prologue_common_b52992a6		The Yaoguai King stood among the dead. His eyes drifted to the bodies wrapped in burial cloth: a queen and two princes, now claimed by darkness.	game/02_prologue.rpy	525	"[what]"
prologue_common_027bd09f		He inhaled deeply, tasting the air.	game/02_prologue.rpy	527	"[what]"
