chapter_1_5628c481	elara	Tianho… Tetrad above… It's even more beautiful than the stories.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	218	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_a42e2728	elara	Dorian, we should take the kids to see the market! Lucas is going to love this!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	219	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_eafad893		I exhale a slow breath, watching the evening lights bathe the city of Tianho through my binoculars, reflecting off the rivers that weave through its heart like threads of silver.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	222	"[what]"
chapter_1_cee7d755		The air smells of spiced tea and roasted chestnuts from the market stalls below, mingling with the faint fragrance of cherry blossoms that line the cobblestone streets.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	223	"[what]"
chapter_1_d50aca29		The streets below are bustling with life, lined with towering pagodas adorned in colors of crimson, gold, and jade. Lanterns of every imaginable hue float above the streets, their light glowing softly.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	224	"[what]"
chapter_1_4abc8866	elara	Dorian. Are you even listening to me? You've been standing there for a while now.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	226	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_c6de4e4d		I turn to face her, sighing as I pocket my binoculars. She's leaning against the doorframe, arms crossed, a wry smile playing on her lips.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	229	"[what]"
chapter_1_768b3060	elara	You've been standing there long enough to memorize every single detail of the city. Meanwhile, the children are pestering me about seeing the nighttime lantern markets.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	231	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_2aaf5a0a	elara	I would very much like my HUSBAND to take me there as soon as possible before he vanishes to work tomorrow.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	232	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_a41a16d5		I sigh, turning back to the view.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	234	"[what]"
chapter_1_48ecb97d	dorian	My heart, you know how important tomorrow is. Everything has to be perfect.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	237	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_06398373		She sighs.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	239	"[what]"
chapter_1_0ea5825c	elara	I know, Dorian. I know how important it is. The entire world will be watching as Kyeongjang's emperor makes his first public appearance in centuries.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	241	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_6d2610de	dorian	For centuries, Kyeongjang was nothing more than a legend. Many doubted it even existed, and now, their emperor is emerging from the shadows to reconnect.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	244	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_6dd4cac3	dorian	This meeting isn't just a reunion—it's a turning point. Alliances will shift. Trade will flourish—or collapse. Power balances will be rewritten.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	245	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_c566e86d	dorian	And you know Her Majesty. She won't settle for anything less than perfection.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	246	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_9561b0e6		Elara steps closer, her soft smile returning. She reaches up and brushes her fingertips against my cheek.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	248	"[what]"
chapter_1_0da331c7	elara	And you, sir Dorian. You're part of that perfection, aren't you? The Dragon of Gale, second only to the High Paladin himself. You'll make sure it all goes smoothly, like you always do.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	250	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_c575a13d		I manage a faint smile, but the tension in my chest doesn't ease. She notices, of course. She always does.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	253	"[what]"
chapter_1_1d33586a	elara	But, my heart. That's tomorrow. Tomorrow is for the world, the king and the empress and the emperor and their grand, history-altering plans. But tonight?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	255	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_393de7e8		She steps even closer, giving my cheek a kiss.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	257	"[what]"
chapter_1_42b5931d	elara	Tonight, you're not the Dragon of Gale. You're not a paladin. You're my husband. And the father of four wonderful, slightly rambunctious children who are dying to explore this incredible city.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	259	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_55e3c267	dorian	But, my heart…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	262	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_8947b593	elara	No excuses, my heart. You've been working tirelessly ever since we left Gale. Tonight is for us. For me. For the kids who adore their father. For a family that rarely gets days like this together.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	263	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_2eab814f		I sigh, a small smile finally breaking through my resolve. I kiss her.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	266	"[what]"
chapter_1_9ed191d0	dorian	Alright, my heart. You win.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	268	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_92952504		She returns my kiss, but only briefly as she quickly pulls away. She grabs my hand and pulls me toward the door, her laughter filling the balcony.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	270	"[what]"
chapter_1_3179aaa5	elara	Come on, Dragon of Gale. The lantern markets won't wait, and neither will the kids!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	272	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_cc1c00f7		The moment we step out into the street, the kids swarm us, buzzing with excitement.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	285	"[what]"
chapter_1_75bc5199	lucas	Dad! Dad! Look! Look at all the people! This place is huge!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	288	lucas "[what]"
chapter_1_f3391040		Lucas' eyes are open wide as he keeps tugging at the hem of my tunic with both hands.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	291	"[what]"
chapter_1_0c2ae449		I chuckle, bending down to ruffle his hair.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	292	"[what]"
chapter_1_0fe794cd	dorian	Yes, it is. But remember what I said—stay close, okay?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	294	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_ccdaa310		Sarah, as expected, is lost in her own world, flipping through her sketchbook and occasionally glancing up to capture the essence of the city in her drawings.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	296	"[what]"
