chapter_1_07f79e57	sarah	This place is full of colors. I need to capture the lanterns. But, I don't know what color they should be…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	306	sarah "[what]"
chapter_1_d8ab6d90		Emily leans over to Daniel and whispers something in his ear, making him roll his eyes but smirk at the same time.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	308	"[what]"
chapter_1_347debb5	emily	Come on, Daniel! You have to at least pretend to be excited!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	312	emily "[what]"
chapter_1_d3cb07e2	daniel	Hey, I am excited! Just not the way you are.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	316	daniel "[what]"
chapter_1_10e1bfcf	dorian	Come on, kids. We're going to the market.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	317	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_c3a6f9b8	elara	But stay close to your father and me. Tianho may be beautiful, but—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	321	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_72e23a49	emily	You never know what lurks beneath the hearts of strangers and how we kids are gullible and—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	325	emily "[what]"
chapter_1_540a60ae	daniel	We know that, mom! Stranger Danger a thousand times. Can we just hurry up? I wanna see some dragons.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	328	daniel "[what]"
chapter_1_d55641ce	sarah	Mom, we need to see the dragons!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	332	sarah "[what]"
