chapter_1_f01becf0	elara	So, where should we go first?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	344	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_dcd78a2a		I look around, taking in the scenery of the market.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	346	"[what]"
chapter_1_4de4b530	dorian	Well, all of the kids seem intent on finding dragons, and you say that you want to eat at the stalls. I say we follow the flow of the crowd and see where it takes us.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	348	dorian "[what]"
