chapter_1_12c62ba6	dorian	Of course, I am.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	354	dorian "[what]"
chapter_1_81e12beb		As we move deeper into the marketplace, the city seems to come alive around us. Elara looks at me, her hand still in mine, while the kids fidget and bounce with anticipation.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	356	"[what]"
chapter_1_ddecba5c		We can go to the Deng Blossom Avenue, where the lanterns for tomorrow are being prepared. There is also the Fanrong Dragon Square, where the rehearsals for tomorrow's Dragon Dances are being held.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	357	"[what]"
chapter_1_79752d5c		I can also bring them to the Xiangli Centre, where the food stalls are. Or maybe I can lead them straight to the Zhong Lotus Promenade, where inventors are showcasing their inventions for a chance to speak to the Kyeongjang Emperor himself.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	358	"[what]"
chapter_1_07ac86f8		Either way, we're still going to the Zhong Lotus Promenade. Maybe I can take them to the other places first.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	359	"[what]"
chapter_1_7fefa247		I glance at Elara, who's watching the children with an amused smile as they eagerly debate where to go first. She meets my eyes and tilts her head slightly.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	361	"[what]"
chapter_1_ebb5a699	elara	Well, my heart, you're the Father. What'll it be? The kids can't wait.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	363	elara "[what]"
chapter_1_a4fd7b20	lucas	Hurry up, dad!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	364	lucas "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_2b60092e		We turn toward Deng Blossom Avenue, a decision met with a satisfied hum from Sarah and nods of approval from the others.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	417	"[what]"
ch1_city_deng_3dc89f21		The moment we step onto the avenue, lanterns — hundreds, perhaps thousands of them — float effortlessly in the air, their glow soft and ethereal.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	418	"[what]"
ch1_city_deng_de104d8a		They seem alive, swaying gently as though in sync with the faint breeze that carries the sweet scent of lotus blossoms and jasmine.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	419	"[what]"
ch1_city_deng_264e82bb	daniel	Look! They're moving!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	421	daniel "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_47ae5e63	lucas	Are they alive? How are they doing that?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	422	lucas "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_e333863b	elara	It's breathtaking.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	424	elara "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_e20f2784	dorian	It is, my heart.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	425	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_aca0cd29		Sarah, predictably, has already flipped open her sketchbook, her pencil moving furiously as she tries to capture the scene.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	427	"[what]"
ch1_city_deng_fed431a9	sarah	Oh gosh! This is so beautiful! The colors… I need to get the colors just right!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	429	sarah "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_4a101165	sarah	But how do I even start? The reds aren't just red—they're ruby, garnet, scarlet—oh, this is impossible!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	430	sarah "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_f7e9e5a9	dorian	Take your time, Sarah. The lanterns aren't going anywhere.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	432	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_860395c8		Lucas points to a massive lantern shaped like a koi fish.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	434	"[what]"
