ch1_city_deng_456b48db	dorian	With bamboo and silk, Daniel.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	442	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_3a9c1d47		Lead Fire Channeler: Alright, that's enough! Bring them back, fire channelers!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	447	"[what]"
ch1_city_deng_6a95a942		A group of figures in crimson robes steps into view at the far end of the avenue, their hands raised in precise, fluid motions. Flames flicker in their palms.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	449	"[what]"
ch1_city_deng_e050a3f6		One by one, the lanterns return to the fire channelers, floating gently into their hands like obedient birds.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	450	"[what]"
ch1_city_deng_4d3b0ac1	emily	Dad! They're making them come back!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	452	emily "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_aa60636f		Emily tugs at my sleeve, her excitement bubbling over.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	454	"[what]"
ch1_city_deng_5e1e4409	emily	Dad, you're a fire channeler right? Can you make the lanterns move like that?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	456	emily "[what]"
ch1_city_deng_f84d10c7	dorian	Of course, Emily.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	458	dorian "[what]"
