ch1_city_fanrong_c61862f4		I decided that we go to Fanrong Dragon Square to watch the Dragon dance rehearsals.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	490	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_1f744028		As we arrive, we find that the square is alive with rhythm and energy, the pounding of drums and clanging of cymbals echoing off the towering pagodas.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	491	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_5a4137b3		Brightly colored dragons — red, gold, and violet — twist and coil through the crowd, their movements fluid yet deliberate, each step in perfect harmony with the beat of the music.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	492	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_8d91b794	lucas	Look at them, Dad! It's a real dragon!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	494	lucas "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_f5f6aeb6	sarah	Mom! Dad! It's the Prosperity Dragon!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	496	sarah "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_1a4ee1f3		I glance at the gilded dragon costume, its shimmering scales catching the lantern light with every fluid motion.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	498	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_b1be1191	dorian	Yeah… The Prosperity Dragon…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	500	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_eacace94		Lucas can't contain himself. His arms flail as he mimics the twisting, serpentine motions of the dragon dancers, his tiny legs stomping a rhythm of their own on the cobblestone square.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	502	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_6d42fff5		Sarah joins in, her movements more graceful, while Daniel smirks and crosses his arms, clearly too cool to dance but not immune to the energy.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	503	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_9787007a	dorian	Careful, kids. You'll wear yourselves out before we even explore the rest of the city.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	505	dorian "[what]"
