ch1_city_fanrong_9d9509ba	emily	Daniel, please…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	507	emily "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_078fdbb2		As we step closer to the rehearsal, I notice some of the dragon dancers stealing glances in our direction. Whispers ripple through their group, and I catch snippets of their murmurs.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	509	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_f50730be	performers	It's him… The Dragon of Gale…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	511	performers "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_1b12ebef	performers	Is he watching us? Oh no, my steps are all wrong!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	512	performers "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_447a264f	performers	Do you think he'll criticize us?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	513	performers "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_688e5f47	performers	C-Calm down, you guys. He might report us to the Empress!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	514	performers "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_44b523eb		One of the performers, a young man holding the golden dragon's head, stumbles slightly, his confidence clearly shaken. He regains his footing quickly, but his face is flushed with embarrassment.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	516	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_a03fd556		I sigh softly and step forward, raising a hand in greeting.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	517	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_3992a3c2	dorian	You're doing well. Keep your movements calm and deliberate. The Prosperity Dragon commands respect, not chaos.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	519	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_e1079007		The young man straightens immediately, nodding with wide eyes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	521	"[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_643c03e9	performers	Th-thank you, sir. We're… we're just nervous, you see. Tomorrow's performance is for the Emperor of Kyeongjang, the King of Tianho, and, of course, Empress Olympia.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	523	performers "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_828a4c7c	performers	We're just very nervous… Our dance, we just want it to be perfect.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	524	performers "[what]"
ch1_city_fanrong_7a311242	dorian	You'll be fine. Focus on your training, not the audience.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	526	dorian "[what]"
