ch1_city_xiangli_d125aac8		My family surges ahead, the kids' excitement pulling me along like a tide. Lanterns strung overhead illuminate the bustling food stalls, casting everything in a warm, golden glow.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	572	"[what]"
