ch1_city_xiangli_819c3563		The vendor lifts a skewer of the food. Each skewer has bite-sized pieces of meat glazed in a tangy-sweet sauce, interspersed with charred fruit slices and crispy greens. Lucas' mouth hangs open as he stares at it.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	582	"[what]"
