ch1_city_zhong_afcc4ba0		It's an opportunity for local inventors to showcase their creations, with the winner receiving the honor of speaking directly to the Emperor of Kyeongjang during tomorrow's historic meeting.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	698	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_01c66acb		The thought alone makes me pause — Kyeongjang, the most advanced civilization this world has seen in 400 years, reconnecting with us at last.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	699	"[what]"
