ch1_city_zhong_35b371ba	elara	All right, kids. Settle down. Let's just look at the exhibits.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	706	elara "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_630d348c		The exhibit area is packed with people. At the center is a small stage, where a young man with wild, unkempt hair and smudges of soot on his face is gesturing grandly to the crowd. His robes are slightly singed, and his eyebags were… apparent.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	708	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_0629f7e8	yuxuan	Ladies and gentlemen! My name is Cheng Yuxuan, an aspiring visionary inventor! Thank you for coming to my humble exhibit!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	710	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_c2a92473		With a dramatic flourish, he pulls a sad piece of red fabric off a large, boxy contraption.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	712	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_9d93ac44		It's... well, it's a square metal box with arms made of mismatched pipes and legs that are little more than broomsticks. Its 'head' is an old television screen, flickering with static.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	713	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_fd2dc2f7		The kids are trying hard to stifle a laugh.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	714	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_f3ee5e93	emily	Pftt… W-What's that?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	716	emily "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_72163a48	lucas	Dad… I thought you said the exhibit was filled with inventors…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	717	lucas "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_f5cc700e		Yuxuan presses a large red button on the side of the contraption. The television screen blinks to life, displaying a faint grainy smile.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	719	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_2a71317e	yuxuan	I present to you the marvel of modern ingenuity, the pinnacle of technological advancement… ROBOTO!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	721	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_945fb8a6		Roboto: H-H-Hello. My name is R-Roboto— I-I-I-….	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	723	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_9d92db53	lucas	It talks like it's choking!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	725	lucas "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_8201efd6	yuxuan	Roboto will revolutionize your life! It can assist with daily chores, answer your questions, and even tell jokes! Observe!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	726	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_2d87b844		He flips a switch, and Roboto's screen flashes with a bright light.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	728	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_1679088b		Roboto: W-w-w-why did the chicken from Tianho c-c-crossed the road?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	730	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_0524131c		Male 1: Oh I love these types of jokes! Why?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	731	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_f86517d7		Roboto: *weird robotic noises* I-I-I-I— Error… Error… T-T-T-…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	732	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_228abfa4		Daniel couldn't help but snort. He whispers to Sarah.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	734	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_78c09d77	daniel	Maybe it's speaking in Kyeongjangese?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	736	daniel "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_73d94ece	sarah	Pfttt… Hahaha!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	737	sarah "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_21b185ea		Yuxuan, undeterred, holds up a hand for silence.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	739	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_e61a9462	yuxuan	This is merely a minor adjustment issue! Roboto is fully capable of... of… uh…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	741	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_bf49be40		He presses another button, and Roboto's screen suddenly flashes a random image of a fish before its voice returns.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	743	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_de1ad639		Male 1: A fish? What gives?!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	745	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_db4815e0		Roboto: T-To get to the o-o-other s-s-s-s-s…. ERROR… ERROR… sideeee…. S-s-s-s-s— *glitches*	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	746	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_56d45675		Female 1: W-What's happening?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	747	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_a24ccb23		Male 2: Look out! It's gonna explode!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	748	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_0611b872		Roboto begins to shake violently, its screen flashing with bright, chaotic patterns. The arms jerk wildly, one of them flinging off and landing with a loud clank near Lucas' feet.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	750	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_4aca3fdc		The legs collapse, and the entire contraption falls over with a resounding thud. A puff of smoke rises from its side.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	751	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_4e51eac7	yuxuan	I uh… um… well—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	753	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_d37808d2		Roboto: BeboOoOot… Bebooot! Bebottt! *electric static*	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	754	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_65d050fa		The crowd erupts in laughter. Lucas is doubled over, tears streaming down his face. Even Daniel can't hold back a chuckle, and Emily is covering her mouth, her shoulders shaking.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	756	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_68f91327	daniel	I… I think it's dead.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	758	daniel "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_f3982a68	emily	More like it never lived! Hahahaha!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	759	emily "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_2b399466		Sarah, ever the artist, sketches the fallen Roboto in her book with exaggerated arms and legs.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	761	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_4b957132	sarah	Very interesting…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	763	sarah "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_a99246a3		Male 1: Aww brother this guy stinks!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	765	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_fa961e8e		Female 1: Come on! We came here for nothing?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	766	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_dd2a0ecb		Male 2: Tianho will look bad if this man was given a chance to talk to the Kyeongjang Emperor!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	767	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_9ad29c1d	yuxuan	Umm… A minor setback! I'll have Roboto up and running by tomorrow! You'll see!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	769	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_a808f1ff		I let out a quiet chuckle, shaking my head.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	771	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_bcd40cf0	dorian	Well, he's certainly memorable. I'll give him that. But no way he'll win an audience with the Emperor of Kyeongjang.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	773	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_4fe152a9		Elara's sharp elbow finds its way to my ribs.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	775	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_30762a5d	elara	Dorian! That's so mean! What if he actually succeeds one day?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	777	elara "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_26f568ab		I glance at her, raising a brow. I point to the detached arms near Lucas' feet.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	779	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_a398d874	dorian	My heart, do you actually think that this is deserving of the Emperor's presence?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	781	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_063bec8b	elara	Well, I—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	782	elara "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_284b5bee	dorian	The Emperor of Kyeongjang would only entertain the most brilliant minds. That's why we made this exhibit.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	783	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_670f9159	elara	Hmph. You really shouldn't underestimate people like him, Dorian. Ambition can surprise you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	784	elara "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_696042a5	dorian	You're not wrong, but sometimes ambition needs a little… refinement.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	785	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_22216cb0	elara	And sometimes, it just needs a little time.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	786	elara "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_3164b621	sarah	I kinda feel bad for him.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	788	sarah "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_425f075c	elara	Me too, sweetie.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	789	elara "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_0e116e0f	emily	Hey Sarah. Maybe you should draw a better version of Roboto for him. He clearly needs help.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	790	emily "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_513ce3c7	elara	Emily. Be nice.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	791	elara "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_9650318b	lucas	Dad, can we come back tomorrow? I want to see it break down again!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	792	lucas "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_eb8ef765	dorian	Be nice, Lucas.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	794	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_ac82d3a2		I shake my head, a small smile tugging at my lips. Elara links her arm with mine.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	796	"[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_4f156a0f	dorian	Alright, my heart. We've had our fill. Shall we head back to the inn?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	798	dorian "[what]"
ch1_city_zhong_5509fb10	elara	Of course, my heart.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	799	elara "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_52381754		As we make our way back through the bustling streets of Tianho, the sound of a trumpet pierces the night, echoing through the city.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	817	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_1957f557		I stop in my tracks. Elara looks at me curiously.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	818	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_5387d094	elara	What is it? Is something wrong?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	820	elara "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_65d14419		I glance up at the dark sky, and smiled at her.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	822	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_f511e146	dorian	They sounded the trumpet. There will be preparatory fireworks to honor the Emperor of Kyeongjang. Look up, my heart.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	824	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_d0aa41aa		The kids immediately crane their necks, their excitement bubbling over. Emily grabs Daniel's arm, bouncing on her toes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	826	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_18837ee7	emily	Fireworks? Really?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	828	emily "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_bc49a69f	daniel	Now, dad? I wanna see!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	829	daniel "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_f77458ae	lucas	Shhh!! I want to hear them!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	830	lucas "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_a9306d58		Sarah doesn't say a word, but she quickly flips open her sketchbook, pencil poised and ready.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	832	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_cfe364eb		Then, with a loud crack, the first firework bursts into the sky, painting the night with streaks of vibrant crimson and gold.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	838	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_f413e459		The crowd around us pauses, heads tilting back as more fireworks follow in rapid succession — emerald greens, sapphire blues, and fiery oranges dancing across the night sky.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	839	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_9f414141	lucas	Whoa! Did you see that? That one looked like a dragon!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	841	lucas "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_d640a4b1	daniel	Pft. No it doesn't, Lucas.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	842	daniel "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_9958db4a	emily	Oh, let him have his fun, Mr. Serious.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	843	emily "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_c472f057	elara	They really go all out here, don't they?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	845	elara "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_db19bef8	dorian	Well, with such a momentous occasion tomorrow, we can't afford to.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	846	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_8a4fc5a9		I watch as the sky explodes in a final cascade of shimmering gold and silver, like falling stars.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	848	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_764db93b		Sarah, sketching furiously, finally looks up as the last spark fades.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	850	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_f0f6964b	sarah	I think I got it.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	852	sarah "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_b5a6304d		She holds up her page to show a hastily drawn but striking depiction of the fireworks.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	854	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_d420544a	sarah	I think I'll call it: The resplendence of fireworks.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	856	sarah "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_14b81e01	emily	Wow!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	857	emily "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_174d1252	dorian	Haha. Looks good, Sarah.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	858	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_96d04b89	daniel	It looks like a bunch of bull—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	859	daniel "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_aa5c4095	elara	Daniel, be nice.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	860	elara "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_3088a881		As the crowd starts to disperse, we gather the children and head back toward the inn.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	862	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_270f09ec		By the time we reach the inn, the kids are noticeably calmer. Elara ushers them inside, and one by one, they begin to settle.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	866	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_e59ce94b		Lucas and Emily curl up together, still whispering about the dragons they hope to see tomorrow. Daniel sits by the window for a moment, staring out at the now-still city before finally joining his siblings.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	867	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_87de7212		Sarah places her sketchbook neatly by her side before lying down with a satisfied sigh.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	868	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_7248ad6d	sarah	Good night mom. Good night dad. *yawns* Today… was amazing.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	870	sarah "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_6b8c2362	elara	Good night, babies. See you tomorrow.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	872	elara "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_b27439cd	lucas	I had a lot of fun, mom. And dad. *yawns*	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	874	lucas "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_14228e17		She smiles and turns to me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	876	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_7439a182	elara	They'll remember this night forever.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	878	elara "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_ee6465b6	dorian	So will I. Thank you, my heart. I needed this.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	879	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_41172106	elara	*yawns* We better get back to bed. Want me to brew ourselves some hot tea before going to bed?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	880	elara "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_4a23f1fb	dorian	Gladly.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	881	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_4fbb3fcf		The room falls quiet as the children drift off, their breathing soft and steady.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	883	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_ed002e98		Elara and I exchange a knowing glance before settling into our own space, the night finally giving way to a deep, peaceful calm.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	884	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_54028f12		As we lay together on the soft bedding of the inn, her hand rested lightly on my chest, her breathing even and serene.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	885	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_050a1e51		The sounds of Tianho—distant chatter, the faint clatter of late-night carts—lulled me to sleep.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	886	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_84cc87cf		I awaken in the quiet hours before dawn, a strange sense of unease pressing against my chest.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	896	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_a9148757		Moonlight filters through the wooden lattice windows, painting the room in pale silver hues. Everything is still—Elara sleeps soundly beside me, her breaths soft and rhythmic.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	897	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_5337ee6f		Then, I see him.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	898	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_e3000d5d		He hovers just beyond the balcony, suspended against the backdrop of Tianho's breathtaking view. An enormous dragon, his scales a vibrant blend of red and gold, shimmers in the faint light.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	903	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_8f3e0dd2		He was floating on the balcony, staring at the beautiful scenery of Tianho.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	904	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_bfcdb9dc		The glow radiating from him reflects off the walls, casting patterns that flicker and twist like living embers.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	905	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_9528b590		I rise quietly, careful not to wake Elara, and step toward the open balcony.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	907	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_783dd8e0		His gaze is fixed on the city below. The lantern-lit streets and winding waterways of Tianho stretch out before us like a dream.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	908	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_763f9bee	prosperity_dragon	Very. Tianho never ceases to amaze me. Beauty, prosperity... it lives in every corner of this place.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	910	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_77d0588d		As he turns to face me fully, his claws click softly against the wooden floor.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	912	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_9e67efdf	prosperity_dragon	I felt I needed to talk to you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	914	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_ecb432a8		His gaze flicked briefly to Elara, then back to me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	916	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_c8ac4e3e	dorian	What is it? Is it about tomorrow?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	918	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_31bf023d		He pauses, and the silence stretches. The hum of energy around him grows faintly louder, like a distant pulse.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	920	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_f51adbb8	prosperity_dragon	Dorian. You must promise me something.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	922	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_247530df		I frown, unease curling in my gut	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	924	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_dc2287f5	dorian	Promise you what?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	926	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_d2266341		His energy shifts, intensifying. Small sparks ripple around him, dancing in the air before dissipating.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	928	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_080d84e0	prosperity_dragon	Promise me that no matter what happens, you will not lose connection with me. You will not lose yourself.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	930	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_54b850e6	dorian	What are you talking about? You're not making sense. Is something wrong?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	931	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_c5041191		His energy grows stronger. Sparks fly around him.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	933	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_c96f32db	prosperity_dragon	There are things I cannot say, Dorian. Things even I, with all my power, am forbidden to interfere with.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	935	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_29361b43		The hum grows louder now, his form brighter, casting shadows that flicker like flames.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	937	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_0e316a7c	prosperity_dragon	But you must trust me. There will come a time when you feel like all is lost. In that moment, you must hold on to who you are—and hold on to me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	939	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_3abf3a3f	dorian	You're not making this any easier.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	941	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_dc9afcb0		His massive head lowers until we are eye-to-eye, his breath warm against my face.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	943	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_8f9ac233	prosperity_dragon	The Weaver's threads of fate bind even me. All I can do is remind you of what matters. Your connection to me, to the fire that burns within you, is your anchor.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	945	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_2db9da88	prosperity_dragon	Do not sever it, Dorian. No matter what.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	946	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_aee098ec		He pulls back, his towering form retreating into the shadows.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	948	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_465f9722	prosperity_dragon	Dawn is coming. I must go. But remember, Dorian—promise me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	950	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_c68a29c1		His words linger in the air as his body begins to shimmer, his form dissolving into a cascade of molten light. The warmth he leaves behind clings to the air, fading as quickly as it came.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	952	"[what]"
ch1_common_fireworks_b6ffe516	dorian	What? Wait, I—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	954	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_04f238d8	jiang	Paladin! Paladin Dorian! Wake up, sir!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	978	jiang "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_616253dc	gao	Jiang, you're too loud! You're going to give the Paladin a heart attack before he even gets up!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	979	gao "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_9de66e59	jiang	Well, you weren't helping when you spilled hot coffee on the way here, were you, Gao? You're practically useless!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	980	jiang "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_3ecd7541		I rub my temples, trying to shake off the haze of interrupted sleep, when the air suddenly grows tense. A shadow looms over the two soldiers.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	982	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_fa869b42	cyrus	What is the meaning of this racket?!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	984	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_9fb8fa56		The soldiers freeze, their backs stiffening as though turned to stone. Soldier Gao, who just moments ago seemed on the verge of nervous collapse, spins on his heel and salutes so sharply he nearly hits himself in the face.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	986	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_7332f783	gao	P-P-Paladin Cyrus! Sir! I-I was just—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	988	gao "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_7ad2c24c	cyrus	Spit it out, boy! I haven't the time to decipher your blubbering!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	989	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_2385ceac	jiang	Paladin Dorian fell asleep, sir. Gao thought coffee would help, but he, uh… tripped.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	990	jiang "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_cd429e9c		Gao swallows hard, his voice barely above a whisper.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	992	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_b275387c	gao	I… I'm sorry, sir…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	994	gao "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_418340f5		I decide it's time to intervene before Cyrus verbally flattens them both.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	996	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_b3294272		Swinging my legs over the side of the bed, I rise and straighten my tunic, rubbing the back of my neck as I address the scene.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	997	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_d06e455b	dorian	Enough, Cyrus. They were only doing their job — clumsily, I'll admit, but well-intentioned. Let it go.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	999	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_fe2eff09		Cyrus narrows his eyes at me, clearly annoyed.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1001	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_6a3037e4	cyrus	Your leniency is why discipline among the ranks is slipping, Dorian. Soldiers like these will never survive the battlefield if they can't even handle a simple morning task.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1003	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_dc982890	dorian	Berating them further isn't going to change anything.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1004	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_809e09d4	cyrus	Fine. But don't let this happen again, Dorian. The Emperor's procession waits for no one — not even the Dragon of Gale and his soldiers.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1005	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_f22ec1cb		The four of us stride through the expansive halls of Tianho Castle, the sound of our boots echoing against polished stone floors.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1007	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_c1c7d15a		Delicate silk banners sway gently in the morning breeze filtering through open lattice windows, each banner bearing an embroidered sigil of Tianho's imperial line.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1008	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_d19470bc	cyrus	The Emperor of Kyeongjang will be arriving shortly. His appearance has been meticulously planned. Extravagance is expected.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1010	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_cafac484	dorian	We got that covered, Cyrus. Every single guard and soldier have been stationed on all locations of the city.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1011	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_a453272b	dorian	We secured the area from the Qiaxing Square to the Xiangli Centre. Guarded by trained fire, wind and earth channelers from Tianho, Gale and Mjoll.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1012	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_e49b3a90		Soldier Gao and Soldier Jiang exchange nervous glances behind him, clearly on edge.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1014	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_a1337ea3		As we approach the central courtyard, the sound of hushed murmurs grows louder. A long line of people snakes through the courtyard.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1020	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_abb814c1		The line stretches endlessly through the courtyard, weaving past the garden ponds and stone bridges.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1021	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_09316bd2		Most of them clutch documents, some carrying small tokens or gifts.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1022	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_3498125e	gao	What's with the line, sir?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1024	gao "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_79ac1094	cyrus	They're here to apply for the position of a sign language interpreter for the Emperor of Kyeongjang's son. The lad's deaf mute, and the Emperor insists on finding the very best for him.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1025	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_024cfee4	dorian	There's no need to prolong this. My men already found someone qualified — his name is Jiyo. He's more than capable to serve the son for the night.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1026	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_7fb6509c	cyrus	Jiyo? You're suggesting a convict, Dorian. A man with a criminal record to serve the Emperor's son?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1027	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_2348d24d	dorian	He's served his time and turned his life around. He's an exceptional signer, far better than most of these applicants. My men vetted him thoroughly.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1028	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_3feb0f53	cyrus	Clearly, your men need to learn what 'thorough' means. A man's past cannot be ignored so easily, not when it concerns the imperial family.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1029	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_c5400e2f	dorian	Are you questioning my men's judgment or mine, Cyrus?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1030	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_df34c266		Before Cyrus can respond, a commotion breaks out near the front of the line. A woman falls to her knees, clutching the hem of a guard's armor. Her face is streaked with tears, her voice desperate.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1032	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_0543c3b9		The female guard standing before her doesn't flinch.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1039	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_e89acc5f		The woman clings tighter, her sobs echoing across the courtyard. The guard sighs, her patience wearing thin.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1044	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_7e0a2108		With a curt nod, two other guards step forward and grab the woman by the arms, dragging her away as she struggles.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1048	"[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_277a518b	dorian	Your people are quick to dismiss, Cyrus. Not everyone's past defines them. Sometimes all they need is a second chance.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1053	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_a8034867	cyrus	You're being too soft, Paladin Dorian. A second chance is a gamble we cannot afford to take.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1054	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_4fef99f8	jiang	The compensation must be prestigious for so many people to be desperate to apply for a one-time job.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1055	jiang "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_68f64d2f	cyrus	Prestigious doesn't even begin to cover it. Whoever is chosen will not only serve the royal family of Kyeongjang. It's a chance to rise far above their station.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1056	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_dd88951c	dorian	And chances are, if they like their service, they might take the person to live with them in Kyeongjang.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1057	dorian "[what]"
ch1_castle_morning_029c2c19	cyrus	Imagine living in an empire that lives only in legends. Gah! The dream! One can—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1058	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_7c015487		Before Cyrus can utter another word, the next applicants step forward. Two men approach the front of the line.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1071	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_7b631c1c		The older man speaks first, his voice steady and respectful.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1072	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_68866955	niko	Honored officials, my name is Niko Tsukumo, a doctor from the village of Hamatame. This is my younger brother, Kaito.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1074	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_83416496	niko	He is here to apply for the role of interpreter for the Imperial Son. Kaito is fluent in sign language and possesses exceptional skill.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1075	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_1d44f01d		Kaito bows deeply, his hands trembling slightly as he unfolds a scroll of qualifications.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1077	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_e2aafd87	kaito	G-good morning. It's an honor to be here. I am prepared to demonstrate my abilities.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1079	kaito "[what]"
ch1_auditions_199372ae		For a brief moment, a hush falls over the courtyard.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1081	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_136c0351	niko	You got this, Kaito. Remember what we practiced.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1083	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_5f5174c0		Before either man can say more, Cyrus raises a hand, his face hardening like stone.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1085	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_571e62a3	cyrus	That's enough. Guards, take these men out of here.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1087	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_71bfe5fb		The two men exchange a glance, confusion flickering across their faces. Niko's expression tightens.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1089	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_d070875b	niko	Paladin, with respect — may I ask why?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1091	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_01e5e038	cyrus	Do you think I am ignorant of who you are, Tsukumo? Or of who your brother is? Do you think your false civility cloaks who you truly are?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1092	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_17d0ecc4	niko	If you know who we are, then you must also know that we have done nothing wrong. My brother seeks only to serve.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1093	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_00e0918e	cyrus	You are prophets of the death god, are you not? The one whose disciples are forbidden to save a dying man — even if he begs for breath.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1094	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_3968a747	cyrus	You let children bleed out on cold stone if it is 'their time.' You would stand silent as plague takes a village, all in the name of some sacred death. And now you want to 'serve' the palace?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1095	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_b3042432		A murmur ripples through the line of applicants, and a few people take a cautious step back.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1097	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_a65ce38d	woman_1	Tetrad save us… a prophet of the death god?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1099	woman_1 "[what]"
ch1_auditions_a3479b83	man_2	A Chosen of Enoch? Oh no! He'll bring misfortune upon us!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1100	man_2 "[what]"
ch1_auditions_2a48ada6	man_3	Get him out of here!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1101	man_3 "[what]"
ch1_auditions_677a4c23		The younger brother, Kaito, stiffens under the hostile murmurs, his knuckles white as he clutches the hem of his robe. Niko, however, remains calm, though his voice tightens.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1103	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_ed365d92	kaito	B-Brother…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1105	kaito "[what]"
ch1_auditions_c04cb96f	niko	Yes. We serve Enoch. But we do not bring death. We offer peace to those whose time has come. We comfort. We do not decide. That is not our place.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1106	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_1101ea4b		Cyrus' lips curl into a sneer.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1108	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_4843b7b3	cyrus	Don't twist your heresies into compassion. Your order watched my cousin bleed out on a battlefield — because he had 'met his time.'	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1110	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_898e3ff5	cyrus	Your order knelt beside him, praying, as his lungs filled with blood. Don't you dare speak of comfort.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1111	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_7ebb6a2d	female_guard	So this is what the Death God's kindness looks like? Letting the weak die, untouched? And you think we'll let you serve the royal family?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1113	female_guard "[what]"
ch1_auditions_8c265e10	man_3	They worship death. That's all you need to know. Get them out of here before misfortune falls on all of us!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1114	man_3 "[what]"
ch1_auditions_84e6c3e9	man_1	Please! Let them out!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1115	man_1 "[what]"
ch1_auditions_c9251b9b	niko	We came to serve. Not to interfere, not to harm. My brother only asks for a chance to interpret — not to pass judgment on life or death.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1117	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_aab63cfd	cyrus	Spare me your platitudes, Tsukumo. Prophets of Enoch have no place in this court. Your kind are lunatics — worshippers of a barbaric, ritualistic god who revels in death and despair.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1118	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_162e9868	jiang	That's right! Tell him like it is, Paladin!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1119	jiang "[what]"
ch1_auditions_3279a42e	kaito	P-Please… I only want to help. Please.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1121	kaito "[what]"
ch1_auditions_cdcddc4a		The female guard scoffs, her hand resting on the hilt of her sword.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1123	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_ae020998	female_guard	You want to help? Then prove you're not a coward hiding behind your god's silence. Face me in a duel to the death!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1125	female_guard "[what]"
ch1_auditions_5df3ba3a	gao	Th-that won't be necessary, ma'am! We're here to evaluate — not shed blood!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1126	gao "[what]"
ch1_auditions_51580093	kaito	M-Mercy… Brother, I think we should go…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1127	kaito "[what]"
ch1_auditions_97f0cd9c		My instincts scream at me to intervene, but I know that doing so will draw the ire of Cyrus and possibly the entire court. Yet, as I look at the Tsukumo brothers, I see no malice in their eyes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1129	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_ec012af7		What should I do?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1130	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_9334b578		Before the female guard can step forward, I raise a hand, silencing her with a sharp look.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1141	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_f404f31d	dorian	Enough.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1143	dorian "[what]"
ch1_auditions_9820bcc1		I step forward, positioning myself between the guards and the brothers.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1145	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_6ed2f950	female_guard	P-Paladin Dorian? I don't understand. Why would you defend these lunatics? I—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1147	female_guard "[what]"
ch1_auditions_d781f44c	cyrus	Dorian, you overstep your bounds.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1148	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_8e6af384		I turn to him, meeting his glare.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1150	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_bff6660b	dorian	Do I? Or is it you who's letting personal prejudice blind you? They came to prove their worth, not to be humiliated. I won't allow any violence to be inflicted upon innocents in my presence.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1152	dorian "[what]"
ch1_auditions_601ebb21		Cyrus glares at me, his fists tightening at his sides.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1154	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_77dcac8f	cyrus	“Innocents”?! Have you lost your bloody mind, Dorian? You really believe these barbarians are innocent? May I remind you that they serve the death god Enoch?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1156	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_2775a353	cyrus	Tsukumo is a chosen of the Death God! He and his brother are part of the prophets!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1157	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_0cb4284f	niko	We've harmed no one. Let Lord Enoch himself bear witness to that.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1158	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_c8b2b3da	dorian	Leave them be, Cyrus. I won't ask again.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1159	dorian "[what]"
ch1_auditions_c2f0b001		Cyrus scoffs and finally steps back, though it's clear he does so grudgingly.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1161	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_1ca61534	cyrus	Fine. But I still don't trust them near the imperial family. Guards, remove them.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1163	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_aa566952		Before the guards can act, Kaito raises his chin, his voice trembling but defiant.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1165	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_bcec0aa4	niko	We'll leave on our own. We don't need your escort.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1167	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_5508b86b	kaito	Yeah! K-Keep your damned position!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1168	kaito "[what]"
ch1_auditions_36788682	niko	I held out hope that you people would be different. The truth will reveal itself in time. Until then, I wish you peace.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1169	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_e0a27dd3	niko	Let's go brother. We're too good for this place.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1170	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_0e0cad9b	man_1	Get out of here before I crack your skull with this rock!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1172	man_1 "[what]"
ch1_auditions_454f77dd	jiang	Get out of here, lunatics!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1173	jiang "[what]"
ch1_auditions_b9bbc135		The brothers ignore him, their dignity intact despite the hostility. Just before they disappear into the crowd, Niko turns back, his gaze locking with mine. His expression softens, and he dips his head slightly.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1175	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_bdfaccd4	niko	Thank you, Paladin. I do not know your name but I know that few would risk standing against their peers. You have my respect.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1177	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_f8e788ca		As the brothers vanish from sight, Cyrus scoffs, his expression sour with contempt.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1179	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_6bfadff6	cyrus	Siding with those disgusting lunatics… pft! We shall not speak of this again, Dorian.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1181	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_a8acf252	cyrus	Eventhe thought of them disgusts me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1182	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_2fe11c80		I turn to Cyrus, my voice low and	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1184	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_374b30dc	dorian	Fair enough. But don't mistake my actions for siding with anyone, Cyrus. I act for justice, not for prejudice.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1186	dorian "[what]"
ch1_auditions_0635e7f7		I hesitate, my hands curling into fists at my sides. Cyrus is seething, and the female guard's mocking laughter grates on my nerves, but I hold back.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1194	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_cd08dec7	gao	P-Paladin Cyrus, think of the time being wasted on these, um…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1196	gao "[what]"
ch1_auditions_18feefa4	jiang	Lunatics. They're lunatics.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1197	jiang "[what]"
ch1_auditions_1be4c922	gao	J-Jiang! Stop it!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1198	gao "[what]"
ch1_auditions_223bb3d4		Cyrus takes a deep breath.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1200	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_82477344	cyrus	You're right. I won't have the imperial family sullied by the hands of a prophet of Enoch. Guards, remove them.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1202	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_eaad1e6a		The female guard spits on Kaito's feet.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1204	"[what]"
ch1_auditions_3b714f1e	female_guard	You heard the Paladin. Out!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1206	female_guard "[what]"
ch1_auditions_7515e506	kaito	You people are awful.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1208	kaito "[what]"
ch1_auditions_a3fcfd5a	niko	I expected more from all of you. May Enoch have mercy on your souls. Let's go Kaito.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1209	niko "[what]"
ch1_auditions_f3a2a6d6	cyrus	May Enoch have mercy on your souls — spare me. If it were up to me, I'd gut their corpses and toss them to the crows.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1210	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_auditions_ada46006	jiang	Hahahaha! Disgusting!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1211	jiang "[what]"
ch1_auditions_d34496e8		The crowd shifts uneasily. As the Tsukumo brothers disappear, Cyrus smirks, clearly satisfied with the outcome.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1213	"[what]"
