ch1_long_shen_8439eebe		We decide to pass the time by heading to the Imperial Gardens, a sprawling, meticulously maintained space filled with flowering trees, stone lanterns, and koi ponds.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1231	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_3240e25f		Together with Paladin Cyrus, Soldier Jiang, and Soldier Gao, we inspect the venue for the Emperor of Kyeongjang's arrival.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1232	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_34fabb10		Guards rehearse their formations with military precision while musicians tune their instruments in preparation for the grand ceremonial procession.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1233	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_3b8497d8		I personally oversee the placements of banners bearing Tianho's imperial crest, ensuring every detail reflects the dignity of the moment.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1235	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_c0d94428		Paladin Cyrus supervises the final security checks, scrutinizing every station with his sharp eyes… and sharp tongue.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1236	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_31a0cb1c	cyrus	MERCIFUL TETRAD! If I see one more screw-up, I will personally see to it that you spend the night scrubbing latrines!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1238	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_43027633	jiang	Y-Y-Yes, sir!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1239	jiang "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_9abfdbb5	gao	O-O-On it, sir!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1240	gao "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_80d3f7ff	dorian	Cyrus. Calm down, old man. You're scaring the soldiers.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1241	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_0e1351e8		As the sun begins its descent, the imperial kitchens prepare an elaborate feast. The scent of roasted duck, spiced noodles, and sweet lotus cakes wafts through the air.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1243	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_3aaffc9d		As twilight fades, the courtyard of Tianho comes alive, illuminated by hundreds of lanterns. Their warm glow bathes the intricate carvings and towering pillars.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1251	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_28d9ef81		The ceremonial bells chime, signaling the imminent arrival of the Emperor of Kyeongjang. The air is heavy with expectation, the collective breath of the crowd held in reverence.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1252	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_d935220b		Paladin Qi Feng arrives, his commanding presence impossible to ignore. 	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1254	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_5d8cec25		His armor gleams under the lantern light, his expression one of calm authority.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1255	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_b35a478e		He walks alongside none other than the Empress of Gale, Olympia Wyndham. The sight of her golden robes embroidered with phoenixes draws gasps from the courtiers and nobles.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1256	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_b697bd75		I stand a little straighter as her gaze lands on me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1257	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_00d56460	olympia	Paladin Dorian. Paladin Cyrus.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1259	olympia "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_0cdc395d	dorian	Your Grace.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1260	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_504717ba	cyrus	Your Grace.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1261	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_c484aab5		Olympia's lips curl into a faint smile, her sharp eyes glinting.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1263	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_96b2c726	olympia	Both of you have done well. The preparations are flawless.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1265	olympia "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_873e40e2	cyrus	Thank you, Your Grace. It's truly an honor.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1266	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_f1154768		She turns to address the assembled crowd, her voice carrying with regal authority.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1268	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_3744ba20	olympia	Tonight marks a momentous occasion — a meeting not just of emperors, but of legacies. This event is more than symbolic; it is a promise. A promise of unity, prosperity, and shared destiny.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1270	olympia "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_56e53f22	olympia	The Emperor of Kyeongjang, a ruler of wisdom and strength, comes to Tianho not as a stranger but as a brother.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1271	olympia "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_e8d98095		As she finishes, a new figure enters — King Long Shen of Tianho. Dressed in crimson and gold robes embroidered with the Prosperity Dragon, he radiates authority and poise.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1273	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_48b0b914		Flanked by ceremonial guards with ornate halberds, he ascends the dais with deliberate grace, acknowledging Olympia with a respectful bow.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1274	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_c9ae7d69		Raising his hand, he signals for silence, and the courtyard stills completely.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1275	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_90f76977	long_shen	My loyal subjects, noble guests, and esteemed allies. Tonight, we stand on the precipice of a historic union. Together, our empires shall forge a bond unbroken by time or trials, a testament to the enduring power of unity.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1277	long_shen "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_1eac27c2	long_shen	Let tonight's gathering be remembered not merely as a meeting of monarchs but as the dawn of an era. An era where our peoples prosper side by side, bound by mutual respect and unwavering friendship. We —	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1278	long_shen "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_922484a4		Paladin Feng, my long time friend, approaches me with a grin. He and I have been serving the Empress for years.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1281	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_c0f46725	feng	Dorian. How are you holding up? You look like you haven't slept a wink.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1283	feng "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_06b1cf97	dorian	Managing. You know how it is — no rest for the weary.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1284	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_f7a53450	feng	You're telling me. Yesterday, my wife dragged me all around the city. Said she needed to find 'the perfect gift' for tonight's feast.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1285	feng "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_c10402aa	dorian	You tell me. Elara did the same. Something about 'immersing ourselves in Tianho's culture.' My legs still ache from all the walking. But, yeah. I had fun. The kids had fun as well.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1286	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_88caa2d2	feng	Kids, huh? You've got no excuse then.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1287	feng "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_6ff5fbbc	dorian	Where did you go? Too bad we didn't bump into each other. I would have loved for you to meet my kids.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1288	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_45fb0b06	feng	Zhuo Yin! Man, you should have been there! Her Grace the Empress also got me coupons for the all-you-can-eat! It was fantastic!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1289	feng "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_39f2d9b9	dorian	Wait… coupons? She didn't give me any. I'm starting to think you're the favorite Paladin.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1290	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_c23b1e6d		Before Feng could reply, Paladin Cyrus storms over, his weathered face flushed with irritation.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1292	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_f6a63bc4	cyrus	You two fools! Standing here gossiping like washerwomen while the King of Tianho is giving his address? Do you have no sense of decorum?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1294	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_01f490c5	feng	Relax, Cyrus. We're just killing time. You should try it sometime — it might help with your blood pressure.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1296	feng "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_684e7bb7		I suppress a laugh, but Cyrus' glare deepens, his face reddening.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1298	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_e24ad7b2	cyrus	I suggest that you obey and listen to the address. This is no time for your childish antics!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1300	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_6699b058		I bite back the retort forming in my throat and glance at Qi Feng, who smirks knowingly. Taking a deep breath, I nod and focus my attention back on King Long Shen.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1310	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_26fee10c		The King's voice resonates across the courtyard, each word deliberate and weighted.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1311	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_3d534e39	long_shen	Together, our nations will stand as a beacon of unity…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1313	long_shen "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_4128dbd1		Cyrus shoots me a sideways glance and gives the faintest of approving nods, as if my silence was a small victory for him. I roll my eyes but hold my tongue.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1315	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_361b7f0f	feng	Well, that was… enlightening. Glad you kept the peace, but you owe me for sitting through that without cracking a joke.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1317	feng "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_591cfd1d	cyrus	The two of you could learn something from the King's wisdom. Perhaps you should take notes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1318	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_650f770c		I narrow my eyes at Cyrus, my patience with his nagging finally snapping.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1327	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_20132669	dorian	Shut up, old man. You've been yelling all day — take a break before you keel over.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1329	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_0e907697		Feng snorts beside me, clearly amused, while Cyrus' face flushes an even deeper shade of crimson.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1331	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_f989ad8a	feng	Pft— Hahahaha!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1333	feng "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_b8adce8c	dorian	You heard me. Save the theatrics for the soldiers, Cyrus. It's not like the King will notice if I miss one line of his speech.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1334	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_66f2c1cf	cyrus	I-well… Tsk…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1335	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_c7b1246c	feng	Dorian's right, Cyrus. We're all tired, and honestly, you yelling at us isn't helping your blood pressure. Maybe you should sit down for a minute before you pop a vein.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1336	feng "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_44fc15ab	dorian	Just loosen up, will you?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1337	dorian "[what]"
ch1_long_shen_f24470ff		The look on Cyrus' face is priceless. He opens his mouth to retort but snaps it shut again, storming off with a muttered string of curses. Qi Feng and I exchange a triumphant grin.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1339	"[what]"
ch1_long_shen_79990795	feng	That was bold. I didn't think you had it in you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1341	feng "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_25dd83ba		As the ceremonial bell tolls, the low, resonant chime echoes through the courtyard. My thoughts wander briefly to Elara and the kids. Are they watching this momentous event unfold from somewhere within the palace grounds?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1360	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_34cce169		I picture Sarah with her sketchpad balanced on her knees. Daniel, Lucas, and Emily, I imagine, are pretending to be guards, mimicking the disciplined stances of the soldiers.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1361	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_ba35f9e8		Elara probably hushes them with a smile, pulling them close to keep them still.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1362	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_bb1b51e3		Wherever they are, I hope they're enjoying this night more than I am.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1363	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_d3aac047		The bell tolls one last time, the air heavy with expectation, and suddenly a wave of energy ripples through the courtyard. In a dazzling display of light, the Emperor of Kyeongjang and his entourage appear.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1364	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_e526695a		The Emperor of Kyeongjang steps forward, wearing ornate robes shimmering as though woven from starlight. Beside him stands a woman, her presence just as regal, which I presume to be his Empress.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1365	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_70540b26		Flanking them is a retinue of guards, their armor polished to perfection, reflecting the warm glow of the courtyard's lanterns. Their long spears, held with practiced precision, glint like silver under the night sky.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1367	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_d8704c64		A collective gasp ripples through the crowd, followed by a wave of hushed murmur. Even Paladin Cyrus falls silent, his usual scowl replaced with a rare expression of awe	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1368	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_e252dd41		I straighten instinctively, adjusting my stance and gripping the hilt of my sword at my side. This is the moment we've been preparing for.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1369	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_220de9f2		As the Emperor takes another step forward, his eyes sweep across the gathered assembly. For a brief moment, I feel his gaze linger on me, and I resist the urge to fidget. Behind him, his guards form a protective arc, their movements precise and synchronized.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1371	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_833b2b82		When he speaks, his voice is deep and resonant, carrying effortlessly across the courtyard.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1372	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_af939300	emperor_minjoon	People of Tianho. My name is Hyon Min-joon, and I am the Emperor of Kyeongjang.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1374	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_24e30791	emperor_minjoon	Let this meeting be a testament to what can be achieved when wisdom prevails over conflict, when unity triumphs over division.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1375	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_b428dcf6	emperor_minjoon	The bond we forge tonight will guide our empires into an era of unparalleled peace and prosperity.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1376	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_af6c7478		The Emperor pauses, his gaze sweeping over the crowd again, then rests briefly on the Empress, who gives him a slight nod of encouragement.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1378	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_f75045df	emperor_minjoon	Together, we will shape a future that honors our past and secures the well-being of generations to come. Let us begin.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1380	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_6a4c1d6e		As he finishes, he steps forward to meet Empress Olympia and the King of Tianho. The three rulers exchange formal bows before clasping hands in a gesture of unity.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1382	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_ff67b49e		The crowd erupts into applause, the sound reverberating through the courtyard like a thunderous wave.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1383	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_0eef501f		I give the signal, and the courtyard springs to life. The musicians begin their symphony, a vibrant blend of drums, strings, and flutes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1384	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_f0dc3fdf		Dragon dancers burst into motion, their costumes shimmering in the lantern light as they weave intricate patterns across the open space.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1385	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_78fa5157		Fireworks crackle and explode overhead, painting the night sky with vivid bursts of red, gold, and green.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1386	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_dca880fb		The crowd cheers even louder, swept up in the grandeur of the moment. I glance upward toward the balconies, half-expecting to catch a glimpse of Elara and the kids.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1387	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_682650da		Though I know they're likely watching from a private chamber with the other families, a small part of me still hopes to see them, to know they're witnessing this historic event.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1388	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_37d71f0e		CG: cg_emperor_arrival	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1390	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_fa8d0514		As the applause gradually fades and the fireworks dwindle into soft crackles in the sky, the Emperor of Kyeongjang, the Empress of Gale, and the King of Tianho are escorted with great fanfare into the grand halls of Tianho Castle.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1396	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_61049c64		Inside, the festivities begin in earnest. The central hall is adorned with silk banners in shades of crimson and gold, and long tables are lined with exotic dishes, their aromas blending into a tantalizing symphony.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1397	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_8da442de		Long tables groan under the weight of an extravagant feast—roasted duck glazed to perfection, steaming bamboo baskets of dumplings, delicate candied fruits, and spiced lotus cakes. The air hums with lively conversation, the laughter of nobles, and the harmonious tunes of zithers and flutes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1398	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_3ef8bd0b		Courtiers, nobles, and foreign dignitaries mingle, raising cups of fine rice wine in celebration, while dancers clad in flowing silks perform graceful routines in perfect synchronization, to the beat of Tianho's ceremonial tunes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1399	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_79f02965		Fire channelers perform a dazzling routine in the center, conjuring fiery dragons that swirl and dissolve into embers, earning applause from the crowd.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1400	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_8bad47c1		I stand at the edge of the gathering, my hand resting on the hilt of my sword, my thoughts far from the revelry.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1401	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_12e86a27		The dragon's cryptic words in my dream earlier still weigh heavily on my mind.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1402	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_8402b56e	prosperity_dragon	There will come a time when you feel like all is lost. In that moment, you must hold on to who you are — and hold on to me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1404	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_e4acb78d		I scan the room until my gaze lands on Feng, effortlessly charming a group of nobles with his jokes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1406	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_0d3e2868	feng	And then I said — what do you want me to do? Pray to Adriana to hand me a new daughter?!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1408	feng "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_fc4816bc	woman_1	Hahaha! Paladin Feng, that's hilarious!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1409	woman_1 "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_fa4f5b36	man_1	That is so funny! Haha! One more, good sir!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1410	man_1 "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_149cd10e		I shake my head, a faint smile tugging at my lips despite myself, and approach Feng.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1412	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_06019ae2	dorian	Feng… Can I have a word with you?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1414	dorian "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_37fd6fbe	feng	Dorian? Oh sure, man!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1415	feng "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_050ec027		Feng raises a curious eyebrow but excuses himself with a dramatic flourish, much to the nobles' disappointment. He leads me to a quieter corner, away from prying ears.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1417	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_67aaf0f9	feng	What's up? You look like you've been chewing on a rock all night.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1419	feng "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_cb7ea7c3	dorian	Feng, I need to leave. I need to be with Elara and the kids. Something doesn't feel right, and I can't shake it off.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1420	dorian "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_d4d08054		Feng turns to me, his usual relaxed grin softening as he studies my face.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1422	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_a9a443ee	feng	Really? The party's just about to start! They haven't even brought out the roasted pig yet!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1424	feng "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_2b2a92eb	dorian	I'll pass… I just have this feeling, you know?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1425	dorian "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_98235638	feng	You're as tense as a bowstring, Dorian. Alright, I'll cover for you. Enjoy your time with your family. If anyone asks, I'll tell them you're handling some critical duty.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1426	feng "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_81923517	dorian	Thanks, Feng. You're the best.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1427	dorian "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_4279c5ac	feng	I know. Now go before I change my mind. And before Cyrus catches you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1428	feng "[what]"
ch1_ceremony_b5dde574		As I step out into the cool night air, the distant music fades, replaced by the soft rustling of leaves in the breeze.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1430	"[what]"
ch1_ceremony_094fa5d5		The streets are quiet, illuminated only by scattered lanterns casting gentle light on the cobblestone path.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1431	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_33a3dc7d		When I reach the inn, I push the door open as silently as I can. Inside, the warm glow of a single lantern illuminates the cozy room.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1448	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_465e4bf1		Elara is there, seated near the bed where our children sleep peacefully, their small faces relaxed in dreams.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1449	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_d053c2c4	elara	You're back early, my heart. How was the celebration?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1451	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_fbe70170	dorian	I didn't want to stay. I'd rather be here — with all of you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1452	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_5273435c		She rises and steps toward me, her arms wrapping around me in a gentle embrace. The weight of the day slips away as I hold her close.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1454	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_4755e96b		I glance at the bed where Sarah clutches her sketchpad even in sleep, and Daniel, Lucas, and Emily are nestled together under the blankets.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1455	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_2242842f	elara	Let me pour you some water.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1457	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_c9689608		After a moment, she pulls away and pours me a glass of chilled water from the jug on the table, handing it to me with a knowing smile.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1459	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_54ec58b9	elara	The kids ran wild through Tianho again today. Sarah's got her eye on this little porcelain doll in the market. She says she wants to name it 'Tedda,' of all things.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1461	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_defd3f36	elara	Lucas, of course, won't stop teasing her about it. Said he'd steal it and make it a pirate instead. They were chasing each other for hours.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1462	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_a58420e2		She laughed softly, the sound delicate as windchimes. I took a slow sip from the glass, chuckling through a yawn.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1464	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_fb03fb62	elara	How's work? Any interesting stories you wanna tell me?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1466	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_14f32a49	dorian	Cyrus barked at nearly everyone today. Even the flagbearers weren't spared.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1476	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_dd53d7c0	elara	Well, what's new? He's an old man who doesn't know the meaning of 'relax.'	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1477	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_155c9252	dorian	Pft… haha! Elara! But… you're not wrong. One of the younger soldiers nearly dropped his spear when Cyrus got in his face. I had to step in before he made the poor kid cry.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1478	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_57894a0e	elara	You've always had a softer touch with people. Cyrus… well, he's been that way for as long as I've known him.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1479	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_1cb40952	dorian	Feng and I tried to get him to calm down, but you know how he is. He even berated us for talking while the King of Tianho was giving his address.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1480	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_b48e818b		Elara reaches for her water and downs it all in one go.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1482	"[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_68161eb1	elara	You and Feng will be the end of that poor man. But you need someone like Cyrus around — someone to keep you in line.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1484	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_41d0ce59	dorian	Maybe. Or maybe we just like riling him up.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1485	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_d2660a7d	dorian	So… Feng was in rare form tonight. You'd think he was the Emperor himself with how he was strutting around. He had everyone in stitches at the party.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1492	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_4b1cc4d4	elara	That doesn't surprise me. He loves these kinds of events, doesn't he?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1493	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_dff43727	dorian	Oh, absolutely. He told me he's going to take full credit for all the preparations since I skipped out early.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1494	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_3ce63532	dorian	I swear, he could convince a stone to laugh if he tried. At one point, he even joked about Adriana granting him a new daughter — right in front of the clerics.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1495	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_808acac0	elara	The clerics of Adriana? Tetrad above, the nerve of that man! Please tell me he didn't start a scene.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1496	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_e6b12134	dorian	No scene, just some very awkward looks. By the way, he said he brought his family here.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1497	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_1a616e62	elara	Oh, we met them earlier today while out shopping. His youngest is adorable. Reminds me of Lucas at that age.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1498	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_06445ae9		She grabs a cookie and offers me one before finishing hers.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1500	"[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_cf69dab6	dorian	Olympia gave a speech tonight. You would've been proud of her. She had the whole audience hanging on her every word.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1507	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_5031769f	elara	I've always admired her ability to command a room. What did she say?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1508	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_0823e707	dorian	She spoke about unity and peace between the empires. Made it sound like tonight was the beginning of a new era.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1509	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_8967518b	elara	And do you believe it?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1510	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_39cdf751	dorian	It's my job to believe it, isn't it? But whether or not I do doesn't really matter.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1511	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_5a95b1f6	elara	Were there any other rulers present?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1512	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_c15b2715	dorian	King Long Shen was there to deliver an address.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1513	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_a6d5f5d9	dorian	King Gustav from Mjoll and King Tatsuya from Hinami were present at the party. They didn't deliver a speech though.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1514	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_f59d0f99	dorian	The Emperor of Kyeongjang made quite an entrance tonight. Teleported right into the courtyard with his entourage.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1521	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_162cd746	elara	Teleportation? That's… bold. What was he like?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1522	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_005fec6f	dorian	Weren't you and the kids watching?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1523	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_8566e756		Elara shakes her head.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1525	"[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_e0c9a176	elara	No. Emily tripped and hit her head earlier, so the kids decided to stay back and help me take care of her. We had a quiet dinner here at the inn instead.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1527	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_e407ef36	dorian	Emily's alright, though, right?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1528	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_d55c0300	elara	She's fine. A little bump, but nothing a kiss and some cookies couldn't fix.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1529	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_4473ac84	elara	So, how was this Emperor? Did he live up to all the stories?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1530	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_904021e2	dorian	He was… impressive. Even Cyrus was speechless for once.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1531	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_60cbca27	elara	Now that's an accomplishment. What about his son? I heard there were a lot of applicants to be his translator.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1532	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_07264841	dorian	The son wasn't there. It was just the Emperor, his wife, and guards.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1533	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_topic_menu_60019e5e	elara	Really? That's too bad. I hope the interpreter still gets paid, though.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1534	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_54b9d12c	elara	*yawns* I think it's time for bed, my heart.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1541	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_4446fb72	dorian	You're right. It's been a day.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1542	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_5c7d6dbe		Before heading to the bedroom, I walk over to each of our children and kiss them on the forehead.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1545	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_d576d5c5	dorian	Good night, kids.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1547	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_83579f38		When I turn back, Elara is leaning against the doorway.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1549	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_cd04bf9e	elara	They're already asleep, you know. You might wake them up.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1551	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_87687190	dorian	Maybe, but I can't shake this feeling. I needed to do that.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1552	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_cc8b5060		Elara walks up to me and gently places her hands on my shoulders. She pulls me down into a kiss, soft and lingering.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1555	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_2de74c39	elara	Whatever's weighing on you… let it go for tonight. Just rest. Remember, Dragon of Gale, I've got you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1557	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_48f2927b		We head to bed together.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1559	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_58a042b1	elara	I love you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1561	elara "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_4cdf02a0	dorian	I love you too, my heart.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1562	dorian "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_58e0bbb2		As her breathing slows beside me, I close my eyes and drift to sleep.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1564	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_bbacc8ec		Elara sleeps soundly beside me, her face serene in the faint moonlight filtering through the window. But I can't shake the twisting unease in my chest.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1573	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_080d84e0	prosperity_dragon	Promise me that no matter what happens, you will not lose connection with me. You will not lose yourself.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1575	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_bd01588a		I can't help but remember those words.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1577	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_af9e1a6e		A wave of cold crashes over me, and the room seems to darken unnaturally. My body stiffens as a figure materializes at the foot of the bed.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1579	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_532cdeb7		Empress Olympia.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1580	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_5650b1b4		Her face is pale, streaked with blood. A jagged wound runs from her temple down to her jaw. Her gown is torn and soaked in crimson, her chest heaving as though every breath might be her last.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1581	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_0773b5fd	olympia	Dorian… wake up. You must go to the castle. Now. Tianho… is in grave danger!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1585	olympia "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_4a42c996		She steps closer — the blood drips from her fingertips onto the floor, the crimson pooling and spreading unnaturally fast.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1587	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_ae55c539	olympia	DO NOT TALLY!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1589	olympia "[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_3b6d3a83		Her image shatters like glass, and I'm left gasping for air, my heart pounding in my chest. The room is silent again, save for Elara's steady breathing.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1595	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_f03dff5d		I sit up, my breath coming in shallow gasps. The weight of her words presses on my chest like a stone.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1596	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_e891419a		I look at Elara, her peaceful expression so at odds with the storm raging in my head. I want to wake her, to tell her what I've seen, but something stops me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1597	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_6966b0ac		Instead, I rise quietly, grabbing my sword and cloak. I kiss her on the forehead.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1598	"[what]"
ch1_elara_chat_common_fcf4a200	dorian	Stay safe, my heart.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1600	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_b42fe9c3		The inn is silent as I step into the cool night. Tianho sleeps on. The streets are quiet.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1621	"[what]"
ch1_battle_d7bf4abb		As I approach the castle gates, I spot two familiar figures in the torchlight — Soldiers Gao and Jiang. They stand rigid, their hands gripping their weapons tightly.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1622	"[what]"
ch1_battle_194cd0de	gao	Paladin Dorian? You're here!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1624	gao "[what]"
ch1_battle_48eb7a90	jiang	Paladin Cyrus and Paladin Feng are already inside. They went inside an hour ago!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1625	jiang "[what]"
ch1_battle_5b6edf8a	dorian	Did Cyrus or Feng mention anything specific? Anything strange before they went in?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1627	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_54bb1417		Before either of them can answer, a deafening rumble erupts beneath us. The ground quakes violently, and cracks spiderweb across the cobblestones.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1629	"[what]"
ch1_battle_417339a0	gao	What the—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1631	gao "[what]"
ch1_battle_3fd412a6		Before he can finish, the earth beneath Jiang explodes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1633	"[what]"
ch1_battle_fe56a88e		A monstrous yaoguai emerges, its massive, grotesque form dripping with black ichor that hisses and sizzles against the stone. Its six glowing red eyes scan the courtyard, its maw filled with jagged, rotting teeth that emit a foul stench.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1634	"[what]"
ch1_battle_8b7087ac	yg	Raaaaaaawwrrr!!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1637	yg "[what]"
ch1_battle_ad85ee51	dorian	Dragon's Bollocks! A yaoguai?!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1639	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_9829ff7b		Soldier Gao and Jiang scream, stumbling back as the creature lets out a piercing roar that shakes the very air around us.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1641	"[what]"
ch1_battle_9e543819	jiang	It's a yaoguai! Tetrad above, it's a yaoguai!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1643	jiang "[what]"
ch1_battle_5543629e	gao	We're going to die! We're all going to—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1644	gao "[what]"
ch1_battle_d6eef2c0		For a split second, I freeze, my mind racing as the yaoguai's eyes bore into mine.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1657	"[what]"
ch1_battle_e16c42d8		Its guttural snarl sends chills down my spine, and I feel every instinct screaming at me to move, but I can't.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1658	"[what]"
ch1_battle_30d0ae51		What in Tetrad's name is happening?!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1659	"[what]"
ch1_battle_90751be1	gao	P-Paladin! Watch out!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1661	gao "[what]"
ch1_battle_e1e232c8		The yaoguai lunges, its claws carving through the air with terrifying speed. At the last second, Jiang dives to the side, pulling Gao and I with him.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1663	"[what]"
ch1_battle_bd7495e4	yg	Grrraaaaawwwww!!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1665	yg "[what]"
ch1_battle_4efd423e		The creature's attack slams into the ground, sending shards of stone flying everywhere.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1667	"[what]"
ch1_battle_cd08399c	jiang	Paladin Dorian! Are you alright?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1669	jiang "[what]"
ch1_battle_19ddf6b4	gao	That was close...	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1670	gao "[what]"
ch1_battle_c148aba5	dorian	Get up! Move!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1671	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_df5f45d6		I shove Gao and Jiang toward the nearby wall as the yaoguai snarls, its glowing eyes locking on me now. My hands ignite with fire, the heat surging up my arms.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1673	"[what]"
ch1_battle_ab805e71		The yaoguai's claws slam into the ground, sending shockwaves through the courtyard. Without thinking, I thrust my hands forward, summoning a fiery barrier between us and the creature.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1681	"[what]"
ch1_battle_178be048		Flames roar to life, swirling in a protective arc that absorbs the beast's attack with a deafening crack.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1682	"[what]"
ch1_battle_7eb455ac		The heat from my shield is intense, but Gao and Jiang hold their ground.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1683	"[what]"
ch1_battle_efca5775	taotie_roar	Grrraaawwwrrr!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1685	taotie_roar "[what]"
ch1_battle_0b6b6ca7	dorian	Are you alright?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1687	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_9106c240	jiang	Paladin… Thank you!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1688	jiang "[what]"
ch1_battle_38a9691b	dorian	Get ready to run when I say.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1689	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_1a1d0c59		I concentrate, channeling more power into the shield until the flames burst outward in a controlled explosion. The yaoguai stumbles back, momentarily dazed.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1691	"[what]"
ch1_battle_ab68a168	dorian	Go now!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1693	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_48e50d87		Gao and Jiang dart to safety, and I extinguish the shield, stepping forward to face the creature head-on.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1695	"[what]"
ch1_battle_8f95f0a6		The yaoguai lunges, its glowing red eyes locked on me. Without hesitation, I channel fire into my palm, condensing the heat into a pulsing orb.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1701	"[what]"
ch1_battle_8b3417a7		I hurl the fireball with all my strength. The orb smashes into the yaoguai's face, erupting in a fiery explosion that engulfs its head in flames.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1702	"[what]"
ch1_battle_e3474746	taotie_roar	Raaaaaaawwrrr!!! Grrraaawwwrrr!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1704	taotie_roar "[what]"
ch1_battle_4e567c73		The yaoguai lets out an ear-splitting roar, thrashing wildly as it tries to shake off the fire. Gao and Jiang take the opportunity to scramble to safety.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1706	"[what]"
ch1_battle_10a81cf3	gao	P-Paladin! What should we do?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1708	gao "[what]"
ch1_battle_b547c2e6		The yaoguai recovers, shaking off the flames, but I can see the scorch marks left behind. It snarls at me, more furious than ever.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1710	"[what]"
ch1_battle_3ef900c6		All of a sudden, I hear screams. Random screams. They pierce the night, each one twisting like a blade in my gut.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1717	"[what]"
ch1_battle_be70e2a5	woman_1	Ahhhhh!!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1719	woman_1 "[what]"
ch1_battle_62acc7d9	man_2	No!! No!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1720	man_2 "[what]"
ch1_battle_f8798955		The ground trembles beneath my feet again, but this time, it's not just from the yaoguai before me. Deep, guttural growls rise from all directions, reverberating through the night air.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1722	"[what]"
ch1_battle_c561404d	yg	Raaaaaaaaawwrrrrr!!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1724	yg "[what]"
ch1_battle_bc23ca45		The city of Tianho is under siege.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1726	"[what]"
ch1_battle_033829cd	dorian	Wait, Gao! Jiang! Sound the alarm! Now!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1728	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_432bebcf	jiang	Y-Yes, sir! Gao, come quick!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1729	jiang "[what]"
ch1_battle_178982a2		He grabs Gao by the arm, pulling him toward the bell tower.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1731	"[what]"
ch1_battle_530c37ca		The yaoguai in front of me snarls, its molten eyes locking onto mine. It lunges, claws slicing through the air like scythes. I brace myself, raising my sword, but before its strike can land—.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1732	"[what]"
ch1_battle_23890533		A blinding light erupts from the darkness, illuminating the courtyard as though the sun itself had descended.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1733	"[what]"
ch1_battle_77e9e2cd	yg	Raaaaaaa!!!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1735	yg "[what]"
ch1_battle_c0a6b510		The yaoguai's roar is cut short, replaced by a piercing screech as its monstrous form is enveloped in the radiance. In seconds, its body is reduced to ash, the air filling with the acrid smell of sulfur.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1737	"[what]"
ch1_battle_90977a14		I lower my sword, blinking against the sudden brightness, and as the light fades, a figure steps forward.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1738	"[what]"
ch1_battle_d9acf53c	vasily	You must be Dorian. The Dragon of Gale. You're welcome, Paladin.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1740	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_164c725e	dorian	I don't think we've met, yet. Who are you?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1741	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_baf97339		The man steps closer, his boots clicking against the fractured stone.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1743	"[what]"
ch1_battle_2c604670	vasily	Count Vasily, royal advisor to His Majesty King Gustav of Mjoll.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1745	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_68299ae6		He gives a shallow, calculated bow before rising to meet my gaze. He glances toward the castle, his expression grave.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1747	"[what]"
ch1_battle_def10d04	vasily	The King of Mjoll is here. He's inside the castle. I felt his spirit call out to me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1749	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_ed9de451	dorian	Olympia — I mean Her Grace called out to me as well.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1750	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_e12c96ed		The bell suddenly rings, its sound sharp and frantic.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1752	"[what]"
ch1_battle_2da544ea		I glance back to see Gao and Jiang pulling the ropes with everything they have.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1753	"[what]"
ch1_battle_01c605a1	vasily	We haven't a moment to lose. The castle is under siege, and the forces within are far beyond what you've seen here.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1755	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_2129125b		He gestures toward the castle gates, his eyes narrowing.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1757	"[what]"
ch1_battle_13c0b304	vasily	Come, Dorian. If we delay, there may be nothing left to save.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1759	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_960a54d0		I nod and we sprint towards the castle.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1761	"[what]"
ch1_battle_578386b1		The moment we stepped into the castle, the metallic stench of blood hits like a tidal wave. The grand halls, once symbols of Tianho's majesty, are now painted red.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1771	"[what]"
ch1_battle_4b076402		Bodies of guards, attendants, and clerics lie strewn across the floor, their lifeless eyes staring blankly into the void.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1772	"[what]"
ch1_battle_a2cd6890		Broken spears, shattered shields, and torn banners scatter the area.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1773	"[what]"
ch1_battle_4620b583	dorian	Tetrad above…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1775	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_eb61cc71		I hear a guttural snarl, and my gaze snaps to the end of the hall. Two yaoguai stand there, their claws dripping with fresh blood, their glowing red eyes locked on us. They charge.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1777	"[what]"
ch1_battle_8b7087ac_1	yg	Raaaaaaawwrrr!!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1779	yg "[what]"
ch1_battle_4630e4b4		I tense up, my nerves getting the best of me after seeing all of those bodies piled up. Count Vasily steps forward.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1792	"[what]"
ch1_battle_389a42e1		Raising a hand, a brilliant burst of light erupts from his palm, enveloping the yaoguai in a searing glow. Their screeches fill the air as their bodies disintegrate into ash the light burning away their monstrous forms in seconds.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1793	"[what]"
ch1_battle_f12fcd70	vasily	Focus, Paladin. I can handle this, but you're not here to stand idle.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1795	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_ae8adce6	dorian	I apologize. I just…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1796	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_1a449ee8	vasily	I understand. But we might become one of them if we don't stay alert.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1797	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_e9431153		I slam my hand to the ground, channeling the raw power of the earth beneath me. Jagged spikes of stone erupt from the floor with a deafening crack, impaling the yaoguai before they can take another step.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1805	"[what]"
ch1_battle_8860681a	taotie_roar	Raaaaaaa!!!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1807	taotie_roar "[what]"
ch1_battle_58072629		Their bodies twitch once before falling limp, pinned like broken marionettes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1809	"[what]"
ch1_battle_64929b3d	vasily	Impressive. Fire channeling, Earth channeling and, if I'm not mistaken, wind as well. The stories about you aren't just legend, it seems.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1811	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_cd07293c	dorian	Thanks. I was just born with this. Nothing special.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1812	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_476440f4		Before I can catch my breath, a third yaoguai lunges from the shadows, its claws aimed for Vasily.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1814	"[what]"
ch1_battle_0d66ac85		But he's faster.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1815	"[what]"
ch1_battle_b8e6e94b	vasily	Enough.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1817	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_adfc9609		Vasily steps forward, his hand glowing with light. His light pierces through the yaoguai, frying the creature instantly.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1819	"[what]"
ch1_battle_6a7c532d		We stand amidst the silence, our breaths heavy. Our eyes won't leave the lifeless bodies surrounding us.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1820	"[what]"
ch1_battle_28c0336f	dorian	This… this isn't an attack. It's a slaughter.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1822	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_3ae55204	vasily	If the yaoguai made it this far… the throne room—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1823	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_27f3bd43		Ahead of us, a door creaks, its sound cutting through the silence like a knife. It swings open fully, revealing a stone stairway that spirals downward into the depths of the castle. Faint, ominous red light glows from below, flickering like firelight.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1825	"[what]"
ch1_battle_1cc5c29f	vasily	It… might be a trap.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1827	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_da7f6e5e		I grip the hilt of my sword tighter, stepping forward.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1829	"[what]"
ch1_battle_8124cad0	vasily	Wait. We don't know what's down there.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1831	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_02e6a165	dorian	We'll soon find out.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1832	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_7c741e30		I glance back at the hall one last time, at the blood-soaked walls and lifeless bodies, and steel myself for what lies ahead.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1834	"[what]"
ch1_battle_36c7e1b0		We descend the spiral stairs, the flickering red light growing brighter with every step. The air is heavy, filled with the stench of sulfur and iron, and each breath feels like inhaling fire.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1835	"[what]"
ch1_battle_31905a1f		At the bottom, we step into a massive chamber carved into the very foundations of the castle. The ceiling arches high above us.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1836	"[what]"
ch1_battle_8b7087ac_2	yg	Raaaaaaawwrrr!!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1844	yg "[what]"
ch1_battle_ecdb5cb6	vasily	Dorian! Look out!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1845	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_aa580083		I thrust my arms forward, summoning the wind with a roar. A sharp gale tears through the room, slamming into the yaoguai with the force of a hurricane. They're thrown backward, smashing into the far wall with bone-cracking force.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1856	"[what]"
ch1_battle_1e945492	yg	Gaaaahhhh—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1858	yg "[what]"
ch1_battle_442e9975	dorian	Ahhh!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1865	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_295efb3c		The yaoguai's sudden attack catches me off guard, and I trip on a loose stone, hitting the ground hard.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1867	"[what]"
ch1_battle_ec2c18d0		Before they can close in, Vasily steps forward, raising a glowing hand. With a burst of crimson light, one yaoguai disintegrates.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1868	"[what]"
ch1_battle_7f9fa502	vasily	Dorian, there's another one!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1870	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_e6cbecdf		I roll to the side and summon a quick gust of wind to send the second one flying into the wall.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1872	"[what]"
ch1_battle_3daa5467		With the yaoguai dealt with, I look around, my heart sinking.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1876	"[what]"
ch1_battle_909e3ba5		At the far end of the room, Empress Olympia is slumped against the wall, her once-pristine robes soaked in blood.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1877	"[what]"
ch1_battle_d48f4500		Paladins Cyrus and Feng are crouched beside her, their armor dented and smeared with gore.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1878	"[what]"
ch1_battle_493c6465	dorian	Your Grace!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1880	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_db23545c		They look up as I approach.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1882	"[what]"
ch1_battle_15f2cf29		Feng's face is tight with worry, his usual confidence replaced by relief as I approach. Cyrus looks grim, his jaw set like iron.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1883	"[what]"
ch1_battle_b7ab16a0	feng	Dorian! It's great to see that you're still alive, man.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1885	feng "[what]"
ch1_battle_7ff11d33	dorian	You too, Feng. What happened here?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1886	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_763ead59	feng	No clue. We were summoned by the Empress.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1887	feng "[what]"
ch1_battle_c1cb4b98	dorian	Where are the others? The Kyeongjang Emperor? The King of Tianho?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1888	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_258ca80d		Feng shakes his head, his eyes filled with frustration and shame.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1890	"[what]"
ch1_battle_ba95cbb6	cyrus	We couldn't find them. We searched the upper levels and the throne room. It's as if they vanished.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1892	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_battle_97a7f454	vasily	Vanished? That's impossible!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1893	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_bdf5294a		He curses under his breath, his frustration palpable.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1895	"[what]"
ch1_battle_f219dbdb	vasily	Damn it…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1897	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_9742b3e9		He spins on his heel and storms toward a shadowy corridor on the far side of the chamber.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1899	"[what]"
ch1_battle_5e25c6b7	vasily	If they're not here, they must've been taken deeper. I'll find them myself if I have to.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1901	vasily "[what]"
ch1_battle_bd3ac506	dorian	Vasily, wait!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1902	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_824f4884		But he's already gone, disappearing into the darkened passage without another word.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1904	"[what]"
ch1_battle_ab4b1bd1	dorian	Your Grace, can you hear me? Everything's going to be alright.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1906	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_845b249d		I turn back to Olympia, her eyes fluttering open as she struggles to focus on me. Her hand weakly grips my arm, smearing it with blood.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1908	"[what]"
ch1_battle_6d87b10e	olympia	Tianho… Danger…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1910	olympia "[what]"
ch1_battle_06cccd62	feng	We need to get her out of here. She's lost too much blood.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1911	feng "[what]"
ch1_battle_8e6bdd7d	dorian	Feng, Cyrus — we need a plan. And fast.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1912	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_0ecca14d	cyrus	There might be a doctor here who can—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1913	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_battle_636d5764		The ground beneath us begins to tremble. Then, the entire castle shakes violently, dust and debris raining down from the ceiling.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1915	"[what]"
ch1_battle_0a0db0b5	cyrus	The castle's collapsing! We need to get out — NOW!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1917	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_battle_f6c51356	feng	In Tetrad's name… What is going on here?!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1918	feng "[what]"
ch1_battle_dad40bd1		I glance toward the corridor Vasily disappeared into. There's no time to go after him.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1920	"[what]"
ch1_battle_2d690302		Cyrus throws Olympia over his shoulder, her weak protests drowned out by the growing roar of the earthquake. I grab Feng by the arm, and we all sprint toward the stairs we came down from.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1921	"[what]"
ch1_battle_49706ac1	dorian	Come on, man. Hurry up!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1923	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_8505a0d9		Finally, we burst out into the courtyard, gasping for air.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1929	"[what]"
ch1_battle_f17ecd06		The city of Tianho is in chaos. Streets are lit by the glow of fires, their smoke curling into the night sky. People are screaming, running in every direction. Buildings collapse in the distance, their foundations giving way as the earth continues to quake.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1930	"[what]"
ch1_battle_2cd60cd8		Man 1: Wait… Look… Up in the sky!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1932	"[what]"
ch1_battle_dd966f8c		And then, the most chilling sight of all—a massive, winged shadow looms atop the highest spire of Castle Tianho. Its form is obscured by the darkness.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1934	"[what]"
ch1_battle_d4366dde		Woman 1: It… It's the death god!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1936	"[what]"
ch1_battle_a5c19188		Man 2: W-We're all doomed!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1937	"[what]"
ch1_battle_d439936f		It fires a red beam towards the castle. The ancient structure groans in protest. Parts of it falling off.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1943	"[what]"
ch1_battle_3259b316		As the castle collapses, a shockwave ripples outward, sending dust and debris flying into the air. The ground beneath our feet trembles again, nearly throwing us off balance.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1944	"[what]"
ch1_battle_320a78b3	feng	The castle… It's gone…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1946	feng "[what]"
ch1_battle_78c5da85		The sound of more yaoguais roaring echo eerily through the chaos as the ground beneath Tianho begins to crack open. The air grows hotter, thick with sulfur, and an ominous red glow spills through the fissures.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1948	"[what]"
ch1_battle_e9e2316c	dorian	What in the Tetrad's name…?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1950	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_8f50e3d1		The earth erupts in fury. Flames and molten rock burst from the ground, and the distant peaks of volcanoes surrounding Tianho belch columns of fire and ash into the darkened sky.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1952	"[what]"
ch1_battle_4d3e7e03	man_3	It… It's erupting! The volcanoes under Tianho are erupting!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1954	man_3 "[what]"
ch1_battle_097ad365		From the watchtower, I spot Gao and Jiang, their faces pale. I shout to them, my voice cutting through the panic.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1956	"[what]"
ch1_battle_bbc0bf52	dorian	Gao! Jiang! RUN! Evacuate as many civilians as you can! That's an order!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1958	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_deddf1b9	gao	Y-Yes, sir!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1959	gao "[what]"
ch1_battle_4d6d9638		I turn to Paladin Feng.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1961	"[what]"
ch1_battle_97a58728	dorian	Feng, we need to help them evacuate! The city will burn if we don't act now!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1963	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_70183ba0	feng	On it. I'll clear the streets and rally anyone who can still fight.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1964	feng "[what]"
ch1_battle_7ef8ae6f	dorian	Cyrus, what about you?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1965	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_2a3dbe49	cyrus	Dorian, you evacuate the city. I'll deal with the winged monster.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1967	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_battle_7f7fbf56	dorian	Cyrus, you can't—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1968	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_c6ca7ff0	cyrus	Listen to me. This city still needs a future, and that future doesn't happen unless someone stops that thing.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1969	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_battle_7dbeedee		He tightens his grip on his sword, a rare softness in his gaze as he meets my eyes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1971	"[what]"
ch1_battle_68df731b	cyrus	Protect the people, Dorian. That's your duty now.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1973	cyrus "[what]"
ch1_battle_6309eb12		Before I can argue, Cyrus charges toward the ruins of the castle, his figure soon swallowed by the smoke and flames.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1975	"[what]"
ch1_battle_02b85379	feng	Let's go, Dorian! We—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1977	feng "[what]"
ch1_battle_94d79ece		The ground beneath us splits once more, sending a fresh wave of heat and ash into the air. Then, a deafening roar cuts through the screams and crackling flames.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1979	"[what]"
ch1_battle_2db6cc7d		A monstrous Taotie, its grotesque form towering above the crumbling city, emerges from the fiery chasm. Its gaping maw seems endless, filled with jagged teeth dripping molten saliva.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1980	"[what]"
ch1_battle_ad355d9b	taotie_roar	GRAAAWWRRRR!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1988	taotie_roar "[what]"
ch1_battle_292076dc	dorian	Tetrad above… What the—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1990	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_57db6b68		Paladin Feng steps forward, unwavering, his sword burning with blue fire.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1992	"[what]"
ch1_battle_da92121b	feng	Dorian, get the civilians out! I'll handle this beast!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1994	feng "[what]"
ch1_battle_9ed97dc6	dorian	Feng, wait! We can't take this thing alone!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1995	dorian "[what]"
ch1_battle_cda3bbc3		But Feng doesn't listen. With a battle cry, he charges toward the Taotie, leaping high and slashing at its massive head.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1997	"[what]"
ch1_battle_394c2f0d		His blade slices across one of its glowing eyes, the blue fire searing into its flesh. The Taotie roars in pain, its head snapping back as it reels from the attack.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	1998	"[what]"
