ch1_battle_8f1f0732		The claws rake across his face, sending him flying backward. He crashes into the ground, rolling to a stop near me. Blood gushes from deep, savage gashes across his eyes, the blue fire extinguished from his blade as it clatters to the ground.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2009	"[what]"
