ch1_common_end_c0deb19b		Without another word, I turn and sprint through the crumbling streets of Tianho.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2203	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_f290e593		Please, let them be safe. Please, Tetrad, don't take them from me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2204	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_27b20cbc		I sprint through the streets of Tianho, the wails of the injured and the cries of the terrified ring in my ears, drowning out the thunder of my own panicked footsteps.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2205	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_60059b3d		The streets are littered with the bodies of fallen townsfolk, their lifeless eyes staring at nothing. Soldiers and civilians alike run past me, their faces twisted in fear.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2207	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_af597897	dorian	Please, please let them be safe. Let Elara and the kids be safe.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2209	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_e147f3cd		As I sprint, my gaze locks onto a building half-consumed by flames. The roof is sagging, embers raining down like hellfire. Faint cries reach my ears through the roaring inferno.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2211	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_77695f1b	man_3	Help! Someone, help us!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2213	man_3 "[what]"
