ch1_common_end_a0f6c2de	woman_3	My baby! My child and I are inside!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2215	woman_3 "[what]"
ch1_common_end_539375cc		I skid to a halt. The doorway is blocked by debris, the flames licking hungrily at the edges. I stretch out a hand, summoning my power.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2217	"[what]"
