ch1_common_end_7e763f35		Coughing and clutching one another, the mother and her child stumble out, tears streaming down their soot-streaked faces. A man runs out, carrying some clothes with him.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2222	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_bdeae824	dorian	Are you alright? Run straight and you'll find soldiers who will help you. Now!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2224	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_4c0b08a5		The man and woman nod, sobbing their thanks before disappearing into the chaotic streets.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2226	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_5a7d9832		A cry pierces the air.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2227	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_ba4fb77d	yuxuan	Ahhh! Help! I'm stuck!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2229	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_common_end_0d4853e7		I rush back to the entrance, finding a young man pinned beneath a beam. The flames are already roaring back to life, encroaching dangerously close.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2231	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_1faa0ac3	yuxuan	The fire! It's too strong— Prosperity Dragon, I'm going to die here like the others! *weeps*	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2233	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_common_end_8fa56a42		I kneel beside him, gripping his trembling shoulder.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2235	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_7eaf0f09	dorian	Hey! Hey! Look at me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2237	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_031a5139		His wide, tear-filled eyes meet mine.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2239	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_c2282953	dorian	You're not going to die here. What's your name?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2241	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_da65958d	yuxuan	Y-Yuxuan. Cheng Yuxuan.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2242	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_common_end_0e518e00	dorian	Alright, Yuxuan. I'm Paladin Dorian. On three, I'm going to lift this beam, and you're going to run. Got it?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2243	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_ddb99eae		He nods shakily, his breaths shallow and quick.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2245	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_c5b7eea9	dorian	One… Two…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2247	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_4bb1395f		I grip the beam, summoning strength into my arms.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2249	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_d9dc6a83	dorian	Three! Run!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2251	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_5d4834fb		I heave the beam aside, flames licking at my boots as Yuxuan scrambles free.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2253	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_1a5c2f27		Yuxuan hesitates for a moment, his gaze fixed on me with an intensity I can't place, then bolts toward safety.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2254	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_6c556345		When he reaches a safe distance, he turns back, his voice trembling but filled with emotion.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2255	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_c0132787	yuxuan	You… You saved me. I…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2257	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_common_end_5f8f3146	yuxuan	P-Paladin D-Dorian, right?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2258	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_common_end_c861eb67	dorian	Don't mention it, Yuxuan. I want you to run. Head straight and you'll find soldiers who will help you. Hurry!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2259	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_e7977f67	yuxuan	T-Thank you for saving me…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2260	yuxuan "[what]"
ch1_common_end_daff8901		I give him a quick nod, urgency pulling me back to my original mission. Elara, the kids... hold on.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2262	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_26ed7080		As I sprint away, I feel Yuxuan's gaze lingering.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2263	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_9cefc71e		Soon, the inn comes into view, but my heart plummets as I see the hellscape before me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2271	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_416470ff		The building where my family rested is now submerged in molten lava, its structure reduced to ash and smoldering debris.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2272	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_9af958fa		No…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2274	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_9af958fa_1		No…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2275	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_5b173c3f		Standing in the center of the destruction is a massive figure, nearly twice the height of a man. Its body is grotesque — hulking and sinewy, its skin a mottled mix of black and crimson, with molten veins pulsing across its form.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2277	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_85e7cbc9		Its claws drip with blood, and its eyes glow like twin embers. Horns twist from its head, curling like a jagged crown, and its gaping maw splits into a sinister grin.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2278	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_2160655d		This is no ordinary yaoguai. This is a Yaoguai King — a lord of their kind, radiating a dark, oppressive aura that makes the air feel heavy.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2279	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_acbfbe69		In its clawed hand, it holds something small and pale.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2280	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_7da48d41		My stomach drops as I realize what it is.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2284	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_cdc63b3e	dorian	ELARA! ELARA NO!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2292	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_a2fe89ba		The yaoguai king throws its head back and laughs, a deep, guttural sound that shakes the ground.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2294	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_25b9727a	yk	Such fragile creatures… humans. So soft. So full of fear.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2296	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_3b7c7c27	yk	I've searched through fire and blood for you, Dragonkin. At last, I've found you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2297	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_898ae987		It raises Elara's severed head higher, as if to taunt me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2299	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_d31db27e	yk	You're looking for this, aren't you?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2301	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_428babe5	dorian	No… No…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2302	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_157d5267	yk	She begged for you. Cried your name with her last breath. Where were you, Paladin?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2303	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_b1d13fa3	dorian	YOU MONSTER! WHAT HAVE YOU DONE TO HER? TO MY KIDS?	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2304	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_980edd50		He opens his other clawed hand — bloodied objects slip through his fingers. I recognize them.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2306	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_76458a23		Sarah's drawing book. Daniel's sash.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2307	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_3aed5d03	yk	The little ones screamed louder than she did.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2309	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_7b31b38f	yk	I feasted on their fear. On their hope. Hope in their tiny voices. Such belief that you would come.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2310	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_9cbb1f39	yk	When they broke down and cried — I saved the last scream for you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2311	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_47533360	dorian	Emily… Daniel… Sarah… Lucas…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2313	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_af96d1ef	yk	You should have heard Emily. Her voice cracked when she cried for you… Oh, and Lucas…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2315	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_545a2627		The words barely register. My world is spinning, collapsing in on itself. My knees hit the ground as a scream tears from my throat.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2317	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_dbf8094b	dorian	I'LL KILL YOU! I'LL KILL YOU! I SWEAR BY THE TETRAD'S NAME, I'LL RIP YOU APART!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2319	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_9c8a53e3		I try to rush forward, to throw myself at the yaoguai king, but strong hands grab my shoulders.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2322	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_3027ad8c	gao	Paladin, no! You can't! We have to go, now!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2324	gao "[what]"
ch1_common_end_10543a3a	jiang	Paladin, please! He's just baiting you!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2325	jiang "[what]"
ch1_common_end_24090c34		I thrash against them, roaring, but more soldiers appear, holding me back. I can feel flames coming out of my eyes.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2327	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_8a773956	dorian	LET ME GO! I'LL KILL HIM! LET ME GO!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2329	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_bf368c6c	yk	YES! YES! HAHAHA! That's it! Cry! Rage! Let your soul split open!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2331	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_b5d8d0a4	yk	Burn for me! Show me what grief can do to a god-touched soul!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2332	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_2db613bf	jiang	Gao! Do something!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2334	jiang "[what]"
ch1_common_end_06736a41	gao	Ok! Ok!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2335	gao "[what]"
ch1_common_end_9a5e9a9a	gao	I'm sorry, Paladin. This is for your own good.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2336	gao "[what]"
ch1_common_end_77ef6fa0	dorian	I'LL HUNT YOU DOWN TO THE ENDS OF THE EARTH YOU FIEND! THEN I—	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2338	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_b18eb49e	jiang	Do it!! Now!!	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2340	jiang "[what]"
ch1_common_end_8d1ddc17		I barely notice the glint of metal in his hand until it's too late. The sharp sting of the dart pierces my neck, and a wave of numbness washes over me.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2342	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_de3ca4ed	dorian	No… Elara…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2347	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_476f7025		My body grows heavy, my vision blurring as I slump to the ground. The last thing I hear is the yaoguai king's laughter.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2349	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_dd34869b	yk	Come find me, dragonkin… But remember this… no matter how fast you chase me… you'll never outrun what I've taken from you.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2351	yk "[what]"
ch1_common_end_818fed40		Then, Elara's voice… and the kids' laughter.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2353	"[what]"
ch1_common_end_2533f781	elara	I love you, my heart…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2355	elara "[what]"
ch1_common_end_254a86ce	dorian	E…lara…	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2356	dorian "[what]"
ch1_common_end_61cb447e		And then — darkness.	game/03_chapter_01.rpy	2360	"[what]"
chapter_2_3989a8ce		The snow falls steadily, blanketing the area in silence. The only sounds are the crunch of boots and the occasional muttered curses from the mercenaries behind me.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	285	"[what]"
chapter_2_57f386d6	mjoll_pavel	Merciful Enoch, it's freezing. Why does it have to be this cold?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	292	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
chapter_2_7eed8ab5	mjoll_helga	Quit complaining, Pavel. We've got bigger things to worry about. You know what this beast did to that caravan last week.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	293	mjoll_helga "[what]"
chapter_2_88109101	mjoll_lars	Screw what it did to the caravan. It destroyed an entire village. I don't know why only five of us were sent to kill it!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	294	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_62afcb99		Their voices lower, but I can still hear them.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	296	"[what]"
chapter_2_2053b216	mjoll_lars	Hey... is that him? The Dragon of Gale?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	298	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_96e18cfe	mjoll_pavel	No way. He's not... The Dragon of Gale wouldn't be out here with us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	299	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
chapter_2_1bfce5e8	mjoll_helga	Wait… Enoch above… it really is him. I heard he lost his entire family. Wife and kids... all of them gone.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	300	mjoll_helga "[what]"
chapter_2_049754d1	mjoll_pavel	No wonder he looks dejected. What kind of man comes back from something like that?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	301	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
chapter_2_571c833f	mjoll_lars	Shut up. He'll hear you!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	302	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_3a3e5904		Vasily shoots them a sharp glare. He snaps his fingers.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	304	"[what]"
chapter_2_1faa43c2	vasily	Eyes forward. Lose focus out here, start thinking about the wrong things and you'll be nothing but meat for the beasts. Do I make myself clear?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	308	vasily "[what]"
chapter_2_8d191c1a	mjoll_lars	Sir!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	309	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_e133def2		The snow around us seemed to grow heavier. I looked around, scanning the barren landscape.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	311	"[what]"
chapter_2_37d8e0e6		Something was off. Too quiet, too still. The wind carried a foul, metallic scent—blood. I stopped in my tracks and raised a hand.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	312	"[what]"
chapter_2_2e08cccf	dorian	We're here.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	314	dorian "[what]"
chapter_2_5c1fdd8c		The mercenaries stiffened, their chatter ceasing immediately. They looked around nervously, hands shaking as they start gripping their weapons.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	317	"[what]"
chapter_2_d6804b8f	mjoll_lars	Umm… where?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	319	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_16b8cb94		Silence.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	321	"[what]"
chapter_2_41e9e518		Then it came.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	322	"[what]"
chapter_2_6b8b51a2		A low, guttural growl rumbled through the frozen wilderness, vibrating the ground beneath us. The snow swirled as if alive, the wind howling in response to the beast's presence.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	323	"[what]"
chapter_2_45646b07		The Qiongqi emerged from the shadows, its massive form blending with the storm. It had the body of a lion but twisted and wrong—its fur black as midnight, its eyes burning like embers. Its sharp claws scraped against the frozen ground, leaving deep gouges.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	324	"[what]"
chapter_2_4feba35e	frost_oni	KRRRIIEEEEEEEEAAAAAAAHHHHH!!!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	336	frost_oni "[what]"
chapter_2_5f96be26		It charged. A blur of claws and fury.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	338	"[what]"
chapter_2_43858c12	vasily	Hold your ground!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	340	vasily "[what]"
chapter_2_c68431bf		One mercenary swung his sword wildly, only for the beast to swat him aside like a doll, sending him crashing into the snow. Another let loose an arrow that bounced harmlessly off the Qiongqi's thick hide.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	342	"[what]"
chapter_2_eb17bdf3	mjoll_lars	AHHH!!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	344	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_61f98b2c	mjoll_helga	My arrows aren't working! Use your shield, Lars!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	345	mjoll_helga "[what]"
chapter_2_a6921566		The beast lunged at the third mercenary, its claws slicing through his shield as though it were parchment.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	347	"[what]"
chapter_2_5a12a4d9		I thrust my arms toward the ground. Pillars of jagged earth erupted from beneath the Qiongqi, slamming into its underbelly and knocking it off balance.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	348	"[what]"
chapter_2_d037755e	frost_oni	Krieeeeeeaaahh!!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	353	frost_oni "[what]"
chapter_2_99096871		It screeched in agony, flipping mid-air, crashing to the ground. Clumps of black fur and blood sprayed into the snow.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	355	"[what]"
chapter_2_485da7d4		But it wasn't finished.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	356	"[what]"
chapter_2_05057cad		It rose, furious—its mouth split open unnaturally wide as it released another piercing howl.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	357	"[what]"
chapter_2_086f5c71	frost_oni	RAAAAAHHHHHHHRRGHHHH!!!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	359	frost_oni "[what]"
chapter_2_9760eee8	vasily	Dorian! It's coming for you!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	361	vasily "[what]"
chapter_2_db8e06c6		I didn't move.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	363	"[what]"
chapter_2_18a5f7d1		Instead, I rotated my palm. The wind around me shifted. Then roared.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	366	"[what]"
chapter_2_828252ad		A gale burst forth—a spiraling, howling torrent that slammed into the Qiongqi's face, flinging it backward across the battlefield like a rag doll. The snow whipped into a frenzy as the beast clawed at the ice, struggling to find footing.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	370	"[what]"
chapter_2_dca61427	frost_oni	RAAAAAHH!! RAAAHHH!!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	372	frost_oni "[what]"
chapter_2_f57bf71b	mjoll_lars	Helga, your bow! Hit it on its shoulder!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	374	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_27ba66a3		One of the Mjoll soldiers managed to shoot an arrow, and by some stroke of luck—or desperation—it embedded itself in the Qiongqi's shoulder. The beast howled, thrashing violently, but it only seemed angrier.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	376	"[what]"
chapter_2_38735204	frost_oni	Krieeeeeewwwaaahh!!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	378	frost_oni "[what]"
chapter_2_15e97695	mjoll_helga	Haha! Take that!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	380	mjoll_helga "[what]"
chapter_2_614733e8		Vasily stepped forward, his expression calm but his eyes burning with resolve. He raised his hands, and a blinding light erupted from his palms. The Qiongqi screeched, recoiling from the light.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	382	"[what]"
chapter_2_faa57b18	vasily	Now, friend!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	384	vasily "[what]"
chapter_2_2772c1e1		I didn't hesitate. Summoning a massive portion of earth, I brought a jagged spike of stone hurtling up beneath the Qiongqi's chest, impaling it.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	386	"[what]"
chapter_2_9a341753	frost_oni	Kwaaaaaaaaahhh—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	391	frost_oni "[what]"
chapter_2_905abd64		The winds circled my body, responding to my silent fury. With a snap of my hand, a twisting column of wind slammed into the Qiongqi's skull, driving it headfirst into the frozen ground with enough force to shatter bone.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	393	"[what]"
chapter_2_d6489f8c	frost_oni	GRGHHHHHHKKKKHHHHHHH—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	395	frost_oni "[what]"
chapter_2_dc6d7b8b		The monstrous shrieking was cut short. The Qiongqi twitched once… then went still.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	397	"[what]"
chapter_2_20d5caff		Dead.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	398	"[what]"
chapter_2_28bde4fe	mjoll_pavel	He… he literally could have just done this without us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	408	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
chapter_2_777f64b9	mjoll_lars	He really is… the Dragon…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	409	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_91c71745		I stood over it, my breath steady, my gaze cold.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	411	"[what]"
chapter_2_9743dd10	dorian	Cut off its head. Now.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	413	dorian "[what]"
chapter_2_e683a146	mjoll_lars	Yes, sir.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	414	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_2_b1d1b20b		He nodded quickly, drawing his blade and stepping toward the corpse.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	416	"[what]"
chapter_2_78d327d2		I turned away, wiping the bloodied snow from my gauntlets. Vasily approached, his light fading.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	417	"[what]"
chapter_2_a8ecce77	vasily	That was quick, friend. You didn't even flinch.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	420	vasily "[what]"
chapter_2_79869389	vasily	Are we even needed anymore, or are we just here for the scenery? Haha.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	421	vasily "[what]"
chapter_2_e9b61535		I didn't respond. My eyes were fixed on the distant horizon, where the snow-covered peaks loomed like silent watchers.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	423	"[what]"
chapter_2_1f82b88b	dorian	Time to go back.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	425	dorian "[what]"
chapter_2_fd17f1ba		The walk back to Mjoll was silent except for the crunch of snow beneath our boots. The soldiers lingered behind me, talking about how they survived the fight with the monster.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	428	"[what]"
chapter_2_213f889b		The Qiongqi's head dangled from my grasp, dripping thick, acrid blood that left a crimson trail in the pure white snow. Its weight didn't bother me—I'd carried far worse.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	429	"[what]"
ch2_palace_dfc82ccc		When we reached the gates of the palace, the guards stiffened, their pale faces betraying their unease. They exchanged glances but didn't dare to stop me. As I pushed through the heavy doors, Vasily trailing close behind.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	447	"[what]"
ch2_palace_ec2db27b		We enter the throne room; the smell of incense hangs thick in the air. A group of Aldoriths knelt on the cold stone floor, their heads bowed low.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	448	"[what]"
ch2_palace_3c6fdebe		At the far end of the room, King Gustav Nordstrom sat upon his gilded throne, his face as hard as the icy mountains that surrounded Mjoll. Beside him, Queen Ekaterina Drakos sat, her dark eyes gleaming.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	449	"[what]"
ch2_palace_7aceec69	vasily	Enoch above. Another punishment?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	456	vasily "[what]"
ch2_palace_9d190cb3		One of the kneeling Aldoriths—a young man with striking purple hair—raised his head.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	458	"[what]"
ch2_palace_5e7dbd5b	svante	Please, Father! I beg you! I didn't mean to—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	460	svante "[what]"
ch2_palace_8feef6d5	king_gustav	You dare speak to me that way, boy? You've been given every chance to prove your worth, and yet you continue to disappoint me.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	462	king_gustav "[what]"
ch2_palace_ec5740ff		The queen leaned forward, her voice a venomous whisper.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	464	"[what]"
ch2_palace_1c687f8a	queen_ekaterina	Svante should be grateful, Your Highness. Without your guidance, he'd be no better than a stray mutt.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	466	queen_ekaterina "[what]"
ch2_palace_2ac5f2a9	kristin	Quiet, Svante. You'll only make it worse for us. Please…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	467	kristin "[what]"
ch2_palace_76ce98dc	boy_ald	Worse? What more can he take from us that he hasn't already?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	468	boy_ald "[what]"
ch2_palace_99e75f2c		I step closer and into the throne room, the soldiers following at a distance, the Qiongqi's head dripping blood onto the pristine marble floor.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	470	"[what]"
ch2_palace_a9d8e1ee	king_gustav	Enough! That goes for all of you. If you disobey, you will be beheaded like your brothers and sisters. IS THAT CLEAR? You are nothing without my name. Nothing!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	473	king_gustav "[what]"
ch2_palace_b29a05df		Aldoriths: Yes, Father.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	474	"[what]"
ch2_palace_84a486f8	queen_ekaterina	Svante speaks like he's a prince, but look at him—groveling like the dog he is.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	475	queen_ekaterina "[what]"
ch2_palace_1e786153	svante	I… I'm sorry, Father… Please forgive me… I—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	476	svante "[what]"
ch2_palace_28e1d208		I step forward then, the Qiongqi's head swinging in my grasp, its blood dripping onto the pristine marble floor. The sound of the impact silences the room.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	478	"[what]"
ch2_palace_8ca304b8		The Aldoriths freeze, their wide eyes darting to me.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	479	"[what]"
ch2_palace_5be2d93d	boy_ald	It's him…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	481	boy_ald "[what]"
ch2_palace_fe34a9c2	svante	The Dragon of Gale…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	482	svante "[what]"
ch2_palace_40e073c4	king_gustav	Ah, Dorian. You've returned. Efficient as always. What news of the beast?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	484	king_gustav "[what]"
ch2_palace_a4329261		I drop the Qiongqi's head unceremoniously onto the floor.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	486	"[what]"
ch2_palace_9599c0ee	dorian	The beast is dead. Your kingdom is safe, for now. My payment.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	488	dorian "[what]"
ch2_palace_6d9301d8		The king gestures lazily, and a servant scurries forward, pressing a heavy pouch of gold into my hand. I take it without ceremony, glancing briefly at Vasily.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	490	"[what]"
ch2_palace_adf901fb	dorian	Thanks.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	492	dorian "[what]"
ch2_palace_aabccfac	king_gustav	This particular Qiongqi has terrorized these lands for a month now, devouring livestock, destroying villages, and killing many of my subjects. The people of Mjoll will sleep easier tonight thanks to you.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	494	king_gustav "[what]"
ch2_palace_22aed93e	queen_ekaterina	You've done this kingdom a great service. And for that, we shall show our gratitude.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	495	queen_ekaterina "[what]"
ch2_palace_0575425d	vasily	You've done what no one else could, Dorian. The King wants to make a spectacle of this victory, a display of his generosity to the people. He'll reward you handsomely if you make an appearance tomorrow.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	497	vasily "[what]"
ch2_palace_6a349566	dorian	Tomorrow?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	499	dorian "[what]"
ch2_palace_6f47074c	vasily	Yes, tomorrow. There'll be a celebration for the people. They wanted to celebrate your slaying of the Qiongqi.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	500	vasily "[what]"
ch2_palace_56b63665		I glance down at the bloodied pouch of gold in my hand.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	502	"[what]"
ch2_palace_8f3fa6ef	dorian	I'll be there.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	504	dorian "[what]"
ch2_palace_ad093b61		As I turn to leave, I hear the Aldoriths' voices behind me, trembling and desperate.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	507	"[what]"
ch2_palace_bf03f56f	svante	Father, please, I only sought to prove my loyalty! Give me another chance!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	509	svante "[what]"
ch2_palace_56208931	kristin	We'll do anything—just let us stay by your side!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	510	kristin "[what]"
ch2_palace_f18d68d1	king_gustav	You've embarrassed me for the last time. Guards, take them to the dungeon. Perhaps some time in the dark will teach you the value of obedience.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	512	king_gustav "[what]"
ch2_palace_60283c6f	queen_ekaterina	They're lucky they didn't end up like the others. You're far too kind, my love.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	514	queen_ekaterina "[what]"
ch2_palace_6105ed0f		I don't look back as the Aldoriths' pleas turn to sobs, swallowed by the clang of armor and the heavy slam of the dungeon doors.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	516	"[what]"
ch2_palace_3e44b478		Vasily catches up to me as I leave the palace, the snow crunching beneath our boots.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	519	"[what]"
ch2_palace_83fdc57e	vasily	Dorian, look. You don't have to come tomorrow, you know. But the King won't forget if you don't. And neither will the people.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	521	vasily "[what]"
ch2_palace_9d74bc24	dorian	Let them remember what they want. I just want my gold.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	522	dorian "[what]"
ch2_palace_a2259f4d		Vasily places a hand on my shoulder.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	524	"[what]"
ch2_palace_ee1bf902	vasily	My offer still stands, okay? Let me know if you want to grab a beer or two. On me.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	526	vasily "[what]"
ch2_palace_1f6778c4		I nod. The wind bites at my face as I head back into the streets of Mjoll, my path lit only by the faint glow of lanterns. I clutch the pouch tightly, its weight pulling at my hand.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	528	"[what]"
ch2_cave_13276bad		I go back to my small cave, the entrance of which is shielded by a curtain of thick furs, swaying slightly in the icy wind of Mjoll.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	548	"[what]"
ch2_cave_c05d9f92		I duck inside, pulling the curtain closed behind me, shutting out the biting cold. The glow of a small fireplace greets me, casting flickering shadows on the rough stone walls.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	549	"[what]"
ch2_cave_9a774991		I kneel by the fireplace, adding another log to the fire. From the small stash of ingredients I've gathered over the years, I begin to prepare dinner.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	551	"[what]"
ch2_cave_61d12fef		I set out six simple plates, each one mismatched and worn, around a low wooden table I carved myself.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	552	"[what]"
ch2_cave_bae584e1		I ladle out portions of the stew I've cooked—one for me, and five for them.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	553	"[what]"
ch2_cave_c29a8071		I sit in my usual spot, looking at their plates.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	560	"[what]"
ch2_cave_df803e27	elara	Kids, come on. Haven't your father and I taught you some table manners?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	563	elara "[what]"
ch2_cave_969461eb	lucas	Mom, can we go play in the snow after this?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	564	lucas "[what]"
ch2_cave_4b139aec	emily	Mmm the stew tastes good, Dad!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	565	emily "[what]"
ch2_cave_d26d552b	daniel	Stop sucking up to dad, Emily!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	566	daniel "[what]"
ch2_cave_9e3504a3	sarah	Guys, stop moving! You'll get food all over my sketchbook!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	567	sarah "[what]"
ch2_cave_5ecf0386	elara	Aren't they adorable, Dorian? I miss you, my heart.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	568	elara "[what]"
ch2_cave_1c093e40		I see their smile, the way they always knew how to make this cold, harsh world feel warm.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	571	"[what]"
ch2_cave_17644d87		The fire crackles and I eat slowly, savoring down very bite, even as the food grows colder.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	572	"[what]"
ch2_cave_ceabefd9	dorian	I'm sorry… I wasn't there. I should've been there. I…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	574	dorian "[what]"
ch2_cave_517e29b0		I ball up my fist and continue eating. After I finished my meal, I head back to my bedroll.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	576	"[what]"
ch2_cave_f9665849		I close my eyes, letting the weight of exhaustion pull me under. Tomorrow will come, and with it, another mission, another royal errand, another reason to keep moving.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	577	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_e0228eb8		The city square of Mjoll is already alive with activity as I arrive the next day. The air is brisk, the cold biting but not enough to faze me anymore.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	598	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_96e1b1fb		Booths are being set up around the square, their wooden frames dusted with a thin layer of snow. Merchants and servants bustle about, their breath forming small clouds in the icy air.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	599	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_c700f0ad		I spot Vasily almost immediately, standing near the center of the square. He's barking out orders, pointing left and right.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	601	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_56d9d425	vasily	Make sure the performers don't miss a single beat. We don't want to have any on-the-spot beheadings this time around. We don't want any blood on our booths now, would we?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	605	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_a1e73bdc		All: Sir!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	606	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_399846bc		The crowd disperses, and I approach him. When he catches sight of me, his eyebrows shoot up in surprise.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	608	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_cc0ff352	vasily	Dorian? Already here?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	610	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_f6f30617		I fold my arms, shrugging slightly.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	612	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_f1c43087	dorian	Why wouldn't I be?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	614	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_7678f1b9	vasily	Oh, silly me. When have you not been early? You'd show up to your own funeral two hours in advance just to make sure everything's running smoothly.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	615	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_5e5c9af7		I don't respond, letting the comment hang in the cold air. Vasily studies me for a moment, his expression softening.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	617	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_2e411d0f	vasily	The event doesn't start for another two hours, you know.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	619	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_a2860dcf	dorian	I'm aware. Just wanted to check the area.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	620	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_cb03338f		He raises an eyebrow but doesn't press further. Instead, he gestures to the booths around us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	622	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_1327f185	vasily	The king and queen will be here later, but as you can see, we've got quite the spectacle planned. Feast, performances, and of course…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	625	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_992fe0bb		He leans in slightly, lowering his voice.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	627	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_99024890	vasily	…the presentation of the Qiongqi's head. It'll be the centerpiece.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	629	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_dddd881d		I nod, glancing at the large wooden platform being constructed in the center of the square.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	631	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_c97a2ae9	dorian	Don't you think it's a little extravagant?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	633	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_3fbd736a	vasily	You know His Highness. Also, the people need something to rally around. After everything that's happened, a little morale boost goes a long way.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	634	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_916366ff		I stay silent, my gaze drifting across the square. Children laugh as they chase each other around the booths. Adults are happily chatting with each other as the snow lightly falls.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	636	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_c446b230	vasily	You should get some rest, Dorian. Come back when the festivities start. You've done your part.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	639	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_eec136a0	dorian	I'm fine.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	640	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_b068551c		He sighs, muttering something under his breath.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	642	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_941d47fd	vasily	Suit yourself. Just don't scare the merchants.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	644	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_5b5ea78a		I smirk faintly at his jab but say nothing.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	646	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_10d928a8	vasily	Come to think of it…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	648	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_e7ea4a7d		I glance at him, raising a brow.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	650	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_668c69d5	dorian	What?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	652	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_d6737653		He folds his arms and smirks.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	654	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_a0cf8449	vasily	You're already here. Why not help me check the booths? Make sure everything's up and running?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	656	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_c434925e		I scoff, shaking my head.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	658	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_5d6f50d3	dorian	Not interested.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	660	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_ff3544d2	vasily	Dorian, come on. When's the last time you did something remotely enjoyable? When's the last time you had fun?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	661	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_b776c082		I narrow my eyes at him.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	663	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_b6c6c2c4	dorian	Every night. When I spend my time with my family.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	665	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_36657c38		He nudges my shoulder gently.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	667	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_b8c9f548	vasily	Hmm… Yeah, but you could use a distraction. Look, if you join me, I'll make it worth your while.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	669	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_ca32ea74		I raise a skeptical brow.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	671	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_76b42e18	dorian	How?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	673	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_0439c902	vasily	Gold. From the king, naturally. Consider it… an incentive for your services.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	676	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_1b33ac1f		I let out a slow breath, crossing my arms as I mull it over.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	678	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_66fddea6	dorian	Fine. Let's get this over with.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	680	dorian "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_f851e229	vasily	That's the spirit, friend!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	681	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_dfa6b491		He claps me on the back, his grin widening.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	683	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_7c840790		As we begin to walk through the square, Vasily dives into his element, greeting merchants, inspecting goods, and occasionally throwing in a comment or two about how to make things 'more appealing to the people.'	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	684	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_5b713194		I follow in silence, my eyes scanning the colorful displays and the array of items on sale.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	685	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_787ca6bc		The scents of freshly baked bread and spiced meat waft through the air, mingling with the faint chill of the snow. People are beginning to trickle into the square, as we walk on by.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	686	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_8bca8e1d	vasily	See? Not so bad, is it? Unfortunately, the merchant who sells Mjollian Mead-Braised Lamb was mercilessly killed by a yaoguai before coming here so… we might have to settle for less.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	689	vasily "[what]"
ch2_square_intro_fd92fa01		I grunt in response, earning a chuckle from him.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	691	"[what]"
ch2_square_intro_07e79163	vasily	Alright, Dorian. Since you're tagging along, where do you want to go? Completely up to you.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	693	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_608189ca		Vasily and I decided to stroll through the food stalls, the air thick with the aroma of roasted fish, hearty soups, and fresh-baked bread. The snow-covered streets contrast with the vibrant colors of the vendors' booths.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	754	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_2e20bfaa	vasily	Ah, here we go, Dorian. Mjollian cuisine is second to none. Let me guess, you haven't eaten anything decent in weeks.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	756	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_7bb1e3e9	dorian	Hmph.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	757	dorian "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_24a025c5		I grunt in response, but my stomach betrays me with a growl. He smirks and gestures toward a booth with a large cast iron cauldron.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	759	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_306cec1f	vendor_mjoll	Two Zarybas, fresh and hot! Best in all of Mjoll!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	764	vendor_mjoll "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_7cf9a1eb		Vasily hands over a few coins and passes me one of the bread bowls.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	766	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_9b889e41	vasily	Eat, friend. You'll thank me later, hungry grumpy man.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	768	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_c1553b71		I take a bite. The smoky, savory flavor of the sturgeon hits me first, followed by the earthiness of the parsnips and turnips. The bread, soaked in the stew, is soft yet hearty. It's... surprisingly good.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	771	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_0dd7522c	dorian	It's… *groans*	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	774	dorian "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_0e8b3139	vasily	See? I told you. Nothing like food to make life a little less bleak.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	775	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_2fc5794f	dorian	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	776	dorian "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_1904a548	vasily	You know, you could make this easier on yourself. You've been carrying this weight for four years. Maybe it's time to let some of it go.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	777	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_2ae40e41		I don't answer, focusing instead on the meal. Vasily knows better than to push further and continues eating.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	779	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_002f7554		As we get up to leave, I catch sight of the vendor. She stands at the edge of the stall, watching the guards escort two boys carrying heavy crates. Her eyes are filled with tears.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	781	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_f1bf1f41	male_guard	Come on! Pick up the pace, will ya? Don't make me bring out the whip!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	786	male_guard "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_6f07c7d6	boy_ald_spa	Please, sir! We just need a drink!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	787	boy_ald_spa "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_9fe773e3	female_guard	You'll get your drink after an hour! Now get back to work!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	788	female_guard "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_cc0a5d28	vasily	Come on, friend. Don't get any ideas. You can't save everyone.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	790	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_865edbee		The vendor glances toward me briefly.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	792	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_58e8f515		I clench my fists, stepping toward the guards as they bark orders at the two kids.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	804	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_d31ba54f	dorian	Let them rest. They're just kids.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	806	dorian "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_1695e62f		The guards turn, startled, before recognizing me. One of them straightens up, puffing out his chest.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	808	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_0e3d65de	male_guard	Stay out of this, mercenary. These children are property of the Crown. They do as they're told.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	810	male_guard "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_6b87c59d		The vendor watches silently, her hands trembling.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	812	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_1763d927	dorian	They look half-dead. If you push them any further, they'll collapse.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	814	dorian "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_cb065d06	male_guard	Then they collapse. Not our problem their constitution's weak.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	815	male_guard "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_290842e3	female_guard	Y-You fool! Th-that mercenary is the Dragon of Gale.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	817	female_guard "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_d06eaa66	male_guard	What? O-Oh… Um… Sure. Kids, break time!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	818	male_guard "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_2c29930b		The two kids immediately run to the vendor to get some water.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	820	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_ca7668cc	vendor_mjoll	Here's some water. Please drink. Are you hungry, my children?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	822	vendor_mjoll "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_8d7502a0	vasily	*sighs* You just had to make a scene. Let's go.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	824	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_9f6a2921		I glance at the vendor, then at the guards. My fists clench, but I force myself to stay rooted in place.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	830	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_c2e8d7f8		The vendor's gaze meets mine for a moment, her eyes pleading, but I look away. Vasily doesn't say anything—he knows what I'm feeling, even if I don't show it.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	831	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_2fc5794f_1	dorian	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	833	dorian "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_7c861f55	vasily	Let's go, Dorian. Nothing to see here.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	834	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_a4994432		As we walk away, I hear the guards bark another order at the children. A crate crashes to the ground, followed by the sound of a whip cracking. A woman's stifled sob is the last thing I hear as we round the corner.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	836	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_9a3228da	vasily	I know what you're thinking. You want to charge in, right every wrong. But that's not how Mjoll works, Dorian.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	839	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_bcc11eb7	vasily	This place… It survives because of the system. The King and Queen, for all their flaws, keep the kingdom standing.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	840	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_da4fc379	dorian	You really believe that?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	842	dorian "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_5de2c577		Vasily doesn't answer immediately.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	844	"[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_58c8f3c1	vasily	I believe that survival comes at a cost. You've paid yours. Maybe it's time to stop paying for everyone else's.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	847	vasily "[what]"
ch2_food_stalls_609808fe		I stay silent, the taste of the Zaryba still lingering on my tongue, now bitter.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	849	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_d53d55ba		Vasily nudges me toward the dimly lit booth draped in heavy, violet curtains. A crooked, hastily-painted sign outside reads: 'Babala: Your Fate Awaits.'	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	869	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_dec5f7a2	vasily	Oh she's back in town!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	871	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_175d806d	dorian	Really? Who?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	872	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_cbc36c8a	vasily	Babala. She's a fortuneteller. They say she never misses with her fortunes. I'd say it's worth a try. She's—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	873	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_5d6f50d3	dorian	Not interested.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	874	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_442ffe5e	vasily	Come on, Dorian. I'd say it's worth a try.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	875	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_af78b41c		I glare at him.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	877	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_87408a72	dorian	Fortunes are just words to me, Vasily. Nothing more.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	879	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_f7eda47f	vasily	Words have power, you know. Besides, maybe she'll tell you about your love life. Don't you think it's time to move on?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	880	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_0c73a52c		I stop in my tracks, the air around us growing cold.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	882	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_5594f41d	dorian	I will never remarry, Vasily. Don't bring that up again.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	884	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_91f487e9		The fortune teller, a middle-aged woman, with white eyes, peeks out from the curtains, chuckling softly.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	886	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_9bda5c0e	babala	Haha. You are as stubborn as the stone you channel, Dragon of Gale. But even the hardest stone cracks in time.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	890	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_5fce7aa5		Vasily laughs, patting my shoulder.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	892	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_9e440b7c		We step inside. The booth is small but warm, the scent of incense hanging in the air. A crystal orb glows faintly on the table, and behind it sits Babala.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	896	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_4cf8a25b		She looks up, her lips curling into a knowing smile.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	897	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_3e6c71e7	babala	The Dragon of Gale. I wondered when you'd visit me.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	899	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_07101d92	vasily	He didn't want to come, of course, but I dragged him here. Babala, tell him something interesting—preferably about his love life.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	900	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_90c05dad	babala	*laughing* Your friend has a sharp tongue.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	903	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_f1d88a3f		I glare at Vasily, but Babala's chuckle draws my attention back to her.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	905	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_4c1ecc61	babala	Sit, child of fire. Let the Weaver guide us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	907	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_eeee7add		I hesitate before sitting across from her. Her gaze turns distant as she places her hands on the crystal orb.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	909	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_c1a5d192	babala	The Weaver… the one who spun the first threads of existence. From the void, she created the Tetrad—four immortal beings who shaped the world.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	911	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_5f5c2254	babala	Together, they wove the earths, the waters, the heavens, and all life. But it is the Weaver who holds all fates in their loom.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	912	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_f4b30633		Her voice takes on a reverent tone, and for a moment, the air feels heavier.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	914	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_9a2489d3	babala	And now, she weaves your threads, Dragon of Gale.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	916	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_c576fc0b	dorian	Th-that's great, I guess.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	918	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_2807b37a		The crystal orb flickers, and a faint swirl of smoke begins to rise. Babala's eyes widen slightly, and her lips curl into a smile.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	920	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_386c94cb	babala	Normally, I allow people to ask one question, but for you, Dragon, I will permit two. Fate bends itself for those who walk in its shadow.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	922	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_d63362da	vasily	*laughs jealously* Why the special treatment?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	923	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_8b843d31		Babala doesn't answer him. The swirling smoke grows, curling around me like an embrace. It feels strangely comforting, and I instinctively close my eyes.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	925	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_b78937a6	babala	Don't fight it, Dragon. Open your heart to me.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	927	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_f4483859		She leans forward, her voice dropping to a whisper.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	929	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_cf6a57c6	babala	Do not fight it, Dragon. Let your heart guide your words to the Weaver's threads. Ask me anything you wish to know.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	931	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_52559044	dorian	Anything, huh?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	933	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_74c54b8a	dorian	I want to know how is my family doing.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	945	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_18b657f3		Babala's expression softens, and the crystal orb flares with light.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	947	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_db28052b	babala	Your family… they have passed on to Tianlun, the Eternal Realm of Peace. Elara cradles your children in her arms, and their laughter echoes through fields of gold.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	949	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_b9a78185	babala	Daniel. Emily. Sarah. Lucas. They are at peace, Dorian. But they watch over you still, their love woven into your every step.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	950	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_91a3632e		My throat tightens, and I can barely speak.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	952	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_58244565	dorian	They're… happy?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	954	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_584654ea	babala	Happier than you can imagine. But they long for you to find your peace as well.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	955	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_8ffc72ba		Vasily places a hand on my shoulder, his usual teasing replaced with quiet support.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	957	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_48e9a46b	dorian	Elara…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	959	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_5470e452	babala	But the threads of fate are not yet finished. We must look to the future.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	961	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_88a5fe03	vasily	I think Dorian's had enough—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	962	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_7d7c613a	babala	Before your time is up, you will hold another daughter in your arms. She will bring you peace, Dragon. A second chance at family, a chance to heal what was broken.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	972	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_21c56957		Another daughter? How could I even think of raising another child after what happened to Elara and the kids?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	975	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_e3a26a0c	dorian	That'll be impossible since I'll never remarry but, thank you.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	977	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_81898e91		The booth grows colder as her voice rises.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	979	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_2e526c2f		My thoughts drift to the others—Paladin Feng, Paladin Cyrus, Empress Olympia, the soldiers who stood beside me during the Tragedy of Tianho.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	984	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_85fe2d5d	dorian	I want to know… how are my past companions?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	986	dorian "[what]"
ch2_fortune_f34d0666	babala	Your companions remain strong. Paladin Feng heals slowly but surely; his resolve is unbroken. Empress Olympia rebuilds what was lost, her strength inspiring those around her.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	988	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_070da5aa	babala	Paladin Cyrus has moved on… As for Count Vasily…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	989	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_aba7d7fd	vasily	You do realize I'm standing right here, don't you?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	991	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_e9f85f11		She glances at him, a smirk tugging at her lips.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	993	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_845bf820	babala	He frets over you more than he lets on.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	995	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_25231098	vasily	I do not fret.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	996	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_06e22a48	babala	But the threads of fate do not end here. We must look to the future.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	997	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_f59bb5c3	vasily	Well, that's enough fortune-telling for one day, don't you think? We sho—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	998	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_ca3393e8		A sudden crash of thunder interrupts him. The orb glows fiercely, and Babala's voice grows deeper, more resonant. Smoke surrounds her, and her eyes shine with an unnatural light.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1007	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_81898e91_1		The booth grows colder as her voice rises.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1009	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_4f3bc0e7	babala	I see you surrounded by five figures. Five men, each unique and powerful. They will walk beside you, bound by loyalty and something deeper. Together, you will face the storm that looms ahead.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1016	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_97e2f69d	babala	Beware, Dragon. A great calamity will strike Ena, and only you and your companions may stand against it. The Weaver's threads will guide you, but the path will not be easy.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1018	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_33bab23a		The light fades, and Babala slumps in her chair, panting.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1020	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_ed9b2cb8	babala	*pants* You're welcome.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1022	babala "[what]"
ch2_fortune_9bf8bcc0	vasily	Well… that's something, isn't it?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1024	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_b34cb26d		As Vasily and I leave the booth, he tries to lighten the mood with a joke.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1027	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_61199f12	vasily	Five men, huh? Looks like you're going to be popular.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1029	vasily "[what]"
ch2_fortune_8b2509b0		I shake my head, the weight of Babala's words pressing heavily on my chest.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1031	"[what]"
ch2_fortune_9b7879b5	dorian	Let's move on, Vasily.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1033	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_fd995ae8		The spa's grand facade rises before us, smoke wafting from its chimneys.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1053	"[what]"
ch2_spa_5c4665a4	dorian	Maybe the spa would be a good idea.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1055	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_6e4cadb4	vasily	A spa? Hmm I love it! Perfect!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1056	vasily "[what]"
ch2_spa_1dd1282e		We step into the spa, the warmth of the heated pools doing little to thaw the chill in my chest. The nobles recline in luxurious pools while aldorith attendants bustle about, their eyes downcast, their bodies worn thin from endless labor.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1058	"[what]"
ch2_spa_7b84971f		A young aldorith boy, looking no older than ten, struggles with a heavy bucket of steaming water, his hands trembling from the heat. He stumbles, spilling water onto his arm. His face contorts in pain, but he quickly bows his head, attempting to clean the mess with his sleeve.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1059	"[what]"
ch2_spa_38810dbe	girl_ald_spa	Brother! Let me help you!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1061	girl_ald_spa "[what]"
ch2_spa_b772ae7b		Nearby, a noblewoman watches with disdain.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1063	"[what]"
ch2_spa_e0e0c8e7	noblewoman	Disgusting, clumsy brat! Do you think I pay for this kind of incompetence?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1067	noblewoman "[what]"
ch2_spa_4c507fe8	boy_ald_spa	I-I'm sorry, mam! I didn't mean to—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1068	boy_ald_spa "[what]"
ch2_spa_5e37e91e		She lashes out with her fan, striking the boy across the face. The sound echoes through the room. He flinches but doesn't cry out.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1070	"[what]"
ch2_spa_57555670		I glance at the boy, my jaw tightening. A pang of something sharp hits my chest—Sarah. Lucas. Emily. Daniel.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1072	"[what]"
ch2_spa_21834405	vasily	Dorian…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1075	vasily "[what]"
ch2_spa_4af1aa83	vasily	I know what you're thinking. But don't. This place… It's not Gale. And it's not Tianho.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1076	vasily "[what]"
ch2_spa_82ee526a	dorian	Tianho. As if I could forget.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1078	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_f796e7b6	vasily	You think I don't remember, too? I lost people there. You weren't the only one who—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1079	vasily "[what]"
ch2_spa_f175dfb7	dorian	Don't. Besides, I don't care. These kids... they're not my problem.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1080	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_c9bdfb05		The noblewoman sees a young girl scrubbing the floor nearby. Her hands are raw, the skin peeling from the harsh soaps and constant work.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1082	"[what]"
ch2_spa_e4e697fa		She pauses for a moment to wipe sweat from her brow, and the same noblewoman snaps her fan toward her.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1083	"[what]"
ch2_spa_dc194c5a	noblewoman	Don't stop! If I can see my reflection in the marble, you're not scrubbing hard enough!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1085	noblewoman "[what]"
ch2_spa_d8037a39		The girl nods quickly, her small body trembling as she works faster.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1087	"[what]"
ch2_spa_9b6c486a		I glance back at the boy, who's still scrubbing the floor with raw, trembling hands. The noblewoman raises her fan to hit him again, but the girl tries to shield him from the noblewoman's wrath.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1089	"[what]"
ch2_spa_1c466e7b	girl_ald_spa	P-Please, mam. Forgive us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1091	girl_ald_spa "[what]"
ch2_spa_cef91833	noblewoman	Incompetent aldoriths! I'll have you both dragged out and hanged for disobeying a noble!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1092	noblewoman "[what]"
ch2_spa_ff207672		The girl freezes, her eyes wide with terror as tears spill down her cheeks. The boy drops to his knees, scrubbing furiously at the floor, his shoulders shaking.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1094	"[what]"
ch2_spa_75a61bdb	boy_ald_spa	Mam, I-I… *crying*	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1096	boy_ald_spa "[what]"
ch2_spa_99bb156d	girl_ald_spa	Please, ma'am. He didn't mean it. We'll do better, I promise— *sniffling*	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1097	girl_ald_spa "[what]"
ch2_spa_1322986f	noblewoman	Cry and beg all you want! You'll both be weeping when they tie the noose around your heads!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1098	noblewoman "[what]"
ch2_spa_e3737381		The boy's shoulders shake, silent sobs wracking his small frame. The girl clutches his arm, her tears falling onto the already-damp floor.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1100	"[what]"
ch2_spa_2fc5794f	dorian	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1102	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_3d8c299d		I turn away, forcing my gaze back to the warm pools and the pampered nobles. The boy's muffled sobs and the girl's quiet pleading fade into the background as I try to block it all out.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1115	"[what]"
ch2_spa_f1d86067	vasily	Come on. Let's get out of here.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1117	vasily "[what]"
ch2_spa_2fc5794f_1	dorian	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1118	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_bf4f0078	boy_ald_spa	Mam, please. We'll do anything… Please! *crying*	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1120	boy_ald_spa "[what]"
ch2_spa_f5a54d2a	noblewoman	Get your filthy hands off my feet! Come dawn, you'll hang like the worthless scum you are. And I'll laugh as your bodies sway in the wind.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1121	noblewoman "[what]"
ch2_spa_6ea18414	dorian	Scum…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1123	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_de628a35		I force myself to walk away.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1125	"[what]"
ch2_spa_ec53b3c2		I close my eyes briefly, channeling the energy deep within me. The ground beneath her feet shifts silently, imperceptibly.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1131	"[what]"
ch2_spa_f8ace654		She doesn't even notice.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1132	"[what]"
