ch2_spa_4df1d39f		As she steps back, the marble tiles give way. A small, perfect hole opens beneath her. She gasps, but no sound escapes as the ground swallows her whole. The hole seals as quickly as it appeared, leaving nothing behind.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1138	"[what]"
ch2_spa_2e914cc4		The children stare at the empty space, confused.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1145	"[what]"
ch2_spa_9c1a4c6c	vasily	Merciful Enoch…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1147	vasily "[what]"
ch2_spa_f156675b	vasily	Dorian… what did you just do? What happened to the noblewoman?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1148	vasily "[what]"
ch2_spa_270d8a00		I walk away.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1150	"[what]"
ch2_spa_57429937	dorian	Like I said, Vasily, I don't care.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1152	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_5915c51f		We step out of the spa, the cold air biting at my skin, a stark contrast to the warmth we just left behind.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1155	"[what]"
ch2_spa_c93f9bb0		My interest in the place has completely faded.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1156	"[what]"
ch2_spa_d89404b8	dorian	Maybe we should try someplace else.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1158	dorian "[what]"
ch2_spa_83e6a5a4		Vasily glances at me, his expression unreadable for a moment, before giving a small nod.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1160	"[what]"
ch2_spa_55b38b52	vasily	Fair enough. Let's see the other booths.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1162	vasily "[what]"
ch2_rest_bd9b8650		I glance at Vasily, raising an eyebrow as I gesture to a small, shaded pavilion tucked away in the corner of the square.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1179	"[what]"
ch2_rest_e1aca6a8		It's a simple structure—a cozy area reserved for the royal advisor to escape the noise and chaos. Cushioned seats and thick, fur-lined blankets are arranged beneath the canopy.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1180	"[what]"
ch2_rest_189182ae	dorian	You keep telling me I need to relax. Why don't you take your own advice for once?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1182	dorian "[what]"
ch2_rest_5424ba38	vasily	Relax? In the middle of the square? You must be joking.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1184	vasily "[what]"
ch2_rest_110701f2	dorian	You have your own private area over there. No one will bother us. You look like you haven't slept in days, Vasily.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1185	dorian "[what]"
ch2_rest_826230c5		He scoffs, rubbing his temples. After a moment of hesitation, he nods.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1187	"[what]"
ch2_rest_b41658da	vasily	Fine. But only for a little while. If King Gustav sees me slacking, he might have my head.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1189	vasily "[what]"
ch2_rest_c190dd3d		We make our way to the pavilion, and Vasily settles into one of the cushioned seats, stretching his legs out. I take a spot beside him, leaning back against a pillow.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1191	"[what]"
ch2_rest_e6a053e2		For a brief moment, it feels... peaceful. The noise of the square fades into a dull hum, distant and unimportant. The sun filters through the canopy above, its warmth battling the cold, snowy air.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1192	"[what]"
ch2_rest_ba92dc65	vasily	You know, I can't remember the last time I did this. Just... sat down without thinking about the next task, the next problem.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1194	vasily "[what]"
ch2_rest_f291c1d3		I close my eyes, letting the rare stillness seep into my bones.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1196	"[what]"
ch2_rest_3ce97cc3	dorian	You know the king. He never stops bitc—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1198	dorian "[what]"
ch2_rest_e0594bf6	vasily	And you never stop brooding.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1199	vasily "[what]"
ch2_rest_e5157caf		The silence stretches between us. I catch Vasily dozing off, his head tilting to one side. He mutters something incoherent before settling into a deeper sleep.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1201	"[what]"
ch2_rest_1eee5e7d	vasily	Zzzzz…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1203	vasily "[what]"
ch2_rest_ba5f1cb2		An hour goes by and I wake Vasily up. He stretches and glances at me, the faintest hint of a smile on his face.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1208	"[what]"
ch2_rest_12adfd96	vasily	Alright, Dorian. I'll admit it—you were right. I needed that.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1210	vasily "[what]"
ch2_rest_5e23b1e0	dorian	Told ya.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1211	dorian "[what]"
ch2_rest_25e1e0a5		He pauses.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1213	"[what]"
ch2_rest_5996eeb8	vasily	You, too, though. You looked... at peace, for once.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1215	vasily "[what]"
ch2_rest_6408fb62	dorian	I agree. Rest is a moment I don't take for granted.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1217	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_freetime_44fa43c8		It's time for the celebration.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1237	"[what]"
ch2_common_freetime_b75bc930		As Vasily and I approached the grand setup in the square, the energy was palpable. The monster's severed head was proudly displayed atop a gilded pedestal, its grotesque features preserved and amplified for all to see.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1238	"[what]"
ch2_common_freetime_da753be8		A crowd had already gathered, their murmurs of excitement growing louder with every passing moment. The sound of children laughing, merchants yelling, and performers playing instruments filled the air.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1239	"[what]"
ch2_common_freetime_4b379264	vasily	There it is. Your hard work on full display. The people will talk about this for years. They'll honor you in the grand Mjollian tradition. It's my favorite part of these ceremonies.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1241	vasily "[what]"
ch2_common_freetime_cfeed1b8	dorian	*yawns* I wanted to go back to sleep.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1242	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_freetime_8ec5850e	vasily	You'll get more sleep AFTER the ceremony.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1243	vasily "[what]"
ch2_common_freetime_7316ae51	dorian	Besides, didn't you help bringing down that thing? We also had three other soldiers with us. Helga, Lars… And, I forgot the name of the last one.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1244	dorian "[what]"
