ch2_common_freetime_da35a23e		The crowd roared in approval as a herald stepped forward to announce the event. My recognition was grand, as Vasily predicted. I could hear murmurs and shouts of my name from the crowd.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1247	"[what]"
