ch2_ceremony_03186085		The man with the violet hair was a standout. His shirt was thin and tattered, barely enough to protect him from the biting wind. The others— a younger girl with silver hair, a gaunt boy, and a frail woman—were dressed similarly, their clothes little more than rags.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1280	"[what]"
