ch2_frost_oni_8a8d5cd2		He didn't wait for a reply. Before I could ask what was wrong, he spun on his heel and bolted toward the castle, the guards following closely behind. I stood there, clutching the pouch.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1663	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_a857ae27		The remaining guards approached cautiously, inspecting the shattered remnants of the ice beings scattered across the bloodied square.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1666	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_6214a533	babala	This… This is no ordinary attack. The Weaver's threads are tightening around us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1668	babala "[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_ce5c1adc		She bent low to inspect one of the larger shards of ice, her fingers brushing the jagged surface. A faint glow pulsed under her touch.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1670	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_c16361ed	babala	Yes… the pieces of the Weaver's plan are in motion. You, Dragon of Gale, must steel yourself. For the storms that come will not spare anyone—not kings, not queens, not even you.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1672	babala "[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_a0e8000c	dorian	The Weaver? What does this have to do with the gods?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1674	dorian "[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_331ebc67	babala	You will find out in due time. For now, my work for you is already done.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1675	babala "[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_28c52aab		She straightened—well, as much as her hunched back would allow—and let out a dry, croaking laugh. Then, as she turned to shuffle away, her back cracked audibly.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1677	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_e094406c	babala	Ahhh!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1679	babala "[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_fb5dc4b8	dorian	A-Are you alright?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1680	dorian "[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_0544b4ec		She waved me off, scowling.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1682	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_dbd061de	babala	Tch! Damned Weaver and your threads! Snagged me good, you meddling hag!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1684	babala "[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_bb85c283		She spat on the ground, muttering curses under her breath.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1686	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_7dabd905		She shuffled back toward her tent, her curses growing louder with each step. The guards gave her a wide berth, whispering among themselves.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1687	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_06b318e2		I watched her go, a strange unease settling in my chest.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1688	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_da98fde3		I looked back at the shattered remains of the ice beings, their glow still faintly pulsing in the twilight.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1689	"[what]"
ch2_frost_oni_ca98e017	dorian	What are these monsters?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1691	dorian "[what]"
game_over_freeze_91dce90f		The cold consumed everything.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1711	"[what]"
game_over_freeze_05386bd1		And then — nothing.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1712	"[what]"
game_over_freeze_2d4f85a9		Reload your last save and take fewer hits from the Frost Oni.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1720	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_b87b15c8		The days passed in a haze. Five, maybe six—I've lost count.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1751	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_bd676054		The silence from the castle stretched on, unnerving in its emptiness. No Vasily, no summons, no word. Not even a whisper of gold. Only rumors and idle gossip.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1752	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_bd58e780		They said the ice creatures had come from inside the castle. From someone within. I didn't care. Let them chase their shadows and whisper their theories. It wasn't my concern. My only concern was survival—and, when I could afford it, distraction.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1755	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_3921bc0e		The biting chill nipped at my skin as I trudged back to my cave. Strangely, the snow was falling heavier than before these past few days.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1758	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_97d9bbde		The cold didn't bother me much—it never had. Maybe it was the fire channeling power coursing through me. But for some people, according to the vendors, it's become unbearable.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1759	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_67c52dc6		The pouch of gold Vasily had thrust into my hands days ago had been spent sparingly, stretched to buy food and small comforts.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1760	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_3b4d3ba5	dorian	Elara… Kids… I'm home.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1768	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_52a7008a	elara	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1770	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_0d4d3884	sarah	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1771	sarah "[what]"
ch2_common_end_ac3a270a	lucas	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1772	lucas "[what]"
ch2_common_end_0dfa97b9	daniel	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1773	daniel "[what]"
ch2_common_end_49c93174	emily	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1774	emily "[what]"
ch2_common_end_9881b712	dorian	Happy birthday, Sarah. I have a surprise for you.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1776	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_6881aeee		I set the bag of food down near the fire, letting the warmth seep into my bones.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1778	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_18a5b757		I pulled out a small, cheap toy from my coat—a makeshift knit doll with one eye missing, the stitches frayed and uneven.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1779	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_84d196d4		It wasn't much. I'd bought it from a street vendor for one gold, a pittance.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1780	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_0a1c368c	dorian	Tedda. That's her name. She's not much to look at, but I thought… I thought she'd make you smile.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1782	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_0d4d3884_1	sarah	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1784	sarah "[what]"
ch2_common_end_cadd1267	elara	I'm sure she would have loved it, Dorian…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1785	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_e1f41b07		My hands trembled as I placed it on a small wooden shelf near the fire, beside a collection of toys.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1787	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_d3b6d6f9		Emily's ribbon that I bought for her, Lucas's slingshot, Daniel's carved wooden horse. Elara's scarf that I bought for her for our anniversary.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1788	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_5420ed90	dorian	Happy birthday, sweetheart. I miss you.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1790	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_0d4d3884_2	sarah	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1792	sarah "[what]"
ch2_common_end_ac3a270a_1	lucas	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1793	lucas "[what]"
ch2_common_end_0dfa97b9_1	daniel	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1794	daniel "[what]"
ch2_common_end_49c93174_1	emily	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1795	emily "[what]"
ch2_common_end_fa97f21b		I stayed there, staring into the fire, as the night stretched on.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1797	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_bdefb8ee	elara	My heart, did you check the mail?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1799	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_84b7e376		I blinked, looking up.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1801	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_d3572b4d	elara	You always forget the mail. Can you check?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1803	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_910516f8	dorian	The mail, my heart?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1804	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_247d78eb		She nodded, her smile unwavering.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1806	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_2c2a3bd7		I walked to the ledge. There, tucked beneath a loose rock, was an envelope I hadn't noticed before.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1807	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_0d099600		It was an elegant thing, crisp and ivory-colored, sealed with an intricate red-and-gold emblem. There was a mark with a picture of a girl and the words: Cheng Industries.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1810	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_67eab095		The Tianho seal gleamed faintly in the dim light, the dragon motif coiled with clouds and lotus blossoms.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1811	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_b2a131b8		I turned the envelope over, running my fingers across the embossed edges before opening it carefully.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1818	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_68d6ddc0		Inside was a letter, written in neat, flowing characters.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1819	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_19de98e1		Dearest Paladin Dorian,	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1822	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_b9024993		I hope this letter finds you well, though I fear it may be too long since we last spoke. I often think of the day you saved me from the tragedy that befell Tianho. Without your bravery, I would not be alive to write these words today. For that, I am eternally grateful. For the Prosperity Dragon, and to you.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1823	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_7e921eae		Word has reached me that you were seen in Mjoll, alive and—dare I hope—well. Knowing this fills my heart with relief. You've been on my mind these past years, and I've often wondered how you've managed, given the burdens you carry.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1824	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_757f2c80		Please, do not hesitate to reach out if ever you are in need of anything. Cheng Industries owes you a debt that cannot be repaid with gold alone. Your kindness and courage have left an indelible mark on my life.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1825	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_2e69b252		If you are interested, I would like to invite you to have tea with me. The city may have changed, but my doors will always remain open to you. Perhaps I can repay a fraction of what you have given me, even if it's only with the comfort of good tea and company.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1826	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_1f5231de		Prosperity Dragon willing, we will see again.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1827	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_ae3aeadd		With deepest gratitude and fondness, Cheng Yuxuan.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1828	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_fa5ddc50	dorian	Yuxuan… Cheng Yuxuan… I don't recall anyone with that name.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1830	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_f3ac238a		The name didn't immediately strike a chord, but I felt like I heard it from somewhere before.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1833	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_afdfbbcc	elara	You saved him from the fire, remember?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1835	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_e0743060	daniel	Yeah! Remember when you lifted that beam like it was nothing? It was so cool!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1836	daniel "[what]"
ch2_common_end_d3ece950		I closed my eyes, the image of Tianho's flames flashing behind my eyelids. The man I saved from the burning building.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1838	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_91bce850		I sighed, folding the letter carefully and setting it aside.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1839	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_23476193	elara	You should write back to him.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1841	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_3d47b92a	dorian	I don't have time for this, my heart. You know that.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1842	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_9b64f7d4	emily	Don't lie, Dad. We know you're not doing anything important. You're just sitting here, talking to us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1843	emily "[what]"
ch2_common_end_43f7d51d	dorian	But—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1844	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_5688e147	elara	Oh, don't be stubborn. Writing back won't kill you. Besides, it might be good to talk to someone new for a change. You can't spend all your time with Vasily—or just us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1845	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_8b00e058	sarah	Yeah, dad! Think of it as my birthday gift!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1846	sarah "[what]"
ch2_common_end_741c1088	daniel	My late birthday gift too, dad!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1847	daniel "[what]"
ch2_common_end_f57d13a3	emily	Mine too!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1848	emily "[what]"
ch2_common_end_a95ddb9d	lucas	Don't forget mine, dad!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1849	lucas "[what]"
ch2_common_end_3a586dbc		I sighed again.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1851	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_ffc5b8f8	dorian	Fine…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1853	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_0f030845		I reached for the old pen Vasily had given me weeks ago and pulled out a sheet of parchment. Sitting down at the rickety wooden table, the glow of the fire flickering on the cave walls, I dipped the pen in ink. What should I write, though?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1856	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_ea64f8bd		I sat for a moment, letting my memories of that night in Tianho run my hand. The ink bottle was nearly empty, but I managed to write carefully:	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1869	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_c52c8da2		Cheng Yuxuan,	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1871	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_f278f37d		It's great to know that the life I saved has grown into such a kind and successful soul. I would be honored to have tea with you and see how you've rebuilt your life. Perhaps we can trade stories—I have a few to tell myself. Thank you for your thoughtful letter. It means more to me than you know.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1872	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_f725e6b1		Dorian Burnham	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1873	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_405ccc9e		Lastly, I placed the address written on Yuxuan's letter. When I finished, I let the ink dry.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1875	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_e558ddac	dorian	There. Happy?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1877	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_bbaa5c3e	elara	Once you send it to the postman, I'll be very happy.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1878	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_2132e72e		The fire crackled as I sat at the table, the pen feeling heavy in my hand. I stared at the parchment for a long moment before scrawling a short reply in quick, precise strokes.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1883	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_c52c8da2_1		Cheng Yuxuan,	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1885	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_3e6bce61		I am glad to hear you are doing well. I don't have time for travel at the moment. Best of luck to you in Tianho.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1886	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_e558ddac_1	dorian	There. Happy?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1888	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_b2d3cd02	sarah	Dad, that's such a cold letter.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1889	sarah "[what]"
ch2_common_end_0e3cce85	lucas	Even colder than this weather!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1890	lucas "[what]"
ch2_common_end_069f3987	elara	How are you supposed to make new friends if you write like that?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1891	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_25905ec3		I groaned, grabbing the letter again. With a grumble, I scratched out 'don't' in the second sentence, leaving a messy strikethrough.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1893	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_ce692140	dorian	There. I fixed it. Happy?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1895	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_3fe64199	elara	You're impossible, you know that?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1896	elara "[what]"
ch2_common_end_0c104c07		I folded the letter and tucked it into my pocket. I'd deliver it when I made my next trip into the city.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1902	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_c020f93f		As I turned back to the warmth of the fire, I heard it—a voice calling for me from outside the cave. It was sharp, urgent.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1903	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_cdce292d	messenger	Paladin Dorian! Are you there? Paladin?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1907	messenger "[what]"
ch2_common_end_cd66b82b		I stood, brushing my hands against my tunic before stepping outside. A young messenger, dressed in the livery of Mjoll, stood at the edge of the rocky path leading to my home. His face was pale, his breathing uneven from the climb.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1909	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_2026df2f	messenger	You've been summoned to the castle immediately. The situation is… urgent.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1911	messenger "[what]"
ch2_common_end_99039fb0		I narrowed my eyes, my heart sinking at the grim tone of his voice.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1913	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_b2010f9b	dorian	What happened?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1915	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_237b221e	messenger	I'm not permitted to say. But the royal advisor insists you come at once.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1916	messenger "[what]"
ch2_common_end_7a6313ba		Vasily.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1918	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_84bd7a9b		I stepped forward.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1919	"[what]"
ch2_common_end_1a282d17	dorian	Let's go.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1921	dorian "[what]"
ch2_common_end_deae1f11		The messenger nodded, and we began the trek back to Mjoll.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1923	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_5154db8b		The howl of the snowstorm seemed alive, its icy fingers clawing at us even as we slammed the heavy doors shut behind us.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1941	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_2bd1de1c	messenger	C-C-Cold… Cold…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1943	messenger "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_124761d1	dorian	Are you alright? Are you still cold?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1944	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_038123ce	messenger	A l-little..	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1945	messenger "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_59549087		Inside, the warmth of the Mjoll Castle did little to shake the lingering chill. My boots echoed on the stone floor as I took in the sight before me.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1947	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_f3652ffa		A group of aldoriths stood huddled in the grand hall, their faces pale and determined. They were gearing up for battle, strapping on mismatched armor and whispering to one another in low, urgent tones.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1948	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_00e57ede		Some glanced at me briefly, but their eyes quickly darted away. They had no love for me, nor I for them.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1949	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_c14a0bd7		Girl aldorith: Have you heard of the death toll? Enoch above…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1952	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_852b4670		Boy aldorith: I know… But we don't have a choice.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1953	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_87a384fb	messenger	Paladin… Count Vasily is over there. If you'll excuse me, I'll—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1955	messenger "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_dc33245f	dorian	Wait—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1956	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_e79339ae		I pulled the folded letter from my pocket and handed him a few coins.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1958	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_59fcb70e	dorian	Please take this to Cheng Yuxuan.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1960	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_40660076		The young man nodded, his face still flushed from the cold. Without another word, he bolted back out into the storm.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1962	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_76bd0fd4		My eyes moved across the room until they landed on Vasily. He stood to the side, leaning heavily on a table, surrounded by three hooded figures draped in deep gray robes—the unmistakable attire of the prophets of the death god.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1964	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_0a4de2e6		Vasily looked terrible. His face was gaunt, and a dark bruise marred his left eye, swelling the skin around it.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1965	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_bb8709f1		The prophets were whispering among themselves, their voices carrying just enough for me to listen to them.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1966	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_e444ede7		Prophet 1: The cold is unbearable… the prince must have made a pact with the death god to gain this much power.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1972	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_417a668c		Prophet 2: I disagree. It's unnatural. Not even the Enoch's touch could twist the elements this way.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1973	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_329908e0	niko	You lack faith, brothers. It is obvious that Enoch's hand is all over this—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1975	niko "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_6cc405db	vasily	Enough. Give me a moment.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1977	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_0e2db427		Vasily straightened when he noticed me approaching, though the movement seemed to pain him. He waved the prophets away with a curt gesture.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1979	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_9f8f3f96	dorian	What in Tetrad's name happened to you?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1981	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_2d71e3ec	vasily	You've seen what's happening outside. It's getting colder by the minute.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1982	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_155a45a9	dorian	I meant your face, Vasily.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1983	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_ad260ce0		He rubbed a hand over his face, wincing as his fingers brushed the bruise.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1985	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_4e2a186c	vasily	It's from the king. It's unimportant.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1988	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_0c7ac6cf		The fire in the hearth sputtered as the storm outside roared with a deafening fury. He leaned on the table, his knuckles white from the strain.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1990	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_03b1d4cb	vasily	The storm won't let up, Dorian. It's relentless. Crops have failed, the rivers are freezing over, and entire villages are being swallowed by snow.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1992	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_621440a8		His voice cracked slightly.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1994	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_1076a357	vasily	The kingdom is falling apart. Trade routes are blocked. Supplies can't get through. We've already lost half of our militia to hypothermia trying to secure the roads.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1996	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_7b6a4362		I clenched my fists, the weight of his words settling like a stone in my chest.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	1998	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_1e4d0c7d	dorian	And no one knows what's causing it?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2000	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_82eb426e	vasily	There's a theory.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2002	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_f1105f4a		He turned toward the hooded prophets of the death god. One's face was familiar… yet I could not recall.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2004	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_7ded215d		Prophet: This storm is no mere act of nature. It reeks of the energies of the death god. We have felt this power before... during the Tragedy of Tianho.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2006	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_dd0eb66b		The mention of Tianho sent a chill down my spine. Elara. The kids.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2008	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_ebcb373c	niko	The death god's power lingers, though it is not as strong as it once was. Its source is concentrated in a desolate place west of here. An abandoned mine known as Frostcradle.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2010	niko "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_ea69194b	dorian	The Tragedy of Tianho? You're saying this storm is connected to that?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2012	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_2ccc2d7b		The man nodded; his eyes gleaming.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2014	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_df0200b2	niko	The energies are unmistakable. Whatever caused the tragedy there has resurfaced. Weaker, yes, but still potent enough to wreak havoc.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2016	niko "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_7e90a9fa	vasily	We sent aldoriths to investigate. None of them came back alive.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2018	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_8a92e5ab		He gestured toward the crowd of aldoriths huddled in the hall. One figure stood apart, his violet hair unmistakable. I think I've seen him before.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2020	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_8ee456fb	svante	I... I saw what happened to them. My brothers, my sisters... they went west, into that cursed place. When they didn't return, I volunteered to go after them.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2022	svante "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_55308e24		He paused, his voice trembling as he continued.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2024	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_961e6e4e	svante	They were impaled with ice. That's not all… their bodies were frozen solid. Twisted. The cold... it didn't just kill them. It consumed them.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2027	svante "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_a480970d		He swallowed hard, his violet eyes glistening.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2029	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_97b18ada	svante	T-They… They were my family…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2031	svante "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_c14570d4		The room was heavy with silence. Even the prophets seemed subdued. Vasily's voice cut through the tension.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2033	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_dec7e458	vasily	That's why we're asking you, Dorian. You're not just a warrior—you're the Dragon of Gale. If anyone can survive this... it's you.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2036	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_2440d115		I stared at him, my jaw tightening.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2038	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_8c39ba16	dorian	What's the mission?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2040	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_c061dbba		Vasily's gaze darkened, and for a moment, he hesitated.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2042	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_e13bc674	vasily	You're to go west, to the Frostcradle. To the source of the storm. And once you're there…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2044	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_262332ea	vasily	You are to kill the Prince Elias Drakos.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2045	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_d3d3d5b9	dorian	Fine. But I want to be paid upfront.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2047	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_01c8020a		Vasily didn't hesitate. He smiled and snapped his fingers with crisp authority. Svante reached to his belt, unclipping a leather pouch heavy with coin. It clinked as he approached, the weight unmistakable.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2049	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_5fa9fb6c	vasily	We don't usually pay upfront, but given the urgency—and our past dealings—I'll make an exception.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2051	vasily "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_76c45d56	svante	T-T-Three thousand gold pieces. For killing Prince Elias Drakos, sir.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2053	svante "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_6bf7aa2a		I took the pouch, feeling the satisfying heft of it before slipping it into my pocket. The room remained quiet, save for the occasional hiss of the fire.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2055	"[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_86229235	dorian	I have questions.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2057	dorian "[what]"
ch2_castle_briefing_db108de7	vasily	Ask. But make it quick. Time isn't on our side.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2058	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_d3cda80c		I glanced around the hall, my eyes drawn to the twin thrones at the head of the room. Both were empty, their gilded frames casting long shadows in the dim light.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2078	"[what]"
ch2_questions_e28947b0	dorian	Where's King Gustav?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2080	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_87e5fc13		Vasily's face darkened at the question, his lips pressing into a thin line.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2082	"[what]"
ch2_questions_132e96e4	vasily	The king is… indisposed. He's in his chambers, mourning.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2084	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_23965046		His voice was tight, as though every word cost him. I noticed the way his hand trembled slightly as he spoke.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2086	"[what]"
ch2_questions_fb12aa93	dorian	And the queen? What of Queen Ekaterina?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2088	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_f93d5984	vasily	?!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2090	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_30be8192		At that, Vasily froze. His shoulders stiffened, and a flicker of pain crossed his eyes. For a moment, he didn't answer, but Svante, standing nearby, stepped forward, his face grim.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2092	"[what]"
ch2_questions_49fd7c7d	svante	She's dead, sir.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2094	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_8712c8b0		The words hung heavy in the air, like a stone dropped into a silent pond.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2096	"[what]"
ch2_questions_b01395b1	dorian	What?!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2098	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_70789f11	svante	We found her in her chambers... with a knife in her heart. Father saw everything.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2100	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_f876773c		I stared at him, my mind struggling to process the words. Queen Ekaterina, dead? It didn't feel real. The room felt colder. I clenched my fists.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2103	"[what]"
ch2_questions_bdf4b88c	niko	Elias killed her. Stabbed her in the heart like the heartless bastard he is.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2105	niko "[what]"
ch2_questions_5e0ba16d		I blinked, trying to process what I'd just heard. King Gustav and Queen Ekaterina. They'd always been there—fixtures of my early missions, handing me my rewards with smiles I'd never trusted but had grown used to.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2107	"[what]"
ch2_questions_1cd69d5b		I didn't care about them, not really, but the idea of her being gone was unsettling in a way I couldn't quite shake.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2108	"[what]"
ch2_questions_7ba7434b	dorian	I don't… I don't understand. The queen is dead? When did this happen?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2110	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_f86b3e71	vasily	During the ceremony. When those… beings appeared.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2112	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_55d3bae8		Beings of ice. The ones that disrupted the ceremony. I remember.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2114	"[what]"
ch2_questions_71f9676c	vasily	We couldn't even do the funeral because of the trade routes.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2116	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_4fd80c3b	dorian	Trade routes?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2117	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_c22c96f9	vasily	Her final wish was to be buried in Hinami. A water burial. But the frozen routes make it impossible to transport her body there.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2118	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_898f89ad	dorian	A Hinami burial? I didn't know Queen Ekaterina had Hinami blood.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2120	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_c6c7be01	vasily	She did. Only a trace, but enough that she wanted to honor their traditions in death.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2121	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_6582453b		Queen Ekaterina has Hinami blood… Who knew?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2123	"[what]"
ch2_questions_1ef880b5	dorian	Well. I suppose even queens aren't untouchable.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2126	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_a7bed0a4		Vasily shot me a sharp look, but he didn't argue. Instead, he turned away, his shoulders slumping.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2128	"[what]"
ch2_questions_4e879b88	niko	Do you have any other questions?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2130	niko "[what]"
ch2_questions_d0af9a2a		Elias. The name wasn't familiar.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2137	"[what]"
ch2_questions_3363664e	dorian	Who's this Elias? This is the first I've heard of him.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2139	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_cf001857		Vasily's shoulders tensed, and he let out a heavy sigh.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2141	"[what]"
ch2_questions_53a97542	vasily	The crown prince of Mjoll. Or rather, the former crown prince of Mjoll.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2143	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_41f29de5		I frowned, confused. In all my four years of working as a mercenary here, I'd never heard of any crown prince.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2145	"[what]"
ch2_questions_7aa5680f	dorian	A crown prince? Since when? All I know are the aldoriths who have claim to the throne.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2147	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_d6470681		Svante, standing nearby, looked down.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2149	"[what]"
ch2_questions_1061eba4	svante	He was the son of Her Majesty, Queen Ekaterina. The true heir to the throne... but not in the eyes of the king. According to Father—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2151	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_d763b87a		He paused, the words catching in his throat, and his hands clenched into fists at his sides.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2153	"[what]"
ch2_questions_4339323e	svante	Elias... Elias is a monster. He's the reason my brothers and sisters… *holding back tears*	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2155	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_c31075a3	vasily	After the Queen was killed... Elias disappeared. We searched, but there was no trace of him. His flight from the kingdom is as clear an indication of guilt as any.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2157	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_1dede77f	vasily	He fled like a coward, leaving his mother's corpse behind.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2158	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_18122389		The pain in his voice, raw and jagged, was almost unbearable. I had never seen Vasily this shaken before.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2160	"[what]"
ch2_questions_3b7f8dd0	vasily	The queen's body was found in her solar… crumpled beside her writing desk. A dagger straight through her heart. No signs of struggle. No mercy.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2162	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_e9bb74e5	vasily	Her own son left her there like refuse.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2163	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_c270c01a	vasily	The day after that and the cold became unbearable. The blizzard began.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2164	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_6edd865e	svante	The king... Father… he was broken by the queen's death. After that, Elias vanished into the frost, like a shadow… He's the reason the kingdom is falling apart.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2167	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_5b91dc78	svante	Father… He probably believed in Elias. And he left him with a corpse and a curse. If I could—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2168	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_bd759b5c	svante	If I only have the power to brave through this blizzard, I will kill him with my own bare hands!	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2169	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_ba56994d		Prophet: If I may. Me and my prophet brothers can sense the death god's magic in this storm. It's unmistakable.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2171	"[what]"
ch2_questions_34e84026	niko	All signs point to Elias. The storm, the cursed frost, the powers he's wielding… they all lead back to him. For all we know, he might have sold his soul to Enoch.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2173	niko "[what]"
ch2_questions_1f18f6a4		I couldn't help but feel the chill of dread that crept up my spine. Everything was pointing to the same conclusion—Elias was behind it all.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2175	"[what]"
ch2_questions_e0b1a728	vasily	You're the only one who can save us, Dorian.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2177	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_6d504320	dorian	I might need supplies if I'm to set out for Frostcradle.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2184	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_1955d43c	vasily	I'm afraid supplies are running thin, Dorian. The frost has locked us down tighter than we thought. The roads to Mjoll… they're almost impassable now.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2186	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_ed1f3827		He sighed heavily, rubbing his temples.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2188	"[what]"
ch2_questions_e6d22a20	vasily	The blizzards are worsening, and the snow is deepening. It's like the very land itself is trying to bury us. We've sent several expeditions out, but none have returned.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2190	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_874695f0	svante	According to the scouts, even the peasants are feeling the cold, sir. It's getting harder to make trades, and even harder to get shipments in.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2192	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_0fb29c79	vasily	I don't know how much longer we can last with what we have. We've sent requests to the outer regions, but even the merchants are afraid to travel these roads now.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2194	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_2fc5794f	dorian	…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2196	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_6dbb0851		I frowned. The weight of their situation was clear.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2198	"[what]"
ch2_questions_dc50a67a	vasily	The only ones left with any supplies… are the Cheng Industries bots. They've been sending us what they can.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2200	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_19c507e9		I blinked. I think I've heard that name before. Cheng Industries. Yuxuan's company.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2202	"[what]"
ch2_questions_fb4f6a0e		As if on cue, a mechanical hum echoed through the hall, and a sleek bot rolled in through the door. It was a little taller than a man, metallic and polished, with a rectangular chest and mechanical arms designed to lift heavy objects.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2205	"[what]"
ch2_questions_47b6b050	niko	Right on cue…	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2207	niko "[what]"
ch2_questions_1a00f802		The bot's sensors glowed softly as it paused.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2210	"[what]"
ch2_questions_16d4d8d5		-Here at Cheng's, we bring change… -	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2212	"[what]"
ch2_questions_0c31bf3f		An oddly soothing jingle filled the room, the cheerful tone feeling almost out of place.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2214	"[what]"
ch2_questions_8340e18f		Supply Bot: Greetings. Supplies delivered—courtesy of Cheng Industries.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2216	"[what]"
ch2_questions_c8c5fe87		The bot spun around, unloading several crates of food and supplies with surprising agility. Canned goods, dried meats, and fresh produce packed neatly in the crates, along with a few additional barrels of water.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2218	"[what]"
ch2_questions_51739ee3	svante	Wow. That's… amazing! Do you think they have a robot that talks? I've never seen—	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2220	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_87023daf	vasily	Svante… Did I give you permission to talk about anything other than the incident?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2222	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_601652da	svante	N-No, sir. Sorry, Count.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2223	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_259e32cf	vasily	Then shut your mouth. One more slip, and I'll have you and whichever aldorith mutt you're closest to flogged for insubordination.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2224	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_b0a19145	svante	Yes, sir. I apologize.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2225	svante "[what]"
ch2_questions_91ef59d4	niko	Asshole.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2227	niko "[what]"
ch2_questions_dd68188e	vasily	What did you just say, Prophet?	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2229	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_94c3f5df		Prophet 1: P-Perhaps we can move on, sire.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2230	"[what]"
ch2_questions_d6298271	vasily	*sighs* As I said, Cheng Industries' bots have been delivering supplies. Only a few shipments, and only what they can carry. It's helping, but it's not enough to sustain us. We can't rely on them forever.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2232	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_b546f774		He fixed me with a hard stare.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2234	"[what]"
ch2_questions_f5bb27dd	vasily	You need to find Elias. And end him. Mjoll depends on it.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2236	vasily "[what]"
ch2_questions_92276ce7		I straightened, meeting his gaze with a nod.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2238	"[what]"
ch2_questions_ce090482	dorian	Got it.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2240	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_de65d07e		I exhaled sharply, watching my breath curl into the frigid air like smoke.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2247	"[what]"
ch2_questions_30e1933e	dorian	That's enough questions.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2249	dorian "[what]"
ch2_questions_f4203c47		Vasily gave a solemn nod. He gestured toward Niko.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2251	"[what]"
ch2_end_2c8f8b43	niko	Frostcradle lies to the west, buried in the heart of the mountains.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2259	niko "[what]"
ch2_end_2ff42f5d		The other prophet raised a pale hand, pointing to a crudely drawn map on the table beside him. The inked lines were jagged, as if the cartographer's hand had trembled while drawing.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2261	"[what]"
ch2_end_4c94a2a4		Prophet: Follow the ridge through the Iceclaw Pass. Then just go straight until you reach the Frostcradle.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2263	"[what]"
ch2_end_c73f5562		I nodded, already tightening the straps of my pack. I adjusted the thick layers of fur and leather I had donned before leaving the castle.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2265	"[what]"
ch2_end_bf35d2b8	vasily	Take care, Dorian. I wouldn't want you to end up like those aldorith mutts.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2267	vasily "[what]"
ch2_end_691a5b38	dorian	I'll find it.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2269	dorian "[what]"
ch2_end_be0840b5		Without another word, I turned on my heel, the weight of my mission pressing heavily on my shoulders.	game/04_chapter_02.rpy	2271	"[what]"
chapter_3_9fb6d34c		The wind howled like a living thing as I trudged westward. Each step was a battle against the biting cold that seeped through every layer of clothing I wore.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	268	"[what]"
chapter_3_9847be5b		My boots crunched against the frost-bitten ground, the sound muffled by the relentless storm.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	269	"[what]"
chapter_3_5289cce1		If it wasn't for my fire channeling gift, I would have frozen by now.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	270	"[what]"
chapter_3_f72f9083		The snow grew deeper as I climbed higher, the jagged peaks of the Iceclaw Pass looming in the distance.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	271	"[what]"
chapter_3_0b2ec8da	elara	We're almost there, my heart. Let's keep moving.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	274	elara "[what]"
chapter_3_202b15a0	lucas	Let's go, dad! We're almost at the Frost… Frostcray—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	275	lucas "[what]"
chapter_3_708c0173	emily	It's Frostcradle, Lucas.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	276	emily "[what]"
chapter_3_1a566443		I adjusted my pack and pressed on.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	278	"[what]"
chapter_3_07c01651		It felt like hours. The further I went, the quieter the world became.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	279	"[what]"
chapter_3_699ab575		Then, I saw it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	280	"[what]"
chapter_3_00ecb923	sarah	Look, daddy! The Frostcradle!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	289	sarah "[what]"
chapter_3_05074205	lucas	It… doesn't look like a cradle.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	290	lucas "[what]"
chapter_3_4649e42c	emily	Maybe it's just a metaphor, Lucas.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	291	emily "[what]"
chapter_3_0427894c	elara	Dorian… are you ready?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	292	elara "[what]"
chapter_3_69fab04c		I nodded, taking a deep breath.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	294	"[what]"
ch3_mine_eed0fb6e		I entered the mine, and it was as silent as a graveyard.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	310	"[what]"
ch3_mine_45b89c4f		The first body I found wasn't whole.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	311	"[what]"
ch3_mine_a3ea39a9		An aldorith. His hair was frozen to the icy floor, his body contorted unnaturally. Jagged shards of ice jutted through his chest and limbs like stakes.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	312	"[what]"
ch3_mine_65b6da51		His eyes were wide open, clouded over with frost, his face twisted into a silent scream.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	313	"[what]"
ch3_mine_08662dab	elara	It's cruel, my heart… Who would do such a thing…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	315	elara "[what]"
ch3_mine_7e482ca1		Further inside, it became worse.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	317	"[what]"
ch3_mine_4ea898ba		A soldier, frozen mid-run, his arm outstretched toward something — or someone. His other arm was embedded in a wall of ice.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	318	"[what]"
ch3_mine_cac9e062		I could see his teeth through his partially frozen, shattered cheek, his mouth frozen wide as though he had been begging for mercy.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	319	"[what]"
ch3_mine_fc42637c	daniel	Dad… Be brave. Like you taught me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	321	daniel "[what]"
ch3_mine_c5260fe7	dorian	I will, Daniel. Thank you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	322	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mine_321e8356	sarah	Go, dad! Go!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	323	sarah "[what]"
ch3_mine_55ee98fe		I swallowed hard, shaking my head. I balled up my fists, the leather gloves worn and familiar.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	325	"[what]"
ch3_mine_0c0902b0		I pushed forward, every step crunching against frost and ice. I found more bodies. Mercenaries this time. One hung suspended from the ceiling, impaled by an icicle that had burst through his abdomen.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	326	"[what]"
ch3_mine_cdf3446a	emily	Dad… Last chance. Do you really want to go this far?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	328	emily "[what]"
ch3_mine_9a6466ec	dorian	We're here now, Emily. No turning back.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	329	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mine_d35a3af5		The words echoed in the cavern, bouncing off the icy walls. For a moment, even the voices of my family fell silent.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	331	"[what]"
ch3_mine_947389be		And then I heard her. And saw her.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	332	"[what]"
ch3_mine_323087c4	yuki_onna	Leave… now…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	340	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_mine_649e4e38		I turned toward the voice. She wasn't human.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	342	"[what]"
ch3_mine_6e3a6e3b		Translucent skin, pale as fresh snow, glowed faintly in the darkness. Frost trailed from her bare feet, spreading like veins over the ground.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	343	"[what]"
ch3_mine_2e671633	yuki_onna	Like ice, life is very fragile… I told you… Leave…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	345	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_mine_00303f2a		The cold thickened, pressing against my lungs, numbing my fingers even as I summoned my fire to fight it off. The flames sputtered faintly.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	347	"[what]"
ch3_mine_cc91c0d7	yuki_onna	Again… Leave… now…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	349	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_mine_f0444833	dorian	Who are you?!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	350	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mine_a248fba7		She didn't answer. Instead, she stepped closer, her form gliding across the icy terrain as though she were weightless.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	352	"[what]"
ch3_mine_47ad9153		Then I felt it. The death god's energy radiating from her, sharp and suffocating, like a thousand needles pressing into my skin.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	353	"[what]"
ch3_mine_83015b4d	elara	Dorian, be careful.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	355	elara "[what]"
ch3_mine_ea1e3334	dorian	I will.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	356	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mine_0f1e98f8		And the flames around me surged brighter.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	358	"[what]"
ch3_mine_69f9bf56	yuki_onna	One last chance… Leave now… or die…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	360	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_7e7abb6f	yuki_onna	Leave us!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	381	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_469e34ba	elara	My heart, use your fire!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	383	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_0ff72fb9		She moved again, her form darting across the battlefield like a specter, each step leaving trails of ice and frost.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	385	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_1bd5296d		The spirit raised her hand, summoning a massive wall of ice to block my path.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	386	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_d8cc652a		I focus my fire, melting a narrow passage through the edge of the wall. The flames hold, and I step through before the frost can overwhelm me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	402	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_b091de00	elara	Good, my heart. Be quick, but don't waste your strength.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	404	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_6e3d2f50	yuki_onna	I told you to leave!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	405	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_ff74072d		I swing my fist, but the wall's frost shoots up my sword and numbs my arm. The ice cracks, but the spirit's frost engulfs my legs.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	418	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_25479dbe	dorian	Ahh!!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	420	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_1331de98	yuki_onna	You should have left… Now you will die!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	421	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_698716e2	emily	Dad! Quickly! Thaw the ice out!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	422	emily "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_78023858	yuki_onna	What's the matter? Are you cold?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	427	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_0fde9a61	elara	She's bound to this place. Her strength fades when she's far from her ice. Force her to move.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	429	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_9ce4ec8d	daniel	Go to the rocks, dad!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	430	daniel "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_86df633a		The spirit glided toward me, the frost beneath her feet thickening with every step.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	432	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_d7935b72	yuki_onna	Die!!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	434	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_3fb54004		I retreat, leading her toward the jagged rocks at the edge of the clearing. Her frost spread slower over the uneven ground, and the ice beneath her faltered, cracks forming in the once-seamless sheet.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	446	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_a7f2e7fc	yuki_onna	You… You…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	448	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_45183c47		She breathes on the rocky terrain, ice forming on the surface. Her breath clouds the air as she struggles to push forward.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	450	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_47e6e01f	dorian	What the…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	452	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_734d7cb7	lucas	She's freezing the area, dad. Be on your guard!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	453	lucas "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_36c788f7		I plant my feet and summon flames, pushing them outward in a desperate attempt to hold her frost at bay. But her power surges, the frost intensifying faster than I could burn it back.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	462	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_3c0534db		The ground turns to slick ice, and I slip, leaving myself open. Her claws slash through my armor, raking across my side.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	463	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_25479dbe_1	dorian	Ahh!!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	465	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_d3c47a8d	yuki_onna	This will be your end…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	466	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_2b29b07d		The yuki-onna's icy presence grows stronger. With a flick of her wrist, dozens of jagged ice spears materialize around her, glimmering like frozen starlight.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	471	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_8b04d436	yuki_onna	You'll die alongside those who are foolish enough to come here!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	473	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_4dd63821	elara	Dorian, don't panic! Try to dodge and look for the gaps. Use your fire wisely!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	478	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_adf2d917		The ice spears shatter against the flames, but the fragments rain down like shards of glass, slicing into my armor. The frost burns as it touches my skin.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	493	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_3bc8ca31	yuki_onna	Give in to the cold…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	495	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_a5375d9d	dorian	Never!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	496	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_7bf2b803		I roll to the side, summoning a controlled burst of fire to melt the nearest shards. The heat pushes back the frost, giving me just enough space to avoid the worst of her attack.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	508	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_0392fd13	elara	Good, but stay alert! She won't stop with just one attack.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	510	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_83b5d816	emily	Dad, take care, please!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	511	emily "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_796432a3		She raised her hands, frost swirling around her as she summoned a massive spike of ice, its jagged surface glowing with an unnatural light.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	516	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_8eac160a	yuki_onna	You… will… die!!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	518	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_e6124f22	elara	She's channeling her energy. Don't hesitate—stop her now!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	520	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_2c4f3360	sarah	Use your fire, dad!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	521	sarah "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_a6478de9	lucas	Do it, dad!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	522	lucas "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_4da3b400	yuki_onna	Farewell…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	524	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_64716d0c		I dive to the side, but the spear grazes my shoulder. Frost spreads instantly, freezing my flesh in a searing burst of pain.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	540	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_a3eef1fd	dorian	Argh—!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	542	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_0cff5a63		The frost continues to crawl up my arm, encasing me in ice. I struggle to move, but the cold is overwhelming.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	544	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_4df99c43	yuki_onna	Like ice, life is very fragile. You should have known before coming here.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	550	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_13b25431	yuki_onna	I told you to leave… And you refused…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	551	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_0455edd5	yuki_onna	Now you will die in frost… Like them…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	552	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_a594b894		The frost consumes me entirely, and the last thing I feel is the crushing weight of ice.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	554	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_a6580aca		I plant my feet, channeling every ounce of fire I have into a concentrated beam aimed directly at the spear. The flames roar to life, colliding with the ice mid-air. The spear melts instantly, the water hissing into steam.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	564	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_6799c3a7	yuki_onna	No!!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	566	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_a3eef1fd_1	dorian	Argh—!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	583	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_0cff5a63_1		The frost continues to crawl up my arm, encasing me in ice. I struggle to move, but the cold is overwhelming.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	585	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_4df99c43_1	yuki_onna	Like ice, life is very fragile. You should have known before coming here.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	587	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_a594b894_1		The frost consumes me entirely, and the last thing I feel is the crushing weight of ice.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	589	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_19e4c663		Her icy form flickers and cracks, her strength waning as the fire consumes her energy.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	606	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_f5f216ab	elara	You did it, my heart!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	608	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_45ad36d5	yuki_onna	AHHH!!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	609	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_4f539c5b		The yuki-onna lets out a piercing wail before shattering into a flurry of snowflakes. The frost in the air dissipates, leaving only the warmth of my flames behind.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	611	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_b0f0116c		Her form dissolves into a cascade of glittering snowflakes, drifting through the air. They swirl ahead of me, shimmering faintly in the darkness of the Frostcradle.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	612	"[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_ebb784e3	elara	Follow her, Dorian. There's something she wants to show you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	614	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuki_boss_d615b667		The snowflakes drifted into a tunnel, leading deeper into the mine. My fists tightened as I followed cautiously.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	616	"[what]"
ch3_truth_26cc39cb		Eventually, I emerged into a small chamber carved into the rock. At its center was a crude, weathered shack.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	635	"[what]"
ch3_truth_758c0111		The snowflakes glided toward it, their light dimming as they disappeared through the cracks in the wood.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	636	"[what]"
ch3_truth_f9a90f34		I pushed the door open with one hand, the other ready in case of an ambush.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	637	"[what]"
ch3_truth_57ebc16a		The inside was warmer than I expected, lit by the flickering glow of a small lantern. Supplies were scattered haphazardly.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	638	"[what]"
ch3_truth_c1212ddb		And then, something hit me. Hard.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	639	"[what]"
ch3_truth_e28c6336		A wooden block collided with my shoulder.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	641	"[what]"
ch3_truth_4487c83a	dorian	Argh! Hey!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	643	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_4325d366		A toddler. Probably three years old. Barely the size of Lucas, crouched in the corner. His face pale, his eyes wide with fear, his tiny hands clutching a wooden spoon.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	650	"[what]"
ch3_truth_f706eaff	elias	Go away! Go away!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	652	elias "[what]"
ch3_truth_a25cd049		The toddler let out a frightened cry as the spoon flew through the air, bouncing harmlessly off my chest.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	654	"[what]"
ch3_truth_a42dd079		I blinked, utterly dumbfounded, as he grabbed the next available object — a dented tin cup — and launched it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	655	"[what]"
ch3_truth_94c0e0f9	dorian	Seriously?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	657	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_3ec5ad8f		The cup clattered to the floor, and I exhaled sharply, lowering my hands.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	659	"[what]"
ch3_truth_127cf3d8	dorian	Hey! Calm down!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	661	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_3ae37639		I took a step forward. He grabbed a small tin plate and flung it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	663	"[what]"
ch3_truth_4dfe8a0d	dorian	Enough!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	665	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_c755f701		I lunged forward, catching his wrist mid-throw. He screamed.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	667	"[what]"
ch3_truth_1c7115ac	elias	Let me go! Let me go!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	669	elias "[what]"
ch3_truth_0b23ea7b		I tightened my grip just enough to keep him from wriggling free, crouching to his level.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	671	"[what]"
ch3_truth_bc8f64ec	dorian	Stop. I'm not going to hurt you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	673	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_9dfd7209	elias	Let me go! *crying*	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	675	elias "[what]"
ch3_truth_6d1f5d4a		Something stirred a pang of unease in my chest. I looked closer, scanning him for any sign of the death god's energy. Nothing. Not on him, at least.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	677	"[what]"
ch3_truth_3c866e27		That's when I noticed the amulet hanging around his neck, faintly glowing with a sinister light. The energy practically oozed from it, but the toddler himself… He wasn't the source.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	678	"[what]"
ch3_truth_a64ca067	dorian	What's your name, kid?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	680	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_1e07464d	elias	*sobbing* E-Elias…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	682	elias "[what]"
ch3_truth_9077171c		The name hit me like a punch to the gut. Elias. Elias Drakos. The former crown prince. The 'monster' Vasily and the prophets had warned me about.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	684	"[what]"
ch3_truth_76c8c9ff	dorian	You're Elias Drakos?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	686	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_e6c910c0		The toddler nodded weakly, his small frame sagging under the weight of his fear and exhaustion.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	688	"[what]"
ch3_truth_1089fee7		This can't be right. This is the killer?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	690	"[what]"
ch3_truth_368d708e	dorian	Alright, Elias. You're tired. Let's get you some rest.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	692	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_ce9d058f	elias	N-No! You'll hurt me!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	693	elias "[what]"
ch3_truth_f8c4cb86	dorian	If I wanted to hurt you, I'd have done it already. Now sit.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	695	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_984f6cd1		He hesitated before collapsing onto the straw bed, his body too weary to fight anymore.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	697	"[what]"
ch3_truth_06161162	dorian	Good. Now sleep.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	699	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_87295979		Elias curled up, his small hands clutching the amulet tightly. Within moments, his breathing evened out.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	701	"[what]"
ch3_truth_c428f527		I sat next to his bed, watching him in silence. My mind swirled with questions.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	702	"[what]"
ch3_truth_cbba5955		I reached out and touched the amulet.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	704	"[what]"
ch3_truth_487362cb		The instant my fingers grazed its cold surface, a surge of power slammed through me, like a tidal wave of energy crashing against my very soul. My vision blurred, and my knees buckled.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	708	"[what]"
ch3_truth_903a2d6d	dorian	What the—?!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	710	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_d41349f8		Then came the light. Blinding, searing. It pierced my mind like a dagger, splintering into a kaleidoscope of fractured images.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	724	"[what]"
ch3_truth_8ef87daa		A man with massive wings, his face obscured, his voice a thunderous whisper that echoed in my skull.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	725	"[what]"
ch3_truth_ee08cf38		Magnus: Help!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	727	"[what]"
ch3_truth_6c0e7e47		Magnus: Come…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	728	"[what]"
ch3_truth_92b75364		Magnus: To Tianho…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	729	"[what]"
ch3_truth_7fc153bd		Magnus: NOW!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	730	"[what]"
ch3_truth_66b60a84		Magnus: AAHHHH!!!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	731	"[what]"
ch3_truth_a070a95c		I recoiled, clutching my head as an unbearable headache tore through me. The pain was sharp, relentless, as if my skull were being split open.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	733	"[what]"
ch3_truth_969e3f49		And then... silence.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	734	"[what]"
ch3_truth_1f786e79		When I opened my eyes, she stood before me. Queen Ekaterina Drakos.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	746	"[what]"
ch3_truth_b980e49b		She stood before me, her figure ethereal and shimmering. Snow swirled around her ghostly figure.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	747	"[what]"
ch3_truth_0783340d	ekaterina_ghost	Dragon of Gale. It's time you learned the truth.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	749	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_6960fdc0	dorian	Queen Ekaterina… what is this? What's happening?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	750	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_05775eac		She raised her hand, the air around us growing colder.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	752	"[what]"
ch3_truth_2681a179	ekaterina_ghost	All of this is because of the amulet Elias is wearing.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	754	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_5ffecc7a	ekaterina_ghost	Vasily... my Vasily... was his loyal hand, aiding him in his research.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	755	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_0fab1b92		My stomach turned at the name. Vasily? This didn't make sense.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	757	"[what]"
ch3_truth_d4d83a6c	ekaterina_ghost	The night before the ceremony, I had Elias with me. Elias wanted to hug his father because it was his birthday — but we stumbled upon Gustav in his study, hunched over the amulet, its cursed light glowing in the dark. Vasily was with him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	766	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_f41ee9d9	ekaterina_ghost	I heard him speaking of a divine weapon underneath Tianho and how he would use it to subjugate the land. And then he saw us — he was frantic, shouting, desperate. He saw me and screamed at me to leave.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	767	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_2b73daaf		The vision shifted. I saw her clutching Elias's tiny hand, rushing through dimly lit corridors. Vasily caught up to them, his face pale with dread.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	769	"[what]"
ch3_truth_5cc58370	dorian	You stole the amulet? Why?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	771	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_8d13bbc5	ekaterina_ghost	I didn't want Mjoll to suffer the same fate as Tianho. Whatever Gustav is planning, I don't want any part of it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	772	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_3a07d94b	vasily	What have you done, Ekaterina?! The king is furious! He wants both of your heads!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	774	vasily "[what]"
ch3_truth_359c717c	dorian	Vasily?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	776	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_25366001	ekaterina_ghost	Vasily... my secret lover. Elias's true father. Not Gustav. He begged me to flee, but there was no escaping Gustav's wrath. Not for me. Not for my son.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	777	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_ca896d9e	ekaterina_ghost	I knew the power of our militia. I knew there was no escape. Gustav's militia would hunt us to the ends of the earth.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	778	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_2a2bf5af	ekaterina_ghost	I lashed out at him. 'Why bring Elias into this?! He's innocent!' But Vasily had no answers. He promised to plead with the king, but I knew better.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	779	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_9336013b	ekaterina_ghost	That night, I made my choice. I recalled an old chant from Hinami, one my mother taught me — a chant that could transform a soul into something eternal. Something powerful. But it required death.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	780	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_e4bf9cc4	ekaterina_ghost	I waited until Vasily was with you during the ceremony.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	781	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_a745cba5	dorian	You… killed yourself.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	788	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_de6def92	ekaterina_ghost	Yes, I took my blade and plunged it into my heart, praying the chant would work. My spirit became one with the cold, with the storm. I became what you see now — a guardian of frost.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	789	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_d158954c	yuki_onna	I took him to the abandoned mine, Frostcradle. I thought I could protect him here, away from Gustav, away from the militia.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	798	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_truth_f78f33e9	yuki_onna	The amulet amplified my abilities. I had Elias wear it so I can draw from its power.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	799	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_truth_4178c524	yuki_onna	Those who came near... those who sought to harm him... I killed them. I froze them. Mercenaries, soldiers, Aldoriths — they all fell to protect my son.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	800	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_truth_33ce9239	dorian	So the bodies I saw earlier were—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	802	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_35ea0eda	yuki_onna	Yes. All who sought to harm my child.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	803	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_truth_0fe39d8f	yuki_onna	My child… Elias.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	804	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_truth_f8a0c941	yuki_onna	My power is waning. Soon, I'll be nothing but a memory in the wind. But before I fade, I'll create one last blizzard — one so fierce, no one will ever come near Elias again.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	813	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_truth_e1db4623		The air around us grew colder, her form flickering like a dying flame.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	815	"[what]"
ch3_truth_e91401f7	dorian	You'd doom the people of Mjoll to starvation and death just to save one child?!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	817	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_a258b802	yuki_onna	I DON'T CARE. You've seen how they wish to kill my child. I heard you were a father once, Dorian. Wouldn't you do the same for your children?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	818	yuki_onna "[what]"
ch3_truth_fffcc967	dorian	I—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	819	dorian "[what]"
ch3_truth_f1bc68d4		Her voice broke, and for the first time, I saw tears coming out of her eyes.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	821	"[what]"
ch3_truth_2141a979	ekaterina_ghost	*weeping* My Elias… Now that I'm gone… I don't know what will become of him…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	823	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_783a3456	ekaterina_ghost	I know I've done terrible things. But please, Dorian... I have nothing left to give. No treasure, no kingdom, no legacy.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	824	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_72b30103	ekaterina_ghost	Please. I beg you, Dorian. Save him. Protect my son. I couldn't in life, but maybe... maybe you can.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	825	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_d3059aaf		She wept in silence for what seemed like hours.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	827	"[what]"
ch3_truth_9c57145b	ekaterina_ghost	Elias… my child… forgive me…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	829	ekaterina_ghost "[what]"
ch3_truth_45e7ed35		And then she was gone.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	831	"[what]"
ch3_truth_db06f04c		The vision faltered. I was back in the room, staring at the sleeping toddler and the glowing amulet around his neck. Ekaterina's words echoed in my ears.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	842	"[what]"
ch3_truth_83ce3f8e		Save him. Protect him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	843	"[what]"
ch3_truth_aab837de		I looked down at Elias, his tiny chest rising and falling.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	844	"[what]"
ch3_truth_f85c7cf9		I feel… light. My body feels heavy. I fall on the floor.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	845	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_310df913		The cold floor bit into my cheek as I stirred awake. The roar of the blizzard echoed through the mining cave like a living beast.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	865	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_5f191132		When I opened my eyes, I was greeted by the dim light of the shack. Elias was in the corner, fumbling with what appeared to be a jar.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	866	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_384945b0		His tiny hands struggled against the lid, his face scrunched up in determination.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	867	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_b7f22874	dorian	What are you doing?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	869	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_1c74b60d		The sound startled him, and he froze.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	871	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_3257d12b	elias	Ahhh!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	873	elias "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_fc420362	dorian	Hey. I'm not going to hurt you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	875	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_cd1328d0		Elias clutched the edge of a blanket like it was a shield, his gaze flickering between me and the jar.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	877	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_e28f47c7		I noticed it more clearly. Old and scratched — a preserve jar. Fruits, most likely. His little hands had been trying to open it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	878	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_4a564189	dorian	You were trying to get this open, right?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	880	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_aefcfa6a		I reached for the jar slowly. He tensed. I gave the lid a firm twist. It popped open with ease.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	882	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_47dee8ed	dorian	There. All yours.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	884	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_a8893882		He hesitated, then inched forward cautiously, still clutching the blanket. His tiny hands darted out to grab the jar, pulling it close. He buried his face in it and began to eat.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	886	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_a1e559cc	dorian	You need to wipe your face. Hold on.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	888	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_0bd5b25c		I knelt and opened my pack. My hands brushed against something familiar. Emily's ribbon. Lucas's slingshot. Daniel's carved wooden horse. Elara's scarf. And Tedda — the knit doll with the missing eye.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	890	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_309214bd	dorian	How did these get here?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	892	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_26bf0b71		I turned back to Elias, who was licking his fingers, his small face sticky with syrup. I offered him the cloth.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	894	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_9bcf181c	dorian	Alright. Hold still.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	896	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_a0cbd2c4		I wiped his face gently, the cloth coming away sticky and stained. He squirmed a little but didn't resist.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	898	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_881f134d	dorian	How old are you?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	900	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_19797a7d		Elias hesitated, then held up three fingers.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	902	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_b8ad9466	elias	Fow.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	904	elias "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_e0ca4ba9	dorian	Four, huh? You sure about that?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	905	dorian "[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_996aca33		He nodded, with a serious expression on his face. I sat back against the creaky shack wall and decided to try a few questions.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	907	"[what]"
ch3_elias_questions_ea6d3b9f	dorian	Alright. I have some questions.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	909	dorian "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_8dab5f8a	dorian	Did your mom bring you here?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	925	dorian "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_95ccc6bd		Elias paused, his cheeks stuffed like a chipmunk's. He swallowed loudly before mumbling.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	927	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_a57a50ec	elias	Uh-huh. Mommy say... um... stay here, an'... an' don't open da door... 'cause... 'cause bad mans come in an'—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	929	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_1771623a		He stuffed another piece of fruit into his mouth mid-sentence.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	931	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_0166c7c9	elias	An' Mama say... no cry, 'cause... 'cause Mommy's gonna be back. But she not...	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	933	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_90464bd6		His little face scrunched up in thought, and he trailed off, licking his fingers again.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	935	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_a941679a	dorian	Well… I'm not getting any answers from you, am I?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	937	dorian "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_5fff0133	elias	Um… Huh?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	938	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_62395003	dorian	What's that amulet you're wearing?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	949	dorian "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_9c8b757e		At this, Elias froze. His sticky hands darted to the amulet, clutching it protectively.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	951	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_83202c03	elias	This? They Mommy say... uh... um... Mommy say, don't give it! Don't give it to bad guys. No, no, no!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	953	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_0c1f8331		He shook his head so hard his hair flopped around.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	955	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_b0f54e86	elias	She say... it's... uh... it's super 'portant! Like... magic, or somethin'…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	957	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_cf31f722		He blinked at me, then tilted his head.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	959	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_aafe262e	elias	Are you a bad guy, mister?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	961	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_de01f71a	dorian	What do you think? I opened the jar for you, didn't I?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	962	dorian "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_d16e0a66		Elias squinted at me suspiciously before shoving another chunk of fruit into his mouth.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	964	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_2c4a81f6	elias	Okay. I believe you, mister.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	966	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_f89a8112		I gestured toward the cave entrance, where the bodies I had seen earlier were frozen.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	977	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_4ba63aab	dorian	Who are those guys? The ones outside?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	979	dorian "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_a1f9f3f2		Elias glanced toward the entrance, his expression scrunching up.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	981	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_f1cda50e	elias	The bad guys… and they make Mommy go WHOOSH!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	983	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_71907c29		He threw his arms up, making a dramatic gusting sound.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	985	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_141b0c05	elias	And they go... um... like statues. Mommy say, 'Leave!' An' dey didn't... so, um, they go 'brrrrrrrrrr!'	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	987	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_a9ee3519		He shivered for emphasis, then giggled, poking at the jar.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	989	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_eeec847a	elias	They're not scary, mister. Mommy's scarier!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	991	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_ef58c2a6	dorian	I can imagine.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	992	dorian "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_5640455f	elias	Okay! You ask lotsa stuffs, mister. I like da fruit. Got more?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1001	elias "[what]"
ch3_question_menu_743ba8f7		I sighed, grabbing the cloth again.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1003	"[what]"
ch3_question_menu_a7213651	dorian	First, let's clean you up — again.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1005	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_5a88bb03		The roar of the blizzard outside echoed loudly through the mining cave.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1019	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_f5fa2068		I wiped his face gently again, making his tiny face and little fingers spotless.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1020	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_be4b4b0e		Then my stomach growled — how long it had been since my last meal? Hours? Half a day. I was starving.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1022	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_c29cb670	dorian	Kid, is there any food in here?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1024	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_74324669		The toddler looked up from where he was fiddling with the now-empty jar. He pointed a finger toward the corner.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1026	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_1c04917e	elias	Uhhh... um... fishies over there, mister! An' veggies... Mommy say dey for soup. But I don't know how.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1028	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_bc1e1c1a		I found what he meant. A pile of provisions — ice-cold fish wrapped in rough parchment, some frozen vegetables, and a sack of rice.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1030	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_bab55879		Tianho white-scaled fish. My mother used to cook these when I was a kid.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1031	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_3d7724ed	dorian	*sighs* I'm going to cook some stew. Want some?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1033	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_0ae32985		Elias's face lit up, and he nodded eagerly.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1035	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_ed71bdc6	elias	Y-Yes. I'm hungry too, mister!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1037	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_05c73546		I cooked. He watched intently as I worked, his eyes following every movement.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1039	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_4eaadadd		Eventually, I ladled the finished stew into a couple of old wooden bowls. The fish had cooked perfectly — tender, flaky, the broth rich with sweetness.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1040	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_19965b8e	dorian	Here. Don't spill it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1042	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_6390e42f		Elias took a cautious sip, then let out a happy hum, his legs kicking excitedly.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1044	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_934325a5	elias	Mmm! It's hot... but it's yummy! You're a good cooker!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1046	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_ca18632a	dorian	It's cook, not cooker.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1047	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_1f8d0912		I rolled my eyes, taking a sip of my own bowl.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1049	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_46cd1143		Dorian: Stay here, kid. I'll be right back.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1057	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_bafdef30		I stepped toward the mine entrance. The icy wind hit me like a wall, cutting through my cloak and stinging my face.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1059	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_b743287b	elara	You know what Gustav will do to that child.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1061	elara "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_55bdf1c6	dorian	It's a bounty, my heart. You know how bounties work.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1062	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_8d5418b6	elara	Well then, why did you accept it?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1063	elara "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_dde6c9a9	dorian	Nobody told me that the target was a toddler. How in Tetrad's name was I supposed to know?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1064	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_2bef480c	elara	You've seen Mjoll. You've seen how they treat the aldoriths. You know what Gustav will do to that child if he gets a hold of him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1065	elara "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_9d56dc3f	dorian	It's not my decision. It's not my place. The task was to kill him, Elara. I didn't... I couldn't. So maybe bringing him to Gustav is the compromise.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1066	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_2f270443	elara	A compromise? You think handing a defenseless child over to that monster is a compromise?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1067	elara "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_db7c8229	dorian	I'm not a savior, Elara. I never was. I… wasn't strong enough to save you… and the kids.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1068	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_f38deabd	dorian	I'm a mercenary now. This isn't—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1069	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_b6ae7beb	elara	This isn't who you are. I know you've buried the man you used to be under all that guilt, but I know he's still there. And you know it too, or that boy would already be dead.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1070	elara "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_a098c0ab	dorian	Once the blizzard stops, I'm giving the boy to King Gustav. I'm a man of my word.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1071	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_5a938006	elara	*sigh* I understand, my heart.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1072	elara "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_cd536656		I stood there for a long moment, the blizzard howling in my ears.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1074	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_dd729e6e		Then I turned back and saw Elias standing behind me, wrapped in a blanket.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1076	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_61e660d5	elias	Hello, mister. Who are you talking to?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1078	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_ed0d4404	dorian	What are you doing here? I thought I told you to stay put.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1080	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_7932ba46	dorian	Come on. Let's head back, Elias.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1081	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_e1f0d53a		A couple of days passed. The blizzard showed no sign of letting up.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1089	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_6cd55e60		I didn't speak to Elias. Not once.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1090	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_03fcc94a		He tried, of course. In his small, curious voice, he'd ask questions. 'Why is it so cold?' or 'What's your favorite food?'	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1091	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_dc9ddd88		I ignored them all. It was easier that way.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1092	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_71b7c9a1		I told myself it was better this way. No attachments. No guilt. When the storm passed, I would take him to King Gustav, collect my bounty, and move on.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1093	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_4344ae80		That's how it had to be.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1094	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_5f03a878		Until the morning I woke up to the sound of soft giggles.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1095	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_8f379500		I blinked groggily. My eyes landed on Elias, sitting cross-legged on the floor with something clutched tightly in his hands.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1097	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_4c9457fb		It took me a second to realize what it was.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1099	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_7dd0afd7		Tedda.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1100	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_6273d0bb		My chest tightened. That was my gift for Sarah.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1102	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_02c1ece8	dorian	That's for Sarah. Put that down.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1104	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_557b1bd9		Elias froze, his wide eyes looking up at me, startled and afraid. He clutched Tedda tighter.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1106	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_b1ceb922	elias	I… I'm sorry, mister. I-I—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1108	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_e3f2082b	dorian	I said put it down.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1109	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_6d696b31		He flinched at the harshness of my tone, his bottom lip trembling. Slowly, he placed Tedda on the floor and backed away.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1111	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_74b39d29		I bent down, picking up Tedda. My fingers trembled, and I hated that they did.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1112	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_ba85328e		Behind me, I heard the faint sound of a sniffle.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1113	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_bbe2ed0c	elias	I'm sorry, mister. I didn't mean to make you mad.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1115	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_4ee2a170		I stood there, staring down at the bear.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1117	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_ce9e8a0b	dorian	This bear's name is Tedda. This was for Sarah. My daughter.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1119	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_5f0d89be		I wasn't sure why I said it. Maybe I just needed to say her name.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1121	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_7229d9a8	dorian	She's not here anymore. I'm her dad… and everything I do is to protect her.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1123	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_66ef8eb9		Elias looked down at his lap, his small hands fiddling with the edge of his blanket.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1125	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_b9d7ba64	elias	I… I wish I had a daddy…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1127	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_34ae342b		His words hit me like a blow. I stared at him, stunned.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1129	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_92019f13	elias	My daddy doesn't love me. He… he wants me dead.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1131	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_0876db78		I was shocked. I didn't know that he knew King Gustav wanted him dead.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1133	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_c72642b4	elias	Mommy saved me… from him. She kept me safe. But now she's…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1135	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_e5a6bd2c		His voice cracked, and tears spilled down his cheeks.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1137	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_5f079db6	elias	…gone too.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1139	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_d2c977fa		He buried his face in the blanket, his small body shaking with silent sobs. I stood there, frozen, clutching Tedda.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1141	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_4f50a156		Before I could stop myself, I knelt beside him, holding out the bear.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1142	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_f2b36dcf	dorian	Here.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1144	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_effb8d00		Elias peeked up at me, his tear-streaked face glowing with surprise. His small hands hesitated before gently taking Tedda from me. He hugged the bear tightly.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1146	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_7ae536ea	dorian	If Tedda will make you happy, you can have her.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1148	dorian "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_6a97d29f	elias	T-Thank you, mister.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1149	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_c210dc77		Elias reached out with both arms and threw them around my neck.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1156	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_ea63c82f		He hugged me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1157	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_6e8b1fa7		His small arms clung to me with all the strength in his tiny body, desperate and shaking, like he was afraid I'd vanish if he let go.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1158	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_1bb3730b	elias	Mommy told me in a dweam. She's gone… She won't be come back…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1160	elias "[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_2c5b7c80		I didn't answer. Didn't have the words.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1162	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_adb682a9		So I just held him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1163	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_fbb89b78		He didn't speak again. Neither did I.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1164	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_85728f27		Only the sound of the blizzard filled the silence — soft and endless.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1165	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_c5c27fa9		And for a long time, we stayed like that.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1166	"[what]"
ch3_blizzard_trapped_73c3c456	elias	Thank you, mister.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1168	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_837d1304		Then I heard it — a faint whirring sound cut through the silence. It grew louder, and I turned toward the noise.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1184	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_34f7c58e	elias	What's that? Is it alive?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1191	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_5336370a	dorian	No, it's not alive. It's a supply bot. Made by Cheng Industries.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1192	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_a9bcdc93	elias	A suh-ply bot?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1193	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_abd721f8		Roboto: Here at Cheng's, we bring change…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1197	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_002e5a6e	elias	It sings, mister! It's so cute!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1201	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_0399b194		As the jingle faded, a soft hum emanated from the bot. A hologram flickered to life above its chest.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1203	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_9f13c7d4	yuxuan	Praise the Prosperity Dragon! Dorian, I'm so happy to see you again!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1207	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_36200846		I blinked, caught off guard. I awkwardly forced a smile, though I didn't remember his face at all. I only remembered writing him a letter.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1209	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_dea5b03f	dorian	Nice to meet you again, Yuxuan.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1211	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_e6385f11	yuxuan	I got your letter! So I've been asking around, trying to track you down in Mjoll. When I heard you might be in the Frostcradle, I figured you could use some help.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1212	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_b49bb562	yuxuan	So, I hijacked one of our bots already en route to Mjoll and had it rerouted here.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1213	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_3708a60c		The bot turned around and opened a compartment on its chest to reveal a neatly organized cache of goods: dried meats, vegetables, warm blankets, fire-starting kits, and even a few luxury items like hot drink packets and a sealed tin of sweets.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1215	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_25d27cf3	yuxuan	The blizzard's getting worse, so I thought you'd appreciate a little extra help. Everything in here is yours — no charge, of course.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1217	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_000b1436		Elias' eyes widened, his eyes sparkled as he stared at the supplies.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1219	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_7740e005	elias	Mister, look! It's got food! And bwankets! And… and CANDIES!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1221	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_68c82b6b		He tugged at my sleeve eagerly, practically bouncing on the spot.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1223	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_0fd8666c	dorian	T-Thanks, Yuxuan. You didn't have to go out of your way.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1225	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_af266475	yuxuan	Nonsense! You saved my hide back in Tianho, remember? Consider this payback.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1226	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_06263c17	elias	Wow, there's so many TWEATS! Tedda, look! Tweats just for us!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1228	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_109159ff		Elias practically squealed as he reached for the tin of sweets, scurrying off to a corner of the shack.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1230	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_c791b846	dorian	Hey — we haven't had a proper meal, first!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1232	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_2f2092c9		Yuxuan chuckled through the hologram.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1234	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_8ac4a4da	yuxuan	Wait… Who's Tedda? Is there another person here?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1236	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_52bab98e	dorian	That's just the knit doll with the missing eye.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1237	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_113983af	yuxuan	Oh… I thought it was another person. Anyway, Dorian… Have you handled the situation yet?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1238	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_54d7ae13	dorian	What situation?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1240	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_6996b892	yuxuan	Have you killed the Prince? The one who murdered the Queen. You know, to stop the blizzard?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1241	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_ecbfa2b8	yuxuan	King Gustav upped the bounty. He already tripled it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1242	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_6c9534f0		The question hung heavily in the air. I took a deep breath and pointed to the corner.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1244	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_b190c8cb	dorian	You're looking at him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1246	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_d2c2180c		Yuxuan's holographic face froze mid-smile, his mouth dropping open as his gaze followed my hand to Elias. The toddler was sitting cross-legged, happily stuffing candies into his mouth while making Tedda 'dance' beside him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1248	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_44462189	elias	*giggling* Tedda says, 'Candy is the best thing ever!' Right, Tedda?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1250	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_48744451	yuxuan	W-WHAT?! That's… that's the Prince?!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1252	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_105f7497		I crossed my arms and nodded.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1254	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_8d9d8362	yuxuan	I… I'm confused. By the way they described what he did, I thought the Prince would be… older. At least of age! Not…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1256	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_5eac9a78		I sighed, the weight of everything pressing on my chest. Taking a deep breath, I leaned closer to the hologram.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1258	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_1b798931		I told Yuxuan everything. How Queen Ekaterina became the frost spirit Yuki-onna and that she's the one who caused the blizzard, not Elias.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1260	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_e33c190d		Yuxuan's expression softened with horror and sympathy as he absorbed the information.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1262	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_9af2323e	yuxuan	Heavens. Prosperity Dragon save Her Majesty's soul. That's too tragic!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1264	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_eb926d9d	yuxuan	And even King Gustav and Count Vasily want him dead…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1265	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_59e04610	dorian	Yeah. Kid's got it rough.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1267	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_15a35350	yuxuan	But… what do you plan to do, Dorian? You can't exactly just…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1269	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_e34f1598	dorian	I don't know…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1271	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_6ff67af0	dorian	C'mon, Elias. I'll cook you up something proper before you finish half of that candy.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1273	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_a9fa662e	elias	Okay, mister.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1275	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_17a5c8d6		I started toward the makeshift cooking area, but before I could take another step, a sharp pain pierced through my head like a hot blade. My knees buckled, and the room tilted. My vision blurred.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1281	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_ed8742fc		Magnus: Come to Tianho, Dragonkin…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1287	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_47d4c751		Magnus: My power flows through you now. Only you can open the…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1288	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_d1f2f6fd		Magnus: Hurry… please…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1289	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_ace08296		And then, darkness.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1291	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_3d77cb32		I hit the ground hard, my body trembling as icy tendrils of pain radiated through my chest.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1295	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_60aad419	elias	Mister! Mister, wake up! What's wrong?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1297	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_a53d73c0	yuxuan	Dorian?! What happened?!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1298	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_e9110b51	dorian	I… don't know…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1300	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_2119e87b	yuxuan	Elias, listen to me! You have to help him. The bot can't administer aid — it's not designed for that. Only you can do this!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1302	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_40740845	elias	Umm… okay. But I don't know how!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1303	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_87e6e3b5	yuxuan	Stay calm! First, you… um… need to… Prosperity Dragon save us… Where's a doctor when you need him?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1305	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_01102634		I felt his tiny hands on my face, shaking me gently.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1307	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_0b91c644	elias	Mister? Please wake up! Please don't leave me!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1309	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_f46a7461	yuxuan	Elias, hold his hand. Talk to him. Sometimes, power responds to emotion. Tell him he's safe, that you're here. It might help ground him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1310	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_9f77e474	elias	Mister… please don't leave. I'll be good, I promise. I'll share all my candies with you and Tedda! Just… don't go.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1311	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_0a67dea1		His voice broke into soft sobs as he clung to me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1313	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_5c6a4fd7	yuxuan	Elias, the necklace! It's reacting to him. Take it off and give it to him — quickly!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1315	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_bf40fe62	elias	O-Okay…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1316	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_4054134f		I felt the weight of the amulet as Elias placed it on my chest. The energy around me shifted immediately, the chaotic sparks focusing, centering.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1320	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_016a63f2		Magnus: Yes… Yes…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1322	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_d2a6749f		And then everything went black.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1324	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_a5dc86a0	elara	Dorian… my heart.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1340	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_6d9e829e		I turned to see her, standing with Daniel, Sarah, Emily, and Lucas. They smiled at me, their faces serene.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1342	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_bafc724a	daniel	Goodbye, Dad. It's time for us to go.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1344	daniel "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_205080ac	sarah	You don't need us anymore, Dad. You're strong now.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1345	sarah "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_cda1d06c	emily	We'll always be with you, in your heart.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1346	emily "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_35a1537d	lucas	Until we meet again, Dad.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1347	lucas "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_4115d804		Tears blurred my vision, but I couldn't bring myself to move or speak.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1349	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_2c1d19ae	dorian	D-Don't go…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1351	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_87ab3e6b		Elara stayed behind as the children faded into the light. She walked toward me, her hand brushing against my cheek.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1353	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_03f3ab39	elara	I'll miss you, my heart. But Ena needs you. Our mission here is done.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1355	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_aaffaf68	elara	Go, my heart. Ena is counting on you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1356	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_598b86e9	elara	Until we meet again.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1357	elara "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_42019ba4		The warmth of her touch lingered as she, too, faded into the golden light.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1359	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_4a476c50	dorian	No!!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1361	dorian "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_2010ec01		I woke with tears streaming down my face, my body trembling.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1371	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_18565625		Then I felt it — a small, warm body pressed tightly against mine.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1372	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_bc17e1a6		Elias was curled up beside me, his tiny arms wrapped around my torso, clutching me. Tedda was squished between us.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1373	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_65657153		As I wept silently, Elias stirred, mumbling softly in his sleep.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1375	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_f6f6f3c6	elias	Please don't take Daddy away…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1377	elias "[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_dab953de		My heart broke all over again. And before I knew it, I found myself holding him close.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1379	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_cb1a173d		The only sounds were the crackling of the fire and Elias' soft breathing.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1380	"[what]"
ch3_yuxuan_arrives_67f2a45c		And as the firelight flickered, I held onto him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1381	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_18285f28		The next morning, I woke up early. Elias was still asleep, his small body curled tightly around Tedda.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1400	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_e7da27f6		I found that I was wearing the amulet Elias had been wearing. Oddly enough, it stopped glowing. I stood up, removed it and placed it on a small table.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1401	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_337d4114		A soft whirring sound made me glance toward the corner. The bot came to life with a low hum, the hologram of Yuxuan flickering into existence.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1402	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_e975f39d	yuxuan	Good morning, Dorian!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1404	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_d20950b0	dorian	Morning, Yuxuan. You're up early.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1405	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_f7cd92f4	yuxuan	I never really sleep much. Or even eat. Too many projects to think about, you know? But… that's not what I called.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1406	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_92139bb3	yuxuan	You're not going to believe this, but there's a rare mushroom growing just outside the shack! I spotted it on the bot's scanners earlier.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1407	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_eba353d7	yuxuan	It's called a Blisscap. They only grow here in Mjoll, and their taste? Oh, it's incredible — earthy, with just a hint of sweetness. It'd be perfect for breakfast.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1408	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_b4d4b692	dorian	Really? Is it edible?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1410	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_a4475c18	yuxuan	Completely! Trust me, I wouldn't suggest it if it weren't.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1411	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_c9c730f3	yuxuan	It's just outside, Dorian. Still inside the cave, so the blizzard won't get in the way. I could guide you to it, you know, if you're up for it. Please?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1412	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_eb02df36		His smile lingered a little longer than it needed to.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1414	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_0f229435	dorian	Alright, Yuxuan. Show me where it is.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1426	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_7e362b17	yuxuan	Great! Follow the bot, and I'll guide you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1427	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_3826676d		As I stepped outside, the air in the cave was cooler, but it wasn't unbearable.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1433	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_8a070d3b		Yuxuan's hologram flickered as he pointed toward a faint patch of glowing blue mushrooms near the cave wall.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1434	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_33da90a2	yuxuan	There. Aren't they beautiful? The glow is caused by a natural compound in their spores. It's harmless, I promise.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1436	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_d4e61d2a		I crouched down, gently plucking a few of the mushrooms.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1438	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_fc7cebab	yuxuan	You know… seeing you here, alive, after everything in Tianho — it's, um… it's really nice. I never got to say thank you. For what you did.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1440	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_0df8fbe8	dorian	You don't owe me anything, Yuxuan.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1442	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_3f626104	yuxuan	Maybe not. But that doesn't mean I'm not grateful. You didn't have to save me back then, but you did. And… it meant a lot.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1443	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_4de79011	yuxuan	I… I'm just so happy I finally get to meet you again. You were my hero, you know? Still are.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1444	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_775f3955		He paused, his holographic image flickering faintly.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1446	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_ebf222e9	yuxuan	Paladin Dorian Burnham. The Dragon of Gale. I never forgot your name.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1448	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_a5f9c1b5		The title felt foreign now, like it belonged to someone else entirely.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1450	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_298dda3e	dorian	I'm just a mercenary now, Yuxuan. I'm not a paladin anymore. I resigned years ago. That man you remember? I apologize. But he's gone.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1452	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_b4b6f9e3		The silence that followed was almost unbearable.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1454	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_82762fee	yuxuan	Maybe you've changed. Maybe you've been through things that I can't even imagine. But you're still the man who saved me. You're still him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1456	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_30f307d5		He paused, the air between us heavy with unspoken words.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1458	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_121dda12	yuxuan	Thanks for humoring me. I, uh… I hope breakfast turns out great.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1460	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_b74c46c8	dorian	It will. Thanks to you, Yuxuan.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1462	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_1de09b55	dorian	Thanks, but I'll pass. I've already got breakfast going.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1472	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_0fb9aed0		Yuxuan's hologram faltered slightly, but he recovered quickly.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1474	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_1905bb6b	yuxuan	Of course. No problem. I just thought… well, never mind. If you change your mind, the bot will be here.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1476	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_6a5bb298	dorian	Appreciate it, Yuxuan. But I think I'll stick with what we've got for now.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1477	dorian "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_0a8e8812	yuxuan	Understood. Well, if you need anything else, just let me know.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1478	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_da05c8d8		With that, the hologram flickered off.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1480	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_135b9455		A few minutes later, Yuxuan's bot returned, its mechanical arms extending to offer me a small container filled with glowing Blisscap mushrooms.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1481	"[what]"
ch3_mushroom_2a646426	yuxuan	Here you go. Breakfast is on me. Well, technically on the cave, but you get the idea.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1483	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_mushroom_a73f1706	dorian	Thank you, Yuxuan.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1485	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_9c83c639		I moved to the fireplace, spreading the ingredients out on a makeshift wooden counter: a couple of golden fish, a white-scaled fish fillet, some string beans, a handful of other vegetables, and the glowing Blisscaps.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1500	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_15b38a32	dorian	Alright. Let's see what we can do with this.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1502	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_d9ab34f9		I decided to make a Golden Fish Omelette for us.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1516	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_79b3b6d5		I cracked the eggs into a bowl, whisking them with a pinch of salt and a sprinkle of dried herbs. I sliced thin pieces of golden fish and added them to the mix, along with a small handful of finely chopped Blisscaps for flavor.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1517	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_69379a6d	yuxuan	C-Careful, Dorian! Don't let it stick to the pan. Maybe a bit more oil?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1519	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_d2f0c791	dorian	I know how to cook, you know.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1520	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_b8ab6eee		I frowned, adding a touch more oil as the edges began to crisp. I folded the omelette in half, the golden fish glinting faintly against the soft yellow of the eggs.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1522	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_4dec48e5		The result was decent — it looked nice. Yuxuan made me add a little herbs. 'For garnishing', he said.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1523	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_3ddb948c		I decided to make soup with vegetables and some white-scaled fish.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1531	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_3e51d13a		I tossed the white-scaled fish into a pot of water, letting it simmer as I added diced vegetables — carrots, onions, and string beans. Healthy for growing little kids like Elias.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1532	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_99b5a7ed		The Blisscaps went in last, their faint glow dissipating as they softened in the broth.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1533	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_af73f660	dorian	Is that how you cook them, Yuxuan?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1535	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_4d93cf74	yuxuan	Uh… maybe add some salt? It looks a little bland.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1536	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_ba076afb		I sprinkled in a pinch, tasting the broth with a wooden spoon. It wasn't bad, but it lacked something.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1538	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_1c039f78	dorian	Maybe some dried herbs…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1540	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_76b525dc		The bot handed me a small pouch of spices, and I added a pinch of dried basil. The soup took on a richer aroma.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1542	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_030abc2c		I decided to just pan-fry the Golden Fish and some vegetables.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1550	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_82b89426		I seasoned the golden fish with salt and pepper, frying it in a pan until the skin was crispy and golden brown. Meanwhile, I sautéed the Blisscaps and vegetables in a separate pan.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1551	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_73029442	yuxuan	D-Dorian! You're burning the veggies!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1553	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_d8a8559d	dorian	Dragon's bollocks! *grumbling*	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1554	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_bdd0b6d9		I plated the fish on a bed of the sautéed Blisscaps and veggies, adding a small garnish of string bean slices for color.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1556	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_ce4ae1fd		I decided to make some fried rice with some string beans and white-scaled fish.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1564	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_1a9207e2		I chopped the white-scaled fish into small pieces, stir-frying it with cooked rice, chopped string beans, and a handful of diced vegetables. The Blisscaps added a faint glow as I mixed them in.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1565	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_4ef58d0f	yuxuan	A little soy sauce might help.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1567	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_ed928d7f	dorian	We… don't have soy sauce. Oh — sorry. We have some.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1568	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_c14b422d		I splashed in a small amount, the rice taking on a richer, darker hue.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1570	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_f30a6005		Not bad.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1571	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_a2075fd9		I plated the fried rice, sprinkling a pinch of dried herbs on top for good measure.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1572	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_ce555a26		Elias woke up and toddled over, rubbing his eyes.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1578	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_74bf5f95	elias	Good morning, da— I mean, mister!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1580	elias "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_9c7b0d0f		I smiled, kneeling to his level to hug him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1582	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_47d99522	dorian	Morning, Elias. Hungry?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1584	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_19a6a5bf		He nodded enthusiastically.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1586	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_1d31d98a	dorian	Dig in!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1588	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_e3481d24		Elias sat cross-legged on the floor, the warm meal before him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1590	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_1e680659	yuxuan	If I had a mouth, I'd eat every bite. My compliments, Chef Burnham.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1592	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_5eccf8c0		Somewhere in the background, I could faintly hear an old woman's voice.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1594	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_b56e7bc5	weng	Master Yuxuan, you must eat something. You've been working so hard.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1596	weng "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_dce469f9	dorian	Who's that, Yuxuan?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1598	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_38adb5fd	yuxuan	Oh just no one… Just my chef. I'm going to eat, Miss Weng! Just wait!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1599	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_b0bf298f		The sound of the raging blizzard outside filled the brief silence.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1601	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_865abab3	elias	Mister…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1603	elias "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_a6543df9	dorian	Yes, Elias?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1604	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_7236523e		He hesitated, fiddling with Tedda's paw.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1606	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_b6148040	elias	Is… is it okay if I call you daddy?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1608	elias "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_4423dc5d		The question hit me harder than I expected. My chest tightened, but I quickly ruffled his messy hair with a soft smile.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1610	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_71171d30	dorian	Whatever makes you happy.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1612	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_cb702b22		Elias beamed, his face lighting up with pure joy as he hugged Tedda tightly.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1614	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_fe27c857	elias	Okay, daddy.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1616	elias "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_40fd2d58		The blizzard raged on for several long, frigid days. Inside the cozy confines of the shack within the cave, we weathered the storm together.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1624	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_174047ef		Yuxuan kept us company through his bot most of the time.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1625	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_7bf9fdbf	yuxuan	Dorian! This bot is powered by solar cells I designed myself. They're ten times more efficient than the industry standard. Did you know—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1627	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_36151537	yuxuan	Dorian, are you even listening? You're not, are you?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1628	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_a088db2c	dorian	I'm listening, Yuxuan. Solar cells. Revolutionary. Got it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1630	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_aa605a92		Elias spent hours creating grand adventures for Tedda. His little voice brought warmth to the cold as he made the bear 'fight' monsters or embark on daring rescues.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1632	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_6f4c48b5		When he wasn't playing with Tedda, Elias would draw with crayons Yuxuan had included in the supply bot. He'd proudly show me his creations — crude, colorful scribbles that strangely resembled me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1633	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_57ef6b1a	elias	This is you, Daddy. See? You're big and strong! And this is me, and this is Tedda. Oh! And this is Mister Yuxuan.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1635	elias "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_18a733a0	dorian	You're quite the artist, Elias. I'll make sure to hang these somewhere special.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1636	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_9c375eca	elias	Good night, Daddy.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1638	elias "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_ee082619	dorian	Good night, Elias.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1639	dorian "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_e486bb36	yuxuan	Good night to both of you. May the howling blizzard only make our little shack feel warmer.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1640	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_breakfast_c6a77214		The next day, I woke up to an eerie silence. No howling winds. No biting cold seeping through the cracks of the shack.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1648	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_eb9866fd		Heart pounding, I scrambled to my feet, careful not to wake Elias.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1649	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_2fd946e8		Snow stretched endlessly in every direction. But the storm — after what felt like an eternity — had finally stopped.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1653	"[what]"
ch3_breakfast_d829699a		Relief washed over me, and I turned, ready to hurry back to the shack and tell Elias the good news.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1654	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_57cce294		But as I stepped forward, a voice stopped me in my tracks.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1672	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_d662e20a	vasily	Hello, friend. Took you quite some time to finish the mission.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1674	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_bcef00de		I froze. The voice was calm, almost casual. Slowly, I turned around.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1676	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_2d8a0e34	dorian	V-Vasily... What brings you here?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1678	dorian "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_5e7b1010		He stepped closer, his boots crunching softly against the cave floor.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1680	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_d24791e4	vasily	Oh, you know. Just passing through. Thought I'd check on an old friend.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1682	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_9dfd10ad	vasily	Imagine my surprise when I heard rumors. A seasoned mercenary hiding in a cave. Abandoning his mission. It's... disappointing, Dorian.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1683	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_4a0151ae	vasily	What else am I here for, friend? We're here for the contract.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1684	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_dadfc007	dorian	We?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1686	dorian "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_147a297a		Vasily snapped his fingers. The sound echoed through the cave, and within moments, soldiers began marching into view. An entire battalion.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1688	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_56e398e7	vasily	Under orders from His Majesty, the Prince is to be executed. Immediately.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1690	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_41d1772d	vasily	So tell me, friend. Have you killed the Prince yet?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1691	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_e9b39adb	dorian	You… didn't tell me the Prince was a toddler, Vasily.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1692	dorian "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_5ebfad8a	vasily	Does it matter? The contract was clear. Elias Drakos is to be eliminated. His age doesn't change what he's done… or what's at stake.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1693	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_8e556529	dorian	Look, I-I'll give you the money back. Every coin. I'll pay you back and walk away from this.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1694	dorian "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_ddbf5f71		Vasily barked out a laugh.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1696	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_d66f2191	vasily	The prided mercenary of Mjoll, reduced to bargaining over coin? I'll even double your pay. Triple it, if that's what it takes.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1698	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_dc75c972	vasily	Just give us the Prince, and we'll call it even. No hard feelings.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1699	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_a62b022f		Before I could answer, a guttural cry broke the silence.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1701	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_5b201337	svante	That snake of a prince deserves to die!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1703	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_c2a6065d		The violet-haired aldorith stormed forward, his sword drawn, his eyes bloodshot.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1705	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_2b34b08a	svante	Hundreds of innocent people were killed because of the blizzard! Dozens of my brothers and sisters died because of him!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1707	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_824715f6		Tears streaked his face as he pointed his blade toward me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1709	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_3d34c18d	svante	Kill the Prince! Show no mercy!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1711	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_7fc87567	boy_ald_soldier	My brother is right! He killed our family through this blizzard! He deserves to die!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1713	boy_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_2262f27b		A man with striking blue hair stepped forward from the shadows — Niko, in a hooded robe.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1715	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_37814a58	niko	Hey… is it true? The Prince… is he really just a toddler?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1717	niko "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_5bbf0977	vasily	What of it, Prophet?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1718	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_de65660a	niko	It just doesn't add up. I no longer sense the death god's energy here. The presence that once lingered is gone.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1719	niko "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_85bbd4e3	niko	A toddler committing murder? The Queen's death? I examined her body. The wound — it's surgical. Precise. A toddler didn't do this.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1720	niko "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_fc086996		Another robed man rushed forward, grabbing Niko's arm.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1722	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_05b8b629		Prophet: Hehe, forgive my fellow brother in Enoch, Count. He tends to let his curiosity get the better of him.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1724	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_7bb80d72		Prophet: Please, pay him no mind.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1725	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_176a6de4	niko	No. I'm serious. Something doesn't make sense, and—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1727	niko "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_a88bdd73		Without a word, Vasily reached into a pouch at his belt and pulled out a heavy bag of coins, tossing it at the man's feet.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1729	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_35304a76	vasily	Here. Your payment. The services of the death god's Prophets are no longer required.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1731	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_c26a4038	niko	Tsk.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1732	niko "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_e45c2dc4		The other prophet scooped up the coins and bowed deeply.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1734	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_9f5f4966		Prophet: Thank you, Count. May Enoch's blessings be with you. We will trouble you no further. Come, Niko.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1736	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_7c36b480	niko	But brother—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1737	niko "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_d5e1f243		Prophet: You know the First Law of Enoch: 'To hinder death is to defy Him.' We are not to interfere. Not even if the innocent must suffer.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1738	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_287dafbf	niko	I understand, brother. Praise be to His Word.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1739	niko "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_1571bfdc		Prophet: Praise be. Now come. Let us leave this place.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1740	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_93f81c8e		He dragged the blue-haired prophet away, but Niko shot me one last look before disappearing over the crowd.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1742	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_d9dd6fbd		The murmurs among the soldiers grew louder. An aldorith with silver hair stepped forward, her voice trembling but resolute.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1744	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_2fdfaf3d	kristin	Count Vasily… maybe they have a point. If the pieces don't fit, we have a duty to—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1746	kristin "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_8e912361	svante	What are you doing, Kristin?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1747	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_9ef96bd9	kristin	Thinking, Svante, dear brother. For myself. You should try it sometime.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1748	kristin "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_d1c28ac9	svante	Shut it, Kristin! You dare question King Gustav? Our Father?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1749	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_cdc6890b	kristin	Brother, you used to think for yourself. What happened to you? Since when did you let blind faith replace reason?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1750	kristin "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_3372e458	kristin	I was there, Svante. I saw the Queen's body with the prophets. The wound didn't match the story of Father. Don't you see? This isn't right!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1751	kristin "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_ea4afd1a	kristin	Brother, please believe me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1752	kristin "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_c956c4fd	svante	I… I…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1753	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_cea0db56		The air grew colder as Vasily stepped forward, his expression dark.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1755	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_b8e6e94b	vasily	Enough.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1757	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_64515844		He snapped his fingers. Kristin turned to him, her eyes wide with fear.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1759	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_cafa7893	kristin	Count, please. I'm just—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1761	kristin "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_19313c2f		The blade struck her before she could finish. She crumpled to the ground, her blood pooling in the snow.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1769	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_157acdbb	boy_ald_soldier	Done, sir.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1771	boy_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_6e052298	vasily	Any more aldoriths willing to share their dissenting opinion?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1772	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_edc63edd	vasily	Hmph. Your Father never tolerates treason. Remember that.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1773	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_956f2aa4		Svante dropped to his knees beside Kristin's lifeless body, his cries piercing the silence.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1775	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_b202efcc	svante	K-Kristin… No…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1777	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_54f1ac27	kristin	B-Brother… I'm sorry… Tell mother I—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1778	kristin "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_72870578	svante	Kristin! KRISTIN!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1779	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_61272d95		Vasily turned to him, his voice cold.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1781	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_8052cbaa	vasily	It's the Prince's fault, Svante. His crime is sowing doubt on Kristin.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1783	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_163c23d3	svante	K… K-Kristin *cries*	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1784	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_956ea8dc	vasily	If it weren't for him, Kristin would still be alive. King Gustav is right.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1785	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_9602d7eb		Svante's tear-streaked face twisted into a mask of rage.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1787	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_c550aab9	svante	E-Elias… that boy… he's the reason…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1789	svante "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_d41732b2		Vasily turned back to me, his expression softening.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1791	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_0c38e207	vasily	Dorian, think about it. Don't throw everything away for this child. You know how this ends if you don't do the right thing.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1793	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_17bcbffc		He placed a hand on my shoulder, firm yet gentle.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1795	"[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_d6a36e91	vasily	His Majesty hated that you took too long, you know… But I'll make sure King Gustav knows what you've done for him. A fresh start, Dorian. You'll be back in his good graces.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1797	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_537835ce	vasily	A mansion, Dorian. Wealth. Comfort. You don't have to keep running, keep hiding. You've saved me countless times, and I'm here to save you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1798	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_847375fa	vasily	I mean it, Dorian. You're my friend. Don't ruin everything for one child. Let me help you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1799	vasily "[what]"
ch3_vasily_arrives_dc6d1068	vasily	Well, Dorian? What's it going to be?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1800	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_c6f08255		A long silence.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1829	"[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_8c5515ed	dorian	Go ahead. The kid's inside the shack.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1831	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_7b86007d		Vasily smiled.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1833	"[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_ab2b1811	vasily	Aldoriths, go inside and kill the prince. Now.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1835	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_4e33e741	boy_ald_soldier	What? That's it? You're not going to punish this traitor for—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1837	boy_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_ff679a56	vasily	Do it. Now.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1838	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_d60caf8d	boy_ald_soldier	Yes, sir.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1839	boy_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_169e5f3b	girl_ald_soldier	On it, sir!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1840	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_5b5088ec	svante	Leave the prince to me. Kristin… sister… you'll be avenged.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1842	svante "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_4e8f0b4c		Vasily turned to me, his eyes soft.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1844	"[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_84ddb302	vasily	You made the right choice, friend. Now let us take care of business. I'm sure you'd rather… not see how the prince will be dealt with.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1846	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_38e90f08	dorian	Thanks, Vasily.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1848	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_9faf26cf	dorian	No, Vasily. I can't do this. I beg you just… take the coin.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1861	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_33e69ea4	dorian	I'll return every piece the King gave me for this mission. No harm, no foul. We can both walk away from this.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1862	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_ffbc4054	vasily	You don't get it, do you? This isn't about the coin, Dorian. It's about loyalty. It's about trust.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1864	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_ab50a561	vasily	The prince needs to die.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1865	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_5ccd38db	vasily	You're putting me in a bad spot, old friend. I vouched for you. I said you'd get the job done, no questions asked.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1866	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_1f3d66ec	svante	That boy — that prince — is the reason my sister is dead! You're protecting a murderer! You're as guilty as he is!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1868	svante "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_ae8d3d6d	dorian	Look. I beg you. Just take the money. We all can—	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1870	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_47aa840b	elias	Daddy?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1872	elias "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_5e357b5e		My heart dropped. I spun around, and there he was — Elias — standing at the entrance of the shack, clutching Tedda tightly. His small face pale, his wide eyes flicking between me and the soldiers.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1874	"[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_a642cdf7	dorian	Elias! Get back inside! Now!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1876	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_dda360cd		I turned back to Vasily, my hand instinctively moving to the hilt of my blade.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1878	"[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_2d9fa459	dorian	You see? He's just a child, Vasily. Look at him. Does he look like a killer to you?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1880	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_faa2bf28	vasily	The prince needs to die. My loyalty stands with the king.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1882	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_73b5278d	boy_ald_soldier	Long live King Gustav!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1884	boy_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_c7cff2c0	girl_ald_soldier	Long live King Gustav!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1885	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_30e0c3a0	svante	L-Long live King Gustav!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1886	svante "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_4dfe8a0d	dorian	Enough!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1888	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_4584d74f		My shout echoed through the cave, silencing the crowd. I stepped forward, placing myself between Elias and the soldiers.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1890	"[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_0626794d	dorian	If you want him, you'll have to go through me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1892	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_8688bd77	vasily	Don't do this, old friend. You're throwing your life away for a child who doesn't even belong to you. Is it even worth it?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1894	vasily "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_aaeda55a	dorian	Yes. Yes, he is.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1895	dorian "[what]"
ch3_critical_fork_03493beb	vasily	So be it.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1896	vasily "[what]"
ch3_bad_end_8a87743e		Years passed.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1915	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_9ff913b5		Mjoll welcomed me back like a long-lost hero. Vasily was true to his word — he always was. The mansion he promised became mine, a grand, sprawling estate with lush gardens, gilded halls, and guards at every gate.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1916	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_55db3a8e		The missions resumed soon enough.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1917	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_10dd8d11	vasily	You've done well for yourself, my friend. Look at you now. Comfortable, respected… untouchable.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1921	vasily "[what]"
ch3_bad_end_0b45a73c	vasily	Ladies, calm down. This is Dorian, the legendary mercenary of Mjoll you're speaking to!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1922	vasily "[what]"
ch3_bad_end_8d34db3f		But his words rang hollow, like the clinking of glasses in empty halls.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1924	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_a1267487		I never saw Elias again.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1925	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_b799869e		It wasn't hard to imagine where he might've ended up. I stopped asking questions. Stopped wondering. Wondering only made the nights longer.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1926	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_bf324190		As for Yuxuan? I avoided him entirely. The thought of facing him, of seeing the disappointment or anger in his eyes, was unbearable.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1927	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_5868a217		And Elara…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1928	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_4bdb48ae		Would she be proud of me?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1929	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_7a978692		I already knew the answer.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1930	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_28b77c20		The parties became a regular occurrence, each one more extravagant than the last.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1932	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_391302e8	vasily	Another grand event next week, my friend. King Gustav will be there. You'll come, won't you?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1934	vasily "[what]"
ch3_bad_end_6c1bac81	dorian	Of course, Vasily.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1935	dorian "[what]"
ch3_bad_end_c2c86a49		One evening, I left the party early.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1946	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_443d3376		The wind was bitter, cutting through my coat as I stood at the edge of the cliff. Below, the snow stretched endlessly, a vast, frozen wasteland illuminated by the pale light of the moon.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1947	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_8c09c71b		I stared out at the expanse, my mind swirling with memories I could no longer suppress. Elias's innocent smile. Yuxuan's sarcastic quips.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1948	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_0657ba7a		And Elara. Always Elara.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1949	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_e814b0bd		I could almost hear her voice, soft and loving, like it used to be when she whispered my name.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1950	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_f8621886		The snow beneath my boots crunched softly as I took a step closer to the edge.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1955	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_32ab2269	dorian	Elara, I'll see you soon.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1957	dorian "[what]"
ch3_bad_end_60e2feb6		For a moment, everything was silent. The world seemed to hold its breath, waiting.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1959	"[what]"
ch3_bad_end_535d96da		And then I let go.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	1960	"[what]"
