ch3_fight_back_020fb635	elias	N-No! G-Get away! Don't hurt me! *cries*	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2082	elias "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_0f9738f7	niko_raven	Hey, hey. Look at me. See? Just a bird. A talking, friendly bird.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2083	niko_raven "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_e2cdc5eb	elias	A… A bird?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2084	elias "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_1609f8d9	niko_raven	Yes. Talking, friendly, very handsome bird. Came just for you.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2085	niko_raven "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_5b5b2f7a	elias	It… it hurts… I'm scared… I don't wanna die… *cries*	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2086	elias "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_03d1331f	niko_raven	Now where does it hurt?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2087	niko_raven "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_acf4dfe8	elias	M-My tummy… I-It's cold… it's so cold…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2088	elias "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_1b505da6	niko_raven	Then hold this. One of my feathers. See? Strong. Safe.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2089	niko_raven "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_5bda4233	niko_raven	Big bird's going to help you. It might tickle, might sting — but I promise, you'll feel better soon. Bird's honor.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2090	niko_raven "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_0da46a91	elias	*crying*	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2091	elias "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_708f8139	niko_raven	Wait — what's this? Is this your friend?	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2092	niko_raven "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_c3bdcec0	elias	T-Tedda… Her name is Tedda. She's… friend.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2093	elias "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_ece5d787	niko_raven	Tedda, huh? A brave guardian. Good. You hold her tight. You've got her… and now you've got me.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2094	niko_raven "[what]"
ch3_fight_back_0dde9cc5	elias	I… I don't wanna die… like Mommy *cries*	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2095	elias "[what]"
