ch3_escape_76c5f2d4		The door creaked open, and Yuxuan stepped inside. For the first time, it wasn't just his hologram from a supply bot. It was him. In the flesh.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2200	"[what]"
ch3_escape_9c6db7ad		His smile was as warm and earnest as I remembered from the hologram, but seeing him here, in person, was something else entirely.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2201	"[what]"
ch3_escape_22dcc19d		His robes shimmered with an opulent sheen. Deep crimson fabric. The stitching alone probably cost more than I'd made in the last decade.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2202	"[what]"
ch3_escape_ef503d36	elias	Daddy, it's him! Mister Yuxuan!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2204	elias "[what]"
ch3_escape_5403ca95		Behind him, two guards flanked the door, their armor marked with the logo of Cheng Industries.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2206	"[what]"
ch3_escape_a48ea1b5	yuxuan	Thank the Prosperity Dragon I decided to check in. If I hadn't sent the bot when I did…	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2208	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_escape_fc9b9e99		He trailed off, shaking his head.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2210	"[what]"
ch3_escape_3a9df2cc	dorian	Y-Yuxuan.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2212	dorian "[what]"
ch3_escape_e59510b2	dorian	Good to see you in person.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2213	dorian "[what]"
ch3_escape_59b3fcbc	yuxuan	The pleasure's all mine, Dorian! I'm so happy to finally meet you again!	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2214	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_escape_1cbada8c		He glanced toward the driver.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2216	"[what]"
ch3_escape_7926eecf	yuxuan	We're taking you both to Tianho. We'll be hiding there.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2218	yuxuan "[what]"
ch3_escape_9c8dcfda		At the mention of Tianho, something stirred in me. It had been years since I'd set foot there. Elara and my family. It's been a while.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2220	"[what]"
ch3_escape_b2e03658		Elias stirred on the bench, his eyelids fluttering open. His gaze met mine, his small hand reaching out.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2222	"[what]"
ch3_escape_3b99046f	elias	Daddy… I'm happy you're alright.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2224	elias "[what]"
ch3_escape_f77a5bbf		I took his hand, squeezing it gently.	game/05_chapter_03.rpy	2226	"[what]"
