chapter_4_5c5c1b19	king_gustav	Count Vasily… dead.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	196	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_63af2dcf	king_gustav	My right hand man… I… I can't believe this.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	197	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_dcc037b4	king_gustav	And the amulet? Tell me you at least retrieved the damn amulet!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	198	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_6f1270ce	mjoll_lars	N-No, Your Majesty. We searched the site thoroughly, but it… it's gone.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	199	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_4_12a6f474	mjoll_helga	We believe… we believe sir Dor – I mean, Dorian took it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	200	mjoll_helga "[what]"
chapter_4_e4ed64c5	king_gustav	That traitorous snake! After everything I gave him—after all my trust!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	201	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_72708898	king_gustav	How many? How many died?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	202	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_b94b6d5b	mjoll_lars	Nearly all, Your Majesty. We lost nearly the entire battalion.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	203	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_4_46f93d64	king_gustav	By Enoch… Nearly all…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	204	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_e4ef6dfd	mjoll_pavel	Your Majesty… We have the two survivors with us. They're outside.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	207	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
chapter_4_3ebdd598	king_gustav	Send them in.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	208	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_83a03e5b	girl_ald_soldier	It… *crying* It wasn't human… He wasn't human…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	211	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
chapter_4_071c9311	mjoll_lars	Miss, please. Take a breath. Tell us what happened.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	212	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_4_2cddef0f	girl_ald_soldier	Flames… everywhere… He burned them… He burned them all alive!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	213	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
chapter_4_95f232d0	girl_ald_soldier	If I hadn't run… I would have… I would have— I would hav—burned with them! *weeping*	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	214	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
chapter_4_96319a8d	mjoll_pavel	And we have Svante, Your Majesty.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	216	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
chapter_4_c306b573	svante	He's a monster… A massacrer… He… he killed them all…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	219	svante "[what]"
chapter_4_9a314a8c	svante	Count Vasily… Kristin… My brothers… sisters… Everyone… gone… It was a massacre… *weeping*	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	220	svante "[what]"
chapter_4_652b5fe2	king_gustav	I am sorry, my son.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	222	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_5d159583	svante	F-Father…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	223	svante "[what]"
chapter_4_2f5f9953	king_gustav	I've heard troubling whispers. Whispers of your sister—TAINTED by the Prince's lies, doubting me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	225	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_501883ee	svante	Kristin, she—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	226	svante "[what]"
chapter_4_ff11f97f	king_gustav	She deserved her fate. Her death was just. Her betrayal brought shame to you and your ailing mother. Surely it must have pleased you to see her cut down for my name.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	227	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_065086e3	svante	I—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	228	svante "[what]"
chapter_4_bdbef6e4	king_gustav	You are loyal, my son, and for that, you will be rewarded. But I see the grief in your eyes—the weight of Count Vasily and the others lost.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	229	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_e32db3ef	svante	The man… he was surrounded by fire, Father. It was like… it was part of him. He burned everything. Everyone. I barely escaped.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	230	svante "[what]"
chapter_4_c102b9ec	king_gustav	A massacre…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	232	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_b1acf400	girl_ald_soldier	Massacrer… He's a massacrer! *weeping*	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	233	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
chapter_4_520bda17	mjoll_helga	Miss, please calm down.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	234	mjoll_helga "[what]"
chapter_4_1c6cfd4c	king_gustav	Dorian the Dragon of Gale… Now the Massacrer of Mjoll.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	236	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_439a96e1	king_gustav	I want him hunted down. I don't care how many Aldoriths it takes or how long. Find him. Kill him. He is an enemy of this land. Do you hear me?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	237	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_a3903465		Aldoriths: Yes, Father!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	238	"[what]"
chapter_4_0772c90b	svante	Y-Yes, Father…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	239	svante "[what]"
chapter_4_4089d222	messenger	A letter from the Emperor of Kyeongjang, Your Majesty.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	241	messenger "[what]"
chapter_4_9dc3f088	mjoll_pavel	K-Kyeongjang, Your Majesty?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	244	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
chapter_4_97aebd55	king_gustav	Hmm… Fascinating…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	245	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_b64be744	mjoll_pavel	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	246	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
chapter_4_6baeb542	mjoll_helga	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	247	mjoll_helga "[what]"
chapter_4_625cd67e	mjoll_lars	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	248	mjoll_lars "[what]"
chapter_4_936f25c3	svante	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	249	svante "[what]"
chapter_4_a0c63c0e	king_gustav	Forget Dorian. We have a new target.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	251	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_8a7fba89	king_gustav	Aldoriths. Our sights are now set on the Emperor of Kyeongjang.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	252	king_gustav "[what]"
chapter_4_c7fa84d9		Aldoriths: Yes, Father!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	253	"[what]"
