chapter_4_1ade113d	svante	The Empreror of Kyeongjang…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	255	svante "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_05ae08f6		8 months later	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	275	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_edb8ad9d		Somewhere in the Kyeongjang Empire	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	276	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_442a4146		Hyon Chung-hee's POV	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	284	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_db1b4e07		The grand hall was alive with celebration today.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	286	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_dd802796		Though I could not hear the cacophony of cheers or the music of the orchestra, I could feel the energy pulsing through the room. I can hear their thoughts.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	287	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_73e2574b		They were as clear as if spoken aloud.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	288	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_8f086087	servant	Happy birthday, Pyeha. May your days be long and prosperous.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	290	servant "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_6c6228e1	woman_1	Pyeha's birthday… what can we possibly gift someone so divine?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	291	woman_1 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_3dc009e7	man_1	Just focus on your singing. Don't falter. Not today.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	292	man_1 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_dbb48ffc		I sat upon the throne of Kyeongjang, looking at the scrumptious feast laid before me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	294	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_f263ab50		The scent of lotus blossoms and spiced incense permeated the air, mingling with the aroma of roasted pheasants, glazed fruits, and elaborate pastries laid out for the feast.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	297	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_141c2f52		The dancers twirled gracefully before me, their silken robes catching the light with each spin. I watched, entranced, my attention so absorbed that I barely noticed him approaching.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	298	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_513a0e2a		Captain Kang Sunwoo, clad in the pristine silver and navy uniform of the Imperial Guard, bowed low before the throne, his posture respectful and precise.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	300	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_54d9fd2a	captain_sunwoo	Pyeha, I humbly wish you a most joyous birthday. May your reign continue to bring light and prosperity to Kyeongjang for many decades to come.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	304	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_c6c3e28e	chung_hee	Captain Sunwoo, I appreciate your words. Please, enjoy the feast. It is as much for you as it is for me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	305	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_9d03fab1		He hesitated for a moment, his sharp eyes flickering.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	307	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_11f8d17f	captain_sunwoo	Pyeha, forgive me for addressing you on such a day of celebration, but I must say this—things are looking brighter for Kyeongjang.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	309	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_c7d78d6f	captain_sunwoo	Trade has flourished within our borders, and our crops yield twice what they did last year. Under your divine hand, the people see you as their protector, their guiding light.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	310	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_4a4f21af	captain_sunwoo	The Tetrad themselves could not have chosen a better ruler.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	311	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_4359ac4e		Before I could respond, another figure stepped forward—Ya Ji-hye, my royal advisor. She was a woman of middle age, her hair streaked with silver, her demeanor sharp and dignified. She bowed deeply, her head nearly touching the floor.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	313	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_ab62163e	ji_hye	Pyeha, on this most auspicious day, I offer my humblest and most heartfelt birthday wishes. May your reign be eternal, and may Kyeongjang continue to prosper under your divine leadership.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	317	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_745994ec	ji_hye	You are the pillar of this empire, the sun that shines upon its people.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	318	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_8f7292f6		I inclined my head, granting her silent permission to continue. Satisfied, she bowed once more and retreated into the crowd.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	320	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_12b5afa6		Next, Park Dae-hyun, Head of Infrastructure, approached. He was a man of practicality, his hands calloused from years of overseeing the empire's great projects. His bow was deep and deliberate.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	321	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_671394eb	dae_hyun	Pyeha, I too wish you the happiest of birthdays. May your wisdom guide Kyeongjang for generations to come.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	323	dae_hyun "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_24ad287d		Beyond my advisors, I felt the pulse of the celebration itself. Courtiers raised their cups in my honor, their thoughts brimming with admiration and awe.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	325	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_a8dd3985	courtier_1	To Pyeha, the living embodiment of Kyeongjang's strength!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	327	courtier_1 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_b0d0ece6	courtier_2	The Emperor's wisdom surpasses all. He is untouchable. Eternal.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	328	courtier_2 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_58d811be		And as is tradition, a song filled the hall, sung by a chorus of voices, though I could not hear it. Still, their thoughts resonated in my mind like a hymn:	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	330	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_ccae5ddc		You are untouchable. Eternal. A god among men.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	333	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_90091234	captain_sunwoo	Pyeha, the people adore you. Kyeongjang grows stronger with each passing day under your rule. You are their guiding star	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	335	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_e832b462	ji_hye	Pyeha has done what other kingdoms could not. Kyeongjang is self-made, unshaken by the tragedy of Tianho.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	336	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_b9e09a04		Upon the mention of the tragedy of Tianho, I could see the unease in their thoughts.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	338	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_9d3110d5	woman_1	The tragedy of Tianho… it all began when they tried to reconnect with the world. Look where it led them.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	340	woman_1 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_3a40c27e	man_1	(thinking): Kyeongjang cannot make the same mistake. Pyeha must keep us strong and protected.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	341	man_1 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_1f87cc6b	man_2	(thinking): The world beyond Kyeongjang brought only ruin to Tianho. Our Lord Emperor won't let that happen to us.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	342	man_2 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_93c7abfb	vendor	Your Majesty, Tianho was mighty, but their trust in outsiders doomed them. Let us not follow their folly. Kyeongjang is strong because we are self-sufficient. The outside world offers nothing but danger!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	343	vendor "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_46262737	courtier_1	Our beloved pyeha and pyeha-sshi died because of those outside infidels!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	344	courtier_1 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_ee056e20	courtier_2	The gates of Kyeongjang must remain closed, Pyeha. We cannot let history repeat itself.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	345	courtier_2 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_aee6b1ea	captain_sunwoo	Silence! All of you!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	347	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_5ac89d9b	ji_hye	This is Pyeha's birthday. Let us focus on the celebration and leave those negative thoughts behind.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	348	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_8fe5a138		I rose slowly from my throne, my gaze sweeping over them—advisors, merchants, courtiers, and guards.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	350	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_fcbbceaf	chung_hee	The tragedy of Tianho is a lesson carved into history, one that I have not forgotten. The loss of our beloved pyeha and pyeha-sshi serves as a reminder of the dangers of trust misplaced and gates left unguarded. But hear me now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	352	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_0e33a5d8	chung_hee	Kyeongjang is not Tianho. Their choices, their fate—it is not ours to share. We have moved past the mistakes of the past. We are stronger, wiser, and more unified than they ever were. We are self-sufficient. We do not need the outside world to prosper.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	353	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_7b6312ff		I saw the crowd listening as I continued.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	355	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_306a3bf6	chung_hee	The past is in the past. We will not dwell in the shadows of fear or doubt. Under my reign, Kyeongjang will remain untouchable. Eternal. A beacon of strength and prosperity.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	357	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_0ad3b3a6	chung_hee	We will never commune with outsiders. That is a promise.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	358	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_cde88c82	vendor	You are right, Pyeha. Kyeongjang needs no one else. We are strong because of you.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	360	vendor "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_4967b4d5	courtier_1	To Pyeha, the unshakable ruler of Kyeongjang!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	361	courtier_1 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_65403fd4	courtier_2	The past is in the past! To our Emperor!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	364	courtier_2 "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_919283c0		I lifted my cup, keeping my gaze fixed on them.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	366	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_a0be26b5	chung_hee	Raise your cups, my people. Let this day not only celebrate my birth but also the unwavering strength of our empire. Together, we move forward. Together, we endure. Together, we thrive.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	368	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_5868761a		I felt the hall erupting in cheers.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	370	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_0b26e9fa	captain_sunwoo	And now, we celebrate! Long live pyeha!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	372	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_35a1258c		10 hours later…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	394	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_9f095e88		The festivities had passed in a blur of music, laughter, and endless praise. When the final toast was raised and the last firework faded into the obsidian sky, the grand hall grew silent, leaving only echoes of the revelry behind.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	396	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_a4a9d079		The empire slept. The clock struck ten.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	397	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_fe1b661e		It's time.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	398	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_7c2299d6		The room I entered was dark, lit only by the pale moonlight filtering through a small, barred window high above. Shelves lined the walls, filled with dusty tomes, crates of sealed scrolls. The air was heavy with the scent of aged parchment and old wood.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	400	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_c8460a31		My steps were deliberate, echoing softly against the stone floor as I approached the center of the room. There it was—a chest, simple in design but bound with golden filigree that glimmered faintly in the moonlight.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	401	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_56af76d3		I knelt before it, the cold seeping into my knees.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	403	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_fd9963d2	chung_hee	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	405	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_81531f90		My hand hesitated over the latch for only a moment before I pushed it open. Inside lay one thing—the amulet.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	407	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_a65a1b9f		I reached for it, my hand steady, and lifted it from its resting place. The emerald-green gem seemed almost alive, its surface impossibly smooth and gleaming as though it held its own pulse. Around the gem, intricate golden runes spiraled outward.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	408	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_e75e826a		The moment it touched my hand, the amulet's glow intensified, casting an ethereal green light that bathed the room.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	412	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_d52917da		I held it before me, trapping my eyes with its green glow. I held it for a long time.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	413	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_fa4e0e98	chung_hee	Mother… Father…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	415	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_c88a8963		Then another thought, sharp and resolute, pierced through the haze of my mind.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	418	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_e284e8d1	chung_hee	I know you're there.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	420	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_b033b343	ji_hye	?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	422	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_6a245925		Her silhouette slowly emerged from the darkness. My royal advisor, Ya Ji-Hye.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	424	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_cc34e1ec		Her face was pale in the moonlight. She clutched the folds of her robes tightly, her shoulders tense as though bracing herself.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	425	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_eecddd82	ji_hye	P-Pyeha… forgive my intrusion. I… I cannot stop you, can I?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	427	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_809f071f		I turned to face her fully, the amulet's light glinting off my robes.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	429	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_afe2d808	chung_hee	You cannot stop the Emperor Lord, Royal Advisor.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	431	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_3f19e539		Her breath hitched, and I can see her composure faltering for the briefest of moments. But she steadied herself, bowing deeply.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	433	"[what]"
