ch4_kyeongjang_night_031d1e2b	ji_hye	Kyeongjang? Or is it just you, Pyeha? Is it your vengeance that drives you—not the empire's? Please… just leave the past behind! I beg you!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	437	ji_hye "[what]"
