ch4_kyeongjang_night_427f390c	ji_hye	All the more reason for you not to go. Please, Chung…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	467	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_eb69e865		Her tears stained the stone beneath her, and I could see her breaking—truly breaking before me. I knelt before her. The glow of the amulet painted the streaks of her tears in green.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	469	"[what]"
