ch4_kyeongjang_night_6a31a511		Her expression faltered, and she bowed her head.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	495	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_a631a0c2	ji_hye	I… yes, Chung. I was worried. I thought perhaps he could change your mind.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	497	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_7e57fada		A sigh escaped me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	499	"[what]"
