ch4_kyeongjang_night_13e5c429		She surprised me then, wrapping her arms around me in an embrace.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	504	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_4e90dc28	ji_hye	Then I will stay. If I cannot stop you, at least let me see you off.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	506	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_23286108		I rested a hand on her back for a short while.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	508	"[what]"
