ch4_kyeongjang_night_11145f40		She opened her mouth, trying to say something. She hesitated, but I heard her thought – 'That's what pyeha and pyeha-sshi said when they went to Tianho. Five years ago…'	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	536	"[what]"
ch4_kyeongjang_night_aa52aa2c		The captain will be coming. I could sense that she really wanted me to stay, and it gave me pause. The captain could potentially cross paths with me if I stayed. He can't stop me, but it'll save me precious time by explaining myself.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	537	"[what]"
