ch4_chunghee_qtc_9f24080a		I focused, my mind reaching outward, weaving through the threads of energy. With deliberate precision, I channeled my power, bending the perception of those around me. Slowly, my form shimmered, then vanished completely.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	580	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_1d8be97e	ji_hye	Chung?! Chung, where are you?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	582	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_01d32329		She stepped forward, her hands grasping at the empty air.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	584	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_251f51cb	ji_hye	No… no, no, no! He's gone… he's really gone!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	586	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_8ed92cef		Her knees gave way, and she collapsed to the cold stone floor, sobbing.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	588	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_6fa35eb3	ji_hye	Why, Chung? Why couldn't you listen to me? Why couldn't you stay?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	590	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_3f7b7b1a		Her thoughts were a blur. Panic. Loss.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	592	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_41cb4365		Captain Sunwoo stepped into the room, his sharp gaze immediately taking in Ji-Hye's crumpled form.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	593	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_3537dc62	captain_sunwoo	Ji-hye-nim, what's happened?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	595	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_6b9577cb		She looked up at him, her face streaked with tears.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	598	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_8a59b9ad	ji_hye	He's gone… He left us, Sunwoo! He's gone to the outside lands. I tried to stop him, but he wouldn't listen… and now he's gone, just like Pyeha and Pyeha-sshi…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	600	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_147fb9b8		She cried, burying her face in her hands.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	602	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_d61ad2d9		Sunwoo knelt beside her, his expression softening as he placed a steady hand on her shoulder.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	603	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_878efa1e	captain_sunwoo	Ji-hye-nim, I'm sorry. I should've arrived sooner… this isn't your fault. You did everything you could.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	605	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_edd45113	ji_hye	He's my nephew, Sunwoo. My family. And I couldn't save him. I couldn't save any of them!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	606	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_041bdbaa		The Captain tightened his grip on her shoulder, his voice low and firm.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	608	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_88132b75	ji_hye	What will I tell Jong-hee when he wakes up in the hospital? What will I say when he asks where his brother is? He would be…*crying*	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	610	ji_hye "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_38332be8		For a fleeting moment, I almost stepped forward, my body tense and my heart aching at the sight of her crumpled form. But then the amulet in my hand pulsed, its emerald glow casting its light over the dim room.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	612	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_7a361c60		I have to finish this.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	613	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_0b2affb8	captain_sunwoo	Pyeha is strong. He's stubborn, yes, but he's strong. We must trust that he knows what he's doing.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	615	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_a0e932c4	captain_sunwoo	Come, Ji-Hye-nim. Let's get you out of here. It's late, but I know of a small vendor near the palace that serves steaming bowls of spicy kimchi jjigae.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	616	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_1cf8ade4	captain_sunwoo	A good meal might help calm your mind.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	617	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
