ch4_chunghee_qtc_1a3c8f61	captain_sunwoo	It's Kyeongjang, Ji-hye-nim. There's always someone open. And I'm told this place also makes the best bindaetteok to pair with it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	619	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_d69294fe	ji_hye	*sniffling* You're persistent, Captain Sunwoo… but thank you. I… I appreciate it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	620	ji_hye "[what]"
