ch4_chunghee_qtc_831e80f2	captain_sunwoo	Let's go. You need warmth, and you won't find it here in this cold room.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	624	captain_sunwoo "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_b3e25686		They began to leave, walking away with Aunt holding his arm.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	626	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_1d807e07		Left alone, I emerged from the shadows where I had been standing invisibly. My hands tightened around the glowing amulet.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	627	"[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_7538fd3c	chung_hee	Aunt… I'm so sorry. Please forgive me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	629	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_chunghee_qtc_f5021876		I sighed, letting my shoulders relax slightly.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	638	"[what]"
