ch4_cemetery_0e93fbfb_2		Tedda: …	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1004	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_964ad71a		I couldn't help but sigh as I approached him.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1006	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_5d301664	dorian	Elias, you're not supposed to sit on top of gravestones. Get down from there.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1008	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_84de71d4		Elias instinctively looked up at me. He cuddled his teddy bear, Tedda, close. He jumped from his perch and walked up to me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1010	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_7b7b3e4e	elias	Oh… Daddy, are you finished already?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1012	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_c834af74	dorian	Yeah. I'm done. Where's Yuxuan? Why aren't you guys at our agreed spot?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1013	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_d945c8a1		I crouched down, brushing some dirt off his cheek.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1015	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_b838aa8a	dorian	Yeah, I'm done. But Elias, this is a place of respect. We don't sit on gravestones, alright?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1017	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_bde95c03	elias	Oh… sorry, daddy.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1018	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_30d118e4		I scanned the area, my gaze landing on Yuxuan a little distance away. He was deep in conversation, gesturing with his usual authority as he discussed something I couldn't quite hear at first.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1020	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_91c86036		I took Elias's hand, his tiny fingers wrapping tightly around mine as he skipped beside me, Tedda swinging from his other hand.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1021	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_baddc05b		As we got closer, Yuxuan's voice became clear, his commanding tone filling the air.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1022	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_f4784968	yuxuan	Gentlemen, I appreciate your insights on the new propulsion system. It's a promising concept, and I look forward to our continued collaboration.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1024	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_55002217		He adjusted a sleek communication device on his wrist before continuing.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1026	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_fa453552	yuxuan	But I need to make sure that the team will be performing properly. Can I count on that, Mr. Diagro? Meeting deadlines is not an unreasonable expectation.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1028	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_338c917d	yuxuan	This new invention has the potential to make a positive impact, to improve lives. I believe it's our responsibility to share it with the world, to make a difference.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1031	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_24ec533b	yuxuan	The propulsion system needs to be launched next month. That's an order, Ms. Ara.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1032	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_467f32e3		I glanced down at Elias, whose eyes were wide with curiosity, though I could tell he didn't understand half of what Yuxuan was saying.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1034	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_d146face	dorian	Elias, how long have you been separated from Yuxuan?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1036	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_5f126d79		Elias tilted his head, biting his lip as if deep in thought. He lifted his hand, struggling to count on his tiny fingers. He scrunched up his face, clearly losing track. He gave up and hugged Tedda.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1038	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_74e0e407	elias	A lot, daddy. Mister Yuxuan was talking for a lot of minutes.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1040	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_e32c78e3	dorian	I see. So, he's been at it for a while now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1041	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_7f092694		Elias nodded enthusiastically, holding Tedda up as if the bear could confirm his statement.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1043	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_659ff208		I stood there for a moment, watching Yuxuan in his element. The conversation seemed intense, and I wondered how much longer it would take.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1044	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_63558278		He had always told me to interrupt him if his discussions dragged on, but I didn't want to come across as rude—not when he was clearly dealing with something important.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1045	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_f0ab5aee		I can give him a few more minutes. It's not like we're in a rush. Elias seems content enough for now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1066	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_d1abac32	yuxuan	Look, I understand your concerns, and they are VALID, but I firmly believe that the market is ready for this innovation. We can't afford to have any more delays.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1068	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_a0d3abc4	yuxuan	But nothing! Risks are inherent in any endeavor, but we've mitigated them to the best of our abilities. We owe it to ourselves and to Ena to move forward.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1069	yuxuan "[what]"
