ch4_yuxuan_convo_0e93fbfb		Tedda: …	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1116	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_a85edae2	yuxuan	I already told you, Jane! Get it done by the end of your shift! Is that too much to ask? We can't afford to have another delay, I told you!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1118	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_7f2d7d71	yuxuan	We need to get those propulsion systems on the market as soon as possible! You have a secretary, right? Go and ask her for help!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1119	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_4ef1504b		Elias frowned.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1121	"[what]"
