ch4_yuxuan_convo_a207d38f		I pinched the bridge of my nose, trying not to laugh.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1125	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_88fcdbad	dorian	It's okay, Elias. It's not your fault. He's busy.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1127	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_0007db98		But Elias wasn't about to give up so easily. His eyes lit up with a new idea, and he pointed toward a nearby gravestone adorned with beautiful flowers.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1129	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_1f19bfda	elias	Daddy! Tedda and me will give him flowers! Pretty flowers! Look over there!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1131	elias "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_f0297335		Before I could say a word, Elias bolted toward the gravestone with his tiny feet pattering against the ground.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1133	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_1dccb9c5		The tag on the flowers read: Rest in Peace, Mom.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1134	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_7bc5bc44		I hurried after him, catching him just as he reached for the vibrant blooms. Gently, I took his little hand before he could pick any.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1137	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_65908796	dorian	Elias, no. We can't just pick flowers from a gravestone. That's bad.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1139	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_506c665d	elias	Oh… sorry, daddy. We'll just continue waving then.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1140	elias "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_ebd1f2ad		Without a care in the world, he cheerfully continues to wave the toy's hands. Charming, but definitely not getting Yuxuan's attention. Why did I even ask for his help?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1142	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_cbdf6934		He told me to step in when this happens. I might as well remind him that we're waiting.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1151	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_9f8109f2		Approaching Yuxuan, I waited for a brief pause in his conversation, and then I cleared my throat to ensure I had his attention.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1152	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_e5ee4006	dorian	Yuxuan. Yuxuan?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1154	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_afde5f74	yuxuan	Jane, I won't ask again. Get it done and send it to him. No excuses.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1155	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_a0d3d2ee	dorian	Yuxuan. Hey, I'm finished.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1156	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_13d72016		As I interrupted Yuxuan, he felt relieved. His face lit up with a smile as he turned to his device.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1158	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_convo_00e4e842	yuxuan	I must step away for a moment. Jane, I trust that you will take charge of the meeting… Huh? Of course it's you! Do you see any other Janes in there?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1160	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_8c302d53		Yuxuan hung up his communication device with a soft sigh, fiddling with it briefly before slipping it into his robe pocket. He gave me a sheepish smile.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1168	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_0d20a9fe		I chuckled, shaking my head.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1169	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_e90b868c	yuxuan	Dorian, buddy, sorry for the spectacle. Are you finished? How was it?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1171	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_93a87cd2	dorian	Don't mention it, Yu. And… yeah, I'm done. It felt nice, actually. It's been a long time since I've been able to visit my family. Thank you for bringing us here.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1172	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_e5c60320	dorian	And I saw what you did with the flowers. It means a lot.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1173	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_c8cd68d0	dorian	You've already done so much for me. For us. And about the gravesite fees… I'll pay you back. If I can do chores, or help with anything—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1174	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_0b02d4e1		He waved a hand dismissively.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1176	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_7db45139	yuxuan	No, no, no! Pleasure's all mine, Dorian. It's the least I can do since you've saved me during the tragedy.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1179	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_06bb0048	yuxuan	And… we're friends. It's an honor for me to be there for you.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1180	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_a7b86c63	dorian	Th-Thank you, Yu. I appreciate it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1181	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_1ea1ce29	yuxuan	Anyway, I think it's time for us to go. Before we leave, however, I suggest we try those treats from Hinami. Elias, do you like treats?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1182	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_144790bc	elias	Treats?! Candies?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1183	elias "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_9bc48011	yuxuan	Well, treats, yes. But they're not candies. They're delectable treats from the Hinami booth here. They're fish treats- considering the ingredients—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1184	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_c3f59de8		As Yuxuan continued speaking, I noticed a growing number of people entering the cemetery. They moved in coordinated lines, their armor gleaming in the sunlight and marked with the unmistakable emblem of the Mjoll kingdom.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1186	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_771fc072		What in Tetrad's name are they doing here? Are they here for me? For Elias?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1187	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_f5244b71	yuxuan	Come, I'll show you where to booth is. Let's go. You'll love them!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1189	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_6bd10cb7	dorian	Wait, Yu—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1190	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_56d8c557	svante	Excuse me, civilians. You need to get away from this place as soon as possible. It's not safe here.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1192	svante "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_c4f382df		A strangely familiar young man approached us, his brushed-up hair was of the color violet, matching his armor.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1194	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_52d83971		Svante. An aldorith from Mjoll.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1195	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_f13833dc		I instinctively turned Elias away, hoping Svante wouldn't recognize us. As he approached, his voice was firm but respectful.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1196	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_df26a635	yuxuan	What? What do you mean it's not safe? This is a cemetery. Why would we need to leave?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1198	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_0d6ab312	svante	As I've said, sir. It's not safe. Please leave immediately.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1199	svante "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_0607bc9c	yuxuan	No. And who are YOU to tell us to leave? There better be a good reason for this!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1200	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_b9bdef0c	svante	Sir, by the order of king Gustav, civilians must evacuate the premises as soon as possible. It's for your own safety.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1201	svante "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_b94174e9	yuxuan	King Gustav? King Gustav has no jurisdiction here. This is Tianho! What in Ena's name are you talking about?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1202	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_1b0a0aaf	svante	Sir, please… this is for your own safety. We don't want you to get involved.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1203	svante "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_0d02aa06		I kept my head bowed, tightening my grip on Elias's hand. His little fingers curled into mine as Tedda dangled limply in his grasp.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1205	"[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_fa120e5c	dorian	Thank you for the warning. We'll heed your advice and leave immediately. Which exit should we take?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1208	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_ea270487	svante	Please exit through the main gate—the way you came. But hurry. There isn't much time.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1209	svante "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_36b1fae0	yuxuan	No, we're not going anywhere without those damned treats—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1210	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_b945cd6d	dorian	Yu, let's just go. Please. Come on. Elias.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1211	dorian "[what]"
ch4_yuxuan_common_1a45579c	elias	Oh… Okay, daddy.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1212	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_03752d4f		We hurriedly made our way through the cemetery gates. We could see people doing the same – scrambling to get out.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1232	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_c08f4922		We exited the gate, and Yuxuan is mad – furious, even.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1233	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_a0cf3355	yuxuan	This is preposterous! I am Cheng Yuxuan, an inventor of great renown! I've contributed to the advancement of technology in countless kingdoms! And yet, here I am, herded out of a cemetery like some common criminal!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1235	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_1849e7a0		I sighed, trying to keep my tone calm as I responded.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1237	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_dc585dcd	dorian	We're not being treated like common criminals, Yu. Calm down.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1239	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_d5e5c3bc	yuxuan	My work has changed lives, improved industries, and brought prosperity to this land! I've dedicated myself to progress, and now I'm being treated like some kind of threat? This is absolutely outrageous!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1240	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_97d0ce51		Elias clung to my hand, his little giggles bubbling up despite the situation. He hugged Tedda close, whispering something to her while sneaking amused glances at Yuxuan.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1242	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_68308467		I stepped closer, placing a firm hand on Yuxuan's shoulder to steady him. His rant came to an abrupt halt, and I noticed his cheeks flush an intense shade of crimson.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1243	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_e49b8710	yuxuan	…?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1245	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_e42f598e		He looked at me, wide-eyed, almost frozen in place.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1247	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_6d4a838c	dorian	Yu, calm yourself. We're going to be fine. Let's just go home.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1249	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_4781e8fb		Yuxuan blinked rapidly, his face growing even redder as he stumbled over his words.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1251	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_4f41d90d	yuxuan	Ah. Um... Hehe, okay. T-Thank you, Dorian. I... Uh… appreciate your support. You always know how to, um, calm my nerves.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1253	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_6193a16e	dorian	Yu, are you okay? You seem... flustered.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1254	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_66d23063	elias	Mister Yuxuan, your face matches Tedda's color!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1255	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_784c9682	yuxuan	Wh-What?! No!!! I—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1256	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_775c762d	dorian	Come on. Let's keep moving.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1259	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_be4e8cdb	yuxuan	You're right. Let's go.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1260	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_5492a5c0	niko	You're kicking us out of here?! We have every right to be here!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1265	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_35872c26	svante	Sir, please understand. This is for your safety. I must insist—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1266	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_268ecaee	prophet	Safety? SAFETY?! We're here because we have brothers who died during the tragedy! This is sacred ground! How dare you kick us out?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1267	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_4f63c3e9	svante	With all due respect, sir, this isn't my choice. These are orders. I assure you, this is for your own protection—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1268	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_12b7fe3a	tian_xun	Protection? Bah! These fools don't deserve protection, Svante. If they won't leave willingly, I'll personally show them the consequences of disobedience!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1269	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_1eca4eca	svante	S-Sir—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1270	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f4c09cfd	tian_xun	I could clear this whole area with one of my beauties, you know. One boom, and everyone's gone! It'd be a lesson in obedience, wouldn't it?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1271	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_aac15891	svante	Sir Tian Xun. Please, that won't be necessary. Our goal was to—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1272	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_ca8dc62d	tian_xun	Oh, but think of the possibilities, Svante! A controlled explosion right here and now—imagine it! One boom, and they'll scatter like frightened mice. Gustav would love it! BOOM! BOOM!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1273	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_c78dcf71	niko	You've got to be kidding me. This lunatic works for Gustav? No wonder things are a mess.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1274	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_efa76b61	prophet	Lunatic, indeed. You shame the name of Tianho, Tian Xun. I pity your parents. To see you now… what grief they must bear.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1275	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_50c7ba8a	tian_xun	Ashamed? HAHAHAHA! My parents were nobodies! Farmers!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1276	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_3e8a703d	tian_xun	What did they ever give me except poverty and a back-breaking life, old fool? Gustav gave me wealth, power, and the means to create. Go, my beauties! BOOM! BOOM!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1277	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_3b0d4682	tian_xun	They should be proud of me! But enough talk—get out before I decide to test my newest invention right here.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1278	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_eeb560da	tian_xun	GET OUT! OUT, OUT, OUT! BEFORE I GO BOOM!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1279	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_41197260	niko	Tsk…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1280	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_5ac75ce0	prophet	Come, brother Niko. There is no reasoning with this one. Let us go for now. But mark my words, this is far from over.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1281	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_0fd17c31	svante	I… I'm sorry.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1282	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_90cf908e	tian_xun	Run! Run, little lambs! HAHAHA!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1283	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_2d287f66	tian_xun	Now come, Svante. We've got such lovely things to test today… Ooh!! I'm getting twitchy, temperamental, and itching to blow!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1286	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_2b531d6c	tian_xun	Hehehe~	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1287	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_5b6b9a3d	prophet	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1292	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_0ea52dd7	niko	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1293	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_ea3ade6f	prophet	… Brother Niko?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1294	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_75a86d50	niko	Kaito… Please forgive me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1295	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f1994953	prophet	Do not let this trouble you too deeply, brother Niko. Your brother's grave will still be here tomorrow. Nothing can take that away.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1296	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_5159e404	niko	I hope so.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1297	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_5927e236	prophet	He knows, Niko. Kaito knows. The love you share transcends these fleeting moments. He understands far more than you give him credit for.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1298	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_a5753171	elias	Daddy, what about the treats?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1300	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_fd780263	dorian	Let's get treats later when we get home. Come on.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1301	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f2e4abe9	niko	Hmm…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1303	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_186d733b	prophet	What is it, brother Niko?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1304	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f34d6925	niko	Hmm… that toy… I remember…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1305	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_98b39998	niko	Tedda… Wait, does that mean that the child is… Elias?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1306	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_35c60ff5	prophet	Elias? From Mjoll? Impossible. That boy was struck down by an arrow. We saw it with our own eyes!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1307	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_15c5fb52	niko	Enoch probably intervened.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1308	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_5c99c2e6	niko	And that means that man with the child… is Dorian.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1309	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_1855ac46	prophet	Dorian… Ex-paladin Dorian… By Enoch, you're right! I did not recognize him with that new hairstyle.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1310	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_7c7397c3	niko	The Dragon of Gale…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1311	niko "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_e87dc0a4	prophet	What are they doing here?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1312	prophet "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_531696f6		The area was crowded with people—more and more of them rushing hurriedly away, their faces painted with unease.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1314	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_22c44598	yuxuan	What is going on? Why is everyone acting like this?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1317	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_e5f0dd50	dorian	Mjoll… What are they up to now?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1318	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_28109b7c		Yuxuan rolled his eyes, fiddling with his communication device.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1320	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_ca811a41	yuxuan	This is intolerable. I'm calling for our carriage. We're leaving this madhouse at once.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1322	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_71cd0bca	girl_ald_soldier	WAIT! HE KNOWS!! HE'S GETTING AWAY!! AFTER HIM, NOW!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1324	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_2ad7304a	tian_xun	What?! HE'S GETTING AWAY?! Bahaha, not on my watch! Fire the beauty—FIRE HER NOW!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1325	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_fb450b9a	elias	Fire? What are they firing, daddy?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1327	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_bc85d317	yuxuan	What are they talking about?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1328	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_3cb4a92f		-EXPLOSION-	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1332	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_3630f02d		Before any of us could comprehend what was happening, a deafening BOOM shattered the air. The shockwave hit us first, followed by the searing heat of the explosion.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1334	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_bd81fe63		The ground trembled violently beneath our feet as dirt and debris rained down from the blast.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1335	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_3630f02d_1		Before any of us could comprehend what was happening, a deafening BOOM shattered the air. The shockwave hit us first, followed by the searing heat of the explosion.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1336	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_bd81fe63_1		The ground trembled violently beneath our feet as dirt and debris rained down from the blast.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1337	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_a482941f	yuxuan	By the Prosperity Dragon! What was that?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1339	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_3694915b		Then… a voice boomed inside my head.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1341	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_ce362d55	chung_hee	People of Tianho! I have been tricked by Mjoll! They've ambushed me—please, I need aid!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1343	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_b3c86347	yuxuan	Wait—I can hear it! I can hear his voice!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1345	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_efc2eeed	elias	Daddy… can you hear it too? What's happening?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1346	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_558ad687		I nodded grimly, gripping Elias's hand tighter.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1348	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_91146bbe	woman_1	The man is asking for aid! But I can't stay here! I have children—I have to get home!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1350	woman_1 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_8501dd5f	man_1	Have you seen the number of soldiers here? I'm not risking my family for this!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1351	man_1 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_581bfdc1	man_2	Not my fight! I'm sorry, but I'm not dying today!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1352	man_2 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_3d1337a6		Despite the desperate plea ringing in our minds, the people around us fled without hesitation	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1354	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_6c8010f0	chung_hee	Someone! Anyone! If you have honor, hear me! I seek only the king of Mjoll—this is my last warning. I do not wish to harm innocents!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1360	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_e59279d7	aoi	Such powerful mind channeling…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1361	aoi "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_ac704846	tian_xun	Honor?! HAHAHA! Don't make me laugh! Someone like YOU, scot-free after MY masterpiece?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1364	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_aff56c74	tian_xun	Impossible! A miscalculation like this… it's infuriating! You should've been a pile of ash by now! How did you survive, huh?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1365	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_89c3c314	tian_xun	What you need is another! Another! BOOM! BOOM!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1366	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_94e121bf	aoi	Tian Xun, enough! The last thing we need is another one of your wasted bombs.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1367	aoi "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_74211dce	tian_xun	Grr…. You're no fun, Aoi.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1368	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_b9b5adbc	aoi	Aldoriths, form up! His barriers won't last long. He's already at his limit.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1369	aoi "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_82e6a508	chung_hee	This is your last chance! I have no quarrel with you. I seek only your king. Stand aside, and no harm will come to you.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1371	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_d34e12cc	mjoll_lars	Your fight with our king is OUR fight, you fool. Do you think you can just waltz in and demand a duel?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1373	mjoll_lars "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_058842cb	mjoll_helga	We've been waiting for a real fight. Your 'honor' doesn't scare us, Emperor. You'll die here like the rest of your kind.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1374	mjoll_helga "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_39a2750d	mjoll_pavel	You're outnumbered, outclassed, and out of luck. It's time you joined your ancestors.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1375	mjoll_pavel "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_936f25c3	svante	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1377	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_ea13045e	boy_ald_soldier	Your blood will stain the land, Emperor! For Father!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1378	boy_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_b8397030	svante	No… No, this isn't right.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1379	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_b55d08c2	girl_ald_soldier	What?! What did you say?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1380	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_9b3980a5	svante	This man doesn't want to harm us! He's asking for a duel—he's giving us a chance to avoid more bloodshed! Please, don't let this end like this!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1381	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_62996a4d	mjoll_lars	Are you… are you siding with him? You'd betray your own people?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1382	mjoll_lars "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_6a1dc225	svante	No! I'm trying to stop more deaths! This man hasn't done anything wrong!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1383	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_53eaecc1	svante	Father said that the Emperor is a dishonorable man who murders and kills innocents. Look at him! He's offering us peace! Will a dishonorable man do that?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1384	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_cbcef49d	aoi	Bold of an aldorith to have an opinion. Your Father will know about this.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1385	aoi "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_1507a0ae	boy_ald_soldier	You really want to end up like your sister Kristin, huh? Dead for nothing?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1386	boy_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_225913ae	svante	All I'm saying is that this isn't the Emperor of Kyeongjang! He's far from him!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1387	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f4899a4b	tian_xun	Oh, how touching! A traitor among the righteous. Let's see how your little 'peace talk' works against THIS!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1388	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f5bee987	aoi	Tian Xun, stop! That's the last bomb we have!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1389	aoi "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_3cb4a92f_1		-EXPLOSION-	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1393	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_24dfbb1c	tian_xun	HAHAHAHA! BOOM! BOOM!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1396	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_bf4268a3	mjoll_helga	The barrier… it's still there!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1397	mjoll_helga "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_97d4a16c	chung_hee	I didn't come here to spill blood. But if you force my hand…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1398	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_19967b71	aoi	Tsk! We wasted the last bomb because of you, Tian Xun! Aldoriths—kill him!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1399	aoi "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_2aefb694	tian_xun	KILL BOTH OF THEM! LET BOTH OF THEIR HEADS BE MOUNTED ON A SPIKE!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1400	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_1f3c1278	tian_xun	CHARGE!! CHA- *coughs* CHARGE!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1401	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_72f68b9f	svante	Sir! What should we do?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1402	svante "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_7283fc91	chung_hee	Run… Leave this place. You're not like them.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1403	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f43f7966		The ground trembled beneath us as the second explosion ripped through the air, sending debris flying in every direction. People screamed and scattered.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1407	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_b67ed5d4		I grabbed Elias's hand tightly as we ran, Yuxuan leading the way with his communication device pressed against his ear.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1408	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_5dde1111	yuxuan	The carriage! It's here—it's at the front gate! But it can't get through!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1410	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_651cb253		Elias stumbled.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1412	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_9b39f4c0	elias	Tedda! I dropped Tedda!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1414	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f93ede46		He turned back, tears welling up in his eyes as he pointed toward the ground. There, a small stuffed bear lay in the dirt.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1416	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_65815f25	elias	We can't leave her! She's scared!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1418	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f11ada41		I raised my hand. The ground shifted slightly as the earth responded to my will, lifting the bear from the dirt and bringing it quickly to my hand.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1420	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_80f18ece	dorian	There. Tedda's fine now. Let's go.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1422	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_b8873301		Then, we saw that the carriage was in sight—but so were they.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1424	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_74d07e00		Three soldiers from Mjoll stood near the carriage, their armor gleaming in the afternoon sun. All of them were arguing with the driver.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1425	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f4f93652	man_1	We need this carriage. It's ours now. Get off!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1427	man_1 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_444e2e7d	carriage_driver	I don't care who you are—I was called to pick Master Yuxuan up! This is the property of Cheng Industries!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1428	carriage_driver "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_0d741137	man_2	Hey, buddy. We can do this the easy way, or we can do this the hard way. Your choice.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1429	man_2 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_739d1953	female_guard	Get out of there if you know what's good for you!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1432	female_guard "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_919ae078	carriage_driver	Ahh!! Okay! Okay!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1433	carriage_driver "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_8bde7698		The second soldier turned, spotting us as we approached. His hand shot to his weapon—a jagged blade that glinted in the light.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1435	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f7bed2b1	female_guard	Looks like they're here.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1437	female_guard "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_1d633c0a	yuxuan	Hey! Step away from the carriage! That's the property of Cheng Industries!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1438	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_57b51a9c	man_2	If you're smart, you know better than to fight us. Find another way out.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1439	man_2 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_56f9176a	elias	Daddy… They look scary…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1440	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_91f8d57f	dorian	You're not taking this carriage. We have a child with us.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1441	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_bc4b79a7	female_guard	And? You think we care about your kid? This carriage belongs to King Gustav now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1442	female_guard "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_d1cf11c0		I clenched my fists, feeling the familiar hum of power coursing through me. The ground beneath my feet shifted slightly, small cracks forming as my frustration grew.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1444	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_aecda949	dorian	This carriage doesn't belong to you. Step down now, or you'll regret it	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1446	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_609b391d	man_1	A channeler, huh?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1447	man_1 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_d6cbc2d8	man_2	You don't scare me, pal. Now beat it!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1448	man_2 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_fbb60b56		The soldier in the driver's seat cursed, trying to pull the reins, but the carriage didn't budge. The horses, too petrified, didn't budge.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1450	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_de62cb88	female_guard	What?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1452	female_guard "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_2d6c6d0f	dorian	Step aside. Now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1454	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_af4448f0		The second soldier stepped toward me, blade raised.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1456	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_bff460b8	man_2	Why I oughta! Someone ought to teach you some manners!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1458	man_2 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_9e53b9b6		I stomped the ground. The earth buckled beneath the soldier's feet, a jagged pillar shooting up and knocking the blade from his hands.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1475	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_313aa942		His head hit the ground, knocking him unconscious.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1476	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_1699fb89	dorian	You were warned.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1479	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_12481792		I froze, panic gripping me as the soldier's blade gleamed dangerously close. My breath caught in my throat.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1485	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_728617fb		Before I could react, Yuxuan reached into his satchel and flung a small pouch at the soldier. It burst mid-air, releasing a fine, silvery powder.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1486	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_b746b6e9	man_2	Zzz… Zzz…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1488	man_2 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_5d6d8516	yuxuan	Sleep powder. Courtesy of Cheng Industries. I knew this would come in handy!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1489	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_52a9607d	female_guard	This one's trouble! Fall back!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1492	female_guard "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_101392fa	man_1	Grr…. Hurry! Pull the reins again! Let's get out of here!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1493	man_1 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_a52b0c3d		The soldiers scrambled onto the carriage, yanking the driver out of the seat. The female soldier grabbed the reins, cracking them hard, and the horses began to pull away.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1495	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_fff94f13	carriage_driver	You can't do that! No!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1497	carriage_driver "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_8b509416		I tried to focus, summoning the energy to stop them—but my foot caught on a loose rock, and I fell flat on my face.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1512	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_21632d5f	yuxuan	Dorian!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1514	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_f4074f9e	elias	Tedda! Protect us!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1515	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_67400f2b		Elias flung his stuffed bear with all his might. The toy hit the female soldier dead in the face as she was laughing, specifically her mouth.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1517	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_8d9f6cd3	female_guard	Pfttt—Waahhh!! Eww!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1520	female_guard "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_b5c22a3a		She flailed, grabbing at the reins, but the sudden commotion startled the horses. They reared up, neighing loudly.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1522	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_fb540223		The male soldier shouted, pulling on the reins to regain control.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1523	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_50a41fde	man_1	Stop! WHOA!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1525	man_1 "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_74283131		The carriage lurched violently to the side, its wheels hitting a large rock. The entire thing tipped over, spilling the soldiers onto the ground in a cloud of dust and splinters, knocking them unconscious.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1529	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_800b80d8	elias	Tedda! We did it!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1531	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_15f30386	dorian	Remind me never to underestimate that bear.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1532	dorian "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_bcc890ec		I planted my feet firmly and reached deep, calling on the winds. They roared to life around me, whipping through the air like an invisible storm.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1540	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_04da8328		With a sharp motion of my arm, the wind blasted toward the carriage.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1541	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_fb12306e		The gust struck the soldiers with brutal force, knocking them clean off the back. They landed on the ground, knocking them unconscious.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1542	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_c3cb54f4	carriage_driver	Please, get in!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1545	carriage_driver "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_736c5d5f		The three of us hurriedly got inside the carriage. The driver pulled on the reins and went on our way.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1549	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_2098efe5		The carriage wheels rumbled beneath us, the city's chaos fading behind as we sped toward safety. I exhaled, the tension in my shoulders easing slightly, though my mind was still racing. Yuxuan sat across from me, as he held Elias close.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1550	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_8b6c0fb8	elias	Daddy… are we safe now?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1552	elias "[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_9ae2fef2		I reached over and gently ruffled his hair.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1554	"[what]"
ch4_cemetery_exit_73dbad64	dorian	Almost. We're getting out of here.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1556	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_4f90a910		But then, as we turned a corner, we saw it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1570	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_e881e4aa		The area near the cemetery was littered with bodies—armored individuals sprawled across the ground, their blood staining the dirt. Some were barely moving, others entirely still. The once-sacred space now looked like a battlefield.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1571	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_55f62d79		In the center of it all, a young man stood in the middle. His chest rose and fell unevenly, his breaths labored and ragged. His right hand clutched at his side, blood seeping through his fingers, and his left arm hung limply at his side.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1572	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_7bdf7edb		His face was pale, slick with sweat and dirt, but what caught my attention most was his eye, which glowed faintly, pulsing with an unnatural light that flickered with each breath he took.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1573	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_5d941f6f		Then, a voice filled my head again.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1575	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_1ae52c54	chung_hee	I beg… of you… Please… help… me…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1577	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_696ea6d2		I froze, staring at him as the carriage slowed. He stumbled forward, his legs barely holding him up, and his eye flickered as if struggling to stay alight.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1579	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_cabada5e	chung_hee	Hurry… please. I've exhausted my powers… More of them… might come. I—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1581	chung_hee "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_f05ac7eb		Before he could finish, his knees buckled, and he crumpled to the ground. His body hit the blood-soaked dirt with a sickening thud, and for a moment, everything was still.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1583	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_acca8a52	dorian	He needs my help. I have to help him, Yu.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1585	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_ced20305	yuxuan	What?! Don't even think about it. We have Elias to protect. He's not our problem. We shouldn't involve ourselves with them!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1586	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_181b9841	elias	Daddy… he's hurt. Are we… are we going to help him?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1587	elias "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_68f74759	dorian	I have to.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1588	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_94ab88a0	carriage_driver	Sir, I don't think we should stop. More of those armored ones could show up any second.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1590	carriage_driver "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_33aeeb8f		I looked back at the young man lying in the dirt, his form so still now, as though even breathing was too much effort. His aura was faint, flickering like a dying ember, but it was still there, waiting.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1592	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_b5be1f6f	dorian	We can't just leave him.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1594	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_63248c59	yuxuan	And risk our lives—and Elias's—for a stranger? Dorian, please!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1595	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_29860a03	dorian	Yu, if it was you or Elias there, I would do anything to help.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1596	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_ea8d7e5d	yuxuan	Dorian…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1597	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_aaa6c152	dorian	Please, Yu. Take Elias to safety and stay out of harm's way. I'll do everything I can to ensure I'm not caught up in something dangerous.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1598	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_6873e716	yuxuan	Fine. Meet me at my house, please. Just stay safe, Dorian. Promise me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1599	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_46dfb2a4	dorian	I promise. Stay safe. You too, Elias.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1602	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_21553460		Without another word, I opened the carriage door and jumped down.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1604	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_fd662284		As I hurriedly made my way over the scattered bodies in the aftermath of the confrontation, I walked over the bodies of the fallen. The bodies, clad in bloodied armored attire, lay scattered like fallen soldiers on a battlefield.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1609	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_c0763dab		One… four… eight… twelve…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1610	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_31aec445		The air was thick with the metallic tang of blood, mingled with the acrid stench of burnt earth. It was suffocating. It was familiar.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1611	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_89d7e961		Too familiar.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1616	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_8d59b6db		Memories came flooding back – horrible ones.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1617	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_979f7bbd	boy_ald_soldier	Mercy!! Enoch save me!! Ahhh!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1619	boy_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_b6e6b4e7	girl_ald_soldier	We're just obeying orders! Don't kill us!! Ahh!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1620	girl_ald_soldier "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_2fc5794f	dorian	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1621	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_486fd4fe		I clenched my fists, forcing myself to push the memories aside. I darted past the remaining bodies and reached the young man.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1623	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_14c5d4bb		His pale body was riddled with deep gashes and bruises, his torn clothes clinging to him in blood-soaked tatters. His chest rose and fell unevenly, each labored breath rasping.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1628	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_c8979c46		I knelt beside him, my heart pounding in my chest as I reached out. His skin was icy cold to the touch, his face drenched in sweat. He was fading—fast.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1629	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_6ba4b26c		Then I felt it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1630	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_7c771752		A faint flicker of energy pulsed weakly from him, like the dying ember of a once-roaring flame. His aura was dim, fragile, and almost extinguished. Whatever power he once had was completely drained.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1631	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_2df8669f	dorian	This is bad… this is really bad…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1633	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_24591df3		He needed a doctor. Now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1635	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_102ba4ca	dorian	Listen to me. The clinic—it's a little far from here, but I'll carry you. Just hold on, alright? I'll do what I can.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1638	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_73091275		I slipped my arms beneath his frail, battered body, carefully lifting him. His head lolled limply against my chest, his weight alarmingly light.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1640	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_4591a889		As I straightened, preparing to run, a soft, barely audible voice reached my ears.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1641	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_f318157d		A whisper? No… it was something else.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1642	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_6e95d7fa	niko_raven	Does he have a pulse?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1644	niko_raven "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_a15d547d		I froze, my eyes darting around.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1646	"[what]"
ch4_battlefield_87b0890e	dorian	Who said that? Hello?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1648	dorian "[what]"
ch4_battlefield_0eed9ed1	niko_raven	Hello, I'm here. Does he have a pulse? Please check his pulse.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1649	niko_raven "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_f6c8424e		My gaze snapped to the source—a raven perched on a jagged piece of debris. Its jet-black feathers gleamed unnaturally under the faint light, and its beady eyes locked onto mine.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1665	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_1fcb25cf		A talking raven? I blinked, rubbed my eyes, and looked again, half-convinced I was hallucinating from the stress.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1666	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_3110457e		The bird let out an exasperated sigh—an actual sigh.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1667	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_01e31ffc	niko_raven	*sighs* Can you check his pulse now, please?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1669	niko_raven "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_a337e92c		Still doubting my sanity, I hesitated, then followed the raven's oddly calm advice. Gently, I pressed my fingers to the young man's wrist, feeling for the faint rhythm of life. His pulse was there—weak, erratic, but there.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1671	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_410997be	dorian	He's still holding on. But if I don't get him to a doctor soon, he won't make it. The nearest clinic is—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1673	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_4e2d8e94	niko_raven	Hold on a second. I'll help you.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1674	niko_raven "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_236264d8		Before I could react, the raven's feathers began to shimmer with an ethereal, silvery glow. Its form trembled and warped, the light intensifying with each passing second.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1676	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_e1e4e311		I stumbled back, clutching the young man tightly as the raven's body began to change. Feathers melted into skin, and wings elongated into arms.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1677	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_04f59528		Standing before me, where the raven once perched, was a tall, striking figure—a person.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1678	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_47e6e01f	dorian	What the…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1680	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_550bd19d		He wasted no time, dropping to his knees beside the unconscious young man. His movements were fluid yet precise, every motion purposeful.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1682	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_d2db992e		He pulled a small satchel from his side and opened it, revealing an assortment of seeds, dried herbs, and vials filled with mysterious liquids.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1685	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_63207245	niko	His pulse is weak, but he's still hanging on. Good. That gives me something to work with.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1687	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_193fd1fe		He plucked a few seeds from the satchel and cupped them in his hand. Closing his eyes, he took a deep breath, and I felt a strange energy ripple through the air.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1689	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_1a556942		The seeds began to sprout, tiny shoots unfurling as though sped up by years in mere seconds. Vines and leaves stretched forth, twisting around his fingers before blooming into vibrant, fragrant flowers.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1690	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_46ae1c00	dorian	Nature channeling… I've never seen one channel nature before.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1692	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_8f8a365f		He snapped the petals from one flower and crushed them between his palms, creating a paste that glowed faintly green. Without hesitation, he applied it to the worst of the young man's wounds, smearing it into gashes and bruises with the deftness of someone who had done this countless times before.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1694	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_a12b85ca	dorian	What… what are you doing?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1696	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_a68775d2	niko	He's losing blood too quickly. The paste will slow the bleeding and encourage his skin to knit itself back together.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1697	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_e0ef51ad		He crushed another leaf, mixed it with water from a vial, and poured the liquid into the young man's mouth with careful precision.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1699	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_8a817287	dorian	Is that safe? He can barely—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1701	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_07cc0675	niko	It's a tonic. It'll keep his organs from shutting down. If you're so worried, please help me keep his head steady.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1702	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_ce090482	dorian	Got it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1703	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_9683dedb		I obeyed, holding the young man's head as Niko worked. His hands glowed faintly with energy, the aura spreading into the young man's wounds as he muttered soft words under his breath—spells? Prayers? I couldn't tell.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1705	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_eb05bee7	niko	His channeling energy is still fragile. His body is trying to give up, but I'm not letting it. Not yet.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1707	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_0e9090b6		He reached for a final seed, planting it near the young man's head. It grew instantly into a flower with soft, golden petals. Niko plucked one and crushed it between his fingers, letting its essence drip onto the young man's mouth.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1709	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_4b1b691e		The glow seeped into his skin, and for a moment, the young man's breathing grew steadier. I could feel his aura growing a little stronger.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1710	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_5ec95dfd	dorian	Amazing…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1712	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_3e0114c7	niko	This will stabilize him for now, but he needs real rest—immediately. If another fight breaks out, he won't survive it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1713	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_a5c350cb	dorian	Who are you? And did this man… did he talk to you too?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1714	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_d13cec13	niko	Yes, this man reached out to me. To everyone within the vicinity of Tianho cemetery, I believe. Very potent mind channeling, no doubt.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1717	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_ac7f2c48	dorian	And only the two of us came to his aid?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1718	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_3b4247cf	niko	I'm afraid so, yes.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1719	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_a6914816	niko	He's from Kyeongjang. You won't find anyone else on Ena with a power like that.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1720	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_ed1efae0		He extended a hand, his expression softening slightly.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1722	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_1fecceba	niko	I'm Niko. Niko Tsukumo. I'm in service to the death god, Enoch. It's a pleasure to finally meet you one-on-one, Paladin Dorian.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1724	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_f2806cf5		I shook his hand, his grip firm but warm.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1726	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_f2f1eeb2	dorian	Niko… Have we met before?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1728	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_2ad3cc4b	niko	We have. Five years ago. I was with my younger brother, Kaito. We crossed paths here in Tianho when you were with Paladin Cyrus.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1729	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_c23053f7		His words startled me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1731	"[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_0972541b	dorian	I don't recall. I apologize.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1733	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_2a1ddd80	niko	Don't apologize. It's been a long time.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1734	niko "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_219ef10f	dorian	You're a nature channeler. I take it you're from Clan Ligaya?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1735	dorian "[what]"
ch4_niko_raven_a1d42635	niko	Contrary to popular belief, not every nature channeler hails from Clan Ligaya. My mother is from Clan Kaibig—the sister clan to Ligaya—and my father is from Hamatame, the village of shadows.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1736	niko "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_51c1c540		Then, a flicker of movement caught my eye. My instincts kicked in, and I turned sharply, spotting the same young man who had warned us to leave earlier.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1750	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_866b29e5		The moment he noticed my gaze, his eyes widened in panic.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1751	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_cb23cedd	svante	…!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1753	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_88b7821b		He turned on his heel and bolted.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1755	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_8412850c		I held my palm outward. The ground beneath us shifted and groaned in response to my will, rising up to form solid restraints that coiled around his legs like vines.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1756	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_18183839		He stumbled, crashing to his knees as the earth held him in place.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1757	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_1fa42908	svante	Please! Let me go! I'm not here to hurt you!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1759	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_11c052b7		He writhed against the restraints, his voice trembling. But I didn't let up.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1761	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_0d11577c		I strode toward him.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1762	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_a5732140	dorian	You knew something was going to happen here. Start talking. Now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1764	dorian "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_49d2d224		His breath hitched, his wide eyes darting between me, Niko, and the unconscious man.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1766	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_579e5f90	svante	I... I don't know everything. They didn't tell me much, but—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1769	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_eb325f0e	niko	But you were with that lunatic. You and your group tried to drive me and my fellow prophet away! Don't act innocent now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1770	niko "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_6da61d2f	svante	It wasn't like that! I was trying to help you! Please, you have to believe me!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1771	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_054c7d78	niko	Help us? By threatening us? You're making this a lot harder for yourself, you know.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1772	niko "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_c63530cd	svante	I wasn't threatening you! I was trying to save you! If you'd stayed, you'd be dead!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1773	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_2c5b3530	svante	They'll kill anyone who gets in their way. I… I didn't want to be part of this.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1774	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_4546f9b4	niko	Then why were you here at all? You could've walked away. Who are you anyway?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1775	niko "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_743a8cd9	svante	M-My name's Svante, sir. Please don't hurt me. I s-surrender.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1776	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_560ca9ee	svante	I-I wanted to help him… and you don't understand. I can't just walk away from them! They'd come after me! I—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1777	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_901683e1	elias	Daddy!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1779	elias "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_76cba436		To my utter surprise, Yuxuan and Elias came running towards me. Yuxuan was panting heavily, his hands on his knees as he struggled to catch his breath.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1781	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_a48bbd43		Elias crashed into me clinging to my leg as though his life depended on it. His small body trembled, and when I knelt to pull him into my arms, I could feel his rapid heartbeat against my chest. He was clutching Tedda in his one hand.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1782	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_81267a8a	dorian	Yuxuan?! What in Tetrad's name are you doing here?! You should be at the carriage!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1784	dorian "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_784de47d		Yuxuan straightened, his face pale as he blurted out the words in a frantic rush.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1786	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_565621cd	yuxuan	Dorian, we-we have a problem! There's an army—a whole battalion of Mjoll soldiers—heading this way! We're surrounded!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1788	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_b01395b1	dorian	What?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1789	dorian "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_64d07e4d	svante	I tried to warn you! You should've run when you had the chance! Now we're all going to die here!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1790	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_56629fe3	yuxuan	Dorian, what are we supposed to do? We can't fight them all, but we can't stay here either! We're trapped!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1791	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_8eb7169f	dorian	You shouldn't have come back! You should've gotten the child out of here! What were you thinking?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1792	dorian "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_35c42f59	yuxuan	Dorian, we're not leaving you behind. We're in this together, no matter what.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1793	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_e916af08	elias	Daddy, I wanted to be with you! I won't leave you, daddy!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1794	elias "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_ca2d0404		I groaned and opened my mouth to answer, but the sound of distant boots—hundreds of them—marching in unison filled the cemetery air.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1796	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_13575819	niko	Calm down. How many soldiers did you see?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1799	niko "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_52894146	yuxuan	I... I don't know. There were so many of them—it looked like an entire battalion! Maybe more!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1800	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_ddb40a80	niko	We can't stay here. We have to move. Now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1801	niko "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_e9f6d564	yuxuan	Move where?! I just told you! We're surrounded! Every path out of this cemetery is crawling with Mjoll soldiers!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1802	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_5070ccda	man_1	We have you surrounded! Surrender now and you might live to see another day. Resist, and you'll meet a swift end!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1804	man_1 "[what]"
