ch4_svante_capture_1c96d0e7		Before he could fully raise his hands, I grabbed his shoulder and yanked him back.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1807	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_bee64932	dorian	Yu, no need to surrender.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1809	dorian "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_a7856e63	svante	He's right! If we surrender, we're as good as dead! They won't let us walk away, not after this. We have to fight or die!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1810	svante "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_a901a3c0	man_2	Come out with your hands up! All of you! We won't ask again!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1812	man_2 "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_761519a7		A commanding female voice cut through the voices of the soldiers like a blade.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1814	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_d04bd9bd	aoi	Back-up has finally arrived, Tian Xun. As for you lot—what took you so long?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1816	aoi "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_1625f87c		The soldiers straightened up immediately, some even flinching at her tone.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1818	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_474288ba	man_1	S-Sorry, mam Aoi! It won't happen again!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1820	man_1 "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_ab09b84e	tian_xun	HAHHAHAHA! Oh, but it better not! Because if I have to wait one more agonizing second for a BOOM, I might just detonate myself for fun! My darlings were perfectly timed and they ruined it! THEY RUINED IT!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1821	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_63b3b440	tian_xun	I want fireworks! I want limbs flying! I want screams and smoke!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1822	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_c307f79c		At the corner of my eye, I saw her. The woman was about Yuxuan's stature. Water circled faintly around her fingers, as if drawn to her by instinct.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1824	"[what]"
