ch4_svante_capture_f1ee0e8d	aoi	I don't care for them. Just make sure that the target is dealt with. As for the others, dead or alive—it's up to you.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1830	aoi "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_63bdd8c8	tian_xun	NO! KILL THEM! LEAVE NO SURVIVORS! THEY FOILED MY BEAUTIES!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1831	tian_xun "[what]"
