ch4_svante_capture_b8dc9285		A man stormed into view, his movements erratic and exaggerated, his face twisted into an expression of obsessive rage.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1835	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_dae9ce4b	tian_xun	My cannons! My beautiful cannons! They ruined everything! Do you know how long it took me to design those? The fuses, the powder, the precision—ruined!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1837	tian_xun "[what]"
