ch4_svante_capture_0d3563ef		The lady rolled her eyes. She glanced at him, her expression one of thinly veiled disdain.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1843	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_d76850e5	aoi	Calm down, Tian Xun. For someone from Tianho, you're embarrassing yourself.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1845	aoi "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_e9732fd4	tian_xun	Embarrassing?! You don't understand! The cannons were my masterpiece! My explosions! You can't just… replace art like that!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1846	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_563c7c62	aoi	You were the one who wasted your own bombs! Ugh!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1847	aoi "[what]"
