ch4_svante_capture_eaba7fe1		From our vantage point, I could see the soldiers shuffling nervously. Aoi's cold demeanor and Tian Xun's volatile nature were enough to unsettle even seasoned warriors.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1855	"[what]"
