ch4_svante_capture_8e644432		The ground shook as the soldiers prepared to launch a second wave of attacks. Meanwhile, the distinct clatter of hooves thundered in the distance, growing louder with every passing second.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1902	"[what]"
