ch4_svante_capture_3a4ad37e		The once-organized battalion had devolved into chaos, their fear tangible as they scrambled in disarray. Aoi's frustration boiled over, her composure unraveling as she clenched her fists.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1949	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_7e0a317f	aoi	This is preposterous! What kind of power are we dealing with here?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1951	aoi "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_8e73f6fd	tian_xun	Preposterous? No, no, my dear Aoi. This is art! This… is genius! HAHAHA!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1953	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_e418f9c0	aoi	Tian Xun, what are you doing?! We need to regroup, not stand around laughing like a madman!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1954	aoi "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_b0a3597d	tian_xun	Regroup? Oh no, no, no. This isn't the time to fall back, Aoi. This is the time to show them true power. It's time for my masterpiece!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1957	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_ba9a79ce	aoi	Wait… That's not…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1958	aoi "[what]"
