ch4_svante_capture_25253e36	aoi	You're insane! You can't use that here, Tian Xun! You'll destroy us all!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1960	aoi "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_e774c585	tian_xun	Destroy us? Oh, Aoi, don't be so dramatic. This. Is. Progress! This is the culmination of my Tianho roots, my art! Draconic fire, distilled into its purest, most destructive form!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1961	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_3af55eb4		From beneath his robe, Tian Xun pulled out a small, ornate container. It was carved with intricate dragon motifs that seemed to writhe and twist as the light played over them. A faint, fiery glow seeped from its seams, pulsating like a heartbeat.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1963	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_db8d909b	aoi	Are you daft?! Do you even understand what you're holding?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1965	aoi "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_62ef1bf3	tian_xun	Legends state that draconic fire can only be channeled by those who are direct descendants of the ancient dragons. The late King Long Shen possessed one… but my father took it before the tragedy. And now, it is mine.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1966	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_1612bddd		He pressed his lips to the container, kissing it.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1968	"[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_7a9a15a6	tian_xun	A gift from the Prosperity Dragon itself… My eternal muse. My guiding light.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1970	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_70d19f44	aoi	Tian Xun, stop this madness! You can't—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1971	aoi "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_fad04ab9	tian_xun	Madness?! Madness would be not using this! Do you comprehend what failure means, Aoi? Do you?!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1972	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_b7297913	aoi	…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1973	aoi "[what]"
