ch4_svante_capture_b21c250c	tian_xun	Oh, you'll see, Aoi. You'll all see. Prepare my final beauty—the crescendo of my genius! BOOM! BOOM! HAHAHA!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1976	tian_xun "[what]"
ch4_svante_capture_e3ff1589	aoi	I'll get the other battalion of soldiers. Make sure you don't miss this time, okay? You two! Come with me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	1977	aoi "[what]"
