ch4_prosperity_dragon_ed45ad61		Suddenly, time seemed to stand still. Absolute silence.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2028	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_88fce38c		I closed my eyes. Is this it?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2029	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_daa29103	prosperity_dragon	My child…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2031	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_12de87b0		My breath hitched. That voice—it was unmistakable.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2033	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_056df192	dorian	…?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2035	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_79b01ec1	prosperity_dragon	It has been far too long since you last called upon me. On your own volition.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2036	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_b80ed757	dorian	I…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2037	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_2efc8d89	prosperity_dragon	Tell me, child, what is it that you desire? What compels you to reach out to me after so long?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2038	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_698e1dc8		I swallowed hard, my voice trembling as I replied.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2040	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_ad78301e	dorian	Please… You know what I need.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2042	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_2f4c3c18	prosperity_dragon	Speak it! Acknowledge what you seek. Do not make me drag it from your lips like a coward's confession.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2043	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_f6b915b5	prosperity_dragon	I know all who carry my blood, all my offspring. I know what burns in your heart. But I will hear it from you, Dorian. Say it with conviction and do not dance around the truth!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2044	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_d2925c53		I clenched my fists, forcing myself to confront the desperation clawing at my soul.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2046	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_96ebee1c		Elias… Yuxuan… Those who I hold dear.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2047	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_bb6b3fa2		I want to protect them.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2048	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_3815bda4	dorian	I… I need your power. Please… grant me your power again.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2050	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_8c92ac9a	prosperity_dragon	My power. How easily you forget, Dorian.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2051	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_012beb43	prosperity_dragon	You have forgotten who you are! Ever since your family was torn from you… ever since the you've worked as a mercenary in Mjoll… you have turned away from what you were born to be.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2052	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_ca4152fa	prosperity_dragon	You have forsaken your very essence. My power is your birthright, and yet you shun it!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2053	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_921cda69		The air ignited around me. Small embers flickered to life, swirling in a growing storm of heat and light. They multiplied rapidly, transforming into a sea of flames that enveloped me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2055	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_ea4459f9		The heat was blistering, but it didn't burn—it was familiar, like an old friend.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2056	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_9e84f700		The flames danced in hues of crimson, gold, and orange coiled around my hand.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2057	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_de3eade3		Just like before.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2058	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_5d6a837b		And then, a memory.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2059	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_d73aae66		The yaoguai king's hand, stained with blood, holding Elara's severed head high like a trophy. The screams of my children echoed in my ears. The emptiness in their eyes as they lay lifeless before me.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2062	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_ef70ef4c	yk	The Dragonkin... I've been searching for you. At last, I've found you.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2064	yk "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_96613cbf	dorian	Elara… Daniel… Emily… Sarah… Lucas… My family…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2065	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_d318cd3d		The flames around me surged. Tears blurred my vision.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2067	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_d57bb52d	dorian	If only… If only I had been strong enough…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2069	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_59d936bd	prosperity_dragon	Enough!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2070	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_37c02bee	prosperity_dragon	My blood runs in your veins. My power is your power. You are not weak. You are not broken. You are DRAGONKIN! You only need to accept it—to welcome it as you did before!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2071	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_1d06f4f4		My hands shook.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2073	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_672bfd51		Elias… Yuxuan… The ones that I care about…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2074	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_34dfcd0f	dorian	They might be put in danger because of me. I—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2076	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_800cacf5		I could feel the heat. The draconic fire.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2078	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_7f5621e4		The bomb. It was approaching.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2079	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_1798d387	prosperity_dragon	The bomb… Channel your power, Dorian! Take control! Remember yourself. Remember your heritage. Remember who you are.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2081	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_b1abf20b	prosperity_dragon	The bomb… Channel your power, Dorian. Remember yourself. Remember your power.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2082	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_b80ed757_1	dorian	I…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2084	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_7692ebbe		The flames surrounding me grew brighter, hotter, more intense.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2086	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_017675bc		I close my eyes, my trembling hand hovering over the flames. All of my memories surge forward, each vying for my attention.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2087	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_6c563522		The tragedy of Tianho—the screams, the chaos, the flames engulfing the city as people cried out.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2099	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_95c632a8		I saw their faces: desperate, terrified, looking to me as if I were a god who could fix everything. I wasn't. I was powerless. I failed them.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2100	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_bbf5fb0a		The fires consumed the city that day. My hands still carried the ash of that failure.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2101	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_3d6607ae	dorian	I'm sorry… I'm so sorry…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2103	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_0031afd0		Their laughter echoed in my ears. Elara's warm smile as she held Lucas in her arms. Daniel teaching Emily how to channel her first flame, the two of them bickering playfully as Sarah tried to mediate.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2112	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_ca8f0bec		I could see them all so clearly. Elara's hand brushing against my cheek, her voice soft as she whispered to me:	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2113	"[what]"
