ch4_prosperity_dragon_28ad3fc8	dorian	Elara… I wasn't strong enough… I couldn't save you. I couldn't save any of you!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2116	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_16862d66		Their faces haunted me too. The aldoriths of Mjoll and… how could I forget? Vasily.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2125	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_e0885b16		My power unleashed recklessly. I only defended myself and Elias but…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2126	"[what]"
