ch4_prosperity_dragon_dce6aacf	dorian	Vasily… Friend, I… I didn't mean to! Forgive me…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2129	dorian "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_f378bd0e		I closed my eyes, letting the voice of the Prosperity Dragon wash over me. The flames burned brighter.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2138	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_0624b554	dorian	The Dragon of Gale…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2140	dorian "[what]"
