ch4_prosperity_dragon_4acaa74d		But that was before the tragedy. Before the yaoguai king. Before I failed my family. Before I let the weight of my grief smother my flames.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2143	"[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_a5097d9b	prosperity_dragon	Rise up, child. Rise, and show them the might of your bloodline!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2146	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch4_prosperity_dragon_b03b9d31		The flames surged around me, growing wild and untamed, but I didn't flinch. My hands trembled as the memories of Elara and my children flashed before my eyes—their laughter, their warmth, their love.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2148	"[what]"
