ch4_bad_end_bomb_b0c81182		His voice echoed faintly as the light engulfed me. The bomb's draconic fire was silent—beautiful, even—as it bloomed in the distance, consuming everything in its path.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2170	"[what]"
