ch4_bad_end_bomb_f1be78e2		Elara stood there, radiant as ever, her arms outstretched. Behind her were Daniel, Sarah, Emily, and little Lucas, all smiling at me with the same warmth I had longed to feel again.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2173	"[what]"
