ch4_draconic_fire_c3c7e437	dorian	Of course, I can.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2309	dorian "[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_2dc3ea4e		I turned to Niko, who stood with his shadows coiling protectively around us, their dark tendrils shifting like living sentinels. He met my gaze and gave a curt nod.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2311	"[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_4cd2399c	niko	If it keeps us alive, we go with his idea. But I'm covering us while we move. No one gets through my shadows.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2313	niko "[what]"
