ch4_draconic_fire_42948686		The pounding of their boots grew louder, closer.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2318	"[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_1ee03311		There wasn't much time.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2319	"[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_6248d814		I took a deep breath, slamming my palms into the earth. The ground rumbled and groaned beneath us as I focused. a wide opening formed, a tunnel descending into the depths below.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2323	"[what]"
