ch4_draconic_fire_9be9a150		Yuxuan didn't hesitate. He leapt in first, already reaching up.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2328	"[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_d14da361	yuxuan	Come on. I'll catch you.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2330	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_04ca089c		Elias clutched his beloved stuffed animal, Tedda, to his chest as he stood at the edge of the opening.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2332	"[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_2310257a	elias	Tedda, don't let go!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2334	elias "[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_0e93fbfb		Tedda: …	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2335	"[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_91f61a1d		I moved to the edge, hefting the unconscious man over my shoulder. His weight was considerable, but I tightened my grip, refusing to falter.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2338	"[what]"
