ch4_draconic_fire_0f61e115	dorian	I know. I've got him. Just keep them off us!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2341	dorian "[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_370c6a4e		Svante lingered at the edge, uncertainty clouding his features. He hesitated, torn between the battle raging above and the unknown below.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2343	"[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_30e0eff2	dorian	You too. Jump. Now. I'll jump after you.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2345	dorian "[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_97786856	svante	I… are you sure— I'm an aldorith I might—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2346	svante "[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_208e279d	dorian	Dragon's bollocks! Just jump!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2347	dorian "[what]"
ch4_draconic_fire_d53dbdba	svante	O-Okay, sir!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2348	svante "[what]"
