ch4_draconic_fire_95d89876		As he jumped, the shadows recoiled, pulling away like a collapsing wave. I didn't waste a second—I slammed my hands into the dirt once more, sealing the tunnel shut above us.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2358	"[what]"
