ch4_underground_dffd3995	yuxuan	Is everyone alright?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2378	yuxuan "[what]"
ch4_underground_0b678405	niko	Shh… Keep your voice down. They're still looking for us. I can feel them getting closer.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2379	niko "[what]"
ch4_underground_51deb846		Above us, we can faintly hear the muffled voices of the soldiers. Elias was about to say something when Yuxuan covered the child's mouth.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2381	"[what]"
ch4_underground_15e183ed	mjoll_lars	Where did they go?! Dammit! They've used the amulet!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2383	mjoll_lars "[what]"
ch4_underground_f20ac82d		A strangled sob.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2385	"[what]"
ch4_underground_df643224	mjoll_helga	Pavel… *cries* Lars, I'm scared…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2387	mjoll_helga "[what]"
ch4_underground_fb0ce88a	mjoll_lars	Calm down, Helga. We'll find them. Aldoriths, search the area for any clues!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2388	mjoll_lars "[what]"
