ch4_underground_48850138	female_guard	Sir yes, sir!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2392	female_guard "[what]"
ch4_underground_1f6fc890		And then—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2394	"[what]"
ch4_underground_e3b92a58	aoi	Ti… Tian Xun…	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2396	aoi "[what]"
ch4_underground_3ddd991b		A pause.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2398	"[what]"
ch4_underground_7311b798		Then, a bloodcurdling scream.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2399	"[what]"
ch4_underground_733b0349	aoi	TIAN XUN!!	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2401	aoi "[what]"
ch4_underground_3783a7ec		And as if the heavens themselves mourned, the sky split open, unleashing a torrential downpour.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2403	"[what]"
ch4_underground_a423daa2		Raindrops hammered against the earth.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2404	"[what]"
ch4_underground_1fcfb68d	svante	It's raining now.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2406	svante "[what]"
ch4_underground_b5838e80	niko	Good. That way they can't hear us moving.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2407	niko "[what]"
ch4_underground_0b35c969		I looked around. Darkness engulfed us, thick and suffocating. But then—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2409	"[what]"
ch4_underground_0ef4817a		A soft glow flickered to life, illuminating Elias's small frame. He clutched a delicate, flower-shaped flashlight in his tiny hands—the one Yuxuan had given him.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2415	"[what]"
ch4_underground_f0e0f744	elias	Nice going, Tedda. The flashlight is helping.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2417	elias "[what]"
ch4_underground_ecc7fa37		He held the stuffed bear close, its one button eye reflecting the faint golden light.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2419	"[what]"
ch4_underground_24a04b54		I took his hand.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2421	"[what]"
ch4_underground_bbd77021	dorian	Are you hurt? Injured?	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2423	dorian "[what]"
ch4_underground_4a06785c		Elias smiled and shook his head. He hugged Tedda tight.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2425	"[what]"
ch4_underground_e711a9c4	elias	We're fine, Daddy.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2427	elias "[what]"
ch4_underground_e3c60770	svante	I-I really can't believe it… We made it. We actually made it. I thought that was the end.	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2428	svante "[what]"
ch4_underground_ab4898b0	svante	Thank you… Thank you, sir! I could kiss your fee—	game/06_chapter_04.rpy	2429	svante "[what]"
