chapter_5_cedc2349		I carried the unconscious young man on my shoulder, the scent of his unfamiliar perfume seemed to linger on my nose. Refined, yet foreign.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	204	"[what]"
chapter_5_2ae2228e		Behind me, Niko walked in silence, his sharp gaze fixed on the unconscious figure. He kept checking his pulse, brushing damp hair away from his face, as if making sure he was still breathing.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	205	"[what]"
