chapter_5_de03b2e4		Svante, the aldorith, walked near me, shifting anxiously. Every few steps, he would whisper yet another apology, his voice trembling slightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	214	"[what]"
chapter_5_420ad8d7	svante	Forgive me for earlier. I'm sorry… I—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	216	svante "[what]"
chapter_5_8b663a02		Still, the rain poured outside. A distant rumble of thunder echoed above.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	218	"[what]"
