ch5_lab_entrance_8bca62ce		I planted my feet firmly on the damp ground and extended my hand. The earth rumbled beneath my palm, shifting and parting at my command. A section of the tunnel wall crumbled away, revealing an entrance—more refined than the natural cave we had been trudging through.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	236	"[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_6bd42deb		Unlike the crude, damp tunnels of before, this place was structured—a carefully designed underground passage. Electric lights, neatly affixed to the earthen walls, illuminated the space with a warm, steady glow.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	237	"[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_4a674da0	svante	This is amazing… Spectacular, even. I… I had no idea tunnels like these existed in Tianho.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	239	svante "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_8fd6c8ee	yuxuan	These tunnels were built to facilitate the safe and discreet travel of my partnered merchants. They connect key points throughout the region, allowing for the transport of goods and valuable cargo—without attracting unwanted attention.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	240	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_1e883a59	dorian	Amazing. I wouldn't expect less from Cheng Yuxuan himself.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	241	dorian "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_dfc185b0	niko	…Wait a minute. Cheng Yuxuan? You're not just a Yuxuan. You're the Cheng Yuxuan? The renowned inventor?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	242	niko "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_ca84f2e3	yuxuan	The one and only. Pleasure to make your acquaintance.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	243	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_ce1941eb	niko	No wonder you have enough coin to facilitate the construction of all these tunnels. How much did it cost? It must have been a sizeable fortune.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	244	niko "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_23537c0e	yuxuan	Haha. Thanks, but these tunnels have been here for a while now. Me and my partners just happened to stumble on it by accident.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	245	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_fc940b10	yuxuan	It would have been a waste if these tunnels just collected dirt. So, we at Cheng Industries decided to convert it to a passageway.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	246	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_c6106770		There was silence—then—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	248	"[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_fe14fb6e	svante	CHENG INDUSTRIES?! YOU'RE THAT CHENG YUXUAN?!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	250	svante "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_6827662d		Svante was shrieking in excitement, his eyes sparkling. He grabbed Yuxuan's sleeve like an excited child.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	252	"[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_9250975e	svante	This… This can't be real! You—you're the genius behind the delivery bots! The man who revolutionized steam-powered mechanisms from Mjoll! You— you saved me and my mom! I— I don't even know what to say! I—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	254	svante "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_0cf00ee0		His words tumbled out in an excited, breathless mess, his face glowing with genuine admiration.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	256	"[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_e6fb10d5	svante	During the great blizzard… when our food ran out… the relief packages from Cheng Industries saved us. We were going to die, sir! But your shipments—your generosity—we lived because of you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	258	svante "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_756a7a41		His hands clenched against his chest, his lip trembling as he blinked rapidly, clearly fighting back tears.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	260	"[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_9bdfb101	elias	Tedda, why is he crying?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	262	elias "[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_0e93fbfb		Tedda: …	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	263	"[what]"
ch5_lab_entrance_5c260139		Yuxuan rubbed the back of his neck.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	265	"[what]"
