ch5_yuxuan_lab_24f946b4		We stopped at a massive door made out of polished metal, gleaming under the artificial lighting. It beared no handles or visible keyholes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	285	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_b2c78e4a		As we stepped closer, a sudden hum resonated from within. A thin, radiant crimson beam of light flickered to life, sweeping across Yuxuan's face with meticulous precision. Yuxuan remained perfectly still.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	286	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_bc2b81d8		Then, the door spoke.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	287	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_cfbd9eaa	door_voice	Attention. Facial recognition is currently in progress. Please be advised that excessive movement may disrupt this unit's sensors and may impact the accuracy of identity verification. Please refrain from doing so. Thank you for your understanding.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	291	door_voice "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_5f0fbc7a		A pause. The crimson light pulsed. Then—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	293	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_47086b89	door_voice	Initiating secondary verification. Please present a valid voice signature.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	295	door_voice "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_8854189b		Yuxuan exhaled sharply before speaking in a smooth, practiced tone.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	297	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_5cc081c0	yuxuan	Cheng Yuxuan. Authorizing entry.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	299	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_d985b85e		The door whirred, but did not yet open.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	301	"[what]"
