ch5_yuxuan_lab_ac661ba4		Without hesitation, Yuxuan pressed his palm against the cold metal.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	305	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_d0dae422	door_voice	Analyzing genetic markers. Matching results with stored biological data.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	307	door_voice "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_fd5502f2	door_voice	Identity confirmed. Welcome home, Master Yuxuan. May the blessings of the Prosperity Dragon be with you today.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	311	door_voice "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_586e1c42	door_voice	Here at Cheng's we bring change. As per your request, this unit will not play the Cheng Industries jingle.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	312	door_voice "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_d97aef8b	svante	Here at Cheng's, we bring change—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	314	svante "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_be8ce6c6		With a deep, mechanical thunk, the massive door finally split apart, revealing a sterile yet inviting interior. A rush of cool, crisp air greeted us as the passageway opened. The lighting inside was dimmed but warm, perfectly illuminating the space beyond.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	323	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_b3f790af		We stepped inside, one by one.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	324	"[what]"
