ch5_yuxuan_lab_2ce41b9c		The room was spacious, lined with sleek furniture, and had the distinct coziness of a lived-in space rather than the cold sterility of a scientific lab. A few shelves were stacked with books, blueprints, and small trinkets, while elegant screens displayed various data across the walls.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	326	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_63654e03	yuxuan	There we are. Home sweet home.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	328	yuxuan "[what]"
