ch5_yuxuan_lab_fcbd22af	yuxuan	Roboto will escort you to the spare room. Roboto! Come here.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	330	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_27c4d7b2		At his command, a small mechanical figure whirred to life from the corner of the room. With a series of cheerful beeps, a scrappy little robot wobbled its way toward us, its monitor-like face flickering before settling into a bright, pixelated smile.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	334	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_78511a89	roboto	You called, Master Yuxuan? Roboto is here. At your service.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	337	roboto "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_1267f6fc	yuxuan	Can you show these people to the spare room?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	338	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_f791745c		Roboto's screen shifted, displaying a large question mark before flickering back to its usual expression.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	340	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_341e42b1	roboto	Which spare room, Master Yuxuan?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	342	roboto "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_980329b7	yuxuan	Any spare room, Roboto. Now. It's urgent.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	343	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_9db3f5f0	roboto	Certainly, Master Yuxuan.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	344	roboto "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_c365d696	svante	A… A robot servant? A talking real-life robot servant? This is… AMAZING!!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	346	svante "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_a1da5a2d	elias	Daddy, daddy, look! A robot!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	347	elias "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_fc7d097f		Roboto tilted its small head toward them, its screen displaying a cheerful expression.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	349	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_1490b0e4	roboto	Precisely. I am a robot. I am Master Yuxuan's r-r-robot companion. I can be whatever he wants… A butler. A cleaner. Or even his own personal c-c-c-c…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	351	roboto "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_c2fe2853	roboto	…chef if need be.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	352	roboto "[what]"
