ch5_yuxuan_lab_5b79f359		Svante's face drained of all color. He suddenly looked sick. His entire body stiffened, his expression twisted with disbelief. His hand shot up, pointing straight at Elias.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	381	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_9942f8e0	svante	What are you doing here?! Why are you dressed up like a girl?!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	383	svante "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_2d821de3		His voice cracked as he turned his trembling hand toward me, realization crashing over him like a tidal wave.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	385	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_793b815a	svante	I—I knew something was off when you channeled draconic fire!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	387	svante "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_5f25b278	svante	Y-You're the Massacrer of Mjoll!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	388	svante "[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_a020f0eb	svante	You… You murdered Count Vasily… My brothers… My sisters….	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	389	svante "[what]"
