ch5_yuxuan_lab_41da2a1a		A hush fell over the room, heavy and suffocating.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	392	"[what]"
ch5_yuxuan_lab_e424bb44		Svante's chest rose and fell rapidly, his gaze darting wildly. Desperation clawed at his voice as he turned to the others.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	393	"[what]"
