ch5_spare_room_95ac169f		We entered the spare room, finding ourselves in yet another well-furnished and comfortable space. The lighting was soft, casting a warm glow over the neatly arranged furniture. A lone bed sat in the corner, its sheets crisp and clean, with a sturdy wooden chair positioned beside it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	443	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_c11bb743	roboto	H-H-Here is guest r-room number one. P-Please make yourselves comfortable. If you need something, please don't hesitate to contact me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	445	roboto "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_41ba3bd6		I gently lowered the man onto the bed. His head lolled slightly before settling against the pillow.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	447	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_6de8ee34		Niko was at his side in an instant, fingers pressing against his wrist. He frowned in concentration, waiting, feeling.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	448	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_7646c671	niko	He's alright. His pulse is steady. He just needs rest.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	450	niko "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_5f3b4c94		He pulled the blankets up to the young man's shoulders, tucking him in with practiced care. But there was a lingering uncertainty in Niko's expression—he wasn't satisfied just yet.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	452	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_47617b36		He looked at the little robot whirring around the room.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	453	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_030655c2	niko	Excuse me, what should we call you again?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	455	niko "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_e19e5fb9	roboto	R-R-Robotooo. Robot with an 'o'. Roboto.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	456	roboto "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_40ebc8e6	niko	Do you have some water here?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	457	niko "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_1f8c80ae		Roboto perked up, its monitor face flashing a bright question mark before flickering back to its usual cheerful expression.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	459	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_02fe2c54	roboto	Warm… or… C-C-Cold? Does it need to be p-p-purified?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	461	roboto "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_de2a4f47	niko	Warm water is fine. Can you put it in a pitcher and bring us some cups?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	462	niko "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_59b05163	roboto	No problemooo!!! You can count on Roboto~	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	463	roboto "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_eb993e02		With an excited little whirl of its gears, Roboto scurried out of the room, leaving me alone with Niko.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	465	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_5b8263d4		Niko exhaled and reached into the leather parcel slung across his chest. With a practiced motion, he unfastened it and pulled out a handful of small, round seeds. They rested in his palm, barely larger than pebbles, their dark shells smooth and unassuming.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	466	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_71886db5		The air in the room shifted ever so slightly, carrying the faint, fresh scent of damp earth and blooming leaves.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	467	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_ec49dbb5		The seeds stirred in his palm.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	468	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_fb4d0bbc		Slowly, their shells cracked open, delicate green shoots emerging like tiny fingers reaching toward the sky. Within seconds, the fragile sprouts twisted and lengthened, their stems strengthening, their leaves unfurling.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	469	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_fc6e854a		Niko carefully placed them on the nightstand beside the bed, arranging them in a small clay dish that had been sitting unused.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	470	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_a272c412	dorian	…You're using nature channeling again?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	472	dorian "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_23a1ec22	niko	It's not enough that he's breathing. He needs to recover properly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	473	niko "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_417d091b		With another wave of his hand, the young plants continued to grow. They bloomed into delicate white blossoms, their petals trembling slightly as if breathing in the room's air.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	475	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_71e7ba8d	niko	These flowers release a mild healing essence. It should help his body recover faster, strengthen his energy flow, and ease any lingering strain on his energy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	477	niko "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_2dc9b9cc		He reached out and lightly pressed his fingers against the unconscious man's forehead. A soft green glow flickered at the tips of his fingers before dissipating into the young man's skin.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	479	"[what]"
