ch5_spare_room_49341641		He adjusted the blankets again, making sure the man was warm but not overheated. Then he sat back with a quiet sigh.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	486	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_3e1eca42	dorian	You're really thorough with this.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	488	dorian "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_63d522ec	niko	… Just being careful.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	489	niko "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_aba0be6c		He looked at the man.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	491	"[what]"
ch5_spare_room_c1cce69f	niko	I've seen this before. People pushing themselves past their limits, burning through their energy until there's nothing left. Some never recover.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	493	niko "[what]"
ch5_spare_room_b868273f		A brief silence stretched between us. Maybe now was a good time to talk to him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	495	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_20637939	dorian	You didn't have to help back there. But you did. So… thanks.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	509	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_63e6dba6	niko	Don't mention it. It's my duty.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	510	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_61df7161	dorian	Your duty?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	511	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_adc5cdd2	niko	I was a doctor before.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	512	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_fd63d6a4	niko	Trained for years under some of the best healers in my clan. Medicine was my life.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	513	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_9d461e41		I blinked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	515	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_8c92ba1b	dorian	A doctor? I figured you had medical experience, but I didn't think you were trained formally.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	517	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_baeef05c		He let out a low chuckle.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	519	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_10d047df	niko	What, you thought I just had a natural talent for it?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	521	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_823a16ca	dorian	With the way you worked? Yeah, I wouldn't have been surprised.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	522	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_38799a4e	niko	Where I come from, healers aren't just people who stitch wounds and mix herbs. We had to know how to fight too.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	523	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_9a4ff18d	niko	You can't save lives if you're dead, after all.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	524	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_131ff7a2		He smirked slightly. His gaze drifted to his hands.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	526	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_e194e726		His fingers flexed slightly, and for the first time, I got a clear look at the intricate symbols running along his arm. Runes—etched like ink, wrapping around. They weren't familiar. They weren't decorative.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	527	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_c5c8a869	dorian	Those runes on your hands… I haven't seen them before.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	529	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_edde6c32	niko	No. They're protective runes. A gift. Or maybe a curse. Depends on who you ask.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	530	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_d7559885		He turned his hand over, the runes catching the dim light of the room.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	532	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_9d3bd0f9	niko	They help me control my shadows.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	534	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_9a93e3b1		His voice trailed off, and for a brief second, I swore I saw something shift behind him. A flicker of darkness, barely noticeable, curling at the edges of his silhouette like something alive.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	536	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_26c0aab0		Then it was gone.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	537	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_8d56971b	dorian	Where did you get them?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	539	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_5022aaa5	niko	Hamatame. A village deep in the mountains of the kingdom of Hinami. The Village of Shadows.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	540	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_7559f3c9	dorian	I see. I haven't been to Hinami before.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	541	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_4bdacd40	niko	You should. The beaches are terrific this time of the year.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	542	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_034c53b4	dorian	Haha. Maybe. Thanks.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	543	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_3ff89854		I shifted slightly, glancing at him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	549	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_00ab34ff	dorian	I've been meaning to ask you this… How—how did you turn into a raven?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	551	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_99681a57		He smirked, clearly amused.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	553	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_b822486a	niko	Didn't I already tell you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	555	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_e1668a1c	dorian	I've seen nature channelers before. Hell, I've fought against them. They can summon beasts, enhance their senses, even morph parts of their bodies. But none of them could fully transform.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	556	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_c6a06349		I crossed my arms.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	558	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_7c94cbc8	dorian	I've seen nature channelers before. Hell, I've fought against them. But none of them could fully transform into animals. At most, they could summon beasts, and some could shift parts of their bodies.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	560	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_7ed042b5		I narrowed my eyes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	562	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_c59e42be	dorian	You don't just shift. You become the animal. How?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	564	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_6f17ca53		Niko leaned back, arms resting lazily behind his head.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	566	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_9ddd450d	niko	It's part of my clan's bloodline ability. Clan Kaibig is… different. We don't just borrow nature's gifts—we embody them.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	568	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_d3d7db7b	niko	It's about becoming. We don't just take on the form. We take on the instincts. The senses. The mind.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	569	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_b8941a32	niko	Some in our clan dedicate their lives to mastering every single animal form – hundreds of them. They become the creatures they study, forsaking everything else.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	570	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_babf17b5	dorian	What about you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	572	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_d260344a		His smirk faded slightly. He glanced at the unconscious man, then back at me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	574	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_ca451514	niko	It's not my priority. I have a different calling.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	576	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_5cdf7a9c		I looked at him, searching his face for some kind of recognition.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	582	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_4350704a	dorian	You said we've met before? Sorry… I don't remember.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	584	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_70036690	niko	Tianho. You were with Paladin Cyrus. I was with my brother, Kaito.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	585	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_aa8bde7e		I blinked. Tianho. That name carried echoes of fire and screaming, the weight of bodies hitting the ground before I could even process what was happening.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	587	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_b7b1911b		My mind clawed at the memories, but all I could grasp was the scent of burning flesh and the metallic tang of blood.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	588	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_bd18a217		Elara. My family. Yuxuan. The Emperor of Kyeongjang. Paladin Cyrus. Vasily. Gao. Jiang. King Long Shen. Empress Olympia.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	589	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_96aeb116		I don't recall meeting Niko. Or his brother.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	590	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_0d0607ac	dorian	Tianho… That was years ago.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	592	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_e85cf059	niko	Kaito wanted to be the translator for the Emperor of Kyeongjang's son. The deaf-mute son of the Emperor.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	593	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_6e0b0b51		I frowned, trying to piece together the fragments.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	595	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_32bba013	dorian	I'm very sorry. I still don't remember. But I do recall the auditions. Long lines. Hundreds of people waiting for a chance to serve.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	597	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_dafddb7c	niko	Yes. The line was massive. Even though we didn't get the chance.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	598	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_474856df	niko	Paladin Cyrus had an issue with us. He has an issue with all followers of the Death God.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	599	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_d1d42d58		I hesitated before asking.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	601	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_81d8de28	dorian	So… Kaito. He's a follower of the Death God too?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	603	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_3d200f0e		Niko's fingers twitched.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	605	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_21c2fd83	niko	Yes. But biologically speaking, he's also my brother.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	607	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_69188bd1	dorian	So… where is he now?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	608	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_96e63474		Niko didn't answer immediately. Instead, he exhaled slowly through his nose. He tightened his fist and stared at the runes etched along his arm.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	610	"[what]"
