ch5_niko_choices_9616b235		I looked down. The air grew thick, like the room had suddenly shrunk.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	614	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_7634c7de	dorian	I'm sorry to hear that.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	616	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_363dfd1e	niko	Don't worry about it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	617	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_64ac1fcc		A long silence stretched between us. Then, slowly, Niko reached out, his fingers grazing the petals of the flowers surrounding the unconscious man.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	619	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_91102783	niko	The flowers seem to be working. He just needs rest, and he'll be okay.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	621	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_2710003f	dorian	You're a follower of the death god, right?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	627	dorian "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_717fee9b		Niko looked down at his half-robe.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	629	"[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_61dd63f6	niko	Haven't I already told you? But yes. Yes, I am. It's no secret—I'm a member of the Prophets.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	631	niko "[what]"
ch5_niko_choices_59399808		The moment he said it, my vision blurred. My breathing hitched.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	633	"[what]"
