ch5_niko_common_768816ab		And above the burning city, hovering in the smoke-cloaked sky, it loomed. A figure with wings—the death god.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	656	"[what]"
ch5_niko_common_765bfa31		I remember it destroying the castle of Tianho. I couldn't believe it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	659	"[what]"
ch5_niko_common_cb2d0420		And then—Paladin Cyrus.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	660	"[what]"
ch5_niko_common_fcdb89b6		I remembered his voice. I remembered the way he lifted his sword, and the way he ran towards the ruins. He had volunteered to face it alone.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	661	"[what]"
