ch5_living_room_83e3ccb6		Yuxuan shot me a look of pure amusement.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	898	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_5617aa05	yuxuan	Don't worry, Dorian. We'll have you fed up in no time.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	900	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_living_room_d55f9b2c		I sighed, rubbing the back of my neck.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	902	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_11bf6653	dorian	I almost forgot. I haven't eaten anything all day.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	904	dorian "[what]"
ch5_living_room_8c1d5eec		And then it hit me—Elias.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	906	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_17d44a46		I glanced toward him, still caught up in his conversation with Tim. The two of them were huddled close, exchanging animated whispers about something I couldn't hear.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	907	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_7515439c	dorian	Elias is probably starving too…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	909	dorian "[what]"
