ch5_living_room_6bde2e04	yuxuan	Umm… Tianho chocolates. Took him to a booth. It was owned by Cheng Industries so I told my employee to give him as much as he wanted.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	915	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_living_room_9d461e41		I blinked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	917	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_7db1ec1f	dorian	How many did he eat?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	919	dorian "[what]"
ch5_living_room_a9301071		I stared at him, and a sense of deep, immediate regret settled in.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	921	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_b64ea4ed	yuxuan	I… uh… got caught up. Associates called. Kinda lost track. *clears throat* Sorry?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	923	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_living_room_2c34ed1a		I sighed.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	925	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_eee07532	dorian	Tetrad, help me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	927	dorian "[what]"
ch5_living_room_c71920ed	yuxuan	Hey, he liked it! Kept him happy while you were gone.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	928	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_living_room_027ffd80		I looked back at Elias, who was still bouncing on his feet, chattering away with Tim, his energy seemingly endless.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	930	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_ad50042a		So that's why he was so hyper.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	931	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_b9e355c0		I let out a slow breath, pinching the bridge of my nose. Yuxuan clapped a hand on my shoulder.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	932	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_72b7b9ce	yuxuan	Relax. He'll crash eventually. Maybe after dinner. Or maybe at midnight.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	934	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_living_room_804dc33f		Weng approached us again, wiping her hands on her apron.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	936	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_372fb7c9	weng	What do you want, sir?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	938	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_c160decf		She took out a small notebook from her side pocket at her white dress.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	940	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_7301d354		I gave her a confused look. I look at Yuxuan, who smiled and put his arm around me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	941	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_de884efc	yuxuan	She's asking about our food, Dorian. You already know what I want, Miss Weng.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	943	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_living_room_50b51ef8	weng	Of course. I wouldn't want Master Yuxuan being denied his favorite dragonfire curry.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	944	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_df032bff	dorian	Tianho's Dragonfire Curry?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	945	dorian "[what]"
ch5_living_room_8c95e93a	yuxuan	Spicy, bold, and delicious!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	946	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_living_room_5c38236c	weng	Suiting an amazing inventor such as yourself, Master Yuxuan! You're truly incredible!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	947	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_a73e6355		I watched as she showered him with praise, her words flowing like an endless stream. I smiled awkwardly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	949	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_531b0dc2	yuxuan	Thank you so much, Miss Weng.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	951	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_living_room_22cb5f32	weng	A man of vision! An inspiration to the people of Tianho! The greatest inventor in the kingdom! The—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	952	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_9d043bde		Weng paused, looking at me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	954	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_35957128	weng	Ah, apologies, Sir Burnham. I can make other things too, of course. I'm well-versed in the cuisines of all five kingdoms—Tianho, Gale, Hinami, Mjoll, and the Centennial Isles.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	956	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_e4340b32	weng	Just name any dish. If we have the ingredients, I'm sure I can cook it for you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	957	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_ae8fb112	weng	And if we don't have the ingredients, well I'll just buy it from the market at the Tianho city proper. I don't mind. It's directly up ground from here. There's still time before it closes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	958	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_96c0cda7		I rubbed the back of my neck.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	960	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_a26cd008		Honestly, I wasn't picky. I'd eat just about anything. But maybe I should choose a dish from one of the kingdoms.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	961	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_48152f34	weng	Don't underestimate the power of food, Sir Burnham. They say you can visit a place just by tasting its dishes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	963	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_51e9d651		Her eyes gleamed with enthusiasm.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	965	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_76c20e30	weng	And I believe that's true.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	967	weng "[what]"
ch5_living_room_69afb479		She leaned forward slightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	969	"[what]"
ch5_living_room_695e05bf	weng	So, Sir Burnham, what cuisine are you in the mood for?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	971	weng "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_f5ed6a1f		I stepped into the storage room, my movements silent against the cold stone floor. The dim flicker of a single candle cast long shadows across the walls, stretching and shifting with the flame's uncertain dance.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	987	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_903fa514		Unlike the other rooms, the air was stale, thick with dust and the faint scent of damp stone.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	988	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_4911cfe7		Then I heard it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	989	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_fa5c5156		A voice—low, trembling—whispering desperate words into the dark.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	990	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_0ea43723	svante	Mighty Enoch… Please… *tears* Your servant is afraid…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	992	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_76e29b83		I stood still, just inside the doorway. He hadn't noticed me. Not yet.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	994	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_4c80ef5a	svante	I know I have strayed, I know I have sinned... I never meant to question Father. I never meant to doubt him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	996	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_9d0990b9		He paused, sniffling.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	998	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_38fa1cb9	svante	I— I betrayed our sacred law. I know I should never have doubted Father... I know my place. But… Kristin…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1000	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_a9dfb535	svante	But… what if…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1001	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_6654e1de	svante	What if Kristin was right all along?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1002	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_5d97ad3a		He swallowed hard, his words now coming in ragged, pleading bursts.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1004	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_043fa2ad	svante	My Lord Enoch, please... *crying* Please don't abandon me. Not now, not when the monster is near.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1006	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_757a9efd	svante	My mother needs me… She's the only family I have left, my Lord. Please help me…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1007	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_2453721b	svante	I… I don't know what to do anymore. I'm so sorry. I feel so lost and broken. Please, mighty Enoch, show me mercy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1008	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_1d1ac8bb		His fingers twitched uselessly, bound and helpless against the wall. The sheen of Jinshen steel caught the dim candlelight, the cuffs glinting like an executioner's blade. I recognized them instantly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1010	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_28155995		Good. That way, I wouldn't have to worry about his channeling.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1011	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_bf00ebcd		I took a single step forward.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1012	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_ccf32062		His breath hitched. His head snapped up so fast I thought he'd hurt himself.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1013	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_b6df4b64	svante	No… No, no, no… Please—please, no…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1015	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_1e3abec7	dorian	Calm down. I just want to ask you a few things.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1016	dorian "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_f7722119	svante	Sir… I beg you. Please let me go! *crying* I have a mother! She's sick. She's the only family that I have left!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1017	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_57a0a8ea	svante	No… No, no, no… Don't hurt me! I beg you! Please—please, no—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1018	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_4d0a60d3		I heard his stomach rumble.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1020	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_f814a178	dorian	You must be starving. Here, I just need to—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1022	dorian "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_561ef93e	svante	I… Is that it, sir? I-If you wish to spare me, Please, you don't have to feed me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1023	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_ff143f88	svante	Please. I'll eat morsels from the garbage if I have to. Just please let me live!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1024	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_3b9785aa		I rolled my eyes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1026	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_b4cf2fc4	dorian	ARE YOU GOING TO CALM DOWN OR NOT?!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1028	dorian "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_e45e1469		Silence. He stopped struggling. But I can see him trembling a bit.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1030	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_c5e24bd8	svante	*crying*	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1032	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_0f45966f	dorian	No one needs to die today. I just need to ask you a few questions. Calm down.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1033	dorian "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_93a1d90b	svante	Y-Yes, sir…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1034	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_3332691f		I took a deep breath.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1036	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_a447d63e	dorian	Let's start with the obvious. Why does Mjoll want the man that we saved dead?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1038	dorian "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_a9dc11d6		Svante hesitated, his fingers twitching against the cuffs. His gaze flickered toward the floor, avoiding mine.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1040	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_26ad073e	svante	I—I don't know everything, sir. I swear it. But...	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1042	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_197163b9	svante	Father said that the man we were supposed to kill… cursed him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1043	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_f7aa74ad	dorian	Cursed him?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1044	dorian "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_f9c95e57		My eyes widened.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1046	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_84088995	svante	That's what he told us. That the man— he was some kind of heretic and is an enemy of Mjoll.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1048	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_cad5b3fa	dorian	And you believe him?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1049	dorian "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_35448f4b		A brief silence erupted between us.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1051	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_71a7517e	svante	No… I think he's… lying…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1053	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_ef82b355	svante	Because he's lied before… with the Elias incident. He told everyone that it was Elias who killed his own mother.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1054	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_5fdf9ea5	svante	My sister Kristin… she accompanied the two prophets as they examined Queen Ekaterina's body.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1055	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_d493718c	svante	The fingerprints on the knife belonged to Father himself. But still, he tried to pin the blame on Elias...	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1056	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_f713260a	svante	I was the only person my sister talked to about this. At first, I got mad at her for doubting Father but after her death, I… I started to wonder.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1057	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_6a98baec	svante	What if she was right?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1058	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_f2229a5f	dorian	So you think the man you were sent to kill today… was innocent?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1059	dorian "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_ebf7e84a	svante	Y-Yes, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1060	svante "[what]"
ch5_storage_room_c38b85c1		I nodded. That was brave of him to say. For an aldorith, it would have been a death sentence.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1062	"[what]"
ch5_storage_room_6020f555	svante	Do you have any more questions, sir?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1064	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_5ef90c4b	dorian	When I saw the battlefield, the bodies of your brothers and sisters were scattered around him. Yet, you… you were still alive.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1079	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_bb689876	dorian	How did he know you were on his side?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1080	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_fae05b74	svante	I… defended him. He saw it, surely.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1081	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_9fec7795	svante	I tried to explain to our commanders Tian Xun, to Lady Aoi… to all of them… I told them that something felt wrong. That I wasn't sure this man deserved to die.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1082	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_1d7820c3	svante	But Tian Xun and Lady Aoi called me a traitor.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1083	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_d6644b75	svante	Then… he attacked. Almost everyone who came close to him died. They didn't expect him to be that powerful. No one did.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1084	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_724c15f5		I studied him carefully. He wasn't lying. The tremor in his voice, the way his body tensed at the memory—it was all genuine.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1086	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_762c44ff	dorian	What about your commanders? Tell me about them.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1088	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_f6d9e7b8	svante	Oh them? Tian Xun was um…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1089	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_b0af4759		Svante shifted, adjusting his wrists against the cuffs. He winced slightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1091	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_dc53c300	svante	Sorry. A little bit itchy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1093	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_1707e610	svante	Tian Xun was a loose cannon. He's obsessed with bombs. They say he grew up in Tianho in an impoverished family, even though his father worked for the King.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1094	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_54c23533	dorian	You mean King Long Shen, the late king of Tianho?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1095	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_ed627d25		Svante frowned a little bit.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1097	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_09e479d6	svante	I think so. Sorry, sir. I'm not familiar with the other kings. I only know Father.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1099	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_97c5df55	dorian	And the last one? Lady Aoi?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1100	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_ffe96935	svante	Oh! Believe it or not, Lady Aoi used to be a songstress from Hinami.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1101	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_eefe2bf9	dorian	That's not what I asked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1102	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_b88cb24a		Svante flinched.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1104	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_a0676431	svante	O-Oh! Sorry, sir! She—uh—she's a powerful water channeler from Hinami. She just… showed up at the palace one day, gave a demonstration of her power.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1106	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_b73a26c5	svante	Father was impressed. So impressed that he made her commander of an entire battalion of Aldoriths.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1107	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_cec37778	dorian	You don't sound convinced.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1108	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_01bac846	svante	Just between you and me, sir… word among my brothers is that Father only sees Queen Ekaterina in her.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1109	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_18970178	dorian	Yeah…. I can see that.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1110	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_adb96338	dorian	What's your name?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1116	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_fd600c42		Svante blinked at me, looking genuinely confused—almost as if the question was unnecessary.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1118	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_bf202e9d	svante	Svante, sir. Svante Nordstrom.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1120	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_0b25ca49		I tilted my head slightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1122	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_3ba72bb5	dorian	Nordstrom. As in Gustav Nordstrom. You took on the king's last name. I'm surprised he even let you do that.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1124	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_517e7474	svante	You're not wrong, sir. Usually, us aldoriths carry the last name of their mothers.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1125	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_08507455	svante	M-Mother received special permission from Father, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1126	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_1d934a33	dorian	Really? How come?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1127	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_1cfb18d0	svante	Mother was at the top of her career when she gave birth to me. She was a songstress. Father was really into her back then.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1128	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_2648bccf	dorian	What about your sister?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1129	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_907e8dca	svante	Kristin…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1130	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_124d73c3		He paused, his hands twitching against the cuffs.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1132	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_00b3a094	svante	She only carried my mother's name.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1134	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_9599e947	dorian	How did you recognize me?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1140	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_b091191e		He shifted slightly, as if trying to find the right words.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1142	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_418735fb	svante	I… I actually didn't at first, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1144	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_80a2f188	dorian	How come?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1145	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_715a79c8		Svante's gaze flickered towards me. At my hair, my clothes, everything.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1147	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_dbd6fb43	svante	Well, your hair, sir. It's different. And your clothes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1149	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_009dcbe8		He bit his lip, hesitating.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1151	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_db75b0ad	svante	Elias was also wearing girl's clothes so I didn't recognize him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1153	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_7fd74934	dorian	But then you figured it out.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1154	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_c78b5eec	svante	It wasn't until I heard you call Elias' name that I put all the pieces together.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1155	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_244a4200	dorian	You called me a different name as well. Why?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1156	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_3072ebcc	svante	The Massacrer of Mjoll. They named you that after you… you—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1157	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_4df8c162		His breathing quickened, and his eyes darted toward mine—fearful, desperate. A long silence erupted.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1159	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_b8ee46bb	dorian	I won't hurt you. I promise.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1161	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_6345b07e	svante	O-Okay, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1162	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_95ca7cfa	dorian	That's all. I don't have any more questions for you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1168	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_a104e09b		I exhaled, stepping back, watching him in the dim light. His breathing had steadied, but his posture remained rigid, his body still caught between fear and exhaustion.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1170	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_e8af5897	svante	Sir Dorian…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1172	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_a3a33443	svante	What would you have done? If you were me?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1173	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_7ed042b5		I narrowed my eyes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1175	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_cbe0b692	dorian	If I were you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1177	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_0ce96617		He nodded. His violet eyes met mine, pleading, uncertain. No malice. No scheming. Just a hurt and tormented man.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1179	"[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_9c102ef5	dorian	I wouldn't let doubt rule me. I would decide. I'd choose a side. And stick with it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1181	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_choices_8f628574		He swallowed, nodding slowly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1183	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_f5509d4d		A pause. I studied him. The way his shoulders slumped in exhaustion, the way his fingers twitched, the way he spoke—like a man who had already lost everything and was now only waiting for the final blow.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1194	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_8ef5ed61		I'd seen men like him before. Broken. But not beyond repair.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1195	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_2c98c11f		I felt that he wasn't a threat. Not now.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1196	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_d227399c		I reached into my pocket, fingers brushing over the cold metal key Weng had given me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1197	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_3497e3f3	dorian	Can I trust you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1199	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_common_05b43821		His head shot up.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1201	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_3c711362	svante	Trust me with what?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1203	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_common_36a42691		I held the key up between us, letting it glint in the dim light.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1205	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_83a0594a	dorian	Swear to me—by your god—that you will never harm my family.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1207	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_common_c653b18f	svante	I… I wasn't planning to, but…. I swear by Enoch that I will never harm you or your family.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1208	svante "[what]"
ch5_svante_common_500ee715		Then, without breaking eye contact, I stepped forward and reached for his cuffs.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1210	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_e6091b75		The metal was cool beneath my fingers as I slid the key into the lock. A sharp click echoed in the small room.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1211	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_03e21b5a		The heavy Jinshen steel fell away from his wrists.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1212	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_189fa9c9		Svante inhaled sharply, his arms dropping limply to his sides. He stared at his freed hands for a moment.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1213	"[what]"
ch5_svante_common_03cf5060	dorian	Don't make me regret this.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1215	dorian "[what]"
ch5_svante_common_521d471c	svante	I won't, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1216	svante "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_6387e936		As Svante and I stepped into the main room, the warm scent of spices and simmering broth filled the air. The rich aroma of slow-cooked meats and fragrant herbs curled through the space.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1230	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_71ae19d1		Weng was still by the stove, stirring a pot with practiced ease. The moment her gaze landed on Svante, she set down her spoon and wiped her hands on her apron, stepping forward with a welcoming smile.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1231	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_0e6f8e0c	weng	Ah, you're awake! That's good to see. You must be starving.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1233	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_0205a028	weng	Proper introductions are in order. I'm Cai Weng, Master Yuxuan's assistant. It's a pleasure to meet you, young man.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1234	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_d9a74b08		He blinked, as if taken aback by the kindness in her voice. He looked at me, and then back to her.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1236	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_383ccd75	svante	I… Yes. Thank you, m-mam. My name's Svante. Svante Nordstrom. I-I'm so glad to meet you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1238	svante "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_784f02de	weng	Dinner is ready. Please have a seat, gentlemen and I'll be serving you up the food.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1239	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_f41ec5fa	weng	I hope you like haugensoppa. I made it just for you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1240	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_29712877	svante	Haugensoppa? You… know Mjoll cuisine?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1241	svante "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_a1600ccb	weng	Oh, I've had my fair share of travelers from the North. You lot love your root vegetable stews.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1242	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_bc742af3		Svante opened his mouth, perhaps to ask more, but before he could reply—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1244	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_dd633f47		A sudden burst of tiny, hurried footsteps came from the hallway.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1245	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_1a67c9f2	tim	Elias, you're going too slow! Dinner's about to start!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1247	tim "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_7ce55664	elias	I'm carrying Tedda and my book! It's a little heavy!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1248	elias "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_45bcdc3a		Tim marched into the room first, his small arms wrapped around a thick, leather-bound book far too large for someone his age. The title was embossed in gold: 'Tianho's Ancient Dynasties.'	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1250	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_3535c012		Elias followed closely behind, but instead of a weighty tome, he proudly clutched a children's coloring book, its cover splashed with bright rainbows and smiling animals. Perched lazily on top was Tedda.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1251	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_88d091f2		Tim sighed dramatically, adjusting his glasses.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1252	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_0e001e3a	tim	Elias, I told you to pick something educational.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1254	tim "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_f3f574a5	elias	This one had colors, Tim! It's got wainbows! They're edumecational.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1255	elias "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_16546baf	tim	Rainbows are not educational, Elias.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1256	tim "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_7fbdd81a		Elias gasped as he spotted Svante. His eyes widened with delight.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1258	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_77cb28cc	elias	Look! It's the pink haired guy! He's awake!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1260	elias "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_ae52bc4e	tim	Huh? He's not pink haired, Elias! It's violet!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1261	tim "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_4d75d416	elias	Tim, pink and violet are the same. Right, Tedda?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1262	elias "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_0e93fbfb		Tedda: …	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1263	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_5fc57ee1	tim	What?! They're completely different colors. Right, Miss Weng?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1264	tim "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_664bbae9	svante	Actually… my hair is violet. It's not really pink.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1265	svante "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_5327ac2d	tim	HA! It's violet! See, Elias? See? I win! HAHA—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1266	tim "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_22259854	weng	Tim, quit it. You're embarrassing me in front of Sir Burnham and Sir Nordstrom. Now be a good boy and help me serve dinner.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1267	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_setup_fc1761e4		Tim huffed but did as he was told, setting his book down carefully before moving to grab a stack of bowls.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1269	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_b3131309		Tianho.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1291	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_02491315		I remembered when Elara and I took the kids there—before everything. Before the tragedy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1292	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_d749f437		It was beautiful once. Its people, its culture, its heart.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1293	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_6682207b		And then there was Yuxuan.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1294	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_ca8e9a60		He always told me he'd never forget that I saved him that day, but I don't remember a thing. Maybe I didn't want to. Tianho was a place I tried to forget.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1295	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_022c9023		But Yuxuan… he's always been there for me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1296	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_6ae38121		I turned to him, offering a small smile.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1298	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_450c12b4	dorian	Thank you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1300	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_380841fc		A faint blush dusted Yuxuan's face.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1302	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_77e0bdc9	yuxuan	H-huh?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1304	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_a327b537		I glanced back at Weng.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1306	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_d9b23728	dorian	I'll go with something from Tianho, Miss Weng.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1308	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_dbb512af		She clapped her hands together, eyes lighting up.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1310	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_0cc1153a	weng	A fine choice, sir Burnham! I know just the thing!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1312	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_8e2b5c4f		She jotted something down on her notepad, nodding to herself.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1314	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_dbc79226	weng	I'll make sure it captures the beauty of Tianho.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1316	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_ffb4b3c0		Gale. My home.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1322	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_4cbc719f		The Empire of Gale was a land of plenty, its cuisine just as vast and rich.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1323	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_83330174		I hadn't had a proper Galean meal since—since Elara and I took the kids to that banquet.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1324	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_08b39c41		It was extravagant, hosted by Empress Olympia herself. That night, she made a grand announcement—the Emperor of Kyeongjang would be visiting.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1325	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_cdf4afac		The people had erupted with joy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1326	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_be4a928c		Kyeongjang.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1327	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_91a133d4		And now, the unconscious man we had just saved… he was from Kyeongjang.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1328	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_fd883992		His mind channeling, his appearance… everything.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1329	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_76fd0cff		Something about him. Just made me very curious.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1330	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_e79842db		I shook the thought away. No use overthinking. Once he wakes up, we'll hopefully get to know him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1331	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_fedde1ca	dorian	I'll have something from Gale. My homeland.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1333	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_4a7dc6de		Weng's eyes widened.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1335	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_33f6e616	weng	You're from the Empire of Gale, Sir Burnham?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1337	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_6fc13b33		I nodded. She practically gushed.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1339	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_6f73ce6d	weng	Oh, I've been to Gale before! With my lover! The sights—oh, the sights!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1341	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_ef789eb1		She twirled her pen between her fingers, a nostalgic smile crossing her lips.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1343	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_eb4b8583	weng	Ah… then you'll need something fit for a nobleman. I have just the thing, Sir Burnham!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1345	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_866fbb7d		Hinami. The Kingdom of Water and Shadow Channelers.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1351	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_521658b3		I had plenty of friends from Hinami. When I was a Paladin for the Empress of Gale, I had the honor of meeting King Tatsuya Fujiwara during his state visit.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1352	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_c8a420be		Familiar—yet, I'd never actually been.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1353	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_5aa4745c		Niko came to mind. Hinami was his home.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1354	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_23bee655		Hamatame Village, specifically.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1355	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_4d5c4ea9		The way he moved, the way he carried himself—his grace, his skill. Watching him heal the unconscious man had been nothing short of mesmerizing.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1356	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_8d2b516e		How he used his shadows to protect us from the Mjoll soldiers earlier.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1357	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_d39c20fe	dorian	I think I'll have something from Hinami.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1359	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_0582a112		Weng's eyes gleamed with excitement.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1361	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_fb89a39e	weng	The Island Kingdom of Hinami—oh! Such beautiful beaches!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1363	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_f845a156		She tapped her notepad, thinking.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1365	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_a2643c86	weng	The fish there? Top notch. There's even an elusive species called Aokibane—very rare!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1367	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_75ffb223		She chuckled to herself.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1369	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_86000a38	weng	And of course, there's the famous Ganderbilt—an exquisite delicacy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1371	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_1a3b0b4c		She snapped her fingers.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1373	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_89356088	weng	Great choice, Sir Burnham. Something warm and comforting, then.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1375	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_choice_f7ee7ea9		Mjoll.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1381	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_55c73531		Elara's hometown. I lived there for—what? Four, five years? I'd lost count.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1382	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_0682a34e		King Gustav. Queen Ekaterina. Elias. Vasily.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1383	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_8ed0b01b		Tetrad above, Vasily.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1384	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_60519977		I can't believe I killed him. Vasily. My friend.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1385	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_95dfcc0f		Not only him. But an entire battalion of aldoriths and soldiers. It was a blur. But I can hear the aldoriths cries and screams.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1386	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_545765cb		Not just him. An entire battalion of Aldoriths and soldiers. It was a blur, but I could still hear it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1387	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_3aab8793		The screams.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1388	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_9630d44f		And now… Svante.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1389	"[what]"
ch5_food_choice_bb814ee0		I'd seen the way he looked at me. He was afraid. I don't want him to be. I—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1390	"[what]"
