ch5_nap_79e41c81		I must have slept for an hour or two.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1494	"[what]"
ch5_nap_13ca8f5e		I stretched, still groggy from my nap, the muffled sound of rain aboveground blending with the quiet hum of Yuxuan's underground laboratory.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1495	"[what]"
ch5_nap_3451ffff		The dim lighting cast long shadows, and the scent of something rich and savory filled the air.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1496	"[what]"
ch5_nap_f44ac5d7		My stomach rumbled.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1497	"[what]"
ch5_nap_15b0a10a	weng	Sir Burnham? You woke up early. Thought you'd sleep until dinner was ready.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1499	weng "[what]"
ch5_nap_596c8fbd		She stood near the stove, stirring a pot, the warmth from the fire flickering across her face.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1501	"[what]"
ch5_nap_fe1fc178	dorian	Did I?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1503	dorian "[what]"
ch5_nap_0670f11d		I could still feel the weight of sleep clinging to me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1505	"[what]"
ch5_nap_b191a480	weng	Master Yuxuan's in his study. Said he had work to do.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1507	weng "[what]"
ch5_nap_3a5cd2bb		I nodded, rubbing the back of my neck as the scent of the stew—something hearty and rich—filled my nostrils.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1509	"[what]"
ch5_nap_c3dea55b	dorian	Smells good, Miss Weng.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1511	dorian "[what]"
ch5_nap_49bd8ffc	weng	You're too kind, Sir Burnham. You'll get your share soon enough. But—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1512	weng "[what]"
ch5_nap_100446d8		She wiped her hands on her apron and approached me, lowering her voice slightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1514	"[what]"
ch5_nap_18ce3a7d	weng	Remember the Aldorith? Svante?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1516	weng "[what]"
ch5_nap_2a468a77	dorian	Yeah. What about him?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1517	dorian "[what]"
ch5_nap_97ff3cdf		She glanced toward the hallway leading to the storage room.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1519	"[what]"
ch5_nap_0f350b79	weng	I took the liberty of preparing something from Mjoll for him. His food's almost ready. No use letting him starve.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1521	weng "[what]"
ch5_nap_194aacdd		She reached into her pocket and pulled out a small, cold iron key, pressing it into my palm.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1523	"[what]"
ch5_nap_77e8902f	weng	You're the one who he has a problem with. I was thinking you should be the one to check on him. See if he's woken up. Maybe talk to him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1525	weng "[what]"
ch5_nap_996fc18d		I looked down at the key. It was simple but sturdy, and heavier than I expected.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1527	"[what]"
ch5_nap_fc5b8dc9	dorian	Is he even awake?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1529	dorian "[what]"
ch5_nap_bc8c6ce9	weng	Hard to say. He's been out for a while, but knowing sleeping powder, its effects should have worn off about now.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1530	weng "[what]"
ch5_nap_6e800114	dorian	And if he's a threat?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1531	dorian "[what]"
ch5_nap_8d673dc2		Weng wiped her hands on her apron again.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1533	"[what]"
ch5_nap_b13987fa	weng	Then you'll know what to do, sir Burnham.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1535	weng "[what]"
ch5_nap_4cb3b7fc		I nodded. A test. A chance. If Svante didn't prove to be a threat, I could unlock his cuffs. But if he did…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1537	"[what]"
ch5_nap_2b47e089		I clenched my jaw and stood up, pocketing the key.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1538	"[what]"
ch5_nap_e0f1f8a6	dorian	I'll see where he stands.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1540	dorian "[what]"
ch5_nap_456243fe		Weng nodded in approval before turning back to the stove, resuming her work.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1542	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_f5ed6a1f		I stepped into the storage room, my movements silent against the cold stone floor. The dim flicker of a single candle cast long shadows across the walls, stretching and shifting with the flame's uncertain dance.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1552	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_903fa514		Unlike the other rooms, the air was stale, thick with dust and the faint scent of damp stone.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1553	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_4911cfe7		Then I heard it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1554	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_fa5c5156		A voice—low, trembling—whispering desperate words into the dark.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1555	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_feb59d0e	svante	Mighty Enoch… Please… *tears* Your servant is afraid…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1557	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_76e29b83		I stood still, just inside the doorway. He hadn't noticed me. Not yet.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1559	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_4c80ef5a	svante	I know I have strayed, I know I have sinned... I never meant to question Father. I never meant to doubt him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1561	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_9d0990b9		He paused, sniffling.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1563	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_38fa1cb9	svante	I— I betrayed our sacred law. I know I should never have doubted Father... I know my place. But… Kristin…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1565	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_a9dfb535	svante	But… what if…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1566	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_6654e1de	svante	What if Kristin was right all along?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1567	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_5d97ad3a		He swallowed hard, his words now coming in ragged, pleading bursts.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1569	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_727ac6b3	svante	My Lord Enoch, please... *crying* Please don't abandon me. Not now, not when the monster is near.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1571	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_757a9efd	svante	My mother needs me… She's the only family I have left, my Lord. Please help me…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1572	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_2453721b	svante	I… I don't know what to do anymore. I'm so sorry. I feel so lost and broken. Please, mighty Enoch, show me mercy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1573	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_1d1ac8bb		His fingers twitched uselessly, bound and helpless against the wall. The sheen of Jinshen steel caught the dim candlelight, the cuffs glinting like an executioner's blade. I recognized them instantly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1575	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_28155995		Good. That way, I wouldn't have to worry about his channeling.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1576	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_bf00ebcd		I took a single step forward.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1577	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_ccf32062		His breath hitched. His head snapped up so fast I thought he'd hurt himself.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1578	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_b6df4b64	svante	No… No, no, no… Please—please, no…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1580	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_1e3abec7	dorian	Calm down. I just want to ask you a few things.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1581	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_65a03806	svante	Sir… I beg you. Please let me go! *crying* I have a mother! She's sick. She's the only family that I have left!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1582	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_57a0a8ea	svante	No… No, no, no… Don't hurt me! I beg you! Please—please, no—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1583	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_4d0a60d3		I heard his stomach rumble.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1585	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_f814a178	dorian	You must be starving. Here, I just need to—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1586	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_561ef93e	svante	I… Is that it, sir? I-If you wish to spare me, Please, you don't have to feed me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1587	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_ff143f88	svante	Please. I'll eat morsels from the garbage if I have to. Just please let me live!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1588	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_3b9785aa		I rolled my eyes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1590	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_b4cf2fc4	dorian	ARE YOU GOING TO CALM DOWN OR NOT?!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1592	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_b191bb2a		Silence. He stopped struggling. But I could see him trembling.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1594	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_57671a06	svante	*crying*	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1596	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_0f45966f	dorian	No one needs to die today. I just need to ask you a few questions. Calm down.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1597	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_93a1d90b	svante	Y-Yes, sir…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1598	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_3332691f		I took a deep breath.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1600	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_a447d63e	dorian	Let's start with the obvious. Why does Mjoll want the man that we saved dead?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1602	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_a9dc11d6		Svante hesitated, his fingers twitching against the cuffs. His gaze flickered toward the floor, avoiding mine.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1604	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_26ad073e	svante	I—I don't know everything, sir. I swear it. But...	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1606	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_197163b9	svante	Father said that the man we were supposed to kill… cursed him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1607	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_f7aa74ad	dorian	Cursed him?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1608	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_f9c95e57		My eyes widened.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1610	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_84088995	svante	That's what he told us. That the man— he was some kind of heretic and is an enemy of Mjoll.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1611	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_cad5b3fa	dorian	And you believe him?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1612	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_35448f4b		A brief silence erupted between us.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1614	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_71a7517e	svante	No… I think he's… lying…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1616	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_ef82b355	svante	Because he's lied before… with the Elias incident. He told everyone that it was Elias who killed his own mother.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1617	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_5fdf9ea5	svante	My sister Kristin… she accompanied the two prophets as they examined Queen Ekaterina's body.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1618	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_d493718c	svante	The fingerprints on the knife belonged to Father himself. But still, he tried to pin the blame on Elias...	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1619	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_f713260a	svante	I was the only person my sister talked to about this. At first, I got mad at her for doubting Father but after her death, I… I started to wonder.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1620	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_6a98baec	svante	What if she was right?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1621	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_f2229a5f	dorian	So you think the man you were sent to kill today… was innocent?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1622	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_ebf7e84a	svante	Y-Yes, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1624	svante "[what]"
ch5_interrogation_c38b85c1		I nodded. That was brave of him to say. For an aldorith, it would have been a death sentence.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1625	"[what]"
ch5_interrogation_6020f555	svante	Do you have any more questions, sir?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1626	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_5ef90c4b	dorian	When I saw the battlefield, the bodies of your brothers and sisters were scattered around him. Yet, you… you were still alive.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1644	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_bb689876	dorian	How did he know you were on his side?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1645	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_fae05b74	svante	I… defended him. He saw it, surely.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1646	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_9fec7795	svante	I tried to explain to our commanders Tian Xun, to Lady Aoi… to all of them… I told them that something felt wrong. That I wasn't sure this man deserved to die.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1647	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_1d7820c3	svante	But Tian Xun and Lady Aoi called me a traitor.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1648	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_d6644b75	svante	Then… he attacked. Almost everyone who came close to him died. They didn't expect him to be that powerful. No one did.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1649	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_724c15f5		I studied him carefully. He wasn't lying. The tremor in his voice, the way his body tensed at the memory—it was all genuine.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1651	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_762c44ff	dorian	What about your commanders? Tell me about them.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1653	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_f6d9e7b8	svante	Oh them? Tian Xun was um…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1654	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_b0af4759		Svante shifted, adjusting his wrists against the cuffs. He winced slightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1656	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_dc53c300	svante	Sorry. A little bit itchy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1658	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_1707e610	svante	Tian Xun was a loose cannon. He's obsessed with bombs. They say he grew up in Tianho in an impoverished family, even though his father worked for the King.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1659	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_54c23533	dorian	You mean King Long Shen, the late king of Tianho?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1660	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_5d7f3fd5		Svante frowned a little.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1662	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_09e479d6	svante	I think so. Sorry, sir. I'm not familiar with the other kings. I only know Father.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1664	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_97c5df55	dorian	And the last one? Lady Aoi?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1665	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_ffe96935	svante	Oh! Believe it or not, Lady Aoi used to be a songstress from Hinami.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1666	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_eefe2bf9	dorian	That's not what I asked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1667	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_b88cb24a		Svante flinched.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1669	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_a0676431	svante	O-Oh! Sorry, sir! She—uh—she's a powerful water channeler from Hinami. She just… showed up at the palace one day, gave a demonstration of her power.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1671	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_b73a26c5	svante	Father was impressed. So impressed that he made her commander of an entire battalion of Aldoriths.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1672	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_cec37778	dorian	You don't sound convinced.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1673	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_01bac846	svante	Just between you and me, sir… word among my brothers is that Father only sees Queen Ekaterina in her.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1674	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q1_18970178	dorian	Yeah…. I can see that.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1675	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_adb96338	dorian	What's your name?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1681	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_fd600c42		Svante blinked at me, looking genuinely confused—almost as if the question was unnecessary.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1683	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_bf202e9d	svante	Svante, sir. Svante Nordstrom.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1685	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_0b25ca49		I tilted my head slightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1687	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_3ba72bb5	dorian	Nordstrom. As in Gustav Nordstrom. You took on the king's last name. I'm surprised he even let you do that.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1689	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_517e7474	svante	You're not wrong, sir. Usually, us aldoriths carry the last name of their mothers.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1691	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_08507455	svante	M-Mother received special permission from Father, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1693	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_1d934a33	dorian	Really? How come?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1694	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_1cfb18d0	svante	Mother was at the top of her career when she gave birth to me. She was a songstress. Father was really into her back then.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1695	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_2648bccf	dorian	What about your sister?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1696	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_907e8dca	svante	Kristin…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1697	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_124d73c3		He paused, his hands twitching against the cuffs.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1699	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q2_00b3a094	svante	She only carried my mother's name.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1701	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_9599e947	dorian	How did you recognize me?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1707	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_b091191e		He shifted slightly, as if trying to find the right words.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1708	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_418735fb	svante	I… I actually didn't at first, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1710	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_80a2f188	dorian	How come?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1711	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_da0016a9		Svante's gaze flickered toward me. At my hair, my clothes, everything.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1713	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_dbd6fb43	svante	Well, your hair, sir. It's different. And your clothes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1714	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_009dcbe8		He bit his lip, hesitating.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1715	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_db75b0ad	svante	Elias was also wearing girl's clothes so I didn't recognize him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1716	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_7fd74934	dorian	But then you figured it out.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1718	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_c78b5eec	svante	It wasn't until I heard you call Elias' name that I put all the pieces together.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1719	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_244a4200	dorian	You called me a different name as well. Why?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1720	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_3072ebcc	svante	The Massacrer of Mjoll. They named you that after you… you—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1721	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_4df8c162		His breathing quickened, and his eyes darted toward mine—fearful, desperate. A long silence erupted.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1723	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_b8ee46bb	dorian	I won't hurt you. I promise.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1725	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q3_6345b07e	svante	O-Okay, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1726	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_95ca7cfa	dorian	That's all. I don't have any more questions for you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1732	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_a104e09b		I exhaled, stepping back, watching him in the dim light. His breathing had steadied, but his posture remained rigid, his body still caught between fear and exhaustion.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1733	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_e8af5897	svante	Sir Dorian…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1734	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_a3a33443	svante	What would you have done? If you were me?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1735	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_7ed042b5		I narrowed my eyes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1737	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_cbe0b692	dorian	If I were you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1739	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_0ce96617		He nodded. His violet eyes met mine, pleading, uncertain. No malice. No scheming. Just a hurt and tormented man.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1741	"[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_9c102ef5	dorian	I wouldn't let doubt rule me. I would decide. I'd choose a side. And stick with it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1743	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_q4_8f628574		He swallowed, nodding slowly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1745	"[what]"
ch5_interro_common_f5509d4d		A pause. I studied him. The way his shoulders slumped in exhaustion, the way his fingers twitched, the way he spoke—like a man who had already lost everything and was now only waiting for the final blow.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1751	"[what]"
ch5_interro_common_8ef5ed61		I'd seen men like him before. Broken. But not beyond repair.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1752	"[what]"
ch5_interro_common_2c98c11f		I felt that he wasn't a threat. Not now.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1753	"[what]"
ch5_interro_common_d227399c		I reached into my pocket, fingers brushing over the cold metal key Weng had given me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1754	"[what]"
ch5_interro_common_3497e3f3	dorian	Can I trust you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1756	dorian "[what]"
ch5_interro_common_05b43821		His head shot up.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1758	"[what]"
ch5_interro_common_3c711362	svante	Trust me with what?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1760	svante "[what]"
ch5_interro_common_36a42691		I held the key up between us, letting it glint in the dim light.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1762	"[what]"
ch5_interro_common_83a0594a	dorian	Swear to me—by your god—that you will never harm my family.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1764	dorian "[what]"
