ch5_interro_common_500ee715		Then, without breaking eye contact, I stepped forward and reached for his cuffs.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1767	"[what]"
ch5_interro_common_e6091b75		The metal was cool beneath my fingers as I slid the key into the lock. A sharp click echoed in the small room.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1768	"[what]"
