ch5_return_to_lab_6387e936		As Svante and I stepped into the main room, the warm scent of spices and simmering broth filled the air. The rich aroma of slow-cooked meats and fragrant herbs curled through the space.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1783	"[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_71ae19d1		Weng was still by the stove, stirring a pot with practiced ease. The moment her gaze landed on Svante, she set down her spoon and wiped her hands on her apron, stepping forward with a welcoming smile.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1784	"[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_0e6f8e0c	weng	Ah, you're awake! That's good to see. You must be starving.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1786	weng "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_0205a028	weng	Proper introductions are in order. I'm Cai Weng, Master Yuxuan's assistant. It's a pleasure to meet you, young man.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1787	weng "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_d9a74b08		He blinked, as if taken aback by the kindness in her voice. He looked at me, and then back to her.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1789	"[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_383ccd75	svante	I… Yes. Thank you, m-mam. My name's Svante. Svante Nordstrom. I-I'm so glad to meet you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1791	svante "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_784f02de	weng	Dinner is ready. Please have a seat, gentlemen and I'll be serving you up the food.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1792	weng "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_f41ec5fa	weng	I hope you like haugensoppa. I made it just for you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1793	weng "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_29712877	svante	Haugensoppa? You… know Mjoll cuisine?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1794	svante "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_a1600ccb	weng	Oh, I've had my fair share of travelers from the North. You lot love your root vegetable stews.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1795	weng "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_bc742af3		Svante opened his mouth, perhaps to ask more, but before he could reply—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1797	"[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_dd633f47		A sudden burst of tiny, hurried footsteps came from the hallway.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1798	"[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_1a67c9f2	tim	Elias, you're going too slow! Dinner's about to start!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1800	tim "[what]"
