ch5_return_to_lab_7c4ea8b6		Tim marched into the room first, his small arms wrapped around a thick, leather-bound book far too large for someone his age. The title was embossed in gold: Tianho's Ancient Dynasties.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1803	"[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_3535c012		Elias followed closely behind, but instead of a weighty tome, he proudly clutched a children's coloring book, its cover splashed with bright rainbows and smiling animals. Perched lazily on top was Tedda.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1804	"[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_88d091f2		Tim sighed dramatically, adjusting his glasses.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1805	"[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_0e001e3a	tim	Elias, I told you to pick something educational.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1807	tim "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_f9be2051	elias	This one had colors, Tim! It's got rainbows! They're educational.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1808	elias "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_16546baf	tim	Rainbows are not educational, Elias.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1809	tim "[what]"
ch5_return_to_lab_7fbdd81a		Elias gasped as he spotted Svante. His eyes widened with delight.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1811	"[what]"
