ch5_chung_wakes_6171eaa5		I felt something. A shift in the air.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1836	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_b12fb5e9		A presence.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1837	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_7ef365bc		Slowly, I turned.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1838	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_dd04f3f4		The once-unconscious man was now floating. His feet hovered barely above the ground, the air around him rippling like disturbed water.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1839	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_5cb45c8c		Then, his head bowed slightly. A voice entered our minds.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1840	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_ef94348e	chung_hee	You must be the ones who rescued me. Thank you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1842	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_8d0d60fb		The room fell into an eerie silence.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1844	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_b9b9d739		We were all seated at the long table—me, Yuxuan, Niko, Svante, and the once-unconscious man. Roboto hummed softly as it moved around the table, methodically placing glasses of water in front of each of us.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1846	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_ce01fb5e	roboto	One for you… One for you…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1848	roboto "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_c0130d3a	roboto	Would you prefer ice cold or lukewarm, Sir Niko?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1849	roboto "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_8dac53ee	niko	Ice cold. Thanks.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1850	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_6e518ba7		Then—the voice returned. Not spoken aloud, but entering our minds like a gentle ripple through still water.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1852	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_058037cc	chung_hee	Once again, I wish to express my deepest gratitude. Words alone cannot convey how much I owe you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1854	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_61a794e1	chung_hee	If not for you, I would have met a terrible fate.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1855	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_66f7010b	dorian	Don't mention it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1856	dorian "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_1d6c584d	niko	And you don't need to be so formal. You don't have to use mind channeling all the time—we can understand you just fine if you speak normally.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1857	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_319a5e66		There was a pause.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1859	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_6e58c9cd	chung_hee	Forgive me. I can only communicate through mind channeling. I hope it is not of any inconvenience to you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1861	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_eaa04d9f	yuxuan	Really? Why not?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1862	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_7e40f322	chung_hee	I was born unable to speak. Nor hear. This is the only way I can make myself understood.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1863	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_7997b3f3	niko	So you're a deaf-mute… and you're using your channeling abilities to expand your senses. That's impressive.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1864	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_08427c68	dorian	I respect that.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1865	dorian "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_11c32a2b	niko	I actually know a little bit of sign language. My brother and I studied it so we can translate for the Emperor of Kyeongjang's son—he's also a deaf-mute.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1866	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_3f440699	svante	The son of the Emperor of Kyeongjang's a deaf-mute? Poor guy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1867	svante "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_071ab564	chung_hee	You know my father?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1868	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_8afc6472	niko	Father?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1869	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_a8ec05a2	chung_hee	Yes, you've heard correctly. My name is Hyon Chung-hee. Son of Emperor Hyon Min-joon. And the Emperor of Kyeongjang.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1870	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_16b8cb94		Silence.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1872	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_a707b497		For a moment, none of us reacted.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1873	"[what]"
