ch5_chung_wakes_53e0454b		I leaned back slightly, watching the man—the Emperor—carefully.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1890	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_6991084f		His expression did not waver. He did not fidget, nor did he show any trace of uncertainty.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1891	"[what]"
