ch5_chung_wakes_01e9eac5	chung_hee	Yes, my Father, Emperor Min-joon and my mother passed away during their time in Tianho.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1894	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_c579456f	chung_hee	In the wake of their passing, I was named their successor. I am the Emperor now.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1895	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_8fe26e53		He exhaled slowly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1897	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_ff1c7d09	chung_hee	But as for me. I am alive and well. Thanks to all of your combined efforts.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1899	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_9d461e41		I blinked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1901	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_597bf714		Silence stretched across the room, thick and suffocating. No one spoke. No one moved.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1902	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_d54f0fae		Then—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1903	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_689d4e40		Yuxuan burst out laughing.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1904	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_95833b3f	yuxuan	HAHAHAHAHAHA!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1906	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_e018e44e	yuxuan	Pfft—alright, that's it. I've officially lost my mind because of that damn propulsion system. This is a dream. A really weird, stress-induced dream.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1907	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_0fbee42c		He waved a hand in front of his face dramatically.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1909	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_6d7e58f7	yuxuan	I mean, let's think about this logically. What are the odds that the actual Emperor of Kyeongjang would be sitting at my dinner table, in my secret underground lab, eating my food?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1911	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_fc342c6f		He turned to Weng, looking utterly amused.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1913	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_eacac511	yuxuan	Come on, Miss Weng. Pinch me. Maybe I'll wake up in my office, face-first in a pile of paperwork.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1915	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_ce622dc3		Weng let out a long, suffering sigh, pressing her fingers against her temples.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1917	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_58747968	weng	Master Yuxuan… Are you sure?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1919	weng "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_1fd7d3bd		Niko chuckled, shaking his head.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1921	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_f08f18ff	niko	Well, I didn't exactly expect to be dining with the owner of Cheng Industries at his 'secret laboratory' either, let alone with an elderly lady as his personal maid… but here we are.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1923	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_c7090e93	niko	On top of that, let's look at our dinner party for a second, shall we?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1924	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_fc4d1843	niko	First up, we have a former Paladin who can channel earth, wind, and fire. Let's also not forget the spectacle with the draconic fire earlier.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1925	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_e4a30040		He flicked a glance at me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1927	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_c7ab7700	niko	Next we have an aldorith with violet hair who switched sides and can manipulate metal at will, an affinity that less than one percent of the population can even dream of.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1929	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_bda4d291		At that, Svante visibly tensed, his fingers curling ever so slightly on the table. But he smiled and said nothing.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1931	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_d46a06cc	niko	A talking robot with a mind of its own. And—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1933	niko "[what]"
