ch5_chung_wakes_1b921332	niko	Right. Moving on.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1938	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_8a4b780d	niko	A green-haired toddler who, for some reason, spends his free time reading damn bibliographies instead of playing with toys.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1939	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_a077f990		Tim blinked up at him from behind his book, entirely unfazed. Then, as if on cue, he calmly turned a page in his heavy tome—Tianho's Ancient Dynasties.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1941	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_f2c1ad05	tim	Hnn…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1943	tim "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_faf3f149	niko	A crossdressing toddler who just so happens to be the crown Prince of Mjoll and carries around a smelly ragdoll named 'Tedda.'	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1944	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_2a96fcb1		Elias suddenly giggled, completely unaware of the tension in the air. He held up his coloring book, showing it off proudly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1946	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_27036a09	elias	Look! Wainbow, daddy!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1948	elias "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_09f88ec4	tim	Not now, Elias. The grown-ups are talking.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1949	tim "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_2dd43d8c	niko	And you have me. A Prophet of the death god, Enoch, who happens to be his Chosen.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1950	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_cf243f19		Niko shot Yuxuan a slow, knowing smirk.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1952	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_7e28035a	niko	So tell me, Yuxuan—are you really that surprised that the man sitting with us is the Emperor of Kyeongjang?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1954	niko "[what]"
