ch5_chung_wakes_eb33709a	weng	You're such an open-minded and understanding person, Master Yuxuan. The pinnacle of open-mindedness!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1959	weng "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_7dc700b4	yuxuan	Aww thank you, Miss Weng! Well, I am a veryyyyy understanding man, so—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1960	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_1e7491b7		I buried my face in my palms.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1962	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_b36a7ebb	chung_hee	I see. You are all… quite the interesting group.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1964	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_b8a142f8		Chung-hee's expression remained unreadable. Svante suddenly spoke up, his voice quiet but firm.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1966	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_9f575001	svante	If I may… I believe His Majesty is telling the truth.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1968	svante "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_f89fcf42		A hush settled over the group. Svante's eyes were downcast.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1970	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_c04c1dad	svante	Father said the Emperor of Kyeongjang was going to be the next target. He told us the Emperor was a sick, twisted, dishonorable person.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1972	svante "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_b675a304		His hands clenched into fists.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1974	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_f381222b	svante	And I believed him at first. I had no reason to but I believed him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1976	svante "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_c3333c31	svante	But… when I met you, Your Majesty, you were kind. You spoke to us with dignity. You offered us peace.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1977	svante "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_f7ea89b2	svante	I didn't believe you could be the Emperor because you weren't the monster I was taught to fear.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1978	svante "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_54705de2	svante	But looking at it now, he must have been lying. Not that you weren't the Emperor but the part where you were a sick, twisted person.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1979	svante "[what]"
