ch5_chung_wakes_b898d0d0		The Emperor of Kyeongjang… No, Emperor Min-joon's son.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1986	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_9c21cfaf		A thousand questions swirled in my mind. Questions about the past. About the Tragedy of Tianho. About why he was targeted. About why he was here.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1987	"[what]"
