ch5_chung_wakes_da820427	yuxuan	Miss Weng! You shouldn't have! My precious dragonfire curry! Oh, how I've missed you!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1997	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_546d61ea		He clasped his hands together dramatically.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	1999	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_b57ca7d1		Meanwhile, Roboto whirred into view, carefully balancing trays of food.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2000	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_86aebfab	roboto	Robotoooo is ready to s-s-s-serve~ F-f-food is ready~	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2002	roboto "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_1b2d2b8c	niko	The robot shouldn't be allowed to serve food. It might crash again.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2003	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_bf2d34d7	yuxuan	You're the only one who thinks that, Niko. Roboto is a technological marvel and- IT. DOES. NOT. CRASH.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2004	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_3f6d2623		Niko's eyes blinked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2006	"[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_86a6396d	niko	Yuxuan, I mean no disrespect to Roboto. It's amazing. But a while ago it almost crashed and brought down a jar filled with water in it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2008	niko "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_e41f80f5	yuxuan	Why I never!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2009	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_chung_wakes_109735f0	niko	Dorian was there. He'll be our witness. Dorian, it's true right?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2010	niko "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_aa6951cc	dorian	Yeah… Roboto did almost trip. But Niko caught it in time, so I don't think it matters much.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2026	dorian "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_32ddf43f	niko	There you have it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2027	niko "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_9c006622	roboto	M-m-m-master Dorian is c-c-correct! I was transporting water, but my sensors momentarily overloaded. Sir Niko was able to assist me.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2031	roboto "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_63e4eea9	yuxuan	Oh… Maybe some recalibration is in order. Can't have my masterpiece faltering under pressure.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2032	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_876dcb7e		Roboto blinked rapidly, its mechanical eyes adjusting.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2034	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_b0ea9adb	roboto	C-c-confirmed! Roboto will undergo recalibration!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2036	roboto "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_3c38e415		Yuxuan sighed, adjusting his glasses.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2038	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_d52b9104	yuxuan	Great. Now I feel guilty. Roboto, remind me to run diagnostics later.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2040	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_007e1b47	roboto	Reminder set! Diagnostics will begin at 20:00 hours!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2044	roboto "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_3e756077		I shook my head, folding my arms.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2050	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_a2c1d057	dorian	No, Roboto had it under control.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2052	dorian "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_ca12cecf	roboto	D-d-data inconclusive. Roboto must recalibrate!!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2056	roboto "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_b15cdfb6		Yuxuan's expression brightened, and he gave me a satisfied nod.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2058	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_1388671f	yuxuan	Thank you, Dorian. At least someone here has good judgment.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2060	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_97c9c2b9		Niko pinched the bridge of his nose.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2062	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_fb6e465a	niko	Oh, for the love of—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2064	niko "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_1397c2ad	yuxuan	Let this be a lesson, Niko. One should never question the technological marvel that is Roboto.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2065	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_d3efa6e2		Roboto whirred smoothly across the room, carefully placing each dish in front of us.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2067	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_1a4c3fac	roboto	Here is your f-f-f-food, Your Majesty. We lack information on Kyeongjang cuisine, but we have prepared a special dish from Gale.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2069	roboto "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_458a6253		As Roboto spoke, its small monitor flickered to life, displaying a video of hand signs.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2071	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_8305e73d	roboto	T-T-This is called mountain herb stew along with a plate of sautéed highland greens.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2073	roboto "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_d15dd24e	roboto	Cooked with garlic and a drizzle of fragrant mountain oil. Enjoy, Your Highness!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2074	roboto "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_b6b3ef70		Chung-hee's expression softened slightly. He raised his hands and responded with hand signs of his own.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2076	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_0be5328c		Roboto paused for a moment before beeping happily.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2077	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_b23a98e0	roboto	A-A-A-Affirmative! I will not call you Your Majesty. T-t-thank you, Sir Chung-hee!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2079	roboto "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_d2832c2d		Niko and Yuxuan paused, exchanging glances.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2081	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_101bfdfc	niko	Roboto knows sign language?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2083	niko "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_8e66cf5f	yuxuan	I programmed Roboto to recognize multiple languages, but I don't remember programming sign language. Fascinating…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2084	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_11997096	weng	As is expected from our amazing and very talented inventor, Master Yuxuan!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2085	weng "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_0053c90d	yuxuan	Aww thank you, Miss Weng!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2086	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_8ed7b71b	niko	Oh brother.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2087	niko "[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_d768f395		Niko rolled his eyes, picked up his chopsticks and started eating.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2089	"[what]"
ch5_roboto_witness_fd7ddd6e		Chung-hee picked up his chopsticks, taking a bite of the stew. For the first time since arriving, he looked almost… at ease.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2090	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_175477fe		Roboto whirred in again, humming softly as it approached me with a steaming bowl. The rich, savory aroma of black garlic and star anise filled the air, mingling with the sharper spice of Yuxuan's dragonfire curry.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2111	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_b1d9c4d0	roboto	Here are your Moonlit Noodles, M-M-Master D-D-Dorian!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2113	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_e5983799		The little machine's voice stuttered slightly, but its movements were careful and precise as it placed the bowl before me. The deep, dark broth gleamed under the dim light, the noodles glistening as they curled beneath the surface.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2115	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_f8e12e18		Resting atop them were thin slices of braised beef, their edges caramelized to perfection, and a single soft-boiled tea egg, its yolk just barely runny.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2116	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_69b15a9d		Yuxuan leaned over with interest, his eyes lighting up.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2118	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_2484249e	yuxuan	Hey Dorian, do you know why the dish is called Moonlit noodles?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2120	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_a1da38e6		I looked at the egg and it vaguely looked like the moon.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2127	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_be78493b	dorian	Is it because of the egg?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2129	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_6cf19579		Yuxuan looked at the bowl.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2131	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_aaeecf9b	yuxuan	Oh you're right. I haven't thought of it that way.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2133	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_98c0c979	dorian	You mean you didn't know, Yu?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2134	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_401939c3	yuxuan	I don't know. That's why I'm asking.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2135	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_641ce27e	dorian	No. Why are they called that?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2139	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_3566e2cf	yuxuan	I don't know. That's why I'm asking you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2140	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_432666d1	dorian	This is my first time eating these, Yu. Why would I know that?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2141	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_ee8c7e13	yuxuan	… Oh…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2142	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_4cac9291	yuxuan	Well, yeah. Figures. You don't really look like someone who dabbles in fine cuisine.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2143	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_a1c85572		I raised an eyebrow.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2145	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_8f1c3ec9	dorian	What's that supposed to mean?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2147	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_72e04da7		Yuxuan waved his hand vaguely.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2149	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_c55fac10	yuxuan	No, no, no. I didn't mean it in a bad way. I meant that you can eat almost anything and still be happy! Not many people are like you, Dorian.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2151	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_87117e7b	dorian	I'll take that as a compliment. Thanks, Yu.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2152	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_9fcbb1f0	roboto	M-m-m-master Dorian is a man of culture! M-m-my sensors detect a 92.3% probability that he will e-e-e-enjoy this meal!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2156	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_ff42628d	yuxuan	But what happens if Dorian doesn't like it?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2157	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_a35b8e1b		There was a brief pause. Then—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2159	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_61172840	roboto	E-e-e-error! Scenario not calculated! Rebooting crisis protocol… Processing…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2161	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_2c34ed1a		I sighed.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2163	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_f6c23f57	dorian	Yu, stop messing with Roboto.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2165	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_983e67bb	yuxuan	It's just part of his crisis protocol subroutine, Dorian. He can handle it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2166	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_f423e655		He leaned back, arms crossed, a knowing smirk tugging at his lips.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2168	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_6a670402	yuxuan	Here, I'll show you. Roboto, give me a compliment.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2170	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_0cf0214e	roboto	A c-c-c-compliment? Certainly!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2174	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_1663f7ea		The little machine beeped twice before its voice rang out.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2176	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_c023ce20	roboto	M-M-Master Yuxuan, you are the greatest inventor Ena has ever known! Your intelligence will put the Almighty Tetrad Li Mengtia to shame!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2178	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_0254b6b2	yuxuan	Awww Roboto, you really know how to make a guy feel special.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2179	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_e224ca74	roboto	I-I-I'm glad you like it, Master Y-Y-Yuxuan! I-I-I try my b-b-best!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2180	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_f66024c4		I let out a slow breath, stirring my noodles with my chopsticks. The warmth from the broth seeped into my fingers.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2182	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_181540b9	chung_hee	You should be proud of yourself, Sir Yuxuan.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2184	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_fcce2647		Yuxuan blinked, his smirk brightening into a smile as he turned to the Emperor.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2186	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_afe6ecaf	yuxuan	Really, Your Majesty?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2188	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_c099e33e		Chung-hee nodded, setting his chopsticks down neatly beside his bowl.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2190	"[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_ae503117	chung_hee	Roboto is a marvel. Not only functional but adaptable. Few inventors create something with the ability to learn, let alone something with such… personality.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2192	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_moonlit_96adf58b	chung_hee	In Kyeongjang, our automatons do not use sign language. They do not adapt to individual needs. I appreciate what Roboto did.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2193	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_8e610c98	roboto	Here it is! A meal fit for a conqueror—Master D-D-Dorian's Imperial Truffle Roast!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2204	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_e28ef202	roboto	Slow-roasted venison, glazed with truffles and wine reduction, served with buttered root vegetables, all arranged to p-p-please even the most discerning p-p-p-p-p-p-p~	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2205	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_ddecc19c	dorian	Palate. Thanks, Roboto.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2206	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_a95ecf87		It placed the dish before me with an exaggerated flourish, its screen blinking in what I could only assume was enthusiasm. The scent of roasted venison and truffle filled the air, rich and mouthwatering.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2208	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_cafb307b		I eyed the venison, the glaze shimmering. Chung-hee leaned forward slightly, his sharp eyes scanning my plate with interest.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2209	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_0be574cb	chung_hee	Fascinating…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2211	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_15f6351c	dorian	Something wrong?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2212	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_1802e64f		He studied the dish as if committing every detail to memory.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2214	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_369f3988	chung_hee	Kyeongjang is familiar with many foreign dishes, but an Imperial Truffle Roast is a rarity among our people.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2216	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_a24a2912	chung_hee	Truffles themselves are difficult to acquire within our lands… and venison, though not unheard of, is not often prepared in this manner.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2217	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_cfb9be4c		Tim, who had been quietly flipping through the pages of his latest book, had dropped it onto the table. He blinked up at Chung-hee, adjusting his glasses.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2219	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_e90d7fa1	tim	Your Majesty, I've read that ancient Kyeongjang dishes were once served on lacquered stone platters infused with medicinal resins.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2221	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_ba063578		The table fell silent.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2223	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_0c72c01a		I turned to Tim, half-expecting him to be making things up. But no—his expression was as serious as ever.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2224	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_968c4fdb		Chung-hee stiffened. Just barely, but enough for me to notice. His gaze, so often cool and composed, flickered with something else. A sharp glint of recognition.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2226	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_0908ddcf	chung_hee	...That practice fell out of use centuries ago.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2228	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_60658e63		His fingers tapped once against the table.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2230	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_c6e7a866	chung_hee	Few even remember it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2232	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_4903fc15		Tim tilted his head.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2234	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_8f1a2f7d	tim	It was abandoned before the time of the Death God Enoch, correct?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2236	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_bf9fcbf4		Chung-hee's head turned toward the boy fully now, shocked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2238	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_3b7da1c3	tim	I read it from a pre-Enoch book. Very few literature from that time period are preserved. Luckily Master Yuxuan keeps a few in his big library.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2240	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_e2f7c23e		He spread his tiny arms wide to emphasize just how massive Yuxuan's collection was.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2242	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_e0ae76f6		Chung-hee studied him with the same scrutiny he had given my meal moments before.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2244	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_67001557	chung_hee	How old are you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2246	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_5dcccfc9		Tim adjusted his glasses.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2248	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_46c854f1	tim	Five.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2250	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_9d461e41		I blinked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2252	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_3edf5175		Chung-hee blinked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2253	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_50497e72		The two of us stared at him.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2254	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_b52b09e6	dorian	Are you sure?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2256	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_8703272d	tim	Yes, I'm sure, sir Dorian.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2257	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_f443f176	roboto	R-R-Roboto confirms! Tim is 100% five years old!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2261	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_4beca55d	yuxuan	Ahaha… don't mind Tim. He's just... Well, we call him a little genius here.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2263	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_95c55b02	chung_hee	A five-year-old… quoting lost histories and the fall of divine ages...	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2265	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_4505ca08	chung_hee	In Kyeongjang, wisdom is not measured by years, but by the depth of one's spirit. And yours, young scholar, is fathomless.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2266	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_18d3a2d5		Tim beamed proudly, pushing up his glasses with both hands.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2268	"[what]"
ch5_food_truffle_57b469fa	tim	Anyway, thank you for confirming it, Your Majesty. I was just curious.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2270	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_1405599d	roboto	A dish fit for a traveler of tides and a seeker of shadows! Presenting your Fisherman's Hotpot, M-M-Master D-D-Dorian—crafted with the heart of the sea and the soul of the island itself!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2283	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_5d86d07a	dorian	Thank you, Roboto. It looks delicious.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2285	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_3e176307		As I took the first sip of the miso broth, the rich umami flavor spread over my tongue, warming me instantly. The fresh seafood, barely touched by the heat, still had that ocean-bright taste, balanced perfectly with the mild tofu and tender greens.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2287	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_8b42a6b3		Beside me, Niko had his head bowed, hands loosely clasped.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2288	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_f39d1bfc	niko	Bless us O mighty Enoch and these thy gifts, which we are about to receive.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2290	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_354947b6	niko	May this food restore our strength, giving new energy to tired limbs and bodies.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2291	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_10af14b6		He finished his prayer and glanced at my bowl.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2293	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_e7a54784	niko	Delicious, huh?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2295	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_3aa0010d	dorian	Yeah. The miso broth with the seafood is a great combination.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2296	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_3a55e9e4	niko	It does. Used to have that all the time when I stopped by Hinami Port for fish and supplies.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2297	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_4818af28		I raised a brow.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2299	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_f203de35	dorian	Didn't peg you as the type to sit around a fire with a bunch of fishermen.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2301	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_422d7e96	niko	Well, when you're a doctor in a small village in Hamatame, you take what you can get. They'd trade me fresh seafood, supplies for herbs and organic medicine.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2302	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_3cfe7e58	niko	Oftentimes I'd end up sharing a meal with them.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2303	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_5a681229		He stirred his spoon through the broth, a hint of nostalgia flickering across his face.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2305	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_0aca09a2	niko	Hinami isn't as wealthy as Mjoll or Gale, but the sea is generous. The people there take care of each other. No one eats alone after a long day at sea.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2307	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_908a0d36	dorian	I take it you miss your home nation?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2309	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_44de5dc1	niko	You could say that. They say that Hinami will be hosting the Tragedy of Tianho's anniversary tomorrow. Perhaps I'll—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2310	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_385fabff		A small commotion at the other end of the table pulled my attention away.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2312	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_93528792	tim	Elias, you need to eat your chicken. And your rice. And your vegetables.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2314	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_1d321db2		Elias shook his head and clutched Tedda like a shield.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2316	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_14b4c335	elias	No!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2318	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_88a471f1		Tim sighed, pinching the bridge of his nose.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2320	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_9d19a215	tim	Elias, you can't just eat chocolate and sweets all the time!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2322	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_d9c7cfbd		Niko chuckled.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2324	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_5cbdd3d5	niko	What seems to be the problem?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2326	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_c4adb98c	tim	Elias won't eat his vegetables!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2327	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_81b7ad1a	dorian	Elias. We talked about this. You need to eat your vegetables.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2329	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_befbb8c3	tim	Listen to your father, Elias.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2330	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_f47d055f	elias	But daddy…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2331	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_91aa173d	niko	Alright, kiddo. How about this—if you eat your chicken, rice, and veggies, I'll read you a bedtime story tonight. How's that sound?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2332	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_d5130b85		Elias's eyes lit up.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2334	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_69f1abce	elias	A story?! Okay!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2336	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_c1566653		Elias glanced at his plate, then back at Niko. He picked up his spoon and carefully scooped up a piece of chicken. After a moment's hesitation, he popped it into his mouth.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2338	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_b435ccd7		Then he beamed again.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2339	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_25e9d830	elias	I eat!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2341	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_de06680a	tim	(muttering) Manipulated by bedtime stories…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2342	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_9fd02859		After a pause, he fidgeted slightly before speaking up.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2344	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_5b094114	tim	I… I'm included too, Sir Niko, right? I can join the storytime… if you want…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2346	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_f1f63772		Niko grinned.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2348	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_dfdaad5b	niko	Sure, but only if you eat your food too.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2350	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_470fce33	tim	Okay. Let's eat, Elias.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2351	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_06f7e866	roboto	C-c-cognitive reinforcement successful! Reward-based motivation confirmed as eff-eff-effective!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2355	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_df77d353		I glanced at Niko, offering a nod of thanks.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2357	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_bc92ca9d	dorian	Thanks for your help with Elias. Didn't know you were good with kids.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2359	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_4562eded		Niko shrugged, a small smile tugging at his lips.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2361	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_c0368f47	niko	You're welcome, Dorian.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2363	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_93263ef9		I watched as Tim and Elias, now fully focused on their plates, quietly ate their food.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2365	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_1282d543		Across the table, Chung-hee had been quietly observing.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2366	"[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_683c652d	chung_hee	Fascinating… You should be proud of yourself, Sir Niko.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2368	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_food_hotpot_b571a730	niko	I used to have a lot of kid patients back in Hamatame. You learn a few tricks when you're treating scared little ones, Your Majesty.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2369	niko "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_df7a08dc	roboto	Behold! A meal fit for a warrior! A dish crafted for the strong and the steadfast—M-M-Master D-D-Dorian, your Mjollian Mead-Braised Lamb awaits!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2382	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_6bcb01a0		I stared down at the plate in front of me. Thick, spiced mead sauce clung to the slow-braised lamb shank, its aroma warm and heady. Beside it, a dense slice of black rye bread and a small dish of herbed butter sat neatly on the tray.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2384	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_f5d17cff		It looked rich—very rich. Heavy. Nothing like the plain food I usually ate.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2385	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_15ba7286	svante	Have you eaten that before, Sir Dorian? Back in Mjoll?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2387	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_a6adee8c	dorian	I… don't remember eating this. I usually just made something easy—stews, boiled potatoes, whatever was quick.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2388	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_02f4635a	svante	Did Father's cooks serve you food when you were working under him as a mercenary?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2389	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_70fc9ac4	dorian	No, I always refused. Dishes like this are too fancy for my taste back then.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2390	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_436c9b04		I glanced at him, then back at the food.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2392	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_c786c2b4		Svante hesitated before exhaling softly, a sad smile ghosting his lips.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2394	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_6fd8221b	svante	My mother used to love that dish. Before she got sick… back when she was still— back when people still talked about her.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2396	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_a3decd3c	dorian	Your mother?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2397	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_c8d26266	svante	I doubt you'd know her sir Dorian. She was a songstress—a famous one, once. Back in Tianho, before she got sick.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2398	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_29eab051	svante	Her voice used to be everywhere—on the radio, in the theaters. People adored her.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2399	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_458a9c1d		He stared down at the dish, a flicker of something bittersweet in his eyes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2401	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_dfe63e6b	svante	She used to call that dish 'the taste of home.' Said it reminded her of the time before… everything changed.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2403	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_2f5d2933		I looked down at the dish again. To me, it was just another meal—fuel to keep going, nothing more. But to him? It was a memory.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2405	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_d001fd57		I nudged the plate slightly in his direction.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2406	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_e127c79b	dorian	You can have it if you want. I really don't mind. I'll just ask for something else—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2408	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_9fa7ab43		Svante's eyes widened slightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2410	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_48384816	svante	What? No, I— I appreciate it, sir, but you should eat. It's a warrior's meal, after all. My mom would have liked that, though.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2412	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_2e6aed04	svante	You should eat it, sir Dorian. Who knows? Maybe you'll grow to like something other than stale bread and ration bars, sir.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2413	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_3b9785aa		I rolled my eyes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2415	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_f7c80dee	dorian	You're making it sound like that's all I eat.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2417	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_6c03069e	svante	No, no, no! I apologize, sir, I—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2418	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_2963829e	roboto	M-m-m-my sensors indicate that M-M-Master Dorian is just fooling around.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2422	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_fec01aa1	svante	Oh, um… S-Sorry…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2423	svante "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_db1e48ba		I shrugged, took my chopsticks, and went to eating.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2425	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_ed58973d		A few minutes after I started eating, Weng approached, setting down another dish with practiced ease.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2427	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_3295155a	weng	Here are some Tianho dumplings I prepared. Extra portions.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2429	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_8c369f9e	tim	Yay! Elias, you need to try these!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2430	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_70c8c912	roboto	Tianho dumplings—suitable for any occasion!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2434	roboto "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_75c084c7		She then placed a fresh pot of tea in the center of the table, steam curling elegantly from its spout.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2436	"[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_6f25f047	weng	And some tea. Freshly brewed from tea leaves from Tianho. I hope you like it.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2438	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_765972f6	yuxuan	The teacup looks beautiful, Miss Weng!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2439	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_9e88e829	tim	We got it yesterday from a bargain store, Master Yuxuan!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2440	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_lamb_5dd3b855	weng	Now, everyone grab a cup and I'll pour you some.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2441	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_common_5df2c00c		Weng then approached the two toddlers, smoothing out the wrinkles in her apron.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2452	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_31c94678	weng	Alright, little ones. What would you like for dinner?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2454	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_common_afb805eb		Tim adjusted his tiny glasses, crossing his arms.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2456	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_e4549f4f	tim	Braised Tianho fish with fermented black beans. Steamed tofu with ginger. And a side of sautéed bok choy with garlic.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2458	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_common_9d461e41		I blinked.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2460	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_623e2f1b		Weng just smiled and jotted the words down on the notepad.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2461	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_d944ca80	dorian	What kind of five-year-old asks for that?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2463	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_common_e943ddf7	yuxuan	Hahaha! That's Tim. He has quite the refined palate, just like me and Weng.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2464	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_common_226c2d42		Tim pushed his glasses up the bridge of his nose, utterly serious.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2466	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_e69230de	tim	Proper nutrition is essential for cognitive development of toddlers like myself. My brain requires high-quality fuel.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2468	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_common_1c03939f		Meanwhile, Elias was bouncing on his heels, practically vibrating with excitement.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2470	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_45e8bece	elias	Ooh! I want choco—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2472	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_common_c9a3c25a		I cut him off before he could even finish.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2474	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_52339123	dorian	Chicken. Rice. Soup. And lots of vegetables. He'll have that.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2476	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_common_74c8fb3e		Elias's little face scrunched up into a dramatic pout, his lower lip jutting out.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2478	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_48a337d5	elias	But daddy—	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2480	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_common_6ba3f8fa		I gave him The Look.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2482	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_53dd4e13	dorian	No, Elias. You already ate enough chocolate today. You need your vitamins.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2484	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_common_2f4ae696		Elias squirmed. His little hands clutched Tedda, his stuffed bear, like the poor toy could somehow convince me to change my mind.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2486	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_da28166f	tim	Vegetables are good for you, Elias.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2488	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_common_6b8eb623	elias	No, they're not… They're icky!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2489	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_common_25f539c4	tim	Yes, they are. They contain essential vitamins and minerals that help you grow stronger and support brain function. You want to be smart like me, don't you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2490	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_common_2f2db44b	elias	Fiiineeee…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2491	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_common_eede9039	weng	Alright then, why don't you two go play while I prepare dinner?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2492	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_common_07529ab3	tim	Master Yuxuan, can Elias and I go to the library?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2493	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_common_8faaa481	yuxuan	Always, Tim. Keep on reading, green-haired buddy.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2494	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_common_3cd7827e		Tim's face lit up. He turned to Elias, taking his hand like a tiny professor guiding his student.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2496	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_e6d044c8	tim	Come with me. I'll show you the library.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2498	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_common_9d438b3b		Elias blinked, surprised.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2500	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_5ad8ed82	tim	I'll show you my favorite books! Let's read together! Oh, you're gonna love the legend of the kumiho!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2502	tim "[what]"
ch5_food_common_73eec692	elias	Let's go! Ooh! Do they have pictures and flowers there?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2503	elias "[what]"
ch5_food_common_05e1200c	weng	Tim… Make sure to be back once dinner is finished, okay? It's a challenge to get you away from those books once you start. Be mindful of little Elias with you.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2504	weng "[what]"
ch5_food_common_490468bc		Yuxuan and I watched them go, both of us shaking our heads in amusement.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2506	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_5437b0dc	yuxuan	They make quite the pair huh, Dorian? They just met and they're acting like they've known each other for a long time!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2508	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_food_common_9345a1ed	dorian	No kidding.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2509	dorian "[what]"
ch5_food_common_0ba928f0		Weng chuckled as she headed toward the kitchen.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2511	"[what]"
ch5_food_common_d5a9051d	weng	You two, just sit tight and wait. Dinner will be ready soon.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2513	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_09c48fee		We continued eating.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2524	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_9bf47403		I focused on finishing my plate first—I was hungry.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2525	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_bcaef2e6		The dishes were nothing short of perfection. Weng was a damn good cook.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2526	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_13263c76		Across from me, Elias had already devoured half of his plate, looking both satisfied and slightly overwhelmed.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2527	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_1c477172		I glanced around. Once everyone had eaten their fill, I set down my chopsticks and spoke up.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2528	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_7933abbe	dorian	So, Chung. Any idea why the kingdom of Mjoll wanted you killed?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2530	dorian "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_ba0df7bd		The light-hearted atmosphere dimmed instantly. Chung-hee's expression darkened.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2532	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_b4fdc0ce		He met my gaze. Then, calmly, with the weight of finality, he spoke.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2533	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_fe5db903	chung_hee	I will end the life of King Gustav Nordstrom.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2535	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_875905d3		The entire table went silent.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2537	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_1328352a		I felt my grip tighten around my cup. The room had grown heavy, like a storm rolling in. Across from me, Svante's entire body went rigid, his fingers barely twitching against the table.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2538	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_03919a75	svante	?!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2540	svante "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_83e2920b		Niko leaned forward, brows furrowing.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2542	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_ecf08174	niko	…What?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2544	niko "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_e997479c		Weng set her teacup down slowly, her voice barely above a whisper.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2546	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_18e9fea5	weng	By the stars…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2548	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_37acfe56		Chung-hee remained composed, his gaze unwavering.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2550	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_4cc197a5	chung_hee	King Gustav seeks to claim the Divine Weapon. He wishes to rule over all nations of Ena.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2552	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_bcaaac97	niko	Divine Weapon? What are you talking about?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2553	niko "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_2f2d074f		Chung-hee didn't blink. He met our gazes.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2555	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_6adfee04	chung_hee	Five years ago, King Long Shen spoke to my father about a weapon unlike any other. A relic forged to defy the laws of life and death itself.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2557	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_72d7cf74	chung_hee	A weapon meant to raise the dead. To bring back entire armies.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2558	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_6204b044		A weighted silence followed. I had never heard of such a thing. And judging by the expressions around the room, neither had they.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2560	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_26433b47		Tim shook his head, pushing his glasses up the bridge of his nose.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2562	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_c1e6c107	tim	…I… don't think I've ever read about anything like that, Sir Chung.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2564	tim "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_8a3a8f5d	yuxuan	Hmm… That doesn't sound good. If Tim hasn't read about it, it probably doesn't exist.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2565	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_d04db881	weng	That is true, Master Yuxuan.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2566	weng "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_f3ce1d87		Roboto's glowing eyes flickered. The whir of his internal mechanisms filled the room as he processed the information.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2570	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_7fd3ea2d	roboto	Checking… C-C-C-Checking library r-r-r-records…	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2572	roboto "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_2bc26bf5	roboto	Search concluded! N-N-No records in the library about a so-called 'DIVINE WEAPON.'	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2573	roboto "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_a2a34e98	svante	Legends speak of weapons blessed—or cursed— but none have ever mentioned such a thing as a weapon bringing back people to life.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2575	svante "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_37151c72	niko	I've read all of Enoch's chronicles. Every single one. Not one of them mentions a Divine Weapon.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2576	niko "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_e8b6dbf6		He leaned forward, gaze sharp.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2578	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_a1812a27	niko	Do you even know where this thing is?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2580	niko "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_34e5bf96	chung_hee	No. Only that it is somewhere in Tianho.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2581	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_64d0f5c8	chung_hee	The fact remains. It must never fall into King Gustav's hands.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2582	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_164f2614	chung_hee	I will end him before that happens.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2583	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_f7a430ce		Yuxuan let out a sharp breath, leaning back in his chair.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2585	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_8b7bc8e2	yuxuan	I was not expecting that with my tea.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2587	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_2a7409ce		Svante's fingers trembled against the table. His voice was unsteady.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2589	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_46e1f55c	svante	Kill… Father? A-Are you sure of this, sir Chung?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2591	svante "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_9fe6650e	chung_hee	I would not speak of such things lightly.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2592	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_6ef2e70b		Roboto, usually cheerful, gave a low whirring sound.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2596	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_1c1063ac	roboto	D-d-d-danger level escalating. Adjusting threat parameters… I-I-I strongly advise against making dangerous statements out loud!	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2598	roboto "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_82e59fd4		Niko exhaled sharply, rubbing his temples.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2600	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_c5c066d2	niko	You're talking about regicide, Chung.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2602	niko "[what]"
