ch5_dinner_talk_0e93fbfb		Tedda: …	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2636	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_fffae3be	tim	Umm… never mind.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2637	tim "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_c7819706	roboto	Tim's knowledge is accurate. The Cheonmyeong Gyeol was considered the ultimate test of kingship. Only the worthy could survive.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2641	roboto "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_10228575	yuxuan	That's Tim for you. Always knowing the old stories.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2642	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_2237383b	chung_hee	I challenged Gustav months ago. He only recently accepted.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2644	chung_hee "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_6dcb9c17		Yuxuan leaned back in his chair, one brow arching in curiosity.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2646	"[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_2d1cce9a	yuxuan	Then tell me, Chung—if King Gustav agreed to the duel, why did he send a battalion of soldiers and Aldoriths after you?	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2648	yuxuan "[what]"
ch5_dinner_talk_d9e5ed67		A shadow passed over Chung-hee's face.	game/07_chapter_05.rpy	2650	"[what]"
