chapter_6_dc5e111d		His voice wavered, gentle, worried.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	236	"[what]"
chapter_6_0b12b5c1	elias	I was worried. Tedda went out to get water from kitchen.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	238	elias "[what]"
chapter_6_2567d472		I exhaled, rubbing my face.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	240	"[what]"
chapter_6_d9909500	elias	Tedda says bad dreams need water. She'll be back.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	242	elias "[what]"
chapter_6_41cd0bc7		He smiled and reached out, his tiny hand wrapping around mine.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	244	"[what]"
chapter_6_a59b02f6		I froze.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	245	"[what]"
chapter_6_28b34322		With my free hand, I wiped away the last of my tears, then gave his fingers a gentle squeeze.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	246	"[what]"
chapter_6_88b9d82f		He hesitated, then reached up with his other hand, his small arms barely making it to my face as he patted my head.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	247	"[what]"
chapter_6_0db7a8da	elias	I'm here, daddy. Okay? Don't cry. I love you.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	249	elias "[what]"
chapter_6_c1ee9f4e		I forced a chuckle, ruffling his messy curls.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	251	"[what]"
chapter_6_7d2c0969	dorian	Come on, Elias. I'm not crying. But, thank you. I love you too, Elias.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	253	dorian "[what]"
chapter_6_d3b675a9		His eyes shone, full of childlike pride.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	255	"[what]"
chapter_6_33e55ada	elias	You always protect me, Daddy. I wanna protect you too.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	257	elias "[what]"
chapter_6_38491adf		I smirked, shaking my head.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	259	"[what]"
chapter_6_34371fef	dorian	But what happens if I got attacked by an ugly monster? Would you save me?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	261	dorian "[what]"
