chapter_6_dc17bb2e	dorian	And Tedda.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	295	dorian "[what]"
chapter_6_60c77acd		The fan continued to hum softly in the quiet room. Elias yawned and hugged me close back.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	297	"[what]"
