ch6_elias_choices_c61a123c	dorian	Like angry? That's him alright. Sounds like something that he'll do.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	319	dorian "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_e2549a42	elias	But then he went inside office and it became quiet. Weaaaal quiet. He took Mister Roboto with him too.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	320	elias "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_8d054f8c	elias	But he's reallyyyy nice, daddy. He gave me and Tim some candies a while ago! He even made you and me stay in a big room like this. Maybe we can live here forever! Hihi	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	321	elias "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_4e44ec67	dorian	Well, not forever, Elias. I doubt a millionaire like him would want us to stay in his expensive home.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	322	dorian "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_fbd10cd1	elias	He wants us to, daddy! He told me that if we wanted to, we could stay here forever with him! You, me and him!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	323	elias "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_c296336a	dorian	Huh? Wait, did he really say that?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	324	dorian "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_bfe71c05	elias	Yes, daddy! Tim even made fun of Mr. Yuxuan! He said that Mr. Yuxuan was… hmm, what was it… oh, a blushing mess! Tim said Mr. Yuxuan was a blushing mess when he said we can stay here forever!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	325	elias "[what]"
