ch6_elias_choices_d961b228	dorian	Uh, well... a blushing mess is when someone has their face all red and can't speak straight. Like when they're embarrassed or have a crush on someone.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	330	dorian "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_0479d82b	elias	Ohhh, like when Mr. Yuxuan talk to you, daddy! He always gets all red and acting weiwwd! Tim was right, daddy!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	331	elias "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_76e0895d	dorian	I-I'm not sure what you mean, Elias. Yuxuan is just a good friend, that's all.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	332	dorian "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_8db3bd17	dorian	Do you remember the man we rescued? How is he doing?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	340	dorian "[what]"
ch6_elias_choices_0e1c3547	elias	Oh, the man with the cool arm, daddy?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	341	elias "[what]"
