ch6_briefing_1ffea94b		There, in the dim glow of the lanterns, Chung-hee sat with his back straight, a cup of tea cradled in his hands. Beside him, Tim fidgeted anxiously, his little fingers drumming against the wooden table.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	435	"[what]"
