ch6_tedda_alive_2830a161		I turned, and there she was, standing in the doorway with a dramatic pout. She held a pitcher of water in both hands, her pink dress swishing as she swayed on her heels. Stuffed toy ears, identical to the ones on Elias's doll, sat atop her head.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	497	"[what]"
