ch6_tedda_alive_d4fb19a7	tim	She's Tedda, Mister Dorian! Mister Chung made her alive with his mind channeling!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	501	tim "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_a9bb944e	chung_hee	Took you a while just to get water.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	502	chung_hee "[what]"
