ch6_tedda_alive_bba186b3	roboto	Me and Miss T-T-Tedda here will take care of Elias. Don't worry.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	539	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_a5a7a7fc		His arms whirred as he gave me a reassuring thumbs-up.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	541	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_f82e7c3d	roboto	You can count on Robotoooo~	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	543	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_068fbf81	tedda_alive	See? You'll be leaving Lady Elias in the best hands. Now go and take care of yourselves!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	544	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_409f6fae		Tim, who had been fidgeting near the table, quickly stepped forward.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	546	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_f9799e1c	tim	Mister Roboto, how's Master Yuxuan?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	548	tim "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_ac27e90d		Roboto's head tilted, gears clicking as he processed the question. His screen showed a smiling face.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	550	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_b17b7c87	roboto	Master Yuxuan is doing fine. I gave him some s-s-s-s-snackss!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	552	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_64e2831a	roboto	He's currently monitoring the situation ab-b-b-b-bove ground and b-b-b-below ground from his room.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	553	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_fe6d9f37	dorian	And what about Svante and Niko? Any word from them?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	554	dorian "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_ea22a0ae	roboto	Unfortunately, we were not able to contact t-t-t-t-them.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	555	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_2bc37733	roboto	If you wish to go there, now would b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b *crashes*	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	556	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_e19d2a87		His head snapped back with a loud clunk before he slumped forward slightly, his voice cutting off entirely.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	558	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_1e21b80e	tedda_alive	Umm… Is Roboto alright?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	560	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_cee27ff4	tim	Oh, um… Hold on a second.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	561	tim "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_ec1f36e3		Tim hurried behind Roboto, his small hands fumbling as he reached into his pocket. He pulled out a well-worn screwdriver, its handle smoothed from years of use.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	563	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_0fe32b76		With careful hands, he opened a panel on Roboto's back, adjusting a few loose wires.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	564	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_d32f4bf0	tim	Okay… this one connects here, and that one—yeah, that should do it…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	566	tim "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_862c796f		A few moments later, Roboto jolted back to life.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	568	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_f6eeee8b	roboto	Bzzt—Reboot sequence complete… r-r-r-r-recalibrating sensors…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	570	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_e882d734	roboto	Robotooo is ready to seerrveeee~ You can count on Robotoo~	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	571	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_21210a56	tedda_alive	Yay! Tim, you're amazing!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	573	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_485ae9d2		Tim scratched the back of his neck, looking away with a sheepish smile.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	575	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_c5b4f5b2	tim	It's nothing, Tedda. Just a small fix.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	577	tim "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_ee7a69d4		Chung-hee stepped back, shaking his head in disbelief.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	579	"[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_98b45120	chung_hee	Are all kids here that smart?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	581	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_1be7dbee	dorian	No.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	582	dorian "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_63c5ec9e	roboto	Y-Y-You should depart now if you're planning to leave.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	584	roboto "[what]"
ch6_tedda_alive_5fcb22a1	dorian	Alright. Let's head out.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	585	dorian "[what]"
ch6_depart_d7c1c54d		Tim's hands curled tighter. He inhaled deeply, then straightened up, determination flickering behind his nervous eyes.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	596	"[what]"
ch6_depart_91b3daad	tim	I can show you the way to Tianho!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	598	tim "[what]"
ch6_depart_38f74b1e	tim	I-I know all the fastest roads! I can help!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	599	tim "[what]"
ch6_depart_388fff01	chung_hee	Tim, it's too dangerous for you. You would be safer here with Tedda and Roboto.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	601	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_depart_9547f881	dorian	Chung-hee's right, Tim. Even if you're smart, you're still 5 years old. If anything were to happen to you, Yuxuan would—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	602	dorian "[what]"
ch6_depart_9355b6b2	tim	Please, Mister Dorian! I don't wanna just sit here and do nothing!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	603	tim "[what]"
ch6_depart_2c34ed1a		I sighed.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	605	"[what]"
ch6_depart_fad4f208	dorian	Dragon's bollocks. Fine. But you stay close to us, alright? And when we tell you to run, you run. No arguments. Got it?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	607	dorian "[what]"
ch6_depart_21b2f8b3		Tim's eyes widened in shock. Then he grinned, nodding rapidly.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	609	"[what]"
ch6_depart_8a1d194b	tim	Yes, sir.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	611	tim "[what]"
ch6_depart_eec242df	chung_hee	Let's head out.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	612	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_depart_cdddfc47		I gave Tedda and Roboto one last look.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	614	"[what]"
ch6_depart_a7d9fd3c	dorian	Take care of Elias, okay?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	616	dorian "[what]"
ch6_depart_75613388		Tedda beamed, placing a hand on her hip.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	618	"[what]"
ch6_depart_10e5cfa8	tedda_alive	Obviously! Now go before you miss all the fun!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	620	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch6_depart_46fb8363	roboto	C-C-Come home safe!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	621	roboto "[what]"
ch6_elevator_2684feb2		Tim led us through a dimly lit corridor, the soft hum of machinery whispering through the walls. At the end stood a small, unassuming elevator, its metal frame dull and scratched with age. No buttons. No panels. Just a smooth reflective surface.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	636	"[what]"
ch6_elevator_1117b0aa		Without a word, Tim stepped forward. A soft blue light flickered to life, scanning his face with a faint beep.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	637	"[what]"
ch6_elevator_cdfe8cc8	lab_door	Attention. Facial recognition is currently in progress.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	639	lab_door "[what]"
ch6_elevator_77e78db5	lab_door	Identity confirmed. Going above ground. Take care, Mister Tim.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	640	lab_door "[what]"
ch6_elevator_e92e1aff		The elevator jolted, then ascended so smoothly it felt like we weren't moving at all. A moment later, the doors slid open with a quiet hiss.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	642	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_20bac560		We stepped out into what looked like a rocky outcrop, hidden beneath a thick canopy of gnarled trees. The entrance behind us disappeared, concealed beneath layers of foliage and jagged stone. The air smelled of damp earth and moss, the ground uneven beneath my boots.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	658	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_76b4ee9c		Tim moved ahead, brushing past thick vines and branches that had been carefully arranged to keep the entrance secret. He pointed past the trees, toward a cluster of makeshift structures nestled in the valley below.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	659	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_fbedabf7	tim	That's Tianho.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	661	tim "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_aaf2e957		I followed his gaze, my stomach twisting at the sight before me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	663	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_974bfc53		I couldn't help but compare it to before. Before the Tragedy.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	664	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_90c29f79		Before the flames. Before the screams.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	665	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_f31add78		Before the Death God. Before the Emperor. Before the Yaoguai King.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	666	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_c196af49		Tianho—if you could even call it that anymore—looked nothing like the grand city it had once been.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	667	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_92448f57		Gone were the towering pagodas, the intricate wooden bridges that once spanned the rivers like delicate ribbons.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	668	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_519cb2b1		It was a makeshift village, hastily built upon the bones of the old Tianho. Wooden scaffolding clung to the remnants of once-magnificent buildings, their broken walls patched with mismatched planks and scavenged stone.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	669	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_3d891976		Tim adjusted the straps of his satchel and glanced up at me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	671	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_6745c349	tim	We'll have to walk the rest of the way. It's not far—just a short walk.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	673	tim "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_e1b8f793		I nodded, then turned to Chung-hee.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	675	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_2083716c	dorian	Chung… earlier, you were floating. Why aren't you doing that now?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	677	dorian "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_5372f992		Chung-hee's voice echoed in my mind, the way it always did.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	679	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_3d470e29	chung_hee	Floating attracts attention. Also, why would waste energy floating when I could just walk?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	681	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_9a3eb9d0		We pressed forward.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	683	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_67bd0419	dorian	Stay alert.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	685	dorian "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_447935a5		Tim nodded, his expression growing serious.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	687	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_dd242ec4	dorian	And Tim—stay close. Don't wander off.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	689	dorian "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_cfa9ad35	tim	Y-Yes, sir.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	690	tim "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_5ece68ea		Then, I felt it—a ripple in the air, a shift in the stillness that sent a chill up my spine.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	692	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_4d5c745d		Chung-hee tensed beside me. He felt it too.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	693	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_525a64f3		Then—footsteps.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	694	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_978551f1		Fast. Heavy.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	695	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_027add80		Out of nowhere, three Yaoguai burst into view, tearing through the dust and haze with inhuman speed. Their grotesque forms flickered in and out of sight—limbs too long, spines twisted at unnatural angles, glowing eyes burning with raw hunger.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	697	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_3b8b5eae	yg	Raaaaaaawwrrr!!! Craaawwrrr!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	699	yg "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_650df4bd		Chung-hee reacted instantly.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	701	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_6585fc87	chung_hee	Get back!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	703	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_b7698170		He thrust a hand forward, and the air pulsed— a sudden, invisible force slammed into the nearest Yaoguai, halting it mid-lunge. The creature shrieked in fury, its claws scraping wildly against an unseen barrier, but it was pinned in place.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	707	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_92a1c935	chung_hee	Dorian, behind you!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	709	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_a404c327		I spun around and the yaoguai was already upon me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	711	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_8b7087ac	yg	Raaaaaaawwrrr!!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	713	yg "[what]"
ch6_overlooking_111a5f58		Its clawed hands stretched forward, its gaping maw snapping open, teeth like jagged shards of obsidian.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	715	"[what]"
ch6_overlooking_2d89b8c5		Too close. Too fast.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	716	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_88e5d47b		My foot slammed into the ground, and a pulse of raw energy surged through my veins.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	739	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_65fa90fe		A burst of sharpened rock erupted from the ground, spearing upward like a wall of jagged teeth. The Yaoguai screeched, twisting in midair to avoid the worst of it, but the stone still caught its leg—a sickening crunch.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	740	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_ab17e697	yg	GRAAAHHH!!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	742	yg "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_9369e502		It crashed onto its side, hissing in fury.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	744	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_ac22dc84		My foot caught on a loose rock.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	752	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_70604b6b		Shiii—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	753	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_22c9b16e		I tripped, my arms flailing as the world tilted.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	754	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_4ab22628		The Yaoguai pounced. Its claws raked across my side—pain exploded through me as I hit the ground hard. The impact knocked the breath from my lungs.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	755	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_acca73d9	tim	Mister Dorian!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	757	tim "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_8b7aec1a		I barely registered his voice—the Yaoguai loomed over me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	759	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_2be064ac	yg	Graaaaaaawwrrr!!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	761	yg "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_d3eafeb4		Then, a flash of light. A bolt of lightning hit the beast.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	763	"[what]"
