ch6_yaoguai_encounter_87c13b64		Chung-hee stood over me, eyes narrowed, hand still raised.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	765	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_42307eb9	chung_hee	Are you alright?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	767	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_92e84d05		I sucked in a shaky breath, pain flaring through my ribs.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	769	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_05509725	dorian	T-Thanks… Sorry.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	771	dorian "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_e4b9e5bf		Tim's panicked scream split the air.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	773	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_aeca5ef7	tim	Mister! A-Another one!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	775	tim "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_8dc09536		I turned just in time to see another Yaoguai sprinting toward us from the shadows, its grotesque form blurring with unnatural speed.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	777	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_encounter_3c00d1ce	tim	Mister! Make a barrier! Quick!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	779	tim "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_a64d0c66		I slammed my hands together, channeling my energy into the ground.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	802	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_a3685983		The earth rumbled.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	803	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_38544d23		A wall of solid rock erupted between us and the Yaoguai—thick, sturdy, unyielding. The creature crashed into it headfirst, letting out a choked snarl as the impact sent it sprawling.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	804	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_9d51d616	yg	GRAAAH—!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	806	yg "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_a415c2e6		I could hear it scratching, clawing, trying to scale the wall, but I had bought us time.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	808	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_58283ccf	tim	You did it, sir Dorian!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	810	tim "[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_f5f1d6bf		I exhaled sharply, wiping sweat from my brow.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	812	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_3bf8c19a		I thrust my hands forward, summoning the wind—a forceful gust howled to life, swirling between us and the oncoming Yaoguai.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	822	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_fef054b9		For a split second, I thought it would be enough.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	823	"[what]"
ch6_yaoguai_barrier_a3955ae0		I was wrong.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	824	"[what]"
