ch6_tianho_approach_acd63212		We ran—feet pounding against the rough earth, the wind howling past us.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	926	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_56e666fd		Tim clung to me, his small arms wrapped tightly around my neck as I carried him.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	927	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_0c138d65	tim	Go left! That way!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	929	tim "[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_a5f3e6e4		I barely had time to process his words before two more Yaoguai emerged from the shadows—twisted, snarling creatures with glowing, predatory eyes.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	931	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_e5cde073		I didn't hesitate.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	932	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_4fe79f2d		With a surge of power, I slammed my foot to the ground. The earth trembled beneath us—then rose.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	936	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_f5a73d72		Jagged spikes of stone erupted from the ground in a split second, impaling both creatures mid-leap.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	937	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_4a5413ee		A sickening crunch. A strangled howl.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	938	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_577ce39c		Then—silence.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	939	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_7d301817		I exhaled sharply. No time to waste.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	940	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_d44491e4		We pushed forward.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	941	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_cefcf144		We reached Tianho.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	945	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_3e1b1b7a		It had been five years since the Tragedy of Tianho—five years since the city fell.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	946	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_cd97a72e		Now, it was a makeshift town, pieced together from the ruins. The skeleton of a place that once thrived.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	947	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_b9650e39		But there were flickering business lights. Small lanterns swayed gently in the night breeze, their glow casting soft pools of light onto the cracked streets.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	948	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_6fcf93cb		A few shops had reopened—noodle carts pushed against alley walls, tiny market stalls selling whatever goods they have to offer.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	949	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_2b60c60a		It was quiet. The air was heavy. Suffocating.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	950	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_4235df61		We walked down streets lined with Yaoguai corpses.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	951	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_bd51fb86		Twisted, grotesque bodies lay motionless in the dust, limbs contorted in unnatural angles.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	952	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_dacd2780		Some had deep slashes, others looked like they had rotted from the inside out.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	953	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_38a5f21a		I lowered Tim gently to the ground. He stumbled a bit, still shaken.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	955	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_656da0b5		Chung-hee immediately pulled him close, his expression unreadable.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	956	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_7510971a	chung_hee	Stay close to me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	958	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_36b767a2		Tim nodded, his small fingers clutching the hem of Chung-hee's sleeve.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	960	"[what]"
ch6_tianho_approach_7b4514c0		Then… I've heard voices. A hushed whisper from the shadows.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	961	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_5f566b0b	gao	Gao, look! People!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	974	gao "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_722f60fd	jiang	Hmm… Wait, Jiang… Is that—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	975	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_99522850	gao	Paladin Dorian? In Li Mengtia's name! It's really you!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	976	gao "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_846a7194	jiang	Hey! Hey! Over here, sir!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	977	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_58a2b8bf		I turned toward the sound, heart pounding, and there they were—peering out from a ruined storefront, their bodies pressed into the shadows.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	979	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_8b441cf7		They weren't in armor. No swords at their hips. Instead, they wore Cheng Industries shirts—stained, but unmistakable.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	980	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_f67dcd88		Relief washed over me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	981	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_5d916cdf	dorian	Jiang! Gao!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	983	dorian "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_8543bb03		I barely held back the urge to grab them, to make sure they were real.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	985	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_8907f785		Gao smirked and pointed at his shirt.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	986	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_32e083d4	gao	We work for Cheng Industries now! Here at Cheng's, we make ch—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	988	gao "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_7bafde02		Jiang rolled his eyes.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	990	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_46d504e6	jiang	Change. *Hums a tone* Yes, anyway…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	992	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_fdf9355a		He cleared his throat.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	994	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_e38abec3	jiang	You must be looking for Miss Weng… She's with your friends.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	996	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_4cede3fb	dorian	You know Miss Weng?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	997	dorian "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_23019ed5	jiang	She's our supervisor… in a way.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	998	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_772ed338	gao	She's with the doctor, and the guy with the pink hair.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	999	gao "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_a1e5d6cc	jiang	Idiot. It's not pink. It's violet.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1000	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_68d8fa1f	gao	Sir, it's been a while! How are—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1001	gao "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_7c9325ad	jiang	Don't raise your voice too much, Gao. That thing might see us.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1002	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_209f78b0	dorian	He's right, Gao. Where are the others?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1003	dorian "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_00659532	gao	H-Hiding, sir. Many are wounded. They're hiding inside this store.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1004	gao "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_0561ca4c	jiang	The doctor is trying to heal the injured.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1005	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_daf517ba		Chung-hee's sharp gaze flicked between us.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1007	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_b6211255	chung_hee	Do you know these people, Dorian?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1009	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_d2e99aff	dorian	Yeah, I've fought with them during the Tragedy of Tianho.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1010	dorian "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_4dd863cb		Tim's worry hadn't left his face.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1012	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_eb6fd01c	tim	But… they're hiding from something… Shouldn't we hide too?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1014	tim "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_e202a019		I glanced at him. He's right. It's too dangerous for him to be out in the open. I gestured toward Jiang.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1016	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_1afaf842	jiang	Got it, Paladin. We'll make sure he's safe.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1018	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_674da33f		He approached Tim and extended his hand.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1020	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_09c1274f	jiang	Come with us, little one.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1022	jiang "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_7d94ea01	tim	Um… okay. Take care mister Dorian.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1023	tim "[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_56b1d6e8		They took him to hide behind the storefront, their eyes still watching.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1025	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_d54f0fae		Then—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1026	"[what]"
ch6_jiang_gao_8187af6e		The ground trembled.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1027	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_2e2fb3a1		A wet, gurgling sound slithered through the alleyways of Tianho.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1042	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_1cf781d4		It wasn't footsteps. It wasn't breathing.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1043	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_12fb4f7a		It was something else.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1044	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_1ba74359		A noise so unnatural it sent a shiver down my spine.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1045	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_5bd160f9	jiang	Li Mengtia, save us…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1047	jiang "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_baf0f070	gao	D-Don't you wanna hide with us, Paladin Dorian?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1048	gao "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_32bf2998		And then I saw it.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1050	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_b033415c		A massive, shifting mass of flesh and darkness loomed above us, writhing and twisting in unnatural ways.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1058	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_6de8945b		Its form was never still.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1059	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_393e1742		Limbs sprouted and folded, then vanished back into the mass.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1060	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_1034df7b		Clawed fingers stretched, twitched, then melted away.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1061	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_e11050bf		Jagged mouths appeared across its hide, filled with crooked, gnashing teeth.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1062	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_67d6560c		The lanterns flickered erratically, the air warping around us.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1063	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_5ab3b458		Tim's voice was barely a whisper.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1065	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_cca78d1e	tim	A… Hundun…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1067	tim "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_b43d9ea3		Chung-hee approached me, his gaze not leaving the monster's.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1069	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_2768549c	chung_hee	I take it this isn't just another Yaoguai?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1071	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_5831bc92	dorian	Don't you have this creature in Kyeongjang?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1072	dorian "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_9b74b5e6	chung_hee	No, I- I haven't read about this. This is foreign to me…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1073	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_7babbd6e	tim	Hundun… it means 'chaos.' It's not like the others. I've read about it. In Li Mengtia's bibliography page 237.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1074	tim "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_357933eb	dorian	How so?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1075	dorian "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_f920dcf1	tim	Chaos. Confusion. It moves in ways you can't predict. If you watch it too long, you'll start seeing things that aren't real.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1076	tim "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_55f03753	tim	Hunduns confuse people and… they eat them.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1077	tim "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_45f44161		Gao took an uneasy step back.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1079	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_7ea546b9	gao	Holy… So that's why people have been hiding.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1081	gao "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_3d70f169	jiang	Once people started seeing that thing, they're minds are all muddied.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1082	jiang "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_f12140fc	dorian	Tch. Just my lucky day.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1083	dorian "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_91bef6ea		The Hundun rippled.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1085	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_71fde2a2		Its many mouths opened at once.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1086	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_84b18506		And then—it spoke.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1087	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_3f1e6c77		Not in words.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1088	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_30e94839		Not in a voice.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1089	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_b7992cca		But in echoes.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1090	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_0fb22c9a		Whispers.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1091	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_c3dfc505	hundun	Mhmhmhmhmhm…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1093	hundun "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_2cee9ed0		The air itself warped, twisting like a heat mirage. The world wavered at the edges of my vision, everything doubling, then tripling—Chung-hee, Tim, Jiang, Gao, the Hundun.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1095	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_095dfadf	dorian	W-What the…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1097	dorian "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_ef25a44a		Too many.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1099	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_8d6413cf		My grip tightened into fists, my nails digging into my palms as I fought to keep my focus.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1100	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_0b611a52		The monster's many mouths split open, but no sound came. Instead, the echoes surged through my mind, like a choir, curling around my thoughts, bleeding into them.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1101	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_c3dfc505_1	hundun	Mhmhmhmhmhm…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1103	hundun "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_f7669727		I blinked—once, twice—only to find that my own hands were shifting before my eyes, fingers elongating and twisting. The ground beneath me felt wrong—soft, then hard, then liquid.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1105	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_29ca519a		Tianho itself flickered before my eyes. No longer a struggling city in recovery, but a warped nightmare—buildings bending at impossible angles, their windows wide and dark like gaping mouths. The sky above churned in a swirling abyss, the color of rotting ink.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1106	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_6e58d305	jiang	Come here, Paladin! Hahaha! We won't bite!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1108	jiang "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_a0898a10	gao	Hahahaha! Your blood will be perfect for our dinner!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1109	gao "[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_eb2f08b4		My breath hitched.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1111	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_eef8eb8f		All of a sudden, Chung-hee's voice echoed in my mind.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1112	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_appears_3ae0b75b	chung_hee	Dorian. Listen to me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1114	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_5c7ed0eb		It was sharp, cutting through the suffocating fog in my mind.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1128	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_36aa6cbf	chung_hee	What you're seeing is the Hundun. It's digging into your thoughts, warping your perception. You must trust me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1130	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_b7383318		I swallowed hard, clutching my head as another vision flickered before me—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1132	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_7d23a057		Elara.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1133	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_49fb5e12		She stood just ahead, her red hair flowing as she reached out to me. Behind her, Emily, Sarah, Daniel, and Lucas—small hands outstretched, eyes wide with tears.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1134	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_46a1805e	dorian	E-Elara?! What are you doing here—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1136	dorian "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_30c36e68	lucas	Dad come back!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1138	lucas "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_09a40bd4	emily	We miss you!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1139	emily "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_95838f09	daniel	We missed you so much!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1140	daniel "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_1896daba	sarah	Come here, dad!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1141	sarah "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_af68f883	elara	Dorian.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1142	elara "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_5a47d796		She stepped forward, arms outstretched, a smile pulling at her lips.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1144	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_5c6dbf34	elara	Here. I missed you. Take one more step.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1146	elara "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_6a152bc1		My entire body locked up.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1148	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_d95ae216		My heart pounded.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1149	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_6ef8b2ed		I wanted to.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1150	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_991a12f3		One step.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1151	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_5c766eea		One step closer, and I could hold them again.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1152	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_70dcf357		My breath shook.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1153	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_5ebbb21e		My legs moved.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1154	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_89401483		One step—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1155	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_1f4dc44e		NO.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1156	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_447e9bd0		I clenched my jaw.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1160	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_3a4889a8		The illusions flickered.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1161	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_565eff1f		The children's eyes darkened—turning black, hollow, hungry.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1162	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_060007ea		Elara's face twitched.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1163	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_fd38c526		For a fraction of a second, the warmth in her smile cracked.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1164	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_b86f09b1	elara	Dorian… I won't ask again.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1166	elara "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_d980b2ea	dorian	You're not Elara.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1168	dorian "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_3c02b973		I slammed my fists together.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1170	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_5ec0f120		Flames erupted from my hands—bright, wild, furious.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1174	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_ca42c166		I thrust my arms forward, sending a torrent of fire surging toward them.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1175	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_68068329		The illusion shattered like glass.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1176	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_1f7d97fa		The warm, familiar faces of my loved ones morphed.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1177	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_d0d4b673		Elara's soft features melted into a grotesque, many-mouthed horror. The children's arms stretched into clawed appendages. Their eyes turned into endless, soulless pits.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1178	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_de00ed29		Its true form coiled in the darkness—its many mouths stretched wide, jagged teeth gnashing in fury.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1182	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_d792fe82		It screamed.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1183	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_8438e68e		Not one voice. Not two. A thousand voices.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1184	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_6eeeb513	hundun	You. Reject. Us. Hmmmmrnmmmm…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1186	hundun "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_187c719b		Its flesh blackened and split, its writhing limbs thrashing wildly.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1188	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_539fec67		Reality warped, twisted, fractured.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1189	"[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_739cbad5	hundun	Your fire will not cleanse. Your fire will not save. Your fire will not bring them back.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1191	hundun "[what]"
ch6_hundun_illusion_1_03255a2c	hundun	Hrnnnrrnnn…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1192	hundun "[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_dbff2fa0		The world collapsed in on itself.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1206	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_49e5af1a		The ruined streets of Tianho vanished, replaced by a throne room. A lavish throne room in Mjoll. As I remembered it.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1207	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_2a4ae8c0	vasily_illusion	My, my. Dorian my friend. Still as temperamental as ever, I see.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1209	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_8bc073ab	vasily_illusion	Do tell me, how's the Prince?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1210	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_dd572f0f	dorian	Vasily…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1212	dorian "[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_96cb084c		The words barely left my lips before he multiplied.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1214	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_2bb5b000		One Vasily. Then two. Then four. Then dozens—standing at every corner of the throne room, each an exact copy, each watching me with those sharp, amused eyes.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1215	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_100cf65f	chung_hee	Be careful, Dorian… This is a trap.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1217	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_7235b91e	chung_hee	Don't be rash. Rely on what I say.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1218	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_540f4bcb		I could feel it. The pressure building around me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1220	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_a39372f9		Vasily was channeling light.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1221	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_c2943ba3		The illusions layered on top of each other, twisting, warping, shifting. The throne room flickered—too bright, too dark, too blinding.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1222	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_6b8d8048		My heartbeat pounded in my ears.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1223	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_78dd5b91	vasily_illusion	What's the matter, old friend? Confused?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1225	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_room_e9980d2d		I ground my teeth. I had to make a decision—fast.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1227	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_a4ca573c		I struck first—but my hand went straight through the illusion.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1248	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_377dba50	dorian	W-What?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1250	dorian "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_a4bc5063	vasily_illusion	No hard feelings, old friend.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1252	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_d3e0c50b		A blinding flash of bright light came. Light seared through my side, burning hot, ripping through flesh like molten steel.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1254	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_205b30ce	dorian	Ahhhh!!! F—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1256	dorian "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_23824818		I hit the ground hard, vision swimming, my nerves screaming in agony. Above me, Vasily loomed, smirking, his sharp eyes gleaming in the flickering light.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1258	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_12edaa68	vasily_illusion	It hurts. Doesn't it, old friend?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1260	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_9cae2a33	vasily_illusion	Call it karma. Or revenge.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1261	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_18ba0ec1	chung_hee	DORIAN, NO!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1263	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_e573a187		And then darkness swallowed me whole.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1265	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_36dddafb		Reload your last save and trust Chung-hee's guidance.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1271	"[what]"
