ch6_vasily_qtc_b0d559b7		I shut my eyes, forcing myself to ignore the illusions.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1310	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_b7ef1a79	vasily_illusion	What's the matter, old friend?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1312	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_ce494bf9	vasily_illusion	Open your eyes before you get yourself killed! Hrmmmmmnnnn….	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1313	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_af9cd8ef		Then—a voice cut through the noise.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1315	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_4d418dc9	chung_hee	Third person from the left.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1317	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_e5cde073		I didn't hesitate.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1319	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_47857376		I lunged—flames igniting along my fist.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1320	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_ba25d730	vasily_illusion	Wha-?!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1322	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_59ef1c93		The moment my fire struck him, the illusions shattered like glass, breaking into shards of twisted, flickering light.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1324	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_cea1f1e0	vasily_illusion	AAHHH!!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1328	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_359fa101	hundun	AHHHHH!!! You!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1330	hundun "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_995059a0		I threw my hands up, summoning fire from deep within.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1338	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_87d0521b		The flames exploded outward, engulfing the entire room in a brilliant, raging inferno.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1339	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_fa065ea9	vasily_illusion	Graahhh!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1341	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_adbd1cce		The Hundun howled, its monstrous form recoiling from the fire.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1343	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_qtc_8c4a25ca	hundun	NOOOOOO!!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1345	hundun "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_c081333f		Vasily's grin widened, a slow, lazy smirk spreading across his face.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1360	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_e05c952c	vasily_illusion	Time for some friends from the upper society.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1362	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_7a69f45b		He snapped his fingers.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1364	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_80233749		The air twisted.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1365	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_86011f71		King Gustav. Empress Olympia. Emperor Min-joon.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1367	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_51cc0ede		Their figures stood tall and regal. I took an instinctive step back, my chest tightening.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1368	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_d9d3a19d		Their gazes bore into me, their expressions unreadable—but their intentions were clear. Destroy me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1369	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_6ab11255	vasily_illusion	Do you, by chance, remember them, old friend?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1371	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_ffd6e5ea	dorian	What kind of sick game is this?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1373	dorian "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_e6502744	gustav_illusion	DIE!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1375	gustav_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_61e06791		Empress Olympia: You burn everything you touch, Paladin.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1377	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_294c52a0		The winds around her howled, her presence distorting the air itself.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1379	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_f08ceea6	olympia_illusion	You will die, you monster!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1381	olympia_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_adf44539		I clenched my fists.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1383	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_80e47526	minjoon_illusion	Your head will be ours… It will look good on a pike.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1385	minjoon_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_eb2f08b4		My breath hitched.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1387	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_7607ed2d		My flames wavered—as if responding to my own doubt.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1388	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_d4c6361e		I could feel their power pressing down on me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1389	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_08472210		Could see the unwavering conviction in their eyes.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1390	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_ee9bfd4c		Was this an illusion? Or was it something more?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1391	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_a2e93ea1		A cold wave of fear crept into my chest, tightening like a vice.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1392	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_ce40e326	chung_hee	Dorian. Listen to me. I can feel your fear. You must let it go.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1394	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_1a3b3198		I sucked in a sharp breath.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1396	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_d4c45413	dorian	…*breathes deeply* Hrnnn…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1398	dorian "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_7d4fa83c	chung_hee	Do not let your mind betray you. Those are merely illusions.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1400	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_63033763	chung_hee	Strike first at the Honorable Empress.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1401	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_dbdc5588	chung_hee	And then the illusion of… pyeha.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1402	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_11516013		For the briefest moment, his mind faltered—but it was gone in an instant.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1404	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_6f076610	chung_hee	My father.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1406	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_5c627c09	chung_hee	Then, that venomous serpent of a king.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1407	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_b3cde834	chung_hee	And lastly, you shall strike down whoever is left.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1408	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_760b8896		The area shuddered as the rulers prepared their assault.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1410	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_1cf86367		I gritted my teeth, sweat beading down my temple. Even though I knew they weren't real, their presence was so overwhelming that doubt still clawed at the edges of my mind.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1411	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_b00c329e		Their gazes pierced through me, judgment dripping from every word, every movement.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1412	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_8d967338		On the far left, Gustav stood unshaken, his broad form towering, his expression carved from stone.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1413	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_2e314a8f		Cracks spiderwebbed beneath his feet, the very earth groaning under the weight of his rage.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1414	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_185b0399	gustav_illusion	Prepare to die, Dorian!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1416	gustav_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_d30668e6		To his right, Empress Olympia hovered mid-air, her robes billowing violently in a cyclone of shrieking wind. A hurricane twisted around her, distorting the air itself, flickers of lightning threading through the storm.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1418	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_efeca39e	olympia_illusion	You will rue this day!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1420	olympia_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_55832eea		At the center, Vasily stood, his form bathed in radiant light, his smirk so casual it sent chills down my spine. He raised his hand, and daggers of light formed at his fingertips, their edges pulsing with raw, celestial power.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1422	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_8b7a42b3	vasily_illusion	A pity it has to end this way, dear friend.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1424	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_70c00eef		On the far right, Emperor Min-joon stood, but he did not move. His eyes gleamed an unnatural violet, swirling with shifting patterns.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1426	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_e08860f8	minjoon_illusion	Your family died because of you. Death will be too kind of a punishment for monsters such as yourself…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1428	minjoon_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_f3d49b6b		I staggered, my breath hitching— My body felt disconnected.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1430	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_62773b14	chung_hee	Wait for it, Dorian.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1432	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_fad2cfb2		The four figures stepped forward, power building to a breaking point—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1434	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_a06bbb11		I tightened my fists. My flames surged.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1435	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_8042bd2d	vasily_illusion	LIGHTS OUT!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1437	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_748027cc		Then—pitch blackness.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1441	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_c04a8985		The world vanished.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1442	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_43ef0386		The ground beneath me disappeared into an abyss. I couldn't see. All I can see are shadows.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1443	"[what]"
ch6_rulers_illusion_ebf90d77	chung_hee	NOW!! Hit them before they strike!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1445	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_darkness_qtc_d9aadf82	dorian	GRAAHHH!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1467	dorian "[what]"
ch6_darkness_qtc_06c8b80b		My flames surged, my fists colliding with—nothing.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1469	"[what]"
ch6_darkness_qtc_f8760d92	dorian	W-What?! But how?!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1471	dorian "[what]"
ch6_darkness_qtc_527fff7c	olympia_illusion	Oh, Paladin. Did you think you could strike down the wind? The Dragon of Gale has lost his wits.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1473	olympia_illusion "[what]"
ch6_darkness_qtc_41819aba	gustav_illusion	Foolish. Utterly foolish.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1474	gustav_illusion "[what]"
ch6_darkness_qtc_6f39052d	minjoon_illusion	How disappointing. How unworthy.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1475	minjoon_illusion "[what]"
