ch6_darkness_qtc_4676e0c3		A sudden pressure exploded in my chest—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1478	"[what]"
ch6_darkness_qtc_47e9c99c		Then—searing, unbearable pain.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1479	"[what]"
