ch6_vasily_final_51ecb046		The warmth was ripped away in an instant, replaced by a howling blizzard. The sky churned an eerie gray, thick snow pounding against my skin like frozen needles. The air burned in my lungs, each breath coming out in a white gasp.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1601	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_final_f5a0055a		We stood on an endless stretch of ice, the frozen wasteland stretching in all directions. Jagged cliffs loomed in the distance, their edges sharp as broken glass.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1602	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_final_f7ee7ea9		Mjoll.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1603	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_final_dd38f7ee		I clenched my fists, flames flickering to life at my fingertips. They sputtered, struggling against the cold.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1604	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_final_3a33f729		Vasily stood across from me, unbothered, smirking. His coat billowed in the wind, the fur-lined edges pristine despite the storm.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1605	"[what]"
ch6_vasily_final_860ea1ba	vasily_illusion	Feels familiar, doesn't it? How many battles did we fight here, Dorian? How many nights did we spend wading through snow, side by side…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1607	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_final_c4d5cf6b	dorian	Mjoll…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1609	dorian "[what]"
ch6_vasily_final_f33f404a	vasily_illusion	Fitting, isn't it? Where it all started. Where we stood side by side—until you decided to betray it all.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1611	vasily_illusion "[what]"
ch6_vasily_final_6078d8bb		I looked down.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1613	"[what]"
