ch6_feng_appears_515c2074	dorian	Don't be reckless, Chung.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1883	dorian "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_8d6cfd4b	chung_hee	I—Fine…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1884	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_6c87e7b6		I readied myself—fists clenched, fire curling at my fingertips—when suddenly a brilliant blue light cut through the night.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1886	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_a8140252		A wall of blue fire hurled towards the yaoguai. The Yaoguai screeched in agony as the blue flames swallowed them whole. Their blackened bodies twisted, shriveling, burning, turning to ash.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1890	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_b5bd7556		I turned sharply, and a figure stood atop the wreckage of a ruined merchant's stall. I knew that stance.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1892	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_f9c95e57		My eyes widened.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1893	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_31b33708		My mind reeled. What in Tetrad's was he doing here?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1894	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_69ab552e	dorian	Feng?!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1902	dorian "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_4332ea31	feng	Watch out! Behind you!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1903	feng "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_076ba3f4	aoi	Stay sharp!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1904	aoi "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_04dfc869		Before I could even open my mouth—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1906	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_5c350b45	yg	Graaaawwrrrr!!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1908	yg "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_94e8acce		A surge of water rushed through the streets, coiling unnaturally, moving like a living serpent. The liquid swirled with unnatural precision, snaking between us and slamming into the advancing monsters with crushing force.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1912	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_9a877e53		The water pierced through them, shaping into sharp spears that skewered the creatures in mid-air.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1913	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_49d30a2f	yg	Raaaaaaaaaahhh!! Graahh—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1915	yg "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_0c316159		Their bodies tensed—twitched—then dissolved into black mist.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1917	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_aa3e664c	chung_hee	You—!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1919	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_8e955546		Chung-hee's glare darkened, energy rippling in the air around him like a storm ready to break. Electricity cracked through the air.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1921	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_b4736f87		I turned, and there she was. One of the Commandants of Mjoll. The woman who stood beside Tian Xun earlier. She stood where the last Yaoguai had fallen, calm. Unshaken.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1922	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_ee60a1a9		Feng casually raised a hand.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1924	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_c48c430c	feng	Easy. She's on our side.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1926	feng "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_a32b1a38		Aoi merely huffed, flicking her wrist.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1928	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_6a22d0a8	aoi	Hmph.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1930	aoi "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_bc55fbb3		A final tendril of water lashed out behind her, striking the last Yaoguai.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1932	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_6aa7f158		The creature didn't even have time to scream before it burst into dust.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1933	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_5a920b69	dorian	What…	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1935	dorian "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_6996ce7c	yg	Graaaarrrrr!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1937	yg "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_ad6d5c78		Aoi's head snapped toward the sound, water already coiling at her fingertips, alive and restless. Her expression was unreadable, cold as ever.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1939	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_fe2bd26c	aoi	I'll handle it, Feng. This won't take long.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1941	aoi "[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_cddc6bdf		She didn't wait for permission. With a swift movement, she vanished into the shadows, her figure weaving through the broken streets of Tianho.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1943	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_9d2af758		But even as she disappeared, Chung-hee's glare followed her.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1944	"[what]"
ch6_feng_appears_6e195e0f		His entire body remained tense, his presence humming with quiet suspicion. Electricity crackled faintly at his fingertips.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1945	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_60829eb9		Feng exhaled before stepping forward, finally turning his attention to me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1958	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_2e1efba1		He didn't say anything at first. His gaze lingered on Chung-hee. The ghost of a smirk pulled at his lips.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1959	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_120dfa5c	feng	By the Prosperity Dragon, The Emperor of Kyeongjang in the flesh.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1961	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_5e79df8c		Chung-hee met his gaze, still stiff, still guarded.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1963	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_360ff7d6	feng	You look different from your father, His Majesty Hyon Min-joon. But I see the resemblance.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1965	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_046dccb1		Chung-hee didn't respond.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1967	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_f6f5b0a2	feng	Should I kneel? Or perhaps I should summon an interpreter for a deaf-mute? I could arrange—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1969	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_a80feb98		Chung-hee's voice slammed into our minds like a thunderclap.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1971	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_04ca4e7a	chung_hee	Does it look like I need an interpreter?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1973	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_reunion_1128de69		Feng's smirk faltered—just slightly.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1975	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_6865815b		Feng.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1976	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_e3030032		My old friend. My old best friend.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1977	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_afbf9858		He stood before me, still wearing that same confident stance, that same effortless composure—but something was different.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1978	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_eb811981		I remembered the Taotie. Its claws. Its shriek. The way it had nearly gouged out Feng's left eye.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1979	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_74113b46		I opened my mouth, wanting to ask—wanting to know— but before I could—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1980	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_e346cec0	dorian	Feng, what are you doing here?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1982	dorian "[what]"
ch6_reunion_adf44539		I clenched my fists.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1984	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_38bfaca0	dorian	Don't you know she's from Mjoll? They attacked—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1986	dorian "[what]"
ch6_reunion_ca7826b1		Feng cut me off with a single, casual shrug.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1988	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_c9d6d11f	feng	She's a mercenary of King Gustav. Her loyalty can always be bought.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1990	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_e5c4bf01	chung_hee	Loyalty isn't something that can be bought.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1992	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_reunion_14d9ce89	feng	Loyalty is a luxury, Your Majesty. Some of us don't have the privilege of being born into it.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1994	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_a8ad95c3	dorian	As long as she's on our side, it doesn't matter anyway.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1996	dorian "[what]"
ch6_reunion_5f2ed238		Feng only rolled his shoulders, exhaling lazily.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	1998	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_df7e218b	feng	Look, I didn't come here to debate politics. I came because I heard some crazy rumors—	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2000	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_a9cb97a2	feng	So, there we were, interrogating the aldoriths that was with Aoi earlier—nothing unusual. Then they start babbling about a blond-haired demon who burned through an entire battalion. Fire, wind, earth, they said.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2001	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_6c42e8eb	feng	And I thought, 'Nah. That can't be my best friend. My best friend left Tianho years ago, and he sure as hell ain't going back...' Then—lo and behold.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2002	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_31d2a88d	feng	How's it going, old friend? Miss me?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2003	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_e3d72e90	dorian	Feng… It's been a while. I thought you were dead.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2005	dorian "[what]"
ch6_reunion_71c9b66e	feng	Funny. I thought the same about you.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2006	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_f63dd752		And then—without thinking—I stepped forward and pulled him into a hug.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2008	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_45967b03		Then, with a quiet chuckle, he patted my back—harder than necessary.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2009	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_8529925c	feng	Alright, alright. Don't get all sentimental on me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2011	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_222461ed		I huffed a laugh, pulling back just enough to look at him.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2013	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_43d9431f	dorian	Haha. Shut up, jackass.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2015	dorian "[what]"
ch6_reunion_87dcc04a		Then I noticed it. The scars. A jagged mark running down the left side of his face—faint but unmistakable. And the red-tinted glasses. My stomach clenched.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2017	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_84f24fab	dorian	Your eye… How is it?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2019	dorian "[what]"
ch6_reunion_30f52b5e		Feng waved a hand dismissively.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2021	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_98c294f4	feng	It's fine. Healed up a long time ago.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2023	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_fb4b60e4	feng	The Empress' personal doctor patched me up. Had some fancy healing techniques. You know how they are in the Imperial City—spare no expense when they want you back in fighting shape.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2024	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_1c3f5a35		He smirked, tapping his glasses.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2026	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_37578342	feng	Still, I keep these around. Gives me a little edge. Makes me look mysterious, don't you think?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2028	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_3b9785aa		I rolled my eyes.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2030	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_c14efad3	dorian	You always did think too highly of yourself.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2032	dorian "[what]"
ch6_reunion_beff8ddb	feng	Hahaha. Damn right.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2033	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_53376da9		Feng slung an arm around my shoulders, his grin easy. He gestured toward the charred remains of the Hundun, its twisted form still crackling with lingering energy.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2035	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_77b650ff	feng	Tell you what—once we're done cleaning up this mess, let's catch up over a drink. I know a place.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2037	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_dae5a101	feng	Best liquor this side of Tianho.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2038	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_c68ea21c	feng	My treat, of course. The Empress still pays us Paladins well.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2039	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_1b0402a7		Then, with an exaggerated wave, he turned his attention to Chung-hee, his smirk widening.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2041	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_6898d4cd	feng	What about you, Your Majesty? Will the Emperor Lord grace us peasants with his presence?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2043	feng "[what]"
ch6_reunion_ef92e053		Chung-hee stood with his arms crossed, with his brow twitched.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2045	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_c3842262	chung_hee	Please. Calling you or Sir Dorian 'peasants' is beneath me.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2047	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_reunion_6ba13471		I arched an eyebrow.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2049	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_61e6e361	dorian	So, that's a yes?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2051	dorian "[what]"
ch6_reunion_98a20480		Chung-hee's mouth opened—then closed. A faint wrinkle appeared between his brows, as if he were choosing his words carefully.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2053	"[what]"
ch6_reunion_a0b07d7c	chung_hee	I… suppose I can accompany you.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2055	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_reunion_a6574808	feng	Oh? His Majesty drinks with commoners? I'm honored.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2057	feng "[what]"
ch6_end_8639c122		But before I could reply, the air shattered—another piercing screech.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2068	"[what]"
ch6_end_7189ab6a	yg	Grawwwrrrr!!!	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2070	yg "[what]"
ch6_end_be7e33e6		Feng's entire body went rigid. The easygoing playfulness vanished in an instant. His smirk faded, his stance shifting, shoulders squared.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2072	"[what]"
ch6_end_37aaacbe	feng	See you later, buddy.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2074	feng "[what]"
ch6_end_01af4924		He cracked his knuckles, stepping forward as his blue flames reignited at his fingertips.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2076	"[what]"
ch6_end_81462332	feng	Don't worry. Me and the Paladins will handle this. Go to the hideout.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2078	feng "[what]"
ch6_end_576165d2		I frowned, feeling an unease settle in my gut.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2080	"[what]"
ch6_end_eb6b0540	dorian	You sure?	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2082	dorian "[what]"
ch6_end_b6c107ea	feng	Tianho is under the protection of the Imperial City of Gale. This is our job as Paladins. You should know this, buddy—you were one of us once.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2083	feng "[what]"
ch6_end_068b56a5	feng	Besides, there are plenty of us. You sticking around would just be a waste of resources.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2084	feng "[what]"
ch6_end_4085b182		He wasn't wrong. He looked at the charred body of the Hundun.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2086	"[what]"
ch6_end_206d7eae	feng	And more importantly—the appearance of this… thing isn't normal. Whatever's happening, we need answers, not just bodies in the streets.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2088	feng "[what]"
ch6_end_f255ebdb	feng	Fortunately, we have specialists from the city who will handle the investigation. Best you steer clear once they arrive.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2089	feng "[what]"
ch6_end_8b2ab67f		Chung-hee nodded.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2091	"[what]"
ch6_end_128968f2	chung_hee	He's right, Dorian.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2093	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_end_9c875637	chung_hee	Then we go to the hideout beneath the Cheng Industries store.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2094	chung_hee "[what]"
ch6_end_9e48eb55	dorian	Tch. Fine.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2096	dorian "[what]"
ch6_end_84c9823e	feng	Try not to miss me too much. See you later.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2097	feng "[what]"
ch6_end_3b9785aa		I rolled my eyes.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2099	"[what]"
ch6_end_964d7fd4	dorian	Try not to get bitten this time, dumbass.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2101	dorian "[what]"
ch6_end_64adcc67		Feng barked out a laugh—then disappeared into the shadows, his blue flames joining the lanterns in illuminating the area.	game/08_chapter_06.rpy	2103	"[what]"
chapter_7_9838e6ff		CHAPTER 7	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	106	"[what]"
chapter_7_9d50b139	magnus	DRAGONKIN…. DRAGONKIN!!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	108	magnus "[what]"
chapter_7_4353d252		I gasped, my breath sharp and ragged as I jolted awake. There he was—the winged man again.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	110	"[what]"
chapter_7_2909fc3f		The blinding white void collapsed like fragile glass, breaking inward, dissolving into wisps of fading light.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	111	"[what]"
chapter_7_fe84cb85		The air hit me like a wave—thick, humid, ancient. It reeked of damp moss, of something metallic and bitter, of rot buried deep within the earth.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	112	"[what]"
chapter_7_7964ddfd		A cavern stretched before me, vast and endless. Stalagmites jutted from the ground like jagged teeth, and the walls shimmered faintly.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	113	"[what]"
chapter_7_7ee741e7		But it was the door that held me still. It loomed before me—massive, stretching high into the abyss, forged of simple stone yet impossibly ancient.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	114	"[what]"
chapter_7_d3310d1d		The carvings on its surface were impossibly delicate, intricate to the point of madness—a magnificent dragon, its body coiling through storm-wracked clouds. The Prosperity Dragon.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	115	"[what]"
chapter_7_46cf7cbb		Magnus' fingers dug into my shoulders, desperate, clawing. His golden eyes burned with an unnatural glow, his large white wings twitching, restless, afraid. Cracks spiderwebbed through his feathers, glowing faintly at the edges.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	116	"[what]"
chapter_7_37211840	magnus	They're here… Dragonkin. Help me! Please!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	118	magnus "[what]"
chapter_7_7ee1a8bf		And then—I felt it. Something watching. Something waiting.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	120	"[what]"
chapter_7_8c034780		A presence, slow and hungry, like a massive, slumbering beast curling in its den, exhaling long, rattling breaths through jagged fangs.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	121	"[what]"
chapter_7_69385a08	dorian	Magnus!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	123	dorian "[what]"
chapter_7_8c1139e6	magnus	You have to hurry—no, no, no, listen to me, Dorian! This isn't a warning anymore—IT'S HERE!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	125	magnus "[what]"
chapter_7_54892bf0		The cracks in his feathers deepened. The cavern trembled. Stone dust rained down from above.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	127	"[what]"
chapter_7_8763efa2		The air was heavier now—thick with something unseen, something pressing against my ribs, my throat, my skull.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	128	"[what]"
chapter_7_c15f9bdb	yk	Dragonkin… Dragonkin…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	130	yk "[what]"
chapter_7_7b034329		It was low. Hungry. Smiling. Like it knew I was there. Like it knew my name.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	132	"[what]"
chapter_7_f5e8fecd		I felt my blood turn to ice.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	133	"[what]"
chapter_7_7f3ee5e0	dorian	Magnus! What in Tetrad's name is happening? What's behind that door?!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	135	dorian "[what]"
chapter_7_f34fedfb		Then Magnus became quiet.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	137	"[what]"
chapter_7_da6fc6d5	magnus	There's no time. The seal—it's WEAKENING. I don't know how, but something—someone—has started to undo it!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	139	magnus "[what]"
chapter_7_f59d7bb2	magnus	If it breaks—if it breaks, Dorian, I… I—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	140	magnus "[what]"
chapter_7_bf7dc392		The stone splintered. Something on the other side moved.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	142	"[what]"
chapter_7_fefd1328	magnus	PLEASE! HURRY! I don't think I can last much longer—Please—!!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	144	magnus "[what]"
chapter_7_1e494a95		Then, I felt pain.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	146	"[what]"
chapter_7_c24a1271		Magnus screamed. His entire body convulsed as unseen forces ripped at him, as if his very essence was being torn apart. His wings, so brilliant and white before, fractured, black veins crawling along his feathers like spreading rot.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	147	"[what]"
chapter_7_6c555a54	magnus	AHHHH!!!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	149	magnus "[what]"
chapter_7_de1fd675	dorian	MAGNUS!!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	151	dorian "[what]"
chapter_7_badd6c12		He reached for me, and I reached out for him. But before I could grasp him, he was yanked away.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	153	"[what]"
chapter_7_1292cd15		The world around me shattered.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	154	"[what]"
chapter_7_774fd42f		I woke up gasping.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	163	"[what]"
chapter_7_d3db8a40		Cold sweat clung to my skin, my breath coming in short, uneven bursts. My body was tense, hands clenched like I had tried to hold onto something.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	164	"[what]"
chapter_7_3a38c0bb		A soft whirring sound broke the silence.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	165	"[what]"
chapter_7_c3785bfa		I turned my head sharply, still disoriented, and was immediately greeted by the glow of a blue-tinted screen. A small hovering delivery bot floated beside me, its screen flickering before revealing a familiar face.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	166	"[what]"
chapter_7_be929d12	yuxuan	Had another dream, Dorian buddy?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	170	yuxuan "[what]"
chapter_7_2834dd2c		His usual teasing tone was there, but the way his brows furrowed told me he already knew the answer.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	172	"[what]"
chapter_7_255c22a7		I blinked, my thoughts sluggish. I rubbed my palms against my face.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	173	"[what]"
chapter_7_311e0954	weng	Here Master Dorian, drink this.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	175	weng "[what]"
chapter_7_10cddd2c		I barely registered her presence before a warm ceramic cup was pressed into my hands. The scent of bitter herbs and a whiff of honey drifted into my nose.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	177	"[what]"
chapter_7_1da4d9be		We were deep within the hidden bunker beneath Cheng Industries, a makeshift sanctuary carved into the underbelly of Tianho. The space was dimly lit, filled with the quiet sounds of the wounded.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	178	"[what]"
chapter_7_817b8d21		Scattered around the room, soldiers and civilians alike lay on makeshift beds, some wrapped in bloodied bandages, others slumped in exhaustion.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	179	"[what]"
chapter_7_cdb0be61		I took the teacup that Weng held out to me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	181	"[what]"
chapter_7_851baeb7	dorian	Thank you, Miss Weng.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	183	dorian "[what]"
chapter_7_1b00575a	weng	You must be parched from the battle earlier. I really have to thank you for being concerned about an old woman like me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	185	weng "[what]"
chapter_7_edf70be4	yuxuan	Weng told me about the Hundun. And when I heard, well—by the Prosperity Dragon, I was mortified! What in the world was an extinct creature doing here?!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	187	yuxuan "[what]"
chapter_7_a44791a4	weng	His Majesty told Sir Niko, Sir Svante, and me. At first, we didn't believe him. Until Tim backed him up.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	189	weng "[what]"
chapter_7_d0d2c730	weng	And then we went outside and saw the body.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	190	weng "[what]"
chapter_7_103c1d22	dorian	Yu, how's Elias?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	192	dorian "[what]"
chapter_7_ea788cb5		Yuxuan opened his mouth to respond, but before he could—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	194	"[what]"
chapter_7_70b428aa	tedda	Master Doriaaaann! Lady Elias is sleeping soundly! You have nothing to worry about! She is—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	196	tedda "[what]"
chapter_7_d1af64ad	roboto	Miss Tedda, please lower your voice.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	198	roboto "[what]"
chapter_7_921898ea	tedda	Oh… Sorry, Roboto. Whoopsiee…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	200	tedda "[what]"
chapter_7_33a6d05d		Yuxuan sighed, but a smirk tugged at the corner of his lips.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	202	"[what]"
chapter_7_c28c747c	yuxuan	Well, you heard it, buddy. Elias is fine.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	204	yuxuan "[what]"
chapter_7_0dfecb44		I nodded but barely acknowledged their words. My mind was still back in the dream. The cavern. The door.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	206	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_20706529	dorian	Yu… I have to tell you something.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	220	dorian "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_e655183e		The room hushed slightly. I took a breath and told them everything.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	222	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_bc2aee58		I told them how the white void cracked apart, breaking like shattered glass until I stood in an ancient underground cavern.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	223	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_bfe4688d		I told them about the winged man – Magnus. How his white wings streaked with cracks of light. How he would always call me every now and then.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	224	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_1b7eedf6		How he had grabbed me, shook me, and yelled my name in desperation. He told me that the seal was weakening. That someone—or something—was undoing it.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	225	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_8eeabcd2		When I finished speaking, a heavy silence settled over between the three of us.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	226	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_b6d6c39c	weng	By the stars… Is that what happened in your dream?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	228	weng "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_fbb875bf	yuxuan	A winged man? Preposterous. We—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	230	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_9004633e	niko	A winged man, you said?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	232	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_dd075449		I turned just in time to see him striding over, his coat slightly disheveled from tending to the injured. In one gloved hand, he held a scalpel, the blade still stained with antiseptic, while his other hand balanced a tray of rolled bandages and a mortar filled with crushed medicinal herbs.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	234	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_90943edd	svante	Sir Dorian, you're awake.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	236	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_a09ce703		The violet-haired Aldorith lifted his head. He set down the cloth and stood, striding toward us.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	238	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_ce599dc6	svante	Me and Sir Niko hurried to get here when we learned that the monsters attacked Tianho.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	240	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_80d41e6c	yuxuan	If it wasn't for them, almost half of the wounded here might have died.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	242	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_462e2899	weng	Such amazing gentlemen. I appreciate your help.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	244	weng "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_2559b70a		Weng looked at Svante and Niko. But Niko's gaze locked onto me, sharp and unyielding.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	246	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_561f2660	niko	Describe the winged man to me. Every detail.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	248	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_ae03acff		I hesitated. Something about the intensity in his voice—like he wasn't just curious, but searching for something.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	250	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_778bfb86		I told him. About Magnus' white wings. Brown hair. His golden eyes. The cracks of light streaking through them. His panic. His urgency. The cavern, and the growl beneath it.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	251	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_1d314e45		Niko listened in silence. He didn't even blink. Then, his grip on the scalpel tightened.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	252	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_65905df4		Svante's brows twitched slightly.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	253	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_6df9cd50	svante	But… That can't be.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	255	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_c4afa954	niko	Are you certain that wasn't a premonition of the Death God?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	257	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_6ef32de8	niko	It must be a sign from Enoch himself! I implore you, tell me more about this dream! Is it telling you to go somewhere? I will follow you, Dorian!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	258	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_8670b7d1		I opened my mouth to respond, but before I could—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	260	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_7e22a683	yuxuan	Oh, here we go…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	262	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_0ae3e3f3	yuxuan	Niko, I think you'd love any excuse to bring up Enoch.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	263	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_da45f4da		Niko shot him a glare but turned back to me, the intensity in his expression unwavering.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	265	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_eba93a45	niko	You described a man with wings. The golden eyes is a dead giveaway.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	267	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_37df3583	yuxuan	Oh, come on. You're reading into this a little too much. Not everything is about your Death God, Niko. Dreams happen all the time!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	269	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_79637f3f		Yuxuan's image flickered with animation.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	271	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_4c15d40a	yuxuan	Why, just last week, I dreamt that I had only eaten one piece of chocolate, but when I turned around—bam!—I was surrounded by an entire mountain of Hinami treats! And naturally, I ate all of them.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	273	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_b83b1d2d	weng	That's such a lovely dream, Master Yuxuan. You are incomparable and you are such a visionary!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	275	weng "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_8acdb985	yuxuan	Awww thank you so much, Miss Weng!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	277	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_2b7c3424	niko	*groans* Ugh…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	279	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_12e5c97b	yuxuan	Now tell me, Niko. Should I be preparing for an avalanche of delectable confections from Hinami to be given to me by the magnificent Prosperity Dragon? Because, if so, I need to grab my finest fork and plate!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	281	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_9d13a77b	niko	What? That's just ridiculous, Yuxuan.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	283	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_fbd4315c	svante	Now that you mention it, that sounds like a wonderful dream, Sir Yuxuan.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	285	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_18e56c3c	svante	I once dreamt that I stood in a field of violet flowers! I was barefoot, and the earth beneath me was warm! And for the first time, I felt… light.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	286	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_c02aaa0f	yuxuan	See?! Dreams are harmless!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	288	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_eb9ff80f	niko	That's not what I'm talking about, Yuxu—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	290	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_d645e65f	weng	I remember dreaming of stirring a lovely kettle and the entire city of Tianho gathered around—each of them drinking from it.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	292	weng "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_d4baa3bf		Svante's smile grew.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	294	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_5da638ba	svante	Wow… That really fits you, Miss Weng.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	296	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_9855e93d		Niko groaned, pinching the bridge of his nose.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	298	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_0681271d	niko	You're all missing the point… Enoch, help me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	300	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_ea004cb3	dorian	I… I need to find him. Magnus said he's in Tianho—but I have no damn clue where.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	302	dorian "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_4041b532		Niko straightened, nodding. I blinked.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	304	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_eb6b0540	dorian	You sure?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	306	dorian "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_5ed094a8	niko	I believe this isn't just some cryptic dream, Dorian. Something is happening.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	308	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_6b626e21		I ran a hand through my hair, taking a slow breath.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	310	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_c47ccdec	niko	Tell me—was there anything else in your dream? Something distinct?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	312	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_4d6370a4		I closed my eyes for a moment, trying to recall every detail. Think, Dorian, think. Then, it hit me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	314	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_14a9c787	dorian	There was a massive door. It was made of simple stone… but it bore an amazing illustration of the Prosperity Dragon. The details were immaculate, almost like I was looking at the dragon himself.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	316	dorian "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_431eb3b5	yuxuan	A massive door… Intricate illustration of the Prosperity Dragon…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	318	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_a5ae39c1		I turned to the delivery bot as Yuxuan's face flickered on the screen. His usual playfulness was gone, replaced with a calculating look.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	320	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_7b0cf6c4	yuxuan	I think I know where that is.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	322	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_eb2f08b4		My breath hitched.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	324	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_a51a4fa8	dorian	You do?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	326	dorian "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_70f7319c	yuxuan	I'm not completely sure yet. But if my guess is right, there's only one place in Tianho that fits that description.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	328	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_a018c839	niko	Isn't the Prosperity Dragon the main deity of Tianho? Surely there are hundreds of places with illustrations of it.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	330	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_1d8d5659	svante	Huh? The main deity? I was certain I saw a shrine for the Tetrad here in Tianho a while ago.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	332	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_715b0a89	weng	Those are for the tourists that will be coming for the Tragedy's fifth anniversary tomorrow.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	334	weng "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_271f88b3	svante	Oh… That makes a lot of sense, mam.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	336	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_a0861e5c	yuxuan	Trust me. I'll explain. Get back to the lab. I'll lead you there once you arrive.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	338	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_e34cfdab	niko	Fine.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	340	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_79ed8be7		I nodded, already feeling the adrenaline creeping back in.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	342	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_cec65348	svante	If it's not a bother. I'd love to join if Sir Niko's coming.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	344	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_6a5cb605	dorian	You sure? You don't have to come.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	346	dorian "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_e7240bd8	svante	If you're heading toward danger, I would like to help, sir. It's the least I can do.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	348	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_048033a6	niko	*sighs* Knock yourself out.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	350	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_0150bdd7		Niko wiped his hands on a clean cloth before turning toward the injured.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	352	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_69ffaca9	niko	Give me a few minutes, Dorian. I need to finish treating the wounded first.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	354	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_753a6f62	svante	I… I'll help too, Sir Niko. W-Wait!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	356	svante "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_4b6849de	niko	Hurry up.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	358	niko "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_d1df6358	yuxuan	Miss Weng, how's medical supply stock? How are the wounded?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	360	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_b8f0c101	weng	We have plenty in reserve, Master Yuxuan. Right this way.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	362	weng "[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_16027ee6		As the others scurried along, I was left alone with my thoughts.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	364	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_24b294b9		The weight of the dream still clung to me, even now. Magnus' voice, the panic in it—it hadn't been just a dream.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	365	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_9a2586bc		I crossed my arms, shifting my weight.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	366	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_e2d27b2a		For now, all I could do was wait.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	367	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_e2691278		…But after a few minutes, I was getting restless.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	368	"[what]"
ch7_dream_debrief_1927a855		Maybe I could spend some time with someone. But who?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	369	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_9bfc3463		I entered the room to my left. My gaze flickered to Svante—he was struggling.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	419	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_b7fd3b60		The violet-haired Aldorith stood by a table of medical tools, his expression utterly lost. His long fingers hovered over a scalpel, then a syringe, then a roll of bandages—clearly unsure what to do with any of them.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	422	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_d9b893fa		I sighed, stepping over.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	423	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_c5cb6fc6	dorian	You look like you're about to perform a heart surgery, Svante.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	425	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_fbf5d547		He jumped slightly, nearly knocking over a jar of ointment.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	427	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_0115c781	svante	N-No, sir! I w-wouldn't dream of it!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	429	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_ceece289		He quickly straightened, holding up a small glass bottle filled with clear liquid. His brows furrowed as he inspected the label like it might hold a hidden trap.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	431	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_d1c3eb0a	svante	There's this little girl who was wounded by a yaoguai, and I'm trying to look for something that can clean the wound.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	433	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_0f6c11f2		He hesitated, glancing at me with a deep frown.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	435	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_902845fc	svante	This says, 'antiseptic'. But I don't know what it does.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	437	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_3b701f91	dorian	It's fine. Antiseptic cleans wounds. Prevents infection, that sort of thing.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	439	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_5b94f552	svante	Really, sir?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	441	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_4dff7c1c		Relief flooded his features. Then, just as quickly, he frowned again.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	443	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_f6b451fd	svante	I was worried that it might be poison. I don't want anyone's flesh dissolving on my watch.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	445	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_8ee25cb3		I choked on a laugh.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	447	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_c897d418	dorian	Who would mix poison with medical supplies?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	449	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_1075a0c3	svante	Y-You never know, sir! Back in Mjoll, I don't have much experience with all this medical stuff.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	451	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_1c4e469e		He waved a hand vaguely at the shelves filled with neatly arranged vials and bandages.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	453	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_a11a9af9	svante	Us guy Aldoriths tend to stick to the battlefield.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	455	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_5af3c018		That part didn't surprise me. Aldorith warriors were known for their resilience in combat, their strict traditions. If you weren't patching up wounds in the middle of a war zone, you probably weren't learning medicine at all.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	457	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_471b7f3d	dorian	Then why are you helping Niko?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	459	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_7732b889		Svante rubbed the back of his neck, looking sheepish.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	461	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_84c639fc	svante	He needed an assistant, sir. And... I figured, since I'm a metal channeler, I could be useful somehow.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	463	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_a10eaa4c		He hesitated, then raised his hand. A soft hum filled the air as faint metallic glimmers flickered along his fingertips.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	465	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_2160785d	svante	See, I can use my metal channeling to bend surgical tools into shape if they break or dull too fast.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	467	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_686b6a8d		To demonstrate, he picked up a pair of tweezers that had a slightly bent tip. With a careful touch, he straightened them out, the metal shifting smoothly beneath his fingertips.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	469	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_a6ee9361	svante	I can also clean instruments really well. Niko told me that sterilization is important, so...	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	471	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_0a99399b		He gestured toward a tray of scalpels and forceps, all gleaming under the lantern light. He must have used his ability to strip them of any impurities, making them practically spotless.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	473	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_4818af28		I raised a brow.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	475	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_d2cc6ab5	dorian	That's actually really useful.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	477	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_53386194	svante	Y-You think so?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	479	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_434be1ba		His ears burned red, and he fidgeted with the antiseptic bottle.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	481	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_997edc0a	svante	I was just trying to be helpful. My sister Kristin was the real healer in the family. She always patched me up whenever I got hurt when we were kids.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	483	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_bc840eea		His voice softened at the mention of her, his eyes growing distant.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	485	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_44808228	dorian	She sounds like she was good at what she did.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	487	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_755a72da	svante	She was amazing. Mom and I loved her.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	489	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_1a9902bc	svante	I remember one time during my birthday, she made me a snow-violet cake.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	490	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_4818af28_1		I raised a brow.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	492	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_db833969	dorian	Oh, so she's a baker?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	494	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_151ce348	svante	Haha. No, sir. Not even close. But she did her best.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	496	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_e1641f33	svante	She made it so she and I could celebrate with Mom. Even if it was a little lopsided and too sweet, it was the best cake I ever had.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	497	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_d2e3dce2	dorian	You're right. She does sound amazing.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	499	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_4ff6e557	svante	Kristin… Mom…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	501	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_1f8d1355		For a moment, he lingered in the memory, and a small nostalgic smile played at his lips but then he caught himself, clearing his throat.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	503	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_3a4e02c5	svante	M-Merciful Enoch… Look at me rambling.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	505	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_42a0c2f8		He straightened, gripping the bottle a little tighter.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	507	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_21611b89	svante	A-Anyway, I should probably bring this to Sir Niko before I waste more time.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	509	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_3b2af724		He turned to go but then hesitated, glancing back at me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	511	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_5cbb83b1	svante	T-Thank you, sir Dorian. I would've overthought this for another ten minutes if you hadn't come in.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	513	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_bbcdc255		I smirked.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	515	"[what]"
ch7_svante_time_e8b76932	dorian	Not a problem. But are you sure you want to come with me and Niko to search for Magnus? You don't have to.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	517	dorian "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_dda0e833	svante	Y-Yes, sir! I really do want to help. I—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	519	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_05af59cb	niko	Svante, did you get the antiseptic for the yaoguai bite?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	521	niko "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_565eb4bf	svante	S-Sir Niko! C-Coming!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	523	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_9d0f2900	svante	See you later, sir Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	524	svante "[what]"
ch7_svante_time_52faea75		He gave a firm nod, then hurried off, the antiseptic bottle clutched tightly in his hands.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	526	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_e0bbb95e		I stepped toward the heart of the medical station, where soldiers lay on makeshift cots beneath the dim warm glow of lanterns. The air was thick with the scent of antiseptic, fresh herbs, and the underlying metallic tang of blood.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	543	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_e24d4df3		It was busier than I'd expected—soldiers and volunteers lay on cots or sat against crates, some wrapped in bloodied bandages, others groaning as healers worked tirelessly.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	544	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_efd8cb3a		I spotted Jiang, crouching beside a soldier with a deep gash on his leg. He looked up as I approached and gave me a quick wave.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	545	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_50ec48b2	jiang	Paladin Dorian. You're safe. Thank the Prosperity Dragon.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	547	jiang "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_483580ab		His gaze flicked over my clothes, as if checking for wounds.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	549	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_e4e27b6b	jiang	You don't seem to be wounded. I take it you're here to help?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	551	jiang "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_5d3ccd2a	dorian	Yeah. You look like you could use a few extra hands. Where's Gao and Tim?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	553	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_be031361	jiang	Gao's outside, patrolling the entrance. Tim's with Miss Weng, helping with supplies.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	555	jiang "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_e28c3349		A pained voice interrupted us—a woman, her voice barely above a whisper.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	557	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_ad7012ef	woman_2	S-Sir! P-Please… It hurts…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	559	woman_2 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_3cc697a9	woman_2	I was hurt by a caught by a yaoguai when… Ughhh…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	560	woman_2 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_f339e152		Jiang turned immediately, kneeling beside her and inspecting her wound.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	562	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_74d54d83	jiang	On it, miss! See you later, Paladin.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	564	jiang "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_d9c74062		I gave a brief nod, then scanned the room.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	566	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_e7201ac9		Niko was at the center of it all, hands steady as he stitched a deep wound on a soldier's arm. Around him, vibrant green medicinal plants flourished in patches of soil—his nature channeling at work.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	569	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_8a79d18d		Leaves rustled, and fresh herbs sprouted as if responding to his focus, their natural properties easing pain and hastening recovery.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	570	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_4935ad73		Niko barely glanced up as I approached.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	572	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_a2027f95	niko	If you're here to help, take a pair of gloves from that crate and get to work.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	574	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_ab3069d7	niko	And watch your step. There are vines near your feet—I'd rather not have a patient and a Paladin to heal tonight.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	575	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_0b1da5ff		I grabbed a pair and pulled them on, stepping toward the injured soldier.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	577	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_0c2aa293	dorian	What do you need, Niko?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	579	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_09ed2710	niko	Keep pressure on this wound while I stitch it up.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	581	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_9775efc3		The soldier winced as I applied pressure. He was a young man—early twenties, maybe—with dark hair matted to his forehead.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	583	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_15762f78	male_soldier_ch7	T-Thank you, sir...	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	585	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_c05aa2a8	dorian	Hang in there.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	587	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_99d7925a		He exhaled shakily, his chest rising and falling in uneven breaths. He gripped his own knee.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	589	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_e2d00c7e	male_soldier_ch7	I knew it'd be tough, but I didn't think it'd be this bad…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	591	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_79177605		Niko didn't lift his eyes from his work, his fingers moving with practiced ease as he threaded the needle.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	593	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_0c1f8b44	niko	The wound will heal soon. Don't worry, sir.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	595	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_f9237035	niko	Now, please relax and stay still.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	596	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_0c93ee89		With a flick of his wrist, he reached for a vial of clear liquid—one of Cheng Industries' medical innovations. He uncorked it, allowing a single drop to land on the wound. The liquid shimmered for a moment before seeping into the soldier's skin.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	598	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_02aec033		A reaction followed instantly. The raw, gaping tear knit itself together at an unnatural speed, reducing to a red scar within seconds. The soldier's breathing steadied, his pain lessening as Niko's nature channeling took over.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	599	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_06b8303c	niko	Feeling any pain, sir?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	601	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_8025b377	male_soldier_ch7	N-no, sir.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	603	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_f6d82532	niko	Good. Please continue to relax.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	605	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_b6311923		The medicinal plants growing around them responded to his call. A cluster of leaves twitched before unfurling, releasing a faint, sweet aroma. The air changed—thick with the scent of crushed herbs and damp earth. The soldier's body relaxed, the natural anesthetic properties dulling his agony.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	607	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_2521c022	male_soldier_ch7	That's… incredible.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	609	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_9138d4bd	niko	Side effects may include dizziness. So don't be surprised if you're seeing stars now.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	611	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_cdf9dd99		The soldier managed a weak chuckle, still staring at his arm in disbelief. Niko's hands moved with practiced ease, his touch gentle as he reached for fresh bandages.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	613	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_d46db4ca	male_soldier_ch7	My father was a jeweler before this…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	615	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_63e59f35	niko	That's great to hear. Jewelry is a profitable trade here in Tianho.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	617	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_80d03f2f	dorian	Where is he now?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	619	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_f98a0c22	male_soldier_ch7	The… The tragedy of Tianho happened. We lost everything.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	621	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_cc99cc3e	niko	I'm sorry to hear that.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	623	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_700f9139		The soldier's voice hardened, and his fingers curled into fists.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	625	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_7fa23c3a	male_soldier_ch7	Damn that wretched Death God and his rotten followers. They deserve worse than death.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	627	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_0ea52dd7	niko	…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	629	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_2fc5794f	dorian	…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	630	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_373e5c73		I saw it—the subtle shift in Niko's expression. It was quick, barely perceptible, but it was there. His shoulders tensed just slightly before relaxing again. His jaw clenched, his focus dropping back to his work.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	632	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_463a0098	male_soldier_ch7	Damn lunatics… They're the reason our city was destroyed.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	634	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_c327b122	male_soldier_ch7	If I ever see one of those damned prophets… By the Prosperity Dragon's name, I don't know what I'll do.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	635	male_soldier_ch7 "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_a650a84f		Niko remained silent, his expression unreadable as he tied off the bandage with practiced precision.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	637	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_9bd8c439		When he finally spoke, his voice was carefully measured.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	638	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_449c2fb6	niko	There. You should be good now.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	640	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_1b08c9ec		He adjusted the bandage one last time, ensuring it was snug but not restrictive.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	642	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_7e95733c	niko	Your bandages are secure. We closed the wound, but still, try not to move too much.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	644	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_d5c6ac02		With a quiet, deliberate motion, he reached for a cloth and gently placed it over the soldier's eyes.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	646	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_1ff32b56	niko	I want you to rest. Your body needs time to recover from closing the wound.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	648	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_92bb8ceb		The soldier's breath slowed. Within moments, he was out.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	650	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_e3c3cd69		Niko straightened, rolling his shoulders as he scanned the room. Jiang approached, carrying a box filled with ointments.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	651	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_025abff8	jiang	Doctor Niko, my men and I can take over from here. The Paladins have arrived. We'll handle the rest.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	653	jiang "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_275c2417		Niko gave a slow nod.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	655	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_eab0afab	niko	Make sure they stay hydrated. Even with the medicine, their bodies need strength to heal.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	657	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_fd1a096c	niko	And most importantly—don't let them push themselves. I don't care how much better they say they feel.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	658	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_b36ded44		Niko exhaled quietly. Then, without another word, he turned and walked toward the far end of the hideout, slipping into a small, solitary room.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	660	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_8e97e7b8		I followed.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	661	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_1093db93		The moment he stepped inside, his shoulders sagged slightly, the tension bleeding out of him as he approached a wooden table.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	662	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_03f6efc5		I leaned against it, watching him.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	663	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_4a3724c2	dorian	…I was surprised you didn't say anything, Niko.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	665	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_f502489b		Niko ran a hand through his hair before letting it drop to the table, his fingers tapping idly against the wood.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	667	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_40f0d088	niko	I doubt it would have changed anything, Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	669	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_c5c87c9f	niko	Besides, if you're in my profession you'll need to grow a thick skin.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	670	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_9d788f04		He didn't look at me, but I could see it in the way his hands curled into loose fists, the tension in his jaw, the flicker of something unreadable in his eyes. A doctor's duty was to heal, not to pass judgment. But that didn't mean he wasn't affected.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	672	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_0f9fdc97		Outside, muffled voices drifted in from the infirmary. The low murmur of people speaking in hushed tones, the occasional rustling of bandages, the soft scrape of boots against the wooden floor.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	673	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_5245dcb2		Through the half-open door, I caught a glimpse of the makeshift ward—rows of injured soldiers quietly lying on worn cots, some resting, others grimacing as volunteers carefully wrapped fresh bandages around their wounds.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	674	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_f96e5155	dorian	Damn those yaoguai…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	676	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_3be0a1ce		Niko let out a breath, slow and deliberate.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	678	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_2e21111f	niko	We're still on later, right? I apologize for making you wait.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	680	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_d0975d5e	dorian	Yes, we're still on.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	682	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_775a0b5d		A pause. I glanced toward the doorway again, watching as a young volunteer carefully adjusted a soldier's sling, murmuring reassurances as she worked. Others bustled around, distributing water, tending to wounds, keeping the place running.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	684	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_158a1531	dorian	Take your time. You did well today.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	686	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_3c2af1cb		Niko nodded, though his expression remained distant.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	688	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_38f5d74a	niko	Thank you. This won't be long. We've already patched up most of them.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	690	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_5095cf80		I studied him for a moment, debating whether to press further.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	692	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_c78060a6	dorian	Want me to help?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	694	dorian "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_18f77ad9		He shook his head, finally looking at me. There was something tired yet appreciative in his gaze.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	696	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_87c8a6a8	niko	No need. *chuckle* Though if you can, maybe fill that pitcher with water.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	698	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_5cca16ac		His voice was lighter now, a flicker of warmth cutting through the exhaustion.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	700	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_a406e4ab		I pushed off the table, grabbing the empty pitcher from a nearby shelf.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	701	"[what]"
ch7_niko_time_aa6d4bc0	niko	Thanks Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	703	niko "[what]"
ch7_niko_time_f1a6fd7f		I nodded and turned to leave. As I stepped out, I glanced back one last time. Niko stood there, his head bowed slightly, his hands still resting against the table.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	705	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_c0e89d0b		Restlessness gnawed at me, so I stood and wandered through the area, searching for someone to pass the time with.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	722	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_1c43edde		Dim lanterns flickered along the uneven stone walls, casting elongated shadows that stretched and shrunk as soldiers and volunteers moved about. The scent of damp earth mixed with burning oil and faint traces of medicinal herbs.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	723	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_137c7465		Near the entrance, I spotted Chung-hee, standing stiffly with his arms crossed, his usual unreadable expression firmly in place. Beside him, Soldier Gao animatedly gestured with both hands, practically vibrating with excitement.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	724	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_12869ab3		Tim, perched atop a wooden crate, swung his legs back and forth while nibbling on something that smelled suspiciously sweet.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	725	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_15f4d6cc		I approached just in time to hear Gao yelling.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	726	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_55d9d64c	gao	I still can't believe I actually met the Emperor of Kyeongjang! Do you know how rare that is? This is historic!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	728	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_a58bef33		He clapped his hands together, eyes gleaming.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	730	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_d9f2949c	gao	I—I'm gushing! Someone pinch me! I must be dreaming!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	732	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_fb9a5762	chung_hee	You're overreacting, Sir Gao. Calm down.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	734	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_977ce8c3	dorian	Chung's right, Gao. Keep your voice down. There are injured people resting.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	736	dorian "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_4eeffd8a		Tim, without looking up from his snack, licked caramel off his fingers and chimed in.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	738	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_680e5eee	tim	Technically speaking, it's not unprecedented.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	740	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_448a4e74		Gao turned to him, eyes wide.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	742	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_a0e479cd	gao	See?! Even Tim thinks it's a big deal!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	744	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_09db8459		Tim swallowed his last bite and wiped his mouth, his expression completely serious.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	746	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_9791b51e	tim	I never said it was a big deal, mister. I simply stated that, historically, rulers do occasionally engage in interactions with their subordinates.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	748	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_20cac0f5	tim	However, the context and frequency of these occurrences would determine whether this situation qualifies as 'rare.'	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	749	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_5c0973b8		Gao blinked at him.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	751	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_17532ab8	gao	That… I didn't understand that…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	753	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_738ec802		I stepped closer, and Gao immediately perked up, beaming.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	755	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_b30d8ecc	gao	Sir Dorian! That's right! You haven't tasted this one yet!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	757	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_a1c85572		I raised an eyebrow.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	759	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_29784705	dorian	Taste what?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	761	dorian "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_ac82f539		Grinning, he held up a small, round clay dish filled with something golden, glossy, and smooth. It looked like flan—caramelized on top, thick and creamy—but the scent was richer, deeper. A subtle hint of spice lingered in the air, something I didn't usually associate with a simple dessert.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	763	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_15c69257	gao	Tianho flan! My mom packed these for me before I left home. This one's still fresh. You gotta try it.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	765	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_ac10f5b8	dorian	Oh… How thoughtful…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	767	dorian "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_3dfced01		Tim, having already finished his portion, wiped his mouth and grinned.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	769	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_382aa438	tim	Mister Chung!! This is so delicious!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	771	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_6af5cbd3		He held up his tiny hands as if presenting an invisible award.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	773	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_e95f9b9e	tim	Acceptable texture! Balanced sweetness! The cinnamon infusion is an amazing addition!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	775	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_5260cb8c	gao	You heard that? It's Tim-approved, Your Majesty! That means it's gotta be top-tier!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	777	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_75a0542a		Chung-hee hesitated, his gaze shifting between the flan and Gao. He looked... almost wary.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	779	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_6a54ff91	chung_hee	Well, um… If you're referring to the physical act of hearing what he said, kind sir, I haven't, since I'm deaf.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	781	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_306c5ff4	chung_hee	But if you're referring to the understanding of what someone meant, then yes, I 'heard' him.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	782	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_1c347f38		Chung-hee paused.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	784	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_ac725bf6	chung_hee	…Does that make sense?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	786	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_afbbb481		Gao nodded rapidly, flustered.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	788	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_756cd5c2	gao	Oh… Um… Right?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	790	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_a18c415f		Quickly recovering, Gao cleared his throat.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	792	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_6d68ff19	gao	My mom makes the best desserts in Tianho, Your Majesty! You should visit her stall tomorrow at the anniversary—she sells out before the ceremony even starts every time!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	794	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_84bb190b	chung_hee	That would be the anniversary of the Tragedy of Tianho, correct?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	796	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_5f55f35e	gao	Yes, sir! A lot of people buy them to leave at the graves of their families and loved ones. I'm sure they'd appreciate it! It's a small but sweet way to remember them.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	798	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_4c097f7d		Chung-hee's gaze lowered slightly, fingers tightening around the small dish in his hands.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	800	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_4f0bb010	chung_hee	Something for Father… Mother…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	802	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_8be77d1c		I studied him, sensing the shift in his mood like the dimming of a flame.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	804	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_1efa61bc	dorian	Is something the matter, Chung?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	806	dorian "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_74cc32d3	chung_hee	Well… it's nothing, sir Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	808	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_7f396a95		Tim perked up again, eyes sparkling.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	810	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_2c447966	tim	I should tell Elias about this! That way, the two of us can eat—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	812	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_b7fbc1fb		I cut in sharply.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	814	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_b5333b06	dorian	(In Tetrad's name, please don't.)	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	816	dorian "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_ff1a895c		If Elias got involved, my money would vanish faster than a spark in the wind.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	818	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_dbcd5a85		I took a bite of the flan Gao handed me. The caramel glaze melted smoothly, giving way to a thick, velvety center, subtly laced with cinnamon. It was richer than I expected—warm, sweet, and spiced just enough to make me take another slow bite.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	819	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_b9b4fd7c		Meanwhile, Chung-hee still hadn't taken a bite. He was holding his portion as if it were something fragile, staring at it like he expected it to bite him instead.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	822	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_7d18e70f	gao	Pinch me, I must be dreaming! His Majesty will be eating my mother's flan!! AHHH!!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	824	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_e2a2553a		There was a long, drawn-out silence.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	826	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_fd9963d2	chung_hee	…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	828	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_2fc5794f	dorian	…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	829	dorian "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_00952cc7	tim	…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	830	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_fd9963d2_1	chung_hee	…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	831	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_1c68099d		I gave him a pointed look.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	833	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_8d443120	dorian	You're supposed to eat it, you know.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	835	dorian "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_508cd1e1		Chung-hee's shoulders tensed slightly.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	837	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_ece0bbec	chung_hee	I… know that, Sir Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	839	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_f7541662		Tim tapped a tiny finger against his chin, studying him.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	841	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_fb7120da	tim	Mister Chung, you might be overthinking the consumption process.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	843	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_6efad1b2		Chung-hee finally took an exaggeratedly slow bite, chewing with stiff awkwardness. The moment stretched. His expression remained unreadable as ever, but he didn't immediately spit it out, which was a good sign.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	845	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_96daea89		After a moment, he swallowed and nodded slightly.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	846	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_c66aec39	chung_hee	…It's amazing, actually.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	848	chung_hee "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_4270581f		Gao let out a victorious cheer.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	850	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_5ac37938	gao	HA! I KNEW IT!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	852	gao "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_75c2f9be		Tim clapped his hands.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	854	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_b3aca0d5	tim	Sensory approval has been achieved!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	856	tim "[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_44d7f0bf		I smiled at Chung-hee, and after a beat, he smiled back.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	858	"[what]"
ch7_chunghee_time_390ef017		We stood together at the entrance, the quiet hum of the camp surrounding us. Lantern light flickered against the stone, shadows stretching and shrinking with each movement. The warmth of the flan lingered on my tongue, and for a while, the weight in the air felt just a little lighter.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	859	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_5f175d39		The area was a little quieter now, the sounds of groaning wounded and hurried footsteps fading into a dull hum. I made my way past rows of flickering lanterns toward the supply area, where Weng—her white dress pristine despite the chaos—was meticulously arranging bottles of medicine.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	876	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_23dad961		She glanced up when she saw me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	877	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_ec3a9612	weng	Ah, Sir Dorian. How are you faring?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	879	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_fb7b1fe0	dorian	Just came to help, Miss Weng. What's the situation? Where's Yu?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	881	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_2bd7b38d	weng	Master Yuxuan's probably taking care of something in the lab right now. He asked me to take stock of the supplies.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	883	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_a2ecae61		She gestured toward a crate stacked high with neatly labeled boxes, all bearing the crest of Cheng Industries. Their sleek packaging stood out against the more standard medical kits. The name was printed in bold lettering:	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	885	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_c225b0f3		"Cheng Industries"	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	886	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_cc2a99d9		There were rolls of self-adhesive bandages, burn ointments that absorbed instantly, and even auto-suture kits for rapid wound closure. Expensive, cutting-edge supplies, leagues beyond the rough linen and herbal pastes most medics had to work with.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	887	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_8c2925b3	dorian	This is all from Cheng Industries?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	889	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_5909b53e	weng	Indeed, sir Dorian. While Sir Niko's salves and organic supplies have helped tremendously, more than half of our treatments tonight have relied on supplies from Cheng Industries.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	891	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_553097c1	weng	The automated injectors for pain relief from yaoguai bites, the clotting agents for deep wounds, even the regenerative salves for burns—it's all Cheng Industries. If we didn't have them, we'd be in a much worse position.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	892	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_607fca85		I frowned slightly. That meant a huge amount of their stock had already been used. That also meant…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	894	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_cd35fb75	weng	Like I said, Master Yuxuan is very busy. He's waiting for a report, but he's not responding to any of my voice messages.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	896	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_b2bc4ed6	weng	But you're free to leave a voice message, Sir Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	897	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_83940990	dorian	Might as well.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	899	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_38c1b98b		She pressed a button on the delivery drone hovering beside her. She motioned me to speak.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	901	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_f84ba052	dorian	Hey Yu. While I'm waiting on Niko to finish with his duties here, I—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	903	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_6b9729b5		I wasn't able to finish my sentence when the machine projected a hologram—and in the shimmering blue light, Yuxuan appeared. His hair was a little messy and he pushed books out of the way.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	905	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_8f2d3be6		Yuxuan's image flickered into view—slightly disheveled, a mess of books and equipment surrounding him. His normally sleek hair had a few stray strands sticking out, and there was ink smudged on his fingers.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	908	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_4a14fcd6	yuxuan	Dorian, buddy! How are you? S-Sorry for the mess. I didn't know you would be calling me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	912	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_8e40c554		He waved a hand at the air, flustered, as if trying to push the scattered notes and tools off-screen.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	914	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_a1c85572		I raised an eyebrow.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	915	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_db66da6a	dorian	I'm sorry, Yu. Do you need a moment?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	917	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_1c319e1a	yuxuan	NO— I mean YES— I mean—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	919	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_be96bd13		He sucked in a sharp breath, then smoothed a hand down his robe in a poor attempt to compose himself.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	921	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_885dc5ff	dorian	Are you sure? You look busy. I can just—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	923	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_f5b75493	yuxuan	I don't look busy! I take offense to that!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	925	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_6a898951		I let out a quiet chuckle. Weng sighed.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	927	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_6762e67a	weng	Master Yuxuan hasn't rested since the attack. He was at the front lines aiding the wounded, negotiating with the local relief groups, overseeing Cheng Industries' contributions, and distributing emergency rations—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	929	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_92652176	yuxuan	Miss Weng, I told you. I'm fine. I don't need rest. There's a lot I need to do.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	931	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_2a8f638e	weng	My apologies, Master Yuxuan.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	933	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_3d93b8fd		I took a closer look at him. Even in a flickering hologram, I could see the exhaustion clinging to him. The dim circles under his sharp eyes. The way his shoulders drooped ever so slightly.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	935	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_295f3eb7	dorian	Yu. You look like you could use some sleep. Can you sleep?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	937	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_806c10c5	yuxuan	Dorian buddy, I'm going to be escorting you to the area you dreamed about, remember? I need to finish this before I can lead the rest of you there. I—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	939	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_d8370e44	dorian	I appreciate that, Yu. Really, I do. It means a lot. But you really do look tired. I don't want you to overexert yourself.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	941	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_7d51a39a		For a moment, he looked like he wanted to argue. To brush it off. But instead, he sighed, running a hand through his hair. His voice dropped slightly, softer now.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	943	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_604cec23	yuxuan	It's not just that.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	945	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_c93fc48f	dorian	Then what?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	947	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_989aa3fb		Yuxuan hesitated. He shifted, glancing away, as if gathering his thoughts. Finally, he exhaled, his tone unusually vulnerable.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	949	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_f8c6772d	yuxuan	Tomorrow… It's the fifth anniversary of the Tragedy of Tianho.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	951	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_9967b3c6		A weight settled between us.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	953	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_32b0f856		Even though the kingdom of Hinami would be hosting the memorial this year, it didn't change the fact that Tianho would be in focus. And for Cheng Industries, the most powerful corporations in Tianho, that meant every move Yuxuan made would be under a magnifying lens.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	954	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_d2ebf452	yuxuan	Cheng Industries will still be scrutinized. Every action, every donation, every word I say—there are people just waiting for me to slip up.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	956	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_bb5332eb	yuxuan	Some people still believe we didn't do enough. Others think we did too much. And I know that no matter what I do tomorrow, someone will find a reason to be upset. A reason to call us vultures. Or opportunists. Or worse.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	957	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_47f67728	dorian	And that's why you're not resting?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	959	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_c793ff66		Yuxuan let out a quiet, almost bitter laugh.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	961	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_4d528fe7	yuxuan	I wouldn't be able to sleep even if I tried.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	963	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_e568ddca	weng	Master Yuxuan, you're not just carrying your own worries. You're carrying the expectations of an entire nation, the legacy of your family.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	965	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_e2659b1e	weng	I know you feel like you can't afford to rest. That you have to keep pushing forward. But running on fumes isn't going to help anyone, least of all yourself.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	966	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_c5aff12b		The dim hum of the underground camp surrounded us—the distant murmur of the injured, the occasional beeping of medical devices.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	968	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_d03c787c		Then I sighed.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	969	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_3b2b14c4	dorian	Come here.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	971	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_cb6f4327	yuxuan	W-what?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	973	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_7eaea1d7	dorian	I said come here…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	975	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_3d9faa44		His hologram flickered slightly as he shifted in place.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	977	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_868dc1b1	yuxuan	Dorian, I am literally a projection right now, what do you mean come here?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	979	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_20fff7a8	weng	Master Yuxuan, just do it, please.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	981	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_d0f2bed3		Hesitantly, he took a step forward. It didn't matter that his body wasn't physically here—just the gesture alone made something in his expression soften.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	983	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_4f6bbe64		I lifted my hand, hovering it right where his shoulder would be if he were standing in front of me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	984	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_39c1c427	dorian	I want you to rest, okay?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	986	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_c8ed259b		Yuxuan inhaled sharply. His hologram glitched, flickering for just a second.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	988	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_76f774dd	dorian	You're allowed to rest, Yu. You're allowed to breathe.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	990	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_3d9faa44_1		His hologram flickered slightly as he shifted in place.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	992	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_868dc1b1_1	yuxuan	Dorian, I am literally a projection right now, what do you mean come here?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	994	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_20fff7a8_1	weng	Master Yuxuan, just do it, please.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	996	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_d0f2bed3_1		Hesitantly, he took a step forward. It didn't matter that his body wasn't physically here—just the gesture alone made something in his expression soften.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	998	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_4f6bbe64_1		I lifted my hand, hovering it right where his shoulder would be if he were standing in front of me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	999	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_39c1c427_1	dorian	I want you to rest, okay?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1001	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_c8ed259b_1		Yuxuan inhaled sharply. His hologram glitched, flickering for just a second.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1003	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_76f774dd_1	dorian	You're allowed to rest, Yu. You're allowed to breathe.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1005	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_3ad793cc	yuxuan	D-Dorian…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1007	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_1a1b2515		Yuxuan opened his mouth as if to protest, but then hesitated. His image wavered.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1009	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_00a772f1	yuxuan	But what about later? You still need me to show you the place from your dream…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1011	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_9c1dd5fd	yuxuan	Or, I don't know. Hmm… maybe Roboto can do it for you—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1012	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_b7612c3a		He blinked at me, then scoffed, rubbing the back of his neck.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1014	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_df22d0d2	yuxuan	I mean, technically, he could. Wait. In fact, Roboto can. Why in the Prosperity Dragon's name didn't I think of that?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1016	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_b97f2e26		Yuxuan sucked in a breath, eyes widening just slightly. I took a step closer to his hologram, the faint blue light casting a soft glow over my face.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1018	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_acd772b3	dorian	If there's anything I can do to help you rest, just say the word.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1020	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_11262a1a		There was a long pause.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1022	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_cae7195b		Yuxuan seemed at a complete loss for words. He stared at me, opened his mouth, closed it again, then finally muttered, almost inaudibly—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1023	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_8881b0bf	yuxuan	Maybe if you were here…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1025	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_9d461e41		I blinked.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1027	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_d2802820		His eyes went wide as he realized what he had just said, his entire face turning red.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1028	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_fd53c342	yuxuan	D-Dorian! F-Forget it! I didn't—I mean—I was just—ugh!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1030	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_a07950bb		He ran both hands through his already-messy hair, looking like he wanted to crawl into a hole.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1032	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_3e73b066	weng	Master Yuxuan, you really are bad at this.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1034	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_fa565ba3	yuxuan	Ugh. Weng! Not now!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1036	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_f1ba2eac	dorian	I'll be there soon, Yu. But for now… just try to get some rest.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1038	dorian "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_86b046ae	yuxuan	Fine… But only because you asked.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1040	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_31bf3779		The flickering blue light of his hologram made his expression hard to read, but there was something else in his gaze now—something softer. Warmer.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1042	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_503ac69f		Then, he huffed dramatically, shifting back into his usual bravado.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1043	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_dd3824be	yuxuan	Fine. I'll send Roboto before I head to bed. Happy?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1045	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_e8bf0397		I rolled my eyes and didn't reply. Before the connection could cut, another voice suddenly rang through the hologram.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1047	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_aeb5942a	tedda	Mister Yuxuan! Mister Yuxuan! Here's your water!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1049	tedda "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_43c27ff1	yuxuan	Oh Tedda! Since you're here, can you do a hand massage? I need one so I can get to sleep.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1051	yuxuan "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_d83ad0a3	tedda	Ooh! I can do that, Mister Yuxuan!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1053	tedda "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_5f95436a	tedda	Wait, oh my! Look at your hair! You do need to get some sleep!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1054	tedda "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_53ef0084	tedda	Maybe a back massage is better! Hold on, let me—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1055	tedda "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_ee55a006		The hologram abruptly cut off.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1057	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_1a660e0b		The supply drone beside Weng beeped, returning to its idle state.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1058	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_931a4418		Weng smiled, clearly amused, then gave me a nod of gratitude.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1060	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_3b047352	weng	Thank you, Sir Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1062	weng "[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_02d8601a		She excused herself, slipping back into her work, carefully organizing the medical supplies.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1064	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_cdb9d963		I exhaled and glanced around. The injured soldiers were still getting some rest. The air felt calmer now, the tension of earlier easing just a little.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1065	"[what]"
ch7_yuxuan_time_93f91ebf		Finding a quiet spot, I sat down and waited for Niko and the others to finish.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1066	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_ca9adbd6		I waited.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1085	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_2e62e4f6		For what felt like an hour, I remained in place, arms folded as I watched the underground camp shift and stir around me. The dim glow of lanterns flickered against the stone walls, casting wavering shadows that danced with every passing movement.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1086	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_2929f205		The scent of medicinal herbs, sweat, and lingering blood filled the air.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1087	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_90a3d11a		Then, suddenly—chaos.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1088	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_7031e1c4		A fresh wave of wounded stumbled in through the entrance, the sound of hurried footsteps and pained groans breaking the temporary peace.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1089	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_0c5803ea	niko	More? Get them here! Quickly!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1091	niko "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_44952d3c	svante	On it, sir!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1092	svante "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_2917d8ab		Niko's voice rang through the camp as he and his assistants rushed forward, guiding the injured toward the makeshift medical beds. Some paladins were already on the move, rolling out more bandages and preparing antiseptics.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1094	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_21f6759d		Weng, despite her age, moved with sharp precision, directing volunteers where they were needed most.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1095	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_51248080		A man groaned in agony as a deep gash along his side was quickly wrapped. Another warrior, his face pale from blood loss, was lowered onto a cot while Niko pressed firm hands over his wound, muttering a prayer.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1096	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_d8ab8050		Through it all, Svante worked quietly, his hands trembling slightly as he sorted through gauze, ointments, and stitches. He wasn't trained for this, but he was doing what he could—meticulously arranging supplies, refilling water basins, anything to help keep the system flowing.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1097	"[what]"
