ch7_waiting_common_ccc5d170		At his side, he held the hand of what looked to be an injured fellow paladin—a younger man whose breathing was shallow but steady. Feng's grip was firm, as if anchoring him in place.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1105	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_74cefb52	feng	You'll be alright. Just breathe.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1107	feng "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_6527347b		The younger paladin barely managed a nod before being led away for treatment. Feng lingered for a moment, watching until he was sure the healers had him in good hands. He turned and spotted me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1109	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_23d4a464		His expression brightened.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1110	"[what]"
