ch7_waiting_common_31f2843e		I stepped forward, scanning him for any serious injuries.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1114	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_2df717c3	dorian	How's the situation?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1116	dorian "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_80778a53		Feng rolled his shoulders with a tired stretch. He dusted off his gauntlets, exhaling sharply.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1118	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_5be6844d	feng	Taken care of. By the Prosperity Dragon, we handled the yaoguai. Before heading back, we swept the perimeter, just to be sure.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1120	feng "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_081db65f		I watched as he leaned against a stone pillar, the dim lantern light catching on his armor's scuffs and dents.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1122	"[what]"
