ch7_waiting_common_2418e21b		Feng scoffed and clapped a hand against my shoulder, shaking his head.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1158	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_2f117790	feng	You could say that?! Dorian and I were best friends!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1160	feng "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_aa449563		Niko, who had been quietly observing, finally spoke up.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1162	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_8d6ef62e	niko	Yeah. The two of you. And that Cyrus fellow.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1164	niko "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_36920194		A flicker of recognition crossed Feng's face. His gaze drifted toward Niko, his brow furrowing slightly as he looked him over.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1166	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_de1f5f60	feng	Oh… I remember you.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1168	feng "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_de5bfaf5		A beat passed. His expression changed—his features sharpening into something colder, edged with disdain.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1170	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_3af5e7f7	feng	You're that Death God prophet who had a brother with the audacity to try out for the interpreter for the son of the Emperor of Kyeongjang.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1172	feng "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_6eeacc6e		Niko's fingers curled slightly against his arms, his expression unreadable.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1174	"[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_51d8d68e	niko	Yes… I was.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1176	niko "[what]"
ch7_waiting_common_bc631801	feng	Hmph. We should have arrested you in the first place.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1178	feng "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_72a280c6		The air grew heavier.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1193	"[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_d9e50691	feng	Maybe if we had, things would have turned out differently. No Tianho Tragedy. No need for underground camps, no need for wounded paladins bleeding out on stone floors.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1195	feng "[what]"
