ch7_feng_niko_clash_65ccface		Feng scoffed.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1199	"[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_e8fc81b0	feng	Right. Because listening to the Death God's lapdog always leads to prosperity.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1201	feng "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_afe02bce	niko	Hmph.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1203	niko "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_a7d07a11		He gestured vaguely toward the injured, his smirk thin and humorless.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1205	"[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_ef8f4946	feng	Your death god caused this, idiot.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1207	feng "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_36d17dd1	feng	Do you ever wonder if your god watched and did nothing? Or do you already know the answer to that?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1208	feng "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_8d2d1261		Niko's expression didn't change, but something in his shoulders stiffened.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1210	"[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_0ea52dd7	niko	…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1212	niko "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_ef8434d2		Svante shifted uncomfortably, his gaze darting between them.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1214	"[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_705b68b0	svante	S-Sir, that's really not necessary, we're just—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1216	svante "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_c595debe	feng	You're not off the hook either, aldorith.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1218	feng "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_6c533e5e	feng	Your Mjollians worship Enoch, don't they? A god of order, of righteous judgment? Tell me, where was that divine justice when Tianho burned?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1219	feng "[what]"
