ch7_feng_niko_clash_327ff347	niko	Sir Feng, you are exhausted. Your core temperature has risen by approximately three degrees, your muscles are visibly tense, and you're favoring your left side.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1256	niko "[what]"
