ch7_feng_niko_clash_c990bd78	feng	Why you arrogant son of a—	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1259	feng "[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_d9e6772d	niko	There are wounded here. Tell me, Sir Feng—how many people will suffer tonight because you chose to satisfy your pride instead of helping them?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1261	niko "[what]"
