ch7_feng_niko_clash_12bca697		Feng, watching me closely, smirked.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1358	"[what]"
ch7_feng_niko_clash_c61f7c88	feng	Well? What's it gonna be, old buddy?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1360	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_4307ff4f		I let out a breath, then smirked. It's been a while since I drank with him. Feng whooped, throwing an arm around my shoulder.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1384	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_512f655b	feng	That's my boy! Thought you got too serious for a good drink!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1386	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_15edfa4e		I took a long sip, the burn of the wine spreading warmth through my chest. The tension from the day—the injured, the yaoguai attacks, the exhaustion—eased just a little.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1388	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_4595bd75		Svante, who had been watching nervously, immediately perked up.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1390	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_4bece723	svante	Ah… T-that's good, Sir Dorian! You should relax a little…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1392	svante "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_28e5bd90		He smiled, clearly relieved. Is he… worried about me?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1394	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_797be04e		But then, I heard Niko sigh.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1395	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_e27ef1e5	niko	Really, Dorian? At this time?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1397	niko "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_7f2c635a		I turned to him, catching the way his arms were crossed. He wasn't fuming, but there was disapproval in his gaze.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1399	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_38299cb9		I frowned, feeling a slight twinge of guilt. Niko had always been the responsible one, the one who thought ahead. He had seen the worst of people when they let themselves go. Maybe, to him, drinking right now—after everything—was reckless.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1400	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_a5c80e5f		Before I could say anything, Feng scoffed and waved a hand dismissively.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1401	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_71655834	feng	Ignore the bootlicker, buddy.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1403	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_26807113		He raised his bottle, clinking it against mine with an exaggerated wink.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1405	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_ccf6bb42	feng	Tonight, we drink to survival. To kicking ass. To another battle won. And to you not losing your damn mind under all that responsibility.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1407	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_2f6363ce		I huffed a quiet laugh despite myself.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1409	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_0966662f	dorian	Yeah, yeah. Just don't make me regret this.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1411	dorian "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_0934eca1		Feng grinned wide.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1413	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_e5c440c6	feng	No promises.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1415	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_a9c724f8		Then, he turned toward Aoi, lifting his bottle in her direction.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1417	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_965dafc7	feng	Aoi, join us, would you?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1419	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_1dad230e		She rolled her eyes, arms still crossed.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1421	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_c988fa8c	aoi	I don't drink on duty.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1423	aoi "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_e8bdb56a		Feng snorted.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1425	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_9dbb8878	feng	Oh, please. You're still getting paid, aren't you? It's not like I'm asking you to down the whole bottle and start singing folk songs. Just one drink.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1427	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_23b7071f		Aoi arched a brow at him. Then, with a dramatic sigh, she plucked a bottle from the stash.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1429	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_51f4cd25	aoi	Fine. Since you're still paying me, basically.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1432	aoi "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_d1dd880b		Feng whooped again as we clinked our bottles together.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1434	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_0eb20555	feng	CHEERS, YOU BASTARDS! TO THE PROSPERITY DRAGON AND TO US!!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1436	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_6397638b	feng	MAY OUR COINS NEVER FAIL, OUR STOMACHS NEVER EMPTY, AND OUR CUPS NEVER RUN DRY!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1437	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_0286244b		All: CHEERS!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1439	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_a4b72dbd		I turned the bottle in my hands, watching the liquid swirl, before shaking my head.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1449	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_2d697f69	dorian	Not tonight.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1451	dorian "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_49ad2bbf		Feng blinked, caught off guard. For a split second, he looked almost disappointed—before he threw his head back with an exaggerated groan and dramatically slumped against a crate.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1453	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_f95e3d5a	feng	Ugh, you really have changed.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1455	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_9a3b0905		I chuckled, shoving the bottle back toward him.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1457	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_fa4067f1	dorian	Someone has to stay sharp.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1459	dorian "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_8a23476b	feng	Pft… Boring Dorian. That's what you are now. Boring. Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1461	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_e6ef8596	aoi	You could learn from him, sir.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1463	aoi "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_ffaf73b1	feng	Don't chastise me, Aoi. I get enough of that from my commanding officers, thanks.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1465	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_584c124a		Out of the corner of my eye, Niko's expression softened. He didn't say much—he never did when he was pleased—but I caught the slight nod of approval.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1467	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_326dc27d	niko	…Good.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1469	niko "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_469d4adf		I understood. To Niko, discipline meant survival. He had seen firsthand what happened when people got careless, when they let themselves indulge too much. Maybe, in his mind, I had just proven I wasn't like the rest.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1471	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_155e9ff9		But then, a quiet fidgeting caught my attention. I turned to see Svante, shifting from foot to foot, his expression unsure.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1472	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_fb98e3ae	svante	…Sir Dorian, it's just one drink. You can afford to relax, can't you?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1474	svante "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_70c5375a		I glanced at him. Was he worried about me? Maybe, in his eyes, refusing to drink meant I was still carrying too much.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1476	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_b5804806		Feng, of course, just shrugged and took another swig, completely unbothered.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1478	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_fe39d90e	feng	Suit yourself. More for me.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1480	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_659e1975		He raised his bottle in a mock toast, then grinned.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1482	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_2bd83950	feng	Come on, Aoi. More for us.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1484	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_b15e0a5f		Aoi pinched the bridge of her nose, but eventually sighed in resignation, grabbing another bottle.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1486	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_cecbcd97	aoi	*sigh* Fine. Just one, alright?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1488	aoi "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_f50bc53c	feng	Fine.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1490	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_b066cc3d		Then, without missing a beat, he turned his attention to the nearby soldiers.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1492	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_9dbc1e9a	feng	Hey you!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1494	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_8b1adac8	jiang	Yes, Paladin?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1496	jiang "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_46c55778	gao	Y-yes, sir?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1498	gao "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_71559a25		Feng grinned, waving his bottle.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1500	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_fdc988c3	feng	Join us! Now!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1502	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_cbec7120		Jiang and Gao exchanged nervous glances.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1504	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_20ac69e5	aoi	Really, sir? *sighs* You really are something, huh?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1506	aoi "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_a740a0e6	feng	The more the merrier! This is a celebration—we survived another damn battle, didn't we?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1508	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_1444b19c		Jiang hesitated, but Gao—after a brief moment of uncertainty—grabbed a bottle and took a small sip. He coughed, sputtering slightly.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1510	"[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_20b93fe4	gao	*coughs* Oh by the Dragon… *coughs* That's strong! *coughs*	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1512	gao "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_f483122b	jiang	Ugh… Gao, get a grip.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1514	jiang "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_f31687d5	aoi	Hey, are you alright?	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1516	aoi "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_e4b87a65	dorian	Gao, don't push yourself, please.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1518	dorian "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_f4ff4f47	feng	That's the spirit! See? This guy gets it! Your turn, other guy! PARTY!!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1520	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_f9b99dd1	aoi	Sir, calm yourself down.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1522	aoi "[what]"
ch7_drink_choice_a047dcb8		Jiang, looking increasingly uncomfortable, gave me a quick, searching glance. I simply shook my head, amused.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1524	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_dda89965		Weng walked toward us, her white dress pristine despite the long hours of work. Beside her, little Tim toddled along, his small fingers clutching her hand.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1538	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_81cf65c1		The toddler's other hand held a plastic bag filled with containers, each stacked neatly. Through the transparent material, I caught a glimpse of their contents—golden, jiggling Hinami flan.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1539	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_808d4cab		Trailing slightly behind them was Chung-hee, his usual unreadable expression in place. His posture was relaxed, but his sharp eyes flicked over the camp, always assessing. Always watching.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1540	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_7005e512		Tim looked at Gao, who flashed a thumbs up at the kid. Tim smiled widely at him.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1542	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_a1bb3c0e		When Weng reached us, she clapped her hands together, nodding with finality.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1544	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_061d6dcb	weng	It's time. We're leaving. Sorry we took too long, Sir Niko. Master Dorian.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1546	weng "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_ca0c79c9		Finally. My thoughts turned to Magnus and the dream. And the mysterious door. I hope Yuxuan's lead is correct.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1548	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_b39a19d6		Niko was already finishing up, securing the last of his medical supplies. Svante, after lingering for a few seconds, finally sighed and stepped away from his task as well.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1549	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_20e43af6	niko	No need to apologize, ma'am. I took too long as well. Come on, Svante.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1551	niko "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_78b4f49d	svante	Yes, sir Niko.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1553	svante "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_e8f93350		I rolled my shoulders, turning to Feng, who was still nursing his bottle of wine, his usual cocky smirk firmly in place.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1555	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_d1d7786b	dorian	We're heading out.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1557	dorian "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_2230d839	feng	Where are you going?! The night's still young, buddy! Tomorrow is the anniversary! We have so many stuff to catch up on!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1559	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_e378872c	feng	You still haven't told me all about your time in the kingdom of Mjoll! Or did the cold finally get to your funny bone, huh? Hahaha!	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1560	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_f4d61896		I hesitated. I could feel his eyes on me—sharp, questioning.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1562	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_f7bdaf0c		But there was no time to waste. I had already lingered too long.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1563	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_5dc6df14	dorian	Sorry, buddy. But we need to move. Now. It's urgent.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1565	dorian "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_b0ffed84		I didn't raise my voice, but the weight behind my words made it clear—this wasn't something I could delay.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1567	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_f7ebd447		Chung-hee and I exchanged a glance. Niko exhaled sharply, adjusting the bandages on his arms. He didn't need to ask why—I could tell by the look in his eyes that he already had a sense of it. Svante, after a brief moment of hesitation, hurried after us, his steps quick.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1568	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_a5257570	feng	Hmm…	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1570	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_7a018a23		Behind me, I could feel Feng's stare lingering. A breath. A pause.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1572	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_7900bf73		Then—a chuckle.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1573	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_c80f6861		The flickering firelight cast shadows over his face as he leaned back slightly, tilting his bottle lazily toward me. He grinned.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1574	"[what]"
ch7_drink_common_7d10efd8	feng	Heh. Alright, alright. No need to be so serious.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1576	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_d34a6e5b	feng	You always did have a way of making things dramatic, old friend. But I get it.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1577	feng "[what]"
ch7_drink_common_4c8be016		He lifted the bottle in an easygoing mock toast.	game/09_chapter_07.rpy	1579	"[what]"
