chapter_8_b74d25c6		CHAPTER 8	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	182	"[what]"
chapter_8_97a84e68		The journey to Yuxuan's lab was quiet, save for the occasional shuffle of boots against the dirt. Above us, the night stretched vast and endless, a deep indigo canvas speckled with stars, their cold glow barely enough to illuminate the path.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	188	"[what]"
chapter_8_3150b1d6		A hush had fallen over our group, the weight of the night pressing in, thick with unspoken thoughts.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	189	"[what]"
chapter_8_b0264669		I kept a watchful eye on our surroundings, my senses tuned to any shift in the air, but the night remained undisturbed. Meanwhile, Svante found a brief distraction, chatting softly with Tim, who clutched Weng's hand while balancing his plastic bags of Hinami flan.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	190	"[what]"
chapter_8_bb20ba97	weng	By the stars, my back is starting to ache… Tim, are you sure you can finish all of that?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	192	weng "[what]"
chapter_8_bb5087eb	tim	Positive, Miss Weng!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	193	tim "[what]"
chapter_8_476ffb4f		After a while, we reached the entrance of Yuxuan's lab. The same towering door of polished metal loomed before us. Like before, it spoke as we approached.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	199	"[what]"
chapter_8_b6e05b76		Door: Facial recognition is currently in progress. Please refrain from excessive movement.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	201	"[what]"
chapter_8_615e6350		A few moments later, the voice spoke again.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	203	"[what]"
chapter_8_96df14da		Door: Initiating secondary verification. Please present a valid voice signature.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	205	"[what]"
chapter_8_1c37340f	weng	Cai Weng. Master Yuxuan's assistant.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	207	weng "[what]"
chapter_8_dd3f76f2		Door: Processing… Please provide a biological confirmation.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	209	"[what]"
chapter_8_d5e4496e		Chung-hee exhaled sharply, folding his arms. His gaze flicked to Weng before trailing over the towering metal door.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	211	"[what]"
chapter_8_a3aa1c70	chung_hee	Isn't this… excessive? Must a simple door be guarded like a royal vault?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	213	chung_hee "[what]"
chapter_8_16d59e87		Niko raised a brow, glancing at him.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	215	"[what]"
chapter_8_eb179f37	niko	They don't have security systems like this in Kyeongjang, huh?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	217	niko "[what]"
chapter_8_c13ecede	chung_hee	We have, but not this excessive.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	219	chung_hee "[what]"
chapter_8_31c4570a	svante	You have these in Kyeongjang too, Your Majesty?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	221	svante "[what]"
chapter_8_54c2cdfc		Chung-hee let out a quiet scoff, shaking his head.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	223	"[what]"
chapter_8_ec935b5f	chung_hee	Yes, but not even our palace gates demand so much proof of existence.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	225	chung_hee "[what]"
chapter_8_ab431322	chung_hee	And again, Svante. Call me Chung.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	226	chung_hee "[what]"
chapter_8_93dcc979	svante	S-Sorry, Your Majesty. I mean Sir Chung.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	228	svante "[what]"
chapter_8_47c9ae1b		The door let out a low beep, and the heavy locks shifted with a mechanical hiss.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	230	"[what]"
chapter_8_b037316b		Door: Identity confirmed. Welcome home, Miss Cai Weng. May the blessings of the Prosperity Dragon be with you this wonderful night.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	232	"[what]"
chapter_8_dc6d0f68		Door: Here at Cheng's we bring change.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	233	"[what]"
chapter_8_6963bae5		~Here at Cheng's we bring change.~	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	234	"[what]"
chapter_8_2fabeed2	niko	Merciful Enoch, I can't seem to escape that damn jingle.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	236	niko "[what]"
chapter_8_bdba129f		The seamless metal parted, revealing the pristine interior of the lab.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	238	"[what]"
chapter_8_b95dfe81		Roboto whirred forward. Its polished exterior reflected the glow of the overhead panels, giving it an almost ghostly sheen in the dim light.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	242	"[what]"
chapter_8_cb4d299f	roboto	G-G-G-Good evening, Master Dorian. Master Yuxuan is t-t-taking a n-n-n-nap.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	244	roboto "[what]"
chapter_8_11029857	roboto	He r-r-requested me to show you y-y-y-your d-d-destination.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	245	roboto "[what]"
chapter_8_adec59d9	svante	Sir Yuxuan… naps?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	247	svante "[what]"
chapter_8_cc18c54b	niko	He's a human being. Of course he gets tired.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	249	niko "[what]"
chapter_8_6ff0f586		Weng turned to us, her gaze gentle but firm as she placed a guiding hand on Tim's back.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	251	"[what]"
chapter_8_fdcb4640	weng	Are you sure about this, Sir Dorian? If so, this is where we part ways for now. Roboto will be leading you to the door in your dream.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	253	weng "[what]"
chapter_8_83eb783a	weng	Tim and I are already feeling tired. These old bones of mine aren't helping.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	254	weng "[what]"
chapter_8_47975d03	tim	N-No I'm not *yawns* I'm more than willing to- *yawn*	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	256	tim "[what]"
chapter_8_c14de901		Weng chuckled softly, shaking her head.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	258	"[what]"
chapter_8_b0d9e362	weng	I apologize. If I were younger I would have *yawn*	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	260	weng "[what]"
chapter_8_a010df40		She yawned, covering her mouth as fatigue settled into her features.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	262	"[what]"
chapter_8_43c8b737	svante	Don't worry, miss Weng.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	264	svante "[what]"
chapter_8_f3fc9c00		Tim pouted but gave a small wave.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	266	"[what]"
chapter_8_7f25e08a	tim	Aww… But take care, sirs! See you *yawns* tomorrow.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	268	tim "[what]"
chapter_8_2aabb63f	chung_hee	We will, Tim.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	270	chung_hee "[what]"
chapter_8_1189293c	weng	I'll check on Elias and Tedda for you before we go to sleep, Sir Dorian. Take care.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	272	weng "[what]"
chapter_8_127401b3		I met her gaze and gave a slight nod.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	274	"[what]"
chapter_8_7d54a6a4	dorian	Thank you, Miss Weng. I appreciate it.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	276	dorian "[what]"
chapter_8_858d1f7d		She gave me a knowing look before turning away, leading Tim inside. The metal door slid shut behind them with a quiet hiss.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	278	"[what]"
chapter_8_4cc1c86b		Roboto whirred again, its headpiece swiveling slightly as it pivoted toward the darkened corridor ahead.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	279	"[what]"
chapter_8_48884fc0	roboto	F-F-Follow me, sirs. T-T-This way…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	281	roboto "[what]"
chapter_8_c02662bc		It pivoted forward, its legs gliding smoothly over the damp ground. The corridor stretched out before us—a vast, quiet expanse of reinforced tunnels lined with cold stone and compacted earth. The air was thick with the scent of damp earth and soil.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	288	"[what]"
chapter_8_61c600d7		As we walked deeper into the tunnel, our footsteps echoed softly against the stone, swallowed by the dim, cavernous passage.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	289	"[what]"
chapter_8_a428d316		I let my gaze drift across the tunnel's edges, where faint etchings ran like veins along the surface—symbols and patterns I didn't recognize— worn, weathered, nearly erased by time, yet still clinging stubbornly to the walls surface.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	290	"[what]"
chapter_8_26c830ad		I narrowed my eyes, reaching out to brush my fingertips against one of the engravings. The texture was uneven, the grooves shallow but deliberate.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	291	"[what]"
chapter_8_93198d81	dorian	So, Roboto, do you have any background of how these tunnels came to be?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	293	dorian "[what]"
chapter_8_a95b823b	roboto	M-Master Yuxuan and his partners d-d-discovered these tunnels b-by accident.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	295	roboto "[what]"
chapter_8_22775850		Niko and Chung-hee exchanged a glance with me. The tunnels were older than Yuxuan?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	297	"[what]"
chapter_8_d830c2f8	roboto	The original creators are… u-u-unknown. However, some data suggest that they predate the c-c-current settlements	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	299	roboto "[what]"
chapter_8_d30a21b7	svante	The creators might predate the current settlements? So that means…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	301	svante "[what]"
chapter_8_582363c9	chung_hee	There is a distinct possibility these tunnels were built long ago, before any of our cities existed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	303	chung_hee "[what]"
chapter_8_c3704a79		I turned my attention back to the etchings. There was something about them, something unsettlingly intricate. The longer I looked, the more I felt a strange sense of familiarity, like I had seen them before in a dream or in the remnants of some old myth.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	305	"[what]"
chapter_8_62fcaeb1		The tunnel stretched endlessly before us, its ancient markings bathed in the cold, sterile glow of the fixed lights embedded in the walls. The artificial brightness clashed against the archaic surroundings, like two worlds trying to coexist.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	306	"[what]"
chapter_8_c0a62b2a	dorian	And where exactly in the tunnel are you taking us?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	308	dorian "[what]"
chapter_8_e57ccafb		Roboto whirred again, tilting its metallic headpiece slightly.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	310	"[what]"
chapter_8_f228cca8	roboto	T-To the end of the tunnels.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	312	roboto "[what]"
chapter_8_0d9d7b1c		It hesitated for the briefest of moments, as if its internal systems were recalibrating its response. Then, it spoke again, its voice more certain this time.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	314	"[what]"
chapter_8_2fd7bc46	roboto	The m-m-massive d-d-door with the Prosperity Dragon illustration… It l-l-lies ahead. At the end of the tunnels.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	316	roboto "[what]"
chapter_8_f735c25a		The group fell into a heavier silence as we continued walking, the weight of Roboto's words settling over us. Each step forward felt like a step into something long buried, something not meant to be disturbed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	318	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_036b7416		Minutes later, the tunnel finally widened, revealing a vast, domed chamber. And there—standing at the farthest point—was the door.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	337	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_4279cd0d		There's no mistaking it. It was the same door in my dream. The Prosperity Dragon stretched across its surface in breathtaking detail. Its body coiling through storm-wracked clouds.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	338	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_42076fba		Then, out of the corner of my eye, I saw movement.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	339	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_640a8b8c		A hooded figure stood at the base of the door, partially concealed in the shadows. My muscles tensed, instinct kicking in. Then, in one fluid motion, the figure lifted their hand and pulled back the hood.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	340	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_57954169		Yuxuan's face emerged from beneath the fabric, illuminated by the dim glow of the chamber.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	341	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_74af8694	yuxuan	You're late, buddy.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	343	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_c229574d		For a moment, none of us moved.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	345	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_cb73ebd4	dorian	Yu… you're here.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	347	dorian "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_2d11ef06	chung_hee	I hope you weren't waiting long.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	348	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_0bdcadc7	svante	We—we thought you were sleeping!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	349	svante "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_54e20a40	niko	Shouldn't you be in bed?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	350	niko "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_3fb4796e		Yuxuan, unbothered as ever, smirked. He shifted his weight onto one foot, crossing his arms.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	352	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_95247ee1	yuxuan	What can I say? The idea of you wandering through my tunnels unsupervised was more terrifying than losing a little sleep.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	354	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_3a86143f		And then—Roboto twitched.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	356	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_245619ec		The bot, which had been standing dutifully beside us, suddenly jolted. A harsh electronic screech cut through the chamber, its optics flickering erratically.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	357	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_c116f1c9	roboto	E-E-E-E-Error. E-E-E-E-Error. P-P-P-Para-d-d-d-d-d—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	359	roboto "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_0975719a		With a sudden, jerky movement, it spun on its wheels and bolted down the corridor, its metallic limbs twitching as if something had taken hold of its systems.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	361	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_24ecaa3d		We all turned, watching as it disappeared into the darkness, its garbled stuttering echoing until it was gone.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	362	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_430dbce5		I glanced back at Yuxuan, half-expecting him to look concerned. But instead— he let out an exaggerated sigh, his smirk never faltering.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	363	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_fd041e7f	yuxuan	Guess even my trashy machines can't handle the grandeur of my genius.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	365	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_dc452619		He waved a hand dismissively, as if Roboto's erratic malfunction was of no concern. Chung-hee furrowed his brow, arms crossed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	367	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_4afc113f	chung_hee	Oh, do they?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	369	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_a5c10816		Yuxuan's grin didn't waver, but his fingers twitched at his side before he threw up his hands in mock surrender.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	371	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_4630b9ce	yuxuan	Of course, Your Majesty! I assure you, everything is perfectly under control.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	373	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_d9fc061c	yuxuan	But enough about my poor, overworked machines. Let's turn our focus to the real star of the show, shall we?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	374	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_30a89ca2		He gestured dramatically toward the massive door, its intricate carvings gleaming under the dim light.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	376	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_5f473b9e	niko	Dorian, is this the same one that you saw on your dream?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	378	niko "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_53665a08		I stepped forward, my gaze tracing the magnificent structure. The closer I got, the more I could see the painstaking detail.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	380	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_c199978e		Its sinuous body in a mesmerizing display of movement, despite being frozen in metal. Every scale was meticulously sculpted, each ridge catching the dim light, making it seem as if the dragon were shifting in place.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	381	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_7f596e8e		Its eyes, inlaid with polished jade, gleamed with an eerie lifelike quality. Though unmoving, they seemed to watch us, reflecting the dim chamber light like distant stars in the void.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	382	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_2cc50507	svante	Incredible… I bet even the most skilled earth channelers would struggle to sculpt something this detailed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	384	svante "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_c968a089		His fingers twitched at his side, as if he were resisting the urge to reach out and confirm that the door was real—that something this perfect hadn't just been imagined into existence.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	386	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_fa1ffd7b	yuxuan	Amazing, right?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	388	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_1e80afaa	chung_hee	A creation worthy of the Tetrad themselves. Not a single detail out of place. This was not simply built—it was bestowed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	389	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_3be8854c		Niko, hands clasped behind his back, studied the metalwork with a careful eye.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	391	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_c0e7006f	niko	Whoever created this was clearly more than just a master craftsman… They were a devout worshiper of the Prosperity Dragon.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	393	niko "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_8ac33b47	niko	I highly doubt that a pagan or a mere artisan would dedicate their waking hours to crafting something this impossibly intricate. This isn't just an offering—it's a declaration.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	394	niko "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_415d90c9		He let his fingers trail over the carved ridges of the dragon's body, his tone growing contemplative.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	396	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_7d02c68f	niko	This level of precision… the sheer reverence in the way each scale, each line, each curve has been etched—it's not just talent. It's faith.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	398	niko "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_ab3fb03c		The chamber was silent, save for the quiet hum of flickering lights and the faint, distant sound of shifting metal in the tunnels beyond.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	400	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_34c9f889		Then, Svante hesitated before speaking, glancing at Chung-hee with curiosity.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	401	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_dc63090d	svante	You worship the Tetrad, right, Your Maj— I mean, Sir Chung? Do you have sculptures like this back in Kyeongjang?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	403	svante "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_1ed9e656	chung_hee	As a matter of fact, we do.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	405	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_e48ccb47	chung_hee	In the Imperial Capital, we have towering sculptures of each of the four Immortal Tetrads.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	406	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_59bd63cb	chung_hee	Adriana, the Immortal Tetrad of Emotion and Kindness, standing at the gates of the Celestial Palace of the Emperor Lord. A reminder for the Emperor Lord's responsibility to rule with kindness and mercy.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	407	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_be0f8ecd	chung_hee	Meanwhile, in the great halls of justice, a solemn statue of Renji, the Immortal Tetrad of Justice and the Void.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	408	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_a126bed1	chung_hee	The Grand Library of Kyeongjang houses a magnificent sculpture of Li Mengtia, the Immortal Tetrad of Knowledge and Wisdom. Visitors see his face each time they seek guidance in the pursuit of knowledge.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	409	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_458302bb	chung_hee	And in the heart of the imperial gardens, the most revered of them all—Saelara, the Immortal Tetrad of Creation, is immortalized in marble. Her outstretched hands hold an intricate celestial map, a reminder that creation itself is a gift to be cherished and honored.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	410	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_40e6e09c	chung_hee	These sculptures were all commissioned by my great great great grandfather, one of the late Emperors of Kyeongjang. He believed the Tetrad's presence should not only be felt but seen, woven into the very foundation of the empire.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	411	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_a1858656	svante	Wow… what I wouldn't give to see them, sir.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	413	svante "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_6a5d1fc8		A quiet chuckle broke through the solemn air.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	415	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_7356f31c	yuxuan	Hahaha! You hit the nail in the head there, Chung-hee. That's a theory I had when I first found this tunnel.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	417	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_b58917cc		His gaze remained locked on the dragon-carved door, a glint of something unreadable in his sharp eyes. He lifted a hand, tracing the air just above the intricate engravings.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	419	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_c8cab2cd	yuxuan	My partners and I stumbled upon these tunnels completely by accident, and since then, I've been studying this door for years. Ever since the Tragedy of Tianho.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	421	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_05bfe7d2		Then, with a smooth motion, he turned to face me and Chung-hee directly, holding out his palm.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	423	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_f1bb2bbb	yuxuan	Now then. The amulets. Hand them over.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	425	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_0d96dcb5		I stiffened. The amulets? My fingers instinctively curled around the cool metal resting in my pocket.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	427	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_8fdef486		Slowly, I withdrew it—the amulet I had found on Elias when I first found him. Its surface gleamed under the dim tunnel light, an intricate pattern of old symbols carved into the metal.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	428	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_2da69fd1	dorian	I have it, Yu. But why?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	430	dorian "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_7f6c1ce3		He motioned toward the door, his fingers ghosting over the carvings of the Prosperity Dragon once more.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	432	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_e89debb8	yuxuan	This door is sealed. My theory is that it has been for far longer than any of us have walked this land.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	434	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_8cdb352b		He glanced at me and Chung-hee, his expression unreadable.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	436	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_3d9c419e	yuxuan	Something is inside this. Something ancient.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	438	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_a71d37a1	yuxuan	It won't open for just anyone. You can't break through it with brute force. We already tried.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	439	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_99ee3716		Chung-hee crossed his arms, his tone cautious.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	441	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_0975bfc6	chung_hee	Then have you discovered what does open it?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	443	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_620e2943		Yuxuan smiled faintly, as if pleased by the question.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	445	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_5b4a923c	yuxuan	Draconic fire. Only a channeler of draconic fire is strong enough to awaken the engravings can unlock the seal. That, and… the two amulets.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	447	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_a5b3c16f	svante	D-Draconic fire? Are you sure, Master Yuxuan? You mean Sir Dorian…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	449	svante "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_93c63b42		I exchanged a glance with Chung-hee, my grip tightening around the amulet.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	451	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_cec34d1c	chung_hee	And you're certain about this?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	453	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_9f4d6627	yuxuan	I wouldn't ask if I weren't.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	455	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_b1c62154		Yuxuan huffed a quiet laugh, tilting his head slightly. Still, neither of us moved to hand them over.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	457	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_ad781ed0		Yuxuan, sensing our hesitation, took a step closer, his voice dipping into something softer—something personal.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	458	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_9283979e	yuxuan	Dorian. You found that amulet on Elias, didn't you? That poor little child. That amulet was given to him by his mother—Queen Ekaterina. You were there when he lost everything. At that cave.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	460	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_829d29d8		The mention of it made my jaw tighten. Snow. Darkness. The relentless howling wind. The way Elias had clung to that amulet like it was his last tether to the world.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	462	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_ca32fed8	dorian	What are you getting at, Yu?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	464	dorian "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_b66aa1d6		Yuxuan exhaled, shaking his head slightly, as if he couldn't believe I had to ask.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	466	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_ad87e1fa	yuxuan	I'm saying… who helped you and little Elias when you were trapped in Frostcradle during the blizzard? When the cold was closing in and there was no way out?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	468	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_6d452906		He took a step closer, tilting his head.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	470	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_b3634409	yuxuan	It was me, wasn't it?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	472	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_80a98bb1		My grip on the amulet tightened.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	474	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_baacd323	yuxuan	You and Elias would've starved to death in that cave if I hadn't gotten you both out.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	476	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_b5070827	dorian	Yes. I do, Yu. Always.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	478	dorian "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_e23200da		I smiled at Yuxuan and gave him the amulet.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	480	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_c5451aa9	yuxuan	Thank you for your trust, Dorian.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	482	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_dfb223b3		He winked at me, a mischievous smile on his lips.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	484	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_a6fbd80b		The familiar voice, vast as the sky and deep as the roots of the earth, roared in my head.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	486	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_9604e688		A blinding white light swallowed my vision.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	487	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_1309656a	prosperity_dragon	YOU HAVE BEEN DECEIVED, CHILD!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	489	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_5b922f3f		A sharp pain lanced through my skull. My breath caught.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	491	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_6e9e2e1e	dorian	ARGH! What do you mean?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	493	dorian "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_6fbb0a7a		The voice thundered again, rattling through my bones.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	495	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_c37c6f7c	prosperity_dragon	GET BACK THE AMULET, CHILD! OBEY!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	497	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_ec1f67ff		And then—silence. The light vanished.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	499	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_bb04777f		I staggered, the room spinning as reality snapped back into place.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	500	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_09767409		My heart pounded against my ribs like a war drum.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	501	"[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_a45ea135	niko	Dorian, are you alright?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	503	niko "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_1dc13fc4	dorian	I-I'm fine…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	505	dorian "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_cd52dd72	yuxuan	And what about you, Your Majesty?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	507	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_a4f424ce	yuxuan	You left Kyeongjang with a purpose, didn't you? And when you return home, Your Majesty, what will you say? What will your aunt think?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	508	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_door_chamber_1ce0bab4	yuxuan	That you came all this way, held the key to something far greater, and did nothing.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	509	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_impostor_4dab7bcb		The shift in Chung-hee was immediate. His entire demeanor darkened, his jaw tightening as his hands curled into fists at his sides.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	523	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_60013d69	chung_hee	Where did you get that?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	525	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_impostor_c7bd9f3c	yuxuan	Pardon, Your Majesty?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	527	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_impostor_d3f25280	chung_hee	Where did you find out about my aunt?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	529	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_impostor_caed25e9	chung_hee	I never told any of you about her. I never spoke of my family—any of them.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	530	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_impostor_8948fa84		Silence hung between us, heavy and suffocating. My mind raced. Chung-hee had never once mentioned an aunt. All we knew was that his parents had perished in the Tragedy.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	532	"[what]"
