ch8_impostor_01a00c72		Chung-hee exhaled slowly, closing his eyes for a fleeting moment before opening them again—sharper, burning with quiet fury. His fingers twitched at his sides, lightning crackling faintly along his knuckles.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	543	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_be0a2da3	chung_hee	…I apologize for this.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	545	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_impostor_da185c60		It was the only warning we got.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	547	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_b3f5d43c		Before anyone could react, a surge of raw energy erupted from his fingertips. A bolt of lightning, blinding and furious, shot straight toward Yuxuan.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	552	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_0b8a6a2b	svante	SIR—!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	554	svante "[what]"
ch8_impostor_0045e44f		The crackling energy illuminated the chamber in a violent flash.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	556	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_00c8337c		The electricity struck Yuxuan dead-on, his body convulsing violently as arcs of energy danced across his frame. The smell of singed fabric filled the air, and for a single, agonizing moment, all I could hear was the crackling of lightning fading into silence.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	557	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_379c7ba7	dorian	YU!! NO!!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	559	dorian "[what]"
ch8_impostor_5283e65c		Panic surged through me as I rushed forward, heart pounding in my chest. The others weren't far behind, though they weren't running to help—no, they were turning on Chung-hee.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	561	"[what]"
