ch8_impostor_79edcf80		My stomach twisted. Yuxuan had been a yaoguai this whole time?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	578	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_bab2c907	niko	Enoch above… What is going on here?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	580	niko "[what]"
