ch8_impostor_776524ac		Then Roboto turned to the yaoguai's still form, its glowing optics flickering as it processed the situation. It tilted its head slightly, then spoke with a tone of programmed enthusiasm.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	636	"[what]"
