ch8_impostor_fe8be1d1	yuxuan	Buddy, you think I've done this before? I told you, I've spent years studying this door, not opening it.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	695	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_impostor_b92ebef5		I groaned, rolling my shoulders.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	697	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_0d434876	dorian	Great. So what now?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	699	dorian "[what]"
ch8_impostor_bafd46ea	svante	Maybe we can just… you know, guess. How hard could it be? It's just a pose right?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	701	svante "[what]"
ch8_impostor_b8c06b8a	chung_hee	I hardly think dramatic poses are necessary. We possess the amulets—surely that alone should be enough. Must we resort to theatrics?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	703	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_impostor_2da32807	niko	Think about it. Posture holds great significance in religious ceremonies, does it not? If this door is bound to something ancient—something sacred—then the way we present ourselves may matter more than we think.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	705	niko "[what]"
ch8_impostor_6fd47436	chung_hee	I… highly doubt that.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	707	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_impostor_46f42e98		Niko took a step forward, holding out his hands with the amulets, palms facing upward, as if offering them to an unseen deity.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	709	"[what]"
ch8_impostor_fd5f592b	niko	Like this. This is how priests kneel before an altar, or how supplicants raise their hands in prayer. If this is a ritual, then our stance should reflect reverence—humility befitting an item of such significance.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	711	niko "[what]"
ch8_impostor_37decf3b	niko	Humility. Reflection. Devotion.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	712	niko "[what]"
ch8_impostor_2345cbae	chung_hee	Isn't that a little excessive?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	714	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_impostor_541056aa	dorian	Chung's right, Niko. Any other ideas?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	716	dorian "[what]"
ch8_impostor_867f6937	svante	Or—and hear me out—you point them at the door like twin weapons. Like—'BEHOLD MY POWER!'—and then blast the fire!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	718	svante "[what]"
