ch8_impostor_abede4df	yuxuan	It's an audio drama I listen to every morning! The protagonist stands before the sacred gate, arms crossed over his chest, an amulet in each hand, and recites a sacred vow before unleashing his divine energy.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	732	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_impostor_6a146e94	svante	You're into audio dramas too, sir Yuxuan?! My mom used to star in one! It's called—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	734	svante "[what]"
ch8_impostor_5bbf1514		Chung-hee let out a long, suffering sigh, pinching the bridge of his nose as if physically pained by the discussion.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	736	"[what]"
