ch8_open_door_5e20c955		He went into full detail. I didn't understand anything.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	825	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_261991e4	svante	Sir Yuxuan! That's correct!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	827	svante "[what]"
ch8_open_door_aed5a65b	niko	...Do you actually listen to these programs or do they just manifest in your mind?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	829	niko "[what]"
ch8_open_door_6dc8c2be		Fine. I took a deep breath. struck a dramatic stance, raising my arms high. I made sure to follow what he said.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	831	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_87685d69	dorian	BY THE WILL OF THE ANCIENT FLAME, I STAND AT THE PRECIPICE OF DESTINY! … Like that?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	833	dorian "[what]"
ch8_open_door_3bdf38bb	yuxuan	I love it! The INTENSITY! The EMOTION! Oh, the drama! It's perfect!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	835	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_open_door_464c5d82	svante	Beautiful. Absolutely beautiful, sir Dorian. I felt moved! Bravo! Bravo!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	837	svante "[what]"
ch8_open_door_fd9963d2	chung_hee	…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	839	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_open_door_7b0694ec	niko	…Merciful Enoch, please grant me patience for I'm running out of it.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	841	niko "[what]"
ch8_open_door_0221826e		I exhaled slowly, pressing my fingers against my temple before turning to Chung-hee.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	850	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_450714fe		For once, I'm going to listen to the most reasonable person in the room.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	851	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_4bd9611f	dorian	Chung, what was your idea?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	853	dorian "[what]"
ch8_open_door_7e5ff838		Chung-hee regarded me with a measured gaze, his expression calm and unwavering.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	855	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_0824a261	chung_hee	The amulets are keys—therefore, they must be used as such. Align them with the engravings and let the door recognize its rightful seal.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	857	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_open_door_aa21ab41	niko	Sometimes the simple answer is the right one.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	859	niko "[what]"
ch8_open_door_8795e406	svante	I suppose it does make the most sense… probably.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	861	svante "[what]"
ch8_open_door_2c87cd31	yuxuan	No battle cry? No flair? That's sad.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	863	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_open_door_0473bb85		I sighed, stepping forward until I was close enough to the door to see the fine details of its carvings.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	865	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_7c9ffcb5		Taking a breath, I pressed both amulets against the engravings, aligning them with the shapes etched into the stone.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	866	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_a09abb08		A deep, resonant click echoed through the chamber.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	867	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_00be5f7b	svante	Oh! Did you hear that, Your sir Chung? It might have worked!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	871	svante "[what]"
ch8_open_door_e8b87012	chung_hee	Svante, I remind you—such sounds do not reach me for I am not of hearing. Please tell me what the sound was.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	873	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_open_door_eacbbfcb	svante	Right. Of course. My apologies, sir Chung.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	875	svante "[what]"
ch8_open_door_e6cc8ead	niko	It was a click, Chung. Like the unlocking of a mechanism or something.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	877	niko "[what]"
ch8_open_door_common_ec19ff19		The air around me thickened, charged with something unseen. The amulets pulsed against my skin, and a warmth coiled in my core—draconic fire.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	885	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_common_e88cc77f		I held firm. I did not break my stance.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	886	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_common_1b6d6240		Then, with a low, grinding groan, the door began to shift. Dust and debris rained down as the massive stone slab trembled and heaved. The very ground beneath us shuddered, and the deep, echoing sound of stone scraping against stone filled the air.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	887	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_common_4e006eca		A gust of air rushed out from the darkness beyond, stale and putrid. It carried the suffocating weight of decay, dampness, and something acrid—like burnt metal and old, rotting blood.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	888	"[what]"
ch8_open_door_common_c8856e83		The door fully parted, revealing a cavernous space beyond.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	889	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_dedd1566		The space beyond was vast, stretching beyond the reach of our light. The ceiling vanished into darkness, unseen, while a sheer, bottomless chasm yawned around the perimeter. The only solid footing was a narrow stone bridge, a precarious path leading to a massive circular platform at the center of the abyss.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	908	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_9fdce080		I turned to Yuxuan, my voice laced with disbelief.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	910	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_61247073	dorian	Yu, do you mean to tell me you studied this door for years and never once suspected what was inside of it?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	912	dorian "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_daf96f80		Yuxuan held up both hands in defense, his eyes wide.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	914	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_7f039e63	yuxuan	I swear to you, I had no idea! We tried everything—earth channeling, brute force—but we could never break the seal. We assumed it was an empty chamber, or that it had collapsed long ago!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	916	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_880e1025		With caution, we stepped forward, each footfall echoing across the vast emptiness.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	918	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_a470bc5b	niko	Careful, everyone.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	920	niko "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_044ec39a	chung_hee	Watch your footing. The bridge is old.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	922	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_4906f228		The bridge rocked.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	924	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_425e7eb8	svante	How deep is the pit?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	926	svante "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_b4ae9f48	yuxuan	Prosperity Dragon bless me! That is one deep pit!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	928	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_5a44dbe3		On the central platform, the remnants of something long-forgotten lay strewn about.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	930	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_1c0430e8		Broken tables, their once-sturdy legs snapped and rotting, were overturned in disarray. Glass apparatus, cracked and shattered, glinted faintly under the dim glow of embedded crystals pulsing weakly along the cavern walls.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	931	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_a2ed54d1		Strange tools lay abandoned—rusted clamps, peculiar metal rods, and parchment so aged that it disintegrated at the slightest touch.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	932	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_f7989cb4		There were corpses littered in the central area. Niko crouched near one of the fallen figures, eyes narrowing as he examined the remains.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	933	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_f168919a	niko	Odd. The decomposition suggests varying timelines. Some of these bodies have been here for centuries, reduced to skeletal remains. Others… are far more recent. Mummified, desiccated, yet eerily preserved by the cold, dry air.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	935	niko "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_6312d174	niko	It reminds me of the time I went to a remote village in the Hinami kingdom. The way corpses were left untouched after the famine, preserved not by time's mercy but by sheer desolation.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	936	niko "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_1226b6ee		Svante swallowed hard, his face paling.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	938	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_581492ba	svante	I-I think I'm going to be sick… *barfs*	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	940	svante "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_2f320188	yuxuan	C-Can I go back? Oh Prosperity Dragon… *barfs* *barfs*	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	942	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_acb870d3	dorian	Calm down, Yu.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	944	dorian "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_e09aa51d		Chung-hee wrinkled his nose in distaste, his voice as poised as ever despite the ghastly scene before us.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	946	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_73e98bea	chung_hee	This stench is vile. A cloying, putrescent rot. Something terrible had happened here. And whatever it was… it had not been swift. Nor had it been merciful.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	948	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_b25649e6		We moved cautiously, our footsteps echoing in the vast, forsaken chamber. Dust and debris covered the floor, mingling with shards of broken glass and rusted metal tools.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	950	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_770f029c	svante	Merciful Enoch…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	952	svante "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_1d72dc0c		We turned toward him and saw what had caught his attention.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	954	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_93b2b638		A corpse lay sprawled across the floor, half-buried under fallen debris. Unlike the other remains, this one was in the process of decomposition. Its flesh had darkened and sagged, splitting in places where decay had eaten away at the muscle. The stench was nearly unbearable.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	955	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_c82583ee		Chung-hee stepped forward, his sharp gaze scanning the corpse with unnerving precision. His expression remained unreadable, but there was something distant in his eyes.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	957	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_3125269b	chung_hee	That uniform… It is standard Kyeongjang military wear.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	959	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_597e8487	dorian	A Kyeongjang soldier? Here?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	961	dorian "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_d38cd4f1		Chung-hee's eyes traced the insignia still faintly visible beneath layers of dust and decay. His lips pressed into a firm line.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	963	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_cf0004f8	chung_hee	No doubt about it. This is not just any soldier—this insignia belongs to the royal guard.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	965	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_e2590e16	yuxuan	The royal guard… You mean… they served the Emperor?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	967	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_86aa505c	chung_hee	Yes. My father's soldiers.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	969	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_f6e3bd8b	niko	Judging by the decomposition, he's been here for at least four to five years. The cold air likely slowed the process, keeping him more preserved than he otherwise would be.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	971	niko "[what]"
ch8_inside_door_be9f66fb		I saw something flicker in Chung-hee's expression—something almost unreadable. Disbelief? Concern?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	973	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_93693f77		His gaze fell to the corpse's hands, which were stiff with rigor mortis. One was curled tightly around something.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	974	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_b028486f		Carefully, I stepped closer, mindful not to disturb the fragile remains. My eyes narrowed as I caught a group of glimmering parchment, aged and brittle, yet miraculously intact, clutched between the soldier's fingers.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	975	"[what]"
ch8_inside_door_a73d54d3	svante	A letter. Should we read it?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	977	svante "[what]"
ch8_corpse_b6ecc44e		I reached out carefully, peeling the parchments from the cadaver's grip. As I did, the stiffened arm shifted slightly, causing the torso to slump. The movement dislodged something from beneath the folds of decayed fabric.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	996	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_2e1547ab		The parchments were not neatly stacked. They were haphazardly pressed together, their edges frayed and uneven. Some pieces were torn, others stained with something dark and long-dried.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	997	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_0144666a		Ink had faded, but the words remained—scrawled in uneven strokes, as if written with trembling hands.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	998	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_7c70a5a1		A testament.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	999	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_6a5fb8ac	svante	W-What does it say, sir?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1001	svante "[what]"
ch8_corpse_55d7b332		I took a steady breath. The moment my fingers brushed the parchment, a pulse of light flickered across its surface. The letters glowed. A low hum filled the air, like a whisper too faint to grasp—until it wasn't.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1003	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_9333240a		The words did not stay confined to the pages.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1004	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_13ade49b	hwan_sik	Baek Hwan-sik, Kyeongjang Protector of Emperor Lord Hyon Min-joon	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1008	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_b519a016		They echoed in our minds.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1010	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_bdd7d731	niko	Are all of you hearing this?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1012	niko "[what]"
ch8_corpse_ed02d1f4		A voice—hoarse, weak, filled with exhaustion and regret.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1014	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_305e4d1c	chung_hee	A mind note. Whoever wrote this… they channeled their very thoughts onto the parchment.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1016	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_corpse_e830540f		Day 1	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1021	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_fa0d988e	hwan_sik	I failed him. I failed my sworn duty. His Majesty, the Emperor Lord. Pyeha and pyeha-sshi was killed… Murdered in cold blood.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1022	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_416bb45c	hwan_sik	Pyeha and pyeha-sshi's body was dragged out by the aldoriths… Bastards that they are…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1023	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_51eaa940	hwan_sik	I do not know if anyone will ever read this, but I must write. If only to keep my mind from slipping. If only to leave something behind when my body joins the others.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1024	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_4f403d28	hwan_sik	We came here for knowledge. That was what they told us. His Majesty was led by the rulers and scholars deep into this place. I was ordered to protect him, but I—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1025	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_a0c6ddde	hwan_sik	I was struck down before I could even raise my blade. Now I am alone.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1026	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_a2438d7a	hwan_sik	The door is sealed. I have pounded on it until my fists bled. No one is coming.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1027	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_4b5d5510	hwan_sik	The pain is dulling, which should bring me relief, but it does not. The skin is turning dark. Swollen. I do not think I will last long.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1028	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_246c2cd3		Day 3	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1030	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_ac143ca9	hwan_sik	I found something. A button —hidden beneath dust and debris.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1031	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_3d781a63	hwan_sik	It took a while for me to solve the puzzle, but I managed to follow her footsteps. I think I unlocked something.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1032	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_376031f0	hwan_sik	But my hand trembles as I write. The infection is spreading. The veins in my arm are blackened. It hurts to breathe. I hope it gets better tomorrow.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1033	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_e842c6e2		Day 5	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1035	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_0ee000b1	hwan_sik	My arm… the skin is splitting. Fever grips me like a vice. I tried to burn the infection out, but I could not hold the knife steady.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1036	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_14ba2175	hwan_sik	I keep hearing things. Scraping in the dark. Breathing. But I know I am alone.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1037	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_196f7618	hwan_sik	Aren't I?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1038	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_a38e2739		Day 8	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1040	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_3fd444ee	hwan_sik	The rations are gone. I can barely stand. My stomach feels like a hollow pit. My body is light—too light.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1041	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_b86d7069	hwan_sik	The dead are everywhere, but some of them… they should not be this well preserved.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1042	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_10a7113b	hwan_sik	Some of them have been here for decades. Maybe centuries. And yet, they have not rotted.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1043	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_5a2155ba	hwan_sik	I found records. They were studying the dead. What were they trying to do?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1044	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_a715e908	hwan_sik	Why did they bring rulers, scholars—the Emperor Lord, pyeha, himself—into this cursed place?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1045	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_ac6f8356		Day 13:	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1047	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_b63d61e7	hwan_sik	I tried everything. Every switch. Every carving. Every prayer I can still remember.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1048	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_9e9f93f8	hwan_sik	I do not have the power to free him. But I know someone is inside that stupid ice. By Xianlun, I do not have the power to free myself.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1049	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_7cfa6060	hwan_sik	My breath is shallow, my vision fading. The infection has reached my chest. I will not last much longer.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1050	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_855669d5	hwan_sik	I found a container of syringes. A potent sleeping agent. A quiet way to go. There are two. I only need one.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1051	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_07d80de4	hwan_sik	But if anyone finds this… if you are reading, hearing these words— Know that Kyeongjang did not fall to cowards.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1052	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_75c80164	hwan_sik	Xianlun, I draw near… Seok-jin, I love you. I'm sorry I couldn't fulfill my promise…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1053	hwan_sik "[what]"
ch8_corpse_4c7c94b1		The final lines trailed off, ink smudged and uneven. The last stroke faltered, as if his strength had failed him in his final moments.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1055	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_f49d4a55		I exhaled slowly, feeling the weight of the words settle deep in my chest. My fingers tightened around the parchments, the paper crackling slightly in my grip.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1057	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_562225a7	yuxuan	By the Prosperity Dragon…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1059	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_corpse_e3541b0c	dorian	He knew he wasn't going to make it.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1061	dorian "[what]"
ch8_corpse_27ba8ec9	svante	He… He wanted to be remembered.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1063	svante "[what]"
ch8_corpse_e60583a8		Chung-hee clasped his hands together, as if in prayer.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1065	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_921c93bd	chung_hee	And so he shall be. Soldier Baek Hwan-sik, Protector of the Emperor Lord…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1067	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_corpse_911416c2	chung_hee	Your Emperor Lord thanks you. May Xianlun's gates open wide for you, and may you walk among the honored dead of Kyeongjang.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1068	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_corpse_13363970	niko	But why? Why bring the Emperor of Kyeongjang here? What purpose could this place have served?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1070	niko "[what]"
ch8_corpse_cedbd749	chung_hee	We will uncover the truth. And we will not leave this place until we do.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1072	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_corpse_56ab91bf		I hesitated. Something about that parchment felt wrong. The sight of the soldier's decaying hand, locked in an eternal grip, sent a chill through me.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1080	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_1b25f4c7	dorian	I don't want to touch that.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1082	dorian "[what]"
ch8_corpse_1decd94b		Chung-hee exhaled slowly, his gaze flicking to me before returning to the corpse.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1084	"[what]"
ch8_corpse_a19d14e3	chung_hee	Then I shall take it.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1086	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_corpse_9203caed	chung_hee	This man once swore fealty to the Imperial House of Kyeongjang. Even in death, he remains my subject. It is my obligation to bear witness to his final message.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1087	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_corpse_bc632b1c		With a careful hand, he pried the brittle parchment from the soldier's grasp. As he did, the stiffened arm shifted slightly, the dried sinew cracking under the pressure.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1089	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_6504f70c		A small object clattered against the stone floor, the faint sound echoing in the silence. Instinctively, I reached down and picked it up, brushing away the dust.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1106	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_fac000a6	yuxuan	What's that?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1108	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_64882f85		At first glance, it appeared to be just a button—small, round, unassuming. But as the dim light of the cavern illuminated its surface, I realized it was anything but ordinary.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1110	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_4ebd620c		The button was exquisitely crafted, its golden frame polished to a mirror sheen despite the years of dust and decay surrounding it. Ornate filigree swirled around its edges, delicate patterns curling like vines embracing the central design.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1111	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_c9e1df80		Embedded within the metal was a miniature portrait, impossibly detailed. Even in the flickering glow, I could make out the fine brushstrokes—an artist's delicate hand immortalizing a man's face. But a crack marred the surface, obscuring his features.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1112	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_1d1714df	svante	That's a beautiful button… It's so well made. Just like the door earlier.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1114	svante "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_97a9442b		Yuxuan leaned in, frowning.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1116	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_5407998e	yuxuan	Even for someone like me—who appreciates a fair bit of extravagance—this seems excessive. No one puts this much care into a simple button.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1118	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_4590b1b8	svante	Or… maybe it's more than that! Maybe it's a piece of something greater.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1120	svante "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_8effaeb7	svante	Too bad we can't see his face, though.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1121	svante "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_c4861bb4	niko	Let's press it and see what happens.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1123	niko "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_b3d7cd76		I hesitated for only a breath, then pressed the button.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1125	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_2124a34b		A whisper curled through the air, a voice neither harsh nor gentle—something ancient, something knowing. It slithered around my mind like a serpent, threading through my thoughts with a tone both amused and expectant.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1129	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_698893cb	spirit	If you seek the truth, lay your hand upon the echoes of devotion.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1131	spirit "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_8651a510		Before me, six paintings shimmered into existence, suspended in the darkness like windows to another time. Each one pulsed with an eerie, otherworldly glow—soft but insistent, waiting. Expecting.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1133	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_85c0d2d6	spirit	Touch them all, and only then shall my greatest treasure be revealed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1135	spirit "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_55f37639		A heavy silence settled over us.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1137	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_78902f12	svante	T-Touch them? Are you sure? All the paintings look beautiful!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1139	svante "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_8cb1ef30		His voice cracked slightly, gaze darting between the glowing paintings and me.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1141	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_ccb803fe	yuxuan	Oh my! These are all exquisite! Can't we all just take them? I'm sure they'd be a wonderful addition to my collection and—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1143	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_4e94b022	dorian	I don't think that's a good idea, Yu.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1145	dorian "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_198a4a24	niko	It would be foolish to rush in blindly. We have no idea what these represent—or what consequences touching them might bring.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1147	niko "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_99a2fbde	dorian	It's obviously a trial of some sort. If they wanted us to just tap all six and be done with it, they wouldn't have gone through the trouble of making them appear like this.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1149	dorian "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_43497672	chung_hee	Agreed. We must proceed with caution. Each one of these may hold a key to understanding what lies ahead.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1151	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_c899c56b		I stepped closer, studying the nearest painting. The light within it flickered, almost as if it were breathing.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1153	"[what]"
ch8_letter_common_73f58541	dorian	We should examine them first—one by one. There's no telling what will happen if we touch them all at once.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1155	dorian "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_0be59483	svante	R-Right. No reckless touching.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1157	svante "[what]"
ch8_letter_common_6b957d90		I turned my attention to the first painting.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1159	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_6aaf65b9		PUZZLE	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1180	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_937c8844		The Loom's Whisper:	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1181	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_3f30ca5b		A celestial void, vast and endless, swirls with cosmic threads of silver and gold. Radiant hands sculpt the form of a woman, her body emerging from celestial mist.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1183	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_5ab8bf43		Her body is half-formed, her eyes closed in peaceful slumber, as if she has yet to awaken to the world.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1184	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_6de451c1	yuxuan	The title of this painting is… The Loom's Whisper…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1186	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_paintings_d267b4cb	niko	Remarkable. The art style is exquisite.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1187	niko "[what]"
ch8_paintings_e3a216fc	svante	It's kind of eerie, isn't it?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1188	svante "[what]"
ch8_paintings_e0126725	chung_hee	Sculpted not just by hands, but by will. By fate. By the Weaver.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1189	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_paintings_771afd20		Chains of Choice:	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1195	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_51fd2ab2		A radiant figure of a woman steps down from a celestial throne, reaching for the hand of a man bathed in soft candlelight.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1197	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_ff9be895		Their fingers intertwine, golden chains barely visible around the divine's wrists, as if binding them to something they are trying to leave behind.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1198	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_7309cddd		In the background, unseen figures watch in silence, their expressions unreadable.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1199	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_d87ae8a4	niko	Galean symbology. Golden chains mean devotion. A vow. A promise you can't break. You were a citizen of Gale, Dorian. Is that true?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1201	niko "[what]"
ch8_paintings_1b18ed6b	dorian	Yes. Elara and I were bound in golden chains when we were wed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1203	dorian "[what]"
ch8_paintings_50702168	niko	I see. I apologize for bringing that up.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1205	niko "[what]"
ch8_paintings_c855ef0e	dorian	No need. The wedding was a fond memory… save for the catering. Elara said it was a disaster.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1207	dorian "[what]"
ch8_paintings_955dc7fc		Thrones of the Eternal:	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1213	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_212d1300		Four celestial beings sit upon towering thrones, their forms bathed in an ethereal glow. Time itself seems frozen in reverence, their robes shifting like flowing water despite the stillness. Above them, a golden sun watches, its unblinking gaze heavy with judgment.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1215	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_1f45c16b		One throne, covered in flowers, bore the sweet smile of the radiant woman.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1216	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_bf3339b7	yuxuan	Hmm… her throne is different. Softer. As if she ruled with something the others did not.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1218	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_paintings_01dab602	niko	Flowers and smiles don't rule eternity. They decay. Enoch's throne is carved from obsidian and silence. Cold, clear. Eternal like death itself. That's power.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1219	niko "[what]"
ch8_paintings_65308d78	yuxuan	"tHat's pOwEr"… Hmph!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1220	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_paintings_beb0bc91	niko	Are you a child?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1221	niko "[what]"
ch8_paintings_f646ee11		Wrath:	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1227	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_05e284c1		A radiant figure of a woman sits upon a burning throne, fingers digging into the armrests as fire consumes the sky behind them. Her eyes burn with unrelenting fury, golden banners slashed and torn at their feet.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1229	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_ffcfc9c1		The last remnants of kindness stain her cheek—a single tear, gleaming in the firelight.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1230	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_934fadb5	chung_hee	Wrath. Pure and simple wrath.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1232	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_paintings_e9011eb0	yuxuan	The deadliest emotion.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1233	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_paintings_36ce6dba		Tragedy:	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1239	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_75d568f8		A winged man looms over a battlefield, clutching the severed head of a fallen man. A radiant figure of a woman kneels in the distance, hands trembling, golden tears slipping down their cheeks. The heavens above are split open with storm clouds, the divine light struggling against the encroaching darkness.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1241	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_93b2d446	svante	Oh no… That's heartbreaking.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1243	svante "[what]"
ch8_paintings_9a230339	niko	Lord Enoch…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1244	niko "[what]"
ch8_paintings_668c69d5	dorian	What?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1245	dorian "[what]"
ch8_paintings_d0200c11	niko	That's him. Lord Enoch. The wings. The markings. The way he holds the severed head like a trophy.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1246	niko "[what]"
ch8_paintings_1d22655b	niko	Why is he here? Why does he appear in these paintings?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1247	niko "[what]"
ch8_paintings_3d44c1d5		When the Stars Watched:	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1253	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_993fe002		A bard plays his lute beneath a sky dusted with stars, unaware of the radiant figure of a woman watching him from the garden's edge.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1255	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_83e53cc4		Their eyes meet across a reflecting pool, the rippling water caught between two fates. The air hums with something unspoken—something fragile, dangerous, and inevitable.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1256	"[what]"
ch8_paintings_db8a307c	svante	Ahh, a romance! This is the moment where everything changes, isn't it?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1258	svante "[what]"
ch8_paintings_b276cb58	yuxuan	*sighs* He must have been very beautiful…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1259	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_paintings_b3fe7896	chung_hee	Stars do not interfere with the lives of men. They only watch.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1260	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_paintings_cbfdd1fa	spirit	Do you want to go through the paintings one more time?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1264	spirit "[what]"
ch8_paintings_f1b1e83b	spirit	Very well. Then you may look again. Pay close attention…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1269	spirit "[what]"
ch8_paintings_57d2e981	chung_hee	Let us examine each painting thoroughly, Dorian. Every detail might matter.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1270	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_paintings_63935c5a	spirit	Good. Then let us proceed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1274	spirit "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_4037bf95	spirit	You will touch each fragment with your own hands.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1288	spirit "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_cac0a13a		I swallowed and looked at my companions, their expressions reflecting the same uncertainty I felt. The paintings loomed before us, waiting.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1290	"[what]"
ch8_painting_order_b72559f4	dorian	So… which one do we touch first?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1292	dorian "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_3abeed11		The moment our hands made contact with the final painting, a tremor coursed through the chamber. The air turned thick—almost suffocating—as the spirit's presence swelled, then cracked like fragile glass.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1299	"[what]"
ch8_painting_order_7e9d2af3		A mournful sigh echoed from the unseen depths, the sorrow in it raw and unbearable.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1300	"[what]"
ch8_painting_order_8e9b3b6e	spirit	No… That is not how it was… That is not how it should be…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1302	spirit "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_296860b1	yuxuan	What?! We were wrong?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1304	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_44cb304b	spirit	I wanted you to see… to understand… but you do not see.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1306	spirit "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_ffef239f	svante	Unfortunate… Maybe we can try again, sir Dorian.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1308	svante "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_ab160f3b	niko	Perhaps the paintings show a story. Let's be sure to pay attention.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1310	niko "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_cade00eb		As the final painting was touched, the chamber came alive. A golden glow spread from the images, weaving threads of light through the air like strands of fate itself. The very walls pulsed, as if breathing in unison with something ancient.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1317	"[what]"
ch8_painting_order_3e17e62d	spirit	Yes… yes, you see it now.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1319	spirit "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_c7204d84		A warmth blossomed in my chest. The paintings shimmered, their colors deepening, details sharpening as if the story they told had never been clearer. The air hummed with power, heavy yet comforting.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1321	"[what]"
ch8_painting_order_d636ba69	spirit	And so… Here is my greatest treasure.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1323	spirit "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_97cc0ceb	chung_hee	Finally. Great job, Dorian.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1325	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_3abeed11_1		The moment our hands made contact with the final painting, a tremor coursed through the chamber. The air turned thick—almost suffocating—as the spirit's presence swelled, then cracked like fragile glass.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1331	"[what]"
