ch8_painting_order_3abeed11_2		The moment our hands made contact with the final painting, a tremor coursed through the chamber. The air turned thick—almost suffocating—as the spirit's presence swelled, then cracked like fragile glass.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1348	"[what]"
ch8_painting_order_7e9d2af3_2		A mournful sigh echoed from the unseen depths, the sorrow in it raw and unbearable.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1349	"[what]"
ch8_painting_order_8e9b3b6e_2	spirit	No… That is not how it was… That is not how it should be…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1351	spirit "[what]"
