ch8_painting_order_44cb304b_2	spirit	I wanted you to see… to understand… but you do not see.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1355	spirit "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_ffef239f_2	svante	Unfortunate… Maybe we can try again, sir Dorian.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1357	svante "[what]"
ch8_painting_order_ab160f3b_2	niko	Perhaps the paintings show a story. Let's be sure to pay attention.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1359	niko "[what]"
ch8_painting_correct_e930eef6		Threads of golden light wove through the air, swirling around us like strands of fate finally aligning. The glow seeped into the very walls, making the entire cavern pulse like a living thing.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1369	"[what]"
ch8_painting_correct_fb1415bd		The temperature dropped in an instant. My breath turned to mist, and an unnatural chill settled in my bones.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1370	"[what]"
ch8_painting_correct_1b44ddf2		Then, from the very center of the platform, the stone cracked apart. A deafening groan filled the chamber as something massive emerged—a monolith of ice, clear as crystal, towering and flawless.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1371	"[what]"
ch8_painting_correct_3b61550c		Inside it—a man. A winged man.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1372	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_8779f9d2		His form was perfectly preserved, encased in shimmering frost. Great, feathered wings curled around his body, their tips barely visible through the ice. His face, serene yet hauntingly familiar, stirred something deep within me.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1391	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_9ef7392e		My heart pounded. It was him. Magnus.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1392	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_5bf255fd		My hands trembled as I reached forward, drawn by something I could not name.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1393	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_652175b3		Then, a voice—soft at first, but urgent—whispered into my mind.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1394	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_69385a08	dorian	Magnus!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1396	dorian "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_a27b0e2b	yuxuan	Wait… Hold on- That's Magnus?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1398	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_652175b3_1		Then, a voice—soft at first, but urgent—whispered into my mind.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1400	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_2155fbd2	magnus	You have found me, Dorian!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1402	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_eb09fed3		I staggered back. The voice wasn't just in my head—it was inside me, resonating through my very soul.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1404	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_27ca9ab3	magnus	Release me, Dorian! Please!!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1406	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_09b84b8d		The plea sent a sharp, aching pang through my chest. This was no illusion. No mere fragment of the past.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1408	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_c2c8f0c5		He was here. He was alive.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1409	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_d2cec751		Svante took a shaky step back, his eyes wide with disbelief.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1411	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_841f9eb8	svante	D-Did we just unearth a person? This is insane!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1413	svante "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_86d4b284	yuxuan	Wait… is that him?! The winged man from the paintings?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1415	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_c8e3e949		Niko stepped forward, closer to the ice. His breath fogged the surface.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1417	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_94517f63	niko	No, Yuxuan. The winged man from the paintings was Enoch.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1419	niko "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_9af0a5f2	niko	Interesting… His body is perfectly intact. No decay, no deterioration. This isn't just preservation—this is suspension. He has not aged a single day since he was sealed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1420	niko "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_d7837f19		The voice called out again, ringing inside my mind.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1422	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_119ad9cb	magnus	Dorian! Release me, please! Only you can release me from this prison I'm in!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1424	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_9c5f69a5	dorian	I can hear him. Inside my mind. He's calling my name, begging me to free him.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1426	dorian "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_b6b74bd7	chung_hee	I hope you know what you're doing, Dorian.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1428	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_decaf3b6		I swallowed hard, my pulse roaring in my ears.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1430	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_a6eae767		I raised my hands, and the chamber trembled in response. Draconic fire ignited in my palms, gold and crimson, burning with an intensity that set the air ablaze. It crackled and roared, a storm of embers swirling around me, hungry, desperate to be unleashed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1431	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_343f3741	dorian	Everyone, get back!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1433	dorian "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_1d455018	niko	Move back! Now! Unless you want to be reduced to ash!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1435	niko "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_d9879d3b		The others obeyed, retreating to the edges of the platform as my flames surged higher. I stepped closer, my heartbeat syncing with the pulsing energy coursing through me. This was not just fire. This was will. This was power.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1437	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_7f5598d5		I thrust my hands forward, and the fire struck the ice.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1438	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_8905eb21		The ice hissed and cracked, steam curling into the air in thick, suffocating waves. The monolith that had imprisoned Magnus for centuries groaned under the heat, fractures spiderwebbing across its surface.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1442	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_35b66c8a	spirit	What… WHAT HAVE YOU DONE?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1444	spirit "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_89e7248a		Then, with a deafening shatter, the ice exploded.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1446	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_9cc56e04		Chunks of frozen crystal shot outward, skidding across the stone floor. A final burst of steam engulfed the chamber, obscuring everything in a thick, suffocating mist.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1447	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_9fefb932		Magnus collapsed forward, landing on his hands and knees, his breath ragged, his body trembling. His wings, massive and drenched in melting frost, unfurled in violent spasms, feathers scattering across the floor. Water pooled beneath him, cascading from his skin like he had been submerged in an abyss.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1448	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_1adfd2ad	magnus	*coughing*	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1450	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_d8b08367	svante	He must be hurt!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1452	svante "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_eb3563c2		Svante lurched forward, but Niko was already moving. He dropped to one knee beside Magnus, his fingers ghosting over the man's soaked skin before pressing against his throat to check his pulse. His brow furrowed, concern tightening his features.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1454	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_ceaeb4fd	niko	Can you hear me? You're breathing too fast—try to slow it down.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1456	niko "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_137d40fc	niko	You must have been trapped for a long time. Hypothermia, dehydration—who knows what else.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1457	niko "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_bf0bec15		His head hung low, silver hair plastered to his face. And then—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1459	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_770c8f40		His eyes snapped open.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1460	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_cf8d5901		They were white. Glowing, searing, burning with unearthly rage.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1461	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_5d877f03		Then—his voice. A sound that carried the weight of a thousand storms.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1462	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_9386ef3f	magnus	YOU KILLED ADRIANA!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1469	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_f58ff9a8	svante	What?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1471	svante "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_255d1fff	niko	?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1472	niko "[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_76727cd1		His words struck like a hammer, reverberating through the chamber. The walls shook. The abyss itself seemed to tremble beneath us.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1474	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_98fb2f29		Before I could speak, before any of us could even breathe—he moved.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1475	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_found_e952b2d5		Lightning-fast, Magnus lunged, his wings snapping open with the force of a hurricane. The ground cracked beneath his takeoff.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1476	"[what]"
