ch8_battle_qtc3_8c0f83e6		I gritted my teeth. The injury was bad, but I could still fight.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1761	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_6f8ac3d4		I slammed my palm against the trembling stone beneath me, channeling earth. The ground answered my call. My energy surged downward, forcing jagged spikes of rock to burst upward, forming desperate footholds. A tether—something to keep us from being swallowed by the storm.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1770	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_7f7acdfc		The wind still howled. I needed to hold on. I needed to pull the others back before it was too late.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1771	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_5c1d03fb	dorian	Come on! Grab my arm!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1773	dorian "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_3906f8e8	yuxuan	You're out of your damn mind if you think I'm letting go!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1775	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_f209e971		Yuxuan reached first, his grip like iron. He dug his nails into my forearm, anchoring himself against the relentless force.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1777	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_234e4726	svante	I-I can't—!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1779	svante "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_b494c739		He was slipping. His feet scraped against the stone, but the wind was too strong. His frame was being dragged straight for the abyss.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1781	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_db0907c0	svante	Sir Dorian! Sir Dorian, help please!! AHHH—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1783	svante "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_94407bd8	dorian	Svante!!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1784	dorian "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_f6f5280e		A shadow tendril grabbed Svante's arm.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1786	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_5161c905	niko	Are you alright?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1788	niko "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_1024fb63	svante	Yes, sir Niko. T-Thank you.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1790	svante "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_b0acef5b		Chung-hee floated, his cape whipping around him like a storm-struck banner.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1792	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc3_5f606216	chung_hee	I'm getting the bigger picture of his mind. I'm close!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1794	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_578b27fc	magnus	I see that you've wounded me. Villains. Righteousness will have its vengeance!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1802	magnus "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_3592a0c0		Magnus exhaled slowly, closing his eyes. The faint scratches on his wings—remnants of our desperate struggle—began to disappear.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1804	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_e7dab3d1	niko	That's… that's not possible.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1806	niko "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_01fbbfbd	svante	H-He just—! That should've taken time!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1808	svante "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_44981e9f		Magnus' white eyes snapped open. The air shuddered with his presence.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1810	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_d0868c27	magnus	You think you can wound me? Me?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1812	magnus "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_921aa7da		His voice sent a ripple through the chamber. The walls cracked under the sheer force of his rage.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1814	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_d221567b	magnus	I have suffered an eternity of torment. And now, you dare to stand before me as if you are not the architects of my misery?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1816	magnus "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_237902e4		He stepped forward. Each footfall sent a tremor through the stone.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1818	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_1308b9f7	magnus	I should rip you apart. One by one. Slowly. Make you feel what I felt when she—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1820	magnus "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_042f8ee7		His breath hitched. His fingers twitched.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1822	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_392fab19	dorian	When she what, Magnus?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1824	dorian "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_825f6e2d		His expression contorted. His hands clenched into fists.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1826	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_1bdfe277	magnus	YOU TOOK HER FROM ME!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1828	magnus "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_187956f6		Divine light ignited.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1830	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_a050da09	niko	You're being unreasonable! We don't know what you're talking about!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1832	niko "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_6aac71cc	magnus	LIES! ABSOLUTE LIES! YOU SHAN'T FOOL ME WITH YOUR DECEIT, VILLAIN!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1834	magnus "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_187956f6_1		Divine light ignited.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1836	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_bdb9ab71		It surged from within him—an overwhelming pillar of golden radiance, stretching to the heavens. The light twisted and burned, crackling with unholy power.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1837	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_dfdd0270	yuxuan	W-What's going on?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1839	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_ed881289	svante	He's channeling light… but—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1841	svante "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_68d64acd		The very air seemed to bend. The cavern rumbled. I looked at Chung-hee, still concentrating on Magnus' mind.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1843	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_3b6326bc	niko	Damn it! He's not just wielding power—he's devouring it! We're wasting our strength throwing everything at him!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1845	niko "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_daf82187		I need to do something.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1847	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_9933c9c3		Quick Timed Choice:	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1849	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_e4f54d12		My instincts screamed at me. Fight back.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1858	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_d7479e90		I channeled my fire, reaching deep within myself. My core burned, the draconic energy roaring to life.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1859	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_0a39239a		The heat within me surged outward, twisting into a spiraling inferno.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1860	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_9d0d8c69		And yet—It didn't work.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1861	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_deba0232		Magnus' light consumed my fire.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1862	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_af48c6d5	dorian	Ghhkk—!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1864	dorian "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_98656e74		I was thrown backward, my body crashing against the cavern wall. A sharp crack erupted through my arm, a searing pain spreading like wildfire. My vision blurred. Smoke curled from my skin.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1866	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_1235f1c3	niko	DORIAN!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1868	niko "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_805e6565	svante	SIR DORIAN!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1869	svante "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_1cc7c20e		Their voices were distant, muffled beneath the ringing in my ears. I forced myself upright, my movements sluggish and pained. My fingers curled against my ribs. It hurts.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1871	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_eeae7382		Above me, Magnus hovered, bathed in golden fury, his wings outstretched like a vengeful god descending upon the unworthy. His eyes burned with celestial wrath, locking onto me like I was nothing more than a blasphemer before his throne.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1872	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_ab87164e	magnus	You dare fight me? You dare compare your flame to the light of the divine?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1874	magnus "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_bb2ec455		I clenched my fists, my body begging me to retaliate—but I forced myself to breathe. Think.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1883	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_3309eca1		I looked at Magnus. He wasn't just furious. He was in agony. Grief.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1884	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_221571a4		I remembered losing Elara, my wife. How it felt.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1885	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_377a956a	dorian	Magnus—stop!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1887	dorian "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_6f143997	magnus	You would dare speak to me?! After what you've done?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1889	magnus "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_4817114e	dorian	I don't know what happened. But I know you're hurting. Tell me what happened.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1891	dorian "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_de0d8f0d		His wings twitched. The divine light flickered—for just a moment.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1893	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_84bd7a9b		I stepped forward.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1894	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_803885b3	dorian	We didn't take her from you, Magnus. We don't even know who you mean.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1896	dorian "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_b8e7653e	svante	You think we're your enemies, but we're not!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1898	svante "[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_bf45f9b9		Magnus staggered. His breath came uneven, his fists clenched so tightly his knuckles turned white. The divine glow around him wavered, like a candle caught in the wind.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1900	"[what]"
ch8_battle_qtc4_523d6c72	magnus	DECEIT! FOUL VILLAIN!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1902	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_1aee2673		DIFFERENT OUTCOMES	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1920	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_21df6ff1	magnus	You think you can deceive me? You think I cannot see the blood on your hands?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1922	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_97b68717		And then—he moved.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1924	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_543b537a		Faster than thought. Faster than we could react.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1925	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_faf403e9		Chung-hee staggered, a radiant blade of light impaled through his chest.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1926	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_16180e3a		His lips parted, but no sound came. The divine energy devoured him from the inside, spreading like wildfire. His body disintegrated into golden dust before he could even scream.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1927	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_002a1a4b	niko	CHUNG-HEE—!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1929	niko "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_6e78abb9	svante	Sir Chung! NO!!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1930	svante "[what]"
