ch8_magnus_end_7bf6dd27		An unseen force gripped Svante's body, lifting him off the ground. His limbs jerked, twisting at unnatural angles as if invisible hands were crushing him from the inside.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1942	"[what]"
