ch8_magnus_end_f0a1cc2c		Magnus turned his head towards me, slow, deliberate. His wings unfurled, their brilliance unbearable, their presence suffocating.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1957	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_d4d82205		His white eyes locked onto mine. For a fraction of a second, something wavered.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1958	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_0aa72825	magnus	Dorian…	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1960	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_7362f6fd		His voice—uncertain, shaken.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1962	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_d9b0a981	magnus	Please! T-This isn't m—	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1964	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_6e0af369		Then, like a blade through glass, the moment shattered. His face twisted, his body tensed—whatever glimpse of clarity had surfaced was drowned beneath raw, consuming fury.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1966	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_9201edd9	dorian	M-Magnus?!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1968	dorian "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_2163fd37	magnus	DIE, VILLAIN!!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1970	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_c552b976		A force wrapped around my throat.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1972	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_2ccd6806		I choked, my vision swimming. My body lifted off the ground, my feet dangling in the empty air.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1973	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_cbfa645a		My lungs burned. My fingers clawed uselessly at my throat, trying to pry away a force I could not touch.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1974	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_530fea1e		Magnus brought me closer. Face to face.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1975	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_9ea30caa	dorian	Magnus…*coughs*	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1977	dorian "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_0cbefd94		His expression was unreadable, but his eyes—those terrible, soulless white eyes—bored into me, stripping me down to my very core.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1979	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_554b75de	magnus	You will feel what I felt.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1981	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_0d85ba7c		Then suddenly, I saw him. A presence just beyond Magnus, just behind his flickering golden light. A figure watching with quiet amusement.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1983	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_248e7b89		A crown of bone sat atop his head, the twisted remnants of something ancient and cruel.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1984	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_12e57fc5	yk	Shame… I thought you had what it takes, dragonkin.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1986	yk "[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_e345e10c		The last of my breath fled my body.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1988	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_e1c708c0		I gasped—a final, desperate sound.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1989	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_end_d2a6749f		And then everything went black.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	1990	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_820f2dfa	magnus	AHHHH!! MY HEAD!!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2010	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_f4b2ea52		Suddenly, the divine light around him shuddered before flickering violently, like a sun on the verge of exploding. His wings spasmed. His hands shot up to clutch his head, fingers digging into his skull.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2012	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_6ed0efdb		His voice tore through the chamber like a dying star. The walls shook. The very ground beneath us quaked as his agony turned into a raw, unfiltered roar of fury.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2013	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_47066b01	magnus	YOU KILLED ADRIANA!! MURDERER! VILLAIN!!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2015	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_524bc6ea	yuxuan	There's so much talk of this Adriana. Who is she? We don't even know who she is!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2017	yuxuan "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_6660ea9f		The heat of his rage was scorching. Even as he clutched his head, golden veins of divine energy flared violently across his arms, surging out in wild, uncontrollable bursts. The air around him bent, warped, twisted like reality itself was struggling under his presence.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2019	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_b8615935		I took a step back, barely stopping myself from instinctively summoning my fire again.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2020	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_dbbc2274	niko	We didn't kill her, Magnus!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2022	niko "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_4fbe8be2	magnus	DECEIVERS!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2024	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_9d4647dd		Another pulse of power. A shockwave. Stones rained from above as the cavern cracked apart at the seams.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2026	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_168f42f8		Through it all, Chung-hee stood firm.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2027	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_d3ecb93c		He placed two fingers against his temple, eyes locked onto Magnus like a hunter sighting prey.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2028	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_8a48e3f4	chung_hee	Your mind is in shambles, Magnus.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2030	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_dcb984f3		Magnus' whole body convulsed. His breathing was ragged, uneven. It was like something inside him was tearing apart—splitting him in two.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2032	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_1ae80e55	magnus	*panting* I WON'T GIVE IN!! YOU WON'T TWIST ME LIKE HER!! I'LL KILL YOU ALL!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2034	magnus "[what]"
