ch8_magnus_peace_49d0969d		Magnus snarled. He fought against it.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2038	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_985c7fae	magnus	YOU LIE!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2040	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_3f593b2b		He slammed a fist into the ground. The earth ruptured beneath him in a violent, golden explosion.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2042	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_12722844		I staggered back, shielding my face as dust and debris erupted around us.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2043	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_8a81073a		But Chung-hee didn't move.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2044	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_cac3719c		His voice remained calm. Unyielding.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2045	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_4ef29d4d	chung_hee	All your memories—they were implanted. Fabricated. Artificial.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2047	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_68e51fe7		I was in shock. Fabricated memories?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2049	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_2840936d		Magnus' breath hitched.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2050	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_931d3275		For a second, the divine light around him faltered. But then—he roared again.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2051	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_9d006fa1	magnus	NO! NO! I REMEMBER HER! I REMEMBER HER SMILE! I REMEMBER HER HAND IN MINE! YOU WON'T TAKE THAT FROM ME!	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2053	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_f5733f0f		Magnus' breath came in ragged, seething gasps. His body trembled—whether from pain or fury, I couldn't tell. His wings remained outstretched, the divine light flickering chaotically along the edges like an unstable flame.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2055	"[what]"
