ch8_magnus_peace_ef243ee5		Magnus' wings twitched. His muscles tensed, but something in his expression… shifted.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2061	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_d807df73		Doubt.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2062	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_83a8c16c		Hesitation.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2063	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_be836482	chung_hee	We aren't your enemies. We aren't here to hurt you.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2065	chung_hee "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_b5741fbf		Magnus' gaze snapped to me instantly, his entire body coiled like a predator ready to pounce.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2067	"[what]"
