ch8_magnus_peace_7a8a8b08	dorian	See? We're not out to get you.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2070	dorian "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_e4ad54ba		His chest heaved. His wings twitched. But he didn't move.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2072	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_2cfd76e0		I followed his line of sight—to the shattered ice. The ice that had once entombed him.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2073	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_73e43f39	dorian	We freed you, Magnus.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2075	dorian "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_ef5edf29		For a long, aching moment, Magnus just stared.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2077	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_28fcc8ce		His fingers twitched. His lips parted. The divine light around him dimmed.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2078	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_e4f3413e		A choked breath escaped him.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2079	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_2d9a2df2	magnus	Everything I knew… everything I remembered… was a lie?	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2081	magnus "[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_5f376045		Magnus' hand trembled as he stared at mine. His breath was shallow, unsteady. For a moment, I thought he would refuse—thought he would pull away, retreat into his fury.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2083	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_23613d7d		But then—his fingers twitched.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2084	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_0fc3eb9e		His shoulders sagged, as if the weight of centuries was suddenly crushing him all at once.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2085	"[what]"
ch8_magnus_peace_11f93ed5		And he took my hand.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2086	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_d4e5b261		--[ BG - Tianho Underground 2 – Normal ]	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2105	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_d48207a6		The walk back to Yuxuan's hidden laboratory was uneventful. None of us spoke much—our minds still reeling from everything that had happened. The discovery of Magnus, the battle, the truth behind his memories… it was too much to process all at once.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2106	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_4d6730f0		Magnus barely made it halfway before his strength gave out. His body, once brimming with divine power, now seemed fragile—human. He collapsed, barely conscious, his breathing shallow but steady.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2107	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_3880a9a1		I caught him before he hit the ground, feeling the unnatural heat still lingering beneath his skin. His wings were dragging on the cave floor.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2108	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_5d69f4bd		When we finally reached the laboratory, Roboto was on edge. It seemed to sense the tension. It moved toward Magnus, scanning him with mechanical precision before giving a small nod.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2115	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_f98f971e	roboto	H-H-HHe requires rest. I have prepared a bed. Please f-f-follow me.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2117	roboto "[what]"
ch8_walk_back_cb9a1eda		We did as it instructed, laying Magnus down on the softest mattress we could find. His face was pale, his breathing slow but even.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2119	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_4a82b0e9		With that done, the rest of us barely managed to settle in before exhaustion dragged us under. The moment my head hit the pillow, I felt myself slipping into the depths of sleep.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2120	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_b45fbc0b		The day had been long. Too long. And as my consciousness faded, I could only hope that tomorrow would bring more answers.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2121	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_e42e0f88		CHAPTER 9	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2123	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_10143cbe		I woke to the softest, most comforting scent. The warm aroma of freshly laundered sheets mixed with something faintly sweet—like the lingering traces of vanilla and sun-dried cotton.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2129	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_c69bfbf8		The fabric cradled me in its gentle embrace, and for a moment, I considered sinking deeper into its warmth. But then, the sound of soft munching reached my ears.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2130	"[what]"
ch8_walk_back_b247f2d2		I blinked my eyes open, taking in the dim light of the fixtures.	game/10_chapter_08.rpy	2131	"[what]"
chapter_9_50b4b92e		I woke to the softest, most comforting scent. The warm aroma of freshly laundered sheets mixed with something faintly sweet-like the lingering traces of vanilla and sun-dried cotton.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	129	"[what]"
chapter_9_c69bfbf8		The fabric cradled me in its gentle embrace, and for a moment, I considered sinking deeper into its warmth. But then, the sound of soft munching reached my ears.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	130	"[what]"
chapter_9_b247f2d2		I blinked my eyes open, taking in the dim light of the fixtures.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	131	"[what]"
chapter_9_0c76e5b0		Beside me, Elias sat cross-legged on the bed, happily chewing on a Hinami chocolate bar. His tiny hands were smudged with bits of melted chocolate, and his bright eyes lit up the moment he saw me stir.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	133	"[what]"
chapter_9_827ff0d7	elias	Daddy! You're awake!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	135	elias "[what]"
chapter_9_a61106dc		Before I could even process what was happening, he launched himself at me, wrapping his little arms around my torso. I let out a breathless chuckle, ruffling his soft hair as he clung to me. He was warm, his small body buzzing with energy.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	137	"[what]"
chapter_9_8dfe9d61	dorian	Elias, you have chocolate all over your hands. And I told you to not eat on the bed.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	139	dorian "[what]"
chapter_9_ab646239		He pulled back, grinning sheepishly. With a tiny huff, he hopped off the mattress and settled onto a chair beside the bed, still clutching his half-eaten chocolate bar like it was the most precious thing in the world.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	141	"[what]"
chapter_9_386bc351	dorian	Have you eaten breakfast yet?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	143	dorian "[what]"
chapter_9_a2457694	elias	Yes, daddy! I'm eating my late lunch now.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	144	elias "[what]"
chapter_9_eb54ba1c		Late lunch? So it was already afternoon? I had overslept.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	146	"[what]"
chapter_9_fa3e47fa		I looked down at his hands, still clutching the half-eaten chocolate bar. Late lunch?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	147	"[what]"
chapter_9_e741f26f	dorian	Elias, how many times have I told you? Eat your vegetables.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	149	dorian "[what]"
chapter_9_1d407c07		Elias immediately scrunched up his nose, his face contorting into the most dramatic expression of disgust.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	151	"[what]"
chapter_9_9c7af3a7	elias	I did, daddy! Miss Weng made me eat! Yucky veggies! Ew!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	153	elias "[what]"
chapter_9_bb363761		I sighed, massaging my temples. Miss Weng was a miracle worker; I had to give her that. Getting Elias to eat vegetables was no small feat.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	155	"[what]"
chapter_9_9ab52c3e		Come to think of it, everything's happening so fast.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	156	"[what]"
chapter_9_47c1bd84		In just a single day, I met Chung-hee, the Emperor of Kyeongjang; Niko, a prophet of the death god; and Svante, an aldorith who had switched sides. I had met Miss Weng, Yuxuan's trusted helper, Roboto, Yuxuan's automaton, and Tim, the brilliant toddler who somehow always knew more than he should.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	157	"[what]"
chapter_9_199286b1		I had reconnected with Paladin Feng, an old friend from my past, and met with Lady Aoi, the mercenary who had been trying to kill Chung-hee.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	158	"[what]"
chapter_9_dd614ed9		And we met and fought Magnus. The man from my dreams. What happened to him? Why had he been sealed in ice for centuries? And what memories had been implanted into his mind, twisting him into something even he didn't recognize?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	159	"[what]"
chapter_9_d1a81e76		I barely had time to process any of it before Elias' small hand slipped into mine. I looked down at him.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	160	"[what]"
chapter_9_0a75e1f6	elias	Me an' Tim gonna play later after my nap, Daddy! You wanna play too?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	162	elias "[what]"
chapter_9_e980938f	dorian	Sorry buddy. Daddy's busy.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	163	dorian "[what]"
chapter_9_95b1a28d		Elias pouted and took another bite of the chocolate. After a few bites, he set down the chocolate and yawned.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	165	"[what]"
chapter_9_2c0e99c8	elias	Mmm... I'm real, real sleepy, Daddy. Can you pat my back so I can... um... nap better?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	167	elias "[what]"
chapter_9_bd945d26		He swayed a little in his seat, blinking drowsily, fighting sleep the way all kids his age did. I knew from experience that Elias never fell asleep quickly. If I helped him, maybe he'd drift off sooner.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	169	"[what]"
chapter_9_437f841b		But at the same time, I haven't checked up on Magnus yet. Who knew what was happening in his mind? If he woke up confused-or worse, hostile again-he could be a danger to everyone.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	170	"[what]"
