ch9_common_00d99fdf		Drawn by curiosity, I followed the scent down the corridor, the rhythmic clatter of knives against wooden boards guiding me toward the kitchen. When I stepped inside, I stopped in my tracks.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	264	"[what]"
