ch9_common_e7d44d23		She took the daikon from his hands and, with precise, elegant movements, she pressed the blade against the radish's smooth surface. With a flick of her wrist, she glided through the vegetable with effortless grace, each slice falling into uniform half-moons. Thin, translucent, perfect.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	273	"[what]"
