ch9_common_f9d75acd		I, on the other hand, found my gaze drifting to the overwhelming amount of food stacked up around the kitchen. Sacks of garlic and onions rustled softly where they were piled high. Slabs of freshly butchered meat lay in careful rows.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	442	"[what]"
