ch9_library_common_c104766b		I turned my attention to the shelves around me. There were books upon books-some old, some new, some nearly crumbling with age.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	614	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_48ee59dc		I ran my fingers over the spines before pulling out one with an ornate cover. Poetry from the Hinami era. Maybe something lighthearted would help clear my mind.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	615	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_1d761634		Beside me, Chung-hee returned to his reading, his focus unshaken. I opened the book of poems.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	616	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_85c4ba38		" Farmer Oda - Takayori Sogen	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	618	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_01011465		"	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	619	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_8ef8d536		"Beneath the moon's pale, mournful gaze, Where silver waves in sorrow wane,	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	620	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_d1324f12		"A father knelt on weary knees,	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	621	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_49817cc1		"His heart weighed down with silent pain.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	622	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_e9378567		"The rice fields sang of autumn's end,	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	623	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_2ddfc647		"Yet no small hands would reap the grain. No laughter danced among the reeds, Only the echo of his name.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	624	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_cb33964e		"He held his child, so cold, so still, A blossom lost before its spring.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	625	"[what]"
