ch9_library_common_99e19869		I ran a hand through my hair, trying to shake the heaviness from my chest, when the sound of footsteps broke the silence.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	644	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_34c3858f		Miss Weng stepped into the library, carrying a few bottles of water.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	646	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_f18215ac	weng	I figured you two would be parched after reading so much.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	648	weng "[what]"
ch9_library_common_1aa6543c		She handed one to me, another to Chung-hee. He took it with a polite nod.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	650	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_5fd8a99c	chung_hee	Thank you, Miss Weng.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	652	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_library_common_f3f975f6		I twisted the cap open, taking a long sip of water, letting its coolness settle in my throat.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	654	"[what]"
ch9_library_common_8fbebd41	dorian	How's the cooking coming along?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	656	dorian "[what]"
