ch9_library_common_7fd6bd80	weng	We're still roasting the chicken and cooking the beef. It's taking a while, so I thought I'd check up on you both. Make sure you're not already starving.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	660	weng "[what]"
ch9_library_common_267fb3fd	weng	Magnus is a lot of help, by the way. He's very optimistic about helping. Prepping ingredients take a lot of work, you know.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	661	weng "[what]"
ch9_library_common_f4c81a2a		I noticed the slightest twitch in Chung-hee's brow. His fingers, which had been resting idly on his book, curled just a little tighter.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	663	"[what]"
