ch9_library_common_bec8d5c3		Minutes passed in quiet. The library remained hushed, save for the occasional soft rustle of pages turning. I kept reading, but my focus wavered, my mind drifting between the words on the page and the thoughts circling my head.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	675	"[what]"
