ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_3cb3dd5f		The king took note of his work and decided to help publish Takayori's work, making him famous. I could almost hear her voice-bright, teasing, full of conviction. She was crazy about this man.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	711	"[what]"
