ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_1751f76e	yuxuan	By the Prosperity Dragon, they have so much planned! But they wouldn't tell me a single thing!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	763	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_f6ed59bb	yuxuan	"It's a surprise, Lord Cheng." They said. Pft! As if I enjoy surprises!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	764	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_8c61c62e		I chuckled, leaning back against the couch.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	766	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_507895cf	dorian	Is the King of Hinami already here with his royal entourage?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	768	dorian "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_15d6aae9	yuxuan	Yes, Dorian. All the royals are here in Tianho as we speak. Tianho, Gale, Hinami, Mjoll, and the Centennial Isles... and Kyeongjang... if you count Chung-hee.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	769	yuxuan "[what]"
