ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_1e22af58	yuxuan	I was supposed to bring the two of you there yesterday when... well... there was a bomb... and the whole situation with Chung-hee happened.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	775	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_2fbd33de		He placed the bag on the low table between us, and immediately, a rich, savory scent wafted through the air-crispy, golden batter infused with the deep umami of Hinami spices.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	777	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_6a6f463c		I glanced at Elias. Yeah. He wasn't going to eat that.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	778	"[what]"
