ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_ae5d847d		We both turned as Tedda stepped in, carrying a small stack of water bottles in her arms. She shot Yuxuan a pointed look.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	810	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_553d9215	tedda_alive	Well, I saw you carrying sweets, so I figured they were for my Lady Elias. I barely had time to react before she continued.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	812	tedda_alive "[what]"
