ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_94f28c72		He sat up straighter, then flashed the most ridiculous, salesman-like grin I had ever seen.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	821	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_d157bf0d	yuxuan	He says yes, Tedda. But more importantly-!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	823	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_560462fc		He turned toward an invisible audience, gesturing dramatically with the half-eaten pastry in his hand.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	825	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_0c2aeb94	yuxuan	Nothing pairs better with the delicious, time-honored taste of Cheng Industries' Tianho Sweets than a refreshing bottle of water!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	827	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_4d4088a1		I stared at him, completely deadpan.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	829	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_c1c68a54	tedda_alive	Even the fish treats, Master Yuxuan?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	831	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_4ccaa01d	yuxuan	No... Not the fish treats though. Those are from the Hinami booth.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	832	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_e6c2d846		Tedda grinned and reached for a fish treat.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	834	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_b092a141	tedda_alive	They look delicious! I wanna try some! Yummy yummy fishy treat!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	836	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_d2d3fbf8		I sighed, reaching for a sesame rice cake.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	838	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_119bfc77		If I decided not to eat the treats, Yuxuan's smile faltered-just for a second. It was subtle, barely noticeable, but I caught the way his expression dimmed.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	842	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_39fcc22d	yuxuan	Oh... well, that's fine. More for Elias, I guess.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	844	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_9eda62e6		He shrugged it off, forcing an easygoing tone, but I knew him well enough to see the flicker of disappointment in his eyes.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	846	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_f4662534	yuxuan	A-Anyway! That's not the only reason I came by. So you won't believe what my Operations Manager said to me-	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	848	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_13650c15		Yuxuan and I continued talking about nothing and everything-old stories, absurd rumors, his company. The conversation ebbed and flowed with ease.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	850	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_b740811b		Time slipped away unnoticed, and before I knew it, Yuxuan glanced at the clock and straightened with a start.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	851	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_190f573b	yuxuan	Oh, wait! I have to go. I need to check up on Miss Weng. I need to see if she finished cooking the meals!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	853	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_eb2cf535		He stood, brushing the crumbs from his ornate robes.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	855	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_3751fdf0	dorian	Don't worry. I'll be here. I'll be up in a bit.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	857	dorian "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_ae7f6a28		Yuxuan shot me a knowing look.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	859	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_be497e41	yuxuan	Try not to fall asleep where you sit.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	861	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_c2233a1d		I waved him off with a lazy flick of my hand as he strode out the door, disappearing into the dimly lit hallway.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	863	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_097f7706		A small rustling from the bed caught my attention. I turned just in time to see Elias stirring, his tiny fists rubbing at his tired eyes. His hair was a tousled mess, and he blinked up at me in a sleepy daze.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	865	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_924cd16d	elias	Hello, Daddy.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	867	elias "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_92eaa8bd		His voice was soft, still laced with drowsiness. Then, his gaze shifted to the table, and the moment his half-lidded eyes landed on the neatly arranged pastries and treats, they snapped fully open.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	869	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_2c718b7b	elias	Ooh! Treats!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	871	elias "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_1561b8e9		A sleepy grin spread across his face as he sat up, suddenly far more awake than he had been mere seconds ago.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	873	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_0d20a9fe		I chuckled, shaking my head.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	874	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_d267a546	dorian	Those are from Yuxuan.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	876	dorian "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_e27c23b5		I reached over, lifting Elias effortlessly from the bed and settling him onto the couch. He wiggled in place, already reaching for one of the sweet red bean pastries with eager fingers.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	878	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_330105fd	dorian	Enjoy, buddy.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	880	dorian "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_ba28772d		Elias took a big bite, his cheeks puffing out as he chewed. His eyes lit up, his entire face brightening with pure delight.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	882	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_d176ac08	elias	Mmm! 'S yummy, Daddy!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	884	elias "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_ce2283d5	elias	Mister Yuxuan's always so nice! He's a biiiig heart!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	885	elias "[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_b799ab6b		I smiled.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	887	"[what]"
ch9_bedroom_yuxuan_e33e4a26	dorian	He sure is, Elias. He sure is.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	889	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_46293a13	door_voice	Good afternoon, Master Dorian. A reminder: Today marks the Fifth Anniversary of the Tragedy of Tianho. A day of remembrance for those we lost.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	905	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_10ea7d23	dorian	You already know my name? I just came here yesterday.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	906	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_c09bf3f8	door_voice	I keep a record of all the guests through Roboto, Master Dorian.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	907	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_f07e2a13	door_voice	Events will be held throughout the entire day and will conclude late into the night. Might I suggest visiting the Tianho Memorial? Or perhaps lighting an offering at the shrine?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	908	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4df5f7d9	door_voice	And for the most anticipated event of the evening-don't miss the grand Lantern Release tonight! Let your loved ones' spirits dance among the stars!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	909	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_6ccc6a30	door_voice	Buy our exclusive Cheng Industries Lantern, now featuring: red weather-resistant paper, ensuring a smooth ascent even in the wind!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	910	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_bb1c5ca7	door_voice	Here at Cheng's, we bring change!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	911	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_cce7d270		-Here at Cheng's, we bring change... -	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	915	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_47387fbf		A familiar odd jingle filled the area, the cheerful tone feeling almost out of place.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	917	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_6b1007d7	dorian	Lantern release? What's that?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	919	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_0164cbd1	door_voice	The Lantern Release is an age-old tradition in the kingdom of Tianho. Participants write the name of their departed loved ones on the lantern, along with a message from their heart.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	920	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_13447446	door_voice	Then, as the night deepens, they release the lanterns into the sky together, creating a breathtaking sea of light that drifts into the heavens.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	921	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_61130b22	door_voice	Legend says that the Prosperity Dragon sees the lanterns and their messages. Moved by the love and longing of those left behind, the Prosperity Dragon intercedes on their behalf to the Dragon of the Depths.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	922	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_14fb524e	door_voice	And in turn, the Dragon of the Depths carries those messages to the dead.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	923	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_7730cc86		The thought lingered in my mind longer than I expected.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	925	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_d7751769	dorian	I'll... think about it. Thank you for reminding me.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	927	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_41792f1a	door_voice	You're welcome. Have a wonderful day, Master Dorian!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	928	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_tavern_0e60b4b7		The walk to Tianho was uneventful, but as soon as I got close, the energy of the city hit me like a wave. The streets were alive with movement-vendors calling out their wares, children weaving through the crowds with paper lanterns, and musicians playing soft, somber tunes on guqins and flutes.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	935	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_37184698		Something else caught my attention-almost no guards patrolled the streets. From Gale, I spotted a few soldiers, their posture rigid as they observed the proceedings. But from Mjoll? Almost none.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	936	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_30a7497b		I exhaled, slipping past the solemn crowd, heading toward my destination-The Tavern of the Jade Serpent.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	937	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_4f04432d		The moment I reached it, I hesitated. I had planned on grabbing a drink, maybe taking a quiet moment to gather my thoughts. But instead, my gaze swept over the people inside, and my instincts flared.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	938	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_2abd4235		Mjoll soldiers.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	939	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_c45e2d84		A group of them, already deep into their cups, laughing raucously. Their uniforms were loosened, some were already shirtless, their posture sloppy, the distinct stink of cheap liquor wafting out onto the street.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	940	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_9e03158f	man_1	Bottoms up! Haha!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	942	man_1 "[what]"
ch9_tavern_24757ed4	man_2	Hey! No fair, you cheating swine! My cup's barely half-full!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	943	man_2 "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4c25c2e5		Immediately, my body tensed. I had spent too many years fighting with Mjoll soldiers to be comfortable standing this close to them. If one of them recognized me...	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	945	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_02e0911a	niko	Tsk. Those Mjoll soldiers... You'd think they'd have better things to do than getting drunk in broad daylight.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	947	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_74d45073		I turned, finding him standing just behind me, arms crossed, his eyes flicking toward the soldiers.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	949	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_5c0cbd0a	niko	What are you doing here? Did you follow me?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	951	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_09049eb0	dorian	Follow you? Hardly. I heard you were meeting your fellow prophets in a tavern. Thought I'd grab a drink myself.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	952	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_f0ccce7c		Niko's gaze drifted back to the Mjoll soldiers. His smirk faded, replaced with a quiet look of distaste.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	954	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_c182c63b	niko	Change of plans. We ate at a local eatery nearby instead. Seeing all those Mjoll soldiers... well, let's just say it killed my appetite.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	956	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_cbe61f63		He exhaled, rubbing his temples before glancing back at me.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	958	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_30e33c9e	niko	But if you're still planning on eating, maybe I'll join you. We didn't eat that much, and I could use something sweet.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	960	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_3dd85322		As we stepped away from the tavern, the scent of something rich and fragrant drifted through the air. I followed my nose to a nearby food stall, where a vendor worked over a sizzling clay pot, stirring a deep, amber-colored broth bubbling with spices.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	971	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_8e1efe58	vendor	Fresh bowls of Cabbage Head Hotpot! Good for the soul on this solemn day!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	973	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_773091ef		I peered into the pot-large, tender meatballs bobbed in the bubbling broth, their juices blending with softened napa cabbage and delicate glass noodles, all soaking in that rich, umami-laden depth of flavor.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	975	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_186eb245	dorian	Ever had this before? It's called Cabbage Head Hotpot. A Tianho classic.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	977	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_9b5d0dcd	niko	Can't say I have. Looks pretty hearty. But sure, go ahead.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	978	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_7d955f0f		I ordered two bowls, and we settled onto a wooden bench nearby, the warmth of the simmering broth already curling into the crisp air.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	980	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_851e87a7	vendor	Two orders, sir? Coming right up! Thank you for your patronage!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	982	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_0879cc7c		With practiced ease, he ladled the broth into heavy ceramic bowls, filling them to the brim before handing them over.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	984	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_2d05f048	vendor	Here you go, sirs! Two piping hot bowls of Cabbage Head Hotpot-perfect for a day like this.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	986	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4787baec	niko	Ah- Merciful Enoch!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	987	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_7f47d098		He recoiled slightly, nearly dropping his bowl as the heat seared through the ceramic.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	989	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_5725525b	vendor	Careful, sir! That bowl is fresh off the fire!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	991	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_b86e3677		The first spoonful was nothing short of perfection-the meatballs were impossibly tender, each bite infused with the warmth of ginger, garlic, and a whisper of five-spice.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	993	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_3f9f4b14		The broth, thick and deeply savory, carried just the right balance of richness, clinging to the softened strands of cabbage.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	994	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_6cb3e8e3		Niko hummed in approval, his chopsticks plucking up a bundle of glistening noodles.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	995	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_244313a9	niko	Alright, I'll admit-it's damn good. The cabbage soaks up all the flavor. Reminds me of the dishes we had back at the seacoast of Hinami.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	997	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_76293305		As he leaned back, tapping his chopsticks against the rim of his bowl, curiosity flickered across his face.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	999	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_81165173	niko	Kind sir, this is excellent. Would you mind parting with the recipe?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1001	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_3dae0613		The vendor let out a hearty chuckle, shaking his head.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1003	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_fd4e61a5	vendor	Ah, I must apologize, sir. This recipe has been passed down through generations. Can't just go giving away family secrets.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1005	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_0d94fa18		He grinned, tipping his ladle toward us.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1007	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_67f1c67b	vendor	But I'm honored by your praise.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1009	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_2ba23fa0		I tilted my head toward Niko.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1011	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_87c6ffba	dorian	Would you like seconds? I could go for another round.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1013	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_5874d941	niko	Maybe just an extra serving of noodles. Not the broth-I can feel it settling in my bones already.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1014	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_80200a8e	vendor	Coming right up, sir! Again, thank you for your patronage!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1015	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_3e169493		As the vendor prepared another portion, Niko shot me an amused glance.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1017	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_e6862000	niko	You eat more than I expected, Dorian. Guess it's fair, considering the last thing we had was dinner, and we're well past lunch now.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1019	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_3874c113		I only shrugged, savoring the last sip of broth on my bowl.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1021	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_20c709d5		The vendor set our bowls down with a warm smile, steam curling up from the broth.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1023	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_3479cb1f	vendor	Here you are, sirs. A second serving. I added extra meatballs to your bowl-on the house, in honor of the festivities.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1025	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_590c463e	vendor	And also, I heard about what you did yesterday. Thank you for clearing the town from those damn yaoguai. Consider this my way of saying thanks.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1026	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_a88a29b6	dorian	How generous. Thank you.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1027	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_8e442630	vendor	You're most welcome, sir. If my daughter were still here, she'd have me giving out an extra meatball to anyone who so much as complimented the cooking. She had a kind heart like that.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1028	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_2e6ffb87	vendor	She was taken during the Tragedy... five years ago today. Our family was being chased by a yaoguai and... you know.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1029	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_cbd7ab51		Niko set his chopsticks down, his gaze shifting, solemn.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1031	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_082b56cc	niko	I'm very sorry to hear that.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1033	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_26420189		The vendor waved a hand, a wistful but resolute smile tugging at his lips.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1035	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_3f6c5bc0	vendor	Don't worry yourselves, sirs. She wouldn't have wanted grief. Today, we honor the fallen, not with sorrow, but with life. And so, we cook, we eat, and we carry forward.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1037	vendor "[what]"
ch9_tavern_6149fa56		We ate the rest of our meal in a more reflective silence, letting the warmth of the broth settle in. Delicious.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1039	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_c81a6ec8		Just as we finished, Niko's attention drifted elsewhere, his gaze sharpening.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1040	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_2322a7eb	niko	...Now that looks interesting.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1042	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_0790a2c1		I followed his line of sight to a man pulling a wooden cart down the street, its wheels creaking softly over the stone path. A rich, caramelized aroma wafted from it-sweet, creamy, with just the faintest hint of toasted sugar.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1044	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_3fd1a968		Something about the man seemed familiar. Then it clicked.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1045	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_14a93c8a	dorian	Wait... Gao? Is that you?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1047	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_5bc6c233		The man looked up sharply, then broke into a broad grin.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1049	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_d416255a	soldier_gao	Paladin Dorian! You're here!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1051	soldier_gao "[what]"
ch9_tavern_e28ebfc3	niko	Gao? The soldier yesterday? What are you doing here?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1052	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_be4b6659	soldier_gao	Oh, Doctor Niko! Well, I'm selling! Care to buy some delicious Tianho flan? Fresh from my mother's kitchen.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1053	soldier_gao "[what]"
ch9_tavern_8b7dda3d		He patted the side of the cart with pride, the lids of several ceramic dishes clinking faintly against one another.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1055	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_099a0785	soldier_gao	You'd best grab them now, sirs. I'm heading to the memorial soon, and we sell out quickly.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1057	soldier_gao "[what]"
ch9_tavern_403a090c		Niko stepped forward, peering at the cart's contents with mild interest.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1059	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_460a09eb	niko	How much?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1061	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_d3f69d09	soldier_gao	Five coins per flan, sir. It'll be worth every coin. I promise!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1062	soldier_gao "[what]"
ch9_tavern_a5f36dc2		Without hesitation, Niko reached into his pouch and pulled out several coins, stacking them in Gao's palm.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1064	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_dd55566d	niko	I'll take five.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1066	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_e1a7ecb9	soldier_gao	Thank you, sir! I'll wrap those up for you!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1068	soldier_gao "[what]"
ch9_tavern_9d461e41		I blinked.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1070	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_f8b55387	dorian	Five, Niko?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1072	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_b0efeb5a	niko	One for you. One for me. One for Elias. One for Tim.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1073	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_82dbb8c6	dorian	...And the fifth?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1074	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_18e1a27a		Niko hesitated, just for a moment. Then he exhaled through his nose, taking the wrapped flans from Gao with careful hands.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1076	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_0eadd20b	soldier_gao	Here you are, sirs! Five Hinami flans!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1078	soldier_gao "[what]"
ch9_tavern_d4814324	soldier_gao	Anyway I have to get going. People in the memorial are a little impatient. See you, Paladin! Doctor!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1079	soldier_gao "[what]"
ch9_tavern_379ff3ce	dorian	Thank you, Gao! Stay safe, okay?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1080	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_fc697f55		Niko looked at me.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1082	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_bada74ab	niko	The fifth is for Kaito.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1084	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_011ea9d0		My breath caught in my throat. Kaito. Niko's younger brother.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1086	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_d5f1b075	dorian	Well, I know for a fact that he'd love whatever you give him.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1088	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_ecea4867	niko	I know. But he really loved sweets so I figured he'd definitely want this.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1089	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_e9d1fa70		I didn't press. Instead, I simply nodded.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1091	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_bbb7e3c6		I shook my head.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1095	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_932793f5	dorian	I'm not really hungry, Niko.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1097	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_fc10af1b		Niko shot me a sideways glance but didn't push the matter.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1099	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_8a3cbe37	niko	Suit yourself. Let's get out of here.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1101	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_f94c4f9a		The steady beat of drums and the lilting notes of flutes filled the streets as we wove through the growing crowd. The air buzzed with conversation, laughter, and the occasional call of a vendor hawking their wares.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1106	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_14f6cce3	woman_2	Moonlit noodles! Especially hot for the occasion!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1108	woman_2 "[what]"
ch9_tavern_d7ca5e4f	man_2	Come get your Cheng Industries Lanterns here! Now featuring: red weather-resistant paper, ensuring a smooth ascent even in the wind!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1109	man_2 "[what]"
ch9_tavern_1ae78b18	woman_2	Here at Cheng's, we bring change! Do you want your loved ones to feel extra loved? Try our new and improved-	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1110	woman_2 "[what]"
ch9_tavern_69fff0c3		Then, through the throng of people, a familiar figure emerged.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1112	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_fb8563a1		A woman in a flowing indigo kimono, her posture as poised as ever, her expression unreadable.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1113	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_e00d823d		Lady Aoi.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1115	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_ddf0202b		One of the commanders who had led the attack on Chung-hee.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1116	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_5f4694da	niko	Keep your guard up, Dorian.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1118	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_825605d6	dorian	You don't have to tell me twice.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1119	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4c39517e		Aoi's sharp eyes flicked to us, her gaze lingering just long enough to let us know she had seen us long before we noticed her. She tilted her head slightly, the faintest ghost of a smirk tugging at her lips.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1121	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_a9384944	aoi	Sir Dorian. Doctor Niko. A pleasure.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1123	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_930790d5		We didn't return the greeting. Our stares were cold, unyielding. She rolled her eyes.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1125	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_b675feb1	aoi	Why are you looking at me like that?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1127	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4d7266a6	dorian	Oh, I don't know. Maybe because the last time we met, you tried to kill us?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1128	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4ad7de33	niko	Or because we have no idea if you're still working for King Gustav?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1129	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_fc4f3347	niko	For all we know, you might still be getting coin from him.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1130	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_c3e054fb		She let out a slow, exaggerated sigh before raising her hands-not in surrender, but with an air of casual indifference.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1132	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_a8f87c83	aoi	Oh, for the love of Tetrad. I'm not after the Emperor anymore. I know when I'm beaten.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1134	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_1749ca03		She met our stares head-on, her voice cool and steady.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1136	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_7fc8848a	aoi	Look, I'll be honest with you. Yes, I was in it for the money. I always am. But I'm not an idiot.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1138	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_5848e9ee	aoi	The last mercenary who failed King Gustav's orders? He was executed. Him and his wife.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1139	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_5d9e4831		The words hung in the air like a blade over our heads.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1141	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_2dc42dea	aoi	Xianlun knows I'm not going back there.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1143	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_3ca31e2f		She fixed her hair with her fingers.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1145	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_d7d8b2db	aoi	I took the coin he gave me. And I deserted.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1147	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_cfd2f970	dorian	So that's why you took the job from Feng.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1149	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_40cde9c5		Aoi gave a small shrug.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1151	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_4171cc4f	aoi	Pretty much. But that's not why I'm here right now.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1153	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_7116053f	dorian	Speaking of which, where is Feng?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1154	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_0bb55f13	aoi	With the Empress at the Tianho Memorial, I've heard. He told me that he's on guard duty and won't leave her side.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1155	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_3ef85af9		Before I could say anything, a woman approached, balancing a tray with a delicate porcelain cup. The faint aroma of herbs and citrus drifted through the air.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1157	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_9df3944b	woman_2	Here it is, madam. Your Lóngyan Tea-brewed with fresh Xingcao leaves, just as you requested.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1159	woman_2 "[what]"
ch9_tavern_20622e61		I frowned. Xingcao? The name was unfamiliar to me. Niko, however, arched a brow.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1161	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_75afd8cd	niko	Longyan Tea? That tea's used by singers to clear their voices.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1163	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_549a5aec		Aoi lifted the cup gracefully, inhaling the steam before taking a careful sip.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1165	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_2db28554	aoi	Yes. I'll be singing tonight, Doctor.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1167	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_bcc4f8f7		She glanced up at us, watching our reactions with quiet amusement.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1169	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_726a0b49	aoi	Why the faces? Haven't you heard? Hinami is hosting the Anniversary this year.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1171	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4e944b00		Aoi took a small sip of her tea before answering.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1173	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_37581d9d	aoi	His Majesty King Tatsuya Fujiwara of Hinami specifically requested me for a song, and who am I to refuse?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1175	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_250f93be	dorian	Svante has mentioned that you were a songstress before.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1177	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_116fb1e0		Aoi let out a soft chuckle.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1179	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_b17e0ef7	aoi	Oh, I was never anything grand. Just a woman with a voice, singing songs that spoke to my homeland.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1181	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_8426b972	niko	Wait... you're the Mistress of Flowing Verses. You performed for King Tatsuya while channeling rain.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1182	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_3e26897e		Aoi smirked slightly, swirling the tea in her cup.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1184	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_09852002	aoi	I see my reputation precedes me. But I'm no more than a normal person.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1186	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_92481592		Niko leaned forward.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1188	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_9353e496	niko	King Gustav is surely going to be at the Tianho Memorial for the ceremony. If you're singing, he'll see you. He might order your capture.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1190	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_3f7d39e4	aoi	Let him try.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1191	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_e3eeb9be		With that, she pointed to the small pin on her robe-a delicate emblem of Hinami's royal crest, unmistakable in its craftsmanship.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1193	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_e9ba8566	aoi	He'll be inviting war with the kingdom of Hinami. The royal singer is protected by His Majesty, King Tatsuya Fujiwara.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1195	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_d12bb4a8	niko	Good point.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1196	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4278c810	dorian	You must be an incredible singer if you performed for the King of Hinami himself. Channeling rain while singing... I can't even imagine the level of control that takes.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1202	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_234db078		Aoi raised a delicate brow, her fingers brushing against the porcelain cup of tea. A small smirk curled on her lips.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1204	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_efc3b57f	aoi	"Famous" is a strong word. I was simply... appreciated. People liked what I did. I didn't just sing-I told stories. I gave people something to believe in.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1206	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_7b4c37e5		She placed her cup down and lifted a single hand, her fingers elegantly tracing the air. A cool breeze stirred around us, and suddenly, droplets of water formed in the air.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1208	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_2fb0dcd2		The moisture wove together into shimmering threads, swirling like mist before gathering into a delicate ribbon of liquid.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1209	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_4b01eefb		The ribbon of water coiled around her wrist like a living ornament before dispersing into the air in a fine mist. She exhaled slowly, as if lost in the memory.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1210	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_bccacf22	aoi	The stage was my battlefield before I ever picked up a blade.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1212	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_c803f869	dorian	I'm curious. I'd like to see you perform.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1213	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_eefbe1d9	aoi	Then watch closely tonight. Who knows? Maybe I'll dedicate a verse to you.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1214	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_04353655		Aoi stood there, silent, her fingers resting lightly against the rim of her teacup. She exhaled softly, her gaze shifting away from me, scanning the crowd.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1218	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_23aa21aa		Aoi's gaze lingered on a family sitting nearby-an elderly woman pouring tea with careful, practiced hands, serving two younger figures. Their expressions were solemn, their movements slow and deliberate, as if honoring something unseen.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1220	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_edaeaf2b		She exhaled softly, her fingers brushing against the silk of her kimono sleeve.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1221	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_d2d3b3c6	aoi	I used to think music was just for beauty. For fleeting moments of admiration.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1223	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_cc5c4888		Her voice was quieter now, almost lost beneath the hum of the festival.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1225	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_dd2a4a2c		Then, just as quickly as the moment arrived, she straightened.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1226	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_6ee33ccd	aoi	Anyway, I must bid you gentlemen farewell. I need to rest my voice for my performance later.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1228	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_27f22a5d	niko	We wish you luck in your performance, Lady Aoi. Make Hinami proud.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1229	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_dffd2b10		She inclined her head slightly, her gaze sharp.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1231	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_8a0d64f5	aoi	I'll do my best. Take care, Sir Dorian. Doctor Niko.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1233	aoi "[what]"
ch9_tavern_c51a1aa9		With that, she turned and disappeared into the crowd, the faint scent of tea and jasmine lingering in her wake.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1235	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_fc66b1f2		I let out a slow breath, shaking my head slightly before glancing at Niko.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1236	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_7973d6c0	niko	Well... at least we have one less person who has a target on our backs.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1238	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_05d716b7		Just then, out of the corner of my vision, a small figure came into view-marching toward us with determined little steps. Tim.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1240	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_1f1e6309		The tiny genius clutched a plate precariously balanced in his little hands. On it were three perfectly arranged slices of Tianho flan.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1241	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_2655dd2f	niko	Tim? What in Enoch's name are you doing here alone?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1243	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_26c4fe82	tim	S-Sir Niko? Sir Dorian? What are you doing here?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1244	tim "[what]"
ch9_tavern_8e773a04	dorian	Adult stuff. Now back to you. What are you doing all by yourself here?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1246	dorian "[what]"
ch9_tavern_14229446	niko	Miss Weng might be worried sick.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1247	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_9e338d3a	tim	I always go out by myself. I'm a big boy!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1248	tim "[what]"
ch9_tavern_2612c302		Niko and I exchanged glances.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1250	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_ad5b684c	tim	I went out of the lab and bought flan for all of us! I did the math. Three flan. One for me, one for Elias, and one we can share for the occasion! Perfectly balanced.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1252	tim "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4defbf17		Niko, however, smirked and lifted a small paper bag, shaking it lightly.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1254	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_e7b30484	niko	I already bought five, kid. We have more than enough.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1256	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_ba3db3e6		Tim froze. His eyes darted from the bag to his own plate. Then back to the bag. Then to the plate again.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1258	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_8283f1b6	tim	Five, sir Niko?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1260	tim "[what]"
ch9_tavern_9c1cd92c	niko	Five.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1261	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_5eeb994e		Another pause. A deep frown creased Tim's brow. He looked at his three flan. Then at Niko's five. Then back at his own.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1263	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_820913fd	tim	...My calculations are wrong... Rookie mistake.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1265	tim "[what]"
ch9_tavern_8ee22667	tim	Numbers don't matter if you control the pace of the battlefield.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1266	tim "[what]"
ch9_tavern_fbe7c75e	niko	Well, it's better to have an abundance than a shortage. Let's just go back.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1267	niko "[what]"
ch9_tavern_389adfd8		We looked at the number of people. It's getting larger.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1269	"[what]"
ch9_tavern_09e3c391	tim	You're right, Sir Niko.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1271	tim "[what]"
ch9_tavern_4160f40f	dorian	Come on. Let's head back.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1272	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_243642f2		Deciding to lend a hand with the cooking, I stepped back into the kitchen, where the rich aroma of sizzling oil, fresh herbs, and simmering broth filled the air.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1286	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_3b53c494		At the counter, Svante was still hunched over a cutting board, his brows furrowed in concentration as he meticulously chopped green onions.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1287	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_554f759f		Magnus held the radish up to the light, turning it this way and that as though contemplating its very essence. Then, with a dramatic flourish, he brought his knife down, slicing cleanly through it.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1288	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_bf6122eb	magnus	Ah! The crisp snap of a fresh daikon beneath my blade! It sings, a melody of earth and harvest, a tale whispered by the soil itself-	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1290	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_718cf589	svante	It's just a vegetable, Magnus.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1291	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_ff831f73	magnus	A vegetable that has lived, Svante. A humble root, torn from its slumber beneath the earth, now meeting its noble fate in the fires of culinary creation.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1292	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_1750cda9	svante	Magnus, please just cut the daikon.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1293	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_b2e5b487		I smirked, folding my arms as I leaned against the counter.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1295	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_2d92d814	dorian	Where's Miss Weng? Shouldn't she be making sure Magnus doesn't turn dinner into a sonnet?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1297	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_c6a08ea2	svante	Oh, sir Dorian! You're here! You decided want to help us?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1298	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_181b1ea9		Magnus, still handling his daikon with far too much ceremony, gestured vaguely toward the back of the kitchen.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1300	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_d3c07d9e	magnus	Miss Weng has retreated to the sacred domain of baking.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1302	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_3609a2e1		Svante nodded, finally glancing up.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1304	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_bc06f018	svante	She took Tedda with her. Baking is a long and arduous process, and Mjoll cuisine requires a lot of it.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1306	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_db5fa5e8	dorian	Makes sense. I imagine it's easier with an extra pair of hands.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1307	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_4b664991	magnus	Then we must prepare our stomachs! For a true feast is on the horizon!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1308	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_7099816e		I sighed, stepping forward and turning my attention to Svante.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1310	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_8b7ed36e	dorian	Anything you need me to do?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1312	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_1e96f22d		Svante stiffened slightly, his knife pausing mid-air for just a fraction of a second. His face turned the faintest shade of pink before he quickly gestured toward a small basket of onions beside him.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1314	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_4d07f94a	svante	Ah-yes! The onions. We need more of them chopped.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1316	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_ce993d5d		I nodded and grabbed a knife, setting to work beside him. The sharp scent of onions filled the air, stinging my eyes slightly as I worked in quiet rhythm next to him.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1318	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_77715c58		Svante, still a little flustered, focused entirely on his own chopping, glancing at me every so often before quickly looking away.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1319	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_d2ef901c		After a moment, he cleared his throat.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1320	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_a4311aa7	svante	So, um... Sir Dorian. You were with the Paladins before, right? With Paladin Feng?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1322	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_cd3e9f59		I nodded and continued chopping.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1324	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_9953e1e8	svante	Is it true you were best friends?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1326	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_82a6ec49		I paused briefly, considering my answer, before resuming my work.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1328	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_ffc5eeac	dorian	We were close, yes. In a way, you could say we were.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1330	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_0cbeaf8d	svante	Oh... I see...	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1331	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_9f1eb4fa		My thoughts drifted to Feng. He was my closest friend during my time with the Paladins.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1333	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_eabf597c		I remembered the countless times we sparred together, both of us fire channelers, pushing each other to our limits.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1334	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_b1be4a1d		Neither of us held back-Feng never allowed it. He fought with relentless precision, his movements sharp and calculated, like a blade honed to perfection. But outside of battle? He was my closest friend.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1335	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_f17eb9da		I huffed a quiet laugh.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1336	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_4e3ba9ee		For all his discipline in combat, he had a habit of skipping training entirely-just so he could sit under a tree with a romance novel in hand, utterly engrossed in tales of star-crossed lovers and grand declarations of devotion.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1337	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_77d4ed37	dorian	Why do you ask?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1339	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_b8ebe22d	svante	Oh-um. Nothing, sir.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1340	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_294c7842		I sighed, shaking my head.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1342	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_7939ed47	dorian	There it is again. What's with the 'sir'? I thought I told you to just call me Dorian.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1344	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_6506eb40		Svante stiffened slightly, his ears turning red as he immediately tried to correct himself.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1346	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_1bffb03f	svante	Oh, s-sorry, s-Dorian! I meant Dorian-Sorry, sir. I mean-	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1348	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_e099151e		He cut himself off, flustered, then exhaled sharply before returning to his onions with renewed determination.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1350	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_f13e532c		We continued cutting, the rhythmic thud of our knives filling the kitchen as the pile of onions gradually shrank. The sharp scent burned my eyes slightly, but I pushed through, matching Svante's steady pace.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1351	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_f45ab656		As I reached for another onion, something on the counter caught my eye-a photograph, slightly worn at the edges but well-kept.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1352	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_f20fa33c		The image was of a woman frozen mid-motion, caught in the flow of a dance-her arms elegantly extended, her silken sleeves billowing like waves.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1353	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_1b44e5ee		The pose was familiar.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1354	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_ee737297		I decided to keep quiet. It wasn't my place to pry.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1360	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_155cf6e7		Svante glanced at the counter, and his eyes widened slightly when he noticed the photograph still sitting there. His cheeks flushed, and with quick, almost clumsy movements, he scooped it up and slipped it into his pocket.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1361	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_fa13341c	svante	S-Sorry, Sir Dorian. I must have left it.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1363	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_3169c537		I offered a small, reassuring smile.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1365	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_4484523b	dorian	Don't worry. I didn't see anything.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1367	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_461dd7eb		Svante nodded stiffly, though his fingers lingered over his pocket for a moment before he returned to his task.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1369	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_6d8cc7f3		Before the silence could settle for too long, a soft whirring sound cut through the air.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1370	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_9c9eb2b1		Roboto rolled toward us, its metal joints clicking faintly as it maneuvered across the kitchen. In one hand, it clutched a spatula-though whether it actually intended to cook or was simply mimicking us, I wasn't sure.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1371	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_d4e243ac	roboto	Sir S-S-S-Svante, how are you holding up? You and S-S-Sir Magnus have been working a lot. Would you prefer to have a quick rest?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1373	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_bb53cf92		Magnus scoffed, tossing his brown hair over his shoulder with unnecessary flair.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1375	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_265451de	magnus	Rest? Me? Real men power through all of this!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1377	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_d2ae018d		Svante chuckled, shaking his head as he wiped his hands on a cloth.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1379	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_b2d89250	svante	Don't worry, Roboto. I've done harder tasks during my time at Mjoll with Father.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1381	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_9888af2b	magnus	That's the spirit! A true warrior of the kitchen!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1382	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_65f1c05b	dorian	This dance... It's budao weng, right?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1388	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_ace7d5ad		A dance performed in Tianho by women and, at times, crossdressing men-known for its fluid movements that mimicked the rolling of waves and the shifting of the wind.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1390	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_cddd46b6		Beside me, Svante's knife stilled. His gaze flickered toward the photograph, and for a moment, something unreadable crossed his face. Then, with slightly pinkened cheeks, he quickly took the picture back, slipping it into his pocket.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1391	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_fcf712a7	svante	S-Sorry, sir. That's just my mom.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1393	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_68f921dd	dorian	Oh, that's right. You mentioned before-your mother was a songstress in Tianho.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1394	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_0f32c04f	svante	Yes, sir. This photo was taken during one of her performances when I was younger. She would perform the budao weng while singing.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1395	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_98289210		There was an unmistakable fondness in his tone.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1397	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_cfb38036	dorian	She looks graceful.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1399	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_afbad975	svante	She was, sir.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1400	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_70c5dcb9		A small, almost shy smile crossed Svante's lips before he nodded.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1402	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_c413cba4	svante	You see... the budao weng requires precise balance. The movements are fluid, but they need to be controlled.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1404	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_27bdbc09	svante	My mother would wear metal cufflinks on her ankles-thin, but heavy enough to ground her movements.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1405	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_efe862c4	svante	She asked me to reinforce them since I can channel metal. To ensure she wouldn't slip or stumble.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1406	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_1e23287d	svante	She taught me a lot about performance. About music, dance... even metal channeling.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1407	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_45bcdf62	dorian	Metal channeling? Is she a metal channeler?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1408	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_a14dd901		Svante shook his head.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1410	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_9d7ebff4	svante	No, sir. My mother is a fire channeler.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1412	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_0bdd0dab	svante	But... she studied it. She read books, talked to scholars from Tianho, Mjoll, Gale-did everything she could to understand what I could do. She didn't know how to channel metal herself, but she still coached me.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1413	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_8604d378	svante	She helped me refine my control, made sure I didn't strain myself, even though there was barely any information out there.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1414	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_2886c91b		A soft whirring sound interrupted us.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1416	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_0e317a70		Roboto rolled toward us, still clutching a spatula in its metal hand.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1417	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_4a4bff23	roboto	Resources about metal channeling are scarce, so it's a-a-a-amazing how she managed to teach you something.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1419	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_c3c19992		Svante turned toward Roboto with bright eyes.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1421	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_f6ae3723	svante	Thank you, Roboto.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1423	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_0924f9f5	roboto	Anyway, d-d-d-d-do you dance and sing, sir Svante?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1424	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_f9353de5	svante	D-Dance? Where did you get that?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1425	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_ed7236a9	roboto	Y-Y-You said that you mom taught you a lot about performance. About music, dance. S-S-So I assumed that she taught you how to dance and sing.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1426	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_f429de54	svante	I... I know how, but I'm not really good at it. Not as good as Magnus here.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1427	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_d4530884	magnus	*belting a high note* Ahhhh!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1428	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_help_0af3cc7b	svante	See?! I can't compare to that!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1429	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_ecd2414d		Then, as if realizing something, he let out a small chuckle, rubbing the back of his neck.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1440	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_678f7050	svante	Sorry. I'm just so happy! It's just... I've never had a conversation with a real-life robot before.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1442	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_806e9cb0		Magnus suddenly clapped his hands together, his brown hair catching the light as he grinned.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1444	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_0d2b87a7	magnus	Me too! And now, I feel the poetic urge to compose a song in honor of our beloved robotic companion!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1446	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_173f4824		Magnus took a deep breath and, with the dramatic flair only he could muster, began to sing in an exaggerated operatic tone.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1448	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_805658eb	magnus	Oh, noble steel and gears divine! ~	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1450	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_36ea13c3	magnus	With spatula in hand, a chef most grand! Oh, dear Roboto, guide our pan! ~	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1451	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_910909e2		I exchanged glances with Svante, suppressing a chuckle. Is this the man who almost killed us?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1453	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_21390e61	svante	He's been like that since early morning.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1455	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_45082874		Roboto, however, didn't seem the least bit fazed by Magnus' impromptu serenade. The little automaton simply adjusted its grip on the spatula before addressing Svante again.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1457	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_c8ca96ec	roboto	We have a lot of delivery a-a-a-autobots in Mjoll, Sir Svante. Are you sure you haven't spoken to any of them before?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1459	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_a14dd901		Svante shook his head.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1461	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_6ee11ec1	svante	The Cheng Industries delivery bots don't really talk, Roboto.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1463	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_5dadee00	svante	Me and Kristin tried talking to one once, but all they do is sing a jingle.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1464	svante "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_7d8e519d		Roboto whirred again, processing the information.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1466	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_8a1a5b1a	roboto	I u-u-understand. You mean the Cheng Industries Jingle! Delivery autoboots are programmed to register the Cheng Industries Jingle as their automated response for any query.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1468	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_481c014b	roboto	H-H-H-Here at Cheng's, we bring change.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1469	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_f30aeb84	magnus	HERE AT CHENG'S, WE BRING CHANGE!!!~	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1470	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_6248ecf4	dorian	Dragon's bollocks, Magnus! You surprised me!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1471	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_5f8c3b6b		Roboto, still clutching the spatula, simply beeped in satisfaction.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1473	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_769fc363		Magnus, emboldened by his successful performance, placed a hand over his chest as if addressing an invisible audience.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1474	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_2880b071	magnus	A glorious melody, etched into the hearts of many! A song of commerce! Of unapologetic capitalism! Of-	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1476	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_b4f8550d	roboto	W-W-W-Would you like some help in cutting the daikon, sir Magnus?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1477	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_85a05d05		Magnus sighed dramatically, shaking his head as if he had just been gravely wronged.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1479	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_b7cac8ac	magnus	I don't need help, Roboto. A thousand thanks though.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1481	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_37f7b5c5		After a solid hour of work, we had finally finished all the preparations. Svante, Magnus and I handled the chopping-onions, scallions, daikon, and an assortment of other vegetables.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1483	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_3e33503c		Magnus, despite his flair for dramatics, proved surprisingly efficient at peeling and slicing. Roboto assisted where it could, handing us ingredients and even stirring a few mixtures under supervision.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1484	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_40affde7		By the time Weng and Tedda returned, the counters were neatly arranged with trays of prepped vegetables, cleaned fish, and marinated meats. Weng smiled in approval before effortlessly taking over the more delicate cooking-frying, broiling, and adjusting flavors with practiced ease.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1485	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_6177eec8		Svante yawned, rubbing his eyes before mumbling a quick goodnight and retreating to his room.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1490	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_cb9a36e3		I sank into the sofa with a sigh, exhaustion settling deep in my limbs. The warmth of the kitchen still clung to me-the scent of spices, the lingering crackle of oil.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1491	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_fc4e7868		Beside me, Magnus flopped down with little grace, his wings shifting as he got comfortable. The soft rustle of feathers filled the quiet space between us.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1492	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_aa1a79b3	magnus	Woo! I can't believe we finished all of that! My hands are still sore from the chopping.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1494	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_f884c4a8		He wiggled his fingers for emphasis, then flexed them dramatically as if they had endured some great battle.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1496	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_ae6a98b7	magnus	Oh, the toil of mortal labor! The weary hands of a soldier turned humble servant of the kitchen! Is this the fate I have been reduced to? From the clash of steel to the gentle kiss of a kitchen knife against daikon?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1498	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_3f414879	dorian	Magnus, are you seriously comparing chopping ingredients to fighting a war?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1499	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_4b949fb3		Magnus grinned, folding his arms.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1501	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_58fd6a9c	magnus	Precisely! And I-I, the valiant warrior-have emerged victorious once again!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1503	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_894f794d		His wings fluttered slightly as he leaned back, letting out an exaggerated sigh of satisfaction. I watched him quietly, my thoughts beginning to drift.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1505	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_eda7bac1		It was only last night that we rescued Magnus. The memory of it still clung to the corners of my mind-the rush of the wind, his wings outstretched like some celestial figure, the sheer relief of being alive.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1506	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_cce63ecb		I debated whether to bring it up. Would it even be appropriate? Would he shrug it off with that same careless charm, or would he acknowledge the weight of what he had done?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1507	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_32bcdb6d		But before I could decide, he began to hum. A familiar melody.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1508	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_557c1156		I turned my head slightly, listening as his deep, rich voice filled the space between us. The song was unmistakable-a traditional Galean ballad, one I hadn't heard in years.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1509	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_92c8312a	dorian	That song...	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1511	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_1a294e93		Magnus smiled, eyes half-lidded in contentment.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1513	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_e66e7fa1	magnus	Ah, you know it? Of course you do. It is the Song of Longing. A tale as old as the gales themselves.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1515	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_7ae862b1		He sang softly, the words carrying an old sorrow, a quiet yearning.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1517	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_81ac89b4	magnus	O sky above, how cruel you are, to gift me wings yet keep me far...	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1519	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_6335617f		I watched him as he sang, the way his fingers tapped idly against his knee in time with the rhythm.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1521	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_be68e98d		I didn't join in. Instead, I simply leaned back against the sofa, letting Magnus' voice fill the room. The melody curled around me like the wind itself-soft, wistful, full of yearning.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1527	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_0c142156		Magnus' eyes were half-closed as he sang, completely lost in the music. His fingers tapped lightly against his knee, keeping time with a rhythm only he could hear. There was something unguarded about him in this moment, something raw beneath the usual bravado.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1528	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_eb2fd3b1		When he finished, he exhaled, smiling to himself.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1529	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_000409c3	magnus	A beautiful song, isn't it?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1531	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_ceab5813		I nodded, reclining further into the sofa.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1533	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_b1a2b022		Magnus stretched his arms above his head, wings fluttering slightly as he relaxed further into the sofa as well.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1534	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_a16374f3	magnus	Ah, but enough of that. I mustn't let my heart grow too sentimental. We have a feast ahead, after all!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1536	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_04e949f8	dorian	O gentle breeze, please let me fly, so I may reach where heavens lie...	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1542	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_ff796f55		Magnus' voice faltered for just a second, as if surprised, but then he grinned, adjusting his pitch to harmonize with mine. His voice was richer, seasoned with experience, while mine was steadier, more grounded.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1544	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_4f5f8fb8		When we finished, Magnus laughed softly, a genuine warmth in his expression.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1545	"[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_cb1fffa5	magnus	Well, well. Not bad at all, Dorian. You've got the soul of a Galean troubadour hidden beneath all that paladin steel.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1547	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_59513c81	dorian	Don't get used to it.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1548	dorian "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_384df911	magnus	Oh, but now that I know you can sing, how could I not?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1549	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_c7a3db15	magnus	You sang the song well, Dorian. You may not have wings, but your voice knows the wind.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1550	magnus "[what]"
ch9_kitchen_common_97c03a9b		His wings fluttered slightly, a sign of amusement. There was a pleased glint in his eye, and though he said nothing more, I could tell-he was genuinely happy.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1552	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_60079c0c		Hours passed, and as the evening settled in, Yuxuan called for all of us to gather in the living room.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1566	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_ae301c6c		He entered with his usual air of effortless grace, his long crimson robes flowing like mist over water. His presence alone was enough to quiet the room.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1567	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_5a4c22bc		Weng followed closely behind him, her arms stacked with neatly folded garments, each one shimmering under the lantern light. The delicate embroidery caught my eye immediately-fine, intricate threads woven into mesmerizing patterns.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1568	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_fedaa0a5	yuxuan	Everyone, it is time to dress for the occasion.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1570	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_c2aeb4c2		He gestured to Weng, who carefully laid the outfits out for all to see.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1572	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_c6dc76f9	weng	They've been tailored to fit each of you perfectly.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1574	weng "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_30e6d655		Her voice was brimming with pride as she smoothed the fabric with careful hands.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1576	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_643168f2	yuxuan	The colors were chosen with intention.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1578	yuxuan "[what]"
