ch9_outfit_gather_cf12a4b2		Despite his deliberately dry tone, his eyes lingered on the stitching, a clear sign that he approved of the craftsmanship.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1601	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_4d6bc937		Then there was Magnus.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1602	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_fa5331f5		He stepped forward, his gaze sweeping over the garments as though he were staring at something divine. Slowly, he reached out, barely brushing his fingertips against the fabric.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1603	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_3151d2c0	magnus	These outfits look... STELLAR!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1605	magnus "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_6964f0cd	magnus	Oh, look how the threads of fate are woven into cloth! The artisans who stitched these must have whispered to the very stars, coaxing light and shadow to dance upon silk and thread!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1606	magnus "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_df1f1079	tim	I firmly agree, sir Magnus!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1607	tim "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_61d56126	niko	Yuxuan, you do realize we can't go to the Tianho Memorial, right?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1608	niko "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_74a4acd0		Weng paused. Even Elias' previous pouting seemed to freeze.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1610	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_0d271d44	svante	Sir Yuxuan... you said Father would be there, right?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1612	svante "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_424d1a2d	svante	I... I don't want to be seen.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1613	svante "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_b897f47d	magnus	Svante, you have a father? You did not mention this to me earlier. Do you two share a strained bond-	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1614	magnus "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_78d309e7	svante	I... I'll tell you later, Magnus.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1615	svante "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_ba8557b0		Chung-hee's arms were crossed, his expression unreadable.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1617	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_b9c0934a	chung_hee	Svante's right. As much as I'd love to challenge King Gustav right then and there, I doubt he'll fight fair.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1619	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_8d284e53	elias	Daddy, does that mean we don't get to eat Hinami fwan?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1620	elias "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_725ac379	dorian	We're just not going to the memorial, Elias. You can still have some. Hey, stop tugging my sleeve.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1621	dorian "[what]"
