ch9_outfit_gather_493a96fa	elias	Yeyy!!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1624	elias "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_d90dd6d2	tedda_alive	Aww, but we still won't see the festivities!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1625	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_d42cea17	niko	It's for the best. We don't want to risk getting seen by King Gustav.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1626	niko "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_49c467c8	yuxuan	Who said anything about being seen?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1627	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_c1ba9078		He stepped forward, his gaze sweeping over us like he was savoring the moment.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1629	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_c5ea1fe7	yuxuan	There is a place-one where we can watch everything unfold without a single soul noticing us.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1631	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_c74232cc	roboto	Master Yuxuan has m-m-m-made a place available so all of us can participate in the festivities. We will have a magnificent view of the memorial!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1632	roboto "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_9608dfa0	weng	Not only magnificent. But also romantic!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1633	weng "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_7ed042b5		I narrowed my eyes.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1635	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_505a98ad	dorian	And where exactly is this place, Yu?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1637	dorian "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_20275753		Yuxuan merely chuckled. His voice was like silk, smooth and unreadable.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1639	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_32852e05	yuxuan	Patience, Dorian... You'll see.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1641	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_b850320d		Magnus, of course, immediately seized the moment, launching into song with a dramatic flourish.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1643	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_96956707	magnus	Oh, secrets held in moonlit air, unseen eyes in silent stare-	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1645	magnus "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_9eddc1fa	magnus	But seriously. Where?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1646	magnus "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_c0ce60f9	niko	Agreed. I apologize for the bluntness, but I don't care if this place has a 'magnificent view.' What I care about is our safety.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1647	niko "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_45273367	svante	We need to be safe. I'm sorry. I'm just... very anxious. I don't want to see Father.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1648	svante "[what]"
