ch9_outfit_gather_379cb7e1		Elias wasted no time, eagerly grabbing a piece and taking a bite. The moment the soft custard melted on his tongue, his entire face lit up in pure joy.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1683	"[what]"
