ch9_outfit_gather_bf2c4e44	tim	A whole kingdom's worth of food! An entire feast!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1696	tim "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_5e83aa1b	tim	And mooncakes! And those soft, fluffy steamed cakes! And grilled skewers with that amazing sauce!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1697	tim "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_53e1f04c	elias	The sauce! The sauce!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1698	elias "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_ea39d52b		They both burst into giggles, their shared enthusiasm making even me hungry.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1700	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_bd528c9c	tim	Oh! Sir Dorian-Sir Niko told me that you're a great storyteller!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1702	tim "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_8c8ee768	elias	Ooh! Yes, Daddy is a great storyteller!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1703	elias "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_59a3afb1	tim	Really? Is that true? Sir Dorian, can you tell us a story sometime?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1704	tim "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_4fc520e7		The two of them looked up at me with wide, hopeful eyes.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1706	"[what]"
