ch9_outfit_gather_1f2c1a11		I smiled, ruffling Elias' hair before nodding.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1730	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_7866fc1b	dorian	Maybe once I'm free. I'll tell you both a story then.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1732	dorian "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_c9b445d5		Tim grinned, clasping his hands together.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1734	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_7af041dc	tim	Ooh, I can't wait! Please tell me something I haven't read before! Please!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1736	tim "[what]"
