ch9_outfit_gather_4af7735e		A gentle but firm knock echoed from the door. I sighed, setting aside my cup as I got up to answer. The moment I pulled the door open, I found myself face-to-face with Roboto, its metallic figure standing stiffly in the hallway.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1749	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_d0605cad	roboto	Master Yuxuan requests your presence, Special Guest.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1751	roboto "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_a1c85572		I raised an eyebrow.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1753	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_23e039e0	dorian	Special guest?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1755	dorian "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_ddedd72c	roboto	Yes. You are invited to b-b-bathe with him in the underground hot springs. This is for preparation in wearing the special outfits you will don for the Anniversary.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1756	roboto "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_d39262e3	dorian	Hot springs? I didn't know Yu had a hot spring here.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1757	dorian "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_117ea011		From inside the room, Tim piped up between bites of flan.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1759	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_b7c945c7	tim	Oh, yeah! Master Yuxuan has a hot spring here. It's natural!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1761	tim "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_5d893cb8	elias	Oh weally? Ish it nice?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1762	elias "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_2eb8ea99	dorian	Elias, don't talk when your mouth is full... Roboto, how exactly does a hot spring exist here?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1763	dorian "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_9465d9c4		Roboto's eyes flickered for a moment before launching into an explanation.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1765	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_5b4375dc	roboto	The underground hot s-s-springs are a result of geothermal activity. Heated groundwater rises from deep within the earth due to volcanic activity beneath Tianho's b-b-bedrock.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1767	roboto "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_8cb3574d	roboto	The mineral-rich waters are known for their r-r-rejuvenating properties.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1768	roboto "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_01fd0fc9	elias	Whoa... What's a geo-thermical?	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1769	elias "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_ac18747a	tim	It means the ground makes the water hot!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1770	tim "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_0d20a9fe		I chuckled, shaking my head.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1772	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_7a505471	dorian	Sounds luxurious, Roboto, but I need to bathe Elias first so he can get dressed in the outfit Yuxuan gave him.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1774	dorian "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_21caedf1		Roboto tilted its head slightly.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1776	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_9d7d45c0	roboto	Don't worry, sir Dorian. Miss Tedda will see to it.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1778	roboto "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_72268c6c		From the corner of the room, Tedda-Elias's ever-loyal stuffed bear-let out an indignant little squeak.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1780	"[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_288a180b	tedda_alive	Aww! But I wanted to relax too! I never get to do anything fun!	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1782	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_72bb96f0	elias	It's okay, daddy. Tim and I will be hewe.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1783	elias "[what]"
ch9_outfit_gather_b4a5a3ba	tim	Yeah! Go enjoy your bath, Sir Dorian! I'll make sure Elias doesn't eat all the flan before you get back.	game/11_chapter_09_p1.rpy	1784	tim "[what]"
