chapter_09_p2_e3a80160		Roboto nodded, its eyes flickering.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	132	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_f7824028	roboto	I have other matters to attend to. Please enjoy your time.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	134	roboto "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_613688eb	roboto	M-M-Master Yuxuan will join you momentarily.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	135	roboto "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_6cac3b02		And with that, the metallic figure turned and departed, his whirring echoing as he disappeared down the stone hallway.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	137	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_81bda8a8		Left alone, I took a step forward, only to pause when I noticed a figure already standing by the water's edge.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	138	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_cffd6b3f		Magnus.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	139	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_3f747a9f		He was dressed in a deep blue shirt with gold accents, a rare sight given that I saw him the entire day shirtless. But what stood out the most was the absence of his wings.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	140	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_dde04d02		I furrowed my brows. Magnus without his wings?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	141	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_bf4955bf		Magnus turned his head slightly, his expression calm.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	142	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_f1a25925	magnus	Dorian! Going to take a dip in the hot spring as well?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	144	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_8688d929	magnus	Look! I've made a discovery-an astonishing revelation, a truth hidden within my very being!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	145	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_4818af28		I raised a brow.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	147	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_bd68b8f2	magnus	Apparently, I can make my wings appear and disappear at will! A most convenient ability, wouldn't you say?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	149	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_127ddc6c	dorian	Convenient. Saves fabric, I guess.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	150	dorian "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_0aa7461a	magnus	Precisely. And, most importantly, it prevents... unfortunate accidents involving doorways and the backs of unsuspecting heads.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	151	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_196b52ba	magnus	Because I have, on numerous occasions, unintentionally struck Svante...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	152	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_231c25f9		He paused, rubbing his chin before continuing.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	154	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_5083d61a	magnus	And Yuxuan... And Chung-hee... And Niko... And Elias... And Tim... And Miss Weng... And Roboto... And Tedda...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	156	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_68ac9537	dorian	So... everyone. You accidentally hit everyone with your wings.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	157	dorian "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_9b409e39	magnus	Yes, everyone... But you! Everyone but you. But you must understand, my dear Dorian!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	158	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_6811423d	magnus	It was never intentional! A cruel twist of fate, a betrayal of my own grand appendages!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	159	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_b9efde5a		He placed a hand over his heart, looking entirely too pleased with himself.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	161	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_9c1b308d	magnus	But alas! The heavens took pity on me. I merely wished for relief, and lo and behold-like the parting of storm clouds, the burden was lifted!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	163	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_0ed553be		He rolled his shoulders once more, as if reveling in his newfound control. I chuckled, nodding toward his attire.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	165	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_8b52bce8	dorian	By the way, nice outfit. You clean up well.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	167	dorian "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_1b966177	magnus	Ah, such high praise from the esteemed Dragon of Gale! I shall treasure this moment.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	168	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_5580ddc2		I asked him where did he get the outfit.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	170	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_91c205bc	magnus	Ah, a tale most unexpected! Tedda, our diligent little dolly, was cleaning out Yuxuan's closet when she stumbled upon this garment-folded, untouched, a relic of time.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	172	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_3e95de07	magnus	I tried it on and Miss Weng and sir Niko loved it! Oh, the applause!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	173	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_08295ca5	magnus	But... it turned out that this was from one of Yuxuan's deceased old friend's clothes.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	174	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_f9c95e57		My eyes widened.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	176	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_9cfd0cc2	dorian	Shouldn't you return it if that's the case? What would Yuxuan think?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	178	dorian "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_81404662	magnus	I did show him. And he said, 'Better that you wear it than let it gather dust.'	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	179	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_d53dcb5b	magnus	So here I am, wearing a memory... but making it move again, making it breathe. Perhaps that is what clothes are meant to do-carry stories forward, instead of letting them fade into silence.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	180	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_4300c48f		He took a sudden step back and struck a pose-one hand on his hip, the other extended outward as if he were about to take center stage in some grand performance.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	182	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_9cccd526	magnus	Tell me, Dorian-does this not suit me like the sky embraces the sun? Like the waves cradle the moon? This shade of blue-it was destined to grace my form, was it not?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	184	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_969f1800	magnus	Or, in more common terms-blue suits me, don't you think?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	185	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_a64509d8		Magnus gasped, his expression shifting into one of delighted triumph. He spun again, this time with even more flourish, letting the fabric billow as he moved.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	192	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_dabe0282	magnus	Ah! I knew you were a man of refined taste! You see it, don't you, Dorian? This hue, this elegance-it was made for me!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	194	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_c03d11b0		He placed a hand on my shoulder, his eyes shining with genuine joy beneath all the dramatics.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	196	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_82be5b8a	magnus	And to have such recognition from you... well, my dear friend, I shall cherish this moment until the stars themselves fade from the sky!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	198	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_96ea2419		He took a deep breath, straightening his posture before giving me a wink.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	200	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_80bfbb27	magnus	Blue it is, then. A color worthy of a Gale-born soul such as mine.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	202	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_74cf98ce		Magnus froze, his expression caught somewhere between shock and absolute betrayal. His hand clutched at his chest as if I had struck him with an arrow.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	206	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_b062205c	magnus	No? No?! Dorian, you wound me!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	208	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_13d04cfb		He turned away dramatically, bringing a hand to his forehead as if the weight of my words was too much to bear.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	210	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_f96e4ed1	magnus	Then tell me, O Great Fashion Oracle, what shade would better suit my divine essence?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	212	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_00f21ff0		He peered at me over his shoulder, awaiting my response. Whether I gave him an actual color or simply let him stew in his devastation, I knew one thing for certain-he wasn't going to let me forget this anytime soon.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	214	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_aa30ffb5		Shaking my head, I reached for my belt and started undoing my clothes. Magnus followed suit, both of us stripping down to our undergarments before stepping into the water.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	216	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_8ab0dcf3		The moment I sank into the warmth, a deep sigh escaped me. The heat seeped into my muscles, melting away tension I hadn't realized I was carrying. Magnus settled in beside me, his gaze drifting over the glowing fungi, the sheer ambiance of the place.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	217	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_bf3af7ca	magnus	It's beautiful here. Almost... unreal.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	219	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_c976710b	dorian	*sighs* This is the life...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	220	dorian "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_071accb7	magnus	*sighs* This is perfect...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	221	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_7c794058		We both closed our eyes and let the gentle hum of water lapping against the stone take us into tranquility.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	223	"[what]"
chapter_09_p2_dd457a3d	magnus	...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	225	magnus "[what]"
