chapter_09_p2_f75c7403	magnus	A breath of peace, a moment's grace, Lost within this sacred place.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	227	magnus "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_439d616e		A few minutes passed in peaceful silence before Magnus shifted slightly, tilting his head toward me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	229	"[what]"
