chapter_09_p2_e48ed17d	svante	But for that long? I don't think you can do it. How are you not hungry? I'd pass out.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	284	svante "[what]"
chapter_09_p2_e7105011	niko	You rely on Enoch's words. And pray. One does not live by earthly sustenance, but by every word that-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	285	niko "[what]"
