chapter_09_p2_da355552		Steam curled lazily through the air as we settled deeper into the hot springs. The warmth seeped into my muscles, unraveling tension I hadn't even realized I carried. For a moment-just a moment-it was peaceful.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	345	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_d141683c	huli_jing	Hihihihi~	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	358	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_3c6e531a	niko	Wait... Did you hear that?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	360	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_0e0e8f8f	chung_hee	No. For the hundredth time, no.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	361	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_d25c689f	magnus	I heard it. I think it's... a laugh.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	362	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_d141683c_1	huli_jing	Hihihihi~	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	363	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_254cad5e	yuxuan	Eek! What was that?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	364	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_0f00f8d2		A whisper of laughter, high and melodic, like wind chimes swaying in a summer breeze. The air itself thickened, humming with unseen energy. A delicate floral scent, subtly sweet, curled into the steam rising from the springs.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	366	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_7e8e8bd4	huli_jing	Ahh, what a luxurious sight! A gathering of warriors, scholars, and lost souls-all marinating like dumplings in a pot.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	368	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_fcf8da36		A faint tinkling of bells accompanied soft footsteps, the sound of water rippling as a figure gracefully stepped into view.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	370	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_097233fc		Perched atop a rock at the edge of the spring, half-shrouded by mist, was a fox.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	371	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_7abc30f4		Nine, impossibly long tails curled elegantly around her, their tips flicking idly, as if brushing away unseen dust motes of magic. Her golden eyes-slit-pupiled, like molten amber-watched us with quiet amusement.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	372	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_3fceaa54	huli_jing	Oh, don't look so startled, my handsome bathers... You wouldn't deny a lonely fox the pleasure of a little conversation, would you?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	376	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_9e5ff9ad		The being's laughter echoed through the mist, melodic yet uncanny, like a song sung in reverse. The steam curled tighter, shifting unnaturally, as if the very air around us was holding its breath.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	378	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_a63d4464		A faint pressure settled in my chest-an instinctual warning, ancient and primal. Then I saw it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	379	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_7c5e624e		Not just the nine flowing tails...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	380	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_25f7084b	svante	She's a fox spirit. A huli jing.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	384	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_c2c14e61	svante	My mom told me and Kristin stories. Said they were born from moonlight and starlight. They've lived for centuries... maybe since the first breath of the world when the Weaver made the Tetrad.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	385	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_d96bb7b2	dorian	And what do they want?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	386	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_3bec2b86	svante	That's the thing. No one ever knows.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	387	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_1acc2be2		His voice lowered, nearly reverent.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	389	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_2e81109f	svante	Some are kind. Protectors. But most of them? They bring ruin with a smile. Trick kings into giving up empires. They love riddles, deals... They whisper and let you think you've won-until the price seeps in through the cracks you forgot were there.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	391	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_147bc791	svante	They've whispered to emperors... to gods. Inspired love, betrayal, even genocide. And sometimes, they simply watched. Waiting.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	392	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_116d9ac7		The Huli Jing tilted her head, her smile curling wider, inhumanly so.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	394	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_1285dd71	huli_jing	Mmm... clever boy. A shame your mother never told you the most important part.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	396	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_dca2f410	huli_jing	We never knock twice.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	397	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_86535f4a	niko	Yuxuan, you didn't say there'd be an ancient spirit here!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	398	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_20eee0b4	yuxuan	But I... I always bathe here! Miss Weng too! Tim as well. We never-!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	399	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_45b452e0	huli_jing	Of course not, my entrepreneurial little beetle. We don't come for the scent of soap, sweat, and money.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	400	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_45536717		She tilted her head, and her nine tails unfurled behind her like a blooming chrysanthemum, each one stirring the steam with ethereal grace.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	402	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_4ae51173	huli_jing	I came because I smelled something rare...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	404	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_9b1a2711	huli_jing	Among your gathering... I scent the blood of an emperor. The son of a king. One who has been chosen by the death god. One... touched by a deity's longing. And one...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	405	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_f724f874		She turned her gaze to me. And the air stilled.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	407	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_3b5c22f0	huli_jing	Praise the Prosperity Dragon indeed...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	409	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_eec3793f	chung_hee	What do you want, spirit? Speak plainly.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	410	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_1f955666	huli_jing	This spring... the mist that dances on its surface... the dreams that bloom when one sinks into its warmth-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	411	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_abebc2c1	huli_jing	These were once mine... before I was betrayed. Before I was slain mercilessly by the Death God Enoch himself.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	412	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_73a4caeb		Niko, lounging with a towel over his head, didn't even lift his gaze.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	414	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_6f5668e4	niko	You creatures probably deserved it, given your kind's reputation.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	416	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_3e57b32f	huli_jing	Understandable... for a lapdog to bark what it cannot comprehend. But I'll pretend I didn't hear that-your heart beats too loud with something else.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	417	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_2e669c81		One tail coiled like a ribbon around her waist, the others slowly dancing in the air like smoke given form.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	419	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_d4affeb4	huli_jing	Now, centuries later, you've stumbled in my spring. And I can smell it... all of you. You're tangled up in fate, in longing.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	421	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_6a7dcd14		She looked at me again, that same unreadable expression.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	423	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_2e7d619f	huli_jing	I am lonely. And I wish to play.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	425	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_c64297e2	huli_jing	If you agree to my game, I promise: I will never trouble you again. In return, I will answer one- and only one-question. From the spirit world. From the place where truths hide and mortals dare not look.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	426	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_f9511475		The mist pulsed once, as if alive.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	428	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_5f06012c	huli_jing	No tricks. No riddles. Just truth.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	430	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_08f86d0c		My heart quickened. One question.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	432	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_5f7a080a	prosperity_dragon	The Huli Jing knows more than she speaks. The knowledge she carries lies coiled in riddles older than your bloodline.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	434	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_f2ff440f	prosperity_dragon	She could speak answers that even the Tetrad have forgotten.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	435	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_8f06bc6a	huli_jing	But if you refuse...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	436	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_b7bef378	chung_hee	Then what? You'll kill us?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	437	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_67c6bb9d	yuxuan	AH! Prosperity Dragon save me!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	438	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_61d85e78	niko	You're more than welcome to try.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	439	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_ac824d66	huli_jing	No, no. I don't spill blood. My fur is too good for that.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	440	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_b5955f5a	huli_jing	I'll curse this spring for a thousand years. Every bather after you will think they've slipped into paradise, only to discover they're soaking in...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	441	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_8fa7f222	huli_jing	Fermented foot fungus stew.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	442	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_33a47294	chung_hee	Pardon me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	443	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_6d1d0c73	magnus	F-Fermented foot fungus stew?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	444	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_6f454497	yuxuan	EWWW! I bathe here all the time!!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	445	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_ca5d7b0d	svante	I... I think I'm gonna be sick... blarrrghhh!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	446	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_e6f5c648	huli_jing	Hahaha! Your guests will be smelling like the Tetrad's feet by the time they finish bathing!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	447	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_bc00da51	niko	*sighs*	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	448	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_1155fff6	huli_jing	So, my beautiful dumplings... Shall we play?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	449	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_72403391		I looked around the spring, its mist now feeling heavier somehow-less soothing, more watchful. My eyes met Svante's. He was looking around too, brow furrowed deep in thought.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	451	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_77ee4c1d	svante	She said she can answer one question...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	453	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_97f6bcc8	niko	Don't be stupid, Svante.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	454	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_d8aba704	svante	I'm not being stupid, Niko. I was just thinking that maybe we need it!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	455	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_4b234b68	niko	She said no tricks-but that's the trick. You said it yourself: spirits like her oftentimes never play fair. You'll think you're getting a straight answer and wind up cursed, or worse.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	456	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_90092503	chung_hee	Niko's right, Svante.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	457	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_7bac0977	chung_hee	Every version of this tale ends the same way. We had stories like that in Kyeongjang too. Not of the Huli Jing-but spirits with games, riddles and promises.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	458	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_26953416	chung_hee	An innocent hero. A ruined life. Don't be a storybook idiot, Svante.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	459	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_e4235505	svante	I... I hate to say it, but you may be right.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	460	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_7647bc32	magnus	But... what if she's telling the truth? Not all spirits are malevolent.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	461	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_05d89cd9	magnus	One question. One truth. Think about what you could learn. Something no divine, no scholar, no channeler could tell us.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	462	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_5c776d25	magnus	Isn't that worth a little risk?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	463	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_f08bd26a	yuxuan	I want to do it!! We have to do it!!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	464	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_33cf84f8	chung_hee	But... why?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	465	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_0812bab7	yuxuan	I-I always bathe here! So does Miss Weng! And Tim! We come here every day! If she curses this spring, it'll smell like foot fungus for a thousand years!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	466	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_62248a65	yuxuan	I can already imagine the smell! I have to do something!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	467	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_f653a8a4	yuxuan	I AM CHENG YUXUAN, an inventor of great renown. And I will NOT BE SMELLING LIKE SOMEONE'S FOOT!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	468	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_14ecc539		He nearly slipped on the rocks trying to make his point.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	470	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_10c621be	yuxuan	AHHH!!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	472	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_ae035169	dorian	Yu! Careful!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	473	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_7e4c8e60	yuxuan	Do you know how expensive this place is?! I spent a lot of coin to refurbish this place!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	474	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_561c99ca	niko	How much would that be?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	475	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_eee60f5d	yuxuan	A LOT!!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	476	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_d21204d2	huli_jing	Ahhh, the little beetle speaks sense~	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	478	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_7b720be7		She cooed, lounging now on her side, chin propped up by one delicate hand.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	480	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_37cb7d4e	huli_jing	So? What will it be, dumpling?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	482	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_f847993f		The mist curled around my fingertips. I didn't know what pushed me to speak, but the words came anyway.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	484	"[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_cb467fb9	yuxuan	Do it! Do it!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	486	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_90f5b3fe	dorian	I'll do it. I agree to the game.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	487	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_jing_1edf2f81	chung_hee	Fine. I trust you, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	488	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_23ecc8b4		The mist curled tighter the moment the words left my lips. It coiled like a serpent around my limbs-soft, almost warm-and then turned cold.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	505	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_bd5aaf5e		The springs vanished.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	506	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_624ee4b3		In their place, snow.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	507	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_a20aa658		The world around us shimmered, then cracked like glass. Wind howled past us, biting at our skin, lifting flurries of snow into the air like ash. But I still felt the heat from the hot springs.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	508	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_3e69dff5	magnus	O-Oh. Oh no. We're still in our undergarments!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	510	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_f0361ac5	yuxuan	AH! I can't be seen wondering around in my undergarments! Think of the bad publicity!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	511	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_0ef992a2	svante	W-What?! This is Mjoll! This is my hometown!! I can't be here! Not like this!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	512	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_1df08b86		He wrapped his arms around his chest, cheeks blazing red.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	514	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_de379ee6	niko	You're not used to your brothers seeing you in your undergarments?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	516	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_3252230f	chung_hee	It's not real. Look at the snow-doesn't melt when it hits your skin.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	517	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_921b7172		He held out a hand. True enough, the flakes dissolved before they touched him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	519	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_9e0a0bb9	dorian	We can also feel the heat of the hot spring's waters.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	521	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_1a3640ea	chung_hee	It's just an illusion. A trick. The spirit's game.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	522	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_24c479da		The snow parted. In the middle of the town stood a man, shackled and bare-kneed in the snow. Blood streaked the front of his torn tunic. Before him, crumpled in the red-stained snow, were two villagers-a woman and a child. Motionless.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	524	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_9f55ce5d	huli_jing	This man, Fynn Hjorth, is a follower of the death god.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	526	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_d3aee41d	huli_jing	He killed his neighbor and her daughter in the dead of night. Stabbed them both. Took their coin. I'll leave you to it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	527	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_66ea0142		Fynn raised his head. His face was pale, eyes sunken and wild.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	529	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_3de83034	fynn	Enoch told me to do it! He told me to cleanse them! To protect the town!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	531	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_5c3b1324		She sat atop a stone throne of ice that hadn't been there before, tails draped like velvet across her lap.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	533	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_621ddd93	huli_jing	Now, as part of our little game... you will judge him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	535	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_83a48047	huli_jing	Death, exile, or forgiveness.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	536	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_39559de0		I stood frozen. Not from the cold, but from the sheer weight of it all.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	538	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_c7944417	chung_hee	We were to judge a man's life. Such a burden to carry.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	540	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_28aae58a		The wind grew louder. Or perhaps it was the breath of the spirits gathering to hear our verdict.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	542	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_5b57b81e	huli_jing	Spirits, be our witness.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	544	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_df252357	huli_jing	Choose wisely, my dumplings. There is no appeal in this court. Your decision is FINAL.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	545	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_63492b02		I looked at the man in the eyes. A man broken, or a man twisted? A misguided zealot? A monster wearing a mask of devotion?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	547	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_ebeffefa		But now... the judgment was mine to cast.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	548	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_c282303c		I closed my eyes. The cold air kissed my skin, but I felt nothing-only the weight of my decision. I raised my hand, flame flickering to life in my palm. Not a warm flame. A crimson one.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	554	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_61ea9a62	dorian	He took two innocent lives. That cannot be forgiven. We sentence death.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	556	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_b85a3d33		A tremor rippled through the ground. The snow around Fynn shattered into sharp shards as the spirits surged up from beneath. He screamed-but it wasn't a scream of fear. It was something worse. A scream of belief.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	558	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_b3b2475e	fynn	I was chosen! I was doing Lord Enoch's work! You'll see!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	560	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_11f5931f	svante	You murdered a mother cradling her child. You didn't cleanse anything. You just wanted to kill!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	561	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_459bb996	yuxuan	You deserve it! Degenerate!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	562	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_2d95451a		The mist devoured him. No blood. No remains. Only silence.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	564	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_181a714c	huli_jing	Hmm... decisive.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	566	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_bcba70e1		Her voice was unreadable-neither impressed nor disappointed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	568	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_17da4495		She tapped her heart. The snow continued to fall. I felt heavier.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	569	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_df3fd825		I hesitated, staring into Fynn's frantic eyes. There was no remorse there-only delusion. But killing him would make me no better.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	574	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_996cdc34		I extended my hand. A cold blue light bloomed in my palm.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	575	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_cac407c7	dorian	You'll not die here, Fynn. But you'll never walk these lands again.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	577	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_8eac7daa		The snow beneath him shifted violently, like it was trying to reject him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	579	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_91c1d1ff	fynn	No... no, this is my home! I did what I had to! For the town! For Lord Enoch!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	581	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_2acaf413		The wind howled louder. His chains dissolved into frost, and something unseen dragged him backward into the mist-screaming, kicking, shouting for Enoch to save him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	583	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_314e63ec	fynn	Lord Enoch! Lord Enoch your servant begs you! No!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	585	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_dd702254	chung_hee	Good. Take him far away from here. Should he ever return, death would await him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	587	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_607bcd25	huli_jing	Hmm... merciful, but not weak.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	588	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_bcba70e1_1		Her voice was unreadable-neither impressed nor disappointed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	590	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_2a393a08		The silence was unbearable.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	594	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_9ef3f355		Everyone waited. The spirits. The snow. The fox. I took a breath. My heart was hammering.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	595	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_a362e465	dorian	He's broken. Not evil. If he can live with what he's done... let him. We grant forgiveness.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	597	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_2d140582	fynn	You... you're not killing me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	598	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_d42ac880	niko	Yes. Continue walking in Enoch's path, brother.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	599	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_de0e379e	yuxuan	W-What?! Why are we letting him go? What is wrong with you, Dorian?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	600	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_d84efe61	chung_hee	Kindness or naiveness? I hope we aren't straying towards the latter.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	601	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_bcba70e1_2		Her voice was unreadable-neither impressed nor disappointed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	603	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_3483c712	huli_jing	Not ready to decide, dumpling?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	607	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_362e0023		I took a breath and stepped forward. The wind bit at my skin, the illusion of snow somehow feeling far too real. I knelt in front of the man they called Fynn Hjorth. His eyes darted wildly.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	609	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_7d3061e5	dorian	Tell me what happened. In your own words.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	611	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_d738ae88		He looked up. Eyes-clouded, red-rimmed-twitched wildly in their sockets.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	613	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_edbff5fe	fynn	They were touched by rot. The mother... I saw her. I heard her whispering at night, speaking to the dark, speaking to Saelara. She was offering prayers when she thought no one could hear.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	615	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_cf7bdeb4		The name landed like a stone in the snow. I felt more than heard a subtle shift in the mist.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	617	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_cfa9c793	fynn	And the child. The child had silver eyes... the kind only a Tetrad follower would birth.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	619	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_e6583666	fynn	Enoch sent me the vision. Clear as fire. Told me to cleanse them. To save this town.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	620	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_fda3f867		He grabbed my wrist.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	622	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_e22fd7e5	fynn	I did it for Him. For Lord Enoch. His voice roared like a tempest! Oh, glorious, radiant death!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	624	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_8c24907f	fynn	I felt His hand guide mine when I struck with the axe. I watched the life leave their heretic eyes, and I laughed, I laughed for Enoch!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	625	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_31dbe697		He broke into hysterical giggling. I pulled my hand away. I stood, heart a stone in my chest.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	627	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_4e6482a7	chung_hee	Madness. I've heard stories like this in Kyeongjang. Men claiming divine voices told them to murder their own kin. It's never justice. It's bloodlust wrapped in prophecy.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	629	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_cfee222a	magnus	But... is it really forbidden? Tetrad worship?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	630	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_925e1e79	svante	In Mjoll, yes. It's punishable by death. Especially Saelara... Her worship is considered the gravest blasphemy. Father says her name poisons the wind.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	631	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_d8b69080	svante	But I rarely see Tetrad worshippers punished for it. Some keep their heads down. Live quietly. They're not hunted unless they cross a line.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	632	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_d7b3c292	svante	Still... my mother always told me: "Too much mercy for the killer becomes cruelty to the dead."	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	633	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_41b8d007	niko	Maybe Fynn did see Enoch. You'd be surprised how often the divine walks among us, especially when desperation opens the door. You speak of madness-but what if he really was chosen?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	634	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_cb3ca3d7	yuxuan	Are you joking? He murdered a mother and her child in the name of your rotting corpse deity! You defend this?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	635	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_3d198531	niko	Only those who follow a sane god can understand the cost of divine obedience. Unlike others who would worship an overgrown lizard.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	636	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_8c571901	yuxuan	LIZARD?! HOW DARE YOU- The Prosperity Dragon ISN'T A LIZARD!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	637	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_de2cc0a6	chung_hee	The two of you, calm down.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	638	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_689348c5		Magnus took a careful step toward Fynn, expression soft but troubled.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	640	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_c7bc799e	magnus	You took two lives, Fynn. A mother and her child. Look at me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	642	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_a7b77993		Fynn raised his head, trembling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	644	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_6f619761	magnus	Do you feel it? The weight of what you've done? Do you... regret it?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	646	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_e285fb65		Fynn stared at him. For the briefest second, a flicker of uncertainty passed through his eyes-like a man waking from a terrible dream. Then his lips split into a smile.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	648	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_11814457	fynn	No. I was chosen. I'd do it again if my Lord commanded me to.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	650	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_e213b8d6	fynn	ALL HAIL LORD ENOCH!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	651	fynn "[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_21985510		The air turned still. Even the snow seemed to freeze in place.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	653	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_mjoll_cf9f97f8	huli_jing	Ooooh... how deliciously complicated. Mortals and your morality. So-will you judge, dumplings?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	655	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_2e90a215		Then, the air shifted again.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	673	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_9acc7d0f		The bitter cold of Mjoll vanished like melting frost. In its place came warmth-salt-laced and sun-kissed. The world opened into color and light.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	674	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_78377607		Suddenly, we were standing atop windswept cliffs beneath a wide blue sky. The scent of the sea wrapped around us, briny and deep. Waves thundered against the rocks below, their rhythm steady.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	675	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_434a4970	svante	W-We're not at Mjoll anymore.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	677	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_aeb31953	magnus	Really? Where are we now?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	678	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_9ae5dca4	niko	Hinami...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	679	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_7ac39050		He stepped forward, lifting his face to the wind.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	681	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e41605c5	niko	This ocean scent... It's unmistakable. It's from Hinami.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	683	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_960157e4	chung_hee	That's right. You said you were from Hinami...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	684	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_3a15b510	huli_jing	That's right! Welcome to Hinami, little dumplings! Ahhh... can you feel it?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	685	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_eb3461df	huli_jing	The salt in your lungs, the sun on your cheeks? A perfect day for judgment.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	686	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_06d2a076	svante	A-Another judgment?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	687	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_927d7c40		She turned, fox tail swaying.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	689	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ca753d70	huli_jing	Look behind you, dumplings.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	691	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e0edbc80		We did.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	693	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_0cd69ccc		Chained to the jagged cliff face was a man. Arms outstretched, his body crucified by salt and time. His skin was rough and sun-darkened, his clothes tattered and clinging to his frame. Bruises ringed his wrists where iron bit into flesh. The tide lapped at his ankles like a patient predator. With every swell, he shivered.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	694	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e9fd8710		Below him, kneeling in the wet sand, was a woman. Her shoulders shook with sobs as she clutched a bundle of soaked cloth to her chest.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	695	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_44672980	emi	Please! Please, he didn't mean any harm!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	697	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_9938ad82		Her cries echoed across the shore. Even the seagulls were silent.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	699	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_5c1f5fc0	huli_jing	This man is Katashi Morita. Once a fisherman. Now heralded as a thief.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	701	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_4847f789		She gestured to the girl, who clung to a soaked bundle of cloth.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	703	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_616daa22	huli_jing	And that is Emi, his daughter. She's been crying since dawn.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	705	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c0251da5	emi	Please! Save my father. I beg you!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	706	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ec27e17b	huli_jing	Ah, this game is divine. You know the rules, my dumplings. Like before-you judge.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	707	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_09884699	magnus	Just like before... Justice is not a sword, but a wave. It wears you down. It erodes the soul. It asks you to stand in the storm and never flinch.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	708	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_6faa1a0c	huli_jing	Well said, pretty one.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	709	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_46a42ed9	huli_jing	So, beloved judges... what now? This island's laws are clear. Theft is theft. And the punishment?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	710	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b04f5879	huli_jing	DEATH.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	711	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e61ad87f	yuxuan	D-Death? Niko-tell me that's not true.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	712	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_02574a1a	niko	It depends on what was stolen. On who it was stolen from. And why. Hinami's laws are old... and not always kind.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	713	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_3217bab8	huli_jing	But here, your judgment holds sway. What will your choice be?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	714	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b80d3261		I looked at my companions. Magnus whispered, barely audible.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	716	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_af06dc1b	magnus	The burden of choice falls to us.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	718	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_16871966		I closed my eyes, the weight of the island pressing on my chest. When I opened them, I lifted my hand.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	724	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e19dd087	dorian	Hinami's laws are cruel... but they are clear. And you, Katashi Morita, have broken them. I pass the judgment of death.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	726	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_89724f73		Emi's scream pierced the sky.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	728	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_357bc8c4	emi	No-NO! You said the judges were kind! Please-no! He did it for me! It should've been me!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	730	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b8668cd1		She stumbled forward, crawling toward the shore as if she could reach him. Her voice cracked, desperation raw and bleeding.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	732	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_d6e8542b		Katashi didn't resist. His eyes were steady, weathered like driftwood.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	733	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_579ed08f	katashi	Then let the Tetrad see my blood... and judge them who made me choose between hunger and crime.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	735	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_d53149cd		He turned his gaze to his daughter, voice soft now, almost inaudible against the crashing surf.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	737	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e353cedd	katashi	Emi... my daughter... live. That's all I ever wanted for you. Please... live.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	739	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_2caf9d78	emi	Father! No! NO! *cries*	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	740	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e1939ce7		The Huli Jing exhaled, slowly, her smirk dimming like a flame losing air.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	742	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c78a6718	huli_jing	Ah, cold justice... Spirits, let it be done.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	744	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_29dd0742		There was a faint sound-like metal on stone-as the chains coiled tighter. The wind howled.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	746	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ad28cfd3		Then, the wave rose-taller than any before, unnaturally high, as if the sea itself was delivering judgment. It crashed forward.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	747	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_22125faf		And when the water receded... he was gone.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	748	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ab5bf456	emi	NO! FATHER! FATHER! PLEASE!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	750	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_a98442d1		The tide tugged gently at the hem of her dress, as if trying to comfort her. But there was no comfort here.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	752	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b49d3b55	svante	I... I thought we were better than this.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	754	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_7280c5d9	magnus	I hope you're proud of yourself, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	755	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_a000c2cc	niko	The law is not kindness, it is structure. And Katashi knew what he risked when he broke it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	756	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ecdad3b3	niko	We cannot let emotion blind us. That is how justice becomes chaos. Dorian did what needed to be done, even when it hurt. That is the mark of a real judge.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	757	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b9d20efa	yuxuan	"wE cAnnOt lEt eMotIon bLind Us" Hmph!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	758	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_f3f46fa4		Niko rolled his eyes.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	760	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c268f3bf	huli_jing	Mmm. So be it. One life ends... another sorrow born.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	762	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b9a17913		I stepped forward, my voice cutting through the mist.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	766	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_1beb8f3f	dorian	Your crime cannot be ignored. But your reasons... I understand them. You will not die, Katashi. But you are banished. From Hinami. Forever.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	768	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ad2f6e0f		Katashi looked down at his daughter, sorrow blooming across his weathered features.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	770	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_1c201f0b	katashi	Exile is a quieter death... but it is a death I can meet on my feet. Thank you. For sparing me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	772	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_79b2f38d	emi	Wait-what? No! Where will we go? We have no coin, no boat-how will we survive?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	773	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_3a0ee9e1		Before the wind could carry her tears, the chains snapped. Not with violence-but with finality.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	775	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_187a5e2c		Dark shapes emerged from the rocks-shadows, cloaked and faceless-guiding the father and daughter away from the cliffs.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	776	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_80e724c2	katashi	We'll survive, Emi. We always have. One tide at a time.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	778	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_84c155dd	emi	Yes, Father.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	779	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_cef55a83	chung_hee	He will live. That, in itself, is a mercy most do not receive.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	781	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_42adec21	niko	This is mercy, by Hinami's standards. And mercy... is a rare, dangerous thing. Enoch, please forgive us...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	782	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_2941c2f8	yuxuan	I don't care about Enoch's forgiveness.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	783	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_f3fb72d9	magnus	Wherever the sea carries you-may it carry you to peace. I wish you both the best.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	784	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_270ea6d4		Huli Jing twirled one tail lazily.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	786	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e96e4307	huli_jing	A soft punishment wrapped in thorns.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	788	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b53a3611		She tilted her head toward me, eyes narrowing playfully.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	790	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_4f5d0b66	dorian	You stole-but not for greed. For love. For survival. You chose your daughter's life over obedience to a cruel system. And for that...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	795	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_88a8fde2	dorian	You will not die. You are forgiven.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	796	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c6f6ebcd		A silence followed-still and wide as the sea itself. Even the wind paused.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	798	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_deb1153d		Katashi's mouth parted, trembling. His knees buckled, but he caught himself. Tears began to spill freely, carving tracks through the grime on his cheeks. He lowered his head in reverence.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	799	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ba00059b	katashi	You... you honor me more than this island ever has. I have no words, only gratitude. From the deepest part of me... thank you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	801	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e00d604a		Beside him, Emi sobbed and threw herself around his waist, her arms locking tight around her father.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	803	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b89ae42a	emi	Thank you!! Thank you! You saved him-you saved us!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	805	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_f1bfa8eb		With a sound like falling rain, the chains shattered, not broken by force-but by will. They fell into the surf, vanishing beneath the tide.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	807	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_39abcddf	niko	This will... upset the elders. Enoch, judge us gently. We have strayed from the letter of the law-but perhaps not its spirit.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	809	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_93df7815	magnus	Let them be upset. If the law cannot bend for the starving, then it deserves to break.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	810	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e23ed84e	yuxuan	Yeah! What Magnus said!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	811	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_597b30ab	svante	I hope the world is kinder to you from now on. I hope it gives you peace. You both deserve it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	812	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_63972f49	magnus	Justice without mercy is a sword that rusts in its own blood~ Let this tide wash away the weight-let love be understood~	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	813	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_680cd0c3		Katashi and Emi turned, bowing deeply. The shadows returned-silent escorts. But this time, they walked behind, not leading them like prisoners-but following them like guardians.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	815	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_cce4e03e	huli_jing	...!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	817	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_0818dfed		Huli Jing smiled wide, teeth sharp but gleaming like polished pearls. Her silver tails flicked in satisfaction.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	819	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c3696066	dorian	Before we make any decisions... I want to speak to Katashi first.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	823	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_bb3e6d91	emi	Please, sirs! I beg of you!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	824	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_a63e5908		Tears streamed down her face, her hands clutching the soaked hem of her robe.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	826	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_5787ed47	huli_jing	Don't worry, dumpling. Your father's fate will be spun soon enough.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	828	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_22251fbd		She tapped her chin with a lacquered claw, eyes gleaming.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	830	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_a6248ac2	magnus	Kind sir... What do you have to say for yourself? Do you deny the charges laid upon you?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	832	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_16c1a712	katashi	I do not deny it. I broke the law.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	833	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_f67318b9	katashi	But tell me-is it justice to watch your child starve? Is it noble to let your daughter bathe in saltwater while nobles hoard rose oils and perfumes? I am no saint. But I would steal again if it meant she could eat.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	834	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_fe102f52	chung_hee	Eat, you say? Then enlighten us, Katashi Morita. What prize did you deem worth breaking the King's law?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	835	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_83f60260	katashi	A loaf of bread. A sack of rice. A bar of soap. Two dried fish.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	836	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_688d14a3		Svante looked like he'd been punched.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	838	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_f3b8e534	svante	T-That's it? Just food and soap?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	840	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ac593ce5	emi	We were starving! We hadn't eaten in days. Please... he didn't want to steal. I begged him not to... but-he did it for me!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	841	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_fbed45fb	dorian	Where did you steal the food and soap?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	842	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_587f4c57	katashi	... I stole from the home of Lord Nakai.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	843	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_4794e9d1	niko	Merciful En-... Lord Nakai?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	844	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c1fc4c19	niko	You've either got guts or a death wish. Might as well stroll into a yaoguai king's den and ask for a cup of tea.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	845	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_656574c9	svante	Who is Lord Nakai, Niko?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	846	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_9c460fe5	niko	One of Hinami's high lords. Second only to King Tatsuya Fujiwara. He commands the military and answers to no one but the crown.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	847	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_aeec24b4	niko	The man would have you flayed for touching his wine cellar, let alone stealing from his kitchens.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	848	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_deb52124	katashi	I knew the risk. But his servants throw away more food in a week than most villages see in a season. I couldn't watch her waste away. Not again.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	849	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_209e1eb9	chung_hee	Again? What do you mean... 'not again'?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	850	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_be844015	emi	We had... a sister. Her name was Maru.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	851	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_30c11d14	emi	She died last winter. Her belly swollen from hunger, her skin cracked and cold. We had no firewood. No rice. No medicine.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	852	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c18616ea	katashi	Lord Nakai never paid us our wages. We toiled from dawn till night, patching nets and scrubbing floors. But when the season ended, his men said we were too late-too slow. No coin. No food. No justice.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	853	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_dd3cdb81	katashi	I swore I'd never lose another child.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	854	katashi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_9041eb10	emi	Please! I beg you-don't take him from me...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	855	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c327d4ec		She suddenly stumbled toward Chung-hee, dropping to her knees and clutching his bare ankles.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	857	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_9f13e757	emi	Please, your highness, your grace-anything! Take my life instead! I'll serve-I'll go in his place! Just let him go!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	859	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_9cbd1c6a		She lowered her face, lips trembling, and pressed them against his foot. Svante blushed and shielded his face.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	861	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_3c7fb1e4	svante	N-No! Please don't do that, we're still in our undergarments!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	863	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_3af3d73a	chung_hee	H-Hey... that's-this is highly improper. Please rise. There is no need for... such a display.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	864	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_b9277014	huli_jing	Hey! No touching the judges! That's against the rules!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	865	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_128b5710	yuxuan	This is preposterous!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	866	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_e25804da	yuxuan	I am Cheng Yuxuan, an inventor of great renown! I've contributed to the advancement of technology in countless kingdoms! And yet, here I am, in my undergarments in front of all to see!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	867	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_465639ce	yuxuan	You could have at least gotten us some clothes before making us judges, you know!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	868	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_1a2ee37a	huli_jing	And where's the fun in that?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	869	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_16744403	emi	Please! I'll scrub floors-I'll beg Lord Nakai himself-I'll cut off my hair, my hands, just please... don't let him die!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	870	emi "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_6cd5310f		Her words hung in the salt-heavy air, raw and aching.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	872	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_56b669c7		I turned to the others, the wind pressing against my back like a tide urging me to speak.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	873	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_4c03238d	dorian	You've heard him. Now I ask you-what do you think?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	875	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_a38c5cc2	niko	According to the teachings of Lord Enoch, the law is the spine of civilization. Harsh? Perhaps. But mercy without order is rot without bone.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	876	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_48193457	niko	"When one man steals with no consequence, a hundred more will follow. Then who feeds the honest?" That's what Enoch teaches. The law must stand-or all things crumble.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	877	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_f5c2ee35	chung_hee	As the Emperor of Kyeongjang, I've had to pass judgments that weighed heavy on my heart.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	878	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_93f3f161	chung_hee	Aunt Ji - I mean, my royal advisor once told me, "Compassion must walk behind law, not in front of it."	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	879	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_5921d354	chung_hee	Order is fragile. If the law bends for sympathy, how long until it breaks for greed?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	880	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_1b99f5ef	yuxuan	But what kind of justice punishes a starving man trying to save his daughter? Are we really protecting society?! Or just the pride of the rich?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	881	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_310cb56f	niko	You're one to talk. You're one of the rich yourself.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	882	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_0ee368b1	yuxuan	I try to feed as many as I can! I give what I have! I- I don't punish love with death! If we are going to punish him, at least don't kill him!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	883	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_38bb2265	svante	W-We should forgive him. Please. What kind of world punishes love like this?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	884	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_2e3a9b9e	svante	A father's love... I...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	885	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_922bacc4		Then, Magnus stepped forward. His eyes were on Katashi, but his voice was lifted to the crashing sea.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	887	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_4d3e897c	magnus	I don't care what the law says.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	889	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_c8b4d84c	magnus	Justice without compassion is cruelty dressed in gold. If the law demands we turn away from the hungry, then the law has already failed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	890	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_43545f7f	magnus	Look at her. Look at him. Tell me-are these the faces of danger? Are these threats to the throne?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	891	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_645839e0	magnus	Break the chains. Feed them. Heal them. That is the kind of kingdom I would fight for.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	892	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_4cb807a2	niko	This isn't about threats, Magnus. It's about precedent. The moment the law yields, even once, every tyrant will find cause to twist it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	893	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_050481aa	chung_hee	As much as it pains me, I must agree. The law is not a feeling-it is a pillar. Without it, we drift.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	894	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_fb3e272c	huli_jing	Mmm... such passion. Such division. Oh, my dumplings... what a delightful dilemma.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	895	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_92054dfb	huli_jing	Well then, Dragon of Gale... it falls to you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	896	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_63c4ff11		I then turned to the Huli Jing.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	898	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_hinami_ebe5ab2e		I turned to look at them all-at Katashi, crucified by justice; at Emi, drowning in desperation; at the sea, endless and roaring. The world held its breath.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	899	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_e214027b		The air shifted again-sharp and dry, like brittle parchment touched by flame. The scent of lotus blossoms and aged ink reached my nostrils, thick and heady. My feet met smooth stone, cold to the touch. I looked around slowly.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	917	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_078e4478		We were no longer near the sea.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	918	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_4bc98717		Towering pagodas surrounded us, their curved rooftops gleaming with gold leaf beneath a pale sky. The very ground vibrated with power-a coiled pressure humming just beneath the surface.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	919	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_e4ccccef		I blinked, adjusting to the light that struck the stone courtyard like polished jade. And then-I saw her.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	920	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_7206566e		A woman knelt in the center of a marble platform, chains wrapped tight around her wrists. Her hanbok was torn, stained from travel or shame. Her long black hair hung in tangles, but even in ruin, she carried a strange grace.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	921	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_dae6b742		She raised her head. Her hollow, desperate eyes locked onto one of us.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	922	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_dadf8dc8	seorin	Y-Your Majesty?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	924	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_bfbf188f		Chung-hee was startled. His face flushed, and he shifted awkwardly, hand tugging at the edge of the towel slung over his shoulders. We were, after all, still in our undergarments.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	926	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_a9cdc2a0	chung_hee	Seorin seonsaengnim?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	928	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_193da801		Huli Jing cooed from above, now reclined on a gilded parasol carried by an unseen force, her nine tails fanned out like a blooming chrysanthemum.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	930	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_9182aef7	huli_jing	Ahhh, so he does know her. Even better. The final judgment will cut closest to the heart.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	932	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_3fa3d163	dorian	Wait... You know her, Chung?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	933	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_05f76b5c	chung_hee	She was my past mentor. In alchemy. Before I ever wore the crown.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	934	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_ce276290		He narrowed his eyes at the ornate architecture.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	936	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_01f21eb3	chung_hee	With this vision, I take it we stand in Kyeongjang?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	938	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_b3e523a7	huli_jing	Right you are, dumpling! Welcome back to the capital!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	939	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_34a236a6	svante	W-Wow... This is Kyeongjang? It's beautiful...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	940	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_3b7b2d94	yuxuan	PRAISE THE PROSPERITY DRAGON! KYEONGJANG! AT LAST!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	941	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_df045ea2	yuxuan	I have waited for this moment my entire life! My life's work has led me to this moment! Niko, pinch me! I must be dreaming!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	942	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_9d57a8d3	niko	This is still an illusion, Yuxuan. Part of the Huli Jing's game.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	943	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_78329b62	magnus	Beautiful, magnificent Kyeongjang! Oh, how noble your towers, how gleaming your-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	944	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_3b99d1f7	dorian	Magnus. Please. Save the ballad for later.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	945	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_1716e327	chung_hee	Seonsaengnim. Explain yourself.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	947	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_b843cb54	seorin	Y-Your Majesty! I didn't mean for any of it. I swear it, I didn't.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	948	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_72866dc4		Her voice cracked as she tried to rise, but the chains held her fast.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	950	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_c4401628	huli_jing	Seorin Im. Scholar. Once one of the most promising alchemists in the Empire. Tasked with crafting a powerful medicinal salve for the royal hospital-one that would heal plague, infection, and injury alike.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	952	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_14e33fe9	huli_jing	But her alchemy was flawed. The ingredients, unstable. Instead of healing the sick...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	953	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_6fbf146c	huli_jing	...it poisoned them. Fifty-five souls. Gone. Thirty-seven imperial soldiers. Eighteen children. Every last one who drank the salve died within hours.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	954	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_c39dca2e	magnus	Those... Those poor children...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	956	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_9ac3b1aa	dorian	Tetrad above...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	957	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_16f085cc	niko	Unforgivable. I've seen things like this in Hamatame. Villagers dosing the sick with faulty tinctures, hoping for miracles. It always ends in death. You don't gamble with lives-not as a healer. Not ever.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	958	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_f5c181e4	seorin	I-I didn't know, Your Majesty! It was a mistake! Please, I beg you!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	959	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_63ff9030		She turned to Chung-hee, voice trembling, heart in her throat.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	961	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_e49533be	seorin	You know me, Your Majesty... You know I would never do this deliberately.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	963	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_66228479		Around the platform, ghostly silhouettes began to appear-spirits with soft blue eyes and pale robes, their hands clasped before them as if in mourning.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	965	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_6f1c51e3	huli_jing	So... my beautiful dumplings. For the last time. Death, exile, or forgiveness?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	967	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_cbb08df9	niko	Last time? Great.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	968	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_a1bf948b	huli_jing	The dead don't speak, but they remember. And they are watching.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	969	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_251bb05b		She grinned, sharp as a blade.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	971	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_3f24a245	huli_jing	Judge wisely, Dragon of Gale. This one cuts to the bone...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	973	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_4fe0d6a7		I closed my eyes. The weight of it all pressed down on my chest like iron.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	979	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_65da1699	dorian	Seorin Im. By your own admission, your salve was unstable. Your negligence took the lives of children, soldiers... innocent people who trusted you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	981	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_53cb5df1	dorian	We pass the sentence of death to you, Seorin Im.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	982	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_57cd3a6b	seorin	No... Your Majesty-please! You know me-!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	983	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_386f5cae		But her voice broke as Chung-hee turned away.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	985	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_4eca0d48	chung_hee	I did know you once.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	987	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_5cb23e73		The shadows moved without a sound. Like a tide, they rose-liquid, cold, inky-and swallowed her whole.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	989	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_0a4b167a	seorin	No! No! Get away! NO!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	991	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_d2fc122e		They enveloped her. And then- Silence. She was gone.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	993	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_5914688a		Yuxuan muttered a prayer under his breath.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	994	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_dca41904	yuxuan	By the Prosperity Dragon... may her spirit find peace.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	996	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_d086d306	niko	She made her choice long before this moment. Enoch teaches: mistakes may be human, but consequences are divine.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	997	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_7c7f14d0	chung_hee	I am sorry, Seorin seonsaengnim. I wish the stars had guided your path elsewhere.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	998	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_6569abd4	magnus	...So many lives. So many lost. But in the end... it was her hand that made the poison.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	999	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_41b3aca6	huli_jing	So cruel... and yet so just. Your judgment echoes through the heavens, dumpling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1000	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_1efcb49a	dorian	Your negligence caused suffering on a scale we can't ignore. You are exiled. You will never set foot on Kyeongjang soil again.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1005	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_9b13824e		I turned to Chung-hee, who gave a solemn nod.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1007	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_c16625be	chung_hee	I have no qualms with the judgment, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1009	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_12210529		Her voice cracked, but she did not argue.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1011	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_80ee0fc1	seorin	I... I understand. Thank you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1013	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_2e4c6703	chung_hee	Farewell, Seorin seonsaengnim. I wish the stars had guided your path elsewhere.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1014	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_65d5e9ee		Chains dissolved into smoke. She crumpled to the ground, then rose, trembling. The spirits turned their backs on her as she was led away by shadowy guards.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1016	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_11ec23a9	seorin	Farewell, Your Majesty.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1018	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_49118ec7	yuxuan	That was fair. Harsh... but fair.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1020	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_29dfafe3	niko	She'll never escape the guilt. That's a heavier sentence than steel.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1021	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_ca15b657	huli_jing	A punishment without blood... elegant, in its own way.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1022	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_082167d7	dorian	Seorin Im. You made a mistake. One you'll carry the rest of your life. But we believe in redemption... and we believe you would give your life to take it all back.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1026	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_427a162d	dorian	And for that, we pass the judgment of forgiveness to you, Seorin Im.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1027	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_1e2cdac9	seorin	A thousand thank yous would not suffice. I... I will not waste this chance.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1028	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_2866da1b		Her wrists slackened as the chains uncoiled, shimmering into mist. She gasped, then clutched her own hands tightly, tears running freely.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1030	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_fc5e3d39	seorin	Thank you... Thank you...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1032	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_1837faab		Chung-hee stood motionless, the wind ruffling the towel at his shoulders. His hand trembled slightly at his side. Then, with difficulty, he gave a single, solemn nod.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1034	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_01f1b2c2		The shadows returned-not as hunters, but as silent escorts. They gathered around Seorin like quiet sentinels and began to lead her away.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1035	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_d3f3a301	yuxuan	Dorian buddy, that was brave! I think you did the right thing.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1037	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_2a0e9deb	magnus	I wouldn't claim it was the right thing... But if justice can wear a gentler face, then let it be this one. My heart is at peace with the path we've chosen.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1038	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_ccfdcf27	niko	You forgave her. And now she walks away. Just like that.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1039	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_b7ce8a63	niko	I hope those fifty-five souls get to walk too. I hope the parents of those children get to wake up tomorrow without weeping. I hope the soldiers get their years back.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1040	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_dcb8b3f6	niko	But they won't. I hope you understand that.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1041	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_5df2b502	svante	I... I want to believe people deserve a second chance, but... I kind of agree with Niko. That many lives? It's hard to forgive fully.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1042	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_a7df6e1a	huli_jing	Oh, you tender little dumpling. Mercy is a delicious flavor.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1043	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_27b03410		I turned to Chung-hee and met his gaze. I gave a nod. He returned it, slower, and he stepped forward.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1047	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_f31d6d02	chung_hee	Seonsaengnim. Start from the beginning. Tell us everything.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1049	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_3bb7d3b2	seorin	Yes, Your Majesty. I will.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1050	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_ab36dc27	seorin	I was tasked to create a salve powerful enough to heal plague, infection, burns... everything. I studied night and day.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1051	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_b4b2e97e	seorin	I tested it thoroughly on rats, on plants, even small doses on myself. Every result was stable. As the Almighty Tetrad Immortal Renji is my witness.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1052	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_cefb99a5	seorin	But the supply-when it scaled to mass production... something changed. I swear I didn't alter the formula. I had no idea the ingredients had spoiled, or reacted differently in bulk...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1053	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_4ae17405	niko	You didn't realize it was poison after it was distributed?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1054	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_dd91ec71	seorin	No-I didn't... I didn't even know until I heard the soldiers were dying. Then the children...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1055	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_8fca9a92		She looked down.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1057	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_f9bd502f	seorin	By then it was too late. I rushed to the lab, ran test after test. It was the main reagent-it had turned unstable in storage.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1059	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_908bddf3	seorin	But it was already in the hands of the sick. Already killing them.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1060	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_d79a5d96	yuxuan	This is... this is a disaster. A total collapse of safety protocols. How was this even allowed to pass inspection?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1061	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_963db9ab	yuxuan	Cheng Industries better not be cutting corners like this. I'll need to audit our entire healing division. This can't ever happen in Tianho.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1062	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_99821e4b	seorin	And then I was arrested and brought here...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1063	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_4bf866ed	seorin	Your Majesty, please... I beg you. I was careless, yes. But not cruel. I never meant for harm.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1064	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_97efbc3d		I turned to the others. My chest was tight with the gravity of what I had to ask.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1066	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_56600caa	dorian	For the last time. Tell me... what do you all think?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1068	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_2c2e5e66	niko	Even if it's just a mistake, it's a crime. And crimes have consequences. If we let her walk free, we say their deaths meant nothing.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1069	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_a0aa74c2	niko	Fifty-five lives, Dorian. Fifty-five.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1070	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_2ec6af99	svante	Niko's right. Their lives can't go unanswered. Forgiveness doesn't erase the dead.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1071	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_9b7dc535	yuxuan	I don't know. I... I see her remorse. But can we risk others thinking a mistake like this is acceptable?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1072	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_f80c5d0e	magnus	She should not die. Death is final. She would learn nothing. Heal nothing. Let her live with the grief she caused-and do something with it. Make her rebuild what she destroyed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1073	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_a2945d00	yuxuan	But letting her walk away unscathed... Would that be fair to the ones that died?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1074	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_5613e1b7		I turned again to Chung-hee, but before I could speak, he raised a hand.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1076	"[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_3fe44d6b	dorian	This is your empire, Chung. Your people. If you wish to render judgment, I will stand aside.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1078	dorian "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_9070fe56	chung_hee	No. You should be the one to deliver judgment, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1079	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_a47b2dbb	chung_hee	I am the Emperor of Kyeongjang. And because of that-I cannot be the one to judge her. I knew Seorin once. Admired her even. That bond clouds my mind even now.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1080	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_9a8933c8	huli_jing	Ohhh, I love this. Look at all of you, writhing on the hook of morality.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1081	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_a20a05df	seorin	Please, Your Majesty!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1082	seorin "[what]"
ch9_judgment_kyeong_ebf034cb	huli_jing	So have we made a decision, dumpling?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1083	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_bf4a28a3		The air shifted one final time.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1101	"[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_948cb8dc		The incense, the towers of Kyeongjang, the weight of our choices-all of it faded like breath on glass. The cold dissolved. The thunderous silence of the spirit realm gave way to something gentler.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1102	"[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_bd394401		Heat. Steam. The sound of water lapping gently at stone. We were back. In the hot springs.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1103	"[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_324cb6eb	yuxuan	By the Prosperity Dragon's blessed scales-we're back!!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1105	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_d503365d	niko	That wasn't just illusion. That felt real. Too real.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1106	niko "[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_6302efdb	chung_hee	It was an illusion. I think. Tetrad above, I hope it was.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1107	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_94476f64		Magnus stretched dramatically, droplets flinging off his arms like golden ribbons.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1109	"[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_1fafc76b	magnus	And yet... we're still in our undergarments. Perhaps now we can enjoy a proper bath without sentencing anyone to death.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1111	magnus "[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_ae5b98a8	svante	I don't think I'll ever look at justice the same way again...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1112	svante "[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_926e12db	huli_jing	Mmmm... Delicious, wasn't it? Judging mortals is no neat affair. It tangles the soul.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1113	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_judgments_back_279bf25b	huli_jing	Makes it chewy. Like good dumplings.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1114	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_4b88807d	huli_jing	As for your judgments, my dear dumplings... I was a little underwhelmed. Mmm. Lukewarm, like reheated noodles.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1128	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_aa2f0586	huli_jing	I gave you a game. A gift of truth. And you judged... mediocrely. Is that even a word?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1129	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_5ab0acfa	dorian	But you promised. You said you'd leave the springs.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1130	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_ee545f26	yuxuan	Yes! You swore it on your tails, remember? We upheld our end.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1131	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_889dc864	huli_jing	And a promise is a promise. I shall never again haunt these springs, nor return to soak my tails. You'll never see me here again. Pity... I was beginning to like you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1132	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_e6e4c1b4	magnus	And we were starting to like you too, beloved fox!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1133	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_8d880e70	magnus	Farewell to the fox with the nine shining tails... To judgment and laughter where truth always sails...~	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1134	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_7980f187	huli_jing	Wow! I love it, dumpling! I'm going to miss you!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1135	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_33296a59	niko	Wait. You also promised one answer. One truth.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1136	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_f0d4ddba	huli_jing	Ah... but you failed the game. No answer for you. But I am not without gifts.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1137	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_a4b0a4be		She snapped her claws-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1139	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_low_bf819cbe		FWOOMP.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1143	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_8c0c8ab9	huli_jing	As for your judgments, my dear dumplings...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1154	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_325e8688	huli_jing	I am beyond delighted. Compassion with justice, side by side... How refreshing.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1155	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_1e3417db		A shimmer of foxfire circled her ankles as she floated down gracefully onto the steaming surface of the spring.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1157	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_f904c388	niko	Well... that's reassuring. I was starting to question everything.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1159	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_bb90e5c7		Chung-hee, ever the stoic, crossed his arms and gave the faintest, coolest nod.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1161	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_c00b60a2	yuxuan	THANK YOU, PROSPERITY DRAGON! YESSS!!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1163	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_5e9273b2	magnus	I was sure I'd end up cursed. Or bald.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1164	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_343f79e4		Huli Jing floated closer to me. The lavender steam coiled around her as if drawn by her warmth. Then her golden eyes narrowed, a glint of something ancient sparkling behind them.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1166	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_42d2badb	huli_jing	As a reward, I will grant something I haven't done in centuries, sweet dumpling. One question. Any question, and I will answer.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1168	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_66244415		The air stilled. Even the steam seemed to hold its breath.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1170	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_361f86d3	svante	My mother used to tell stories about this... She said the Huli Jing only ever answered a single question as a reward before. Just once in all her lifetimes...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1172	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_57fb1b52		My eyes widened. Is that true?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1174	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_896818e5	dorian	Really? Who did she answer?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1176	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_c13691a4	svante	Li Mengtia. The Divine Tetrad of Knowledge and Wisdom. That was a thousand years ago.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1177	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_c7895a27	chung_hee	Dorian. Ask about the future of Ena. We need to know if the Divine Weapon still poses a threat.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1179	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_2716063b		My heartbeat slowed. The fox spirit smiled, nine tails curling gently around her.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1181	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_3753468a	huli_jing	So, my dumpling... ask. One truth, one mystery, one thread in the grand weave of fate. I will answer. Just once.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1183	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_2b916681	dorian	What's going to happen to Ena?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1189	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_e25318aa		The question hung in the steam like a thread pulled tight.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1191	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_ecfc5b45		The Huli Jing paused, tilting her head. One tail slowly wrapped around her arm like a silken ribbon.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1192	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_260a4d2b	huli_jing	Ahh... a noble and unselfish question. Very well, little dumpling. I will show you. But only for a moment. One breath. One heartbeat.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1194	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_051461ad		She lifted a single clawed finger to my forehead. Pain. Light. Fire.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1196	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_51e4a6b2		A searing jolt ripped through me. My breath caught in my throat as visions burst behind my eyes.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1197	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_8e8bb127		Visions exploded in my mind- A crowned figure of fangs and molten eyes standing atop a throne of bones. Villages drowned in darkness. Temples burning under a red sky.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1198	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_79550117	huli_jing	He has awakened. The harmony of Ena breaks. But the tide has not yet turned...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1200	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_53f13986		She leaned closer, her many tails coiling behind her like stormclouds.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1202	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_065d4304	huli_jing	Dragonkin... Only you and your companions can stop him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1204	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_6a3b9ee1		I swallowed hard, my hands still shaking. But she wasn't done.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1206	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_43deeafe		Her voice dropped to a whisper that slid beneath my skin.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1207	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_458b44dd	huli_jing	He will come to you. Soon. He will make an offer. A deal. One that promises power... vengeance... salvation. He will make it tempting. He will make it feel right.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1209	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_78d680d3	huli_jing	Decline it. Do NOT give him the Divine Weapon. Do NOT give him Magnus. If you want Ena to survive, decline it without hesitation.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1210	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_8390d7a2	huli_jing	Or Accept it... if you want to doom your world. Your choice, dumpling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1211	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_3ec77470	huli_jing	But... since you passed my test with such heart, I doubt you will choose wrong.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1212	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_46199c32	magnus	Someone's making you a deal? What kind of deal? Who is this bastard? When does this happen? What does it have to do with me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1213	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_8e4e99ff	chung_hee	Beware him, Dorian. Such creatures twist language like silk. They don't lie. But they do mislead. They'll offer you fairness... even justice. But beneath it, always: rot.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1214	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_5cc2b444	dorian	Thank you. For showing me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1215	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_aca2c830	huli_jing	You can absolutely thank me by making the right choice, dumpling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1216	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_d2923c83		Her tail brushed my cheek like a whisper.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1218	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_4b9e983e		I remembered them. Elara.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1222	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_402a6aab		Daniel. Emily. Sarah. Lucas.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1223	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_e8e4c6d7		Their laughter. Their warmth. The sound of their feet running across the wooden floors of our home in Gale.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1224	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_b011030e		I felt the ache again. That terrible hollow ache I never dared to touch.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1225	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_69473215	dorian	How... how are my wife and the kids doing?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1227	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_48fdbdbd		The question slipped from me before I could stop it. My voice cracked.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1229	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_1eadacc5		The Huli Jing's smile faded. Her playful poise stilled. Her eyes, golden and ancient, turned solemn. There was a softness to her now-a reverence I hadn't seen before.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1230	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_d901b7bf	huli_jing	Elara. That's your wife's name, isn't it, dumpling? Daniel, the eldest. Emily, so clever. Sarah, the dreamer. Lucas, your little star.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1232	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_e0b25de9		She gestured with a paw, and soft golden mist coiled from her tails as they lifted and coiled like ribbons of starlight, swirling into the air.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1234	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_8d3f70f3		They stood beneath a warm, endless sky. Smiling. Whole. Unscarred by the world.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1235	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_e6e0f746		Elara's arm rested around Sarah's shoulder. Daniel stood tall, hand protectively over his younger siblings. Emily clutched a bundle of flowers. Lucas was... laughing. Running in circles like always.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1236	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_c5247aef		Behind them loomed a great golden gate, etched with stars and music and language I couldn't read but felt in my heart.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1237	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_4a69ad1a		And just beyond that- The Halls of Xianlun. Realm of the noble dead. The honored. The brave. The pure.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1238	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_4024285d	huli_jing	They walk where pain cannot touch them now, dumpling. Brave, every one of them. They knew courage. They knew love. And that was enough.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1244	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_993b48fb		A melody I couldn't name filled the air-like lullabies sung.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1246	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_5bd2154a	huli_jing	They rest in song, Dorian. You gave them your everything. And they carried your love with them.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1248	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_32f80492	huli_jing	They want you to live your life. And live you shall.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1249	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_c55234d3		My knees gave out. I fell.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1251	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_574aab3c		Niko was there-quiet, steady-catching me before I hit the ground.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1252	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_25ed2745	niko	Easy, Dorian. Breathe.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1254	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_dd83664a	yuxuan	They made it to Xianlun. That's all any of us could hope for.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1255	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_ef89a0aa	magnus	Xianlun... The great halls. Rest in peace.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1256	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_66e581c6	dorian	Thank you... for showing me. I needed this.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1257	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_e0d0e042	huli_jing	You're welcome, dumpling. And when your time comes... they will be the first to greet you at the gate.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1258	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_0ccf9a1e	dorian	What's waiting for me in my future?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1262	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_d0edcbef		The Huli Jing's ears twitched.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1264	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_33eb716b	huli_jing	Your path is a tangle, dumpling. Woven of heart and blade... but you wish to know who walks beside you in the end, hmm?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1266	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_4176f215		She touched my forehead. Visions bloomed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1268	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_279096b8		Not of battle, nor glory-but moments. Shared laughter. Late-night talks. Someone bandaging my wounds.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1269	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_a002feb1		A hand reaching for mine under the stars. A voice calling my name as if it was the only name they ever knew.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1270	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_17add978		My companions. One of them. But which one? The vision blurred-never showing their face. Just the feeling. Of being loved. Truly. Without weight or duty or fear.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1271	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_0d71624a	huli_jing	I will not name them. But your true love... is already beside you. All that's left-is for you to see them clearly.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1273	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_821c1ae8		The vision faded. I blinked, disoriented.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1275	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_e176397a	chung_hee	Was that a prophecy or a romantic prank?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1277	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_8507e39b		Yuxuan blushed, refusing to look up.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1279	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_dad7562e	yuxuan	T-The possibility of... me and Dorian... I-I wasn't prepared for that.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1281	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_26a7b331		Magnus smirked.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1283	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_9d21096c	magnus	Did she show you me? Come on, you can say it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1285	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_1965dc4f	niko	Magnus, don't you have a woman?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1286	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_4a19ce8b	svante	Niko, he's been frozen for Enoch knows how long. Odds are she's dust.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1287	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_eca253ad	huli_jing	You all chatter like baby sparrows. But here, Dorian, more truths for your heart-if you dare take them.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1288	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_df911423	huli_jing	There will come a moment when your future lover will be the one to rescue you. And when that moment arrives... you must trust them. Let them save you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1289	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_dc8ce8d8		She flicked a tail, and for a heartbeat, I saw fire. Pain. Then- hands catching me before I fell.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1291	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_b1b7c2c5	huli_jing	And-there is a child in your life. The most important soul to you right now. There will come a time when they will need you the most... At that instance, choose your child over spending time with your love, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1293	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_64fe16a5	huli_jing	Lastly... never betray your lover. No matter how cruel the world becomes. Or how tempting it may be. Be the man they believe you are.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1294	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_5218a251		I swallowed hard. Another lover. Even hearing the words felt like betrayal. Could I even love again? Did I want to?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1296	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_ce75bc95		Part of me whispered no.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1297	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_7ed9c2dc		But another part... the part that had long been silent... trembled.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1298	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_4d7154b5	dorian	...Thank you. For showing me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1300	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_728597e9	huli_jing	You can thank me by honoring them when the time comes. Be faithful, dumpling. With all your heart.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1301	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_625e0583	dorian	Okay, real question: What's the secret to Gao's flan?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1306	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_16b8cb94		Silence.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1308	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_4237e1e4		A long, awkward beat of silence.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1309	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_6da48c2d	niko	...Merciful Enoch.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1311	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_b3b88237	huli_jing	Gao? You mean the soldier?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1313	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_91b0cf0b	yuxuan	Dorian means Li Gao. He's a retail worker for Cheng Industries. And yes, he was a soldier before. He makes... I mean his mom makes insanely good flan.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1314	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_aab74bf5		Huli Jing's tails froze. Her eyes went wide.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1316	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_88f93f09	svante	Can you imagine being one of the only mortals in history to be granted a question from an ancient, reality-bending fox spirit-and you ask about flan?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1318	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_f040eaba	yuxuan	Dorian buddy, umm... I literally own the company he works in. I could've just... bought the recipe.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1319	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_5812c3ca	huli_jing	Ohhh, dumpling! I adore it! Li Mengtia asked me about the essence of knowledge. You ask about custard.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1320	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_af771b03	huli_jing	You are an icon. You are a legend. And you are the moment.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1321	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_96f48f45		She twirled midair, tails drawing shapes in the steam, and whispered.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1323	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_59254b9f	huli_jing	It's salt. Just a pinch. Right after pouring the custard, before it sets. It sharpens the sweet. A secret as old as war and love.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1325	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_c5ffa7e9	chung_hee	I KNEW IT! I knew it! I knew there was a mystery in that flan!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1327	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_ebaacb69		Everyone turned.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1329	"[what]"
