ch9_huli_reward_high_c4ce5296	niko	Not you too, Chung.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1332	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_63c989c3		Chung-hee froze mid-celebration. His cheeks flushed a little pink. Then, in perfect imperial fashion, he straightened his spine, dusted his undergarments and tucked his arms behind his back.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1334	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_d07aa248	chung_hee	...I was merely confirming a culinary hypothesis. Nothing more. Carry on. And stop calling me His Majesty.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1336	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_8737baa3	magnus	? O Flan Divine, fit for a throne, praised by the Emperor all on his own... ?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1337	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_fa55d14d	chung_hee	Stop.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1338	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_a0ba31fa		Huli Jing: Just for you, Dragon of Gale. Another gift. One that is very handy.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1340	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_bd19648a		Her eyes sparkled as she leaned forward.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1342	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_c92415df	huli_jing	Choose one of these men.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1344	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_4fbe6433		The humid air from the hot springs clung to my skin, curling tendrils of steam around us. I could feel the heat rising not only from the water but from my own cheeks as well.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1346	"[what]"
ch9_huli_reward_high_224432ac		The Huli Jing's smile deepened as I leaned closer, my voice dropping into a low whisper, almost swallowed by the bubbling of the spring.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1347	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_89bf80ae		Yuxuan straightened, hopeful.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1364	"[what]"
