ch9_huli_love_975a849d		His whole face lit up like the midsummer lantern festivals in Lanliang.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1368	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_17f90359	yuxuan	Dorian~! I knew it! I knew this was destiny! Take that, Niko!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1370	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_c718507f	niko	...What did I do?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1371	niko "[what]"
