ch9_huli_love_4c45a405		She twirled in the air, one tail looping into a perfect spiral before she carved a sigil of light in midair. She tapped my chest with one claw, and warmth flooded through me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1374	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_4f981144		I felt an odd tingling sensation.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1375	"[what]"
