ch9_huli_love_ea1c3967		Niko arched an eyebrow, skeptical.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1383	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_bd9faa6e	niko	Choose me? Choose me for what, exactly?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1385	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_1b74ba11	huli_jing	Hmm... The doctor who walks with death. The prophet of Enoch. Steady as stone, cold as snow, yet tender underneath. Delicious.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1386	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_b609f37a	magnus	? Oh Healer of mine come soothe thee. Thine path is mine and yours to- ?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1387	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_2e20ac04	niko	Magnus, quiet. Besides, you got the lyrics all wrong.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1388	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_33241e8a		The Huli Jing drew a sigil in the air with a claw and touched my heart. I felt an odd tingling sensation.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1390	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_8352a194	dorian	I choose Svante.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1396	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_c9b9f9a1		Svante flinched at the attention, cheeks red. His hands fidgeted.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1398	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_dcf1850c	svante	You... You really mean that, sir-I mean, Dorian? Choose me for what?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1400	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_4432d902	huli_jing	Awwww! My sweet dumpling! You chose the softest bun in the basket!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1401	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_12e78546	chung_hee	Sweetest? He was sent to assassinate me yesterday.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1402	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_430a3188	svante	I-I beg your forgiveness once more, Your Majest-!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1403	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_56638a2f	chung_hee	Svante, I jest. A ruler who cannot laugh has already lost half his kingdom. And I already accepted your apology. I do not give those lightly.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1404	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_d5c1c74e	svante	I... Thank you, Chung.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1405	svante "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_a7dd7b84		The Huli Jing danced in the air, and with a flick of a claw, etched a glowing sigil in the steam before pressing it gently to my heart.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1407	"[what]"
