ch9_huli_love_73733e68		Chung-hee's expression faltered for a moment. Just a moment.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1415	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_ba759c7d	chung_hee	You honor me, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1417	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_c41920bf	huli_jing	The Emperor of Kyeongjang! Oh, I didn't know you were into royalty, dumpling. A scandal! A story! And-wait, he can read our minds! Everyone-think pure thoughts!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1418	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_21a72351	chung_hee	I'll pretend I didn't hear that.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1419	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_8ccc5eca	huli_jing	Teasing, your Majesty. Just teasing. You're a difficult one to crack.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1420	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_33241e8a_1		The Huli Jing drew a sigil in the air with a claw and touched my heart. I felt an odd tingling sensation.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1422	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_5b080202	dorian	I choose Magnus.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1428	dorian "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_06b041a0		He gasped, both hands dramatically clasped over his chest.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1430	"[what]"
ch9_huli_love_a9ca9d1f	magnus	I knew it! The stars were right! The harp sang to me last night!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1432	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_c3f25215	niko	Of course it did...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1433	niko "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_72734b02	huli_jing	An unknown heart, bright and wild. He'll break it, you know. But he'll write you a song for every piece.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1434	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_67836b08	magnus	? Love's a fire, bright and bold-let it burn or leave you cold~ ?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1435	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_0ac73d6e	huli_jing	You're lucky he's charming. Now hold still.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1436	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_love_c527ace7		She painted the sigil with three tails at once-effervescent and glittering-before placing it on my chest. I felt an odd tingling sensation.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1438	"[what]"
ch9_huli_exit_e2aa652c	huli_jing	And a promise is a promise. I shall never again haunt these springs, nor return to soak my tails. You'll never see me here again.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1449	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_exit_f0711d6a	huli_jing	I will be in Xianlun. With my family. Pity... I was beginning to like you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1450	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_exit_e6e4c1b4	magnus	And we were starting to like you too, beloved fox!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1451	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_exit_8d880e70	magnus	Farewell to the fox with the nine shining tails... To judgment and laughter where truth always sails...~	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1452	magnus "[what]"
ch9_huli_exit_7980f187	huli_jing	Wow! I love it, dumpling! I'm going to miss you!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1453	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_exit_73334981	huli_jing	Alas, this is farewell. But I have one last parting gift.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1454	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_huli_exit_a4b0a4be		She snapped her claws-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1456	"[what]"
ch9_huli_exit_bf819cbe		FWOOMP.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1460	"[what]"
ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_a8e98d68		In a blink, the warmth vanished. Steam gone. Stones vanished. Comfort obliterated. Suddenly-squish. Pressed in. Too close. Far too close.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1475	"[what]"
ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_dc9122df	dorian	What in the name of the Tetrad-?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1477	dorian "[what]"
ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_4bdfa213		I was squished-stuffed, really-inside what looked like a giant toy Limbs tangled, faces mashed together, undergarments sticking uncomfortably.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1479	"[what]"
ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_80091aca	dorian	Why... why can't I move my legs-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1481	dorian "[what]"
ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_c6f816f0	yuxuan	Ahhh! Dorian~! Just you and me and-wait, wait, someone's chest is in my-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1482	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_4a81bb00	niko	Grr... Yuxuan. That is my chest. Kindly remove your hand.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1483	niko "[what]"
