ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_285b9ea6	svante	AHH! I-I'm sorry, Your Maj-I mean, Chung!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1489	svante "[what]"
ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_2beda3eb	dorian	Svante, for the love of the Tetrad, don't lift your arms. I can smell your armpits-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1490	dorian "[what]"
