ch9_stuffed_fox_exit_32eed71d		Everyone: Magnus. Shut up.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1495	"[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_15304842		Tim: Elias! Hey Elias!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1509	"[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_85a44df8		Elias: Yes, Tim?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1510	"[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_a4ec4389	tim	Come here! The water's fine!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1511	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_81ff5ae7	tim	Given the thermal consistency of this geothermal spring and accounting for the elevation, I hypothesize that the temperature today hovers around seventy-eight degrees Celsius-perhaps just under the threshold to soft-boil an egg.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1512	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_10749d05	tim	We might even be able to cook noodles, Elias. Just imagine-hot spring ramen! Ambient-heated broth, mineral-rich. Quite possibly delicious.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1513	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_89490cd2	elias	Soup? We takin bath in soup?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1514	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_337884c2	weng	It's not soup, kids. It's spring water. Full of magic. And minerals. Good for the bones and even better for the soul.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1515	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_e3dcbb26	roboto	S-S-S-Springs detected. Temperature optimal. Steam density: fluffy.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1519	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_e823be5a	elias	Ooh! It's so pretty! We swim together, Roboto!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1520	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_ad921029	roboto	N-N-Negative... I may be waterproof, but my sensors are not human-safe. A power surge could shock the party. I will supervise from a safe distance.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1521	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_59024a5d	tedda_alive	Then it's just us! Come, Lady Elias!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1522	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_3efc86ca	weng	Tedda, are you sure you don't want to wear swimwear?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1523	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_7ea6c58a	tedda_alive	My clothes can't be removed, Miss Weng. I'm a toy, remember?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1524	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_fc1ffa80	weng	Oh, silly me. I forgot. Carry on, then.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1525	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_f4407d7a	tedda_alive	Let's go, Lady Elias! Let's swim like noble queens in our glittery bath!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1526	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_09a14648	elias	Yey!! Let's go, Tedda! Tim, let's go!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1527	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_78ec8f93	tim	Hey! I'm a king! I'm not a queen!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1528	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_2d3834a5	tim	So... Miss Weng told me a story once. About this very spring.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1530	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_55e74ba2	elias	Ooooh. What story?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1531	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_680e611e	tim	A tale of the Huli Jing. A legendary fox spirit said to dwell in these waters.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1532	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_ae996adb	elias	Hulee Jee?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1533	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_da791b0e	tim	Huli Jing. A fox spirit who once lived in this spring! Some say she played tricks, others say she gave blessings with kind and compassionate hearts! There was a legend of a game... a test of judgment... but most adults think it's just a myth.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1534	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_ce49d018	elias	Ooh! Can we see them?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1535	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_09a787b0	tim	Only those who are destined to do great things can see them!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1536	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_b11dbc68	weng	Tim, enough of your stories. That's just Tianho folklore. Only the Tetrad Li Mengtia ever claimed to see and speak with one-and that was a thousand years ago.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1537	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_3e06e193	weng	Now hurry up and focus on your baths. We have a ceremony later.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1538	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_23e0b98a	elias	Miss Weng, what we do later?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1539	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_9352404d	weng	We'll watch a special program and release lanterns into the sky, Elias dear.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1540	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_7f30f513	roboto	Unfortunately, t-t-the lantern releasing is only for adults.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1544	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_eb737146	weng	But don't worry, little ones. There will be plenty of delicious food afterward.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1545	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_40c256cc	roboto	Based on observed preparations from the Hinami delegation, there will also be a d-d-dragon presentation at the memorial grounds.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1546	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_ee224f82	tim	No way! A DRAGON presentation?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1547	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_6ac35f3b	roboto	H-H-However, reports indicate the dragon will be a hologram. Please consume this information with a figurative grain of sodium chloride.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1548	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_2a687dcb	tedda_alive	Wow! Did you hear that, Lady Elias?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1549	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_cb383934	tim	And Miss Weng brought crayons for us! We get to color while we wait!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1550	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_2227fe52	elias	Yay! Color time!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1551	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_bf16b1b6	tedda_alive	I already have so many ideas for what we can draw, Lady Elias!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1552	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_21a2fc68		-BACK CRACK-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1554	"[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_3c8109ce	weng	My back... If you'll excuse me, I'll have a cup of calming jasmine tea.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1556	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_9fa35199	roboto	M-M-Miss Weng, I highly suggest you don't drink tea while taking a bath in the springs.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1557	roboto "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_8257e032		-Weng and Roboto goes away-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1559	"[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_c4ff6d3a	elias	Hmm... Daddy told me to always believe in legends.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1561	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_645d82f1	tim	Oh, Mister Dorian? He's so cool! He fought a Hundun in Tianho with Mister Chung, remember?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1562	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_cb795399	tim	Oh I forgot. You weren't there. But he was so cool!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1563	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_9d2605d4	elias	Daddy's so cool! He's big and strong and wears underpants with dragons on them! He fight big monster!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1564	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_e8821ecb	tim	Hey, Elias... Watch this.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1565	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_2a5e13ab		-Tim extended his hands. A tiny glowing figure, like a dragon made of mist, forms between his palms, wriggling and coiling like it's alive.-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1567	"[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_5317754c	tedda_alive	It's a dragon!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1569	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_db8a0ee8	tim	A basic projection, stabilized by willpower and concentration. This one is better!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1570	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_a64a5ede	elias	WOW! How you do dat, Tim? Magic cwayons?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1571	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_4a4b1c67	tim	Shhh. Don't tell Miss Weng! It's a secret ability of mine that I can do! You promise?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1572	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_634720d4	elias	Um... okay. I promise. You have powers wike Daddy!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1573	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_bcdce23f	tim	I'm... not entirely sure how I got them. They're just... there. That's why I want to ask Mister Chung if-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1574	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_b4884447	tedda_alive	Wait... something moved over there! The water moved!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1575	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_97deb0b9	tim	Wait... D-Do you see what I'm seeing?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1576	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_cfa3cd83	huli_jing	...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1578	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_427e06b6	elias	Where? Oh! That's a cute fox! With fow tails!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1580	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_ad8504af	tim	Four? No! It's nine, Elias! One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight... nine! That's a real Huli Jing!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1581	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_bcf63ddf	elias	It's so cute! Come here little foxie!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1582	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_47347720	huli_jing	Hello little ones! What are your names?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1584	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_05576202	tim	My name is Tim! I'm the brains of the group! I'm also the leader!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1586	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_361aac17	elias	And I'm Elias! Hewwo!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1587	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_29b33a69	tedda_alive	Kids, are you talking to someone? I don't see anything... Should we tell Miss Weng? What if it's dangerous?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1588	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_dd99438a	weng	Hey, kids! Who are you talking to?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1589	weng "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_90d07bdc	huli_jing	Here's a little gift for you... Goodbye little dumplings...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1590	huli_jing "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_2117dab2	tim	Wait... where did it go? Aww, it ran away!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1591	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_3552c381	tedda_alive	Look! Lady Elias! Look at the water! Pretty colors!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1592	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_7abab06d	elias	Red and yellow and green and pink! It's so pretty!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1593	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_c576e51d	tim	Chromatic auric distortion. A spontaneous display of spiritual color energy. Fascinating...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1594	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_941137ff	elias	Do ya think it's from the fox?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1595	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_1cc8dee7	tim	I... don't know. Maybe?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1596	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_7c70d3e3	tedda_alive	Lady Elias! Look! There's something floating over there-It's a FOX STUFFED TOY!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1597	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_e055aff7	elias	Oooooh!! Can I have it? Can I have it?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1598	elias "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_6ae909ea	tim	The Huli Jing said it was a gift. So we should open it! Open it, Elias!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1599	tim "[what]"
ch9_kids_spring_41cf5e10	tedda_alive	Or!! Maybe you can give it a shake first! Maybe there's magic inside!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1600	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_7f3ec043	elias	Ooh! Okay! I'll shwake it!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1615	elias "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_336ed670	tedda_alive	With emotion, Lady Elias! Let's goooo!!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1616	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_4ff61b7b	tim	Are... you sure shaking it is the best course of action?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1617	tim "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_0e82f666	elias	Shwake! Shwake!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1618	elias "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_69b7dec7		Men: AHHHHH!!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1619	"[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_b9a6dd5d	tim	Huh? What was that?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1620	tim "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_349bddb3	tedda_alive	That must be coming from inside, Lady Elias! Open it!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1621	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_f65d5c95		-POP-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1622	"[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_a73ac432	elias	Let's open it first, Tedda!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1626	elias "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_621c5636	tim	Let's count to three first!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1627	tim "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_975028d6	tedda_alive	On the count of three open it~ One! Two!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1628	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_fox_toy_f65d5c95_1		-POP-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1629	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_d017e223		I tumbled out.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1642	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_f471a999		Face-first. Right into someone's thigh.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1643	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_fc742fe0		Everything reeked of lavender, steam, and shame. We were all still in our undergarments, soaked, tangled like a bundle of wet spaghetti, sprawled out in the middle of the hot spring.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1644	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_259aa6d2	chung_hee	This is completely indecent. I swear someone's cheek was on my-wait. Never mind. I don't want to know.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1646	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_9b65ac65	svante	I'm... I'm upside down. I can taste someone's foot.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1647	svante "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_a6e01655	magnus	I think my entire spine cracked. Also, someone's sitting on my hair.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1648	magnus "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_2beb9fcc	niko	I apologize. I'll move now.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1649	niko "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_7379a39d	elias	DAAADDDYYY!! Why are you in the foxie?!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1650	elias "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_c0d12978		Above us, I saw Weng, holding a teacup in her swimwear. She squinted at the mess.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1652	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_8a1e22d3	weng	By the stars, Master Yuxuan? What happened to all of you?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1654	weng "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_2511e374	yuxuan	W-We did it, Miss Weng! The spring won't smell like fermented feet stew!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1655	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_f9bf92b8	weng	W-What?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1656	weng "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_189ec330	dorian	J-Just ignore him, Miss Weng.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1657	dorian "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_f320dee3	yuxuan	It's a long story involving a fox, judges and... moral philosophy.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1658	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_cf07a792	elias	Daddy, you look siwwy! I'll help you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1659	elias "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_6dd085b7		Tiny hands grabbed mine. I looked up to see Elias, dripping and smiling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1661	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_5004e4f5	tedda_alive	That looks uncomfortable! I'll help you Lady Elias!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1663	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_e7f7ceea	weng	Do you need help? Roboto, hold this teacup.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1664	weng "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_7251ace3	roboto	T-T-Transferring... hot liquid. Grip calibrated to teacup fragility.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1668	roboto "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_7ea48c3f	tim	That was amazing. I deduce that the fox must've sealed them inside an extradimensional plush construct-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1669	tim "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_34c709df	chung_hee	Tim. Please. Not now.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1670	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_8576e8fa	tim	S-Sorry, Mister Chung! Do you need some help?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1671	tim "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_d356dc2a		One by one, we were untangled-wet, dazed, and half-dressed, but alive. Tedda and Elias offered towels. Roboto beeped encouragingly. Magnus looked like he needed ten massages.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1673	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_b8db0ccc		I groaned, dragging myself upright. My hair clung to my face. Water trickled down my back.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1674	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_9588e243	roboto	S-S-Spatial anomaly resolved. Group integrity: 100%. Modesty: 4.143%.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1676	roboto "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_2870f437	elias	You okay now, Daddy?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1677	elias "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_7d11be31		I looked at him and grinned, still catching my breath.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1679	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_d1709b1b	dorian	Yeah, buddy. I'm okay now.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1681	dorian "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_2af62286		After we finished bathing, I gently scrubbed Elias for a while, until Tedda took over with gleeful determination, humming a tune while she made sure every inch of Elias was squeaky clean.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1683	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_89e9ffda		Weng, groaning a little, called out for help with Tim-her back giving out after all the excitement. I didn't know she had lots of back problems.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1684	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_f41cf46e		Yuxuan tried to step in, but quickly realized toddler bath time was not his calling. I ended up taking over, gently scrubbing Tim while he lectured me about soap composition.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1685	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_283aead9	tim	Interesting. I appear to be cleaner than the average imperial scroll... but less organized.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1687	tim "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_866e3434	tim	This blend lacks proper alkali balance, Mister Dorian. My skin pH will be most offended. Roboto told me that.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1688	tim "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_73421eff	dorian	Tim, I wasn't able to understand half of what you just said. Now, raise your arm.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1689	dorian "[what]"
ch9_spring_end_05648bb2		Once we were all dry and dressed, we changed into our Tianho ceremonial attire-layers of silk and charm, embroidered with celestial patterns. Yuxuan, beaming with excitement, led us to the special place he had mentioned.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1691	"[what]"
ch9_spring_end_0b586b06		We took an elevator hidden deep inside the library, and when the doors opened, we emerged onto a quiet hilltop.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1692	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_f17fcaa9		The warm breeze rolled over the hill as we all stood beneath the deepening indigo sky. The last rays of sunlight clung to the clouds like strands of gold silk, while the first stars blinked to life-gentle pearls scattered across a velvet sky.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1709	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_b45bf259		From afar, the Tianho Memorial shimmered in the twilight, glowing faintly.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1710	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_4173c57e		Elias and Tim were already running in small circles around the hill, chasing each other in their ceremonial robes.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1711	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_80f94e9d	elias	You can't catch me, Professor Tim!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1713	elias "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_a4e7a3a1	tim	Incorrect, my student. My calculations suggest you have a 32.8% chance of tripping on your hem in the next five seconds.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1714	tim "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_d1dbac18	elias	Wha-AHH!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1715	elias "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_a973be26		Elias' foot caught on the edge of the robe, causing them to tumble onto the floor, giggling uncontrollably.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1717	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_b671414e		Weng was laying out a neat spread of food on a long silk blanket, adjusting each dish with practiced hands-though every so often, she winced and rubbed her lower back.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1718	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_1f548992	weng	Kids, stop running around like little spirits. You're in ceremonial outfits. You'll tear the fabric and then what?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1720	weng "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_420b771a	roboto	B-b-bento arrangement: c-c-c-complete. Humidity: 47%. Aesthetic symmetry: 93.44%... adjusting for toddler chaos.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1724	roboto "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_6df759b7	tedda_alive	Ooh! Look how cute these rice cakes are! They look like smiling bunnies!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1726	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_7e8d606a		Yuxuan waved us over from the far side of the hill, dressed in his expensive looking golden ceremonial attire.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1728	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_ee3968bb	yuxuan	Dorian! Over here, come on!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1730	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_b41b6b36	yuxuan	This is the place I wanted all of you to see. A hill above history. The calm before reverence.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1731	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_78299096		We all gathered at the rise. The view was breathtaking. The Tianho Memorial stood distant yet dominant, a pale silhouette bathed in the twilight's soft glow.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1733	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_a2cb465d	yuxuan	I had my people prepare this place for this very special night.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1735	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_4e1d500e		Magnus stood quietly to one side, his arms crossed, expression unreadable. He stared out at the fading horizon.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1737	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_874df381	magnus	It's a beautiful view... The kind that doesn't ask for words. Makes you feel small. But not in a bad way. Small like a star in a sky of stories.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1739	magnus "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_c5052a57	svante	Hard to believe that yesterday we were fighting right there.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1740	svante "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_0c309e27	niko	It was all just yesterday. A siege, bombs falling like fire. Now we're here.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1741	niko "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_90aa5893	chung_hee	Indeed. To think King Gustav sent an entire battalion to destroy what he feared. I did not expect to survive the day. And yet-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1742	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_cc51fa15	chung_hee	All of you saved me. Thank you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1743	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_77702fdc		I scanned the land surrounding the Tianho Memorial. There was no trace of what had happened. No debris, no craters, no bloodstains. Just pristine grass, untouched stone, and soft lanterns beginning to glow in preparation for the evening's rites.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1745	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_36bd38da	dorian	They did well. There's not a single trace of the bombs.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1747	dorian "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_cf8840b0	svante	Or my brothers and sisters... I can't believe so many of us died yesterday.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1748	svante "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_2a79ca6d	yuxuan	They called in all the best Earth Channelers from across the Empire. Every stone replaced, every crack healed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1749	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_b03d15de	roboto	For m-m-m-more information, even the Paladins from Gale lent their hands. According to my database, they all w-w-w-worked to make this moment possible.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1750	roboto "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_21a2fc68		-BACK CRACK-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1752	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_662822c6	weng	Tetrad above... Should've called in a back healer too. These knees weren't built for bending this much.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1754	weng "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_fb663cfc	niko	Miss Weng, do you want me to grab a chair?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1755	niko "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_ba510457	weng	Yes, please. Maybe we could use a table instead of a mat.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1756	weng "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_c7a5827f	tedda_alive	On it, Miss Weng! Spare table coming in hot!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1757	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_bc656e02		We all pitched in. Magnus levitated the spare table over with a grunt of wind magic. Svante rolled out fresh cushions.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1759	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_10c71fc8		Even Roboto carefully laid out ceramic cups and bundles of incense, his mechanical fingers trembling slightly with effort.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1760	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_8a10e551		The breeze picked up, carrying with it the scent of steamed rice, plum wine, and jasmine. The horizon began to darken into cobalt and violet, and distant bells rang faintly across the hills. Lanterns along the path to the memorial flickered to life one by one.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1761	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_bc12a0f9	yuxuan	It's starting! Everyone, grab a seat.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1763	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_4834d3ee		All at once, the soft hum of conversation quieted.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1765	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_8004691d	tim	Elias, come sit with me!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1767	tim "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_8afe5314	elias	Coming! Daddy, sit with us!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1768	elias "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_e35ee9e7		I smiled, lowering myself beside them as Elias eagerly curled into my side, his tiny fingers finding mine. His hair still smelled faintly of lavender from the hot spring. A rare, rare calmness washed over me as I rested my arm around him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1770	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_16c49821	elias	Daddy look! Miss Weng gave us cwayons!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1772	elias "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_bc91da1a	dorian	That's nice, Elias.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1773	dorian "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_1c3477ac		Then the lights dimmed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1775	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_6415bc73		The entire sky above the Tianho Memorial shimmered-and from the center of the clearing, a pulse of blue light burst upward.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1776	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_21415087		The hill trembled softly as sound and vision merged. Water began to rise upward in brilliant strands of glowing liquid. The streams coiled and danced, forming an enormous spectral image.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1777	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_518012fd		A woman stepped into the projection. Her indigo kimono trailed behind her like flowing waves.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1778	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_dace814a	svante	Lady Aoi...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1780	svante "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_1476544c		A gasp left my lips.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1782	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_2109a5e0		She stood alone in the image, graceful and dignified, as if she were standing on the ocean's surface itself. The holographic sea churned around her feet, and from the depths behind her, a massive, shimmering shape began to rise.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1783	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_ae7057b2		( PLAY VIDEO: Dragon of the Depths - ?? )	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1785	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_707f6a31		As the last haunting note of the song faded into the wind, silence settled over the hill like a soft shroud.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1791	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_8258e470		None of us moved for several long seconds-no one dared disturb the weight of what we had just witnessed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1792	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_5c6efc61		I turned, instinctively. Svante, normally so composed, had tears glistening at the corners of his eyes. Niko sat motionless; fists clenched tightly in his lap. Chung-hee stared ahead, jaw set, his expression regal-but his breathing had slowed, as if to anchor himself.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1793	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_d3afc36a		Yuxuan looked at me. His gaze met mine-quiet, knowing.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1794	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_badc74ff		Even Elias and Tim were silent, their wide eyes fixed on the heavens above. Weng was busy wiping tears from her eyes.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1795	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_48635941		Magnus let out a breath.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1796	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_01edf3c8	magnus	Amazing. I could give it a go too. A little aria of my own-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1798	magnus "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_2f1edd84	roboto	W-W-Would you like some tea to calm you down, Sir Magnus?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1802	roboto "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_e1d9abb4	magnus	...I suppose that's a no.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1803	magnus "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_e15594b8		Then, as the water projection calmed into a mirror-like stillness once more, Lady Aoi reappeared-her image clear, standing tall at the center of the great pool of light.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1805	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_fedf150f	aoi	Tonight, beneath these stars and above these honored hills, we gather not as divided nations, but as a shared people-united by memory, by loss, and by hope.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1807	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_36cc6f9c	aoi	We remember the Tragedy of Tianho. A day not written in ink, but seared into our hearts.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1808	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_080b5fcb	aoi	A thousand lives-fathers, mothers, children, heroes-lost to the fire, to the fear, to the fury. The ground may have healed, but their names live on in us.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1809	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_dbe5a772	aoi	In every breath we take, in every song we sing, and in every vow we swear.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1810	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_e675b5ff	aoi	We remember their courage. We honor their sacrifice. And in their memory, we promise: never again.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1811	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_2b5d0ce5	aoi	We are graced by the presence of those who lead our world with dignity and strength.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1813	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_65f2f938	aoi	His Majesty, King Tatsuya Fujiwara of Hinami, whose wisdom and compassion have lit a path of healing for his people.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1814	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_e66b4692	aoi	King Gustav Nordstrom of Mjoll, whose fierce devotion to justice and peace remains unwavering even in times of grief.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1815	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_532ecf1a	aoi	And Her Radiance, Empress Olympia Wyndham of Gale, who continues to lead with elegance, fortitude, and an unshakable will.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1816	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_00b5fb7d	aoi	To all rulers and leaders present-thank you for your presence, your compassion, and your courage to remember.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1817	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_89b55aab	aoi	This ceremony is not just for mourning. It is for resolve. That we-no matter the distance between us-will never forget.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1818	aoi "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_426168f2		The light dimmed once again. We sat in reverence.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1820	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_34f6e911	door_voice	And tonight's ceremony has been proudly brought to you by Cheng Industries. Here at Cheng's... we bring change.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1824	door_voice "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_cce7d270		-Here at Cheng's, we bring change... -	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1826	"[what]"
