ch9_hilltop_a9d87943		Despite the interruption, the ceremony below continued, unbothered by the distant chorus of the people around me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1843	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_7a757f81		The ceremony continued from afar, the glow of the memorial casting long, gentle light over the gathering below. In the next phase, testimonies were shared-fragments of lives once lived, spoken aloud by their loved ones.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1844	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_39e91e9d		Some spoke of a baker who had just opened her first shop, her dreams rising like dough in the early morning sun.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1845	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_3d978cb9		Others remembered a teacher who stayed behind to guide frightened children to safety, his final words reassuring.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1846	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_40688925		One woman recalled her twin sons, musicians who died with their instruments in hand, playing even as the ground crumbled.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1847	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_0d8254a2		We listened in stillness. While the children got bored and carried on coloring. And then came the Lantern Release.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1848	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_c4996c49	yuxuan	Miss Weng, the lanterns please!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1850	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_afeb3172		Weng stood, her hands carrying a lacquered box. She opened it gently and revealed lanterns, folded and decorated in the traditional style of Tianho, each one tied with a crimson ribbon.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1852	"[what]"
ch9_hilltop_7b4e317c	weng	Here it is, Master Yuxuan.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1854	weng "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_255a19f6	yuxuan	One for each of us. The Prosperity Dragon will carry our prayers to the ones we've lost.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1856	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_56d01f65	weng	You may write a message. A memory. A prayer. You can draw something if words are hard. Or add a token-something small. Something that meant something to you... or to them.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1857	weng "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_36e386a3	niko	Understood. Thank you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1858	niko "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_05d8ca89	svante	Anything, huh...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1859	svante "[what]"
ch9_hilltop_90404039	yuxuan	Now. I know we all have someone to remember. Take your time. Go where you need. Be alone if you must. Speak quietly to the ones who can no longer answer.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1860	yuxuan "[what]"
