ch9_lantern_kids_73451e88	tedda_alive	Lady Elias, we must go! Miss Weng is summoning us!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1951	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_88620095	roboto	M-M-Miss Weng has entered Critical Hunger Mode. She is demanding all juniors report for dumpling consumption immediately.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1955	roboto "[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_e46ba416	elias	Dumprings!?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1956	elias "[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_0b72d040	weng	And lots of flan! Come here! I'm getting hungry!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1957	weng "[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_9324bcc3		A wide, mischievous grin tugged at her lips. In her hands she cradled a large, round bamboo steamer basket, the wood darkened slightly from years of faithful use. Wisps of fragrant steam curled from beneath the woven lid.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1959	"[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_b93d9b9b		With a dramatic flourish, she lifted the lid. Inside, nestled atop glistening green banana leaves, were dozens of plump dumplings. Tianho Xiang Xia Bao. Tianho Fragrant Shrimp Dumplings.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1960	"[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_1006bd71		Each dumpling gleamed invitingly under the misty steam, their translucent skins slightly stretched over a generous filling of tender shrimp, minced Tianho forest mushrooms, and fragrant herbs.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1961	"[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_d1d7c053	weng	There's more where this came from! Come here, kids!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1963	weng "[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_5ca91215	roboto	A-A-A-ALERT: DUMPLING DISPENSATION IN PROGRESS. MOBILIZE. MOBILIZE. L-L-Let's go, everyone!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1967	roboto "[what]"
ch9_lantern_kids_0e3a4dd2		And just like that, they vanished-sprinting back with a flurry of giggles, robotic beeping, and a suspicious trail of glitter that they absolutely were not supposed to have.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1969	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_a5485609		As I turned around, I saw Yuxuan. He was standing there, wide-eyed, staring up at the wobbling lantern.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1990	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_172bba2d	yuxuan	Dorian, what was that?! That lantern just launched early! What if someone down there saw it?! It's glowing like a signal flare! It could give away our location! I told Miss Weng not to let the kids have brushes unsupervised-!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1992	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_644dc438	dorian	Yu, it said teDuH. I don't think anyone is gonna decode that and send battalions.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1993	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_ea056b7a	yuxuan	...TeDuH?! Was that supposed to be Tedda?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1994	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_11b0677a		I nodded. I watched his shoulders slowly slump as the lantern disappeared over the ridge.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1996	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_397c9510		Then, he looked at the lantern in his own hands-perfectly folded, delicately painted with calligraphy and a small pressed flower at the base. Of course his looked like a museum piece.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1997	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_86f20415	yuxuan	Wait. Don't tell me... was that your lantern?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	1999	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_26776a8e		I nodded again. Slowly. Dramatically.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2001	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_923cbded	yuxuan	Nooo... Here. We'll share mine.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2003	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_e62f4f4e	dorian	You sure? Roboto told me earlier you wanted to be alone.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2004	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_50bc6643	yuxuan	Ah-hah... yeah, well... I told Roboto that so... I could, uh... scout the area. Alone. For... strategic solitude. Yes.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2005	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_bf8a6076		He gave me a sheepish smile, clearly realizing how flimsy his excuse sounded.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2007	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_47b9ccfe		We both chuckled softly. Without another word, I took the lantern he offered, our fingers brushing for a moment. He lingered in the touch longer than necessary. We didn't mention it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2008	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_3b6c69a0		We walked a little farther from the others, away from the gentle laughter of children and the distant sound of flutes playing down at the memorial.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2010	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_898db445		The wind was gentler here. A quiet hill beneath the stars, just the two of us. The glow of the memorial in the distance made Yuxuan's silhouette shimmer like something caught in a dream.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2011	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_09c18519		He sat down slowly on the grass, patting the space beside him. I joined him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2012	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_0ad877f4	yuxuan	How have you been feeling... since Elara? Since the kids?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2014	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_1ed49183		He didn't look at me when he said it. His voice was soft, like he was afraid of pressing too hard.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2016	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_7dbceb8c		I hesitated, staring out into the dark where Elias's lantern had floated. Somewhere above, it drifted still-misspelled and luminous.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2017	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_6cae54ee	dorian	I'm... getting there. One day at a time.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2019	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_dac212b1		The words sat in the air for a long moment. He nodded, understanding without needing the details. Then, I glanced at him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2021	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_1c2a4858		He was touching the lantern. I noticed an entire line of names written on the lantern.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2022	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_45b40794	dorian	Those names there. Did you... lose someone important in the tragedy?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2024	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_63131a07		Yuxuan didn't respond right away. He traced a finger along the edge of the lantern, watching the way the candlelight flickered through the rice paper.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2026	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_bc33adfd	yuxuan	Yeah. I did. A lot of someones, actually. Friends. Colleagues. People who... believed in me. Partners who were with me since the beginning. We all had this dream-building something that could help people. That could change lives.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2028	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_86437f53	yuxuan	We met at the Xiangli Centre-back when none of us had money, barely enough to eat. We'd beg vendors for scraps, pool coins for dumplings. I was shocked how many inventors were there. All brilliant. All broke like me. Heh.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2029	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_857343fe		He paused, his voice thickening. He touched the names written in the lantern.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2031	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_042385e8	yuxuan	They were there when Cheng Industries was just a wild idea on a napkin. We stayed up all night coding and designing and arguing over font choices. We believed in what we were building.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2033	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_a59c907d	yuxuan	I remember standing for hours at the Zhong Lotus Promenade, trying to convince passersby that our tech could change lives. And then... when Tianho fell...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2034	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_dedf6252	yuxuan	They didn't make it... But I did.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2035	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_cee1985a		He looked away.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2037	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_548cd463	yuxuan	When you rescued me... I was grateful. So grateful to you. I was over the moon to have survived. But once I heard they didn't...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2039	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_cd3a97a0		His voice caught. He rubbed at his neck, eyes glinting with the shine of held-back tears.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2041	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_c64e922d	yuxuan	I couldn't breathe. I felt like I'd stolen their air just to keep myself going.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2043	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_38066c90	yuxuan	I told myself I need to finish what we started. And I did. Cheng Industries... it's successful. It's helping people now. I just...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2044	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_b059c5f7	yuxuan	I just wish they were here to see it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2045	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_31b20972		He gave a soft, shaky laugh and rubbed his neck.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2047	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_a6dc8b98	yuxuan	Sorry. That got heavy. I should've told you all this sooner.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2049	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_63e37260	dorian	No. It's okay. They'd be proud of you. I know I am.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2056	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_1088d52e	yuxuan	Thank you, Dorian. I really appreciate it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2057	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_612ded0f	dorian	I'm glad you told me this.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2058	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_fb108583		He turned to look at me then, eyes glinting with something more vulnerable than usual. The breeze tugged gently at his hair.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2063	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_3fcc78a6		I lowered my gaze to the lantern in our hands.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2064	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_f3c54df8		Elara. Daniel. Emily. Sarah. Lucas.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2065	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_d8eac401		I wrote each name with slow, reverent strokes. His hand never left the side of the lantern, steady and warm beside mine.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2066	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_3d42ebaf		Then... the call came.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2067	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_9b5e11e9	feng	Honored guests, travelers, friends from every border-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2069	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_47496736	yuxuan	Dorian... That man up front. Wait... Is that your best friend? He's-oh. He's the emcee?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2070	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_af74f2c3	dorian	I guess he is... That charismatic dog...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2071	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_6d69e9fe	feng	Tonight, our lanterns rise not just as tribute, but as light.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2072	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_570a8aa7	feng	May they find the ones we lost... and may the stars remember them always.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2073	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_73cbee0a	feng	On the count of three-One. Two. Three-Release!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2074	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_b810b485		All around us, lanterns lifted.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2076	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_4c55a0f0		One by one. Then by the dozens. Then by the hundreds.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2077	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_9356dcb6		A quiet gasp rippled through the crowd. It was as if the heavens themselves were exhaling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2078	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_134047bc		Lanterns floated upward like glowing petals caught in an invisible tide, rising into the night sky. Red, gold, amber. Some danced lazily in the wind, others soared with sharp purpose.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2079	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_bf2105a2		Our lantern joined them-gentle, steady, the names glowing softly like a heartbeat. And then-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2080	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_82e080a8		BOOM.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2085	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_bbc73beb		A firework lit the sky in brilliant pink.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2087	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_8607336d		Then another-crackling blue, gold, silver stars spinning across the clouds. One exploded into the shape of a dragon, another in the spiral of a flower.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2088	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_4a358cb9		It was breathtaking. Silent awe fell across the hilltop as the world above bloomed in light.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2089	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_2e3beeb4	tim	ELIAS!! ELIAS!! LOOK!! It's amazing!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2091	tim "[what]"
