ch9_route_yuxuan_528169e4	elias	A FROWER! A DWAGON!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2093	elias "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_084f0722	roboto	V-V-VISUAL SPECTACLE REGISTERED. SENSORY SYSTEMS OVERLOADING-IN A GOOD WAY! INITIATING JOY DANCE PROTOCOL!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2097	roboto "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_ad0073b9		Roboto actually spun in a little circle, his mechanical arms lifted like wings, twinkling lights flashing from his chest panel like party lights at a tiny disco.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2099	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_c5f3b9a3	dorian	Looks like they're having fun too.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2101	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_5c3c4a73		I turned to Yuxuan, who hadn't moved. His eyes reflected every flare, every color, as if he were trying to memorize it all.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2103	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_5a8fdfe1	yuxuan	Dorian... I... I want to say something	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2105	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_43a92fd7		I raised a brow, a smile tugging at my lips.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2107	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_56420957	yuxuan	But it's embarrassing. So you... um... you have to close your eyes first.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2109	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_bbcdc255		I smirked.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2111	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_5f2b936a	dorian	Is this another Cheng Industries promotional stunt?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2113	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_07eb02e6	yuxuan	No! I mean-well, not unless you want a jingle.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2114	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_397c1c8f		I closed my eyes, amused.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2116	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_651fba80		A moment passed. Two. I felt his fingers brush against mine, almost trembling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2117	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_891d8292		And then-soft.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2118	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_2c2730f8		A quick, fluttering kiss on my cheek.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2119	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_48e9abd9		So fast, it might've been imagined. But I felt it. Warm and real.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2120	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_77a5d0fe		I opened my eyes. He was blushing, absolutely red, looking anywhere but at me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2121	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_0fb7a61f	dorian	Yu...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2123	dorian "[what]"
