ch9_route_yuxuan_c617e3cf	niko	You can, Tim. But make sure you practice caution. You don't know how many people die because of fireworks.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2132	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_120ed023	magnus	Don't be such a spoilsport, Niko! You're scaring the kids!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2133	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_6b25da40		Weng appeared from behind a tree, holding her back like she just climbed a mountain.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2135	"[what]"
ch9_route_yuxuan_69d84408	weng	Tetrad save me-someone help me with this sparkler! Svante, could you be a dear and help me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2137	weng "[what]"
