ch9_route_chunghee_c8007371		He looked down at the lantern again, then up at me. His gaze was gentle. Inviting.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2198	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_88e7965b	chung_hee	Share it with me? Since yours... flew off early.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2200	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_0e610a52		I nodded. He looked at me like I was more than a warrior, more than a companion. Like he needed me there.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2202	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_ac5cedde		He exhaled-quiet relief flowing from his shoulders as I sat beside him. He took the brush and dipped it slowly into the ink.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2203	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_3b051d23		He didn't speak.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2204	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_c98adf81		His hand trembled slightly as he pressed the bristles against the paper. And then-he paused. His eyes flicked toward the memorial down below. His breath caught.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2205	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_c6d7ec50		He closed his eyes... and the brush slipped from his fingers. He bowed his head-and sobbed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2206	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_ef92f8a4	chung_hee	Mom... Dad... I'm so sorry.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2208	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_95f008b6		His body shook with each breathless cry, silent but raw, each tremor echoing louder in my chest than any scream could've.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2210	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_982c82fe		I placed a hand on his back. He didn't pull away.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2211	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_cfbfe867		Moments passed. Maybe minutes. The soft rustling of wind, the flicker of firelight, the faint laughter of children far in the distance... and the sound of his crying.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2212	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_36a3e03e		Finally, he lifted his head and wiped at his face with the back of his sleeve.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2213	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_cdd83289	chung_hee	Forgive me... Such a display is unbecoming of an emperor.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2215	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_bbce23a1	dorian	Don't say that.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2216	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_cc8fc419		I turned to him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2218	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_8201ce70	dorian	If I may ask, what happened?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2220	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_7a6a6af7		He hesitated... then let it out like a dam finally breaking.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2222	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_e8ee22b3	chung_hee	I love my parents with all my heart. But I never wanted the throne. I wanted to be a writer.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2224	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_209ada64	chung_hee	I argued with my parents the day they left. They... wanted me to take the throne. I didn't want to. I said cruel things. Things I never meant.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2225	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_d2e2503b		He swallowed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2227	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_cf922224	chung_hee	I thought I had time to fix things. I thought I'd see them again. But they came to Tianho that day. And I...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2229	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_eb763185		His voice faltered.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2231	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_7c5289be	chung_hee	I never got to apologize. It was too late.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2233	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_a8adfff1		He looked down. I leaned closer. I reached for his hand-his normal one-and held it firmly. He blushed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2235	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_309e53f7	dorian	Then we'll make this one count. For them.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2237	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_3eb4c596		He nodded, his fingers curling softly around mine.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2239	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_98c4eecd	dorian	What about your aunt? You mentioned her yesterday. Is she...?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2241	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_a0f5a3ac		He lowered his eyes.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2243	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_d488ea35	chung_hee	I... suppose I can talk to you about her now. She's alive. She warned me about coming here. About King Gustav.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2245	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_1492439a	chung_hee	She was right...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2246	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_9d9e4885		With slow, reverent strokes, he wrote his parent's names on the lantern's side: Hyon Min-joon. Kim Seo-yeon.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2248	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_d8784733		I could feel the reverence in his hands-the way each letter was its own goodbye. Then, we rose together. Still holding hands.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2249	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_bf11a01d		He lit the base, and the lantern swelled gently, filling with warm air. Our arms brushed. Our eyes met again. Neither of us looked away.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2250	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_60caba85		Down below, Feng's voice carried across the fields, rich and resonant, echoing through the hush of the gathered crowd.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2251	"[what]"
