ch9_route_chunghee_d5ff388f	chung_hee	Paladin Feng. Your best friend. Hm. Let me guess... he's the master of ceremonies tonight, isn't he?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2254	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_af74f2c3	dorian	I guess he is... That charismatic dog...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2255	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_6d69e9fe	feng	Tonight, our lanterns rise not just as tribute, but as light.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2256	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_570a8aa7	feng	May they find the ones we lost... and may the stars remember them always.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2257	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_73cbee0a	feng	On the count of three-One. Two. Three-Release!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2258	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_d77a7151		We let go together.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2260	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_b810b485		All around us, lanterns lifted.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2261	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_4c55a0f0		One by one. Then by the dozens. Then by the hundreds.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2262	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_9356dcb6		A quiet gasp rippled through the crowd. It was as if the heavens themselves were exhaling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2263	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_134047bc		Lanterns floated upward like glowing petals caught in an invisible tide, rising into the night sky. Red, gold, amber. Some danced lazily in the wind, others soared with sharp purpose.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2264	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_bf2105a2		Our lantern joined them-gentle, steady, the names glowing softly like a heartbeat. And then-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2265	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_82e080a8		BOOM.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2270	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_bbc73beb		A firework lit the sky in brilliant pink.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2272	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_8607336d		Then another-crackling blue, gold, silver stars spinning across the clouds. One exploded into the shape of a dragon, another in the spiral of a flower.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2273	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_4a358cb9		It was breathtaking. Silent awe fell across the hilltop as the world above bloomed in light.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2274	"[what]"
