ch9_route_chunghee_ad0073b9		Roboto actually spun in a little circle, his mechanical arms lifted like wings, twinkling lights flashing from his chest panel like party lights at a tiny disco.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2284	"[what]"
