ch9_route_chunghee_b5dc687c	chung_hee	They sure are.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2287	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_f48df2da		Chung-hee turned toward me, the firelight painting his face with soft, dancing shadows.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2289	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_a85934eb	chung_hee	Thank you... for staying with me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2291	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_ccf48431		I smiled, saying nothing. Just letting the warmth between us linger.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2293	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_6f2f5186		He glanced down, realizing our hands were still entwined. His eyes widened slightly. A faint blush crept up his neck, and he quickly-though reluctantly-let go.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2294	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_26052c3a		Then, almost like flipping a switch, he straightened his posture, squared his shoulders, and cleared his throat.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2295	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_9ef47996	chung_hee	Ahem. I-apologize. I allowed emotion to... compromise my composure. Clearly, this moment has overwhelmed me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2297	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_6edbd8f0	chung_hee	Thank you, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2298	chung_hee "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_a48a939b		He folded his arms, turning his head as if to reclaim his dignity. But the pink hue still burned on his cheeks.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2300	"[what]"
