ch9_route_chunghee_c5e1dfa6	svante	I got you, Miss Weng!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2315	svante "[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_7e70ef9e		Laughter and sparks filled the air as the kids darted between glowing trails of light, their joy casting little halos of warmth over the night.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2317	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_58bc0edb		Chung-hee and I stood together, quietly watching them.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2318	"[what]"
ch9_route_chunghee_a4ab2a1d	chung_hee	Do you think... Never mind...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2320	chung_hee "[what]"
