ch9_route_svante_a95e0a45		I turned around, still shaking my head at the trail of glitter Elias left behind, and there he was-Svante.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2335	"[what]"
ch9_route_svante_c755f4b7		He stood a few steps away, his arms awkwardly half-folded like he'd been trying to decide whether to approach me or not. His eyes drifted up to the sky where "teDuH" was still barely visible-wobbling, defiant, and doomed.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2336	"[what]"
