ch9_route_svante_c78f101e		His lips twitched like he was fighting the urge to stay serious. But then a warm, helpless chuckle escaped him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2340	"[what]"
ch9_route_svante_45edef00	svante	Haha! Really? It had 'Elias was here' energy all over it.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2342	svante "[what]"
ch9_route_svante_4c527fb9		He stepped closer, his shoulders still a little tense, like he wasn't sure if he was intruding.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2344	"[what]"
ch9_route_svante_f9c4f8b5	svante	So... uh, what are you doing now?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2346	svante "[what]"
ch9_route_svante_8494665e	dorian	Now that my lantern's flying into the cosmos like a glitter-filled disaster? Probably will grab food with Elias. Why? Something wrong?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2347	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_svante_0f7b5817	svante	N-No! Nothing's wrong. I just...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2348	svante "[what]"
ch9_route_svante_28329ef7	svante	I just... um... wanted to see how you were doing. Thought maybe... I don't know, you'd want some company.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2349	svante "[what]"
ch9_route_svante_ba9b4805		There was something in the way he said it. A little nervous. A little hesitant. But it wasn't pity. It was care. Simple, honest care.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2351	"[what]"
