ch9_route_svante_f913c97e	svante	I haven't written anything yet. I wasn't here during the tragedy. I didn't lost anyone in Tianho. But I figured... maybe you'd want to share one with me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2354	svante "[what]"
ch9_route_svante_fe88be5f		I blinked, caught off guard for a moment. That softness in his voice-it made my chest ache a little. I nodded slowly.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2356	"[what]"
ch9_route_svante_8c8c9c50	dorian	I think that's a nice idea.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2358	dorian "[what]"
