ch9_route_svante_c47f50de	svante	I was so angry with you. With Elias. I blamed you both. I wanted someone to hurt as much as I did. And I hated myself for it. Because deep down, I knew...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2395	svante "[what]"
