ch9_route_niko_ad0073b9		Roboto actually spun in a little circle, his mechanical arms lifted like wings, twinkling lights flashing from his chest panel like party lights at a tiny disco.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2644	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_c5f3b9a3	dorian	Looks like they're having fun too.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2646	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_dc23427f	niko	A lot of fun, actually.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2647	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_74841b96		He reached into his pockets. His fingers curled around something small.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2649	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_5f33c68c		Then he held it out to me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2650	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_6015cd1a		A tiny charm.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2651	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_14b50160		Shaped like a yellow flower. Pressed and lacquered, its petals still delicate, preserved perfectly in time. It shimmered faintly beneath the lantern light-sun-touched and a little worn, like it had been carried for a while.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2652	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_4abc670b	niko	It's... a star lily.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2654	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_06655b13		His voice was soft. Too soft for someone who usually spoke in clean, clipped words and divine edicts.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2656	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_d4308ce8	niko	It only grows in the fields outside the Seventh Temple in Hamatame. They say it blooms at dawn. Even in winter.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2658	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_0dd987e7		He didn't meet my eyes. His gaze stayed fixed somewhere far off in the distance.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2660	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_4f3dc396	niko	It reminded me of you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2662	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_319a5e66		There was a pause.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2664	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_496a5774		His jaw tightened.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2665	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_4b4b16ba	niko	Bright... and stubborn.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2667	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_f8c3125c		I stared at the charm, turning it gently in my hand.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2669	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_690ea59a	dorian	Niko...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2671	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_e90bbc2b		He cleared his throat, still avoiding my gaze.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2673	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_a3a0243a	niko	You don't have to keep it. I just thought...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2675	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_c000961f		He stopped himself.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2677	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_0aa2d0a9		I didn't say anything. Instead, I leaned just a little closer. Let my shoulder brush against his. He tensed-but didn't pull away.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2678	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_55bed4a7		The fireworks above us flared again-red, gold, a spiraling white bloom like a galaxy unfolding. A quiet gasp rippled through the crowd again.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2679	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_645ca3dd		And in the middle of all that noise and color, Niko glanced toward me-just once.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2680	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_5289a3e8		Tetrad above... is he... blushing?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2681	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_4d82ff59		I tucked the charm carefully into my cloak pocket.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2682	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_133872ee	roboto	SPARKLER DISPERSION SYSTEM: ENGAGED!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2686	roboto "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_991d50c7	tedda_alive	SPARKLERS!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2687	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_8de41445	elias	Ahh!! Tim!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2688	elias "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_fca1d8b5	tim	I wanna hold two! Roboto!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2689	tim "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_c617e3cf	niko	You can, Tim. But make sure you practice caution. You don't know how many people die because of fireworks.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2690	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_120ed023	magnus	Don't be such a spoilsport, Niko! You're scaring the kids!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2691	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_e90bf5de	yuxuan	Niko, you're making it sound like they're juggling hand grenades like that Tian Xun guy.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2692	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_6b25da40		Weng appeared from behind a tree, holding her back like she just climbed a mountain.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2694	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_69d84408	weng	Tetrad save me-someone help me with this sparkler! Svante, could you be a dear and help me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2696	weng "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_c5e1dfa6	svante	I got you, Miss Weng!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2697	svante "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_09d22301		Laughter and sparks filled the air as the kids darted between glowing trails of light, their joy casting little halos of warmth over the night. Roboto spun in place again, strobing pink and purple like some overexcited festival lantern.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2699	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_271eff2f	roboto	S-S-Safe sparkler mode initiated!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2701	roboto "[what]"
ch9_route_niko_51f0be27		I looked at Niko again.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2703	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_2fda47bc		And before either of us spoke again, our fingers found each other.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2704	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_5f51274e		No words. Just the quiet meeting of palms. His fingers curled gently into mine.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2705	"[what]"
ch9_route_niko_7cdf15f0	niko	Thank you, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2707	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_94ee2df4	magnus	What a lovely made piece of artwork!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2718	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_db9c2747		I turned around, and there he was-Magnus. Standing a few paces away, hands in his ceremonial sleeves, eyes tilted upward toward the sky. His gaze followed the drifting lantern with "teDuH" scrawled proudly across its paper like it belonged in a museum of chaotic childhood art.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2720	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_3e32f913	magnus	A lone flame sails with crooked grace, a tribute born of sticky haste.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2722	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_e9972be3	magnus	The name misspelled; the ink still wet-but love was there. So, no regret.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2723	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_b3cea6fc		I couldn't help but chuckle.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2725	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_d6da9f17		Magnus turned his head slightly, his usual cool expression softening into the faintest grin. He stepped closer, hands behind his back now.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2726	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_45ec2ea9	magnus	I just wanted to see you! Is that alright? I also wanted to ask if you played an instrument.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2728	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_ec1f4b57		I shook my head a little.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2730	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_9b28522b	dorian	Not really. I mean, I've tried-kind of. I'm more of a... listener.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2732	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_466ef5e4	magnus	Mm... I play the harp. Nothing fancy. Just enough to annoy my tutors when I was a boy... I remember that much, at least.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2733	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_9fd24408	magnus	I could play for you sometime. If you'd like.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2734	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_b3728a2e		Something about the way he said that made the night feel warmer. Then, after a small pause, he tilted his head toward me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2736	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_4353a162	magnus	Would you... like to share a lantern with me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2738	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_6b463412		He held one out, delicately folded, the red ribbon trailing from one end like a promise. One lantern.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2740	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_6319bf66	dorian	...Yeah. I'd like that, Magnus.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2742	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_893334ea		We stepped away from the others, just far enough that the noise faded into a soft background hum. The lantern flickered between us as we walked, swaying gently in the breeze.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2744	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_70df748f		After a while, Magnus spoke again-softly.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2745	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_6d433ad2	magnus	I still don't remember everything. Not even most things. But... bits remain.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2747	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_7013efe0	dorian	Like what?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2748	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_f6169fe3		He thought for a moment, fingers brushing the red ribbon.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2750	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_9a956b5e	magnus	The taste of Galean persimmons. The sound of wind through temple bells. A song... Many songs... something about stars.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2752	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_daef9906	magnus	But most vividly, I remember... love. I had a woman. Her name was Adriana.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2753	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_1f5f6c70		I froze. The name hit like a dropped torch in the dark. He mentioned her before when we were fighting but I was too focused on surviving.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2755	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_da337841	dorian	Adriana? You mean the Adriana? One of the Immortal Tetrad?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2757	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_00e37f36	magnus	Immortal? Hahaha! No, she was mortal. Human. She lived in a village near the coast... or maybe it was on the cliffs. I can't quite see it. But I remember her hands. Her voice.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2758	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_c6f55d2e		His brow furrowed, eyes narrowing like he was reaching for something just beyond the veil.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2760	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_b26918b0	magnus	She was killed. I don't remember the man who did it. A villain with eyes like razors and a soul already given to ash.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2762	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_9450715f		I didn't know what to say. My heart tightened in my chest, caught between sympathy and something sharper-something I couldn't name yet.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2764	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_3e9c6766		But then, Magnus looked at me. And everything shifted.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2765	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_5b9a381b	magnus	After she died, I began to dream. Not of her. Of... someone else.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2767	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_3282f807	magnus	Of you, Dorian.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2768	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_f3e98a5d		I stared at him, stunned into silence.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2770	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_29bef839	magnus	I saw you-again and again. Calling out. In firelight, in snow, in the middle of shattered cities I'd never seen before. Calling for me. Begging me to wake up.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2772	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_2483ea08		A cold thrill ran down my spine.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2774	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_aa2be6bd	dorian	No... that can't be right. I'm the one who dreamed of you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2776	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_ce1668d5		The lantern between us flickered.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2778	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_6a688027		Magnus turned, slowly, fully, to face me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2779	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_d3171a2a		We stood in silence, just for a moment, as the fireworks cracked again above us-silver now, fanning out in spirals like celestial wings.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2780	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_1ae005f8	dorian	How long were you calling for me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2782	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_bb5e4b12	magnus	Long enough for me to believe I might never be found.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2783	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_9952a6d5	magnus	But I was... by you and our companions. For that, I thank you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2784	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_13d583da		I looked down at the lantern between us. We hadn't written anything yet. Without a word, I took up the brush.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2786	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_7d6a6664		Elara. Daniel. Sarah. Emily. Lucas.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2787	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_dbaa8de8		I wrote each name with care, letting the memory settle into every stroke of ink. Magnus stood beside me, watching-not intruding, but present, solid.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2788	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_73ed42b2		We lit the lantern together. The flame inside flickered once, then glowed warm and steady. Then... the call came.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2789	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_9b5e11e9	feng	Honored guests, travelers, friends from every border-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2791	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_6d69e9fe	feng	Tonight, our lanterns rise not just as tribute, but as light.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2792	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_570a8aa7	feng	May they find the ones we lost... and may the stars remember them always.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2793	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_73cbee0a	feng	On the count of three-One. Two. Three-Release!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2794	feng "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_b810b485		All around us, lanterns lifted.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2796	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_4c55a0f0		One by one. Then by the dozens. Then by the hundreds.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2797	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_9356dcb6		A quiet gasp rippled through the crowd. It was as if the heavens themselves were exhaling.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2798	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_134047bc		Lanterns floated upward like glowing petals caught in an invisible tide, rising into the night sky. Red, gold, amber. Some danced lazily in the wind, others soared with sharp purpose.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2799	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_bf2105a2		Our lantern joined them-gentle, steady, the names glowing softly like a heartbeat. And then-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2800	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_82e080a8		BOOM.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2805	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_bbc73beb		A firework lit the sky in brilliant pink.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2807	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_8607336d		Then another-crackling blue, gold, silver stars spinning across the clouds. One exploded into the shape of a dragon, another in the spiral of a flower.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2808	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_4a358cb9		It was breathtaking. Silent awe fell across the hilltop as the world above bloomed in light.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2809	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_2e3beeb4	tim	ELIAS!! ELIAS!! LOOK!! It's amazing!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2811	tim "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_8187fb4f	tedda_alive	OH MY GOODNESS! IT'S A FLOWER!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2812	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_528169e4	elias	A FROWER! A DWAGON!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2813	elias "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_084f0722	roboto	V-V-VISUAL SPECTACLE REGISTERED. SENSORY SYSTEMS OVERLOADING-IN A GOOD WAY! INITIATING JOY DANCE PROTOCOL!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2817	roboto "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_ad0073b9		Roboto actually spun in a little circle, his mechanical arms lifted like wings, twinkling lights flashing from his chest panel like party lights at a tiny disco.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2819	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_c5f3b9a3	dorian	Looks like they're having fun too.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2821	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_3ad23dd3	magnus	Oh, how the young ones delight! Come, Dorian-we should join them. At least for a moment.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2822	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_12233838		He offered me his hand - an invitation. I accepted it and we danced along with the kids.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2824	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_fa987251		Magnus lifted his voice in song-soft and smooth, a melody that felt older than the stars overhead. His voice wrapped around me like silk, and without thinking, I joined in.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2825	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_430fd2ba	magnus	O stars that sail the velvet night, O winds that carry dreams in flight...	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2827	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_b4fc2dd2	dorian	...If I must drift, let it be near, the one who makes the dark feel clear.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2828	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_4bb235d9		And then-	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2830	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_3fe0d363		BAM.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2831	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_a26c56e3	roboto	U-U-U-UNINTENTIONAL TRAJECTORY DETECTED-IMPACT IMMINENT!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2835	roboto "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_1ee3006a	tedda_alive	Oh my! I'm so sorry!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2836	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_b453be6b		There was a blur of motion-a flailing arm and suddenly I tripped. Magnus tried to catch me, but his foot caught the edge of his robe, and we both went tumbling back.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2838	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_aee193ed		I landed right on top of him.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2839	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_a98550b2		The world went quiet for a moment-just the thud of hearts, the echo of laughter, the flicker of firelight dancing across Magnus' cheeks.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2840	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_717349a9		I stared down at him, and he stared up at me.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2841	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_28effe91		One of my hands was braced on his chest, the other still holding a piece of my robe from the fall. His hands had instinctively found my waist.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2842	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_e32a961f	magnus	You... have a beautiful voice.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2844	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_93629e73	dorian	You too, Magnus. Sorry for landing on top of you.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2845	dorian "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_523e0051	magnus	That may have been the highlight of my evening.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2846	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_13655eec		We didn't move. We could have. But neither of us wanted to.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2848	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_133872ee	roboto	SPARKLER DISPERSION SYSTEM: ENGAGED!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2852	roboto "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_991d50c7	tedda_alive	SPARKLERS!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2853	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_8de41445	elias	Ahh!! Tim!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2854	elias "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_fca1d8b5	tim	I wanna hold two! Roboto!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2855	tim "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_c617e3cf	niko	You can, Tim. But make sure you practice caution. You don't know how many people die because of fireworks.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2856	niko "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_120ed023	magnus	Don't be such a spoilsport, Niko! You're scaring the kids!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2857	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_e90bf5de	yuxuan	Niko, you're making it sound like they're juggling hand grenades like that Tian Xun guy.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2858	yuxuan "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_6b25da40		Weng appeared from behind a tree, holding her back like she just climbed a mountain.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2860	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_69d84408	weng	Tetrad save me-someone help me with this sparkler! Svante, could you be a dear and help me?	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2862	weng "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_c5e1dfa6	svante	I got you, Miss Weng!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2863	svante "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_09d22301		Laughter and sparks filled the air as the kids darted between glowing trails of light, their joy casting little halos of warmth over the night. Roboto spun in place again, strobing pink and purple like some overexcited festival lantern.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2865	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_271eff2f	roboto	S-S-Safe sparkler mode initiated!	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2867	roboto "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_e04c55b6		We both burst into laughter as I finally rolled off Magnus-but not far. Just enough to still feel the warmth of him beside me, our arms brushing as we watched the sky blossom in fire.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2869	"[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_39d2c147	magnus	We'll finish that dance later.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2871	magnus "[what]"
ch9_route_magnus_0bc02a8f	dorian	It's a promise.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2872	dorian "[what]"
ch9_end_64e3c796		The hilltop was glowing now, cast in soft hues of flame and magic. Lanterns floated steadily upward, their light flickering like heartbeat echoes. Sparklers twirled in tiny hands.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2883	"[what]"
ch9_end_51dd7bbf		One by one, the firecrackers gave way to silence. The celebration slowly dissolved into the hush of night.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2884	"[what]"
ch9_end_23c9a115		We returned to the lab in quiet procession. My steps felt heavier, but not from exhaustion-from the weight of everything I'd seen, heard, and felt.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2885	"[what]"
ch9_end_c4874d08		I changed, climbed into bed, and let myself collapse into the softness. My heart was full. Maybe too full.	game/12_chapter_09_p2.rpy	2886	"[what]"
chapter_10_60fecd6c		A warm light shimmered behind my eyelids.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	176	"[what]"
chapter_10_e0dccd97		Then a voice-familiar, gentle, ancient, and layered with celestial resonance-whispered through the void.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	177	"[what]"
chapter_10_bc0475a4	prosperity_dragon	Child... Listen to me...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	179	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
chapter_10_c93b1db5	prosperity_dragon	My child...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	180	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
chapter_10_72b5f01f		But just as I reached toward her-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	182	"[what]"
chapter_10_c58b41a1		Darkness.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	183	"[what]"
chapter_10_9dc69a17		The warmth was ripped away, swallowed by the cold. The world twisted into shadows. A heavy footstep echoed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	184	"[what]"
chapter_10_305415db		The air turned acrid.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	185	"[what]"
chapter_10_2da0cf11	yk	Dragonkin...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	187	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_deb56d47		I spun around.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	189	"[what]"
chapter_10_d8a555e8	yk	They sleep. Exhausted. Vulnerable. That ridiculous ceremony drained them. Their warriors lie scattered, half-drunk on memory. Tianho is wide open.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	195	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_4639db14		He raised a clawed hand, and behind him, silhouettes moved-legions of yaoguai hidden in the folds of night. Waiting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	197	"[what]"
chapter_10_c5db06bb	yk	Before dawn, we strike. At their armies... at their soul. Their schools. Their homes. Their children.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	199	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_50222ddf	yk	Let them mourn again. Let them remember anew.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	200	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_5a280210	dorian	You monster!! What do you want?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	201	dorian "[what]"
chapter_10_4c309bec		He tilted his head, lips curling.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	203	"[what]"
chapter_10_4baf3040	yk	A deal. An agreement.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	205	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_ad7057d3	yk	Give me Magnus. Give me the winged man's unconscious body.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	206	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_55f7da8f	yk	Do that... and Tianho lives. No blood. No fire. No screams. Just peace.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	207	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_cc481897	yk	Refuse...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	208	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_b43cfda5	yk	And mark my words-Tianho will be ash before the sun rises.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	209	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_cb9a1bb8	dorian	You wouldn't dare-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	210	dorian "[what]"
chapter_10_1f2aa009		The Yaoguai King's eyes glinted-then he raised one jagged claw.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	212	"[what]"
chapter_10_b3587eb4	yk	You doubt me? Fine. See for yourself.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	214	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_7a69f45b		He snapped his fingers.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	216	"[what]"
chapter_10_7b873f50		Visions flooded my mind, like a dam had burst inside my skull. Horrifyingly vivid:	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	217	"[what]"
chapter_10_0fb7f071		Yaoguai tearing through Tianho's sleeping streets-claws raking silk robes, teeth sinking into flesh. Fire against moonlight. Screams. A mother trying to shield her baby with trembling hands before her head ripped apart.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	218	"[what]"
chapter_10_231ab636		A soldier barely awake before teeth pierced his side. Children trampled in panic. Houses ablaze. Memorial lanterns crushed. I felt the people's agony.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	219	"[what]"
chapter_10_ac461a7c		The pain was unbearable.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	220	"[what]"
chapter_10_9dc15b22		When the vision snapped away, I nearly collapsed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	221	"[what]"
chapter_10_104609b8	yk	Now you understand. Make your decision, dragonkin...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	223	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_de0ae95b		I steadied myself, heart pounding like a war drum.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	225	"[what]"
chapter_10_a97d93c3	dorian	I... I need time. To think.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	227	dorian "[what]"
chapter_10_99f6203f	yk	There is no time. You will choose here and now. The second you say no... they move.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	228	yk "[what]"
chapter_10_cea5f9c3		My mind whirled-and then, I heard the familiar voice again.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	230	"[what]"
chapter_10_776b1217	prosperity_dragon	I sense him... He's getting desperate. Impatient. His armies WILL attack Tianho.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	232	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
chapter_10_7dd41178		My blood burned.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	234	"[what]"
chapter_10_612e7c88		Rage-bitter, ancient-surged up. This monster.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	235	"[what]"
chapter_10_6c214c65		He killed Elara.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	236	"[what]"
chapter_10_0f3677f8		He killed my children.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	237	"[what]"
chapter_10_c6d559a8		Their faces-gone too soon, smiling in dreams I could never have again. And now he wanted more?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	238	"[what]"
chapter_10_7392895b		And then I heard it.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	239	"[what]"
chapter_10_c33911c4		Elias' voice, giggling under fireworks. Tim spinning in the lanternlight. Weng's laugh. Yuxuan's smile. The people-my people.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	240	"[what]"
chapter_10_1707377c	prosperity_dragon	Breathe, my child... I am with you. Let not vengeance cloud your judgment.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	242	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
chapter_10_ae7abc93	prosperity_dragon	The Yaoguai King... does not know what Magnus truly is and neither do you. To surrender him would be to surrender the unknown.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	243	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
chapter_10_4f9f2230	prosperity_dragon	But if you refuse... the people of Tianho, weary from celebration, still dressed in joy, will awaken to carnage.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	244	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_2fb1cfb4	yk	I knew you were always going to say yes.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	273	yk "[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_b6751436		The Yaoguai King's lips twisted into a crooked smile-satisfied, smug, victorious. He raised a hand, and the shadows behind him dispersed like vapor. The threat was withdrawn.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	275	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_4887e3fb		Tianho would wake to another quiet morning. The streets would remain unburnt. Children would still laugh in the courtyards. No one would know how close they came to death.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	281	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_d58782d1		But the cost...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	282	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_6461b4c5		Magnus was taken, unconscious and bound in chains. I wasn't allowed to see his face. Not a word, not a goodbye.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	283	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_40a6b223		The Prosperity Dragon's voice fell into silence. It did not return. It left me completely. Even its warmth was gone from my dreams. Its presence-snuffed out like a candle in deep water.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	284	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_18c94920		Days passed. Then weeks. Then-the world began to crumble. We heard the whispers first.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	285	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_2bad6eed		Mjoll, the northern realm of snow and light, was the first to fall.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	290	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_75bf3828		They said the mountains cracked open, that black mist spilled from the earth, and creatures with no mouths and too many eyes swept through the villages. The screams were swallowed. The snow ran red.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	291	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_efa3bc5f		Hinami, Gale, the Centennial Isles, all of them destroyed by yaoguai.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	292	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_6593b2ce		But Tianho... Tianho remained untouched. Exactly as he promised. Perfectly, horrifically untouched. We had no contact with other nations. Not that we had a choice. There was no one left to contact. People began to leave. Not to run... just to fade.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	293	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_cc51a699		Chung-hee left one night and never came back. No farewells. No goodbyes. We never heard from him or the empire of Kyeongjang.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	294	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_55b65d19		Kyeongjang... Now, lost to time.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	295	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_de0fcc4c		Niko joined the Prophets of Enoch, walking westward in silence. He told us, as the chosen of the Death God, that the world would be remade in its image. He smiled when he left. He didn't say goodbye.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	299	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_4eb1a11e		Svante went home-to ash and broken stone. He said he needed to make peace with his brothers and sisters.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	300	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_45d97b3a		His dead brothers and sisters. We never heard from him again.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	301	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_6a85e2a7		As for Yuxuan, Cheng Industries crumbled. The deals stopped. The trade dried. The joy left his voice, then the light left his eyes.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	302	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_5623c5bf		We found him one day, staring blankly into a broken screen, an empty bottle in his hand. In the end, it was just me and Elias.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	303	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_399f3a2d		We wandered through ashen fields where golden rice once swayed. We crossed rivers that now reeked of rot.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	304	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_8b237268		The towns were corpses-hollowed buildings with doors swinging open like mouths frozen in screams. There was no sun. Only smoke.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	305	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_d005404d		Elias held my hand tighter each day. He didn't cry anymore. He was learning what silence meant.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	306	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_a92da643		But the silence... didn't last. The Yaoguai followed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	307	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_3460f54d		I saw them.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	308	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_e627fce9		Dozens. Then hundreds. Their claws gleamed like obsidian glass. Their eyes glowed with hunger. They walked without sound, without breath, without mercy.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	309	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_97ad72b8		They had waited. And now... they came for us.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	310	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_accept_0f97edeb		The last thing I remember was the sound of him screaming my name-and then the light went out.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	311	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_82c042f9	dorian	Never.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	322	dorian "[what]"
ch10_refuse_e6ce32a0		The word left my mouth like thunder-final and resolute.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	324	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_e2b6510d		The Yaoguai King's expression shifted. No longer smug. No longer amused.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	325	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_ab597b91		It twisted-wrath incarnate, as though my defiance was the deepest betrayal he'd ever known. A thick silence bloomed between us. It pulsed like a second heartbeat, dense and waiting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	326	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_150298fc	yk	Then so be it. Let them drown in fire.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	328	yk "[what]"
ch10_refuse_99264e1f		He took a step forward, face inches from mine, his breath a rot of ash and centuries.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	330	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_2b11b416	yk	Remember this night. It will become legend. And the blood spilled will be on your hands, dragonkin.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	332	yk "[what]"
ch10_refuse_18cdc787	yk	But should you change your mind-and you will-you can find me where you saw Magnus. I'll be waiting...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	333	yk "[what]"
ch10_refuse_8dae87ae		He's talking about the room with the sealed door.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	335	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_49a864d8		Then, without another word, his body turned to black smoke-hissing as it evaporated-and the shadows surged behind him, spreading like a plague across the horizon.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	336	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_cb0d69fd		They vanished into the winds. But I felt them still.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	337	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_d070c771		And then I heard his voice.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	338	"[what]"
ch10_refuse_871fb5bd	prosperity_dragon	Child! Wake-wake now!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	340	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_refuse_3fbcb130	prosperity_dragon	They march now. They will strike from the southern hills.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	341	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_refuse_0ac3177f	prosperity_dragon	Rally the Paladins. Gather every ally you can get. Help fortify the defenses. Set the alarm bells alight-yes, light them. The sound will not carry fast enough.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	342	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_refuse_abdf85f6	prosperity_dragon	AWAKE! NOW!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	343	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_refuse_ceebe34d		My eyes flew open.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	345	"[what]"
ch10_consult_80210dfd		I closed my eyes, my hands shaking.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	356	"[what]"
ch10_consult_533fd1c6	dorian	...Please. I don't know what to do.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	358	dorian "[what]"
ch10_consult_8c679455	prosperity_dragon	Then listen, child... Let me tell you a story. As old as flame and wind...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	359	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_7accbfea	prosperity_dragon	Long time ago before Enoch, there was once a prince named Zhan. Keeper of Li Mengtia's Endless Garden.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	360	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_6865d9ef	prosperity_dragon	The Endless Garden was a place of miracles. Flowers that bloomed through winter's frost. Laughter that echoed across rivers clear as glass. His people adored him. The prosperity of his land knows no bounds.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	361	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_caaa8a49	prosperity_dragon	At the center of it all... was a strange stone. Smooth, humming faintly. Zhan didn't know what it was. Just that it had always been there.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	362	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_394ee856	prosperity_dragon	Seasons passed. The Garden grew richer. Zhan became the wealthiest of rulers. The most prosperous of them all.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	363	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_dc44c930	prosperity_dragon	But Zhan grew afraid. A conqueror came from the west. One who promised to spare the Garden if Zhan gave up the strange stone in the middle of the garden.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	364	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_77a82370	prosperity_dragon	Zhan, afraid to lose everything, agreed. And true to his word... the conqueror spared the Garden.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	365	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_0d11f333	prosperity_dragon	But days passed, Zhan returned to find the trees wilting. The soil rotting. The laughter gone. The stone had not just fed the land... it was the land.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	366	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_bdc8a3c6	prosperity_dragon	And the conqueror? He used the stone to build a fortress of shadows. And from it, he conquered ten other kingdoms. He slaughtered their men. Enslaved their women and children.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	367	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_5e824424	prosperity_dragon	And Zhan, once beloved, stood in the ruins of what he had traded. He wept, of what thought he gave up a stone... but he had given away everything.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	368	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_23507958	prosperity_dragon	It is not my choice to make. I trust you to make the right decision, child.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	369	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_consult_648453c4		I opened my eyes.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	371	"[what]"
ch10_consult_16abb33e		The Yaoguai King awaits for my decision.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	372	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_6f514f36		My body was drenched in sweat. The room was trembling. No-not the room. The ground.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	386	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_a9a58d8a	prosperity_dragon	Dorian! Listen to me! There is no room for hesitation now.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	388	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_27d8aaab		Elias was still sleeping near me. I touched his hair gently.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	390	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_ca0531de		Then I quickly got dressed. There was no time for questions. No time for doubt.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	391	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_98ac8d6a		Chace: But... love, come on! I barely know him!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	396	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_638c39cf		Isagani: You said he just turned fourteen a few days ago, love. Fourteen. And his mother just died trying to keep him from being deported. Don't you care what happens to Yevhen?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	397	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_6b78b9af		Chace: Of course I care! It's just-I don't know how to be anything to him. He's just a half-sibling. I didn't even know my dad had another kid until days ago.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	398	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_47802297		Isagani: Funny. That didn't stop you with Maja.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	399	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_e42d0924		Chace: Don't bring her into this, love. She's different.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	400	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_f2c3abdb		Isagani: How? Because she was already in your life? Because loving her didn't feel like a risk?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	401	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_473c6e5a		Chace: Yevhen's just a kid. A scared, angry kid who definitely doesn't want anything to do with me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	402	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_f49ba272		Isagani: Then be the first person who doesn't walk away. Love, if you turn your back on him now... that's not the man I said yes to.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	403	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_8a5c2881		Storyteller: Find out what happens next... in the explosive sequel to-A Tropical-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	404	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_64e235ae	roboto	A-A-Audiodrama paused by M-M-Master Yuxuan.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	408	roboto "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_f2a525a6	yuxuan	So... thoughts? Come on, I want honest feedback here!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	409	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_fa1b181c	niko	For starters, I love the acting. The guy who played Chace was perfect for the role.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	410	niko "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_bd87ed8f	svante	I-I agree! Even his younger voice! The way he cried... it brought tears to my eyes!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	411	svante "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_ec530852	magnus	~Noel's voice... was heaven-sent... like silk, like rain, like sweet lament~	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	412	magnus "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_ef25923d	yuxuan	YES!! Roboto, take note of that. Praise from Magnus is a sign we're about to break the market!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	413	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_c1f48bd1	roboto	N-N-Noted. Cheng Industries... preparing hit tracker update. Logging Magnus endorsem-m-ment.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	414	roboto "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_76c0c31c	niko	Great. *yawns* Are we done here? I'm late for prayer.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	415	niko "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_7cb0c6d8	yuxuan	Honestly, I think Isagani's voice is underrated too. So grounded. So real. But enough about my tastes, I-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	416	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_935eded0		And then... I stepped into the room, the weight of urgency pressing on my shoulders.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	418	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_3a0b2ab9	dorian	They're coming.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	420	dorian "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_6aef8218	magnus	Who?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	421	magnus "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_bb88c1d1		The room stilled. Every eye turned to me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	423	"[what]"
ch10_common_wake_e9817d25	dorian	The Yaoguai King has made his move. The attack has begun.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	425	dorian "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_83d8df16	yuxuan	Wait... w-what?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	426	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_58eee150	roboto	I-I-Incoming threat? P-Please reconfirm?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	430	roboto "[what]"
ch10_common_wake_912bb6a2	dorian	There's no time. Tianho will be attacked under an hour.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	431	dorian "[what]"
ch10_departure_323a6090		We woke up everyone inside the underground lab-Chung-hee, Miss Weng, and the kids. Tedda quietly gathered Elias and Tim and led them into a single room, locking the door behind her to keep them safe.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	445	"[what]"
ch10_departure_a41fe84c	dorian	Please... take care of Elias, Tedda.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	447	dorian "[what]"
ch10_departure_e537db43	tedda_alive	Don't worry, Sir Dorian. I'll make sure Elias and Tim are safe. I'll lock the door.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	448	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch10_departure_85556fd6		They slept together in a pile of pillows.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	450	"[what]"
ch10_departure_f9c240a4		The rest of us-me, Niko, Yuxuan, Chung-hee, Svante, Magnus, Miss Weng, and Roboto-hurried to the living room for a quick, urgent meeting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	451	"[what]"
ch10_departure_a1d7f9c7	chung_hee	Are you certain this is happening?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	453	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_departure_36885d1f	magnus	I trust Dorian. That's enough for me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	454	magnus "[what]"
ch10_departure_f3328100	yuxuan	It has to be that damned Yaoguai King. Probably the one who sent a doppelgänger to impersonate me! For all we know, anyone here could be fake!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	455	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_departure_27468dbb	chung_hee	Yuxuan, don't worry. I saw through each of your minds. We're all safe.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	456	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_departure_dbeb446f	yuxuan	Oh... thank the Prosperity Dragon.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	457	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_departure_ce0d7902	dorian	Yu, can you send a message to Gao and Jiang immediately? We need to reach Paladin Feng. If he's still at Tianho at this hour, he might be able to mobilize the other paladins in time.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	458	dorian "[what]"
ch10_departure_1d21be6b		Paladin Feng... My old friend. Once my closest ally. If he's still there, he'll act. He has to act.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	460	"[what]"
ch10_departure_a589d556	svante	What about Lady Aoi? She's an incredible water channeler. She could make a huge difference.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	462	svante "[what]"
ch10_departure_584d2906	niko	That is, if she's still in Tianho.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	463	niko "[what]"
ch10_departure_a38822f3	svante	She sang during the festivities, right? That means she might still be nearby. Though... she might ask for compensation.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	464	svante "[what]"
ch10_departure_dd4877c4	weng	Her song was beautiful! What a lovely young woman.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	465	weng "[what]"
ch10_departure_b133725f	magnus	Wait... she's the one who sang at the festival? AND she's an incredible water channeler?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	466	magnus "[what]"
ch10_departure_071d5cd0	svante	Yes! That's why Father hired her as a mercenary after Dorian. She deserted when Paladin Feng made a better offer.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	467	svante "[what]"
ch10_departure_88cec83d	chung_hee	She deserted when she and Tian Xun failed to eliminate me. Anyway, let's just hope she's still working with Feng. If she is, we might have a fighting chance.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	468	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_departure_56b0b294	yuxuan	Roboto, establish connection with Li Gao and Sun Jiang immediately!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	469	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_departure_0c1ec4ab	roboto	G-G-Got it, Master Yuxuan. Establishing connection in 3...2...1...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	473	roboto "[what]"
ch10_departure_9912b42f		The device crackled. A hologram shimmered to life-a flickering image of Jiang in his Cheng Industries uniform.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	475	"[what]"
ch10_departure_b5afb238	jiang	Good evening, sir Yuxuan. We're receiving your transmission. What's going on?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	477	jiang "[what]"
ch10_departure_453a7638	yuxuan	Yes, Jiang. This is a full-scale alert. Patch in Gao-now.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	478	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_departure_b88eb36a	jiang	Right away, sir.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	479	jiang "[what]"
ch10_departure_db36e3ff	yuxuan	Listen closely. There is no time for pleasantries. The Yaoguai are coming.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	480	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_departure_8d2ce573	gao	Y-Yaoguai? What are they doing here?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	481	gao "[what]"
ch10_departure_f3bb9dbe	jiang	Gao, Paladin Feng is still here. I'm telling this to him now.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	482	jiang "[what]"
ch10_departure_a048f3df	jiang	Anything else, Master Yuxuan?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	483	jiang "[what]"
ch10_departure_f7399e32	yuxuan	Nothing else. Please, just tell Paladin Feng.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	484	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_departure_eed4f357	jiang	Yes, sir. Let's get to it, Gao. Hurry!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	485	jiang "[what]"
ch10_departure_5df1c7db		The screen blinked out.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	487	"[what]"
ch10_departure_cd7dc8b2	roboto	C-C-Connection terminated, Master Yuxuan.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	491	roboto "[what]"
ch10_departure_fbbe8407		I exhaled, realizing I'd been holding my breath. The lab felt heavier now-like the walls themselves could sense what was coming.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	498	"[what]"
ch10_departure_53a159b9	roboto	F-F-Fear levels in the room are fluctuating at 63%. Suggesting calming ambient music-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	502	roboto "[what]"
ch10_departure_dd9429a1	chung_hee	If this happens tonight, we don't have long. We leave for Tianho now.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	503	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_departure_20d3c5eb	svante	We can set up a makeshift command post there. An hour's not enough to mount full defense-but we have to try.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	504	svante "[what]"
ch10_departure_f6948b30	niko	No more waiting. We move. Now.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	505	niko "[what]"
ch10_departure_65a9a57d	magnus	Four hundred years, I slept in ice, and this is the week I wake to? Part of me thinks... maybe I was waiting for this.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	506	magnus "[what]"
ch10_departure_02b53138	weng	Roboto and I will stay behind to protect the kids. This lab's shielded, reinforced. It'll hold.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	507	weng "[what]"
ch10_departure_0f6682f1		She snapped her fingers. A flame sparked in her palm, steady and sharp.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	509	"[what]"
ch10_departure_52914883	weng	Any yaoguai stupid enough to get through that door? I'll make sure they burn to ash.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	511	weng "[what]"
ch10_departure_ee6a5638		A loud crack echoed from her spine as she stretched.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	513	"[what]"
ch10_departure_6529df1b	magnus	Such fire from a woman of iron and ember. But bones do not lie, Miss Weng.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	515	magnus "[what]"
ch10_departure_9ce12502	weng	Oh shush, Magnus. Believe me, I've felled more enemies than I could count when I was your age.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	516	weng "[what]"
ch10_departure_596eda34	weng	By the stars-getting old is not for the weak. Still... I trust the door holds. It always has.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	517	weng "[what]"
ch10_departure_d8e01029	weng	Roboto, be a dear and brew me a cup of tea, will you?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	518	weng "[what]"
ch10_departure_e8c20900	roboto	T-T-Take care, Masters! Please stay alive!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	522	roboto "[what]"
ch10_departure_3432eabd	roboto	I'll make you a quick cup of tea, Miss W-W-Weng.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	523	roboto "[what]"
ch10_departure_e0dd715a		We exited the door. The big metallic door for the underground laboratory closed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	528	"[what]"
ch10_departure_9b8f5c1d	door_voice	Good evening, Master Yuxuan. A reminder: Tonight is still the Fifth Anniversary of the Tragedy of Tianho. A day of remembrance for those we lost.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	530	door_voice "[what]"
ch10_departure_71f043ce	door_voice	Current city events include an afterparty at the Tavern of the Jade Serpent. Please drink responsibly.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	531	door_voice "[what]"
ch10_departure_7051251c	magnus	A... talking door!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	532	magnus "[what]"
ch10_departure_489068df	niko	The city's partying... Not that I can blame them. But there's going to be a yaoguai attack. Soon.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	533	niko "[what]"
ch10_departure_7ea3d6e6	yuxuan	Double the security protocols. We cannot allow anyone unauthorized to go inside.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	534	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_departure_c0f0041e	door_voice	Security enhancement confirmed. Initiating Protocol Lockdown: JIN-SHIELD. All channeling frequencies-nullified.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	538	door_voice "[what]"
ch10_departure_ae9c8053	door_voice	Perimeter defenses active. Unauthorized entry will result in automated defense response.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	539	door_voice "[what]"
ch10_departure_899cde26	door_voice	No unauthorized being shall pass.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	540	door_voice "[what]"
ch10_departure_f521e348	niko	Are you sure this thing can hold, Yuxuan?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	541	niko "[what]"
ch10_departure_85a2600d	door_voice	I am forged from Jinyan steel, tempered in the magma-forges of Yonghai. I do not buckle. I do not burn. I do not break.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	542	door_voice "[what]"
ch10_departure_844c0168		Svante lifted his hand, trying to channel the metal. It won't budge.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	544	"[what]"
ch10_departure_7c5c95f3	svante	It's right. My energy's getting dampened. Can't push even a breeze through it.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	546	svante "[what]"
ch10_departure_ff7ea070	door_voice	Thank you for your feedback. Here at Cheng Industries, we bring change. And yes, we take custom orders.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	547	door_voice "[what]"
ch10_departure_65daf17a	dorian	We're counting on you to protect them. The children... Weng... everyone inside.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	548	dorian "[what]"
ch10_departure_58085b90	door_voice	Affirmative. As per Master Yuxuan's settings, this unit will not play the Cheng Industries jingle unless he is 10 meters away.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	549	door_voice "[what]"
ch10_departure_810ef164		The door's lights flickered once, then faded, locking into silent vigilance.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	551	"[what]"
ch10_departure_b305bee4		Everyone stood in a circle-Yuxuan's eyes scanning a datapad, Niko gripping his prayer beads, Svante nervously adjusting his gloves. Magnus, tapping his foot impatiently. Chung-hee, arms crossed, his brows drawn low.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	553	"[what]"
ch10_departure_a6a896e3		All their attention was on Tianho.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	554	"[what]"
ch10_departure_b1c9cafe	yuxuan	We'll head straight to the eastern gate. We can set up defenses there.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	556	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_departure_e18d6781	niko	We need to get people to safety first.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	557	niko "[what]"
ch10_departure_3ba2a0ec	svante	I really hope Lady Aoi is still there. We'll need her...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	558	svante "[what]"
ch10_departure_36c32faf	chung_hee	We only have 40 minutes. We need to hurry. I can use the amulet of teleportation to-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	559	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_departure_da1b1b27	dorian	Everyone, I'm not coming with you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	560	dorian "[what]"
ch10_departure_179ed7c1		Heads turned. Silence fell like a blade.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	562	"[what]"
ch10_departure_ccc9dffe	magnus	What? No, Dorian, we need every fighter we can get-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	564	magnus "[what]"
ch10_departure_2d642cdc	dorian	You need to go. All of you. Tianho needs you. You're stronger together-and you'll be able to set up defenses faster without me slowing you down.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	565	dorian "[what]"
ch10_departure_958f278d	chung_hee	You're thinking of facing the Yaoguai King alone?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	566	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_departure_cfada583		I nodded once. My throat tightened.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	568	"[what]"
ch10_departure_a07bc288	dorian	Elara. Sarah. Daniel. Emily... Lucas.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	570	dorian "[what]"
ch10_departure_945da701		Their names cut into me like glass.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	572	"[what]"
ch10_departure_5c95cd15	dorian	He took everything. Burned it all. And I... I can't walk forward without facing him. This isn't just battle for me. It's blood. It's grief. It's personal.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	574	dorian "[what]"
ch10_departure_5f30934d		The wind swallowed their responses, if any came. Behind me, I could feel their stares lingering. But my path was set.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	576	"[what]"
ch10_departure_041b691a		Tonight, I would face the monster who tore my world apart. And either I would return...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	577	"[what]"
ch10_departure_8eba71db		...or I would die with fire in my fists, and my family's names on my lips.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	578	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_170c1d23		I kept walking.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	596	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c5747dc7		Each step carried the weight of ghosts I could no longer protect. My fists clenched. My jaw tightened. I had to do this. Alone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	597	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e6f79b24		Then I heard it-footsteps pounding fast behind me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	598	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_dbe36ebd	yuxuan	DORIAN!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	600	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_b39a09df		I stopped. His voice cut through the silence like a blade. Urgent. Cracked. Furious.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	602	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_befb5dba	yuxuan	What in the Prosperity Dragon's name are you doing!?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	604	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_aeddd60a		I turned halfway. There he was-panting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	606	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_add5d141	dorian	Yu, please. Go back. Go to Tianho.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	608	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e1ecd43f	yuxuan	No. No, no, no-you don't get to play hero right now. This is suicide, Dorian! You know what the Yaoguai King can do! You really think you can take him alone?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	609	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_0b265b33	dorian	I have to do this.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	610	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_7d6aa67e	yuxuan	No, you don't! You could help us! You could protect more people! Why throw yourself away for revenge? It's selfish.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	611	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_ef40aee9	yuxuan	I thought we were past this. I thought we were a team. I... I thought we were family ever since the blizzard at Frostcradle. I...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	612	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c1d0a264		His voice broke.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	614	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e365dc7d	yuxuan	I don't want to lose you, Dorian...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	616	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_efeef266	dorian	I don't plan on dying, Yu.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	617	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c2b25f36	yuxuan	Well, neither did your wife. Nor your kids. Nor Count Vasily. Nor my friends. Nor-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	618	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_f5cc7ff1	yuxuan	You know what? Fine.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	619	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_aad58977		His hands shook. His eyes shimmered from the underground lights, unshed tears.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	621	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_517175ed	yuxuan	Do what you want. Be the tragic Paladin. Die a noble death if that's what helps you sleep.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	623	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a85d240a		He turned, robe whipping behind him as he ran. His footsteps faded behind me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	625	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_3b286c3e		And I kept walking. Toward the dark. Toward him.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	626	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_f782305f		I'm so sorry, Yu.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	627	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_170c1d23_1		I kept walking.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	631	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c5747dc7_1		Each step carried the weight of ghosts I could no longer protect. My fists clenched. My jaw tightened. I had to do this. Alone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	632	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_bbebeb8e		Then a voice thundered inside my head, not spoken aloud but pulsing through my chest like a divine decree.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	633	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_aa600614	chung_hee	Dorian. What do you think you are doing?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	635	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_6298168b		Footsteps followed, fast, heavy, resolute. Chung-hee was behind me-his presence unmistakable.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	637	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_eea46aac	dorian	Go to Tianho. They need you more than I do.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	639	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_8813a99b	chung_hee	The Yaoguai King isn't some warlord you can stab through the heart. He's not a man-he's a force. A storm. You'll be throwing yourself into a hurricane fueled by rot and fury.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	640	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a4f152fe	chung_hee	You'll die for vengeance, Dorian. And it won't bring them back.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	641	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_516063e0	dorian	This is personal, Chung.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	642	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_ce53ae6a	chung_hee	Personal? You think you're the only one who's ever lost someone? You're not the only man dragging corpses through the dark, Dorian.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	643	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_46123ac0		I froze. Just for a second.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	645	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_df0ae354	chung_hee	I once told Aunt Ji-hye I had to face King Gustav alone. Said no one else could understand. That no one else could carry my war. I thought I was being noble. Brave.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	647	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a39042ea	chung_hee	I was wrong. I stood there in the battleground. Like a fool. Begging for mercy for anyone who would come by.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	648	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_faddffdb	chung_hee	Then you and the others came along. You, Niko, Svante, Yuxuan and Elias. You nursed me back to health.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	649	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_fbff4096	chung_hee	Then I realized I made a mistake. A mistake that nearly cost me my life. I would've died there if you-if all of you-hadn't been there.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	650	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_f82997a6	dorian	This is different. You don't know what he took from me, Chung. I can't even hear his voice without seeing my family's faces-burning, screaming, gone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	651	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_62a9163d	chung_hee	You think I don't know what that feels like?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	652	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e0152b5a	chung_hee	Every night, I lie awake imagining how my mother and father must have died. Whether they were afraid. Whether they suffered. Whether they called for me before dying at Tianho.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	653	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_21500d78		He stepped closer, and the air thickened.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	655	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_957c7e2f	chung_hee	Their deaths hang on me like chains, Dorian. But I bear them. And I'm telling you-don't add your name to the dead by going alone. I'm begging you-don't do this.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	657	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_d13c27bd		I stared at him for a moment. And I turned. Started walking again. Behind me, I heard nothing. No words. No movement. Only silence.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	659	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_17b43a9d		...I'm sorry, Chung.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	660	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_170c1d23_2		I kept walking.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	664	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c5747dc7_2		Each step carried the weight of ghosts I could no longer protect. My fists clenched. My jaw tightened. I had to do this. Alone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	665	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e6f79b24_1		Then I heard it-footsteps pounding fast behind me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	666	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_331e99b8	svante	Dorian!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	668	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c2280494		It was Svante. Breathless. His face flushed, eyes wide with panic and frustration as he caught up beside me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	670	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_cf0d7f00	svante	You can't go alone! The Yaoguai King-he's not just some monster. He's old, Dorian. Too powerful. Please, come back. Come with us to Tianho.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	672	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_918ad51c	svante	Yuxuan's worried sick. I'm worried sick. We need to-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	673	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a7afbdab	dorian	Svante, go back. I have to do this alone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	674	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_04175fd0	svante	W-What? Why?! Why does it have to be you, and why does it have to be alone?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	675	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_314da799	dorian	It... It's personal.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	676	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_1ba47d63		He grabbed my arm-his grip trembling.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	678	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_1432ac35	svante	You're being selfish. What about Elias? You're all he has. He lost Queen Ekaterina, his mother-don't make him lose you, too!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	680	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_55c9129e		I looked at him, my heart twisting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	682	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_b5da7058	dorian	I'm not planning to die.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	684	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a7440225		Svante looked down.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	686	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_0c709663	svante	Neither did Kristin when she stood up to Count Vasily.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	688	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_3c16159f	svante	You were there, Dorian. You saw what they did to her. And then I blamed you and Elias.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	689	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_d769a759	svante	So don't lie to me now. Don't say you'll survive just because you want to.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	690	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_16b8cb94		Silence.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	692	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_0b265b33_1	dorian	I have to do this.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	694	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_8b5046c0		He stared at me, breath ragged, anger and sorrow warring on his face. And then-He let go.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	696	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_fa746f4a		He turned away, shoulders slumped. But just before he walked back to the others, he looked over his shoulder. His eyes-violet-met mine.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	697	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_6db6fe05	svante	I know we only met a few days ago but...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	699	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_0ad0bccc	svante	...Please don't make me mourn you too.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	700	svante "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_bc6476f6		I watched him disappear into the shadows, his silhouette swallowed by the dim underground lights. I stood there for a moment longer, the ache in my chest heavier than before.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	702	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_689fce2f		I'm sorry, Svante.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	703	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_170c1d23_3		I kept walking.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	707	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c5747dc7_3		Each step carried the weight of ghosts I could no longer protect. My fists clenched. My jaw tightened. I had to do this. Alone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	708	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e6f79b24_2		Then I heard it-footsteps pounding fast behind me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	709	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_3c2f7f58	niko	Dorian.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	711	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_afe25e13		I stopped, but didn't turn. The sound of his footsteps caught up with mine.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	713	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_8deb8a0a	niko	Forget me. Forget about the others. But what about Elias?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	715	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_cba04aab		I flinched.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	717	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a82942e3	niko	You know the Yaoguai King isn't just some monster in the dark. You've seen what he is. What he does.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	719	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_5c9e0b7d	niko	You're not invincible, Dorian. Please... come back to Tianho. Maybe we can-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	720	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_824ba2fa	dorian	I have to do this, Niko.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	721	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_b683106a	niko	Then I'm coming with you. You shouldn't-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	722	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_db52214d		I shook my head and raised my hand. And he stopped. Stilled. His expression twisted, somewhere between pleading and fury.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	724	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_6b7f4e9d	niko	Are you really willing to leave Elias behind? Leave him fatherless? To chase a death you know is coming?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	726	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_b5da7058_1	dorian	I'm not planning to die.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	727	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_acdcf56d	niko	Well, neither did Kaito.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	728	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_6d68ef5a	niko	He thought he could save everyone in that burning building. Thought strength would be enough. Now he's in Xianlun.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	729	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_713c0a90		I turned slightly. Just enough to look at him from the corner of my eye.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	731	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_526e777a	dorian	You, of all people-Enoch's chosen and a Prophet of the Death God-should understand. Death is natural. Normal. I'm choosing this. That's the Law of Enoch, right?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	733	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_81cb7de2	dorian	Don't deny someone their death.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	734	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_9fe97bc8		That silenced him. For a beat. Then-he stepped back, something breaking behind his eyes.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	736	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e34cfdab	niko	Fine.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	738	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_ee724c76	niko	Then may the Death God, Lord Enoch, greet your sacrifice with open arms and empty hands.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	739	niko "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_bb849b9d		He turned without another word and began walking away.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	741	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_f6739b0f		I turned, too and walked forward. I didn't look back.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	742	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_1444d3b2		Forgive me, Niko.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	743	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_170c1d23_4		I kept walking.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	747	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c823498a		Each step carried the weight of ghosts I could no longer protect. My fists clenched at my sides. My jaw tightened. My breath came steady, but heavy-measured like the silence between thunder.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	748	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_2a540f61		I had to do this. Alone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	749	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a5a680ff	magnus	Wait, Dorian! Wait!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	751	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_7f8172aa		I didn't stop.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	753	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_30b34c1a	magnus	Heavens, you walk like you're marching into hell-...which, okay, fair, you kind of are, but still.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	755	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_824d5fbc		He stepped in front of me, arms stretched out like a wall I didn't ask for.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	757	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_612310fd	magnus	Hey. Hey. Look at me for a second, yeah? Just... listen.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	759	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_171f7260	magnus	I-uh... I don't know how to do the whole "pep talk" thing. So... I'm gonna do the only thing I do know.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	760	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_d3fc4ef7		He cleared his throat dramatically.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	762	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_940b6cbf	magnus	Don't throw yourself into doom, my friend, The world still needs your flame to mend...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	764	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_abbf3f32	magnus	We've fought, we've cried, we've bled, we've burned, But some of us still need you returned...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	765	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_673aaef8		He trailed off. He shrugged sheepishly.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	767	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_f45cb735	magnus	Okay, that was terrible. I know. But the message is clear, right?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	769	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_8129f18c	magnus	The Yaoguai King is powerful, Dorian. You know that. You're not stupid. If he wants you to come alone. He wants you to die.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	770	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e836c028	magnus	Why give him what he wants? Just... come with us to Tianho. Ignore him. Help save lives there.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	771	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_0b265b33_2	dorian	I have to do this.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	772	dorian "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_04eaca35		Magnus flinched.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	774	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_6d2d1301	magnus	Why? Because of vengeance? Because of pride? You think you're doing this for your family-but what about the ones still here?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	776	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_0b793153	magnus	I'm talking about Elias. You know, the one that dresses up like a girl?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	777	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_4449c080		I turned to look at him.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	779	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c6579bf8	magnus	Yuxuan told me. I didn't know until now that he's your son. He's alive, Dorian. He still needs you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	781	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_9895ded4		A long silence. I shook my head.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	783	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_c2234d17		Magnus looked at me like I had just slapped him.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	784	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_403db072	magnus	You're being selfish.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	786	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_5584d2e0		He turned, started to walk away... but then stopped. Glanced back over his shoulder.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	788	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_60f2f55f	magnus	I... I remembered that my lover once said to me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	790	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_1252b038	magnus	"I don't intend on dying." That was the last thing she ever said. And now that's... one of the only memories I have of her.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	791	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_e0941693		His voice dropped to a whisper.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	793	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_057cb0ce	magnus	Please... let me come with you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	795	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_060c3c36		I looked at him. The pain in his eyes. The history in his voice.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	797	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_ce239036		But I shook my head. The Yaoguai King is after him. I can't risk it.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	798	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_d1e1acef		Magnus stepped back. Wounded. Silent.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	800	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_9c52e659	magnus	Fine.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	802	magnus "[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a5e038b9		And I walked away-toward the dark, toward the fire, toward the one thing that had taken everything from me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	804	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_db5133cd		Behind me, Magnus didn't follow.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	805	"[what]"
ch10_route_farewell_a44df9e5		I'm sorry, Magnus...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	806	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_9849bf0c		After minutes of walking, I reached the place where we had found Magnus.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	820	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_13e2ccdc		A bottomless chasm wrapped around the edge, and a single narrow bridge stretching towards the center.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	821	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_ade7d6e8		Two yaoguai hunched over mangled bodies-unrecognizable, barely even bones now. The sound-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	827	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_270cc1c3		MUNCH. CRUNCH.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	829	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_045e2bbd		-echoed across the stone. One of them slurped something wet and vile, then burped loudly, its bloated belly sagging against the ground.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	831	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_570b1319	yg	Mmmh... That one tasted like fear. My favorite seasoning.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	833	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_0899db0d	yg	You always say that. I think this one tasted like despair. Much richer. Earthier. You wouldn't know taste if it chewed you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	834	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_3e5be234	yg	Bah. Give me fear with a side of broken dreams any day.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	835	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_620a8dc9	yg	We already ate all of them, Your Majesty. Nothing but bones left!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	836	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_7796b144	yk	You're spoiling your appetites, boys. The main course has arrived.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	837	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_bc6b182f		At the center stood the Yaoguai King.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	839	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_a973db83		He was crouched low, fingers trailing along the broken ice where Magnus had once been entombed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	840	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_2c7e9d8c	yk	This was where he slept. Four centuries in silence... and still, his presence lingers, dragonkin.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	842	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_a45d3744	dorian	Hmph. I didn't know I was expected.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	843	dorian "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_8253e481	yk	Oh, you were always expected, dragonkin. Ever since your wife screamed my name with her dying breath.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	844	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_ed3e0d47		I didn't flinch. Not on the outside.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	846	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_89a6fa58	yg	The dragonkin smells like righteous fury. I love when they're angry. It makes the blood sweeter.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	848	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_28bf73a1	yg	Do you think we can have a taste before the king breaks him?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	849	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_579e9bab	dorian	Tell me what happened. And maybe I'll make this quick.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	850	dorian "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_f1f038a4	yg	Ohh, he wants answers now. How precious. Maybe if you ask real nice, we'll write it on your tombstone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	851	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_3baa5fb7	yg	He's burning up! Let's bite him now! Hot blood's the sweetest!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	852	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_e29ce98d	yk	Hush, boys... Let the dragonkin grieve with context.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	853	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_6e5ef2a2	yk	Very well. This will be fun. I suppose you've earned a peek behind the curtain. After all, you have played your part well, dragonkin.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	854	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_6f99978b		He circled slowly, claws clicking against the cracked ice where Magnus once hung, suspended in frost. His grin widened, revealing fangs too long for his face.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	856	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_7ced2685	yk	Magnus is... a clone. A clone of the death god.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	858	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_12a40817		My breath caught. My pulse thundered in my ears. A clone?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	860	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_4797a5f9	yk	Yes. A clone. Of the Death God's reincarnation.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	862	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_0743ae75		I said nothing. Not from fear-but disbelief. He watched me closely, savoring the silence like wine.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	864	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_ed750799	yk	You should've seen your face just now. Delicious...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	866	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_c8e406cc	yg	Delicious! Delicious! Good enough to eat!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	867	yg "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_b473f657		He tapped the icy platform with a clawed foot, sending tiny shards skittering.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	869	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_2fa460a6	yk	I overheard it all, you know. A whispered little meeting between King Long Shen of Tianho and King Tatsuya Fujiwara of Hinami.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	871	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_f74a1edd	yk	Did you know they meet in secret? So many secrets among old men with too much power.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	872	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_270b1872		He leaned closer, voice dropping to a conspiratorial murmur.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	874	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_ea7f0537	yk	They spoke of the Rebirth. Said the Death God always reincarnates. Again and again and again. Death, reborn to die once more. Beautiful, isn't it? The god of endings trapped in an eternal loop.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	876	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_bb6298e4	yk	When Enoch died, a new vessel emerged. But they caught him. Froze him in true ice. Buried him deep beneath Tianho like a shameful relic.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	877	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_93864004		My heart pounded. Four centuries. No sign of the Death God. And now I knew why.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	879	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_bc3b92c3	yk	From that vessel, they made the clone. It took centuries. Science, sorcery, desperation. But they did it.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	881	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_c882d1dc	dorian	Why? Why make a clone?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	882	dorian "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_be96e6ba	yk	I don't care. Let the royals cling to their reasons. All that matters is the truth: the Death God's body still exists. And even without will... it is still a weapon.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	883	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_416298c2	yk	Bone forged in divinity. Blood soaked in finality. Imagine it-an army raised from his marrow. Corpses that do not rot. Channelers who wield death as birthright. The dead, reborn to kill.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	884	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_085e24e2		The Divine Weapon... is Magnus? This can't be...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	886	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_5a72c414	yk	The original body-the one that brought the Tragedy of Tianho-was destroyed. That meddling paladin, Cyrus, actually managed to kill him and destroyed the body.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	888	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_2304df0b	yk	But Magnus? Still intact. Still potent. Was supposed to be mine.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	889	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_adb6b283	yk	I had everything. I was so close. If not for that ridiculous spectacle with the rulers...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	890	yk "[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_e98de3cb		The Yaoguai King raised his claw. Shadows coiled around my head.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	892	"[what]"
ch10_sealed_door_b40706f1		And I saw a vision...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	893	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_8bb3cdd6		We were in this very hall, though the memory shimmered like heat rising from frost.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	907	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_d7e10743		King Gustav stood at the center, bound in iron cuffs. His teeth bared in fury, his gaze locked-hungrily-on the frozen form of Magnus.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	908	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_69d8cf0c	king_gustav	UNHAND ME this instant, or I will order every soldier in my empire to raze this palace to ash!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	910	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c5e99f0e	long_shen	You butchered my family, Gustav! You sent your aldorith assassins in the dead of night! My wife and my two sons-you knew what you were doing!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	911	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_1d40822e	king_gustav	Pft. Do you have proof? Do you have proof, Shen? Or just grief and wild accusations?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	912	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_cf015d28		Silence fell. It was thick with outrage.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	914	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_2e763e01	long_shen	Any objections?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	916	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_d92ba784	emperor_minjoon	None. Then let it be known: if this is the way Ena kings govern, Kyeongjang disavows your alliance entirely.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	917	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_aad61fa5	emperor_minjoon	I should never have brought my wife here.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	918	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_dca1be7b	seo_yeon	You couldn't have known, love. But now we do.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	919	seo_yeon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_62166812	olympia	Min-joon... Seo-yeon, I apologize on behalf of our alliance. Gustav will be punished. I swear it.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	920	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_eb9f2b2c	emperor_minjoon	You brought Jin-haeng back. You brought our son back from the dead... That is the only reason I still stand in this room.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	921	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_fa61e719	seo_yeon	I would have torn apart time itself for that miracle. You gave me back my son... when my own body could not.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	922	seo_yeon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_8e7fbf0c	olympia	You have my thanks. It is my pleasure to give you your infant son back.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	923	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_f3701875	long_shen	DEATH ISN'T ENOUGH FOR HIM!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	924	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_1c12072f	emperor_minjoon	I cannot imagine your grief, Shen. And I do not intend to stand idle through it. Gustav must be killed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	925	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_8d0fa868	olympia	We can't. We would risk the project getting known.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	926	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_5bba72ef	olympia	First-we reseal the chamber. That weapon must never be touched again.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	927	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_2b38bcea	olympia	I'll take the Amulet of Frost. I will guard it with my life. And I swear-Gustav will never hold power over the key again.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	928	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_f290331b	king_gustav	That's mine! I hold the third key to the door! Not you!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	929	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c6a290a4	emperor_minjoon	One of the keys is draconic fire, and only Tianho's royal blood can channel it. You knew that. That's why you murdered Long Shen's family-to ensure no one could ever seal the door again.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	930	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_7f6810c2	long_shen	YOU KILLED MY FAMILY because they could channel draconic fire!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	931	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_0a7e5b0b	king_gustav	GIVE ME THE AMULET OF FROST! YOU ARE VIOLATING THE AGREEMENT!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	932	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_eae9b02c	olympia	The gall of you to even make demands!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	933	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c32af337	emperor_minjoon	Your right to that amulet died with Shen's family. You forfeited your claim the moment you became a murderer.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	934	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c2c6599a	long_shen	THEN EXECUTE HIS WIFE TOO! STRIKE HER DOWN AND EVEN THE SCORE!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	935	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_a9a02deb	olympia	Shen. Calm down.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	936	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_6ef84852	long_shen	THEY WERE MY FAMILY, OLYMPIA! My sons... my wife... They were the last heirs to the Prosperity Dragon's bloodline!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	937	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_d8749bac	olympia	I know, Shen... *softly* And I would've died in their place if it meant undoing this. But we have to think clearly now.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	938	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_faf3c1ef	emperor_minjoon	I will guard the Amulet of Teleportation-the second key. I will make sure that it's safe in Kyeongjang.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	939	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_789a1600	long_shen	By the Prosperity Dragon-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	940	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_8d3a41fb	king_gustav	TOOK YOU LONG ENOUGH!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	941	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_b20ad6dd	boy_ald	They have Father! Destroy them!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	942	boy_ald "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_41a51a45	girl_ald	YAHHHH!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	943	girl_ald "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c2546461		The doors exploded inward as Gustav's hidden soldiers stormed in, blades drawn and channeling elements.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	945	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_70e775fe	emperor_minjoon	Gustav, you dare wage war in the heart of peace?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	947	emperor_minjoon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_8e355c49	long_shen	You'll burn for this!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	948	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_52af9478		A spire of earth struck Empress Olympia across the side, sending her tumbling. But even as blood trickled down her brow, she rose.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	950	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_ce8e6b69	long_shen	OLYMPIA! ARE YOU ALRIGHT?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	952	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_6e960855	olympia	I'm fine, Shen.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	953	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_5b71b257	king_gustav	Heh. You will give me the amulet of frost, skank!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	954	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_1d204baa	olympia	You want the weapon, Gustav? Then come and take it!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	955	olympia "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_3b661d04		The vision shifted-like flame caught in a gust.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	960	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_37eb83a4		Screams. Roars. Metal clashing. The ground trembled beneath the weight of monsters unleashed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	961	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_042f8647		And I stood before them. King Gustav lay broken on the blood-soaked ground, battered and heaving, his armor cracked, his face streaked with ash and blood.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	962	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_35c9aa3b		Standing over him was King Long Shen, surrounded by scorched earth and a seething aura of draconic power.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	963	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_cbf28472	king_gustav	Do it... Kill me...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	965	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_0ec37f53		King Long Shen's voice thundered.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	967	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_0dd26452	long_shen	You released the Death God onto Tianho! What madness took root in your soul, Gustav?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	969	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_2eeac1f5	king_gustav	I... I had everything under control. It was an accident!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	970	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_656284c7	king_gustav	If you and the other rulers hadn't fought me-none of this would've happened! If you would have just given me the divine weapon like I asked-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	971	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_285a2116		I felt the ground shaking harder. A beast screamed in the distance.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	973	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_cc1edb7e		King Long Shen's eyes blazed gold-his veins glowing faintly with draconic fire.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	974	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_dd4ca946	long_shen	You insufferable wretch. Your ambition knows no end!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	976	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_db62179b		He stepped forward and thrust his palm toward the door.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	978	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_a0d16c50	long_shen	By frost and flame, by blood made pure, the weapon be sealed behind this door. Three keys shall break what now I bind-Frost and flight, and fire combined.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	980	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c7f3de01		A burst of pure fire channeled from his chest to the seal. The door screeched shut, etchings flaring with molten gold as the door locked.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	982	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_1c44a531	king_gustav	NO!! NOOOOO!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	984	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_035ec2ca	long_shen	You will never open it again. Ena will be safer without you. The Amulet of Teleportation-Min-joon already sent it to Kyeongjang.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	985	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_a3051c5b	long_shen	You'll never see it again.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	986	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_30331dae		He held up the second amulet-the Amulet of Frost, gleaming with icy light.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	988	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_a3594977	long_shen	As for this? It stays with me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	990	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_67b79458		King Gustav snarled.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	992	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_07f570ac	king_gustav	I swear, as long as I draw breath, I will-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	994	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_8e111bc3		A scream tore from his throat as Long Shen slammed a flaming fist into his ribs, the heat searing armor and flesh. Gustav collapsed, choking on pain.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	996	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_a8959f30	king_gustav	AAHHHHH!!!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	998	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_71568e8b		King Long Shen took a knife from his pouch.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1000	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_f4d26a83	long_shen	This is for my sons. For my wife. For every soul you damned.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1002	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_fac0eb48		But then-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1004	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_6ba20525	vasily	YOUR MAJESTY!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1006	vasily "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_ed60c0a5		A beam of divine light tore through the haze. Count Vasily, brilliant and fast as lightning, surged in. In one blinding motion, he drove a knife through Long Shen's back.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1011	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_de4b2251	long_shen	N.... No...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1013	long_shen "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_4e51bf81		The fire in his eyes flickered out. He crumpled, lifeless.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1015	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_a2379512	king_gustav	Vasily... what have you done? We needed him alive! We needed that seal!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1017	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_810e72cb		Count Vasily's eyes were hard.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1019	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_3acb7cca	vasily	He would've killed you, Your Majesty.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1021	vasily "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_55a5c625	vasily	The yaoguai are overrunning the palace. Tianho is a ruin. We have to move-now.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1022	vasily "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_6203d9e8	vasily	Are you listening to me, Your Majesty? Your Majesty!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1023	vasily "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_6282f4ed		King Gustav roared.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1025	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_099770a4	king_gustav	We'll never access the Divine Weapon now! You FOOL! You-BELLIGERENT, SANCTIMONIOUS-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1027	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_f497027a		Count Vasily slapped him.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1029	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_eec73b81	king_gustav	?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1031	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c5291c9a	vasily	Forgive me, Your Majesty. But Mjoll needs you alive. The death god is laying waste to everything.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1032	vasily "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_58f178f0		He reached down, gripping Gustav's arm and hoisting him up with surprising gentleness.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1034	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_9da0eda1	vasily	We have a carriage waiting. We're evacuating through the hidden passage beneath the north wing. Can you walk?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1036	vasily "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_98027108	king_gustav	O... Of course.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1037	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_02b2f478	vasily	Then let me help you. We must hurry.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1038	vasily "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_1ff1a7ce		The vision ended yet I stood frozen. The echo of the vision still burned in my mind-the roar of fire, the flash of betrayal, the final breath of a king.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1043	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_36b9014e		Count Vasily was the one who saved Gustav. That loyal dog.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1044	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_9086da7d		King Gustav was the reason for the death god's release in his ice prison.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1045	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_302a1edd		And in that chaos... King Long Shen-the last known wielder of draconic fire-was killed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1046	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_307ba1dd		The Yaoguai King let out a low, satisfied hum behind me, as if relishing my silence.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1048	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_1e205f48	yk	Now you understand... The divine seal needs something more than brute strength or blood. It needs fire. Not the mortal kind. Draconic fire.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1050	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_d47a0045		I turned toward him, my fists clenched.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1052	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c60acb8e	dorian	You needed someone of Tianho royal blood.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1054	dorian "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_1f5e148c		The King's smile split wider, showing rows of jagged, gleaming teeth.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1056	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_93c0de21	yk	Precisely. I could scour the continents for the two amulets. But it would be meaningless without a soul the seal would answer to. And then I saw you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1058	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_55e5047f	yk	You, dragonkin... Speaking to the Prosperity Dragon as if it were an old friend. Whispering. Smiling. Laughing. Like it was nothing.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1059	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_95de8c1f		His voice grew quieter, darker-deadly.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1061	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_b9b3725c	yk	Even kings and queens of Tianho have waited lifetimes to hear a whisper from that spirit. Some died without ever glimpsing it. The Prosperity Dragon has remained silent for generations...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1063	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_fce9f1dc	yk	Yet it spoke to you for some reason. Very casually.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1064	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_d95ae216		My heart pounded.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1066	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_21da9551	yk	That's when I knew. You are not just a warrior. You are the key. A flame born to break open what Long Shen sealed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1068	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_3e8ca50d	yk	And I was right...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1069	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_1f402793		He tilted his head, his tone mocking.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1071	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_2c4a0891	yk	And whether you want to or not... I will have your flames.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1073	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_59b71ecb	dorian	THEN WHY KILL ELARA AND MY CHILDREN?! THEY DIDN'T HAVE TO DIE FOR THIS!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1074	dorian "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_7b603b5c		The words ripped from my chest-raw and seething.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1076	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_ae3bb6fb		It all came running back to me. How he disrespected Elara, the kids.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1077	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_cb1f17d9	yk	Because I needed you broken. The legends say draconic fire awakens only through sheer desperation. When your heart is torn apart and all that remains... is rage.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1079	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_178d78f4		Then came the voices-those cursed, laughing mouths beside him.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1081	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_90e4be42	yg	And they were yummy! Yummy delicious!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1083	yg "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_5c25343e	yg	That woman- what a skank! Hahaha! And the little ones-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1084	yg "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_3f64ed2d		They didn't finish. I didn't let them.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1086	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_f9089268		My rage ignited. Draconic fire erupted around me like a storm-blazing gold and crimson, heat warping the air in violent waves. I thrust both hands forward and unleashed a roaring inferno across the platform.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1087	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_a4ecf8d3		The flames consumed the two yaoguai instantly, their screams shrill and choking as fire melted flesh from bone and turned the stone beneath them black.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1091	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_05fe9b9d	yg	AAAAAGHHH-!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1093	yg "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_bd651a52	yg	NO! STOP-GRRAHHHH!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1094	yg "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_92b71e70		Ash and smoke whirled in the air.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1096	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_f7881834		The Yaoguai King didn't move as the flames engulfed him-but his grin was gone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1097	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_27baa139	yk	HOW DARE YOU! AFTER I JUST TOLD YOU EVERYTHING! I could have given you power. Dominion. Revenge. I was going to make you a god, Dragonkin!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1099	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_7527db6a		My flames blazed brighter, the fire pulsing from my chest like a heartbeat.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1101	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_44994fe3	dorian	This is for Elara. This is for my children. Daniel. Emily. Sarah. Lucas.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1103	dorian "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_08703f39		The King bared his jagged teeth.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1105	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_d5cbad83	yk	SUCH POWER! SUCH GLORIOUS FIRE! But how foolish! YOU WILL RUE THE DAY YOU FACE ME!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1107	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_01104bc2		He raised his claws, darkness gathering behind him in a wave of corrupted energy.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1109	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_d8b38236	yk	Come, dragonkin... I'LL BURN YOU TO ASHES!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1111	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_b707be79		The Yaoguai King roared-a sound that cracked stone and shook the platform beneath our feet. Shadows curled around him like tendrils, twisting into monstrous limbs. His claws-longer than swords-gleamed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1113	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_f5b5b28b	yk	Let's see if that draconic fire still burns as bright... when you're bleeding.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1115	yk "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_346d0a2a		Then... a voice called out to me. It called out to me again.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1117	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_efd8600a	prosperity_dragon	Child...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1119	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_21ac0057		The world slowed.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1121	"[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_8cb1e67d	prosperity_dragon	He is old. Two centuries of strength. Unmatched. Unrelenting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1123	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_16b83a38	prosperity_dragon	You are new. You are fast. Heed my advice. Don't meet force with force.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1124	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_c9fc5382	prosperity_dragon	Wait and slip past the storm. I trust you, child. Do not let this monstrosity get the better of you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1125	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_vision_rulers_e623a1a3		The world resumed its pace. The king lunged. Fast. Too fast. His claw came down like a guillotine, aiming to cleave me in half.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1127	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_84e8a9a8		QUICK TIMED CHOICE:	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1138	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_4de320fb		I ducked low and rolled to the left. His claw slammed into the ground where I'd been standing, splintering the stone with a deafening crack. Mid-roll, I threw my hand forward and unleashed a torrent of fire straight at his side.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1145	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_4e7fc496		The flames roared against his ribs, and I caught the scent of scorched rot as bits of his corrupted armor blackened and burned.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1146	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_bf09fad6	yk	Not bad... but not enough.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1148	yk "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_24c914c9		I braced my arms in front of me, channeling draconic fire as a shield. His claw tore through it like paper. Pain exploded through my shoulder as his strike connected, slashing flesh and armor alike.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1152	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_466c1449	yk	WATCH HOW MY CLAWS TEAR YOUR FLESH LIKE PAPER!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1154	yk "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_ac1a2e8e		I choked out, staggering back as blood streamed down my arm. But I stayed standing. I had to.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1156	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_76375d0c		The Yaoguai King stepped back, dark eyes gleaming with menace.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1158	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_c859d778	yk	You'll be joining your family soon...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1160	yk "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_1_c0ce28c3		He spread his arms. The air warped and twisted. A cyclone of corrupted wind and shadow coiled above us, rising higher and higher into the sky like a black storm.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1162	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_84e8a9a8		QUICK TIMED CHOICE:	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1173	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_f93796a7		I stood my ground and summoned a dome of fire around me. The cyclone hit with the force of a hurricane, blades of shadow slicing through the flames. The shield held-then shattered.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1179	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_ad7467e9		The impact hurled me across the arena. I crashed hard, pain tearing through my side.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1180	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_b0048f89	yk	What's wrong, dragonkin? Had enough?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1182	yk "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_239e1a95		I groaned, coughing up blood, but pushed myself to my knees. I wasn't done yet.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1184	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_9da4b94d		I clenched my fists and launched into the air, draconic fire roaring beneath my feet.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1189	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_22c3f883		I plummeted from above, fist wreathed in flame, and slammed it into his chest like a meteor. The impact cracked the ground and sent him skidding back, trails of fire left in my wake.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1190	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_913c8322	yk	Ghhh-! Screw you dragonkin!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1192	yk "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_34d42d31		The arena smoldered. The ground cracked beneath us. My shoulder ached, my ribs screamed, but the fire in my heart wouldn't die.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1194	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_4f2b68c7		The Yaoguai King stood tall, smoke rising off his hide. His smile widened.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1195	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_7b281429	yk	You're still alive? Good. That means I can keep breaking you-piece by piece.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1197	yk "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_b89523e6		My draconic fire flickered across the cracked stone, and I could feel the pulse of the Prosperity Dragon burning in my veins.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1199	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_9926aa2c		But the Yaoguai King was far from done.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1200	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_f1b41f97		With a snarl, he spread his arms wide. Black mist gushed from his body, and behind him rose the silhouettes of twisted spirits-dead yaoguai, their wailing souls clawing for release.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1201	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_9db258f9	dorian	Impossible... The spirits?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1203	dorian "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_6e332208	yg	Raaaaaaawwrrr!!! Grrraaawwwrrr!! Rawwwrrr!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1207	yg "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_f6e2e8ba	yk	Their hatred will be my shield. Their screams, my chorus.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1208	yk "[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_2_513c4dac		He hurled them toward me in a wave of screaming shadow.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1210	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_3_9933c9c3		Quick Timed Choice:	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1221	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_3_c60a7b7f		I need to slice through them before they could touch me. I closed my eyes and inhaled-then roared.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1228	"[what]"
ch10_boss_fight_3_9f712de1		A surge of wind erupted from my core, sharp as blades and fast as thunder. The spirits shrieked as the gust shredded through them, dissipating their forms into wailing mist.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1229	"[what]"
