ch10_bad_end_fight_2578ac1c	yk	You tried, little dragonkin. You really did.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1320	yk "[what]"
ch10_bad_end_fight_62b08fdc	yk	Look on the bright side. At least you'll get to be with your family now. Elani or whats-her-name... those tasty children of yours... I'm sure they've been waiting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1321	yk "[what]"
ch10_bad_end_fight_37a83024		I fell forward. My face hit the cold stone. My fingers twitched, reaching for fire that would never come. Behind me, I heard the jeering laughter of his minions. The Yaoguai. Loud. Cruel. Victorious.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1323	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_fight_2f2e0467		Darkness crept in-but before I faded completely, I heard the King speak again. A promise. A curse.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1324	"[what]"
