ch10_rescue_chunghee_c98df638		His claws still gripped my throat. Blood still dripped from my wound. But something changed in the air. The pressure shifted. The shadows that danced eagerly behind the Yaoguai King suddenly recoiled, like frightened beasts sensing something far worse.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1504	"[what]"
