ch10_rescue_chunghee_b59c04a0	chung_hee	Dorian, are you alright?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1556	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_rescue_chunghee_d09d6075		He stared down at me, expression unreadable-but his voice was gentle in my mind, a whisper of moonlight and wind.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1558	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_chunghee_13a2e805	dorian	Chung...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1560	dorian "[what]"
ch10_rescue_chunghee_d33e0f6d		He nodded slowly, brushing the blood from my cheek with care.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1562	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_chunghee_618fddd5	chung_hee	It's alright now. You're safe. I've got you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1564	chung_hee "[what]"
