ch10_rescue_svante_1499fbec	dorian	S... Svante?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1609	dorian "[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_d0cc813e		He didn't look at me. His gaze was locked on the monster in front of him.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1611	"[what]"
