ch10_rescue_svante_2d966293	prosperity_dragon	Svante Nordström. Illegitimate son of King Gustav of Mjoll. A heart forged not from royal blood, but from undying loyalty and courage.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1624	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
