ch10_rescue_svante_5247d2e6		The yaoguai spirits surrounding the Yaoguai King sprang forth-wailing specters of the dead, cloaked in fire and grief. They screeched, lunging toward Svante with blazing teeth and blade-like limbs.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1628	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_61338432	svante	M-Merciful Enoch...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1630	svante "[what]"
