ch10_rescue_svante_e075aefd		The Yaoguai King shrieked, flailing, but every attempt at retaliation was met by a storm of blades that tore through flesh and armor alike.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1635	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_350479bc		Blood. Smoke. Steel. Svante was unrelenting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1636	"[what]"
