ch10_rescue_svante_55678ff2		Svante took a sword and stabbed the King, tore through the Yaoguai King's chest, straight through heart and spine. The monster arched back, screaming, black flames pouring from his mouth.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1638	"[what]"
