ch10_rescue_svante_9de0bd93		The Yaoguai King collapsed in a heap of soot and shadow, disintegrating into the earth. Silence.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1643	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_7243c04b		A deafening, holy silence.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1644	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_dbda1b79		I stumbled, vision blurring. My legs gave out. I fell, but strong arms caught me.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1645	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_4c1a53f5	svante	DORIAN!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1647	svante "[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_a609665b		He pulled me close, clutching me as though I might disappear.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1649	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_8b22721d	svante	Hey-hey. Look at me. Eyes open, alright? You're not dying on me. Not now. Not ever. Please...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1651	svante "[what]"
ch10_rescue_svante_b58635b3		I gave a weak breath, blood trailing from my lips.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1653	"[what]"
