ch10_rescue_niko_f5a43553		His face was cold, twisted in rage. Shadows flowed like blood from his fingertips, surpassing the Yaoguai King's. They coiled and snarled like starving wolves, eager to devour.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1705	"[what]"
