ch10_rescue_niko_fd8b0ae3	yk	You insolent-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1708	yk "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_0f7e322e		With a single flick of Niko's wrist, spears of shadow launched forward-howling through the air like a chorus of executioners. They skewered the Yaoguai King's arm, nailing it to the wall.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1710	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_f3acce30		He screamed, shadows biting into him like venom.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1711	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_dd989ebb	yk	What-what are you?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1713	yk "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_a39a557d	prosperity_dragon	Niko Tsukumo. Chosen Champion of the Death God Enoch. Former Healer in the village of Hamatame.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1715	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_66c42112	yk	The... the Prosperity Dragon...?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1716	yk "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_d297ceab		The Yaoguai King's eyes widened in horror.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1718	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_2eea8a05	yk	You were chosen?! The Dragon talks to you?! But how?! I don't-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1720	yk "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_fd2090cb	niko	You hurt him. You dared to pretend to be her. You mocked his pain.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1721	niko "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_b892926f		He raised both hands, and an enormous ring of shadow erupted around them.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1723	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_8e2feeaa	niko	Your death won't be quick. I want you to remember what fear tastes like.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1725	niko "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_9e5dcd59	yk	T-These shadows... M-Mercy! I didn't mean to insult the death god! I thought he wasn't supposed to intrude with my killing!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1726	yk "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_af33e703	niko	I'll tear your soul apart piece by piece.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1727	niko "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_28c62c1b	yk	Mercy! Please-PLEASE!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1728	yk "[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_d987a39d		The Yaoguai King screamed as the shadows surged forward-latching onto his limbs, face, chest. His flesh began to burn with a fire blacker than night. His bones cracked. His blood evaporated into mist.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1730	"[what]"
