ch10_rescue_niko_ef307687		His skin peeled back. His eyeballs shriveled and popped, leaking black tears. His spine bent backwards as his legs twisted in unnatural angles.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1734	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_23c2fdc4		The shadows clawed deeper-not just through body, but soul. Memory. Identity. Existence. He was undone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1735	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_niko_968781ef		Every lie. Every cruelty. Every scream he'd ever silenced-torn back into the world and used to shred him.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1736	"[what]"
