ch10_rescue_magnus_14672dc3		A blazing sigil erupted across the underground rooftop, ancient and divine. The king screamed as the flames consumed him-white-hot fire pouring from his eyes and mouth.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1832	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_4f2429ed	yk	GRAHHH!! NOOO!!! AHHHH!!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1834	yk "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_1e264757	magnus	YOU. SHALL. NEVER. TOUCH HIM. AGAIN!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1835	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_b1298cb7		The Yaoguai King exploded in a storm of ash and shadow. The light swallowed it all. And then-Silence.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1837	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_8422f71d		Magnus landed hard beside me, stumbling, dropping to his knees at my side.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1838	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_cc2c600a	magnus	Dorian? Dorian! Hey-no, no, no, stay with me. Please.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1840	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_c04d6270	dorian	M.. Magnus... You... came...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1841	dorian "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_8721c73f		His hands were trembling as he gathered me in his arms, pressing his forehead to mine.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1843	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_29ce9129	magnus	You're okay. You're okay. I've got you. Just breathe... You idiot...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1845	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_f7076d55	magnus	Weaver's bollocks, why'd you fight him alone...?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1846	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_8d698140		I tried to say his name again, to tell him I was still here-but the darkness came too fast, too heavy.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1848	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_5be932fd	magnus	No... No...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1850	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_2d10eccc	magnus	PLEASE! SOMEONE HELP! IS THERE ANYONE HERE?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1851	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_4652f50c		A soft whirring sound echoed in the distance.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1853	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_b72f3774		Supply Bot: Sir Magnus detected. Emergency medical protocol online. Master Yuxuan suspected Master Dorian might be reckless. He was, in fact, correct.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1855	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_19ef4a1a		The small metal drone hovered into view, arms outstretched with medkits and healing supplies.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1857	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_67add06d	magnus	Wh-what? Yuxuan sent you?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1859	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_4518520d		Supply Bot: Affirmative. Master Yuxuan stated, quote: 'If Magnus goes after Dorian, which he absolutely will, bring everything and prepare for melodrama.'	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1861	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_fad1d499	magnus	Melodrama? I-Never mind, help Dorian!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1863	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_62259619		Supply Bot: Vital signs stabilizing. Continue holding his hand. Data suggests you refusing to let go improves patient survival by 6.8%	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1865	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_59365076		Magnus cradled me close. Then, softly-tenderly-he began to hum.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1867	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_7d873051	magnus	I'll follow you through fire and flame... Wherever you go, I'll bear your name...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1869	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_24a82f20		Supply Bot: Please be advised that Master Yuxuan advises songs should be reserved until after stabilization.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1871	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_5dd5c813	magnus	O-Oh! S-Sorry, robot sir. Please-carry on!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1873	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_e2446101		Supply Bot: Affirmative.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1874	"[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_8f4916ba	magnus	Everything will be-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1876	magnus "[what]"
ch10_rescue_magnus_1bf9722c		His voice trailed off. I closed my eyes. And then-darkness.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1878	"[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_7982466c	jiang	Everyone, fall back! Get inside your homes, now! Barricade the doors!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1896	jiang "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_10b2d046	gao	GO! Don't look back! Get to Cheng Industries!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1897	gao "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_e5b4cc66	yg	GRAWWRR!!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1898	yg "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_10902113	jiang	GAO! We've got incoming! Left flank!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1900	jiang "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_ecb92a40	gao	I see it!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1901	gao "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_485e12e0	jiang	Nice! You hit it!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1902	jiang "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_6bbd957b	yuxuan	Jiang! Gao! Don't do anything reckless! Please-stay sharp, stay alive. My companions will handle the front.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1906	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_09f09af4	jiang	Understood, Master Yuxuan. We'll hold the line. You can count on us.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1907	jiang "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_bf8d0111	gao	Wouldn't be the first time we've danced with monsters.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1908	gao "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_7fd217aa	svante	Leave the heavy lifting to us. We'll make sure nothing gets past.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1909	svante "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_7f6aebab	yuxuan	Alright... We're trusting you. All of you. Make it count.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1910	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_1a560a2c	magnus	I shall scout up in the air. I shall see if there are more yaoguai.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1911	magnus "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_b0a5dfc5	yuxuan	Oh that's actually a very good idea, Magnus.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1912	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_6a3d7968	niko	Everyone! In position! No mistakes. We hold the gate or we die trying.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1913	niko "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_da2196d0	yuxuan	Come on, Dorian... wherever you are. Don't die on us now.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1914	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_672f9297	chung_hee	Jiang. Gao. Do not act without thought. Stay sharp. Stay alive. My companions will handle the front.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1918	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_18b51fb4	jiang	Understood, sir Chung-hee. We'll hold the line. You can count on us.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1919	jiang "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_bf8d0111_1	gao	Wouldn't be the first time we've danced with monsters.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1920	gao "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_919308cb		Female Soldier: We'll fight to our last breath to protect Tianho, my lord!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1921	"[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_a36ac5c0		Male Soldier: I can't believe the Emperor of Kyeongjang is fighting with us! For our children... for every home still standing. For Tianho!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1922	"[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_efa3ecb1	chung_hee	To arms! Let the Yaoguai learn that Tianho's spirit does not break. Not now. Not ever.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1923	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_354343c5	chung_hee	Let no yaoguai survive!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1924	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_5c1a7fac	chung_hee	Dorian... Wherever you are, you have to survive.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1925	chung_hee "[what]"
