ch10_tianho_battle_fdf5969c	gao	Wait... PALADIN FENG!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1968	gao "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_3ed822c5	feng	Stay low. You're not dying today.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1969	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_518ac7b6	jiang	F-Feng?! P-Paladin! SIR!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1970	jiang "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_16b85568	feng	I've seen too many good people fall today. I won't lose you two. Not tonight.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1971	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_cc1d1e3d_1	yg	GWAAARR!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1972	yg "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_596a9c20	feng	HYAAAA!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1973	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_7cc006ca	gao	S... So cool....	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1974	gao "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_c650fef9	feng	Heh. Five years of working together and you're crushing on me now, Gao? I'm touched.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1975	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_9f562d12	man_1	Th-thank you! May the Prosperity Dragon bless you!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1976	man_1 "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_4a0de827	feng	Get inside. And lock all the damn doors. And for the love of, we told you to get inside!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1977	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_b364d7a7	man_1	Y-Yes, sir!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1978	man_1 "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_1eb1683e	jiang	Let's move, everyone! Let's move!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1979	jiang "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_13de7891	niko	Paladin Feng... Seems we'll need to put our differences aside. We're grateful for your help.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1982	niko "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_012c45fe	yuxuan	Paladin Feng!! Oh!! Thank the Prosperity Dragon you're still here...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1984	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_tianho_battle_0b2b9386	feng	Heh. You're lucky my best friend still owes me a drink. Now-how about we roast some yaoguai? My blue flame's just getting warmed up.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	1986	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_c1b88ebe	babala	Damned Weaver... I-I can't for the life of me... My arms... they won't respond. I can't channel... not like I used to...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2002	babala "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_f54956b6	male_guard	We already told you to stay inside your homes! Why won't you listen?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2003	male_guard "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_5e7825f6	female_guard	Mam, please! We have to move-now!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2004	female_guard "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_f10aa9d1	babala	I'm trying!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2005	babala "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_9b411381	babala	I shouldn't have come here. These old bones were never meant for battle. This was foolish...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2006	babala "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_857cb33e	yg	GRAWWWRR!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2007	yg "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_7877bede	babala	HELP! Someone-please!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2008	babala "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_4d87f1d0	female_guard	It's right behind us-AAHHH!!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2012	female_guard "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_473af653	yg	GRAWWRRRRR!!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2013	yg "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_f629b27c	babala	ARGHHH!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2014	babala "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_7444bbdf	male_guard	NO! NO!! AHH!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2015	male_guard "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_6afd3d68	female_guard	No!! No!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2020	female_guard "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_22f09e21	male_guard	Get behind me, mam!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2021	male_guard "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_473af653_1	yg	GRAWWRRRRR!!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2022	yg "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_8c0b343b	aoi	Not today.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2023	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_5153f579	yg	GYAAAAA!!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2024	yg "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_b512cedd	babala	Heavens! What a stunning young woman! Thank the Weaver, you-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2025	babala "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_1fd669de	aoi	Save the flattery. More are coming. Why are you even out here? We told you to evacuate!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2026	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_a918c602	babala	Alright, alright! No need to shout!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2027	babala "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_779aa6f0	aoi	What was that?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2028	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_9248428f	babala	Nothing! Just grateful, is all. Pft.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2029	babala "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_6713c8af	male_guard	That was incredible water channeling... Wait... Aren't you the songstress who performed earlier?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2030	male_guard "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_ca6d358a	aoi	Yes. I'm Aoi. Aoi Mizuhara. Pleasure to meet you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2031	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_1d261b58	aoi	You-come with me. We don't have time to waste.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2032	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_a85f202b	aoi	There are more in this sector. I won't let a single one of them leave unscathed. They'll learn what it means to challenge a mistress of water.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2033	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_1f6ccf94	female_guard	Mam!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2034	female_guard "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_b80808f6	feng	Well, well... You wear the battlefield well, Lady Aoi. Quite the vision outside your kimono. Long hair really does suit you.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2038	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_7f8f71ec	aoi	Ugh. Really, Feng? Save the charm for after we've cleaned up this mess. Now move-we're not done yet.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2039	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_473af653_2	yg	GRAWWRRRRR!!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2040	yg "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_456c8441	aoi	To think... they've learned from their attack yesterday.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2041	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_dfce066e	feng	Heh. More fun for us. Let's do it. I'll even give you a nice bonus if we survive.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2042	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_d08180e6	aoi	Agreed. You're on. It would be an opportunity to go all out with my water channeling.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2043	aoi "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_4cf05595	feng	And me with my blue fire.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2044	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_752702a1	feng	Side by side, you and me? These yaoguai won't know what hit them.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2045	feng "[what]"
ch10_tianho_aoi_5466fdb6	feng	They will be sorry they messed with Tianho.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2046	feng "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_606b2c4d	prosperity_dragon	And so, the attack on Tianho was repelled. The fires of war were extinguished not by luck, but by the bravery of those who stood unwavering in the face of despair.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2062	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_0a530ae9	prosperity_dragon	Among them... one still rests.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2063	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_44e0d37f	prosperity_dragon	Dorian-the Dragon of Gale, bearer of grief, fire, and unyielding will-now lies in recovery, his body battered, but his soul no longer burdened by vengeance.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2064	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_d328a43a	prosperity_dragon	When he awoke, it was not to battle horns or the roar of flame, but to a familiar warmth. A small hand in his own. A voice, soft and sweet.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2065	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_827ff0d7	elias	Daddy! You're awake!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2067	elias "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_9d1cedfb		Supply Bot: Vitals stable. Blood pressure within optimal range. Neural activity increasing... Welcome back, Master Dorian.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2069	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_67a5a6ea	prosperity_dragon	The weight that had pressed on his heart for so long finally lifted in that moment. For the first time in what felt like lifetimes... he breathed without ache.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2071	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_7c1a4422	prosperity_dragon	And beside him, the one who had saved him-the partner who stood between him and death-remained close.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2072	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_88ae338b	prosperity_dragon	To him, Dorian knew only gratitude. And perhaps, something deeper.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2073	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_643bed72	prosperity_dragon	The Yaoguai King was no more. Justice-delayed, but never denied-was finally delivered. His family could rest. And so, too, could he.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2074	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_56215bed	prosperity_dragon	The flames of revenge no longer consumed him. In their place... new embers flickered. Softer ones. Hopeful ones.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2075	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_cdc1bba9	prosperity_dragon	Dorian now stands at the edge of a new chapter. Not written in blood or fury-but perhaps... in love.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2076	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_8972d4e9	prosperity_dragon	As for our tale... it is not yet over.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2077	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_cfc2abd0		I gathered everyone in the kitchen. I told them everything. About Magnus. About the Yaoguai King. About the Divine Weapon.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2082	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_e2498602	yuxuan	Wait... so let me get this straight. Magnus is a clone of the Death God?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2084	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_090fa839	weng	By the stars... I can't believe it. The Death God...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2085	weng "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_1cf79ea6		Magnus sat off to the side, silent, his brows furrowed in confusion. I didn't blame him.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2087	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_782d1ac4	magnus	I... don't really feel like a clone. I don't even know what that means. I have memories. Feelings. I've laughed, cried, bled. How do you explain that?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2089	magnus "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_a91db2e4	svante	I'm with Magnus. I haven't seen clones before. But I know he's not one. He's real to me. Maybe the Yaoguai King was just trying to mess with your head.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2090	svante "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_bfc2681e	niko	I highly doubt that. Normally, I'd call it blasphemy outright. But considering that the Prosperity Dragon is involved with this... it aligns. All too well.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2091	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_57cdf4f1	chung_hee	If what you're saying is true, I can take Magnus back to Kyeongjang with me. If he really is the Divine Weapon, we can't risk him falling into King Gustav's hands.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2092	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_133cd1f7	svante	My father would never harm Magnus. He has merciful and kind tendencies! I don't think he'll want to doom us all.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2093	svante "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_78642c7a	elias	Ooh! Can I come? I wanna go to Kongjong!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2094	elias "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_ac53a01e	tim	I'd be honored to visit Kyeongjang!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2095	tim "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_d6414488	tedda_alive	ME THREE! I WANNA GO TOOOO!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2096	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_7bbaf30c	weng	Kids, hush now. Don't interrupt the adults. Roboto, could you get them some snacks before they break my back and my nerves?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2097	weng "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_3821c0ee	roboto	R-R-R-Right away, Miss Weng. Snacks incoming.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2101	roboto "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_8ff457db	dorian	We need answers first, Chung. We need to know why the Divine Weapon was created. What its purpose is. Who it was meant to destroy-or protect.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2103	dorian "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_7b5d0e5e	niko	To think they caged the reincarnation of the Death God for four hundred years. Encased in some wretched contraption like a tool, a thing!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2104	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_d82b2d29	niko	Have the great kings of Ena know no shame? Enoch weeps for what they've done! Heresy! Apostasy! No amount of gilded temples will cleanse that sin!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2105	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_e827f785	yuxuan	Calm down, Niko. Calm down.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2106	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_d74f3adc	dorian	The Yaoguai King said... he overheard two rulers speaking about it. King Long Shen of Tianho. And King Tatsuya Fujiwara of Hinami.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2107	dorian "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_9405b0d9	roboto	U-Unfortunately, K-K-King Long Shen has long been deceased. No further logs are available on his activities.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2111	roboto "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_7ba98352	yuxuan	Then we turn to the other. King Tatsuya of Hinami.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2112	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_1664ca76		I looked down, my fists tight.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2114	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_1f926fd2	dorian	I need to go. But... after everything that's happened, I don't think I want to go alone. Will some of you come with me?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2116	dorian "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_ad6c9dfa		Chung-hee placed a hand on my shoulder.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2118	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_14e3785e	chung_hee	You have me, Dorian. I'd use the Amulet of Teleportation, but it's only stable for one person at a time. We'll need another route.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2120	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_90fcd247	tim	I volunteer! I may be small, but I can catalog everything! Diplomats always bring scholars.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2121	tim "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_7a85ec2b	elias	Daddy I wanna come too! I wanna go swimmwing!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2122	elias "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_499013b5		I winced. The thought of them anywhere near danger twisted in my gut like a blade.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2124	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_371b3a56	dorian	Elias... Tim... I'm sorry. It's too dangerous. You'll have to stay here where it's safe.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2126	dorian "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_285572b7	weng	That's final. Listen to the adults, little ones. Tim, you stay here and play with Elias. There's plenty of adventure in stories and sweets.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2127	weng "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_f0b6026a	tim	WHAAAT?! But I wanted to wear my sailor hat!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2128	tim "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_2321f494	yuxuan	Luckily for all of us-I have just the thing. A luxury boat, custom-built, smooth as silk and fast as wind. Enough beds for everyone, even Tedda. And the kitchen makes warm bao buns on demand.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2129	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_c4d72392	tedda_alive	Yeyyy!! Does that mean I'll be coming along?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2130	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_73b12833	roboto	No, Miss Tedda. You'll stay in the lab and c-c-c-clean up after Lady Elias. And maybe assist in kitchen duties if you don't burn rice again.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2134	roboto "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_45b19639	tedda_alive	Aww boo...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2135	tedda_alive "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_b3734e14	niko	Dorian, you'll need someone who knows the island. I'll go. For Enoch. And for the truth they've long buried.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2136	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_74816b26		Magnus looked up from where he sat-his carefree demeanor dimmed. His eyes serious now, thoughtful.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2138	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_27fdf40c	magnus	I... I'll go. I need to know who I really am. I need to understand what this 'Divine Weapon' means.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2140	magnus "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_35624efe	svante	I'm happy for you, Magnus. This will be a step in knowing who you actually are.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2141	svante "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_de0e4869	magnus	Thank you, Svante.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2142	magnus "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_35d7ac33	svante	I'm also in. I've never been to Hinami before, and honestly? I wanna see the beaches.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2143	svante "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_7ee35518	magnus	Wait... beaches?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2144	magnus "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_c802c726	roboto	Yes. Hinami's coastal line is considered one of the most breathtaking in all Ena. T-T-Turquoise waters. Shimmering white sand.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2148	roboto "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_fb991acc	roboto	Crystal-clear coves. And the sunsets? Like fire melting into the sea. P-P-P-People write poetry about it. Some even propose there.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2149	roboto "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_ad5ef9fe	magnus	WOOHOO!!! BEACH TRIP!!! Let's go swimming!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2150	magnus "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_8ed7b71b	niko	Oh brother.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2151	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_69591886	magnus	Svante! Let's go swimming once we're there!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2152	magnus "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_11754425	svante	Of course! We probably deserve a little sun! I remember me and my fellow aldoriths bathing in the waterfall in Mjoll! I can't imagine swimming in a beach! It must be fun!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2153	svante "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_093005db	yuxuan	Everyone, please! This isn't vacation time, we-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2154	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_15e575ab		Magnus leaned over and whispered something.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2156	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_1e9696c1	yuxuan	D-D-Dorian in... Magnus: Absolutely...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2158	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_ef092691	yuxuan	I-I-I CHANGE MY MIND! Everyone pack your swimwear!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2159	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_f01a3e0e	niko	Well, if the opportunity arises, I suppose a little dip wouldn't hurt. Hinami does have quite a few resorts, after all.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2160	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_c72f9740	svante	A white sandy beach... Is it really that beautiful?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2161	svante "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_d76608f0	niko	As someone born there... yes. The beaches of Hinami are magic made real. Waters that glow under moonlight. Tide pools with starfish that shimmer.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2162	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_0cb162bc	niko	They don't exaggerate. It is beautiful. And the castle of Hinami? It floats upon the sea itself.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2163	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_654cdf71	yuxuan	What? How do they do that?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2164	yuxuan "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_9cd91605	niko	Water channelers. Probably empowered by the Dragon of the Depths... or some ancient art lost to time. Nobody really knows.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2165	niko "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_ab600736	magnus	I can't wait! Hinami, here we come!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2166	magnus "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_ffbfd907	elias	No faiw!! Daddy!! That's so unfaiw!!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2167	elias "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_3cc4576f	tim	Elias... maybe it's time for Operation: Sneak-Aboard. Listen carefully. Here's the plan-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2168	tim "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_965f81f7		Chung-hee approached me, rubbing his temples.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2170	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_7fab289a	chung_hee	Well... these people sure are excited.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2172	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_a75a51b4	dorian	Tell me about it...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2173	dorian "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_b6ba7dc5	weng	Don't worry, Sir Dorian. I'll take care of Elias. He'll be safe here-with Tim, Tedda, and Roboto. He'll be happy.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2174	weng "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_b030a885	chung_hee	I'm sorry you're not feeling well enough to join us, Miss Weng.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2175	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_dc4afb31	weng	It's alright, sir Chung. I'll be fine here with the little ones. A good cup of tea and some poetry by Takayori Sogen will keep me company.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2176	weng "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_ecea043d	chung_hee	That's it, everyone. We leave at first light. Prepare yourselves.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2177	chung_hee "[what]"
ch10_epilogue_8cb8dcf2		And just like that, the decision was made.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2179	"[what]"
ch10_epilogue_b7c94076		Tomorrow-we set sail. To Hinami.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2180	"[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_1fcf5019		( Credits )	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2195	"[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_e604c283		The imperial carriage rumbled down the muddy trail, wheels slick with rainwater. Thunder cracked in the distance, the sky bruised with approaching storm.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2202	"[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_60b91afb	king_gustav	Damn that Yaoguai attack. Everything has to fall apart the moment I take a detour.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2204	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_1a29a651	cyrus	You seem surprised, Gustav. Monsters rarely wait their turn.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2205	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_166391d8	cyrus	Besides, you'll be inside the comfort of your castle soon.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2206	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_eca62128		The carriage lurched slightly. A knock sounded. The door creaked open to reveal three kneeling figures-hooded Aldoriths, rain dripping from their cloaks.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2208	"[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_f847c24d	boy_ald	Father... we are humbly asking for your permission to-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2210	boy_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_c54938c1	cyrus	CAN'T YOU SEE HE IS TALKING TO ME?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2211	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_8306a91d	boy_ald	F-Forgive us...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2212	boy_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_e07fca3a	king_gustav	Cyrus. Calm yourself. It's alright... My children, speak.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2213	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_fd96aa0e	boy_ald	Thank you Father. I appreciate your kindness.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2214	boy_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_d41f89d1	girl_ald	Father, forgive the intrusion. We bring urgent news.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2215	girl_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_e0e0af1d	boy_ald	We found him. Our brother... Svante. He lives.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2216	boy_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_70c42e14		King Gustav's eyes narrowed, tension rising in his shoulders.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2218	"[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_67217608	girl_ald	We wished to bring him to you... but...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2220	girl_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_6d1ec995	king_gustav	But what?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2221	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_30fb41e2	girl_ald	He is not alone. He travels with others. A man named Dorian... and others whose names we don't know.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2222	girl_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_c5367ea8	king_gustav	Dorian?! What?!	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2223	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_949305a5	boy_ald	There is also one who is called Magnus.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2224	boy_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_b6043ae1	king_gustav	Magnus?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2225	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_2baeec7b	boy_ald	Yes, Father. He has wings. And he burns with light.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2226	boy_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_f1627470	mjoll_lars	We compared your past descriptions, Father. The signs match.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2227	mjoll_lars "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_03e0e768	mjoll_helga	According to your descriptions, we believe he's the Divine Weapon.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2228	mjoll_helga "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_318bac93	cyrus	And? Are you certain of this information? We don't tolerate false information.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2229	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_bcba3b05	mjoll_helga	As certain as breath and bone, Paladin Cyrus.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2230	mjoll_helga "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_1c570c8d	mjoll_lars	We also inspected the sealed chamber, as you taught us. The seal was ultimately broken.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2231	mjoll_lars "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_8494752d	mjoll_lars	The area was in utter disarray. Scorched stone. Scattered feathers. A battle, by all signs.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2232	mjoll_lars "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_2ceda1f3	cyrus	Dorian and Magnus... Interesting.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2233	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_1d7b7c32	king_gustav	Enoch above... The Divine Weapon.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2234	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_44fd1d83		A long silence fell, punctuated only by the rolling wheels and distant thunder.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2236	"[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_3be75c61	girl_ald	Our agents in Tianho saw them together... just yesterday.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2238	girl_ald "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_1bc9123d	king_gustav	INSOLENCE! You took too long to report this! TURN THE DAMN CARRIAGE AROUND! I want to-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2239	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_a52a874c	cyrus	Back to Tianho? Don't bother. You'll only be wasting your time, Gustav.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2240	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_dbd299df	king_gustav	You think they're not in Tianho anymore?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2241	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_039b9ca5	cyrus	No, they're not. I feel it. A pull in my blood. In my bones.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2242	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_87bd0b91	cyrus	They're either headed towards the Empire of Gale or the Island of Hinami.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2243	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_98ea8379	cyrus	But if I were to bet my coin, I'd place it on Hinami.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2244	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_8ba45818	mjoll_helga	But... Paladin. Forgive me-but the ferries bound for Hinami are booked solid because of the festivities of the anniversary of the tragedy.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2245	mjoll_helga "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_c2c2a65b	mjoll_lars	Helga, stop questioning the Paladin.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2246	mjoll_lars "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_ad533410	mjoll_helga	I'm not, Lars! But there's no passage left for them to go to the Kingdom of Hinami! We-	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2247	mjoll_helga "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_7b2abdcf	cyrus	Then that narrows it down. Who in Tianho is powerful or influential enough to reach the Island of Hinami without needing a ferry?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2248	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_e3f88b1f		He leaned forward slightly.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2250	"[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_b9999a3a	cyrus	Tell me, Gustav. Which king failed to attend the rulers' meeting during the Tragedy of Tianho?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2252	cyrus "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_a912ef6c	king_gustav	Tatsuya...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2253	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_d264cca9		King Gustav froze.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2255	"[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_e6630938	king_gustav	Hinami...	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2257	king_gustav "[what]"
ch10_credits_scene_da0b03a8		[ DEMO OVER ]	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2259	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_credits_e9a1a86d		GAME OVER - BAD END / CREDITS	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2278	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_credits_7968b9d4	prosperity_dragon	The savior is gone. The one who could have rescued Ena lies dead.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2280	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_bad_end_credits_0344f029		The dragon's massive head lowered, smoke billowing from its nostrils as it turned its gaze to the horizon, where darkness gathered like a storm.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2282	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_credits_6df6d087	prosperity_dragon	And now... who will save them?	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2284	prosperity_dragon "[what]"
ch10_bad_end_credits_3a3d2e56		The land of Ena lay silent, its fate uncertain. The savior-its last hope-was gone.	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2286	"[what]"
ch10_bad_end_credits_434b9582		( CREDITS )	game/13_chapter_10.rpy	2288	"[what]"
